values
  ('767997089471272116', 'Pachamama', 2018, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Juan Antín', 'Olivier de Bannes, Juan Antín, Patricia Valeix', 'Andrea Santamaria, India Coenen, Saïd Amadis, Marie-Christine Darah, Alex Harrouch, Vincent Ropion, Gérard Surugue, Nola Klop', null, 'A young boy living in a remote village in the Andes Mountains dreams of becoming shaman.', 'A young boy living in a remote village in the Andes Mountains dreams of becoming shaman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZrqG7icldmNYc4NgDwE3dd5tS7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529790'),
  ('875728243470658258', 'Pacho, the Brigand of Hybe', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Martin Ťapák, Jozef Šafarka, Marián Vojtek', 'Peter Jaroš, Martin Ťapák', 'Jozef Kroner, Slavomír Záhradník, Dušan Blaškovič, Karol Čálik, Július Vašek, Peter Debnár, Ivan Palúch, Juraj Kováč', null, 'A funny outlaw tale inspired by traditional folk humour. Pacho is no ordinary outlaw. He detests injustice and feudal oppression and he copes with each troublesome situation with the help of his cleverness and wit.', 'A funny outlaw tale inspired by traditional folk humour. Pacho is no ordinary outlaw. He detests injustice and feudal oppression and he copes with each troublesome situation with the help of his cleverness and wit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGGgjLhLyeQdc3bkpywyCG6Rb4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41226'),
  ('67053811820572617', 'Pachuvum Athbhuthavilakkum', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Akhil Sathyan, Sharan Velayudhan Nair', 'Akhil Sathyan', 'Fahadh Faasil, Viji Venkatesh, Dhwani Rajesh, Anjana Jayaprakash, Vineeth Radhakrishnan, Mukesh, Avyukth Menon, Abhiram Radhakrishnan', null, 'In return for getting ownership his shop space in Mumbai, Prakashan is tempted into helping his landlord''s mother on a mission. Will he succeed? What does success mean?', 'In return for getting ownership his shop space in Mumbai, Prakashan is tempted into helping his landlord''s mother on a mission. Will he succeed? What does success mean?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhIr3BSgxLgshCH8waq7zz7zmft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816590'),
  ('140000971438164082', 'Pachyderm', 2024, 'Animation, Drama', 'Stéphanie Clément', 'Marc Rius', 'Christa Théret', null, 'As every summer, Louise is entrusted to her grand-parents for a few days of vacation in the country. The green grass of the garden, the swimming in the lake, the fishing with Grandpa, everything seems as sweet as Grandma''s strawberry pies. Yet this year, the snow will fall in summer and a monster will die.', 'As every summer, Louise is entrusted to her grand-parents for a few days of vacation in the country. The green grass of the garden, the swimming in the lake, the fishing with Grandpa, everything seems as sweet as Grandma''s strawberry pies. Yet this year, the snow will fall in summer and a monster will die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmXoJpg0Zu3r1RoupIvyXWLcJeq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950822'),
  ('465346448546302083', 'Pacific 231', 1949, 'Music', 'Jean Mitry', 'Marc Ducouret, Jean Mitry', null, null, 'An engine moves from the roundhouse to a track where it couples with several passenger cars. At 2:10 in the afternoon, it starts a trip out of the station through the countryside to its destination. The film consists of a montage of shots, some close up, of the engine and its gears and wheels. With the accompanying ambient sounds and an orchestral score, the emphasis is on the engine''s power and speed. Parallel lines of multiple tracks, telephone wires, and trees confirm a careful composition.', 'An engine moves from the roundhouse to a track where it couples with several passenger cars. At 2:10 in the afternoon, it starts a trip out of the station through the countryside to its destination. The film consists of a montage of shots, some close up, of the engine and its gears and wheels. With the accompanying ambient sounds and an orchestral score, the emphasis is on the engine''s power and speed. Parallel lines of multiple tracks, telephone wires, and trees confirm a careful composition.', null, 'tmdb:movie:237187'),
  ('99330960871352886', 'Pacific Fear', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Alexandra Kan, Sélélina Pakaina, Jacques Kluger', 'Jean Michel Albert, Fabien Adda, Jacques Kluger', 'Adèle Galloy, Marie Zabukovec, Vaimiti Teiefitu, Marilyn Lima, Aurélien Recoing, Laurent Maurel', null, 'A surf vacation turns into a nightmare when a group of surfers go looking for waves on a mysterious island that isn''t on any map.', 'A surf vacation turns into a nightmare when a group of surfers go looking for waves on a mysterious island that isn''t on any map.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2XGmV7exdrQ9WUTxqgjC3Ch0UZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1134278'),
  ('1148461246970493818', 'Pacific Heights', 1990, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'John Schlesinger, Amir Mokri, Herb Gains', null, 'Melanie Griffith, Matthew Modine, Michael Keaton, Mako, Nobu McCarthy, Laurie Metcalf, Carl Lumbly, Dorian Harewood', 'R', 'A couple works hard to renovate their dream house and become landlords to pay for it. Unfortunately one of their tenants has plans of his own.', 'A couple works hard to renovate their dream house and become landlords to pay for it. Unfortunately one of their tenants has plans of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iHD6xIrGSuuMEFWhwSVGXSddY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2990'),
  ('769562253746008388', 'Pacific Liner', 1939, 'Adventure, Action', 'Robert Russell Bennett, Albert S. D''Agostino, Sam Ruman', 'John Twist', 'Victor McLaglen, Chester Morris, Wendy Barrie, Alan Hale, Barry Fitzgerald, Allan Lane, Halliwell Hobbes, Cy Kendall', null, 'The S. S. Arcturus sails from Shanghai to San Francisco, and Dr. Jim Craig takes the post of ship''s physician in order to be near Ann Grayson, the ship''s nurse. Chief Engineer ''Crusher" McKay also has his eyes on Ann, and this brings an immediate conflict between the two men. When an epidemic breaks out below decks, Craig tells McKay the engine-and-fire rooms must be put under quarantine, but all of Craig''s efforts to keep the disease from spreading are opposed by McKay.', 'The S. S. Arcturus sails from Shanghai to San Francisco, and Dr. Jim Craig takes the post of ship''s physician in order to be near Ann Grayson, the ship''s nurse. Chief Engineer ''Crusher" McKay also has his eyes on Ann, and this brings an immediate conflict between the two men. When an epidemic breaks out below decks, Craig tells McKay the engine-and-fire rooms must be put under quarantine, but all of Craig''s efforts to keep the disease from spreading are opposed by McKay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geF2Zd3gtHodKwmflUgzEi2E2sq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218332'),
  ('75198261359216009', 'Pacific Palisades', 1990, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bernard Schmitt, Martial Barrault', 'Bernard Schmitt, Marion Vernoux', 'Sophie Marceau, Adam Coleman Howard, Anne E. Curry, Toni Basil, Virginia Capers, Virgil Frye, Diana Barton, Sydney Lassick', null, 'A woman from Paris, Bernadette, comes to the United States after being promised a job. When she arrives, however, she learns that she is a victim to a hoax. Unable to return to France, Bernadette looks for work while staying with her close friend Shirley, an actress looking for her big break. Their friendship is challenged when Bernadette finds herself falling in love with Shirley''s boyfriend.', 'A woman from Paris, Bernadette, comes to the United States after being promised a job. When she arrives, however, she learns that she is a victim to a hoax. Unable to return to France, Bernadette looks for work while staying with her close friend Shirley, an actress looking for her big break. Their friendship is challenged when Bernadette finds herself falling in love with Shirley''s boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGgd5Mb0d6YCkFkwwSi6FzRXzRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60301'),
  ('662745151528168424', 'Pacific Rim', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Guillermo Navarro, Guillermo del Toro, Alexander H. Gayner', 'Travis Beacham, Guillermo del Toro', 'Charlie Hunnam, Rinko Kikuchi, Idris Elba, Max Martini, Clifton Collins Jr., Ron Perlman, Charlie Day, Burn Gorman', 'PG-13', 'Using massive piloted robots to combat the alien threat, earth''s survivors take the fight to the invading alien force lurking in the depths of the Pacific Ocean. Nearly defenseless in the face of the relentless enemy, the forces of mankind have no choice but to turn to two unlikely heroes who now stand as earth''s final hope against the mounting apocalypse.', 'Using massive piloted robots to combat the alien threat, earth''s survivors take the fight to the invading alien force lurking in the depths of the Pacific Ocean. Nearly defenseless in the face of the relentless enemy, the forces of mankind have no choice but to turn to two unlikely heroes who now stand as earth''s final hope against the mounting apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wo4eN8dWKaKlxhSvBz19uvj8gA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68726'),
  ('210898201155813755', 'Pacific Rim: Uprising', 2018, 'Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Steven S. DeKnight, Nick Satriano, Aashrita Kamath', 'T.S. Nowlin, Steven S. DeKnight, Emily Carmichael', 'John Boyega, Scott Eastwood, Cailee Spaeny, Jing Tian, Rinko Kikuchi, Burn Gorman, Adria Arjona, Max Zhang', 'PG-13', 'It has been ten years since The Battle of the Breach and the oceans are still, but restless. Vindicated by the victory at the Breach, the Jaeger program has evolved into the most powerful global defense force in human history. The PPDC now calls upon the best and brightest to rise up and become the next generation of heroes when the Kaiju threat returns.', 'It has been ten years since The Battle of the Breach and the oceans are still, but restless. Vindicated by the victory at the Breach, the Jaeger program has evolved into the most powerful global defense force in human history. The PPDC now calls upon the best and brightest to rise up and become the next generation of heroes when the Kaiju threat returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFWhttU8PM50t25NPdy7PE7rv3G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268896'),
  ('304762479318918933', 'Pacifiction', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Artur Tort, Albert Serra', 'Albert Serra', 'Benoît Magimel, Pahoa Mahagafanau, Marc Susini, Matahi Pambrun, Sergi López, Montse Triola, Michaël Vautor, Cécile Guilbert', 'NR', 'Island of Tahiti. French government official De Roller is a calculating man with impeccable manners, capable of dealing with both high society and the locals he frequents in shady joints.', 'Island of Tahiti. French government official De Roller is a calculating man with impeccable manners, capable of dealing with both high society and the locals he frequents in shady joints.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kElJcT1oteDCyRzw0XNqrTZcCvA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:691214'),
  ('95154804541898361', 'Pack Up Your Troubles', 1932, 'Comedy, War', 'Ray McCarey, George Marshall, Art Lloyd', 'H.M. Walker, Stan Laurel, Ray McCarey', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Don Dillaway, Jacquie Lyn, Mary Carr, James Finlayson, Richard Cramer, Adele Watson', 'NR', 'The story begins in 1917 with Stan and Ollie being drafted into the U.S. Army to fight in World War I. While in the Army, the pair befriend a man named Eddie Smith, who is killed by the enemy during a battle. After the war is over, Stan and Ollie venture to New York City, where they begin a quest to reunite Eddie''s little daughter with her rightful family. The task proves both monumental and problematic as the boys discover just how many people in New York have the last name Smith.', 'The story begins in 1917 with Stan and Ollie being drafted into the U.S. Army to fight in World War I. While in the Army, the pair befriend a man named Eddie Smith, who is killed by the enemy during a battle. After the war is over, Stan and Ollie venture to New York City, where they begin a quest to reunite Eddie''s little daughter with her rightful family. The task proves both monumental and problematic as the boys discover just how many people in New York have the last name Smith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nfi4YmKSHn974CDd5VxOtPYOLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44775'),
  ('152483011413318699', 'Package Tour', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Lasse Åberg, Jörgen Persson, Peter Hald', 'Bo Jönsson', 'Lasse Åberg, Jon Skolmen, Lottie Ejebrant, Kim Anderzon, Roland Jansson, Magnus Härenstam, Ted Åström, Sven Melander', null, 'Stig-Helmer and Ole Bramserud on a trip to the Canary Islands for Christmas.', 'Stig-Helmer and Ole Bramserud on a trip to the Canary Islands for Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebBdGB4CCSFbhw8M3fUG0kvYt4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16026'),
  ('783721007720636524', 'Package, Double Package and Counterpackage', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Nanni Loy, Claudio Cirillo, Umberto Riccioni Carteni', 'Elvio Porta, Nanni Loy', 'Tommaso Bianco, Enzo Cannavale, Italo Celoro, Giobbe Covatta, Isa Danieli, Nuccia Fumo, Nunzio Gallo, Leo Gullotta', null, 'Life in Naples is tough, so Neapolitans invent ways to get by. Whatever works, conning mostly, tricking the IRS, the university, the landlord, cruise ship passengers, even conning victims three times with the same ruse.', 'Life in Naples is tough, so Neapolitans invent ways to get by. Whatever works, conning mostly, tricking the IRS, the university, the landlord, cruise ship passengers, even conning victims three times with the same ruse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SVzbRTSvdCjOfNANFUNbddaLN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73645'),
  ('208576254162664143', 'Paco', 2010, 'Drama', 'Diego Rafecas', 'Diego Rafecas', 'Tomás Fonzi, Norma Aleandro, Esther Goris, Romina Ricci, Andrea Galante, Roberto Vallejos, Sebastián Cantoni, Willy Lemos', null, 'The story of Francisco, a young psychics teacher who starts consuming drugs, his mother, a well known congresswoman and Nina, the woman who will try to save him from a horrible future.', 'The story of Francisco, a young psychics teacher who starts consuming drugs, his mother, a well known congresswoman and Nina, the woman who will try to save him from a horrible future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2DfdQKUHBiwbbPPX8Vo2FCt4AE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46810'),
  ('915441985500103490', 'Paco and the Magical Book', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Tetsuya Nakashima, Atsushi Ozawa, Shôichi Atô', 'Tetsuya Nakashima, Nobuhiro Monma', 'Ayaka Wilson, Koji Yakusho, Ryo Kase, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Anna Tsuchiya, Gekidan Hitori, Jun Kunimura, Takaya Yamauchi', null, 'Onuki asks people in a hospital to perform a play for Paco, who suffers from memory disorder. His only hope is to help Paco survive from her illness.', 'Onuki asks people in a hospital to perform a play for Paco, who suffers from memory disorder. His only hope is to help Paco survive from her illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fls07CBytVr3T4KTV2w2VYleeb3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68308'),
  ('761413581620534390', 'Pacto de Fuga', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David Albala, Jorge González Vasquez, Pilar Zderich', 'David Albala, Loreto Caro-Valdés, Susana Quiroz Saavedra', 'Benjamín Vicuña, Roberto Farías, Amparo Noguera, Francisca Gavilán, Patricio Contreras, Eusebio Arenas, Mateo Iribarren, Willy Semler', 'PG', 'During the last years of Pinochet''s military regime, a group of militants from the "Manuel Rodríguez Patriotic Front" plan a prison break of political prisoners, through a tunnel that will take them 18 months to dig.', 'During the last years of Pinochet''s military regime, a group of militants from the "Manuel Rodríguez Patriotic Front" plan a prison break of political prisoners, through a tunnel that will take them 18 months to dig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDFfu73R8uO94ydFtdxEdSfTlg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596247'),
  ('67189702491596851', 'Pad Man', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shruti Mahajan, R. Balki, P. C. Sreeram', 'Swanand Kirkire', 'Akshay Kumar, Radhika Apte, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Jyoti Subhash, Mrinmayee Godbole, Soumya Vyas, Riva Bubber, Urmila Mahanta', null, 'Upon realizing the extent to which women are affected by their menses, a man sets out to create a sanitary pad machine and to provide inexpensive sanitary pads to the women of rural India.', 'Upon realizing the extent to which women are affected by their menses, a man sets out to create a sanitary pad machine and to provide inexpensive sanitary pads to the women of rural India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guI9SEqpZ6A0mhYpngb1gwAy6N2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447856'),
