  ('327937348676153276', 'Padayappa', 1999, 'Drama, Action', 'K. S. Ravikumar, S. Murthy, Prasad', 'K. S. Ravikumar', 'Rajinikanth, Sivaji Ganesan, Ramya Krishnan, Soundarya, Lakshmi, Sithara, Radha Ravi, Nassar', null, 'Padayappa, a mechanical engineer whose father gives up his property to his foster brother, and then dies of shock soon after. Neelambari initially loves Padayappa, but plans to humiliate him after his family humiliates her father. The rest of the plot deals with Padayappa overcoming all the obstacles placed by Neelambari.', 'Padayappa, a mechanical engineer whose father gives up his property to his foster brother, and then dies of shock soon after. Neelambari initially loves Padayappa, but plans to humiliate him after his family humiliates her father. The rest of the plot deals with Padayappa overcoming all the obstacles placed by Neelambari.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PSYF0AtpLbSlTDneCUo7zP4qL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47940'),
  ('462383801268809030', 'Paddington', 2014, 'Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Paul King, Tamara King, Sue Whitaker', 'Paul King', 'Ben Whishaw, Hugh Bonneville, Sally Hawkins, Madeleine Harris, Samuel Joslin, Julie Walters, Nicole Kidman, Imelda Staunton', 'PG', 'A young Peruvian bear travels to London in search of a home. Finding himself lost and alone at Paddington Station, he meets the kindly Brown family, who offer him a temporary haven.', 'A young Peruvian bear travels to London in search of a home. Finding himself lost and alone at Paddington Station, he meets the kindly Brown family, who offer him a temporary haven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpchRGhRhvhtU083PfX2yixXtiw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116149'),
  ('1006850714030002253', 'Paddington 2', 2017, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Joanne Ridler, Lorna Houlihan, Alice Walker', 'Jon Croker', 'Ben Whishaw, Sally Hawkins, Hugh Bonneville, Madeleine Harris, Samuel Joslin, Julie Walters, Hugh Grant, Imelda Staunton', 'PG', 'Paddington, now happily settled with the Browns, picks up a series of odd jobs to buy the perfect present for his Aunt Lucy, but it is stolen.', 'Paddington, now happily settled with the Browns, picks up a series of odd jobs to buy the perfect present for his Aunt Lucy, but it is stolen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OJ9vkD5xPt3skC6KguyXAgagRZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346648'),
  ('778304125232789583', 'Paddington in Peru', 2024, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Dougal Wilson, Erik Wilson, Dario Nolé', 'James Lamont, Jon Foster, Mark Burton', 'Ben Whishaw, Hugh Bonneville, Emily Mortimer, Samuel Joslin, Madeleine Harris, Antonio Banderas, Carla Tous, Olivia Colman', 'PG', 'Paddington travels to Peru to visit his beloved Aunt Lucy, who now resides at the Home for Retired Bears. With the Brown Family in tow, a thrilling adventure ensues when a mystery plunges them into an unexpected journey through the Amazon rainforest and up to the mountain peaks of Peru.', 'Paddington travels to Peru to visit his beloved Aunt Lucy, who now resides at the Home for Retired Bears. With the Brown Family in tow, a thrilling adventure ensues when a mystery plunges them into an unexpected journey through the Amazon rainforest and up to the mountain peaks of Peru.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ffZAucqfvQu36x1C49XfOdjuOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516729'),
