  ('168990700997705763', 'Paddleton', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'TK Shom, Sean Vawter, Alexandre Lehmann', 'Mark Duplass, Alexandre Lehmann', 'Mark Duplass, Ray Romano, Christine Woods, Jen Sung, Stephen Oyoung, Bjorn Johnson, Harry Dej, Sierra Fisk', 'R', 'An unlikely friendship between two neighbors becomes an unexpectedly emotional journey when the younger man is diagnosed with terminal cancer.', 'An unlikely friendship between two neighbors becomes an unexpectedly emotional journey when the younger man is diagnosed with terminal cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtssTSvNgY8132hPRtp1DbciYJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525183'),
  ('534269787537207003', 'Padmaavat', 2018, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Sanjay Leela Bhansali, Saraswathi Menon, Sudeep Chatterjee', 'Sanjay Leela Bhansali, Prakash R. Kapadia', 'Deepika Padukone, Shahid Kapoor, Ranveer Singh, Jim Sarbh, Aayam Mehta, Ujjwal Chopra, Raza Murad, Aditi Rao Hydari', 'NR', 'Rajputana, India, 13th century. The tyrannical usurper Alauddin Khilji, sultan of Delhi, becomes obsessed with Queen Padmavati, wife of King Ratan Singh of Mewar, and goes to great lengths to satisfy his greed for her.', 'Rajputana, India, 13th century. The tyrannical usurper Alauddin Khilji, sultan of Delhi, becomes obsessed with Queen Padmavati, wife of King Ratan Singh of Mewar, and goes to great lengths to satisfy his greed for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kk71s8Vmvt8XQOojevhTA5QcB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432527'),
  ('438370415970916529', 'Padosan', 1968, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Jyoti Swaroop, N.K. Roy, K.H. Kapadia', 'Rajendra Krishan', 'Sunil Dutt, Saira Banu, Mehmood, Kishore Kumar, Om Prakash, Dulari, Sunder, Agha', null, 'A simple man from a village falls in love with his new neighbor. He enlists the help of his musical-theater friends to woo the lovely girl-next-door away from her music teacher.', 'A simple man from a village falls in love with his new neighbor. He enlists the help of his musical-theater friends to woo the lovely girl-next-door away from her music teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3saYvaYdzuXCEfIfNJiKaO58qO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20622'),
  ('331269280687979674', 'Padre no hay más que dos', 1982, 'Comedy, Family', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Leopoldo Villaseñor', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Fernando Esteso, Andrés Pajares, Miguel Ángel Valero, Miguel Joven, Mari Carmen Pascual, Paloma Hurtado, Beatriz Carvajal, Luisa Armenteros', null, 'Amalio and Florencio are two cabaret artists who divorce their wives and stay with custody of their children. An unscrupulous cheat the two rent both of them the same dilapidated house. There will have to live both trying to get ahead as a team of magicians who happens to be a failure. But thanks to the ideas of their children, both parents are a couple of musical comedy that, despite initial failures, is a great success with the participation of the kids. Moreover Amalio and Florencio try to flirt with girls that are radically different from their wives but the kids will all the impediments that have no future.', 'Amalio and Florencio are two cabaret artists who divorce their wives and stay with custody of their children. An unscrupulous cheat the two rent both of them the same dilapidated house. There will have to live both trying to get ahead as a team of magicians who happens to be a failure. But thanks to the ideas of their children, both parents are a couple of musical comedy that, despite initial failures, is a great success with the participation of the kids. Moreover Amalio and Florencio try to flirt with girls that are radically different from their wives but the kids will all the impediments that have no future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txoqaGACEe73QjUluLqZRnDHWCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122976'),
  ('1126076765778655480', 'Padre no hay más que uno 3', 2022, 'Comedy, Family', 'Santiago Segura', 'Marta González de Vega, Santiago Segura', 'Santiago Segura, Toni Acosta, Martina D’Antiochia, Calma Segura, Luna Fulgencio, Carlos González Morollón, Sirena Segura, Wendy Ramos', null, 'Christmas is coming. The children accidentally break a Nativity scene figurine from their father''s collection and must by all means get an equal one, the problem is that it is a unique antique piece. Sara, the eldest daughter breaks up with her boyfriend, Ocho, who will try to recover her favors with the help of her father-in-law, Javier. Precisely Javier''s father-in-law, Marisa''s father, will be welcomed into the family home to spend the holidays after her recent separation, which will not leave Javier''s mother, Milagros, indifferent. Rocío, the folklore of the family, who has been playing the Virgin for several Christmases, is relegated this year to playing the shepherdess, something that her father, Javier, is not willing to assume.', 'Christmas is coming. The children accidentally break a Nativity scene figurine from their father''s collection and must by all means get an equal one, the problem is that it is a unique antique piece. Sara, the eldest daughter breaks up with her boyfriend, Ocho, who will try to recover her favors with the help of her father-in-law, Javier. Precisely Javier''s father-in-law, Marisa''s father, will be welcomed into the family home to spend the holidays after her recent separation, which will not leave Javier''s mother, Milagros, indifferent. Rocío, the folklore of the family, who has been playing the Virgin for several Christmases, is relegated this year to playing the shepherdess, something that her father, Javier, is not willing to assume.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2v9xSPtiyxCNxaRGtj7COwdgG3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975120'),
  ('842293382793940544', 'Padre no hay más que uno 5: Nido repleto', 2025, 'Comedy, Family', 'Santiago Segura', 'Marta González de Vega, Santiago Segura', 'Santiago Segura, Toni Acosta, Leo Harlem, Silvia Abril, Loles León, Carlos Iglesias, El Cejas, Marta González de Vega', null, 'Some parents experience the anguish of the "empty nest" when their children leave home. Javier, on the other hand, suffers the trauma of the "full nest": no one wants to leave home.', 'Some parents experience the anguish of the "empty nest" when their children leave home. Javier, on the other hand, suffers the trauma of the "full nest": no one wants to leave home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7H27uvaPZfq794qVcLFrSEgHseZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1328913'),
  ('983398689332899051', 'Padre Padrone', 1977, 'Drama', 'Vittorio Taviani, Paolo Taviani, Mario Masini', 'Paolo Taviani, Vittorio Taviani', 'Omero Antonutti, Saverio Marconi, Marcella Michelangeli, Fabrizio Forte, Marino Cenna, Stanko Molnar, Gavino Ledda, Nanni Moretti', null, 'The true story of the life of Gavino Ledda, the son of a Sardinian shepherd, and how he managed to escape his harsh, almost barbaric existence by slowly educating himself, despite violent opposition from his brutal father.', 'The true story of the life of Gavino Ledda, the son of a Sardinian shepherd, and how he managed to escape his harsh, almost barbaric existence by slowly educating himself, despite violent opposition from his brutal father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kGarhZIsbpFNcEHftRzNeuz6Sb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42225'),
  ('534165789364210839', 'Padre Pio', 2023, 'Drama', 'Abel Ferrara, Alessandro Abate, Giulio Donato', 'Abel Ferrara, Maurizio Braucci', 'Shia LaBeouf, Cristina Chiriac, Marco Leonardi, Asia Argento, Vincenzo Crea, Luca Lionello, Brando Pacitto, Stella Mastrantonio', 'R', 'It is the end of World War I and the young Italian soldiers are making their way back to San Giovanni Rotondo, a land of poverty, with a tradition of violence and submission to the iron-clad rule of the church and its wealthy landowners. Families are desperate, the men are broken, albeit victorious. Padre Pio also arrives, at a remote Capuchin monastery, to begin his ministry, evoking an aura of charisma, saintliness and epic visions of Jesus, Mary and the Devil himself. The eve of the first free elections in Italy sets the stage for a massacre with a metaphorical dimension: an apocalyptic event that changes the course of history.', 'It is the end of World War I and the young Italian soldiers are making their way back to San Giovanni Rotondo, a land of poverty, with a tradition of violence and submission to the iron-clad rule of the church and its wealthy landowners. Families are desperate, the men are broken, albeit victorious. Padre Pio also arrives, at a remote Capuchin monastery, to begin his ministry, evoking an aura of charisma, saintliness and epic visions of Jesus, Mary and the Devil himself. The eve of the first free elections in Italy sets the stage for a massacre with a metaphorical dimension: an apocalyptic event that changes the course of history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRrCrLtbhIPelONxL8MEFif1JZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860901'),
