  ('426817729238076978', 'Pagan Moon', 1932, 'Music, Animation, Comedy', 'Rudolf Ising', null, 'Johnny Murray, The King''s Men, Rudolf Ising, Marcellite Garner', null, 'On a tropical island, a native boy sings "Pagan Moon" to his sweetheart. Later, he plays music underwater with an octopus-pianist and other jazz-loving sea life.', 'On a tropical island, a native boy sings "Pagan Moon" to his sweetheart. Later, he plays music underwater with an octopus-pianist and other jazz-loving sea life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lb8CiPe8x8uQvHamQ5uXsAbuAYE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161645'),
