  ('756231670613670323', 'PAIN', 2022, 'Romance', 'Felipe Zimermann, Clara Kim', 'Clara Kim', 'Andre Liz, Blonden', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqPwyUUttEvobfmjNN8Lyw1llqK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1057918'),
  ('530867779561443379', 'Pain & Gain', 2013, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Michael Bay, Ben Seresin, Carlos Rojas', 'Christopher Markus, Stephen McFeely', 'Mark Wahlberg, Dwayne Johnson, Anthony Mackie, Tony Shalhoub, Ed Harris, Rob Corddry, Bar Paly, Rebel Wilson', 'R', 'Daniel Lugo, manager of the Sun Gym in 1990s Miami, decides that there is only one way to achieve his version of the American dream: extortion. To achieve his goal, he recruits musclemen Paul and Adrian as accomplices. After several failed attempts, they abduct rich businessman Victor Kershaw and convince him to sign over all his assets to them. But when Kershaw makes it out alive, authorities are reluctant to believe his story.', 'Daniel Lugo, manager of the Sun Gym in 1990s Miami, decides that there is only one way to achieve his version of the American dream: extortion. To achieve his goal, he recruits musclemen Paul and Adrian as accomplices. After several failed attempts, they abduct rich businessman Victor Kershaw and convince him to sign over all his assets to them. But when Kershaw makes it out alive, authorities are reluctant to believe his story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WqA0Ry9wmTzFvom8mNbcyKZQgP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134374'),
  ('50318319368952251', 'Pain and Glory', 2019, 'Drama', 'Victor Quintero, Manuel Calvo, David Esquivel', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Antonio Banderas, Asier Etxeandia, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Nora Navas, Julieta Serrano, Penélope Cruz, César Vicente, Asier Flores', 'R', 'Salvador Mallo, a filmmaker in the twilight of his career, remembers his life: his mother, his lovers, the actors he worked with. The sixties in a small village in Valencia, the eighties in Madrid, the present, when he feels an immeasurable emptiness, facing his mortality, the incapability of continuing filming, the impossibility of separating creation from his own life. The need of narrating his past can be his salvation.', 'Salvador Mallo, a filmmaker in the twilight of his career, remembers his life: his mother, his lovers, the actors he worked with. The sixties in a small village in Valencia, the eighties in Madrid, the present, when he feels an immeasurable emptiness, facing his mortality, the incapability of continuing filming, the impossibility of separating creation from his own life. The need of narrating his past can be his salvation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMlueArJXXwZbeLpb4NhC3pxmBk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519010'),
  ('343069208319023069', 'Pain Hustlers', 2023, 'Drama', 'David Yates, Dixon McPhillips, Cliff Lanning', 'Wells Tower', 'Emily Blunt, Chris Evans, Catherine O''Hara, Andy Garcia, Jay Duplass, Brian d''Arcy James, Amit Shah, Chloe Coleman', 'R', 'After losing her job, a single mom falls into a lucrative but ultimately dangerous scheme selling prescription drugs.', 'After losing her job, a single mom falls into a lucrative but ultimately dangerous scheme selling prescription drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0gM9jE1KmCkXZRqkeNYEQZdVsZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862968'),
