  ('891159598783774359', 'Painkili', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sreejith Babu, Arjun Sethu', 'Jithu Madhavan', 'Sajin Gopu, Anaswara Rajan, Jisma Jiji, Roshan Shanavas, Chandu Salimkumar, Abu Salim, Riyaz Khan, Lijo Jose Pellissery', null, 'Tale of Suku, who fakes insanity to escape the law. While faking insanity, he falls in love.', 'Tale of Suku, who fakes insanity to escape the law. While faking insanity, he falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hj2VTnrshKRFi6rUKd8neP4q8qO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290218'),
