  ('68180777784016119', 'Pains of Autumn', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Tomris Giritlioğlu, Ercan Yılmaz', 'Tayfun Pirselimoğlu, Etyen Mahçupyan, Nilgün Öneş', 'Murat Yildirim, Beren Saat, Okan Yalabık, Belçim Bilgin, Hüseyin Avni Danyal, İlker Aksum, Umut Kurt, Avni Yalçın', null, 'When a nationalistic wealthy landowner''s idealist son falls for a non-muslim prostitute, he finds himself in a conflict between his feelings and politics under the shadow of the events of September 6th-7th in 1955, the Istanbul Pogrom.', 'When a nationalistic wealthy landowner''s idealist son falls for a non-muslim prostitute, he finds himself in a conflict between his feelings and politics under the shadow of the events of September 6th-7th in 1955, the Istanbul Pogrom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rb7BJV4ZiliODgXj9Djlkxf3UZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52178'),
  ('1016990913303596118', 'Paint', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Brit McAdams, Patrick Cady, Jake Martin', 'Brit McAdams', 'Owen Wilson, Michaela Watkins, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Ciara Renée, Lusia Strus, Stephen Root, Lucy Freyer, Denny Dillon', 'PG-13', 'Carl Nargle, Vermont’s #1 public television painter, is convinced he has it all: a signature perm, custom van, and fans hanging on his every stroke… until a younger, better artist steals everything (and everyone) Carl loves.', 'Carl Nargle, Vermont’s #1 public television painter, is convinced he has it all: a signature perm, custom van, and fans hanging on his every stroke… until a younger, better artist steals everything (and everyone) Carl loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ELRsmAhDj3FKYYFIrOcOLXyVSM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821890'),
  ('1101230393218871093', 'Paint it Gold', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rémi Bezançon, Eric Vedrine, Philippe Guilbert', 'Gastón Duprat, Rémi Bezançon, Vanessa Portal', 'Bouli Lanners, Vincent Macaigne, Bastien Ughetto, Anaïde Rozam, Aure Atika, Philippe Résimont, Tibo Vandenborre, Madeleine Baudot', null, 'Arthur, a passionate Parisian art gallery owner, represents Renzo, a longtime friend, and radical figurative painter stuck in an existential crisis. Suffering from painter''s block, dejected, Renzo slumps into utter boredom. To save themselves, Arthur develops a bold plan to bring them both back into the limelight.', 'Arthur, a passionate Parisian art gallery owner, represents Renzo, a longtime friend, and radical figurative painter stuck in an existential crisis. Suffering from painter''s block, dejected, Renzo slumps into utter boredom. To save themselves, Arthur develops a bold plan to bring them both back into the limelight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nurzCuBfHW8yH3VhpzHXXsc38YT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979149'),
  ('547968983447340901', 'Paint Your Wagon', 1969, 'Comedy, Western, Music', 'William A. Fraker, Joshua Logan, Tom Shaw', 'Alan Jay Lerner', 'Lee Marvin, Clint Eastwood, Jean Seberg, Ray Walston, Harve Presnell, Tom Ligon, Alan Dexter, Terry Jenkins', 'PG-13', 'A Michigan farmer and a prospector form a partnership in the California gold country. Their adventures include buying and sharing a wife, hijacking a stage, kidnapping six prostitutes, and turning their mining camp into a boom town. Along the way there is plenty of drinking, gambling, and singing. They even find time to do some creative gold mining.', 'A Michigan farmer and a prospector form a partnership in the California gold country. Their adventures include buying and sharing a wife, hijacking a stage, kidnapping six prostitutes, and turning their mining camp into a boom town. Along the way there is plenty of drinking, gambling, and singing. They even find time to do some creative gold mining.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwnYGuba3ZSM2bXwBZZs4DqqKTl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20391'),
  ('360453073404451589', 'Paintball', 2009, 'Thriller, Action, Horror', 'Daniel Benmayor', 'Mario Schoendorff', 'Brendan Mackey, Jennifer Matter, Patrick Regis, Iaione Perez, Neil Maskell, Anna Casas, Peter Vives, Claudia Bassols', 'R', 'Eight strangers engaged in an intense game of experts-only paintball find their friendly game taking a terrifying turn when one member of the team begins playing by a different set of rules. It started as a remote raw battle of wits and wiles set against the backdrop of majestic wilderness. With each shot fired, the stakes grew higher. But something horrible has happened, and what was once a team sport has become a relentless struggle for individual survival. The danger growing by the minute, the combatants gradually come to realize that their greatest adversary may be the very game they set out to play.', 'Eight strangers engaged in an intense game of experts-only paintball find their friendly game taking a terrifying turn when one member of the team begins playing by a different set of rules. It started as a remote raw battle of wits and wiles set against the backdrop of majestic wilderness. With each shot fired, the stakes grew higher. But something horrible has happened, and what was once a team sport has become a relentless struggle for individual survival. The danger growing by the minute, the combatants gradually come to realize that their greatest adversary may be the very game they set out to play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGzGlsrRiLJA5S81CPguLDDZNZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25377'),
  ('274681944710209370', 'Paintball Massacre', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller, Comedy', 'Darren Berry, Martin Zenic, Saffron Watson', 'Chris Regan', 'Katy Brand, Lee Latchford-Evans, Robert Portal, Nicholas Vince, Ian Virgo, Cheryl Burniston, Lockhart Ogilvie, Brendan Carr', null, 'Old school friends go on a paintball trip miles away from civilization. But things go horribly wrong when they discover a cold-blooded masked killer is amongst them. Now, they must fight to survive their school reunion.', 'Old school friends go on a paintball trip miles away from civilization. But things go horribly wrong when they discover a cold-blooded masked killer is amongst them. Now, they must fight to survive their school reunion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJK5LT37i8rDGg76rlBZ38PP7dS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:770992'),
  ('750140663622684425', 'Painted Faces', 1988, 'Drama', 'Alex Law Kai-Yui, David Chung, Roland Chan Ngok-Chung', 'Alex Law Kai-Yui, Mabel Cheung Yuen-Ting', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Lam Ching-Ying, Cheng Pei-Pei, Lee Din-Hing, Yeung Yam-Yin, Chung Gam-Yam, Siu Ming-Fui, Cheung Man-Lung', null, 'This is a story about the Peking Opera School that Jackie Chan, Samo Hung and Yuen Biao attended as young men. The story is about their teacher Master Yu and his school.', 'This is a story about the Peking Opera School that Jackie Chan, Samo Hung and Yuen Biao attended as young men. The story is about their teacher Master Yu and his school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzyijrI9OEeTPEAHabnMeN9iQa5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154989'),
  ('1080455998443558799', 'Painted Fire', 2002, 'Drama, History', 'Im Kwon-taek, Jung Il-sung, Kim Dong-ho', 'Im Kwon-taek, Kim Yong-ok', 'Choi Min-sik, Kim Yeo-jin, Ahn Sung-ki, Yoo Ho-jeong, Son Ye-jin, Jeong Tae-woo, Park Cheol-min, Kim Eung-soo', null, 'In a time of political and social unrest in 19th century Korea, uncouth, self-taught painter Jang Seung-up explores his natural talent amidst the repressive world around him.', 'In a time of political and social unrest in 19th century Korea, uncouth, self-taught painter Jang Seung-up explores his natural talent amidst the repressive world around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZfIDpywVqgftbTPJw8uui2PZFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18302'),
  ('1110548354171286809', 'Painted Lips', 1974, 'Drama, Romance', 'Leopoldo Torre Nilsson, Rodolfo Mórtola', 'Luis Pico Estrada, Leopoldo Torre Nilsson, Beatriz Guido', 'Alfredo Alcón, Marta Yolanda González, Luisina Brando, Raúl Lavié, Leonor Manso, Isabel Pisano, Cipe Lincovsky, Oscar Pedemonti', null, 'The life and the lovers of a few young women in a provincial town.', 'The life and the lovers of a few young women in a provincial town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8a4K3sb9dzsnzWw4pZVFMXhHegP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62499'),
  ('578108128424187749', 'Painted Skin', 1993, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'King Hu, Catherine Lau Ga-Wai, Chung Yee-Fung', 'Zhong A-Cheng, King Hu', 'Joey Wong, Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Wu Ma, Lam Ching-Ying, Lau Shun, Li Changhua, Ting Chou', null, 'A roving ghost spirit controlled by Ying Yang the Evil paints her face in the guise of a concubine. Her spirit can only be released by a ghostbusting monk who comes to her rescue.', 'A roving ghost spirit controlled by Ying Yang the Evil paints her face in the guise of a concubine. Her spirit can only be released by a ghostbusting monk who comes to her rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnGmNirm8DE7qIuB1qyDZTDFJuq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106654'),
  ('329381502957627307', 'Painted Skin', 2008, 'Fantasy, Action, Drama', 'Gordon Chan, Zhang Yang', 'Gordon Chan, Abe Kwong Man-Wai, Lau Ho-Leung', 'Donnie Yen, Zhou Xun, Chen Kun, Vicky Zhao, Sun Li, Qi Yuwu, Jin Song, David Liang Kai-Di', null, 'Painted Skin is based on one of Pu Songling''s classic short stories in Strange Stories from a Chinese Studio. Zhou Xun stars as Xiao Wei, a fox spirit that feasts on human hearts in order to maintain her lovely, youthful appearance. When General Wang Sheng (Chen Kun) ''rescues'' her from a band of bandits and brings her home, trouble brews as the demon falls in love with the general.', 'Painted Skin is based on one of Pu Songling''s classic short stories in Strange Stories from a Chinese Studio. Zhou Xun stars as Xiao Wei, a fox spirit that feasts on human hearts in order to maintain her lovely, youthful appearance. When General Wang Sheng (Chen Kun) ''rescues'' her from a band of bandits and brings her home, trouble brews as the demon falls in love with the general.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5F7FS2brRyRp2lSLEsuvuRBSsrt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17808'),
  ('350159016183104716', 'Painted Skin: The Resurrection', 2012, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Wuershan, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Liu Aidong', 'Ran Ping, Ran Jianan', 'Zhou Xun, Chen Kun, Vicky Zhao, Yang Mi, William Feng, Chen Tingjia, Lenox Lu, Kris Phillips', null, 'According to demon lore, it takes hundreds of years to attain human form. Even then, lacking a human heart, a demon cannot experience the true pains and passions of existence. However, there is a legend that if a pure human heart is freely offered to a demon, it can become a mortal and experience true life. Sequel of Painted Skin (2008).', 'According to demon lore, it takes hundreds of years to attain human form. Even then, lacking a human heart, a demon cannot experience the true pains and passions of existence. However, there is a legend that if a pure human heart is freely offered to a demon, it can become a mortal and experience true life. Sequel of Painted Skin (2008).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76kFdKtdUrW9E6mMw2Xf5Wf10LZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124471'),
  ('298594166046163509', 'Painting for the main bedroom', 2020, null, 'Ilias Doulis, Ilias Doulis', null, 'Kostas Tsarouhis, Giorgos Gotzos, Evgenia Kokolaki', null, 'A man is painting a landscape. A woman is holding two cups. What can go wrong? A nightmare in pink.', 'A man is painting a landscape. A woman is holding two cups. What can go wrong? A nightmare in pink.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yD4Y1C0PEOmwMwjGHhWfwHY5JgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745948'),
  ('1094093644023384860', 'Paisan', 1946, 'Drama, War', 'Roberto Rossellini, Otello Martelli, Annalena Limentani', 'Vasco Pratolini', 'Carmela Sazio, Robert Van Loon, Benjamin Emanuel, Raymond Campbell, Harold Wagner, Albert Heinze, Merlin Berth, Mats Carlson', null, 'Six stories unfold in various regions, from Sicily to the northern Po Valley as American military personnel interact with a variety of Italian locals over eighteen months in the push north during the Italian Campaign of WWII as German forces retreat.', 'Six stories unfold in various regions, from Sicily to the northern Po Valley as American military personnel interact with a variety of Italian locals over eighteen months in the push north during the Italian Campaign of WWII as German forces retreat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5IGAFASCXmp8m51vUbER3WwVcB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8429'),
  ('692457713226226208', 'Pajama Party', 1964, 'Comedy, Music, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Don Weis, Clark L. Paylow, Floyd Crosby', 'Louis M. Heyward', 'Tommy Kirk, Annette Funicello, Elsa Lanchester, Harvey Lembeck, Jesse White, Jody McCrea, Ben Lessy, Donna Loren', 'NR', 'A Martian teenager sent to prepare for an invasion falls in love with an Earth girl.', 'A Martian teenager sent to prepare for an invasion falls in love with an Earth girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzk45q0phMDlKwgcv5ePmME7yq3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53617'),
  ('967739902639976962', 'Pajarito Gómez', 1965, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rodolfo Kuhn, Ignacio Souto, Nicolás Sarquís', 'Rodolfo Kuhn, Carlos del Peral, Francisco Urondo', 'Héctor Pellegrini, María Cristina Laurenz, Nelly Beltrán, Lautaro Murúa, Alberto Fernández de Rosa, Maurice Jouvet, Beatriz Matar, Jorge Rivera López', null, 'A chronicle of the life and career of a popular singer: his humble origins, his rise to fame, and his exploitation by the media.', 'A chronicle of the life and career of a popular singer: his humble origins, his rise to fame, and his exploitation by the media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfQESzAA7LzdnbzfAnekc7FdIoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269054'),
  ('8085450322509601', 'Pájaros volando', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Néstor Montalbano', 'Damián Dreizik', 'Diego Capusotto, Luis Luque, Verónica Llinás, Alejandra Flechner, Damián Dreizik, Vanessa Weinberg, Juan Carlos Mesa, Tahiel Arévalo', null, 'José (Diego Capusotto) lives in Buenos Aires with his father, with whom he doesn''t have a good relationship. He''s a musician, but supports himself with the earnings from his taxi company, and when he can, he plays with his band in pubs. He''s nostalgic for the success he could never achieve again, like when he played with his cousin Miguel (Luis Luque). They had both achieved a certain notoriety with the song "Pájaros vuela" (Flying Birds) by their band "Dientes de Limón." After a long time without seeing each other, Miguel, who lives in Las Pircas, a small town in the mountains of Córdoba, comes to visit him and suggests that he leave the city and come with him.', 'José (Diego Capusotto) lives in Buenos Aires with his father, with whom he doesn''t have a good relationship. He''s a musician, but supports himself with the earnings from his taxi company, and when he can, he plays with his band in pubs. He''s nostalgic for the success he could never achieve again, like when he played with his cousin Miguel (Luis Luque). They had both achieved a certain notoriety with the song "Pájaros vuela" (Flying Birds) by their band "Dientes de Limón." After a long time without seeing each other, Miguel, who lives in Las Pircas, a small town in the mountains of Córdoba, comes to visit him and suggests that he leave the city and come with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptGAsnFcZDF186SusDtY2wjqpR5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94180'),
  ('213734473451756453', 'Paju', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Park Chan-ok, Kim Woo-hyung, Kim Seung-gyu', 'Park Chan-ok, Lee Yoo-rim', 'Lee Sun-kyun, Seo Woo, Shim Yi Young, Han Ye-ri, Lee Kyung-young, Kim Bo-kyung, Lee Dae-yeon, Lee Bong-gyu', null, 'A young woman living in the South Korean town of Paju recalls the last 8 years of her life, since a young man on the lam escaped to it from Seoul and married her older sister.', 'A young woman living in the South Korean town of Paju recalls the last 8 years of her life, since a young man on the lam escaped to it from Seoul and married her older sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ifA1dOwwUe5KLMs5edjo0IR4ux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36329'),
  ('675218714231982151', 'Pakeezah', 1972, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Kamal Amrohi, Josef Wirsching', 'Kamal Amrohi', 'Meena Kumari, Ashok Kumar, Raaj Kumar, Veena, Nadira, Kamal Kapoor, D.K. Sapru, Pratima Devi', null, 'A beautiful courtesan is unable to break away from the cycle of prostitution until a forest ranger falls in love with her. Unfortunately, his wealthy parents oppose the union.', 'A beautiful courtesan is unable to break away from the cycle of prostitution until a forest ranger falls in love with her. Unfortunately, his wealthy parents oppose the union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVm7WcvVfeQzi8M7NZXcdtbF6jz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54966'),
  ('870831182915001575', 'Pal Joey', 1957, 'Music, Romance, Comedy', 'George Sidney, Harold Lipstein, Arthur S. Black Jr.', 'Lorenz Hart', 'Rita Hayworth, Frank Sinatra, Kim Novak, Barbara Nichols, Bobby Sherwood, Hank Henry, Elizabeth Patterson, Hermes Pan', 'NR', 'An opportunistic singer woos a wealthy widow to boost his career.', 'An opportunistic singer woos a wealthy widow to boost his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vWaDXDBxEv9ahwF8aSigbC0ADy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33734'),
  ('994046596354947542', 'Palace Beach Hotel', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Philippe Venault, Marc Romani', 'Jacques Forgeas, Philippe Venault', 'Thierry Godard, Raphaëlle Agogué, Margot Bancilhon, Thomas Coumans, François-David Cardonnel', null, 'Three young soldiers who participated in a military operation that went wrong, and where one of their comrades had been killed before their eyes, are placed in a luxury hotel to prevent a scandal. Despite the help of a young military psychiatrist, the young trio denies any trauma suffered, but they seem to hold a very different secret truth.', 'Three young soldiers who participated in a military operation that went wrong, and where one of their comrades had been killed before their eyes, are placed in a luxury hotel to prevent a scandal. Despite the help of a young military psychiatrist, the young trio denies any trauma suffered, but they seem to hold a very different secret truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8uscC3fWRNaqGTo2WNq3EWYTpp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303632'),
  ('712411924426912357', 'Palau the Movie', 2019, 'Drama', 'Kevin Knoblock', 'Kevin Knoblock', 'Gastón Pauls, Alexandra Bard, Daniel Roebuck, Estela Garelli, Ramiro Mendez Roy, Alan Daicz, Gabriel Gallicchio, Arthur Marroquin', null, 'After his father passes away at age 10, the lives of Luis Palau and his family are changed forever. Within a few years of his father''s death, Luis, his siblings, and his mother are left nearly destitute. Luis is forced to discontinue his education at an elite boarding school in Argentina and provide for his family as they slip into poverty.', 'After his father passes away at age 10, the lives of Luis Palau and his family are changed forever. Within a few years of his father''s death, Luis, his siblings, and his mother are left nearly destitute. Luis is forced to discontinue his education at an elite boarding school in Argentina and provide for his family as they slip into poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IbjA53Crr3Ej7w1dAG7r2tyjY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593693'),
  ('53608460302939173', 'Palazzina LAF', 2023, 'Drama', 'Claudio Cofrancesco, Michele Riondino, Saverio Di Biagio', 'Michele Riondino, Maurizio Braucci', 'Michele Riondino, Elio Germano, Vanessa Scalera, Anna Ferruzzo, Domenico Fortunato, Giovanni D''Addario, Michele Sinisi, Fulvio Pepe', null, 'Caterino is a worker at the Ilva factory in Taranto. When the company executives decide to use him as a spy to identify the workers they should get rid of, Caterino starts to track his colleagues, in search of reasons to report them. He then asks to be assigned himself to the Palazzino LAF where as punishment, some employees sit out their time with no job assignment. There he discovers that what looks like paradise is actually a strategy to psychologically break troublesome workers.', 'Caterino is a worker at the Ilva factory in Taranto. When the company executives decide to use him as a spy to identify the workers they should get rid of, Caterino starts to track his colleagues, in search of reasons to report them. He then asks to be assigned himself to the Palazzino LAF where as punishment, some employees sit out their time with no job assignment. There he discovers that what looks like paradise is actually a strategy to psychologically break troublesome workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Avkcz7wPGEadCInD5X7MyWGPy46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1037052'),
  ('1007901115264837928', 'Pale Blood', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller', 'V.V. Dachin Hsu, Michael W. Leighton, Gerry Lively', 'Takashi Matsuoka, V.V. Dachin Hsu', 'George Chakiris, Wings Hauser, Pamela Ludwig, Diana Frank, Darcy DeMoss, Earl Garnes, Frazer Smith, Sybil Danning', null, '3 dead women, blood drained through small bites and placed around L.A. The murders catch international attention of a lonely man looking to teach a suspected vampire some morals.', '3 dead women, blood drained through small bites and placed around L.A. The murders catch international attention of a lonely man looking to teach a suspected vampire some morals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vr80VFhcPqX5tj6sFlgcYP6WWKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46230'),
  ('495242153943380635', 'Pale Cocoon', 2005, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yasuhiro Yoshiura, Yasuhiro Yoshiura', 'Yasuhiro Yoshiura', 'Minako Kawashima, Michio Nakao, Yuka Koyama, Yasuhiro Yoshiura', null, 'In the far future when the continuity of the history has been lost, humans live in an ever more deteriorating completely artificial and enclosed world. The sea and the sky have disappeared, and the only window to "living" scenery exists in the records from the past, excavated in the relic.The Bureau of Record Excavation is an organization responsible for this task. Ura works for the 92nd office of the bureau. He is absorbed by the restoration of various records and fascinated by world of the past. Riko keeps a little distance to watch him, but averts her eyes from the records, believing that sometimes people just want things to stay the same.Everyone in this world knows that to know the past means to know the misery of this world, the present reality. But one day, Ura restores a strange video...', 'In the far future when the continuity of the history has been lost, humans live in an ever more deteriorating completely artificial and enclosed world. The sea and the sky have disappeared, and the only window to "living" scenery exists in the records from the past, excavated in the relic.The Bureau of Record Excavation is an organization responsible for this task. Ura works for the 92nd office of the bureau. He is absorbed by the restoration of various records and fascinated by world of the past. Riko keeps a little distance to watch him, but averts her eyes from the records, believing that sometimes people just want things to stay the same.Everyone in this world knows that to know the past means to know the misery of this world, the present reality. But one day, Ura restores a strange video...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wpe6Rjrj2cl7FcUktAh0Dk2xnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20683'),
  ('266494825572703692', 'Pale Flower', 1964, 'Crime, Romance', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Saburo Abe, Masao Kosugi', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Masaru Baba', 'Ryō Ikebe, Mariko Kaga, Takashi Fujiki, Naoki Sugiura, Shinichirō Mikami, Isao Sasaki, Koji Nakahara, Chisako Hara', null, 'A gangster gets released from prison and has to cope with the recent shifts of power between the gangs, while taking care of a thrill-seeking young woman, who got in bad company while gambling.', 'A gangster gets released from prison and has to cope with the recent shifts of power between the gangs, while taking care of a thrill-seeking young woman, who got in bad company while gambling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEB48waFBIx4WEySuOpk1vOFZ6E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61475'),
  ('1092057577209886001', 'Pale Moon', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Daihachi Yoshida, Makoto Sigma, Tsuyoshi Sugino', 'Kaeko Hayafune', 'Rie Miyazawa, Sosuke Ikematsu, Seiichi Tanabe, Satomi Kobayashi, Yoshimasa Kondo, Renji Ishibashi, Yuko Oshima, Mayumi Sakura', null, 'Daily, Rika Umezawa battles a nagging sense of emptiness and dissatisfaction. She works a tiring job, comes home to an unappreciative husband and has little opportunity to enjoy life. But things change when office gossip about affairs and embezzlement inspire Rika to do the unthinkable. Soon, Rika finds herself filling the void with a university student named Kota and the millions entrusted to her by clients. Is her newfound lifestyle the key to happiness? And if so, how long can it last?', 'Daily, Rika Umezawa battles a nagging sense of emptiness and dissatisfaction. She works a tiring job, comes home to an unappreciative husband and has little opportunity to enjoy life. But things change when office gossip about affairs and embezzlement inspire Rika to do the unthinkable. Soon, Rika finds herself filling the void with a university student named Kota and the millions entrusted to her by clients. Is her newfound lifestyle the key to happiness? And if so, how long can it last?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Z9ZU7modHZSDFfbE1b1xKHpwXP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294651'),
  ('13124497008887384', 'Pale Rider', 1985, 'Western, Drama', 'Clint Eastwood, Bruce Surtees, David Valdes', 'Michael Butler, Dennis Shryack', 'Clint Eastwood, Michael Moriarty, Carrie Snodgress, Chris Penn, Richard Dysart, Sydney Penny, Richard Kiel, Doug McGrath', 'R', 'A mysterious preacher protects a humble prospector village from a greedy mining company trying to encroach on their land.', 'A mysterious preacher protects a humble prospector village from a greedy mining company trying to encroach on their land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpAN5WnDEVWYzMDPkXHTbrDQuak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8879'),
  ('278310154652543683', 'Palermo – Milan One Way', 1996, 'Crime, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Claudio Fragasso, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Rossella Drudi', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Raoul Bova, Ricky Memphis, Francesco Benigno, Romina Mondello, Valerio Mastandrea, Rosalinda Celentano, Paolo Calissano', null, 'A mob accountant accepts to be witness for the prosecution at a trial involving Mafia higher-ups. Seven cops are tasked with escorting him and his family alive from Sicily to the courtroom in the North, but it won''t be easy.', 'A mob accountant accepts to be witness for the prosecution at a trial involving Mafia higher-ups. Seven cops are tasked with escorting him and his family alive from Sicily to the courtroom in the North, but it won''t be easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNO633xy2uVrrDWtZVNv7bjz58t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42422'),
  ('28891505513010419', 'Palermo Hollywood', 2004, 'Drama', 'Eduardo Pinto, Pablo Schverdfinger, Roberto Ceuninck', 'Brian Maya, Federico Finkielstain', 'Brian Maya, Matías Desiderio, Manuela Pal, Edgardo Nieva, Cristina Banegas, Azul Lombardía, Martín Adjemián, Pablo Tagliani', null, 'In a country that has been broken down and corupted by poverty, Pablo and Mario are best friends and local thieves. Although they come from very different backgrounds, they help each other out by commiting petty crimes that help Pablo support his family and Mario become independent from his own. In a twist of fate, they become involved in a kidnapping that goes sour. This tragedy triggers and unmasks a series of events that changes their lives forever. Now the two friends will be tested and their lives taken to the limit.', 'In a country that has been broken down and corupted by poverty, Pablo and Mario are best friends and local thieves. Although they come from very different backgrounds, they help each other out by commiting petty crimes that help Pablo support his family and Mario become independent from his own. In a twist of fate, they become involved in a kidnapping that goes sour. This tragedy triggers and unmasks a series of events that changes their lives forever. Now the two friends will be tested and their lives taken to the limit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lW7JvVHcdkqHD0pXVNJswhfhSVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51252'),
  ('857988173993300782', 'Palermo or Wolfsburg', 1980, 'Drama', 'Werner Schroeter, Thomas Mauch', 'Werner Schroeter, Giuseppe Fava, Orazio Torrisi', 'Nicola Zarbo, Otto Sander, Ida Di Benedetto, Magdalena Montezuma, Johannes Wacker, Antonio Orlando, Brigitte Tilg, Gisela Hahn', null, 'An impoverished young man from Sicily travels to Wolfsburg, West Germany to find work. He takes a job in the Volkswagen factory after he travels through Northern Italy by train.', 'An impoverished young man from Sicily travels to Wolfsburg, West Germany to find work. He takes a job in the Volkswagen factory after he travels through Northern Italy by train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oasIw6YqAJ9BssUcDgActphDDw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130544'),
  ('571517585387249632', 'Palermo Shooting', 2008, 'Drama', 'Wim Wenders, Karina Sparks, Karina Sparks', 'Wim Wenders, Bernd Lange, Norman Ohler', 'Campino, Inga Busch, Axel Sichrovsky, Gerhard Gutberlet, Harry Blain, Sebastian Blomberg, Jana Pallaske, Olivia Asiedu-Poku', null, 'After the wild lifestyle of a famous young German photographer almost gets him killed, he goes to Palermo, Sicily to take a break. Can the beautiful city and a beautiful local woman calm him down?', 'After the wild lifestyle of a famous young German photographer almost gets him killed, he goes to Palermo, Sicily to take a break. Can the beautiful city and a beautiful local woman calm him down?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDTuyypuDHngXat0tt49wYoBBXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8886'),
  ('854287370005183850', 'Palestine 36', 2025, 'Drama, History, War', 'Annemarie Jacir, Hélène Louvart, Sarah Blum', 'Annemarie Jacir', 'Karim Daoud Anaya, Hiam Abbass, Robert Aramayo, Yasmine Al Massri, Billy Howle, Dhafer L''Abidine, Ward Helou, Yafa Bakri', null, 'Year 1936. As villages across Palestine rise against British colonial rule, Yusuf drifts between his rural home and the restless energy of Jerusalem, longing for a future beyond the growing unrest. But history is relentless. With rising numbers of Jewish immigrants escaping antisemitism in Europe and some arriving with nefarious Zionist-colonial ambitions, and the Palestinian population uniting in the largest and longest uprising against Britain’s 30-year dominion, all sides spiral towards inevitable collision in a decisive moment for the British Empire and the future of the entire region.', 'Year 1936. As villages across Palestine rise against British colonial rule, Yusuf drifts between his rural home and the restless energy of Jerusalem, longing for a future beyond the growing unrest. But history is relentless. With rising numbers of Jewish immigrants escaping antisemitism in Europe and some arriving with nefarious Zionist-colonial ambitions, and the Palestinian population uniting in the largest and longest uprising against Britain’s 30-year dominion, all sides spiral towards inevitable collision in a decisive moment for the British Empire and the future of the entire region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajeiriNRFPLESjGZ0vdp4MVardZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1432596'),
  ('523464068448137699', 'Palindromes', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Todd Solondz, Tom Richmond, Keith Jones', 'Todd Solondz', 'Ellen Barkin, Stephen Adly Guirgis, Sharon Wilkins, Richard Masur, Emani Sledge, Jennifer Jason Leigh, John Gemberling, Debra Monk', 'NR', 'Aviva is thirteen, awkward and sensitive. Her mother Joyce is warm and loving, as is her father, Steve, a regular guy who does have a fierce temper from time to time. The film revolves around her family, friends and neighbors.', 'Aviva is thirteen, awkward and sensitive. Her mother Joyce is warm and loving, as is her father, Steve, a regular guy who does have a fierce temper from time to time. The film revolves around her family, friends and neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqcNYtm3F7GhCgAnTcQslKzMFOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13073'),
