  ('888843872013576831', 'Pallid', 1973, 'Animation', 'Heino Pars, Arvo Nuut, Ülo Saar', 'Heino Pars', null, null, 'The characters of this film are the balls. They represent the idea that relations between people are fragile and it is very difficult to correct relations once destroyed. This is expressed by movements, colours and music.', 'The characters of this film are the balls. They represent the idea that relations between people are fragile and it is very difficult to correct relations once destroyed. This is expressed by movements, colours and music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJvbt5O63W5OD2LiFkJR4jUSRzC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1415444'),
