  ('275949160409913074', 'Palm Springs', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Max Barbakow, Quyen Tran, Kim Barnard', 'Andy Siara', 'Andy Samberg, Cristin Milioti, J.K. Simmons, Peter Gallagher, Meredith Hagner, Camila Mendes, Tyler Hoechlin, Chris Pang', 'R', 'When carefree Nyles and reluctant maid of honor Sarah have a chance encounter at a Palm Springs wedding, things get complicated when they find themselves unable to escape the venue, themselves, or each other.', 'When carefree Nyles and reluctant maid of honor Sarah have a chance encounter at a Palm Springs wedding, things get complicated when they find themselves unable to escape the venue, themselves, or each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnAfqiV7yO3Jq9IntTmwkcaICqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587792'),
  ('602778928602022326', 'Palm Springs Weekend', 1963, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Norman Taurog, Chuck Hansen, Stanley Goldsmith', 'Earl Hamner, Jr.', 'Troy Donahue, Connie Stevens, Ty Hardin, Stefanie Powers, Robert Conrad, Andrew Duggan, Jack Weston, Carole Cook', null, 'Set in Palm Springs during a long, fun-filled weekend where several Los Angeles college students flock to spring break, centering on Jim who finds romance with Bunny, the daughter of Palm Springs harred, stressful police chief. Jim''s bumbling roommate, Biff, tries to get Amanda, a tomboyish girl''s attention with a so-called love gadget. Meanwhile, Gayle Lewis is a high school senior posing as a wealthy college girl who is pursued by Eric Dean, a wealthy and spoiled college prepie, while Gayle has eyes for a cowboy from Texas, named Stretch. Also Jim and Biff''s basketball coach, Campbell, tries to romance Naomi, the owner of the motel where all of the gang is staying at, which is interfered by Naomi''s young, trouble-making, brat son who''s dubbed, Boom-Boom.', 'Set in Palm Springs during a long, fun-filled weekend where several Los Angeles college students flock to spring break, centering on Jim who finds romance with Bunny, the daughter of Palm Springs harred, stressful police chief. Jim''s bumbling roommate, Biff, tries to get Amanda, a tomboyish girl''s attention with a so-called love gadget. Meanwhile, Gayle Lewis is a high school senior posing as a wealthy college girl who is pursued by Eric Dean, a wealthy and spoiled college prepie, while Gayle has eyes for a cowboy from Texas, named Stretch. Also Jim and Biff''s basketball coach, Campbell, tries to romance Naomi, the owner of the motel where all of the gang is staying at, which is interfered by Naomi''s young, trouble-making, brat son who''s dubbed, Boom-Boom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5lt8axlnmTD5lWdE2pGmbaRjD9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42985'),
