  ('738766337614657550', 'Palm Trees and Power Lines', 2023, 'Drama', 'Chananun Chotrungroj, Jamie Dack, Kali Mann', 'Audrey Findlay, Jamie Dack', 'Lily McInerny, Jonathan Tucker, Gretchen Mol, Auden Thornton, Armani Jackson, Quinn Frankel, Lily Collias, Kenny Johnston', 'R', 'A disconnected teenage girl enters a relationship with a man twice her age. She sees him as the solution to all her problems, but his intentions are not what they seem.', 'A disconnected teenage girl enters a relationship with a man twice her age. She sees him as the solution to all her problems, but his intentions are not what they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWiSF5VbFeeWZmx7rGgQCsFsLdW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872516'),
  ('1044749704438699166', 'Palm Trees in the Snow', 2015, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Fernando González Molina, Xavi Giménez, Anna Rua', 'Sergio G. Sánchez', 'Mario Casas, Adriana Ugarte, Macarena García, Alain Hernández, Berta Vázquez, Djédjé Apali, Daniel Grao, José María Kimbo', null, 'Spain, 2003. An accidental discovery leads Clarence to travel from the snowy mountains of Huesca to Equatorial Guinea, to visit the land where her father Jacobo and her uncle Kilian spent most of their youth, the island of Fernando Poo.', 'Spain, 2003. An accidental discovery leads Clarence to travel from the snowy mountains of Huesca to Equatorial Guinea, to visit the land where her father Jacobo and her uncle Kilian spent most of their youth, the island of Fernando Poo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIVqgTKbqt24bUTzMlyRX8kB1Ac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274109'),
  ('1152142243577127984', 'Palmetto', 1998, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Thomas Kloss', 'E. Max Frye', 'Woody Harrelson, Gina Gershon, Elisabeth Shue, Rolf Hoppe, Michael Rapaport, Chloë Sevigny, Tom Wright, Marc Macaulay', 'R', 'After being released from prison on a bum charge, Harry Barber is out for payback to regain his lost two years. He''s hired by Mrs. Malroux to fake the kidnapping of her stepdaughter (the daughter of a dying millionaire). He discovers that he is being set up on multiple levels and will soon face a longer sentence if he doesn''t prove the truth.', 'After being released from prison on a bum charge, Harry Barber is out for payback to regain his lost two years. He''s hired by Mrs. Malroux to fake the kidnapping of her stepdaughter (the daughter of a dying millionaire). He discovers that he is being set up on multiple levels and will soon face a longer sentence if he doesn''t prove the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3R8At5ll1ZyCJT7FWbLmCjVqFlp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30949'),
