  ('799438579412182804', 'Palombella rossa', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nanni Moretti, Giuseppe Lanci, Andrea Molaioli', 'Nanni Moretti', 'Nanni Moretti, Silvio Orlando, Asia Argento, Mariella Valentini, Alfonso Santagata, Claudio Morganti, Eugenio Masciari, Mario Patanè', 'NR', 'Michele is a Communist MP who loses his memory in a car crash—although nobody seems to notice. Over the course of a water polo match ahead of election day, he begins to remember his past life, revealing the picture of a man whose personal and political identity crisis mirrors the one of Italian communism.', 'Michele is a Communist MP who loses his memory in a car crash—although nobody seems to notice. Over the course of a water polo match ahead of election day, he begins to remember his past life, revealing the picture of a man whose personal and political identity crisis mirrors the one of Italian communism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kk8Xv0j7m3CGrSRPoIEitxtEP3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56521'),
  ('260038343543261882', 'Palookaville', 1995, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alan Taylor, John Thomas', 'David Epstein', 'William Forsythe, Vincent Gallo, Adam Trese, Gareth Williams, LisaGay Hamilton, Bridgit Ryan, Kim Dickens, Suzanne Shepherd', 'R', 'Jerry and his two pals, Russ and Syd, are just looking for some easy money to help them break out of their nowhere lives in their nowhere town. Despite a bungled jewelry store heist which exposes their incompetence as criminals, a fateful event (and an old black-and-white film) convinces them that they can pull off an armored-truck robbery. While they are busy plotting their caper, their dysfunctional families spin out of control, all around them.', 'Jerry and his two pals, Russ and Syd, are just looking for some easy money to help them break out of their nowhere lives in their nowhere town. Despite a bungled jewelry store heist which exposes their incompetence as criminals, a fateful event (and an old black-and-white film) convinces them that they can pull off an armored-truck robbery. While they are busy plotting their caper, their dysfunctional families spin out of control, all around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmlO5CbUKmqvn5BVtEprxAmNOkp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37616'),
  ('545293246832547388', 'Pals', 1982, 'Drama', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Antonio Cuevas, Hans Burmann', 'Gonzalo Goicoechea, Eloy de la Iglesia', 'Antonio Flores, Rosario Flores, José Luis Manzano, José Manuel Cervino, Queta Ariel, José Luis Fernández ''Pirri'', Enrique San Francisco, Ricardo Márquez', null, 'José is an unemployed 18-year-old living in a cramped apartment in the slums of Madrid. Marginalized by poverty, José spends his time with his friend Antonio. However, when Antonio gets his girlfriend, Rosario, pregnant, the two friends try anything to get the money to pay for her to have an abortion.', 'José is an unemployed 18-year-old living in a cramped apartment in the slums of Madrid. Marginalized by poverty, José spends his time with his friend Antonio. However, when Antonio gets his girlfriend, Rosario, pregnant, the two friends try anything to get the money to pay for her to have an abortion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGaiAlrdNXfd67jPDDH77yx10yl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115903'),
