  ('220628645168828630', 'Paltan', 2018, 'War, Drama, Action', 'J. P. Dutta, Nagender Choudhary, Surendra Verma', null, 'Arjun Rampal, Jackie Shroff, Sonu Sood, Sonal Chauhan, Esha Gupta, Gurmeet Choudhary, Harshvardhan Rane, Siddhanth Kapoor', null, 'A war drama based on the Indo-China War of 1962, JP Dutta''s "PALTAN" focuses on the hard-hitting truth of India''s relations with China, and how it is important to acknowledge that China, an enormous power in world politics, poses to be a huge threat to India.', 'A war drama based on the Indo-China War of 1962, JP Dutta''s "PALTAN" focuses on the hard-hitting truth of India''s relations with China, and how it is important to acknowledge that China, an enormous power in world politics, poses to be a huge threat to India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQ9G7JjxM2NWyOrWfhgsTA6mBM7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540612'),
  ('1060650366343014806', 'Paluwagan', 2024, 'Drama', 'Roman Perez Jr.', null, 'Micaella Raz, Shiena Yu, VR Relosa, Richard Solano, Ricardo Galing, Adelaide Sojo, AC Barcelona, Racquel Enriquez', null, 'In a province where most housewives are deprived of intimacy by their busy husbands, a new savings cooperative is introduced by a merchant. The salary to claim: cash or a night with a mysterious man. The women surely know what to choose.', 'In a province where most housewives are deprived of intimacy by their busy husbands, a new savings cooperative is introduced by a merchant. The salary to claim: cash or a night with a mysterious man. The women surely know what to choose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRitRV90rkSlGQICZO7xUMjnVx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1325230'),
  ('1138472865445672943', 'Pamasahe', 2022, 'Drama', 'Roman Perez Jr.', 'Roman Perez Jr.', 'Mark Anthony Fernandez, Felix Roco, Azi Acosta, Julio Díaz, Shirley Fuentes, Shiena Yu, Alvaro Oteyza, Rash Flores', null, 'A penniless mother, with her infant child, takes on a journey by land and sea to find her husband in Manila. But this trip won''t be free for she has to use her body to get to her destination.', 'A penniless mother, with her infant child, takes on a journey by land and sea to find her husband in Manila. But this trip won''t be free for she has to use her body to get to her destination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bm8wS2LnKKOuDyp3WSe5pgoLkp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1041898'),
  ('30663994196635347', 'Pamela, A Love Story', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Ryan White, Dominique Hessert, David Paul Jacobson', null, 'Pamela Anderson, Brandon Thomas Lee, Dylan Jagger Lee, Carol Anderson, Barry Anderson, Dan Hayhurst', null, 'In her own words, through personal video and diaries, Pamela Anderson shares the story of her rise to fame, rocky romances and infamous sex tape scandal.', 'In her own words, through personal video and diaries, Pamela Anderson shares the story of her rise to fame, rocky romances and infamous sex tape scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkVnRwZWbrd55P3Tx7BZZQ1gU89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1061671'),
  ('893160155686316231', 'Pamela: secretos de una pasión', 2008, 'Drama', 'Rodolfo Galindo, Carlos Aguilar', 'Rodolfo Galindo', 'Federica Quijano, Fabián Corres, Gabriela Zamora, Eduardo Arroyuelo, Carlos Cardán, Mirrha Saavedra, Valeria Vera, Luis Ernesto Franco', null, 'This is the story of the problems of a young 21-year-old woman who, in the context of modern Mexico, tries to escape reality with the false relief granted by drugs and casual sex. Pamela gets involved with an older man called Victor, in an unboundedly passionate relationship that leads them to invent a double life for themselves in order to cross over the boundaries and explore their deepest fantasies. They set off in the company of Miguel, a young and sensual Spaniard, on a trip to Pie de la Cuesta.', 'This is the story of the problems of a young 21-year-old woman who, in the context of modern Mexico, tries to escape reality with the false relief granted by drugs and casual sex. Pamela gets involved with an older man called Victor, in an unboundedly passionate relationship that leads them to invent a double life for themselves in order to cross over the boundaries and explore their deepest fantasies. They set off in the company of Miguel, a young and sensual Spaniard, on a trip to Pie de la Cuesta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBlvb3Yxrjk48Cu9cIAswGGPNOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347290'),
  ('876399313162962351', 'Pamfir', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Dmytro Sukholytkyi-Sobchuk, Olha Liubarova, Mykyta Kuzmenko', 'Dmytro Sukholytkyi-Sobchuk', 'Oleksandr Yatsentiuk, Solomiia Kyrylova, Stanislav Potiak, Olena Khokhlatkina, Myroslav Makoviichuk, Ivan Sharan, Oleksandr Yarema, Andrii Kyrylchuk', null, 'When reformed ex-smuggler Pamfir returns home to his village on the Ukrainian border after working abroad for several years, he’s determined to earn an honest living and set a good example for his beloved teenage son Nazar. But in a town where corruption runs deep and crime and religion are inextricably linked, his plan is quickly thwarted when Nazar sets fire to the local church in a misguided effort to keep him at home. To pay for the damage, Pamfir must take on one last job for a crime syndicate operating a risky smuggling venture in a place where all the rules have changed.', 'When reformed ex-smuggler Pamfir returns home to his village on the Ukrainian border after working abroad for several years, he’s determined to earn an honest living and set a good example for his beloved teenage son Nazar. But in a town where corruption runs deep and crime and religion are inextricably linked, his plan is quickly thwarted when Nazar sets fire to the local church in a misguided effort to keep him at home. To pay for the damage, Pamfir must take on one last job for a crime syndicate operating a risky smuggling venture in a place where all the rules have changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CeXigpnq1qfAJPap6xOynr5Wgu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850297'),
  ('915706480537297586', 'Pan', 2015, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family, Action', 'Joe Wright, John Mathieson, Seamus McGarvey', 'Jason Fuchs', 'Levi Miller, Garrett Hedlund, Hugh Jackman, Rooney Mara, Adeel Akhtar, Nonso Anozie, Amanda Seyfried, Kathy Burke', 'PG', 'Living a bleak existence at a London orphanage, 12-year-old Peter finds himself whisked away to the fantastical world of Neverland. Adventure awaits as he meets new friend James Hook and the warrior Tiger Lily. They must band together to save Neverland from the ruthless pirate Blackbeard. Along the way, the rebellious and mischievous boy discovers his true destiny, becoming the hero forever known as Peter Pan.', 'Living a bleak existence at a London orphanage, 12-year-old Peter finds himself whisked away to the fantastical world of Neverland. Adventure awaits as he meets new friend James Hook and the warrior Tiger Lily. They must band together to save Neverland from the ruthless pirate Blackbeard. Along the way, the rebellious and mischievous boy discovers his true destiny, becoming the hero forever known as Peter Pan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8i0mZR7MEL7c3bXSsuYg7VJsew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266647'),
