  ('948295138234561468', 'Pan Tau – der Film', 1988, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jindřich Polák, Aleš Dospiva, Emil Sirotek', 'Ota Hofman', 'Otto Šimánek, Dana Vávrová, Ute Christensen, Viktor Preiss, Vladimír Kratina, Jakub Drocar, Michal Soukup, Karel Soukup', null, 'Pan Tau, the friend of all children, now also helps the adults. A movie producer is in trouble and decides to shoot another Pan-Tau movie. But the old Pan-Tau actor Karasek is no longer young enough to walk the almost weightless walk of Pan Tau. Mr. Novak turns up - he resembles Pan Tau like a twin brother. He succeeds every pirouette. And as if by magic, he solves all the problems between people! Who is Mr. Novak? Is he really ...?', 'Pan Tau, the friend of all children, now also helps the adults. A movie producer is in trouble and decides to shoot another Pan-Tau movie. But the old Pan-Tau actor Karasek is no longer young enough to walk the almost weightless walk of Pan Tau. Mr. Novak turns up - he resembles Pan Tau like a twin brother. He succeeds every pirouette. And as if by magic, he solves all the problems between people! Who is Mr. Novak? Is he really ...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8C7hjynEnpG089bO5anAxcLcOnS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276827'),
  ('599654528893779993', 'Pan''s Labyrinth', 2006, 'Fantasy, Drama, War', 'Guillermo Navarro, Guillermo del Toro, Jorge Calvo', 'Guillermo del Toro', 'Ivana Baquero, Sergi López, Maribel Verdú, Doug Jones, Ariadna Gil, Álex Angulo, Roger Casamajor, Manolo Solo', 'R', 'In post–civil war Spain, 10-year-old Ofelia moves with her pregnant mother to live under the control of her cruel stepfather. Drawn into a mysterious labyrinth, she meets a faun who reveals that she may be a lost princess from an underground kingdom. To return to her true father, she must complete a series of surreal and perilous tasks that blur the line between reality and fantasy.', 'In post–civil war Spain, 10-year-old Ofelia moves with her pregnant mother to live under the control of her cruel stepfather. Drawn into a mysterious labyrinth, she meets a faun who reveals that she may be a lost princess from an underground kingdom. To return to her true father, she must complete a series of surreal and perilous tasks that blur the line between reality and fantasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7xXihu5wHuSMWymq5VAulPVuvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1417'),
  ('453362599079833272', 'Panama', 2022, 'Thriller, Action', 'Pedro Juan López, Edmundo H. Rodríguez, Mark Neveldine', 'Daniel Adams, William Barber', 'Cole Hauser, Mel Gibson, Kiara Liz, Mauricio Hénao, Kate Katzman, Charlie Weber, Jackie Cruz, Victor Turpin', 'R', 'An ex-marine is hired by a defense contractor to travel to Panama to complete an arms deal. In the process he becomes involved with the U.S. invasion of Panama, and learns an important lesson about the true nature of political power.', 'An ex-marine is hired by a defense contractor to travel to Panama to complete an arms deal. In the process he becomes involved with the U.S. invasion of Panama, and learns an important lesson about the true nature of political power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9DzgsmssidygWuORgYzhi317vj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628878'),
  ('919764066482482649', 'Panamerican Machinery', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Joaquín del Paso', 'Joaquín del Paso, Lucy Pawlak', 'Ramiro Orozco, Delfino López, Javier Zaragoza, Cecilia García, Franco Legorreta, Tania Canciolla, Maricarmen Piña, Hilario Vega', null, 'It''s Friday morning at Panamerican Machinery Inc., a company specialising in selling and repairing machines for construction and destruction. The employees are already winding down for the weekend, engaging in little rituals and routines when an unexpected turn of events shakes their peaceful monotony. Don Alejandro, the boss, lies dead at the back of the warehouse.', 'It''s Friday morning at Panamerican Machinery Inc., a company specialising in selling and repairing machines for construction and destruction. The employees are already winding down for the weekend, engaging in little rituals and routines when an unexpected turn of events shakes their peaceful monotony. Don Alejandro, the boss, lies dead at the back of the warehouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbHdub97DIjwAZ5PA2WFzQeFZu4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345906'),
  ('414023824226206525', 'Panarea', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Pipolo, Angelo Vicari, Sebastiano Celeste', 'Simone Cesareo, Pipolo, Lorenzo Castellano', 'Alessia Merz, Guido Nicheli, Adelmo Togliani, Andrea Livio, Mariangela Giordano, Alessandro Mascali, Massimo Bulla, Alessandro Cozzani', null, 'During a summer weekend in the island of Panarea, a series of stories of love between the vacationers are intertwined.', 'During a summer weekend in the island of Panarea, a series of stories of love between the vacationers are intertwined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y33hpQoQDCGVgG5AqOVzup51xy5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167626'),
  ('432680270499797232', 'Panash', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Music', 'David Nazareno, Christoph Behl', 'Christoph Behl, Mariano Samengo', 'Real Valessa, Lautaro Rodríguez, Homer El Mero Mero, Esteban, Dani Riba, Black Panther, Maximiliano Ocampo, G Sony', null, 'Panash is a fictional film set in a dystopian near future. Buenos Aires is in flames, convulsed by a state of siege that seems to have no end. But in the margins of the city, there is room for a love story.', 'Panash is a fictional film set in a dystopian near future. Buenos Aires is in flames, convulsed by a state of siege that seems to have no end. But in the margins of the city, there is room for a love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Czx3ILeegA2xoB7G751x9q7VDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:898036'),
  ('510099492955288818', 'Panayotis Pascot: Almost', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Panayotis Pascot, Adib Alkhalidey', 'Panayotis Pascot', 'Panayotis Pascot', 'R', 'Those who still see him as an innocent teen TV correspondent are in for a surprise: French comic Panayotis Pascot is all grown up and ready to get real.', 'Those who still see him as an innocent teen TV correspondent are in for a surprise: French comic Panayotis Pascot is all grown up and ready to get real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWLp40JN7GeV9zdvMxxq0n3C7Gg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1043816'),
  ('940378025011339956', 'Panchatanthiram', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'K. S. Ravikumar, Arthur Wilson', 'K. S. Ravikumar', 'Kamal Haasan, Jayaram, Ramesh Aravind, Sriman, Yugi Sethu, Simran, Ramya Krishnan, Urvashi', null, 'Ram''s friends hire Maggie, a call girl, to help him get over his wife, who mistakenly believes him to be a philanderer. However, they get in trouble when Maggie ends up dead.', 'Ram''s friends hire Maggie, a call girl, to help him get over his wife, who mistakenly believes him to be a philanderer. However, they get in trouble when Maggie ends up dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofTPB176uIsjGTdsZbQrVE86yxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49033'),
  ('735774479970415712', 'Panchhi 2', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Maneesh Bhatt', 'Prince Kanwaljit Singh', 'Prince Kanwaljit Singh, Naiqra Dhillon, Aarushi Sharma', null, 'After losing love, Panchi finds love through a voice on the same phone number, until truth, crime, and blood ties pull him into a dark spiral of fate.', 'After losing love, Panchi finds love through a voice on the same phone number, until truth, crime, and blood ties pull him into a dark spiral of fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SGyMdOlJqhaHjcHnQRlO6Sx45G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1658635'),
  ('608278675330300046', 'Pancho Villa', 1972, 'Western', 'Alejandro Ulloa, Eugenio Martín, Gil Carretero', 'Julian Zimet, Eugenio Martín', 'Telly Savalas, Clint Walker, José María Prada, Ángel del Pozo, Anne Francis, Luis Dávila, Alberto Dalbés, Antonio Casas', 'PG', 'In 1916, during the Mexican Revolution, General Pancho Villa manages to escape from the clutches of General Goyo, his greatest enemy, only to face an even greater problem when he meets McDermott, a mysterious adventurer who promises to get him weapons and ammunition for his troops.', 'In 1916, during the Mexican Revolution, General Pancho Villa manages to escape from the clutches of General Goyo, his greatest enemy, only to face an even greater problem when he meets McDermott, a mysterious adventurer who promises to get him weapons and ammunition for his troops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eznvxzOo1yZ23mvumjZbUH1VcWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74064'),
  ('904314251756773959', 'Panda Bear in Africa', 2024, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Stine Marie Buhl, Karsten Kiilerich, Richard Claus', 'Rob Sprackling', 'Yootha Wong-Loi-Sing, Maurits Delchot, Georgina Verbaan, Namisa Mdalose, Silas Lekgoathi, Candice Modiselle, Sthandile Nkosi, Thulani Nzonzo', null, 'A young adventurous panda travels from China to Africa to rescue his best friend, Jielong the Dragon, who has been kidnapped. On his journey, he discovers a strange amazing new world of mountains, deserts and jungles.', 'A young adventurous panda travels from China to Africa to rescue his best friend, Jielong the Dragon, who has been kidnapped. On his journey, he discovers a strange amazing new world of mountains, deserts and jungles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxpu7svVqA0ALYpofQBPujGelN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676685'),
  ('460952463127135745', 'Panda Plan', 2024, 'Action, Comedy', 'Zhang Luan, Daxin Dong', 'Wei Xu, Meng Yida, Zhang Luan', 'Jackie Chan, Shi Ce, Wei Xiang, Han Yanbo, Danny Ray, Xu Juncong, Andy Friend, Huang Yuntong', 'PG-13', 'International action star Jackie Chan is invited to the adoption ceremony of a rare baby panda, but after an international crime syndicate attempts to kidnap the bear, Jackie has to save the bear using his stunt work skills.', 'International action star Jackie Chan is invited to the adoption ceremony of a rare baby panda, but after an international crime syndicate attempts to kidnap the bear, Jackie has to save the bear using his stunt work skills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iMPQl13q89jQhaA5nXb6UiT0t0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1160956'),
  ('415503394137705979', 'Panda Plan: The Magical Tribe', 2026, 'Action, Comedy, Family', 'Derek Hui Wang-Yu, Daxin Dong, Derek Hui Wang Yu', 'Pan Keyang', 'Jackie Chan, Wang Yinglu, Ma Li, Qiao Shan, Yu Yang', 'Not Rated', 'Giant Panda Hu Hu and Jackie Chan accidentally stumble into a mysterious primitive tribe, beginning an unprecedented and hilarious adventure.', 'Giant Panda Hu Hu and Jackie Chan accidentally stumble into a mysterious primitive tribe, beginning an unprecedented and hilarious adventure.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FasrLPsZMg75SxN1BooggGmpBwRO.jpg', 'plex:movie:panda-plan-2-the-magical-tribe'),
  ('179709231625025918', 'Panda vs. Aliens', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Sean Patrick O''Reilly', 'Sean Patrick O''Reilly', 'Dan Payne, Sean Patrick O''Reilly, Sara L. Beck, Andrew Gray, David Milchard, Kiefer O''Reilly, Scott McNeil, Chevy Chase', null, 'A group of aliens seek out to conquer new worlds and take particular notice of Earth, after seeing satellite broadcasts of TV shows of a powerful panda, Pandy.', 'A group of aliens seek out to conquer new worlds and take particular notice of Earth, after seeing satellite broadcasts of TV shows of a powerful panda, Pandy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozJA81S5r2ynrHwlzSBh4aMgeZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756806'),
  ('346030142921280468', 'Panda! Go Panda!', 1972, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Isao Takahata, Yasuo Otsuka, Yōichi Kotabe', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Kazuko Sugiyama, Kazuo Kumakura, Yoshiko Ohta, Yasuo Yamada, Reiko Seno, Eken Mine', null, 'Cheerful Mimiko’s small family grows when she adopts a talking baby panda and his full-grown papa. Despite Mimiko''s best efforts, the appearance of Panny and Papa Bear disrupts the quiet pace of life in town, prompting zookeepers to reclaim the escaped bear pair.', 'Cheerful Mimiko’s small family grows when she adopts a talking baby panda and his full-grown papa. Despite Mimiko''s best efforts, the appearance of Panny and Papa Bear disrupts the quiet pace of life in town, prompting zookeepers to reclaim the escaped bear pair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdN1fZhb1mcfJScu9MXXQSuY4Iz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21036'),
  ('1098990764077552369', 'Panda! Go Panda!: Rainy Day Circus', 1973, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Isao Takahata, Yasuo Otsuka, Yōichi Kotabe', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Kazuko Sugiyama, Kazuo Kumakura, Yuko Maruyama, Yoshiko Ohta', null, 'Mimiko, Papa Panda, and Panny make friends with a baby tiger from the circus — just in time for a flash flood to throw the whole town into chaos.', 'Mimiko, Papa Panda, and Panny make friends with a baby tiger from the circus — just in time for a flash flood to throw the whole town into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEuBBOnfhSMXhe8mClJ64j6h9cL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123867'),
  ('178464722716880098', 'Pandas', 2018, 'Documentary', 'David Douglas, David Douglas, Drew Fellman', null, 'Kristen Bell, Wen Lei Bi, Rong Hou, Ben Kilham, Jacob Owens, Li Bingbing', 'G', 'In the mountains of Sichuan, China, a researcher forms a bond with Qian Qian, a panda who is about to experience nature for the first time.', 'In the mountains of Sichuan, China, a researcher forms a bond with Qian Qian, a panda who is about to experience nature for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htfqp08gdzv9TTYNTFW0iBk7RB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497802'),
  ('406000011329755977', 'Pandemic', 2009, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Takahisa Zeze, Kōichi Saitō', 'Takahisa Zeze', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Rei Dan, Ryoko Kuninaka, Yoji Tanaka, Chizuru Ikewaki, Cunning Takeyama, Ken Mitsuishi, Midoriko Kimura', null, 'ER doctor Tsuyoshi Matsuoka receives a patient with a virus unlike anything he''s seen before. His symptoms include high fever, convulsions, vomiting of blood and multiple organ failure. Could this be a new form of influenza or is it some other variety of virus? As the situation worsens and more cases begin arriving, a medical officer from the World Health Organization named Eiko Kobayashi is dispatched to the area. At the rate the virus is spreading, the entire city’s transportation system and infrastructure would be brought to a halt within 3 months. Within 6 months it could spread to tens of millions of people--reaching a death toll far worse than any war.', 'ER doctor Tsuyoshi Matsuoka receives a patient with a virus unlike anything he''s seen before. His symptoms include high fever, convulsions, vomiting of blood and multiple organ failure. Could this be a new form of influenza or is it some other variety of virus? As the situation worsens and more cases begin arriving, a medical officer from the World Health Organization named Eiko Kobayashi is dispatched to the area. At the rate the virus is spreading, the entire city’s transportation system and infrastructure would be brought to a halt within 3 months. Within 6 months it could spread to tens of millions of people--reaching a death toll far worse than any war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6Qd6yrLe8PL7XyROrilLpsaBxH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41813'),
  ('1076778777605904789', 'Pandemic', 2016, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'John Suits, Mark Putnam', 'Dustin T Benson', 'Rachel Nichols, Alfie Allen, Missi Pyle, Mekhi Phifer, Paul Guilfoyle, Danielle Rose Russell, Pat Healy, Robert Lewis Stephenson', 'PG-13', 'After a virus of epic proportions overwhelms the planet—with more infected than uninfected—humanity is losing its grip on survival and its only hope is finding a cure and keeping the infected contained. Lauren, a doctor, arrives in Los Angeles with her crack team to lead the hunt for uncontaminated civilian survivors, but nothing can prepare them for the blood-soaked mayhem they witness as they head into the Californian streets where everything is considered a trap.', 'After a virus of epic proportions overwhelms the planet—with more infected than uninfected—humanity is losing its grip on survival and its only hope is finding a cure and keeping the infected contained. Lauren, a doctor, arrives in Los Angeles with her crack team to lead the hunt for uncontaminated civilian survivors, but nothing can prepare them for the blood-soaked mayhem they witness as they head into the Californian streets where everything is considered a trap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0OCqNmVudMtbGlv4iTcyYrbp9m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346651'),
  ('695998494751602829', 'Pandemonium', 1982, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery', 'Alfred Sole, Michel Hugo, Jack Clements', 'Richard Whitley, Jaime Barton Klein', 'Carol Kane, Tom Smothers, Candice Azzara, Debralee Scott, Judge Reinhold, Marc McClure, Miles Chapin, Teri Landrum', 'PG', 'A former high school student who always wanted to be a cheerleader decides to reopen the cheerleading program at her former high school after years of closure for being targeted by a serial killer.', 'A former high school student who always wanted to be a cheerleader decides to reopen the cheerleading program at her former high school after years of closure for being targeted by a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3e2POUduuwxQMejbmusZUtfkgeJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84784'),
  ('948855821153192460', 'Pandemonium', 2024, 'Horror, Drama', 'Quarxx, Hugo Poisson, Colin Wandersman', 'Quarxx', 'Arben Bajraktaraj, Ophélia Kolb, Manon Maindivide, Hugo Dillon, Sidwell Weber, Jérôme Paquatte, Carl Laforêt', null, 'Nathan and Daniel are caught in a road accident that kills them both. As they come to grips with their deaths, Nathan confronts his past and the consequences of his actions. Now trapped in the hellish void of Pandemonium, he encounters tortured souls like Jeanne, a disturbed child; Julia, a grief-stricken mother; and Norghul, the guide of the great void. Will he find a way to escape the torment that awaits him for eternity?', 'Nathan and Daniel are caught in a road accident that kills them both. As they come to grips with their deaths, Nathan confronts his past and the consequences of his actions. Now trapped in the hellish void of Pandemonium, he encounters tortured souls like Jeanne, a disturbed child; Julia, a grief-stricken mother; and Norghul, the guide of the great void. Will he find a way to escape the torment that awaits him for eternity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TQ4WcuSgwdSdM7DtBKQdjBDGOZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1080512'),
  ('75697176798774345', 'Pandora', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Kim Ho-sung, Kim Min-sung, Park Jung-woo', 'Park Jung-woo', 'Kim Nam-gil, Kim Joo-hyun, Kim Myung-min, Lee Kyung-young, Kim Young-ae, Jung Jin-young, Moon Jeong-hee, Bae Gang-Yoo', 'R', 'When an earthquake hits a Korean village housing a run-down nuclear power plant, a man risks his life to save the country from imminent disaster.', 'When an earthquake hits a Korean village housing a run-down nuclear power plant, a man risks his life to save the country from imminent disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elTrkTm5GjynK3H26cpOZsWDYjy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429450'),
  ('569200870586474309', 'Pandora and the Flying Dutchman', 1951, 'Romance, Drama, Fantasy', 'Albert Lewin, Jack Cardiff, T. Hopewell Ash', 'Albert Lewin', 'James Mason, Ava Gardner, Nigel Patrick, Sheila Sim, Harold Warrender, Mario Cabré, Marius Goring, John Laurie', 'NR', 'Pandora Reynolds is a woman who has never fallen in love – but one who men kill and die for. When she meets dashing and mysterious ship''s captain Hendrik van der Zee, he pushes her to commit the ultimate act of love.', 'Pandora Reynolds is a woman who has never fallen in love – but one who men kill and die for. When she meets dashing and mysterious ship''s captain Hendrik van der Zee, he pushes her to commit the ultimate act of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6G6rRwPQzxxq8Yk75UWNtUTjjYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38688'),
