  ('707479407107495638', 'Panic', 1982, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Giovanni Bergamini, Tonino Ricci', 'Jaime Comas Gil, Víctor Andrés Catena', 'David Warbeck, Janet Ågren, Roberto Ricci, José Lifante, Miguel Herrera, Eugenio Benito, Ovidio Taito, José María Labernié', null, 'A scientist''s experiment with a deadly bacteria goes awry and leaves him horribly deformed. The monstrous man then runs amok in his town.', 'A scientist''s experiment with a deadly bacteria goes awry and leaves him horribly deformed. The monstrous man then runs amok in his town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVldkjMyKtFvP1kCM92Bhbwfa3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113674'),
  ('1138678707334773583', 'Panic', 2000, 'Crime, Drama', 'Henry Bromell, Jeffrey Jur, John M. Nelson', 'Henry Bromell', 'William H. Macy, Neve Campbell, Tracey Ullman, John Ritter, Barbara Bain, Miguel Sandoval, Donald Sutherland, Tina Lifford', 'R', 'Alex is going through a midlife crisis and it has become a very difficult time for him. His marriage is struggling, he''s worried about his son, and his job of killing people for his family has become the most stressful part of his life. He seeks the help of a therapist and meets a woman in the waiting room that he connects with.', 'Alex is going through a midlife crisis and it has become a very difficult time for him. His marriage is struggling, he''s worried about his son, and his job of killing people for his family has become the most stressful part of his life. He seeks the help of a therapist and meets a woman in the waiting room that he connects with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCaWBW6qQ0otWliRi0Gs4bAzgDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20637'),
