  ('1123537507325918413', 'Panic in the Streets', 1950, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Elia Kazan, Joseph MacDonald, F.E. ''Johnny'' Johnston', 'John Lee Mahin, Philip Yordan', 'Richard Widmark, Paul Douglas, Barbara Bel Geddes, Jack Palance, Zero Mostel, Dan Riss, Tommy Cook, Wilson Bourg Jr.', 'NR', 'A medical examiner discovers that an innocent shooting victim in a robbery died of bubonic plague. With only 48 hours to find the killer, who is now a ticking time bomb threatening the entire city, a grisly manhunt through the seamy underworld of the New Orleans Waterfront is underway.', 'A medical examiner discovers that an innocent shooting victim in a robbery died of bubonic plague. With only 48 hours to find the killer, who is now a ticking time bomb threatening the entire city, a grisly manhunt through the seamy underworld of the New Orleans Waterfront is underway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79jfETdOonIFL8UEjBxptPS27yo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32078'),
  ('947561330548023235', 'Panic in Year Zero!', 1962, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Ray Milland, James Engle, Gilbert Warrenton', 'Jay Simms, John Morton', 'Ray Milland, Jean Hagen, Frankie Avalon, Mary Mitchel, Joan Freeman, Richard Bakalyan, Rex Holman, Richard Garland', 'NR', 'While on a fishing trip, Harry Baldwin and his family hear an explosion and realize that Los Angeles has been leveled by a nuclear attack. Looters and killers are everywhere. Escaping to the hills with his family, he sets about the business of surviving in a world where, he knows, the old ideals of humanity will be the first casualties.', 'While on a fishing trip, Harry Baldwin and his family hear an explosion and realize that Los Angeles has been leveled by a nuclear attack. Looters and killers are everywhere. Escaping to the hills with his family, he sets about the business of surviving in a world where, he knows, the old ideals of humanity will be the first casualties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqeVkPaRwn0Rt5MF0VvGsBsMJtF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27568'),
  ('179176673464568388', 'Panic Room', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'David Fincher, Darius Khondji, Conrad W. Hall', 'David Koepp', 'Jodie Foster, Kristen Stewart, Forest Whitaker, Dwight Yoakam, Jared Leto, Patrick Bauchau, Ann Magnuson, Ian Buchanan', 'R', 'Trapped in their New York brownstone''s panic room, a hidden chamber built as a sanctuary in the event of break-ins, newly divorced Meg Altman and her young daughter Sarah play a deadly game of cat-and-mouse with three intruders - Burnham, Raoul and Junior - during a brutal home invasion. But the room itself is the focal point because what the intruders really want is inside it.', 'Trapped in their New York brownstone''s panic room, a hidden chamber built as a sanctuary in the event of break-ins, newly divorced Meg Altman and her young daughter Sarah play a deadly game of cat-and-mouse with three intruders - Burnham, Raoul and Junior - during a brutal home invasion. But the room itself is the focal point because what the intruders really want is inside it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hANYbvfwxmkC9E4yY6YyJxYxlSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4547'),
  ('896587636701028874', 'Panipat', 2019, 'Action, History, War, Romance', 'Ashutosh Gowariker, C.K. Muraleedharan, Rohit Saini', 'Chandrashekhar Dhavalikar, Ashutosh Gowariker, Ranjeet Bahadur', 'Arjun Kapoor, Kriti Sanon, Sanjay Dutt, Mohnish Behl, Mohan Joshi, Krutika Deo, Nawab Shah, Kunal Kapoor', null, 'During 18th century India, the Marathas emerged as the most powerful empire in the nation until the Afghan King Ahmad Shah Abdali plans to take over India. Sadashiv Rao Bhau is brought in to save the empire from the king which then leads to the third battle of Panipat.', 'During 18th century India, the Marathas emerged as the most powerful empire in the nation until the Afghan King Ahmad Shah Abdali plans to take over India. Sadashiv Rao Bhau is brought in to save the empire from the king which then leads to the third battle of Panipat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z59Vr7l2ZFQPh76ooSQdXjW3YRo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577332'),
  ('407348921575032945', 'Panny i wdowy', 1991, 'Drama', 'Witold Adamek, Janusz Zaorski', 'Maria Nurowska', 'Maja Komorowska, Katarzyna Figura, Ewa Dałkowska, Maria Gładkowska, Joanna Szczepkowska, Andrzej Zaorski, Jan Nowicki, Władysław Kowalski', null, 'Maidens and Widows is an epic tale of a hundred years of Polish history from the perspective of women, the titular maidens and widows. Set against the backdrop of turbulent historical events.', 'Maidens and Widows is an epic tale of a hundred years of Polish history from the perspective of women, the titular maidens and widows. Set against the backdrop of turbulent historical events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yehDtOyXnEsOmjAwBGFyUeKZbUu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568582'),
  ('104077008449631996', 'Panor', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Putipong Saisikaew, Saran Srisingchai, Nattaphon Liamwinit', 'Peerasak Saksiri, Nattapot Potchumnean, Nattamol Peanthanom', 'Cherprang Areekul, Jackrin Kungwankiatichai, Chalita Suansane, Rattanawadee Wongtong, Nuttawatt Thanathaveeprasert, Nantawan Pongprasertsin, Pijika Jittaputta, Krichayos Lerdprapai', null, 'Born during an ancient village ritual, Panor faces isolation as mysterious misfortunes plague those around her. She must uncover the truth behind the dark curse that has haunted her since birth.', 'Born during an ancient village ritual, Panor faces isolation as mysterious misfortunes plague those around her. She must uncover the truth behind the dark curse that has haunted her since birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3tG02uudhv1YemqPUoC75q3lbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1278162'),
  ('84457658454765395', 'Panor 2', 2026, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Putipong Saisikaew', 'Peerasak Saksiri, Nattapot Potchumnean, Nattamol Peanthanom', 'Cherprang Areekul, Jackrin Kungwankiatichai, Pimmada Chaisaksoen, Chinawut Indracusin, Suriwatsa Vivatvanit', null, 'After Panor renounces the power of the Three-Eyed God, her life is reset — her memory wiped clean. She begins a new chapter, living her dream of studying at a teacher''s college, with Piak quietly watching over and helping her from afar.', 'After Panor renounces the power of the Three-Eyed God, her life is reset — her memory wiped clean. She begins a new chapter, living her dream of studying at a teacher''s college, with Piak quietly watching over and helping her from afar.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4mTkjl2LoEp1xGZb5Gc9EXHfrut.jpg', 'plex:movie:panor-2'),
