  ('915415060990006264', 'Panorama of the Grand Canal Taken from a Boat', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre Promio', null, null, null, 'Filmed in 1896 by Alexandre Promio for the Lumière company, this short actuality presents one of the earliest traveling shots in cinema. With the camera mounted on a gondola, the film glides along Venice’s Grand Canal, capturing passing gondolas, bustling waterfront activity, and the city’s iconic architecture from a moving perspective. This simple yet groundbreaking technique introduced audiences to a new way of experiencing motion on screen.', 'Filmed in 1896 by Alexandre Promio for the Lumière company, this short actuality presents one of the earliest traveling shots in cinema. With the camera mounted on a gondola, the film glides along Venice’s Grand Canal, capturing passing gondolas, bustling waterfront activity, and the city’s iconic architecture from a moving perspective. This simple yet groundbreaking technique introduced audiences to a new way of experiencing motion on screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMVkY1PfSFp98aC30Dx20MYmBub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190553'),
  ('1069922761635857153', 'Pansamantala', 2026, 'Drama', 'King Abalos', null, 'Karen Lopez, Marlon Marcia, Paula Santos, Rhian Rivera, Athena Red', null, 'A story of a drunken dare that pulls best friends into a sexy secret, sparking desire, guilt, and jealousy while testing how far friendship can go.', 'A story of a drunken dare that pulls best friends into a sexy secret, sparking desire, guilt, and jealousy while testing how far friendship can go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oa9YIxSVw7FsVIWaObFiO0RkKv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1627796'),
  ('442750400052977857', 'Pantafa', 2023, 'Horror', 'Simone D''Onofrio, Emanuele Scaringi', 'Tiziana Triana, Emanuele Scaringi, Vanessa Picciarelli', 'Kasia Smutniak, Francesco Colella, Giuseppe Cederna, Mario Sgueglia, Betti Pedrazzi, Mauro Marino, Greta Santi, Ugo De Cesare', null, 'Marta and her daughter Nina move to Malanotte, a small mountain village. The little girl has been suffering from hypnagogic paralysis for some time, a sleep disorder which can lead to hallucinatory states, and Marta thought that a bit of mountain air and distance from the frenetic rhythm of city life might benefit the little girl. However, the house they move into is anything but welcoming, and children are never seen playing in the streets of Malanotte. Nina’s symptoms begin to worsen from the very first night in the new house, and the little girl has more and more vivid nightmares in which a ghostly figure sits on her chest, immobilises her and steals her breath. For Marta, a single mother in a place she finds increasingly sinister, it will become harder every day to know what is best for her child.', 'Marta and her daughter Nina move to Malanotte, a small mountain village. The little girl has been suffering from hypnagogic paralysis for some time, a sleep disorder which can lead to hallucinatory states, and Marta thought that a bit of mountain air and distance from the frenetic rhythm of city life might benefit the little girl. However, the house they move into is anything but welcoming, and children are never seen playing in the streets of Malanotte. Nina’s symptoms begin to worsen from the very first night in the new house, and the little girl has more and more vivid nightmares in which a ghostly figure sits on her chest, immobilises her and steals her breath. For Marta, a single mother in a place she finds increasingly sinister, it will become harder every day to know what is best for her child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbrJLE4OicQuWYZhkWOXQXFcdcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876619'),
  ('921934020654823458', 'Pantasya ni Tami', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Easy Ferrer, Topel Lee', 'Don Santella', 'Azi Acosta, Ali Asistio, Jiad Arroyo, Shiena Yu, Zia Zamora, Erika Balagtas, PJ Rosario, Justin MC', null, 'Tami, with the help of her fubu photographer, Ken, sells sexy photos of herself. When she meets her fan, Gelo, who loves her as she is, she is torn whether to leave cosplaying or leave Gelo.', 'Tami, with the help of her fubu photographer, Ken, sells sexy photos of herself. When she meets her fan, Gelo, who loves her as she is, she is torn whether to leave cosplaying or leave Gelo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iej9tjZsnWbfn6BirakJAygfaEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1226281'),
  ('472694063296277979', 'Panther', 1995, 'Drama, History', 'Mario Van Peebles, H.H. Cooper, Algric Leo Chaplin', 'Melvin Van Peebles', 'Kadeem Hardison, Bokeem Woodbine, Joe Don Baker, Courtney B. Vance, Tyrin Turner, Marcus Chong, Anthony Griffith, Bobby Brown', 'R', 'In this sprawling, fictionalized history of the Black Panthers, 1960s Oakland becomes a war zone as the Panthers battle for the right to exist.', 'In this sprawling, fictionalized history of the Black Panthers, 1960s Oakland becomes a war zone as the Panthers battle for the right to exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxGOkt6WBhSIdZiQqyVEccRURVv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41478'),
  ('978032833940944026', 'Panther Squad', 1984, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Pierre Chevalier, Phil Uyuer, Peter Markess', 'Georges Friedland', 'Sybil Danning, Jack Taylor, Karin Schubert, Jean-René Gossart, Françoise Bocci, Donna Cross, Karin Brussels, Analía Ivars', null, 'An astronaut has been abducted by a group of environmental terrorists. The New Organization of Nations decides to send a lethal commando "The Panther Squad", composed of sexy female mercenaries to get rid of the terrorists led by Barbara Wims and to free the hostage...', 'An astronaut has been abducted by a group of environmental terrorists. The New Organization of Nations decides to send a lethal commando "The Panther Squad", composed of sexy female mercenaries to get rid of the terrorists led by Barbara Wims and to free the hostage...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qK8Qy6C7YtlyOupn5V4RxNobT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134051'),
  ('1048337236628584014', 'Pantry Panic', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walter Lantz', null, 'Mel Blanc, Ben Hardaway, Kent Rogers, Sara Berner, Bernice Hansen, Danny Webb', 'NR', 'Woody''s friends warn him that the groundhog has predicted a blizzard. Unconcerned, Woody decides not to go South with his pals. Soon enough, the blizzard sweeps in and destroys the loony woodpecker''s stash of food. Facing starvation, a glimmer of hope arrives in the form of a cat. The cat is also starving and it turns into a match of brawn and wits to see who eats who.', 'Woody''s friends warn him that the groundhog has predicted a blizzard. Unconcerned, Woody decides not to go South with his pals. Soon enough, the blizzard sweeps in and destroys the loony woodpecker''s stash of food. Facing starvation, a glimmer of hope arrives in the form of a cat. The cat is also starving and it turns into a match of brawn and wits to see who eats who.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2sa1l8YfMS3P5IYYXkaxqOM3Tv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87958'),
  ('836682989232877111', 'Pantry Pirate', 1940, 'Animation', 'Clyde Geronimi', null, 'Lee Millar, Lillian Randolph', 'NR', 'Pluto is tied up in the backyard and has been ordered by the maid to stay outside while she prepares a roast. Of course, once Pluto smells the scent of the roast, he makes a beeline for the kitchen. Unfortuantely, staying undiscovered proves difficult for Pluto once he gets inside particularly after he inhales a bucket of soapy water and starts sneezing. Bubbles fill the kitchen and cups are broken at which point the maid comes downstairs. Luckily, Pluto returns to his doghouse leaving the impression that he never left. The maid just shrugs and says, "I could swear it was that dog."', 'Pluto is tied up in the backyard and has been ordered by the maid to stay outside while she prepares a roast. Of course, once Pluto smells the scent of the roast, he makes a beeline for the kitchen. Unfortuantely, staying undiscovered proves difficult for Pluto once he gets inside particularly after he inhales a bucket of soapy water and starts sneezing. Bubbles fill the kitchen and cups are broken at which point the maid comes downstairs. Luckily, Pluto returns to his doghouse leaving the impression that he never left. The maid just shrugs and says, "I could swear it was that dog."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/il2ZKZMREOQqk0O5ypYnwh4KGPG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68497'),
  ('484957369118783028', 'Pants on Fire', 2014, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jonathan A. Rosenbaum, Jan Kiesser', 'Alex Cramer', 'Bradley Steven Perry, Tyrel Jackson Williams, Brittney Wilson, Harrison Houde, Joshua J. Ballard, Taylor Russell, Nicholas Coombe, Rachelle Gillis', null, 'Jack Parker has always skated by on his lies, especially the one about Mikey, an underprivileged (and made-up) teen who Jack "tutors"... until one day "Mikey" shows up for real, and all Jack''s lies start coming true.', 'Jack Parker has always skated by on his lies, especially the one about Mikey, an underprivileged (and made-up) teen who Jack "tutors"... until one day "Mikey" shows up for real, and all Jack''s lies start coming true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMT9wbyLRfyUwUMVLmEGBVedAgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304441'),
