  ('1000269541306031674', 'Paolo Borsellino: The 57 Days', 2012, 'History, Drama', 'Alberto Negrin', 'Francesco Scardamaglia', 'Luca Zingaretti, Lorenza Indovina, Aurora Quattrocchi, Francesco Casisa, Bruno Torrisi, Giovanni Calcagno, Giuseppe De Rosa, Davide Giordano', null, 'The film traces the 57 days after the assassination of his friend and fellow anti-Mafia judge Giovanni Falcone when Paolo Borsellino must come to terms with his own inescapable destiny.', 'The film traces the 57 days after the assassination of his friend and fellow anti-Mafia judge Giovanni Falcone when Paolo Borsellino must come to terms with his own inescapable destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzOvjVTyEThZ5uSDWMP8ERArTj6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112586'),
