  ('600520806930597625', 'Paolo the Cool', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Ciccio Ingrassia, Aldo Giordani, Roberto Pariante', 'Ciccio Ingrassia, Marino Onorati', 'Franco Franchi, Ileana Riganò, Guido Leontini, Ciccio Ingrassia, Tino Scotti, Mimmo Baldi, Isabella Biagini, Linda Sini', null, 'A baron, nicknamed Paolo il caldo (Paul the Hot One) because of his womanizing, asks his son, on his deathbed, to leave women alone and only think about work. The son tries hard but only gets into trouble.', 'A baron, nicknamed Paolo il caldo (Paul the Hot One) because of his womanizing, asks his son, on his deathbed, to leave women alone and only think about work. The son tries hard but only gets into trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VT0h2xVLOoZDNs8f14VJ4vS1Dz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131825'),
  ('813792599544778873', 'Papa', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Maurice Barthélemy', 'Maurice Barthélemy', 'Alain Chabat, Martin Combes, Judith Godrèche, Yaël Abecassis, Anne Benoît, Michel Scourneau, Pierre Richards, Valérie Moreau', null, 'Louis and his Daddy are driving back home. Daddy is a past master at clowning, which does not necessarily make Louis laugh. At times Daddy gets awfully mad, picking on people who don''t deserve it. That also does not make Louis laugh. But Daddy IS sweet. He knows how to soothe Louis when he is very very upset. And he can rock-a-bye his baby with a song by Niagara. Daddy has been rather slipshod lately. And ill-shaved. And has had hair-raising nightmares. Louis can burst into tears just because a little girl refuses a sticker he wants to give her. What''s wrong with Louis and his Daddy? Written by Guy Bellinger', 'Louis and his Daddy are driving back home. Daddy is a past master at clowning, which does not necessarily make Louis laugh. At times Daddy gets awfully mad, picking on people who don''t deserve it. That also does not make Louis laugh. But Daddy IS sweet. He knows how to soothe Louis when he is very very upset. And he can rock-a-bye his baby with a song by Niagara. Daddy has been rather slipshod lately. And ill-shaved. And has had hair-raising nightmares. Louis can burst into tears just because a little girl refuses a sticker he wants to give her. What''s wrong with Louis and his Daddy? Written by Guy Bellinger', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bh4D7RI2tQSpbIivEFGvkzaEPEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59163'),
  ('727814210763516616', 'Papà dice messa', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Renato Pozzetto, Lamberto Caimi, Angelo Vicari', 'Renato Pozzetto', 'Renato Pozzetto, Teo Teocoli, Felice Andreasi, Marta Forghieri, Nunzio Fabrizio, Paolo Mancini, Giacomo Pozzetto, Maurizio Tabani', null, 'Father Arturo is a suburban parish priest, full of goodwill despite the absenteeism of his parishioners and the "harassment" from his bishop. One day, Francesco, the son he secretly had twenty years earlier, shows up at the church. His girlfriend, Matilda, is pregnant—Father Arturo is about to become a grandfather! The next day, Francesco disappears, and the priest and the girl set out to find him.', 'Father Arturo is a suburban parish priest, full of goodwill despite the absenteeism of his parishioners and the "harassment" from his bishop. One day, Francesco, the son he secretly had twenty years earlier, shows up at the church. His girlfriend, Matilda, is pregnant—Father Arturo is about to become a grandfather! The next day, Francesco disappears, and the priest and the girl set out to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMUKPH47pJ9i7Mzys7eTqo0fNgI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255883'),
  ('463718240252457214', 'Pápa Piquillo', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Álvaro Sáenz de Heredia', 'Álvaro Sáenz de Heredia', 'Chiquito de la Calzada, José Manuel Muñoz, Samara Losada, Adolfo Losada, Isaac Cuende, Miguel Angel Arrojo, La Chunga, Bigote Arrocet', null, 'Papá Piquillo is a gypsy grandfather who makes a living singing and dancing in the streets of Madrid with a monkey, a goat and his six grandchildren. Things get complicated when one of the children suffers an accident and the police prevent them from continuing to perform.', 'Papá Piquillo is a gypsy grandfather who makes a living singing and dancing in the streets of Madrid with a monkey, a goat and his six grandchildren. Things get complicated when one of the children suffers an accident and the police prevent them from continuing to perform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aDFoJPAkxxnMQTYu38wo08kebc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166207'),
  ('813749134863201204', 'Papa Was Not a Rolling Stone', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sylvie Ohayon, Laurent Brunet', 'Sylvie Verheyde, Sylvie Ohayon', 'Doria Achour, Aure Atika, Marc Lavoine, Soumaye Bocoum, Rabah Nait Oufella, Sylvie Testud, Attica Guedj, Pascale Arbillot', null, 'Stéphanie grew up with an absent mother and a brutal stepfather. One day, she knows, she''ll leave the city to live the life she''s always dreamed of.', 'Stéphanie grew up with an absent mother and a brutal stepfather. One day, she knows, she''ll leave the city to live the life she''s always dreamed of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aps3aN4Slzv1fk4bBSboSYMbWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294466'),
  ('393885879509464454', 'Papá x dos', 2025, 'Family, Comedy, Romance', 'Hernán Guerschuny, Mariano Pariz', 'Mili Roque Pitt, Matías Rodríguez', 'Benjamín Vicuña, Celeste Cid, Lucas Akoskin, Tati Fernández, Filippo Carrozza, Molly Madrid, Gênesis Abril Vallejos, María Gracia Omegna', null, 'Santiago decides to start a family with his girlfriend Ana, even though she is pregnant with her ex, Pancho''s. However, the real challenge will come when Pancho unexpectedly returns from Miami to get involved in the pregnancy, unleashing a series of comical and chaotic situations in his home.', 'Santiago decides to start a family with his girlfriend Ana, even though she is pregnant with her ex, Pancho''s. However, the real challenge will come when Pancho unexpectedly returns from Miami to get involved in the pregnancy, unleashing a series of comical and chaotic situations in his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gclIrK0PYAVXhROFQuH6ju15k8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1366745'),
  ('345171811367418406', 'Papá Youtuber', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Eliana Illescas, Fernando Villarán, Pato Fuster', 'Fernando Villarán, Gonzalo Ladines', 'Carlos Carlín, Gianella Neyra, Thiago Bejar, Valentina Izquierdo, Pelo Madueño, Manuel Gold, Paul Vega, Emilram Cossío', null, 'A family dad with no technology knowledge is fired by his new boss, a young millennial. In desperation to don''t lose his home and after learning that his wife is pregnant, he decides to become a YouTuber, for what he will need the help of his two misunderstood kids.', 'A family dad with no technology knowledge is fired by his new boss, a young millennial. In desperation to don''t lose his home and after learning that his wife is pregnant, he decides to become a YouTuber, for what he will need the help of his two misunderstood kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGgcGtgNGXAEdyuj7o6JttQZvy3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586602'),
  ('376368889568110484', 'Papa Zola: The Movie', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Nizam Razak, Raja Nukman Raja Mohd Noordin, Anas Abdul Aziz', 'Nizam Razak', 'Nizam Razak, Ieesya Isandra, Noor Ezdiani Ahmad Fauwzi, Yusuf Bahrin, Aloeng Silalahi, Imaad Iskandar, Nur Fathiah Diaz, Dzubir Mohamed Zakaria', null, 'Papa Zola, a schoolteacher, and his gifted daughter Pipi go on small adventures that often escalate. Their escapades showcase their loving relationship and Pipi''s intelligence, as they navigate whimsical situations together.', 'Papa Zola, a schoolteacher, and his gifted daughter Pipi go on small adventures that often escalate. Their escapades showcase their loving relationship and Pipi''s intelligence, as they navigate whimsical situations together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tl7huo6BSWpCESeF4lXGHCdv2TG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1274214'),
  ('237855672634603383', 'Papa, Can You Hear Me Sing?', 1983, 'Drama, Music', 'Yu Kan-Ping, Tsui Hark', 'Wu Nien-jen, Sung Hsiang-yu, Yip Wan-Chiu', 'Vickey Liu, Sun Yueh, Ng Siu-Gong, Lee Li-Chun, Hsiao Hou Tao, Chin Pin, Su Chu, Chen Chi-Chun', null, 'A poor army veteran in Taiwan adopts a daughter. She grows up and leaves him to enter show business. When she becomes famous she shuns her father and friends.', 'A poor army veteran in Taiwan adopts a daughter. She grows up and leaves him to enter show business. When she becomes famous she shuns her father and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nx9CJjv8KXiOo68AM1y8DlwXPMn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272121'),
  ('170169682173488331', 'Papa, Mama, My Wife and Me', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Paul Le Chanois, Brigitte Dubois, Maud Linder', 'Marcel Aymé', 'Robert Lamoureux, Gaby Morlay, Fernand Ledoux, Nicole Courcel, Louis de Funès, Élina Labourdette, Renée Passeur, Madeleine Barbulée', null, 'Robert Langlois is now married to Catherine, the former housemaid. And they would live happily ever after if the housing crisis did not force them to live together with Gabrielle and Fernand, Robert''s parents. For, despite the good will on either side, tension soon arises. What else to expect when there is too little space in their Montmartre apartment for four people (then for six then eight, the couple having... two pairs of twins!) ; the continued presence there of Fernand (who loves peace and quiet) after he is driven to retirement ; the difficult beginnings of Robert as a lawyer in a room of the apartment, etc... Other troubles follow and the harried family is on the verge of implosion...', 'Robert Langlois is now married to Catherine, the former housemaid. And they would live happily ever after if the housing crisis did not force them to live together with Gabrielle and Fernand, Robert''s parents. For, despite the good will on either side, tension soon arises. What else to expect when there is too little space in their Montmartre apartment for four people (then for six then eight, the couple having... two pairs of twins!) ; the continued presence there of Fernand (who loves peace and quiet) after he is driven to retirement ; the difficult beginnings of Robert as a lawyer in a room of the apartment, etc... Other troubles follow and the harried family is on the verge of implosion...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWHHeZAt8TkizSPRU43ZW8G504u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158550'),
  ('566377283207400680', 'Papa, Mama, the Maid and I', 1954, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jean-Paul Le Chanois, Marc Fossard', 'Marcel Aymé, Jean-Paul Le Chanois, Pierre Véry', 'Robert Lamoureux, Fernand Ledoux, Gaby Morlay, Nicole Courcel, Louis de Funès, Gaston Modot, Madeleine Barbulée, Yolande Laffon', null, 'The residents of the apartment building on Rue Montmartre are a motley crew of oddballs and eccentrics. The daring son of a professor couple is in love with a sexy student who supplements her pocket money by working as an au pair. And then there''s Monsieur Calomel, the crazy but helpful neighbor who''s always ready with a funny face...', 'The residents of the apartment building on Rue Montmartre are a motley crew of oddballs and eccentrics. The daring son of a professor couple is in love with a sexy student who supplements her pocket money by working as an au pair. And then there''s Monsieur Calomel, the crazy but helpful neighbor who''s always ready with a funny face...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XkgcIwcgV3WF5Wu6PWBsMTC1Bk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81049'),
  ('1039311159596593232', 'Papa''s Delicate Condition', 1963, 'Comedy', 'George Marshall, Loyal Griggs', 'Corinne Griffith, Jack Rose', 'Jackie Gleason, Glynis Johns, Charles Ruggles, Laurel Goodwin, Linda Bruhl, Ned Glass, Murray Hamilton, Elisha Cook Jr.', 'NR', 'A jolly, family-oriented railroad superintendent tries to get his act together when his love for the bottle starts to alienate him from his wife and oldest daughter. His younger daughter, however, still remains unflinchingly loyal to him, and they share many fun misadventures over the course of the movie.', 'A jolly, family-oriented railroad superintendent tries to get his act together when his love for the bottle starts to alienate him from his wife and oldest daughter. His younger daughter, however, still remains unflinchingly loyal to him, and they share many fun misadventures over the course of the movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSnZkNJXmftJi6uxD8TyumHzbcu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74088'),
  ('284201922050009346', 'Papaflessas', 1971, 'Drama, History, War', 'Erricos Andreou, Dimitris Papakonstadis', 'Panos Kontellis', 'Dimitris Papamichael, Alekos Alexandrakis, Katia Dandoulaki, Dimitris Ioakimidis, Angelos Antonopoulos, Lavrentis Dianellos, Christos Kalavrouzos, Dimitris Bislanis', null, 'The life and work of the hero of 1821 Papaflessas that during the liberation struggle of the Greeks against the Turks, revolutionizing the elders and the world to declare war!!! Up to the heroic battle Maniaki.... A movie that shows the heroism and sacrifice of the Greeks for their homeland and their freedom', 'The life and work of the hero of 1821 Papaflessas that during the liberation struggle of the Greeks against the Turks, revolutionizing the elders and the world to declare war!!! Up to the heroic battle Maniaki.... A movie that shows the heroism and sacrifice of the Greeks for their homeland and their freedom', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFgAvO5Av5tWgx9ROksiyDy6FU3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336062'),
  ('89033021125866351', 'Papageno', 1935, 'Animation, Music, Fantasy', 'Lotte Reiniger', 'Lotte Reiniger', null, null, 'Film shows the story of Papageno (the one from Mozart''s opera "The Magic Flute"), who wants a mate, yet has difficulties getting one.', 'Film shows the story of Papageno (the one from Mozart''s opera "The Magic Flute"), who wants a mate, yet has difficulties getting one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iQCTWVcAyg00OX5qfy0qVBWRl7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88186'),
  ('21388804018724732', 'Paparazzi', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Jacques Rozier, Maurice Perrimond', 'Jacques Rozier, Michel Piccoli', 'Michel Piccoli, Jean Lescot, David Tonelli, Brigitte Bardot, Jean-Luc Godard, Fritz Lang, Jack Palance, Giorgia Moll', null, 'Paparazzi explores the relationship between Brigitte Bardot and groups of invasive photographers attempting to photograph her while she works on the set of Jean-Luc Godard''s film Le Mépris (Contempt). Through video footage of Bardot, interviews with the paparazzi, and still photos of Bardot from magazine covers and elsewhere, director Rozier investigates some of the ramifications of international movie stardom, specifically the loss of privacy to the paparazzi. The film explains the shooting of the film on the island of Capri, and the photographers'' valiant, even foolishly dangerous, attempts to get a photograph of Bardot.', 'Paparazzi explores the relationship between Brigitte Bardot and groups of invasive photographers attempting to photograph her while she works on the set of Jean-Luc Godard''s film Le Mépris (Contempt). Through video footage of Bardot, interviews with the paparazzi, and still photos of Bardot from magazine covers and elsewhere, director Rozier investigates some of the ramifications of international movie stardom, specifically the loss of privacy to the paparazzi. The film explains the shooting of the film on the island of Capri, and the photographers'' valiant, even foolishly dangerous, attempts to get a photograph of Bardot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryJseQE3NrEKdwFVvhYzDPBKOBu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254018'),
  ('363296863433728090', 'Paparazzi', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Carlo Tafani', 'Neri Parenti', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Diego Abatantuono, Roberto Brunetti, Nino D''Angelo, Ramona Bădescu, Rino Barillari, Aldo Biscardi', null, 'A montley group of free-lance photographers are desperate to grab a good shot of a celebrity.', 'A montley group of free-lance photographers are desperate to grab a good shot of a celebrity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/in8v1bGSrF8K3UUw00wb0h2dYiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43554'),
  ('1041224841379610448', 'Paparazzi', 2004, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Paul Abascal, Daryn Okada, Chuck Picerni Jr.', 'Forry Smith', 'Cole Hauser, Robin Tunney, Dennis Farina, Daniel Baldwin, Tom Sizemore, Tom Hollander, Kevin Gage, Blake Michael Bryan', 'PG-13', 'A rising Hollywood actor decides to take personal revenge against a group of four persistent photographers to make them pay for almost causing a personal tragedy involving his wife and son.', 'A rising Hollywood actor decides to take personal revenge against a group of four persistent photographers to make them pay for almost causing a personal tragedy involving his wife and son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9swmQKxrbRTYY3wN2bWmRiebM4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15644'),
  ('726921722603114296', 'Papatrechas', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Errikos Thalassinos, Lakis Antonakos, Sifis Siganos', 'Napoleon Eleftheriou', 'Thanasis Veggos, Souli Sabah, Iro Kyriakaki, Maria Soldatou, Katerina Yioulaki, Taygeti, Kia Bozou, Nitsa Marouda', null, 'Polydoros Lagos is a janitor in an ordinary Athens'' block in the 1960s who''s struggling to serve as many of the building''s residents as possible in order to save some money to help his six sisters (and his aunt) get married, since this is the only way he can finally get married too.', 'Polydoros Lagos is a janitor in an ordinary Athens'' block in the 1960s who''s struggling to serve as many of the building''s residents as possible in order to save some money to help his six sisters (and his aunt) get married, since this is the only way he can finally get married too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xENoEhUI9xwYhDr8pBJAN2dJm2C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344794'),
  ('789214243670062040', 'Papaya: Love Goddess of the Cannibals', 1978, 'Romance, Horror', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato, Donatella Donati', 'Roberto Gandus', 'Melissa Chimenti, Sirpa Lane, Maurice Poli, Dakar, Maria Grazia Smaldone', null, 'A team of geologists attempt to remove a native population from an island to perform atomic research. But their female Cannibal leader disposes of them one by one.', 'A team of geologists attempt to remove a native population from an island to perform atomic research. But their female Cannibal leader disposes of them one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLJ6qsUeRktoT1g0McKvPr0julG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94832'),
  ('996476067301366328', 'Papeles en el viento', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Juan Taratuto, Javier Julia, Matías Scartascini', 'Eduardo Sacheri, Juan Taratuto', 'Diego Peretti, Pablo Echarri, Pablo Rago, Diego Torres, Daniel Rabinovich, Cecilia Dopazo, Paola Barrientos, Juan Pablo Varsky', null, 'When El Mono dies, his three longtime friends try to recover from the loss and want to secure his little girl''s future. But for Fernando, Mauricio and El Ruso this will not be easy. They decide to recover a big investment El Mono had made when he had bought a soccer player who was supposed to become a star.', 'When El Mono dies, his three longtime friends try to recover from the loss and want to secure his little girl''s future. But for Fernando, Mauricio and El Ruso this will not be easy. They decide to recover a big investment El Mono had made when he had bought a soccer player who was supposed to become a star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rJjtxIbNpbdoBJEuEjZnEQhB87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311215'),
  ('835552267993820305', 'Paper Birds', 2010, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Emilio Aragón, David Omedes, Pedro Manuel Lazaga', 'Emilio Aragón, Fernando Castets', 'Imanol Arias, Lluís Homar, Roger Príncep, Carmen Machi, Fernando Cayo, Diego Martín, Oriol Vila, Luis Varela', null, 'At the end of the Spanish Civil War, the members of a group of vaudeville performers have been stripped of everything: all they have left is hunger and the instinct to survive. Day after day, agonizingly, lost and helpless between the victors and the vanquished, the musician Jorge, the ventriloquist Enrique, the couplet singer Rocío and the orphan Miguel search tirelessly for something to eat and a safe place to live.', 'At the end of the Spanish Civil War, the members of a group of vaudeville performers have been stripped of everything: all they have left is hunger and the instinct to survive. Day after day, agonizingly, lost and helpless between the victors and the vanquished, the musician Jorge, the ventriloquist Enrique, the couplet singer Rocío and the orphan Miguel search tirelessly for something to eat and a safe place to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgdLPEiHr4HqtNYuzBhmY9nE4Aa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50004'),
  ('273867618662306291', 'Paper Dove', 2003, 'Drama', 'Fabrizio Aguilar, Micaela Cajahuaringa', 'Gianfranco Annichini, Fabrizio Aguilar', 'Antonio Callirgos, Eduardo Cesti, Aristóteles Picho, Liliana Trujillo, Sergio Galliani, Melania Urbina, Tatiana Astengo, Jesús Carbajal', null, 'Juan, a young man convicted of terrorism, is given amnesty from a Lima prison; he boards a bus to return home and, in his mind''s eye, recalls events in his village near Huaraz when he was 10 or 12. His father is long dead, his mother lives with Fermin, secretly a sympathizer with the Communist guerrillas in the hills. Town leaders are assassinated at night. When Juan discovers Fermin''s secret, Juan is spirited away to the guerrillas to learn Marxist slogans and how to fight. When the band decides to attack the town to avenge the death of a comrade, Juan must choose.', 'Juan, a young man convicted of terrorism, is given amnesty from a Lima prison; he boards a bus to return home and, in his mind''s eye, recalls events in his village near Huaraz when he was 10 or 12. His father is long dead, his mother lives with Fermin, secretly a sympathizer with the Communist guerrillas in the hills. Town leaders are assassinated at night. When Juan discovers Fermin''s secret, Juan is spirited away to the guerrillas to learn Marxist slogans and how to fight. When the band decides to attack the town to avenge the death of a comrade, Juan must choose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ap48gJ9mbwAv4YgBBnulY4TZMZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53125'),
  ('810351165018835613', 'Paper Flags', 2019, 'Drama', 'Raphaël Vandenbussche, Nathan Ambrosioni, Nathan Ambrosioni', 'Nathan Ambrosioni', 'Noémie Merlant, Guillaume Gouix, Sébastien Houbani, Jérôme Kircher, Alysson Paradis, Anne Loiret, Julian Ciais, Jules Vallauri', null, 'He is 30 and just got out of jail after 12 years of detention. She is almost 24 and has a simple life away from the city. One day, he comes to her and she let him stay with her. That''s complicated when your older brother needs to get back to a normal life. Between tenderness and bursts of laughter, his anger is sometimes out of control. However, she wants to help him. As for him, he wants to meet with his sister again.', 'He is 30 and just got out of jail after 12 years of detention. She is almost 24 and has a simple life away from the city. One day, he comes to her and she let him stay with her. That''s complicated when your older brother needs to get back to a normal life. Between tenderness and bursts of laughter, his anger is sometimes out of control. However, she wants to help him. As for him, he wants to meet with his sister again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IubFMkkev7w3YhnDKzxyM7jjGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554855'),
  ('343918334654491977', 'Paper Heart', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nicholas Jasenovec, Jay Hunter', 'Nicholas Jasenovec, Lo Mutuc', 'Lo Mutuc, Demetri Martin, Jake Johnson, Given Sharp, Martin Starr, Michael Cera, Gill Summers, Seth Rogen', 'PG-13', 'Paper Heart follows Nick and Charlyne on a cross-country journey to document what exactly "love" is. Interviewing ministers, happily married couples, chemists, romance novelists, divorce lawyers, a group of children and more, the determined young girl attempts to find definition and perhaps even experience the mysterious emotion.', 'Paper Heart follows Nick and Charlyne on a cross-country journey to document what exactly "love" is. Interviewing ministers, happily married couples, chemists, romance novelists, divorce lawyers, a group of children and more, the determined young girl attempts to find definition and perhaps even experience the mysterious emotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfOYFZ15ZhxKBXgazh2JHaZnoDc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25183'),
  ('694149467979787469', 'Paper Lion', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Alex March, Peter Garbarini, Morris Hartzband', 'Lawrence Roman', 'Alan Alda, Lauren Hutton, Joe Schmidt, Alex Karras, Sugar Ray Robinson, Vince Lombardi, Frank Gifford, David Doyle', null, 'Sportswriter George Plimpton poses as a rookie quarterback for the Detroit Lions for a "Sports Illustrated" article.', 'Sportswriter George Plimpton poses as a rookie quarterback for the Detroit Lions for a "Sports Illustrated" article.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kECYAW0dhyDq0m3ldVBvSbVg4ow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86284'),
  ('652379023372602446', 'Paper Man', 1971, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie, Thriller, Horror', 'Walter Grauman, Jack Woolf', 'James D. Buchanan, Ronald Austin', 'Dean Stockwell, Stefanie Powers, James Stacy, Tina Chen, Elliott Street, James Olson, Jason Wingreen, Dan Barton', null, 'A prank that starts with a group of college students creating a fictitious person so they can get a credit card develops into a plot that leaves three of them dead.', 'A prank that starts with a group of college students creating a fictitious person so they can get a credit card develops into a plot that leaves three of them dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSulwjONKFbuD3T9lyEzwVupm4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315379'),
  ('353500295002472149', 'Paper Man', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kieran Mulroney, Michele Mulroney, Eigil Bryld', 'Michele Mulroney, Kieran Mulroney', 'Jeff Daniels, Emma Stone, Ryan Reynolds, Lisa Kudrow, Kieran Culkin, Hunter Parrish, Arabella Field, Chris Parnell', 'R', 'A coming-of-middle-age comedy that chronicles the unlikely friendship between failed author Richard Dunne and a Long Island teen who teaches him a thing or two about growing up, all under the disapproving eye of his long-suffering wife and his imaginary Superhero friend.', 'A coming-of-middle-age comedy that chronicles the unlikely friendship between failed author Richard Dunne and a Long Island teen who teaches him a thing or two about growing up, all under the disapproving eye of his long-suffering wife and his imaginary Superhero friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wneK8G9E26FUqYo4KjPlsD0TIII.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39414'),
  ('1054791418670705868', 'Paper Marriage', 1988, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting, Jimmy Leung Chi-Ming, Yuen Wah', 'Keith Wong, Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Maggie Cheung, Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting, Dick Wei, Joyce Godenzi, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Hsiao Ho, Tony Morelli', null, 'Set in Canada, a down-on-his-luck Chinese boxer Bo Chin (Samo Hung) accepts promise of payment to marry a Hong Kong woman Jade Lee (Maggie Cheung) so she can get Canadian citizenship. They realize too late that they have been set up in a complicated plan to cheat them out of the woman''s money. Their adventures begin when Bo is forced back into the ring and Jade tries her hand at mud-wrestling!', 'Set in Canada, a down-on-his-luck Chinese boxer Bo Chin (Samo Hung) accepts promise of payment to marry a Hong Kong woman Jade Lee (Maggie Cheung) so she can get Canadian citizenship. They realize too late that they have been set up in a complicated plan to cheat them out of the woman''s money. Their adventures begin when Bo is forced back into the ring and Jade tries her hand at mud-wrestling!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuwV5UqLY6zejp7YUSfT3Zi77Nc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219187'),
  ('362339854811924200', 'Paper Mask', 1990, 'Crime, Drama, Fantasy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Christopher Morahan, Nat Crosby', 'John Collee', 'Paul McGann, Amanda Donohoe, Frederick Treves, Tom Wilkinson, Barbara Leigh-Hunt, Jimmy Yuill, Mark Lewis Jones, John Warnaby', null, 'A lowly hospital orderly impersonates a recently deceased doctor and goes to work in the busy ER of a small hospital where he meets and befriends a nurse who slowly figures out his secret and helps him maintain his charade.', 'A lowly hospital orderly impersonates a recently deceased doctor and goes to work in the busy ER of a small hospital where he meets and befriends a nurse who slowly figures out his secret and helps him maintain his charade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fU4zSjzoczjK4gSMGoIr95RdUu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74741'),
  ('662499513232441733', 'Paper Planes', 2014, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Tristan Milani, Robert Connolly', 'Robert Connolly, Steve Worland', 'Sam Worthington, Ed Oxenbould, Deborah Mailman, Nicholas Bakopoulos-Cooke, Ena Imai, Terry Norris, Peter Rowsthorn, Julian Dennison', null, 'Dylan discovers he has a talent for making paper planes. He has a chance to compete in a world championship, but he''ll have to face bullies and self-doubt to do so.', 'Dylan discovers he has a talent for making paper planes. He has a chance to compete in a world championship, but he''ll have to face bullies and self-doubt to do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpcAApL7oydxKeU2TR5y2RwNQ78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286875'),
