  ('854197492701055821', 'Paper Tiger', 1975, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Ken Annakin, John Cabrera, Lajos Baghy', 'Jack Davies', 'David Niven, Toshirō Mifune, Hardy Krüger, Kazuhito Ando, Irene Tsu, Ivan Desny, Miiko Taka, Jeff Corey', null, 'A somewhat prim and proper Englishman is hired as the tutor to the son of the Japanese ambassador. His life changes when he and the boy are kidnapped by terrorists for political purposes.', 'A somewhat prim and proper Englishman is hired as the tutor to the son of the Japanese ambassador. His life changes when he and the boy are kidnapped by terrorists for political purposes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5AUv62D5eUhWpU7WSk3wTybzL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105240'),
  ('390295167744412679', 'Paper Towns', 2015, 'Mystery, Drama, Romance', 'Jake Schreier, Darrin Prescott, David Lanzenberg', 'Scott Neustadter, Michael H. Weber', 'Nat Wolff, Cara Delevingne, Austin Abrams, Justice Smith, Halston Sage, Jaz Sinclair, Cara Buono, Josiah Cerio', 'PG-13', 'Quentin Jacobsen has spent a lifetime loving the magnificently adventurous Margo Roth Spiegelman from afar. So when she cracks open a window and climbs back into his life dressed like a ninja and summoning him for an ingenious campaign of revenge, he follows. After their all-nighter ends and a new day breaks, Quentin arrives at school to discover that Margo, always an enigma, has now become a mystery. But Quentin soon learns that there are clues, and they''re for him. Urged down a disconnected path, the closer Quentin gets, the less he sees of the girl he thought he knew.', 'Quentin Jacobsen has spent a lifetime loving the magnificently adventurous Margo Roth Spiegelman from afar. So when she cracks open a window and climbs back into his life dressed like a ninja and summoning him for an ingenious campaign of revenge, he follows. After their all-nighter ends and a new day breaks, Quentin arrives at school to discover that Margo, always an enigma, has now become a mystery. But Quentin soon learns that there are clues, and they''re for him. Urged down a disconnected path, the closer Quentin gets, the less he sees of the girl he thought he knew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVW67w7eWwmBhbBCc4f983pO8m6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286565'),
  ('266159387684546838', 'Paperback Hero', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Antony J. Bowman, David Burr', 'Antony J. Bowman', 'Claudia Karvan, Hugh Jackman, Angie Milliken, Andrew S. Gilbert, Jeanie Drynan, Bruce Venables, Barry Rugless, Barry Lea', null, 'Australian truck driver Jack has written a successful romance novel under the name of his best friend''s girlfriend - Ruby Vale. When a publisher arrives to sign up ''Ruby'', complications arise.', 'Australian truck driver Jack has written a successful romance novel under the name of his best friend''s girlfriend - Ruby Vale. When a publisher arrives to sign up ''Ruby'', complications arise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycPH8DZp6qZ5TJuf95pDGoYDFWo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68044'),
  ('479483170967490436', 'Paperhouse', 1988, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Bernard Rose, Mike Southon, Pat Aldersley', 'Matthew Jacobs', 'Charlotte Burke, Elliott Spiers, Glenne Headly, Gemma Jones, Ben Cross, Jane Bertish, Sarah Newbold, Steven O''Donnell', 'PG-13', 'A young girl lost in the loneliness and boredom of reality finds solace in an ill boy, whom she can visit in a surreal dream world that she drew in her school composition book.', 'A young girl lost in the loneliness and boredom of reality finds solace in an ill boy, whom she can visit in a surreal dream world that she drew in her school composition book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZblvybDhNSbEheAF9h8i0iUrdl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41965'),
  ('805000883759206838', 'Papers', 2025, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Arturo Montenegro, Aaron Bromley, Dilva Barriga', 'Arturo Montenegro, Andry J. Barrientos, Andrés Clemente', 'Megan Montaner, Carlos Bardem, Antonio Dechent, Gustavo Bassani, Jaime Newball, Nick Romano, Gaby Gnazzo, Ana Alejandra Carrizo', null, 'Trapped in the middle of the world-shaking Panama Papers scandal, Ana Mendez must fight the system, the global media and her own ethical compass to try to restore her reputation and save her family.', 'Trapped in the middle of the world-shaking Panama Papers scandal, Ana Mendez must fight the system, the global media and her own ethical compass to try to restore her reputation and save her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZfE2pjLfXFhO7h2Rj6fpccM4Ba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1237601'),
