  ('480822021756859844', 'Papi Sitter', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Denis Rouden, Philippe Guillard', 'Philippe Guillard', 'Gérard Lanvin, Olivier Marchal, Camille Aguilar, Jean-François Cayrey, Anne Girouard, Philippine Leroy-Beaulieu, Laurent Olmedo, Souad Arsane', null, 'Franck and Karine are offered a job on a cruise ship they can’t refuse. The only problem: their daughter Camille has to study for her finals but has other ideas of fun in mind instead… No problem! To straighten his daughter out and set her to work, Franck calls on his father André, a retired captain from the national police, hopelessly uptight and rigid. With military discipline, Camille’s finals will be a success! But this is the moment when the second grandfather Teddy, an eccentric and wild former nightclub manager and the total opposite of the strict André, chooses to return after many years abroad... Living together promises to be complicated…', 'Franck and Karine are offered a job on a cruise ship they can’t refuse. The only problem: their daughter Camille has to study for her finals but has other ideas of fun in mind instead… No problem! To straighten his daughter out and set her to work, Franck calls on his father André, a retired captain from the national police, hopelessly uptight and rigid. With military discipline, Camille’s finals will be a success! But this is the moment when the second grandfather Teddy, an eccentric and wild former nightclub manager and the total opposite of the strict André, chooses to return after many years abroad... Living together promises to be complicated…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHwZrgiTDrnTmcsp0x223RwynoN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613367'),
  ('1096349514106238048', 'Papicha', 2019, 'Drama', 'Benjamin Gens, Rachid Bacha, Meziane Nerdjes', 'Mounia Meddour', 'Lyna Khoudri, Shirine Boutella, Amira Hilda Douaouda, Nadia Kaci, Yasin Houicha, Zahra Doumandji, Aida Guechoud, Meriem Medjkane', null, 'Nedjma, an 18-year-old student passionate about fashion design refuses to let the tragic events of the Algerian Civil War keep her from experiencing a normal life. As the social climate becomes more conservative, she rejects the new bans set by the radicals and decides to put on a fashion show.', 'Nedjma, an 18-year-old student passionate about fashion design refuses to let the tragic events of the Algerian Civil War keep her from experiencing a normal life. As the social climate becomes more conservative, she rejects the new bans set by the radicals and decides to put on a fashion show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5SsvyPphkVkByyh0pfzLe00CC2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592807'),
  ('398039047537124082', 'Papillon', 2017, 'Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Michael Noer, Hagen Bogdanski, Milica Đorđević', 'Dalton Trumbo', 'Charlie Hunnam, Rami Malek, Christopher Fairbank, Eve Hewson, Michael Socha, Brian Vernel, Nicholas Asbury, Louisa Pili', 'R', 'Henri “Papillon” Charrière, a safecracker from the Parisian underworld, is wrongfully convicted and sentenced to life imprisonment in the penal colony of French Guiana, where he forges a strong friendship with Louis Dega, a counterfeiter who needs his protection.', 'Henri “Papillon” Charrière, a safecracker from the Parisian underworld, is wrongfully convicted and sentenced to life imprisonment in the penal colony of French Guiana, where he forges a strong friendship with Louis Dega, a counterfeiter who needs his protection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahF5c6vyP8HWMqIwlhecbRALkjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433498'),
  ('1065918904824364805', 'Papita 2da Base', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Luis Carlos Hueck, Guillermo Pérez, Marianne Amelinckx', 'Luis Carlos Hueck', 'Jean Pierre Agostini De Risi, Juliette Pardau, Juan Andrés Belgrave, Ana Karina Terrero, José Roberto Díaz, Vantroy Sánchez, Marcela Girón, Antonieta Colón', null, 'Andrés and Julissa now parents to a seven year old Carlitos struggle to live happily as a family despite being fervent fans of rival teams and of Vicente''s (Julissa''s father) disapproval.', 'Andrés and Julissa now parents to a seven year old Carlitos struggle to live happily as a family despite being fervent fans of rival teams and of Vicente''s (Julissa''s father) disapproval.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiosoBL56xM80Nf3dKlu5gmTBYa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493527'),
  ('431264803950147305', 'Papita, maní, tostón', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Luis Carlos Hueck, Luis Carlos Rodríguez', 'Luis Carlos Hueck', 'Jean Pierre Agostini De Risi, Juliette Pardau, Vicente Peña, Vantroy Sánchez, Juan Andres Belgrave, José Roberto Díaz, Antonieta Colón, Elias Muñoz', null, 'Andres (Jean Pierre Agostini) it''s a fan of Los Leones del Caracas one of the principal baseball teams of Venezuela. Julissa (Juliette Pardau) it''s a fan of Los Navegantes del Magallanes, the rival team. One day Andres gets tickets to see the game in Magallanes VIP Zone. He meets Julissa and her dad who is not only fan but one of the team''s managers. Andres and Julissa will fall in love and will have to pretend to be fan of the other''s team. But soon trouble will arise.', 'Andres (Jean Pierre Agostini) it''s a fan of Los Leones del Caracas one of the principal baseball teams of Venezuela. Julissa (Juliette Pardau) it''s a fan of Los Navegantes del Magallanes, the rival team. One day Andres gets tickets to see the game in Magallanes VIP Zone. He meets Julissa and her dad who is not only fan but one of the team''s managers. Andres and Julissa will fall in love and will have to pretend to be fan of the other''s team. But soon trouble will arise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hF3I0Zd54EOgt9PuI1yXDmsx4gb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248424'),
  ('816954692296973406', 'Pappa ante Portas', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Vicco von Bülow, Gérard Vandenberg', 'Vicco von Bülow', 'Vicco von Bülow, Evelyn Hamann, Gerrit Schmidt-Foß, Irm Hermann, Hans Peter Korff, Inge Wolffberg, Dagmar Biener, Ortrud Beginnen', null, 'Heinrich Lohse, a strict and highly efficient purchasing manager at a company bulk-orders 40 tons of mustard and enough typewriting paper for 40 years just to get discount. Heinrich''s boss decides it’s time for him to retire early. Heinrich suddenly finds himself with nothing to do—except micromanage his household, much to the dismay of his wife Renate and their son Dieter', 'Heinrich Lohse, a strict and highly efficient purchasing manager at a company bulk-orders 40 tons of mustard and enough typewriting paper for 40 years just to get discount. Heinrich''s boss decides it’s time for him to retire early. Heinrich suddenly finds himself with nothing to do—except micromanage his household, much to the dismay of his wife Renate and their son Dieter', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtJOj6mkZ8kKwDNjUgZmYwEforq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4695'),
  ('285524642778997842', 'Pappayude Swantham Appoos', 1992, 'Drama, Family', 'Fazil', 'Fazil', 'Mammootty, Suresh Gopi, Shobana, Seena Dadi, Badusha Mohammed, Sankaradi, K.P.A.C. Sunny, Raveendran', null, 'Balachandran had resorted to his work after he is unable to cope up with the death of his wife, Bhama. During the process, he neglects his only son, Appu. When Appu returns home for his school vacation, Balachandran promises to take him on a lot of trips, but is unable to do any as he is caught up with work. Pappayude Swantham Appoos movie is all about the bonds between the father and his son.', 'Balachandran had resorted to his work after he is unable to cope up with the death of his wife, Bhama. During the process, he neglects his only son, Appu. When Appu returns home for his school vacation, Balachandran promises to take him on a lot of trips, but is unable to do any as he is caught up with work. Pappayude Swantham Appoos movie is all about the bonds between the father and his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ik0OJeGrUvJOshJkWQYYelTWF1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181470'),
  ('924350456054915000', 'Paprika', 2006, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Animation', 'Michiya Kato, Michiya Kato, Masafumi Mima', 'Satoshi Kon, Seishi Minakami', 'Megumi Hayashibara, Tohru Emori, Katsunosuke Hori, Toru Furuya, Akio Otsuka, Koichi Yamadera, Hideyuki Tanaka, Satoshi Kon', 'R', 'When a machine that allows therapists to enter their patient''s dreams is stolen, all hell breaks loose. Only a young female therapist can stop it and recover it before damage is done: Paprika.', 'When a machine that allows therapists to enter their patient''s dreams is stolen, all hell breaks loose. Only a young female therapist can stop it and recover it before damage is done: Paprika.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLUUr474Go1DfeN1HLjE3rnZXBq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4977'),
  ('1091701828009542745', 'Par accident', 2015, 'Drama', 'Elin Kirschfink, Camille Fontaine', 'Camille Fontaine', 'Hafsia Herzi, Émilie Dequenne, Mounir Margoum, Emmanuel Salinger, Thelma Deroche Marc, Roméo Escala, Béatrice Mendiola, Anne-Claire Carret', null, 'One evening, Amra, a young Algerian living in France, accidentally runs over a pedestrian. Riddled with guilt and the certainty that she will lose her French identity papers, Amra is miraculously proved innocent by Angélique, a beautiful redhead who is as open and without any hang-ups as Amra is unsociable and introverted. The two young women become friends, but then Angélique''s attitude becomes increasingly strange, indeed, even troubling...', 'One evening, Amra, a young Algerian living in France, accidentally runs over a pedestrian. Riddled with guilt and the certainty that she will lose her French identity papers, Amra is miraculously proved innocent by Angélique, a beautiful redhead who is as open and without any hang-ups as Amra is unsociable and introverted. The two young women become friends, but then Angélique''s attitude becomes increasingly strange, indeed, even troubling...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGo4wMvBqiZ9zMlmbfivAdiOmBX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363861'),
  ('1033140113824982777', 'Par instinct', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Nathalie Marchak', 'Nathalie Marchak', 'Alexandra Lamy, Brontis Jodorowsky, Sonja Wanda, Ralph Amoussou, Bruno Todeschini, Farida Ouchani, Ibtissam Laaroussi, Khadija Adly', null, 'At the pinnacle of her career as a lawyer, Lucie goes to Morocco on a business trip, a long way from home and her husband. On her arrival in Tangier, she is struck by the chaotic agitation of the city, where it seems that anything could happen. When, out of nowhere, a Nigerian teenager gives Lucie her baby and asks her to protect it, she is completely thrown off balance. Braving the dark corners of the city, Lucie will attempt to rescue this young woman from a dangerous human trafficking ring. But she hadn''t foreseen the growing attachment she feels toward the child...', 'At the pinnacle of her career as a lawyer, Lucie goes to Morocco on a business trip, a long way from home and her husband. On her arrival in Tangier, she is struck by the chaotic agitation of the city, where it seems that anything could happen. When, out of nowhere, a Nigerian teenager gives Lucie her baby and asks her to protect it, she is completely thrown off balance. Braving the dark corners of the city, Lucie will attempt to rescue this young woman from a dangerous human trafficking ring. But she hadn''t foreseen the growing attachment she feels toward the child...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1R4SzB6hX0bsUlFttTXHd7ieeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442267'),
  ('62851192793417804', 'Para toda la muerte', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Fran Fernández-Pardo, Alfonso Sánchez, Carlos Crespo', 'Ana Graciani', 'Alberto López, Estefanía de los Santos, Alfonso Sánchez, Joaquín Ortega, Marta Tomasa, Fernanda Orazi, Francisco Rodríguez ''Padi'', María Cabrera', null, 'José has spent the last 8 years preparing the exams to become a civil servant in Spain. After his tests, he celebrates with friends and family, only to receive the news that he did not actually secure a place.', 'José has spent the last 8 years preparing the exams to become a civil servant in Spain. After his tests, he celebrates with friends and family, only to receive the news that he did not actually secure a place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvpVTlgUheKxiXsE80qnKiEnh81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645691'),
  ('87670294786229824', 'Parable', 2026, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Ritchey Cable', 'Ritchey Cable', 'Brian Duong, Wyomi Reed, Zarrette Rogers, Raquel Lebish, Sabrina Broyles', null, 'Six strangers awake trapped inside a loft with no memory of how they got there. Time counts down as the 6 confront secrets, suspicion, and themselves in a tense, character-driven mystery.', 'Six strangers awake trapped inside a loft with no memory of how they got there. Time counts down as the 6 confront secrets, suspicion, and themselves in a tense, character-driven mystery.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fz9JgMuNcTIyU6VwEJkj2Zr6IfrK.jpg', 'plex:movie:parable-2026'),
  ('5163546582342065', 'Parabola', 1937, 'Animation', 'Mary Ellen Bute, Ted Nemeth', null, null, null, 'Parabola is a celebration of film’s ability to create new ways of seeing the forms around us. Creating juxtapositions between light/shadow, stasis/motion, and form/music, this black-and-white short invites us to see the parabolic curve, or “nature’s poetry,” as both invigorating and beguiling.', 'Parabola is a celebration of film’s ability to create new ways of seeing the forms around us. Creating juxtapositions between light/shadow, stasis/motion, and form/music, this black-and-white short invites us to see the parabolic curve, or “nature’s poetry,” as both invigorating and beguiling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hLCrqPrGg3bvzuwPtoBsaUSGMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219452'),
  ('330922009276665338', 'Paracelsus', 1943, 'Drama, History', 'G.W. Pabst, Bruno Stephan', 'Kurt Heuser', 'Werner Krauss, Mathias Wieman, Annelies Reinhold, Harald Kreutzberg, Peter Martin Urtel, Fritz Rasp, Josef Sieber, Harry Langewisch', null, 'The story of the Renaissance-era Swiss physician, alchemist and astrologer Philippus Aureolus Theophrastus Bombastus von Hohenheim, better known to the world as Paracelsus.', 'The story of the Renaissance-era Swiss physician, alchemist and astrologer Philippus Aureolus Theophrastus Bombastus von Hohenheim, better known to the world as Paracelsus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEqe6GtVj9XVrgZVBO48Df80dxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246939'),
  ('331125585086396411', 'Parachute', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Brittany Snow, Kristen Correll, Joey Montenarello', 'Becca Gleason, Brittany Snow', 'Courtney Eaton, Thomas Mann, Francesca Reale, Gina Rodriguez, Joel McHale, Dave Bautista, Kid Cudi, Celeste Oliva', 'NR', 'Riley has recently been discharged from rehab after struggling with food and body image issues. She soon meets Ethan and finds herself navigating the line between unconditional love and a new addiction.', 'Riley has recently been discharged from rehab after struggling with food and body image issues. She soon meets Ethan and finds herself navigating the line between unconditional love and a new addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGwFRwsqkCX1eMsMZCD0tgGA8Fr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:953713'),
  ('729589408502855331', 'Parachute Jumper', 1933, 'Drama', 'Alfred E. Green, James Van Trees', 'John Francis Larkin', 'Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Bette Davis, Frank McHugh, Claire Dodd, Leo Carrillo, Harold Huber, Thomas E. Jackson, Leon Ames', 'NR', 'An Air Force washout and his buddy room with a pretty young lady. Desperate for jobs during the Depression, they finally land employment with the mob.', 'An Air Force washout and his buddy room with a pretty young lady. Desperate for jobs during the Depression, they finally land employment with the mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lH3kQo4Q6O6OoIVVcPkmxgOMkpd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160466'),
  ('47164738710302646', 'Parade', 1974, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Jacques Tati, Jean Badal, Gunnar Fischer', 'Jacques Tati', 'Jacques Tati, Michèle Brabo, Karl Kossmayer, Pierre Brama, Pia Colombo, Johnny Lonn, Jan Swahn, Bertil Berglund', null, 'For his final film, Jacques Tati takes his camera to the circus, where the director himself serves as master of ceremonies. Though it features many spectacles, including clowns, jugglers, acrobats, contortionists, and more, Parade also focuses on the spectators, making this stripped-down work a testament to the communion between audience and entertainment.', 'For his final film, Jacques Tati takes his camera to the circus, where the director himself serves as master of ceremonies. Though it features many spectacles, including clowns, jugglers, acrobats, contortionists, and more, Parade also focuses on the spectators, making this stripped-down work a testament to the communion between audience and entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pa1jp4ItzasTzl8L04WZhx6leFL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58655'),
  ('606268758286331490', 'Parade', 2010, 'Drama', 'Isao Yukisada, Jun Fukumoto', 'Isao Yukisada', 'Keisuke Koide, Shihori Kanjiya, Karina, Tatsuya Fujiwara, Kento Hayashi, Terunosuke Takezai, Maho Nonami, Yuri Nakamura', null, 'The story of a strange living situation in a 2LDK apartment in suburban Tokyo. There are five residents ranging in age from eighteen to twenty-eight. They are not in any way romantically involved with one another, but one can see subtle hints of affection and friendship among them. In the end, however, none of them really know each other.', 'The story of a strange living situation in a 2LDK apartment in suburban Tokyo. There are five residents ranging in age from eighteen to twenty-eight. They are not in any way romantically involved with one another, but one can see subtle hints of affection and friendship among them. In the end, however, none of them really know each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRXnn54qIJZD8lQHkdjOCXyk5e2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52870'),
  ('121245924372998437', 'Parade of the Award Nominees', 1932, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, 'NR', 'Mickey Mouse grand marshals a parade of 1932 Academy Award nominees. Minnie Mouse leads the marching band and Clarabelle Cow rolls out a carpet for the celebrities. Wallace Beery marches in boxing gloves with Jackie Cooper as his footman. Lynn Fontanne and Alfred Lunt walk the route together. Helen Hayes shuffles down the carpet. Fredric March appears as both Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde. Marie Dressler follows, trailing a corset and an alarm clock. Pluto brings up the rear of the parade.', 'Mickey Mouse grand marshals a parade of 1932 Academy Award nominees. Minnie Mouse leads the marching band and Clarabelle Cow rolls out a carpet for the celebrities. Wallace Beery marches in boxing gloves with Jackie Cooper as his footman. Lynn Fontanne and Alfred Lunt walk the route together. Helen Hayes shuffles down the carpet. Fredric March appears as both Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde. Marie Dressler follows, trailing a corset and an alarm clock. Pluto brings up the rear of the parade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBE7Y0n6gJZz3aAaIN2ZXbyYIHf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161605'),
  ('320801584174759477', 'Parade of the Planets', 1984, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Vadim Abdrashitov, Vladimir Shevtsik, Yan Pototsky', 'Aleksandr Mindadze', 'Oleg Borisov, Liliya Gritsenko, Aleksei Zharkov, Pyotr Zaychenko, Sergey Nikonenko, Aleksandr Pashutin, Boris Romanov, Sergey Shakurov', null, 'A rare astronomical phenomenon — the parade of planets — has a strange effect on several men. The heroes of the film — an astrophysicist, locksmith, salesman, architect, loader, trolley bus driver — are called up for military training, which ends ahead of time. There is a strange pause in their life — no one knows where they are, no one is waiting for them, and they themselves can not rush anywhere. This short respite in a hasty and busy life gives the heroes the opportunity to experience strong and very important feelings for them.', 'A rare astronomical phenomenon — the parade of planets — has a strange effect on several men. The heroes of the film — an astrophysicist, locksmith, salesman, architect, loader, trolley bus driver — are called up for military training, which ends ahead of time. There is a strange pause in their life — no one knows where they are, no one is waiting for them, and they themselves can not rush anywhere. This short respite in a hasty and busy life gives the heroes the opportunity to experience strong and very important feelings for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqxpkKKCshDGDiQ3jEbBnE41RlM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143040'),
  ('837147093657751280', 'Paradise', 1982, 'Romance, Adventure', 'Stuart Gillard, Adam Greenberg', 'Stuart Gillard', 'Willie Aames, Phoebe Cates, Tuvia Tavi, Richard Curnock, Neil Vipond, Aviva Marks, Yosef Shiloach, Yitzhak Ne''eman', 'R', 'After their caravan is attacked and their respective families butchered by Arab marauders, teenagers David and Sarah flee across the desert. But the desert is filled with danger from the elements, animals and the unwholesome appetite of the Jackal, a sheik who wants Sarah for himself. However, the desert also holds temptation and love. David and Sarah hide out in an oasis and build a life for themselves, discovering each other in new ways.', 'After their caravan is attacked and their respective families butchered by Arab marauders, teenagers David and Sarah flee across the desert. But the desert is filled with danger from the elements, animals and the unwholesome appetite of the Jackal, a sheik who wants Sarah for himself. However, the desert also holds temptation and love. David and Sarah hide out in an oasis and build a life for themselves, discovering each other in new ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPWQ02RbO82ijIede7SYHcnhzoT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23942'),
  ('862039735065564986', 'Paradise', 1985, 'Animation', 'Ishu Patel', null, null, null, 'A magnificent bird performs for the Emperor inside a glittering palace. Its plumage is a blaze of colour. A blackbird, watching enviously, strives to acquire what he so desperately covets, only to discover that a golden cage can''t compete with the open skies.', 'A magnificent bird performs for the Emperor inside a glittering palace. Its plumage is a blaze of colour. A blackbird, watching enviously, strives to acquire what he so desperately covets, only to discover that a golden cage can''t compete with the open skies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giH4Z34jlNsM2fH3dcVPExVCNz6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209548'),
  ('125224258731072182', 'Paradise', 1991, 'Drama', 'Mary Agnes Donoghue, Jerzy Zieliński', 'Mary Agnes Donoghue', 'Melanie Griffith, Don Johnson, Elijah Wood, Thora Birch, Sheila McCarthy, Eve Gordon, Louise Latham, Greg Travis', 'PG-13', 'A 10-year-old boy spends a summer in the country with a childless couple and a precocious girl.', 'A 10-year-old boy spends a summer in the country with a childless couple and a precocious girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZ5va4MN4AMNhkRM0bl7VuvZjpE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68430'),
  ('430293213548856609', 'Paradise', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Diablo Cody, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Diablo Cody', 'Julianne Hough, Russell Brand, Octavia Spencer, Holly Hunter, Nick Offerman, Kathleen Rose Perkins, Iliza Shlesinger, Phil Austin', 'PG-13', 'After surviving a plane crash a young conservative woman suffers a crisis of faith.', 'After surviving a plane crash a young conservative woman suffers a crisis of faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghBJXpOeQ6IQN00Eq2d9WVtnefH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152756'),
  ('871511343296995000', 'Paradise', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Alain Cavalier', null, 'Nine d''Urso, Thibault Duteil, Maia Fontaine', null, '"Since childhood, I''ve had the good fortune of going through two mini depressions of happiness, and I''m serenely awaiting the third. This alone is enough for me to believe in a certain beauty to life and to have the pleasure of attempting to film it in all its forms (trees, animals, gods, humans...) and to do so when love is intense. The filmmaker has lost a part of innocence. It''s so difficult to spot it around you, so difficult not to lose it during a film shoot. I''m grateful to those who you look at on screen. To stand up to time, I''ve a tactic, which is to dig into my stock of emotions and old images. Not so as to find what will never come back, but to discover the signs of spring in winter. This allows me to begin another day with an easy, light step." (Alain Cavalier)', '"Since childhood, I''ve had the good fortune of going through two mini depressions of happiness, and I''m serenely awaiting the third. This alone is enough for me to believe in a certain beauty to life and to have the pleasure of attempting to film it in all its forms (trees, animals, gods, humans...) and to do so when love is intense. The filmmaker has lost a part of innocence. It''s so difficult to spot it around you, so difficult not to lose it during a film shoot. I''m grateful to those who you look at on screen. To stand up to time, I''ve a tactic, which is to dig into my stock of emotions and old images. Not so as to find what will never come back, but to discover the signs of spring in winter. This allows me to begin another day with an easy, light step." (Alain Cavalier)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xnHXAnqvP9S6hS4a8BcyXQTKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294721'),
  ('988116659320643166', 'Paradise', 2016, 'Drama, War', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Aleksandr Simonov, Elina Ternyaeva', 'Elena Kiseleva, Andrei Konchalovsky', 'Yuliya Vysotskaya, Philippe Duquesne, Viktor Sukhorukov, Vera Voronkova, Jakob Diehl, Christian Clauss, Peter Kurth, Natalya Kurdyubova', null, 'The historical drama set during the Second World War centres on three people whose paths cross: a Russian aristocratic emigrant and member of the French resistance, a French collaborator and a high-ranking German SS officer.', 'The historical drama set during the Second World War centres on three people whose paths cross: a Russian aristocratic emigrant and member of the French resistance, a French collaborator and a high-ranking German SS officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kI3BSS2pzKimLa8uHk6ap8Ole3o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408539'),
  ('216210717295428548', 'Paradise', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Michael Fissneider, Ronny Bregulla, Bryony James', 'Peter Kocyla, Boris Kunz, Simon Amberger', 'Kostja Ullmann, Corinna Kirchhoff, Marlene Tanczik, Iris Berben, Lisa-Marie Koroll, Lorna Ishema, Alina Levshin, Numan Acar', 'R', 'A man sees the dark side of the time-manipulating biotech company he works for when a crushing debt forces his wife to give up 40 years of her own life.', 'A man sees the dark side of the time-manipulating biotech company he works for when a crushing debt forces his wife to give up 40 years of her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGz88hNPcHUJkUx7MPm0Ue6GZt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1140066'),
  ('915385767176247995', 'Paradise Alley', 1978, 'Action, Drama', 'Sylvester Stallone, László Kovács', 'Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Lee Canalito, Armand Assante, Frank McRae, Anne Archer, Kevin Conway, Terry Funk, Joyce Ingalls', 'PG', 'Three Italian-American brothers, living in the slums of 1940''s New York City, try to help each other with one''s wrestling career using one brother''s promotional skills and another brother''s con-artist tactics to thwart a sleazy manager.', 'Three Italian-American brothers, living in the slums of 1940''s New York City, try to help each other with one''s wrestling career using one brother''s promotional skills and another brother''s con-artist tactics to thwart a sleazy manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tF3YenU48fn1Ml0AMRvsG6nSP9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23916'),
  ('968500040340501443', 'Paradise America', 1990, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lauri Törhönen, Esa Vuorinen, Raili Salmi', 'Lauri Törhönen', 'Kari Sorvali, Mari Rantasila, Jari Järvimaa, Åke Lindman, Markku Huhtamo, Markku Toikka, Tor Planting, Jorma Markkula', null, 'Finnish friends escape taxes to Florida.', 'Finnish friends escape taxes to Florida.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onWtRRYCMVJkChmYazH7lQJBof8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401212'),
  ('1013166141876497409', 'Paradise and Back', 1964, 'Drama', 'Gabriel Axel, Tom Hedegaard, Jørgen Skov', 'Peter Ronild', 'Poul Reichhardt, Lise Ringheim, Nina Larsen, Christoffer Bro, Kirsten Søberg, Preben Lerdorff Rye, Erik Paaske, Guri Richter', null, 'Tonnemann lives in one of the wooden sheds at the far end of Islands Brygge, close to Copenhagen''s landfill site. But in 1928, he wants to leave this environment behind – to go where the air is fresh and life may offer both security and meaning. He is already on his way with his packed suitcase to sign on to a long-distance boat when a lovely girl gets in his way with her little red sports car.', 'Tonnemann lives in one of the wooden sheds at the far end of Islands Brygge, close to Copenhagen''s landfill site. But in 1928, he wants to leave this environment behind – to go where the air is fresh and life may offer both security and meaning. He is already on his way with his packed suitcase to sign on to a long-distance boat when a lovely girl gets in his way with her little red sports car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCUicCSB3Q6TPdXx1YP89zUCalH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358345'),
  ('1122322957590005760', 'Paradise at Mothers’ Feet 2', 2026, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Ruslan Akun', 'Emil Esenaliev, Ruslan Akun', 'Stanislav Bondarenko, Emil Esenaliev, Omar Alibutaev', null, 'Old acquaintances - Adil, a guy with a kind soul and the intelligence of a child, and his nine-year-old friend Samir, a smart and brave boy - embark on a challenging journey from Kyrgyzstan across Russia to Moscow to fulfill the boy''s dream.', 'Old acquaintances - Adil, a guy with a kind soul and the intelligence of a child, and his nine-year-old friend Samir, a smart and brave boy - embark on a challenging journey from Kyrgyzstan across Russia to Moscow to fulfill the boy''s dream.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FqgKDLYCUX3ndb7Ztu7xhUerWqhX.jpg', 'plex:movie:beyish-2-apama-kat'),
  ('1147978450263555371', 'Paradise Beach', 2019, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Xavier Durringer', 'Xavier Durringer, Jean Miez', 'Sami Bouajila, Tewfik Jallab, Mélanie Doutey, Hugo Becker, Kool Shen, Hubert Koundé, Seth Gueko, Flore Bonaventura', null, 'A team of former robbers arrived at Paradise: Phuket, southern Thailand. Now traders, they are happy days. Until the day when the devil arrives: Mehdi, sentenced to 15 years in prison during the robbery, comes to recover his share of the cake.', 'A team of former robbers arrived at Paradise: Phuket, southern Thailand. Now traders, they are happy days. Until the day when the devil arrives: Mehdi, sentenced to 15 years in prison during the robbery, comes to recover his share of the cake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0q0ATqmFWmh5MpIOvE2ZBc321n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571650'),
  ('912011567021385551', 'Paradise Calling', 1988, 'Comedy, Mystery, Romance', 'Arielle Dombasle', null, 'Omar Sharif, Arielle Dombasle, Hippolyte Girardot, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Pierre Vaneck, Françoise Christophe, Carole Davis, Martine Kelly', null, 'Elise is content being the lover of Alex, a wealthy magnate who lavishes her with attention and money. When she gets religious and decides to hide from him in a French convent, Alex hires agents to bring her back.', 'Elise is content being the lover of Alex, a wealthy magnate who lavishes her with attention and money. When she gets religious and decides to hide from him in a French convent, Alex hires agents to bring her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcs8mKlGIuOoFGsNE4Cspqa209R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285975'),
  ('697089408989047668', 'Paradise Canyon', 1935, 'Action, Western', 'Carl Pierson, Archie Stout', 'Robert Emmett Tansey', 'John Wayne, Marion Burns, Reed Howes, Earle Hodgins, Gino Corrado, Yakima Canutt, Perry Murdock, Gordon Clifford', 'NR', 'John Wyatt is a government agent sent to smash a counterfeiting operation near the Mexican border. Joining Doc Carter''s medicine show they arrive in the town where Curly Joe, who once framed Carter, resides.', 'John Wyatt is a government agent sent to smash a counterfeiting operation near the Mexican border. Joining Doc Carter''s medicine show they arrive in the town where Curly Joe, who once framed Carter, resides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2UbntV2xd9D24f7SuzLxOpnPRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23286'),
  ('1127748634242047144', 'Paradise City', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Chuck Russell, Austin Schmidt, Aaron Steele-Nicholson', 'Corey Large, Edward Drake, Chuck Russell', 'John Travolta, Bruce Willis, Blake Jenner, Stephen Dorff, Corey Large, Branscombe Richmond, Lorenzo Antonucci, Kate Katzman', 'R', 'Renegade bounty hunter Ryan Swan must carve his way through the Hawaiian crime world to wreak vengeance on the kingpin who murdered his father.', 'Renegade bounty hunter Ryan Swan must carve his way through the Hawaiian crime world to wreak vengeance on the kingpin who murdered his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdmmd437QdjcCls8yCQxrH5YYM4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829799'),
  ('414436183474739209', 'Paradise Cove', 2021, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Jeb Barrows, Monica Timmerman, Jeb Barrows', 'Sherry Klein', 'Todd Grinnell, Kristin Bauer, Mena Suvari, Eddie Goines, Krista Allen, Horacio Galaviz, Eddie Rivera, Rubén Garfias', 'R', 'A contractor and his wife move to Malibu to flip his mother’s beach house, but are terrorized by the deranged homeless lady living under the house.', 'A contractor and his wife move to Malibu to flip his mother’s beach house, but are terrorized by the deranged homeless lady living under the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrs7xjq4iwZvk5bfOEGFLvr4B3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790894'),
  ('819357341414630921', 'Paradise for All', 1982, 'Drama, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Alain Jessua, Jacques Robin', 'André Ruellan, Alain Jessua', 'Patrick Dewaere, Jacques Dutronc, Fanny Cottençon, Stéphane Audran, Philippe Léotard, François Dyrek, Anna Gaylor, Jean-Paul Muel', null, 'Doctor Valois has invented the "flashage", a cure for depressed people. After having tested it on monkeys, he tries with a first human patient, Alain Durieux. This is great success, everybody''s happy except may be Alain''s wife, Jeanne, who''s worrying about the changes in Alain''s personality. Other patients use the treatment with similar successes, and Valois''s happy about it. But the monkeys are changing: non-cured ones are made mad by the over-stability and stereotyped behaviour of the cured ones. So are the humans. When Valois realises he can''t stop the process, he decides to "flash" himself.', 'Doctor Valois has invented the "flashage", a cure for depressed people. After having tested it on monkeys, he tries with a first human patient, Alain Durieux. This is great success, everybody''s happy except may be Alain''s wife, Jeanne, who''s worrying about the changes in Alain''s personality. Other patients use the treatment with similar successes, and Valois''s happy about it. But the monkeys are changing: non-cured ones are made mad by the over-stability and stereotyped behaviour of the cured ones. So are the humans. When Valois realises he can''t stop the process, he decides to "flash" himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arFohWX8FEUHsXxNczcW0SJuZCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64344'),
  ('675813735826822380', 'Paradise for two', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pier Belloni', 'Antonio De Santis, Gianluca Bomprezzi, Fabrizio Donvito', 'Vanessa Incontrada, Giampaolo Morelli, Ricky Memphis, Laura Esquivel, Gastón Soffritti, Dino Abbrescia, Claudio Castrogiovanni, Florencia Raggi', null, 'A cynical and opportunist building contractor falls deeply in love with biologist/Greenpeace woman. The only way for him to conquer her is to pretend to be an ecologist.', 'A cynical and opportunist building contractor falls deeply in love with biologist/Greenpeace woman. The only way for him to conquer her is to pretend to be an ecologist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Rj9fO0gq4yihpwV3Pm5uguXkSf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182850'),
  ('527341252737739041', 'Paradise Found', 2003, 'Drama', 'Mario Andreacchio, Rachel Evans, Geoffrey Simpson', 'Mario Andreacchio, John Goldsmith', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Alun Armstrong, Nastassja Kinski, Thomas Heinze, Chris Haywood, Nicholas Hope, Sarah Lina Brown, Karel Bělohradský', null, 'Paradise Found is a biography about the painter Paul Gauguin. Focusing on his personal conflict between citizen life and his family life and the art scene in Frane. In an incredible imagery montage Gauguin manages to make a successful living in the South Pacific, while being in opposition to France.', 'Paradise Found is a biography about the painter Paul Gauguin. Focusing on his personal conflict between citizen life and his family life and the art scene in Frane. In an incredible imagery montage Gauguin manages to make a successful living in the South Pacific, while being in opposition to France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5tYnEeCAPODbEbbwYmNd8Y9seA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206'),
  ('192113415388544543', 'Paradise Highway', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Anna Gutto, John Christian Rosenlund', 'Anna Gutto', 'Juliette Binoche, Frank Grillo, Morgan Freeman, Hala Finley, Cameron Monaghan, Veronica Ferres, Christiane Seidel, Jackie Dallas', 'R', 'A truck driver has been forced to smuggle illicit cargo to save her brother from a deadly prison gang. With FBI operatives hot on her trail, Sally''s conscience is challenged when the final package turns out to be a teenage girl.', 'A truck driver has been forced to smuggle illicit cargo to save her brother from a deadly prison gang. With FBI operatives hot on her trail, Sally''s conscience is challenged when the final package turns out to be a teenage girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ahZgaFAbWoKMfJHhmhZDrdStgD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939979'),
  ('993218750340647088', 'Paradise Hills', 2019, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Alice Waddington, Josu Inchaustegui', 'Nacho Vigalondo, Brian DeLeeuw', 'Emma Roberts, Eiza González, Milla Jovovich, Danielle Macdonald, Awkwafina, Jeremy Irvine, Arnaud Valois, Hunter Tremayne', 'NR', 'A young woman is sent to Paradise Hills to be reformed, only to learn that the high-class facility''s beautiful facade hides a sinister secret.', 'A young woman is sent to Paradise Hills to be reformed, only to learn that the high-class facility''s beautiful facade hides a sinister secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7V1N8vMPNDw6be3MDiA4DC0s4Bv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487083'),
  ('47394708609846436', 'Paradise in Service', 2014, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Doze Niu Cheng-Tse', 'Tseng Li-ting, Doze Niu Cheng-Tse', 'Ethan Juan, Wan Qian, Ivy Chen, Chen Jianbin, Phoebe Lin, Miao Ke-li, Chen Yi-wen, Daniel Chen', null, 'Set in the island Kinmen, often seen as the most dangerous military base because it’s geographically close to China, "Paradise in Service" follows the adventure of a boy who serves his military service in Unit 831 from 1969 to 1972, in preparation for a war that could erupt anytime. Through an unlucky lottery draw result, Pao, a twenty-something young man from Southern Taiwan has to serve the military in the remote and perilous Kinmen. Moreover, he is assigned to the Sea Dragon (ARB), a unit noted for the toughest physical training. It never occurs to Pao, however, that the greatest challenge in his military service lies not in the Sea Dragon but in Unit 831, a special task he is later appointed to… In this peculiar assignment, Pao vows to keep his virginity against all odds.', 'Set in the island Kinmen, often seen as the most dangerous military base because it’s geographically close to China, "Paradise in Service" follows the adventure of a boy who serves his military service in Unit 831 from 1969 to 1972, in preparation for a war that could erupt anytime. Through an unlucky lottery draw result, Pao, a twenty-something young man from Southern Taiwan has to serve the military in the remote and perilous Kinmen. Moreover, he is assigned to the Sea Dragon (ARB), a unit noted for the toughest physical training. It never occurs to Pao, however, that the greatest challenge in his military service lies not in the Sea Dragon but in Unit 831, a special task he is later appointed to… In this peculiar assignment, Pao vows to keep his virginity against all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vl6TzTNkEfkJaXyOEbrHsVvt78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287888'),
  ('819309175706004828', 'Paradise Is Burning', 2023, 'Drama', 'Mika Gustafson, Sine Vadstrup Brooker', 'Mika Gustafson, Alexander Öhrstrand', 'Bianca Delbravo, Dilvin Asaad, Safira Mossberg, Ida Engvoll, Mitja Sirén, Marta Oldenburg, Andrea Edwards, Isabella Kjellberg', null, 'Left to their own devices by their absent mother, Laura and her two sisters revel in the excitement of freedom, letting their days unfold without the constraints of adult supervision. However, when Laura receives a call that threatens to place them in foster care, she frantically searches for a substitute mother to avoid this fate.', 'Left to their own devices by their absent mother, Laura and her two sisters revel in the excitement of freedom, letting their days unfold without the constraints of adult supervision. However, when Laura receives a call that threatens to place them in foster care, she frantically searches for a substitute mother to avoid this fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5T4iGsBgD4qIzjlBK9EwqwiITeO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872508'),
  ('1097843429889423860', 'Paradise Kiss', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Takehiko Shinjo, Hikaru Yasuda, Masashige Nakanishi', 'Kenji Bando', 'Keiko Kitagawa, Osamu Mukai, Aya Omasa, Shunji Igarashi, Kento Kaku, Yusuke Yamamoto, Natsuki Kato, Hitomi Takahashi', null, 'Hyasaka Yukari only wants one thing: to enter the college that her mom wants. One day, she meets an extravagant group that loves fashion. They were searching for a model and Yukari fits their ideal model. From now Yukari will know the world of fashion and modeling, and what she really wants.', 'Hyasaka Yukari only wants one thing: to enter the college that her mom wants. One day, she meets an extravagant group that loves fashion. They were searching for a model and Yukari fits their ideal model. From now Yukari will know the world of fashion and modeling, and what she really wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyNH5XUHTStR7IhpBeOJoK7jqpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78214'),
  ('436676738829456393', 'Paradise Lost', 1999, 'Action', 'Herb Freed, Mario García Joya', 'Herb Freed, Marion Segal', 'William Forsythe, Marina Sirtis, Nigel Havers, Miguel Ángel Suárez, Adamari López, Jonathan Dwayne, Ernesto Concepción, Julio Axel Landrón', 'NR', 'A scientist in the rain forest squares off against a land developer while trying to solve some unexplained deaths.', 'A scientist in the rain forest squares off against a land developer while trying to solve some unexplained deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2j2gRtNwxost1rk0B0hs1FfyUM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184585'),
  ('74925599811015165', 'Paradise Lost', 2018, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Monique Gardenberg, Luciana Baptista, Ian Okamoto', 'Monique Gardenberg', 'Lee Taylor, Jaloo, Erasmo Carlos, Júlio Andrade, Seu Jorge, Felipe Abib, Humberto Carrão, Marjorie Estiano', null, 'Marked by losses and mismatches, José''s eccentric family seek to be happy while locked in Paraíso Perdido, a nightclub that has stopped in time, where they sing popular romantic music.', 'Marked by losses and mismatches, José''s eccentric family seek to be happy while locked in Paraíso Perdido, a nightclub that has stopped in time, where they sing popular romantic music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFgXt24xn6KnaVS0J5IllaWUNJg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524323'),
  ('774945969185755377', 'Paradise Lost 2: Revelations', 2000, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Bruce Sinofsky, Joe Berlinger, Robert Richman', null, 'Damien Echols, Jason Baldwin, Jessie Misskelley Jr., John Mark Byers, Kathy Bakken, Steven Branch, Christopher Byers, Melissa Byers', 'NR', 'Revisiting the 1994 Arkansas murder of three 8-year-old boys and the three teenagers convicted of the crime. A follow up to Paradise Lost, Revelations features new interviews with the convicted men, as well as with the original judge and police investigators.', 'Revisiting the 1994 Arkansas murder of three 8-year-old boys and the three teenagers convicted of the crime. A follow up to Paradise Lost, Revelations features new interviews with the convicted men, as well as with the original judge and police investigators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18ixOKgqZGmfALD5080MdZN4dxi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17208'),
  ('1066290606063673013', 'Paradise Lost 3: Purgatory', 2012, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Joe Berlinger, Bruce Sinofsky, Robert Richman', null, 'Jason Baldwin, Damien Echols, Jessie Misskelley Jr., John Mark Byers, Gary Gitchell, Terry Hobbs, Lorri Davis, Don Horgan', 'NR', 'A further investigation into the arrest of three teenagers convicted of killing three young boys in Arkansas who spent nearly 20 years in prison before being released after new DNA evidence indicated they may be innocent.', 'A further investigation into the arrest of three teenagers convicted of killing three young boys in Arkansas who spent nearly 20 years in prison before being released after new DNA evidence indicated they may be innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ix8SvMu5MllsXLtD0dvZR0vDi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83660'),
  ('177906274116583226', 'Paradise Lost: The Child Murders at Robin Hood Hills', 1996, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Joe Berlinger, Bruce Sinofsky, Robert Richman', null, 'Damien Echols, Jason Baldwin, Jessie Misskelley Jr., Joe Berlinger, Bruce Sinofsky', null, 'A horrific triple child murder leads to an indictment and trial of three nonconformist boys based on questionable evidence.', 'A horrific triple child murder leads to an indictment and trial of three nonconformist boys based on questionable evidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h65fwEQTv9zRNyEuExE1wAk5CQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17204'),
  ('751848702216956412', 'Paradise Murdered', 2007, 'Thriller, Mystery', '이주생, Kim Han-min, Kim Yong-heung', 'Kim Han-min', 'Park Hae-il, Park Sol-mi, Sung Ji-ru, Park Won-sang, Choi Joo-bong, Park Gil-su, Yoo Hye-jung, David Lee', null, 'A grisly murder occurs on the small remote island known as Paradise. After a night of gambling, two of the players are found mutilated. Deok-Su, the missing third player, quickly becomes the suspect. As the 17 residents of Paradise Island try to stay calm, suspicion grows that perhaps there was someone else involved in the grisly murders.', 'A grisly murder occurs on the small remote island known as Paradise. After a night of gambling, two of the players are found mutilated. Deok-Su, the missing third player, quickly becomes the suspect. As the 17 residents of Paradise Island try to stay calm, suspicion grows that perhaps there was someone else involved in the grisly murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buvZgMoiYVAmDmZ9o2qmPU7FCoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27516'),
  ('415985985020352058', 'Paradise Now', 2005, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama, War', 'Hany Abu-Assad, Antoine Héberlé', 'Pierre Hodgson, Hany Abu-Assad, Bero Beyer', 'Qais Nashif, Ali Suliman, Lubna Azabal, Amer Hlehel, Hiam Abbass, Ashraf Barhom, Abdulrahman Thaher, Mohamed Bustami', 'PG-13', 'Two childhood friends are recruited for a suicide bombing in Tel Aviv.', 'Two childhood friends are recruited for a suicide bombing in Tel Aviv.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWZkYa8VdcDZk8uzRB2PfhpM9IL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67'),
  ('61813351478039401', 'Paradise Road', 1997, 'War, Drama, History', 'Bruce Beresford, Noni Roy, Colin Fletcher', 'Bruce Beresford', 'Glenn Close, Frances McDormand, Pauline Collins, Cate Blanchett, Julianna Margulies, Jennifer Ehle, Wendy Hughes, Johanna ter Steege', 'R', 'A group of English, American, Dutch and Australian women creates a vocal orchestra while being imprisoned in a Japanese POW camp on Sumatra during World War II.', 'A group of English, American, Dutch and Australian women creates a vocal orchestra while being imprisoned in a Japanese POW camp on Sumatra during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEA7Iv1e6HqpSGMfVUdUfYOusNU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77223'),
  ('109888181838826140', 'Paradise War: The Story of Bruno Manser', 2019, 'Drama, History, Adventure', 'Irene Cotton, Melisa Hana Kristianty, Matthias Reisser', 'Niklaus Hilber, David Clemens, Patrick Tönz', 'Sven Schelker, Nick Kelesau, Elizabeth Ballang, Matthew Crowley, David K.S. Tse, Benjamin Mathis, Daniel Ludwig, Charlotte Heinimann', null, '1984: Searching for an experience that goes deeper than the superficiality of modern civilization, Bruno Manser travels into the jungles of Borneo and finds it with the nomadic Penan tribe. It is an encounter that changes his life forever. When the existence of the Penan is threatened by relentless deforestation, Manser takes up the fight against logging with a courage and determination that makes him one of the most renowned and credible environmentalists of his time. Eventually, it costs him everything. Based on a true story.', '1984: Searching for an experience that goes deeper than the superficiality of modern civilization, Bruno Manser travels into the jungles of Borneo and finds it with the nomadic Penan tribe. It is an encounter that changes his life forever. When the existence of the Penan is threatened by relentless deforestation, Manser takes up the fight against logging with a courage and determination that makes him one of the most renowned and credible environmentalists of his time. Eventually, it costs him everything. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DFMdwAbuumBdK8cZ7Pz8OrqmwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630729'),
  ('756920620838728641', 'Paradise, Hawaiian Style', 1966, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Michael D. Moore, James A. Rosenberger, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Anthony Lawrence, Allan Weiss', 'Elvis Presley, Suzanna Leigh, James Shigeta, Marianna Hill, Donna Butterworth, Irene Tsu, Linda Wong, Julie Parrish', null, 'Blacklisted by the major airlines for endlessly chasing female staff, pilot Rick Richards returns to Hawaii to set up a helicopter charter company with his friend Danny. Having a girl on every island is a good way to get business but it becomes clear that romance and flying don''t always mix.', 'Blacklisted by the major airlines for endlessly chasing female staff, pilot Rick Richards returns to Hawaii to set up a helicopter charter company with his friend Danny. Having a girl on every island is a good way to get business but it becomes clear that romance and flying don''t always mix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PLfdCgjqD3Gm9UeeaF3e8iTo3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18894'),
  ('448987216139492442', 'Paradise: Faith', 2013, 'Drama', 'Ulrich Seidl, Wolfgang Thaler, Edward Lachman', 'Veronika Franz, Ulrich Seidl', 'Maria Hofstätter, Nabil Saleh, Natalija Baranova, Daniel Hoesl, René Rupnik, Trude Masur, Dieter Masur, Michaela Hurdes-Galli', 'NR', 'For Anna Maria, paradise lies with Jesus, and she devotes her time to door-to-door missionary work. One day after years of absence, her husband, an Egyptian Muslim confined to a wheelchair, comes home—and soon prayers are replaced by fighting.', 'For Anna Maria, paradise lies with Jesus, and she devotes her time to door-to-door missionary work. One day after years of absence, her husband, an Egyptian Muslim confined to a wheelchair, comes home—and soon prayers are replaced by fighting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BczhbPMZDOBr8NxXCQHx3j0MQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129734'),
  ('34363421457583007', 'Paradise: Hope', 2013, 'Drama', 'Ulrich Seidl, Edward Lachman, Wolfgang Thaler', 'Ulrich Seidl, Veronika Franz', 'Melanie Lenz, Joseph Lorenz, Verena Lehbauer, Michael Thomas, Vivian Bartsch, Johanna Schmid, Maria Hofstätter', null, 'Her mother in Kenya, 13-year-old Melanie spends her summer vacation at a strict diet camp set in the Austrian countryside. Between workouts and nutrition classes, pillow fights and first cigarettes, she falls in love with a doctor 40 years her senior.', 'Her mother in Kenya, 13-year-old Melanie spends her summer vacation at a strict diet camp set in the Austrian countryside. Between workouts and nutrition classes, pillow fights and first cigarettes, she falls in love with a doctor 40 years her senior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0PACqyXg2hsVMwlapSh9GQq7Nv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150897'),
  ('241159870091925924', 'Paradise: Love', 2012, 'Drama', 'Edward Lachman, Ulrich Seidl, Wolfgang Thaler', 'Veronika Franz, Ulrich Seidl', 'Margarethe Tiesel, Peter Kazungu, Inge Maux, Dunja Sowinetz, Helen Brugat, Carlos Mkutano, Gabriel Mwarua, Josphat Hamisi', null, 'On the beaches of Kenya they’re known as "Sugar Mamas" —European women who seek out African boys selling love to earn a living. Teresa, a 50-year-old Austrian and mother of a daughter entering puberty, travels to this vacation paradise, moving from beach to beach.', 'On the beaches of Kenya they’re known as "Sugar Mamas" —European women who seek out African boys selling love to earn a living. Teresa, a 50-year-old Austrian and mother of a daughter entering puberty, travels to this vacation paradise, moving from beach to beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nah6G8dNvjL6L8k3wumcR3DH3KC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103686'),
  ('58810504939728987', 'Paradox', 2016, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Michael Hurst', 'Michael Hurst', 'Zoë Bell, Adam Huss, Malik Yoba, Brian Flaccus, Michael Aaron Milligan, Ashley Hayes, Jonathan Camp, Courtney Compton', null, 'A group of scientists are experimenting with time travel, and they manage to send one of their group ahead in time one hour. But when he comes back, he tells them that they’ll all be dead within the next hour unless they shut the machine down.', 'A group of scientists are experimenting with time travel, and they manage to send one of their group ahead in time one hour. But when he comes back, he tells them that they’ll all be dead within the next hour unless they shut the machine down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkjDIxzRwFMDvANnpdEIcT4whQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376292'),
  ('715999758712604514', 'Paradox', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Wilson Yip, Kenny Tse Chung-To, Samuel Fu', 'Jill Leung, Nick Cheuk Yik-Him', 'Louis Koo, Wu Yue, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Chris Collins, Tony Jaa, Jacky Cai, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Hanna Chan', null, 'When a Hong Kong police negotiator is informed about the sudden disappearance of his 16-year-old daughter in Thailand, he travels there to search for her whereabouts.', 'When a Hong Kong police negotiator is informed about the sudden disappearance of his 16-year-old daughter in Thailand, he travels there to search for her whereabouts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8cLJXp0DzUtpRUyszFZMPAwUTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452558'),
  ('821814735005325434', 'Paradox Effect', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Scott Weintrob, Dario Di Mella', 'Ferdinando Dell''Omo, Samuel Bartlett, Andrea Iervolino', 'Olga Kurylenko, Harvey Keitel, Oliver Trevena, Alice Astons, Talia Asseraf, Meredith Mickelson, Malich Cissé, Lucia Zotti', 'R', 'An innocent woman is forced to confront a dangerous kingpin who has kidnapped her young daughter and is holding her for ransom. She teams up with a corrupt Interpol agent, whose son is also being held hostage, to rip off various criminals to raise the ransom to save their offspring. Together they have one hour to save their families from the wrath of bigwig.', 'An innocent woman is forced to confront a dangerous kingpin who has kidnapped her young daughter and is holding her for ransom. She teams up with a corrupt Interpol agent, whose son is also being held hostage, to rip off various criminals to raise the ransom to save their offspring. Together they have one hour to save their families from the wrath of bigwig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koJFEW997sLjpu4e7wmFioA2mhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064375'),
  ('776643351990426931', 'Paragraph 175', 2000, 'History, Documentary', 'Rob Epstein, Jeffrey Friedman, Bernd Meiners', 'Sharon Wood', 'Rupert Everett, Heinz Dörmer, Annette Eick, Albrecht Becker, Gad Beck, Pierre Seel, Heinz F., Klaus Müller', 'PG-13', 'During the Nazi regime, there was widespread persecution of homosexual men, which started in 1871 with the Paragraph 175 of the German Penal Code. Thousands were murdered in concentration camps. This powerful and disturbing documentary, narrated by Rupert Everett, presents for the first time the largely untold testimonies of some of those who survived.', 'During the Nazi regime, there was widespread persecution of homosexual men, which started in 1871 with the Paragraph 175 of the German Penal Code. Thousands were murdered in concentration camps. This powerful and disturbing documentary, narrated by Rupert Everett, presents for the first time the largely untold testimonies of some of those who survived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpWAael8IHvFJe50WZ1dTOY1kip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49671'),
  ('181419303608821568', 'Paragraph 78: Film One', 2007, 'Thriller, Action, Science Fiction', 'Vitaliy Ershov, Sergei Kozlov, Mikhail Khleborodov', 'Mikhail Khleborodov', 'Gosha Kutsenko, Vladimir Vdovichenkov, Grigorij Sijatvinda, Stanislav Duzhnikov, Aziz Beyshenaliev, Yusup Bakhshiev, Aleksandr Tyutin, Mikhail Efremov', null, 'The peoples of the world has finally managed to agree on the most important issues on the planet and there was long overdue balance. Signed an agreement to terminate development of weapons of mass destruction, but in secret all the superpowers continue to build up military power on classified sites, which seemed never existed. Goodwin, a former commander of special forces, is tasked to collect his former people responsible for the mission. Something very serious has happened to the base where secretly working to develop a new combat the virus, and more recent cohorts, who have almost nothing left in common, have come together again...', 'The peoples of the world has finally managed to agree on the most important issues on the planet and there was long overdue balance. Signed an agreement to terminate development of weapons of mass destruction, but in secret all the superpowers continue to build up military power on classified sites, which seemed never existed. Goodwin, a former commander of special forces, is tasked to collect his former people responsible for the mission. Something very serious has happened to the base where secretly working to develop a new combat the virus, and more recent cohorts, who have almost nothing left in common, have come together again...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1QqfK0cbtfBlJ9sdRcSh6LMMFh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53086'),
  ('789807585866081102', 'Paragraph 78: Film Two', 2007, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Action', 'Vitaliy Ershov, Sergei Kozlov, Sergey Karpenko', 'Mikhail Khleborodov', 'Gosha Kutsenko, Vladimir Vdovichenkov, Grigorij Sijatvinda, Stanislav Duzhnikov, Anatoliy Belyy, Aziz Beyshenaliev, Yusup Bakhshiev, Aleksandr Tyutin', null, 'In the near future the command of the special setting gets a new important task. On a secret rocket base, where a very tall order brings a command over, they will have face to face to run not only into an external danger but also with each other.', 'In the near future the command of the special setting gets a new important task. On a secret rocket base, where a very tall order brings a command over, they will have face to face to run not only into an external danger but also with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w659JhzTfLgfkbs25zQGlk2tKe1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501748'),
