  ('883698099982919206', 'Paranoiac', 1963, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Freddie Francis, Arthur Grant', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Janette Scott, Oliver Reed, Sheila Burrell, Maurice Denham, Alexander Davion, Liliane Brousse, Harold Lang, Arnold Diamond', null, 'Eleven years ago, the wealthy Ashby family was shattered when Mr and Mrs Ashby died in an airplane crash and their grieving son Tony committed suicide. All who remains is cruel Simon, an alcoholic in desperate need of funds; his mentally fragile sister Eleanor; and his protective aunt Harriet. Simon is just weeks away from receiving his inheritance, but there''s a hitch in his plans when the long-believed dead Tony suddenly arrives.', 'Eleven years ago, the wealthy Ashby family was shattered when Mr and Mrs Ashby died in an airplane crash and their grieving son Tony committed suicide. All who remains is cruel Simon, an alcoholic in desperate need of funds; his mentally fragile sister Eleanor; and his protective aunt Harriet. Simon is just weeks away from receiving his inheritance, but there''s a hitch in his plans when the long-believed dead Tony suddenly arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXD4mLMXR2nibJkELmB5afAI3vj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42344'),
  ('1144821303214086235', 'Paranoid', 2000, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'John Duigan, Sławomir Idziak', 'John Duigan', 'Jessica Alba, Iain Glen, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Ewen Bremner, Mischa Barton, Kevin Whately, Oliver Milburn, Gary Love', 'R', 'Chloe Keane is an stressed American fashion model living in London who is about to have the worst weekend of her life. She and her boyfriend are invited to attend a party at the house of a former rock-star named Stan and his weird family who live in the countryside. Chloe awakes the next morning only to find her boyfriend has abandoned her at Stan''s house and she has been drugged and handcuffed to the bed.', 'Chloe Keane is an stressed American fashion model living in London who is about to have the worst weekend of her life. She and her boyfriend are invited to attend a party at the house of a former rock-star named Stan and his weird family who live in the countryside. Chloe awakes the next morning only to find her boyfriend has abandoned her at Stan''s house and she has been drugged and handcuffed to the bed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ERnpPPhr6mbzKIAqdKsMi6ycQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33347'),
