  ('874032578550613346', 'Parasakthi', 2026, 'Action, Drama, History, Romance', 'Sudha Kongara Prasad, Ravi K. Chandran, K S Jairam, Milind Rau', 'Sudha Kongara Prasad, Arjun Nadesan, Ganeshaa, Mathimaran Pugazhendhi, Dev Ramnath, Yugabharathi, Ekadesi', 'Ravi Mohan, Sivakarthikeyan, Atharvaa Murali, Sreeleela, Kulappulli Leela', null, 'In a time of civil disobedience in the erstwhile Madras state, a ruthless intelligent officer turns up with a duty to track down rebels. Chezhian and his brother Chinndurai are of different personalities, one a hardworking fireman, the other a rebel. A deadly game of cat and mouse ensues as Chezhian is forced to abandon his peaceful ways to protect his people and takes on the mighty forces, culminating in a fierce battle for justice.', 'In a time of civil disobedience in the erstwhile Madras state, a ruthless intelligent officer turns up with a duty to track down rebels. Chezhian and his brother Chinndurai are of different personalities, one a hardworking fireman, the other a rebel. A deadly game of cat and mouse ensues as Chezhian is forced to abandon his peaceful ways to protect his people and takes on the mighty forces, culminating in a fierce battle for justice.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F5%2Fgracenote%2F5c805e5003b1b4418cd4eae3d989e8a0.jpg', 'plex:movie:parasakthi-2026-1'),
  ('3823708929567213', 'Parasite', 1982, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Charles Band, K.C. Scheibel, Mac Ahlberg', 'Frank Levering, Michael Shoob, Alan J. Adler', 'Robert Glaudini, Demi Moore, Luca Bercovici, James Davidson, Al Fann, Tom Villard, Scott Thomson, Cherie Currie', null, 'Paul Dean has created a deadly parasite that is now attached to his stomach. He and his female companion, Patricia Welles, must find a way to destroy it while also trying to avoid Ricus & his rednecks, and an evil government agent named Merchant.', 'Paul Dean has created a deadly parasite that is now attached to his stomach. He and his female companion, Patricia Welles, must find a way to destroy it while also trying to avoid Ricus & his rednecks, and an evil government agent named Merchant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DGPORlVIDIQvsuSDnM4uXKMjWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48311'),
  ('391080118506263425', 'Parasite', 2019, 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 'Park Si-hwan, Hong Kyung-pyo, Kim Chang-ho', 'Han Jin-won, Bong Joon Ho', 'Song Kang-ho, Lee Sun-kyun, Cho Yeo-jeong, Choi Woo-shik, Park So-dam, Lee Jung-eun, Jang Hye-jin, Park Myung-hoon', 'R', 'All unemployed, Ki-taek''s family takes peculiar interest in the wealthy and glamorous Parks for their livelihood until they get entangled in an unexpected incident.', 'All unemployed, Ki-taek''s family takes peculiar interest in the wealthy and glamorous Parks for their livelihood until they get entangled in an unexpected incident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IiTTgloJzvGI1TAYymCfbfl3vT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496243'),
  ('958402705581389769', 'Parasite Dolls', 2003, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Hitoshi Sato, Naoyuki Yoshinaga, Kazuto Nakazawa', 'Chiaki J. Konaka, Kazuto Nakazawa', 'Kazuhiko Inoue, Akemi Okamura, Masaru Ikeda, Somei Uchida, Kikuko Inoue, Toshio Furukawa, Ai Orikasa, Jouji Nakata', 'PG-13', 'Beauty is only skin deep, but when you can’t see beneath the skin, how can you know what you’re really dealing with? In a world where perfect androids called Boomers have infiltrated every aspect of society, it’s the job of Branch to maintain peace between the people and the plastic. Unfortunately, not all boomers are created perfect, and when boomers go bad, people die. The thin blue line that separates man from machine is about to meet its most horrifying test in Parasite Dolls.', 'Beauty is only skin deep, but when you can’t see beneath the skin, how can you know what you’re really dealing with? In a world where perfect androids called Boomers have infiltrated every aspect of society, it’s the job of Branch to maintain peace between the people and the plastic. Unfortunately, not all boomers are created perfect, and when boomers go bad, people die. The thin blue line that separates man from machine is about to meet its most horrifying test in Parasite Dolls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCDVdpjhqbfMsSg0TlNeGMdg2el.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80089'),
  ('892184720888937476', 'Parasite Eve', 1997, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Romance', 'Masayuki Ochiai, Kōzō Shibazaki', 'Ryôichi Kimizuka', 'Hiroshi Mikami, Riona Hazuki, Tomoko Nakajima, Ayako Omura, Goro Inagaki, Hisako Manda, Tetsuya Bessho, Noboru Mitani', null, 'A scientist realizes his dead wife is an organization of mitochondria bent on making a new species that will wipe out humanity.', 'A scientist realizes his dead wife is an organization of mitochondria bent on making a new species that will wipe out humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEQqMOfiHWtCb2dDu4X5dOBF2AH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33045'),
  ('569203790946533959', 'Parasite in Love', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kensaku Kakimoto', 'Yukiko Yamamuro', 'Kento Hayashi, Nana Komatsu, Arata Iura, Ryo Ishibashi', null, 'A man named Kengo Kosaka is germaphobe, Due to his disorder, he is also a lonely young man. Meanwhile, high school student Hijiri Sanagi has Ommatophobia. Both Kengo Kosaka and Hijiri Sanagi do not expect to find love with another person.', 'A man named Kengo Kosaka is germaphobe, Due to his disorder, he is also a lonely young man. Meanwhile, high school student Hijiri Sanagi has Ommatophobia. Both Kengo Kosaka and Hijiri Sanagi do not expect to find love with another person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZGv4WwTGYHfkBIVGrC5WltrssE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:709589'),
  ('115566958868255590', 'Parasomnia', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'William Malone, Christian Sebaldt, Enzo Giobbe', 'William Malone', 'Cherilyn Wilson, Sean Young, Patrick Kilpatrick, Dylan McKnight, Jeffrey Combs, Timothy Bottoms, Alison Brie, Kathryn Leigh Scott', 'R', 'Laura Baxter is a young woman, literally a "sleeping beauty," who suffers from a medical condition called "parasomnia." A childhood accident victim, she is actually sleeping her life away, awakening briefly on rare occasions. Art student Danny Sloan falls in love with her, unaware that her hospital neighbor, a terrifying mass murderer and mesmerist named Byron Volpe has other, more sinister plans.', 'Laura Baxter is a young woman, literally a "sleeping beauty," who suffers from a medical condition called "parasomnia." A childhood accident victim, she is actually sleeping her life away, awakening briefly on rare occasions. Art student Danny Sloan falls in love with her, unaware that her hospital neighbor, a terrifying mass murderer and mesmerist named Byron Volpe has other, more sinister plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4Rx1dwoKkZrtSD0mZBRBo22jmb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19222'),
  ('693164554274729842', 'Parasyte: Part 1', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action, Drama', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Masaki Takahashi, Kiyoko Shibuya', 'Ryota Kosawa, Takashi Yamazaki', 'Shota Sometani, Sadao Abe, Eri Fukatsu, Ai Hashimoto, Kazuki Kitamura, Masahiro Higashide, Tadanobu Asano, Miko Yoki', 'NR', 'Humanity is suffering from a series of mysterious murders across the globe, known as the ''Mincemeat murders''. High school student Izumi Shinichi has a parasite living off him, having replaced his right hand, and he might be the discoverer of truth.', 'Humanity is suffering from a series of mysterious murders across the globe, known as the ''Mincemeat murders''. High school student Izumi Shinichi has a parasite living off him, having replaced his right hand, and he might be the discoverer of truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNzCFguC8wEyJWP89ewQYK8d2nJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282069'),
  ('479196400069752493', 'Parasyte: Part 2', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action, Drama', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Masaki Takahashi, Kohei Adachi', 'Ryota Kosawa, Takashi Yamazaki', 'Shota Sometani, Ai Hashimoto, Sadao Abe, Eri Fukatsu, Masahiro Higashide, Nao Omori, Pierre Taki, Hirofumi Arai', 'R', 'Humanity is under attack by human-mimicking flesh-eating alien parasites. One parasite bonds with his young high school student host, and he convinces the parasite to help him stop the others.', 'Humanity is under attack by human-mimicking flesh-eating alien parasites. One parasite bonds with his young high school student host, and he convinces the parasite to help him stop the others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qO8zQ9dSADWiwRnR7oCOsPDuOom.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282070'),
  ('457267265659945774', 'Parched', 2015, 'Drama', 'Leena Yadav, Russell Carpenter', 'Leena Yadav', 'Radhika Apte, Tannishtha Chatterjee, Sayani Gupta, Surveen Chawla, Adil Hussain, Sumeet Vyas, Riddhi Sen, Lehar Khan', null, 'In the arid landscape of Rajasthan, four women navigate their way through personal and cultural difficulties.', 'In the arid landscape of Rajasthan, four women navigate their way through personal and cultural difficulties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpuW4xGdUVZep3Otwo97xnEzdWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352205'),
  ('542010000269536308', 'Parchís: the Documentary', 2019, 'Documentary, Music', 'Daniel Arasanz, Edgar Lledó', 'Richard Royuela, Daniel Arasanz, Jordi Meya', 'Constantino ''Tino'' Fernández, Yolanda Ventura, Gemma Termes Prat, Francisco ''Frank'' Díaz, David Muñoz Forcadas, Ángel Arroyo, Antoni Planas, Eva Mariol', 'PG-13', 'The spotlight''s on Parchís, a record company-created Spanish boy/girl band that had unprecedented success with Top 10 songs and hit films in the ''80s.', 'The spotlight''s on Parchís, a record company-created Spanish boy/girl band that had unprecedented success with Top 10 songs and hit films in the ''80s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2EGmvbeEWZda5oO5XTiuyOKX8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587910'),
  ('1114095808853186865', 'Pardes', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Subhash Ghai, Kabir Lal', 'Neeraj Pathak, Subhash Ghai', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Amrish Puri, Mahima Chaudhry, Apurva Agnihotri, Padmavati Rao, Alok Nath, Himani Shivpuri, Madhuri Bhatia', null, 'Kishorilal wants an Indian bride for his westernised son. He gets him engaged to Ganga, his friend''s daughter, and brings her to USA. But she shares a deeper bond with Arjun, Kishorilal''s foster son.', 'Kishorilal wants an Indian bride for his westernised son. He gets him engaged to Ganga, his friend''s daughter, and brings her to USA. But she shares a deeper bond with Arjun, Kishorilal''s foster son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUiM7V2hK540SN9Wd6UXZPGcDBH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25519'),
  ('241258713622792042', 'Pardners', 1956, 'Comedy, Western', 'Norman Taurog, Clem Jones, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Sidney Sheldon', 'Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, Lori Nelson, Jeff Morrow, Lon Chaney Jr., Lee Van Cleef, Jack Elam, John Baragrey', null, 'Rich momma''s boy Wade Kingsley Jr. an Eastern dude, tries to follow in his murdered father''s footsteps by returning to the West to partner up with Slim Moseley Jr.,the son of his father''s former partner. Wade overcomes Slim''s initial reluctance to accept him by using his fortune to buy a prize cow and new car to help Slim in his job as foreman on the Kingsley family ranch, currently under siege by a gang of outlaws called "masked raiders." Wade generously tries to pay off the ranch''s mortgage with $15,000 of his own money, but unfortunately neither "pardner" realizes that respected banker Dan Hollis, the son of their fathers'' murderer, is the leader of the gang.', 'Rich momma''s boy Wade Kingsley Jr. an Eastern dude, tries to follow in his murdered father''s footsteps by returning to the West to partner up with Slim Moseley Jr.,the son of his father''s former partner. Wade overcomes Slim''s initial reluctance to accept him by using his fortune to buy a prize cow and new car to help Slim in his job as foreman on the Kingsley family ranch, currently under siege by a gang of outlaws called "masked raiders." Wade generously tries to pay off the ranch''s mortgage with $15,000 of his own money, but unfortunately neither "pardner" realizes that respected banker Dan Hollis, the son of their fathers'' murderer, is the leader of the gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOwKUmyVhmvPdOudF9S3vde0Ky6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22390'),
  ('217015520760790764', 'Pardon', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mert Baykal, Ulaş Zeybek', 'Ferhan Şensoy', 'Ferhan Şensoy, Rasim Öztekin, Ali Çatalbaş, Bülent Kayabaş, Zeki Alasya, Erol Günaydın, Şahnaz Çakıralp, Levent Ünsal', null, 'Based on a true event, Pardon tells the tragicomic story of three friends who end up in prison when they are mistaken as members of a terrorist organization. Ibrahim''s fear of uniforms makes him runaway whenever he sees one. Because of this, police mistakes him with a terrorist and takes him and his friend Muzo into custody. Fooled by the police during the interrogation they name another friend, Aydin, in hope of saving themselves. As they all end up in prison, they remember the families and lovers they left behind.', 'Based on a true event, Pardon tells the tragicomic story of three friends who end up in prison when they are mistaken as members of a terrorist organization. Ibrahim''s fear of uniforms makes him runaway whenever he sees one. Because of this, police mistakes him with a terrorist and takes him and his friend Muzo into custody. Fooled by the police during the interrogation they name another friend, Aydin, in hope of saving themselves. As they all end up in prison, they remember the families and lovers they left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9c5ZnVJvh5pZ5blwQRQ3fhVtlFG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64433'),
  ('713697942128942535', 'Pardon Mon Affaire', 1976, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yves Robert, René Mathelin, Pierre Gompertz', 'Jean-Loup Dabadie, Yves Robert', 'Jean Rochefort, Claude Brasseur, Guy Bedos, Victor Lanoux, Danièle Delorme, Anny Duperey, Marthe Villalonga, Louise Conte', null, 'On an otherwise normal day, Étienne, a happily married man and a good father, sees something that stops him dead in his tracks: a gorgeous woman in a billowing red dress. Long after she has left his vision, her memory continues to haunt his mind. He falls instantly in love with her and tries everything to get to know her better. Helping Étienne snare his elusive lady in red are his three bumbling buddies, which all have secret affairs and/or cheat on their wives.', 'On an otherwise normal day, Étienne, a happily married man and a good father, sees something that stops him dead in his tracks: a gorgeous woman in a billowing red dress. Long after she has left his vision, her memory continues to haunt his mind. He falls instantly in love with her and tries everything to get to know her better. Helping Étienne snare his elusive lady in red are his three bumbling buddies, which all have secret affairs and/or cheat on their wives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYNgxIPOJUlJiN984H4NHf46y66.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2459'),
  ('1041895517792577949', 'Pardon My Sarong', 1942, 'Comedy', 'Erle C. Kenton, Charles Previn, Milton Krasner', 'Nat Perrin, John Grant, True Eames Boardman', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Virginia Bruce, Robert Paige, Lionel Atwill, Leif Erickson, Nan Wynn, William Demarest', null, 'A pair of bus drivers accidentally steal their own bus. With the company issuing a warrant for their arrest, they tag along with a playboy on a boat trip that finds them on a tropical island, where a jewel thief has sinister plans for them.', 'A pair of bus drivers accidentally steal their own bus. With the company issuing a warrant for their arrest, they tag along with a playboy on a boat trip that finds them on a tropical island, where a jewel thief has sinister plans for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5C42mPi2VhjoEv0Tka4qOcr5oc4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31523'),
  ('155407010204096094', 'Pardon My Scotch', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Andrew Bennison', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Nat Carr, James C. Morton, Billy Gilbert', 'NR', 'The Stooges are running the local drugstore and mix up a potion that a desperate businessman decides to sell as scotch. The Stooges impersonate Scotsmen at a party to fool the prospective buyer. Their usual antics disrupt the party, ending when a barrel of their "scotch" explodes and floods the whole house.', 'The Stooges are running the local drugstore and mix up a potion that a desperate businessman decides to sell as scotch. The Stooges impersonate Scotsmen at a party to fool the prospective buyer. Their usual antics disrupt the party, ending when a barrel of their "scotch" explodes and floods the whole house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQm4NLypLNYKTBCYgpg1XRtrIo0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115778'),
  ('897697197729862574', 'Pardon Us', 1931, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, June Marlowe, Wilfred Lucas, James Finlayson, Walter Long, Tiny Sandford', 'NR', 'It''s Prohibition, and the boys wind up behind bars after Stan sells some of their home-brew beer to a policeman.', 'It''s Prohibition, and the boys wind up behind bars after Stan sells some of their home-brew beer to a policeman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBTlnEuKSMoNKO4zYAZ78wcxgkc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375282'),
  ('376532889490575694', 'Pardon, Are You for or Against?', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Sordi, Benito Frattari, Giulio Paradisi', 'Sergio Amidei, Alberto Sordi', 'Alberto Sordi, Anita Ekberg, Bibi Andersson, Tina Aumont, Paola Pitagora, Franca Marzi, Mario Pisu, Caterina Boratto', null, 'A successful fifty-year-old entrepreneur, Tullio Conforti, opposed to divorce for religious reasons, is in fact separated from his wife and leads a frenetic life divided between numerous lovers.', 'A successful fifty-year-old entrepreneur, Tullio Conforti, opposed to divorce for religious reasons, is in fact separated from his wife and leads a frenetic life divided between numerous lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnKkc9EoGSYc0S0LeqF7vULG3iN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73839'),
  ('563254147355305307', 'Pardonnez-moi', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Claire Mathon, Maïwenn', 'Maïwenn', 'Maïwenn, Pascal Greggory, Hélène de Fougerolles, Aurélien Recoing, Mélanie Thierry, Marie-France Pisier, Yannick Soulier, Marie-Sophie L.', null, 'Expecting her first child, actress Violette decides to dive deep into her dysfunctional family''s history by filming a documentary about them.', 'Expecting her first child, actress Violette decides to dive deep into her dysfunctional family''s history by filming a documentary about them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UCqsv9H96VdCT2NSnqAZAmq2tJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70989'),
