  ('896431006134857148', 'Parent Trap: Hawaiian Honeymoon', 1989, 'Family, Comedy, TV Movie, Romance', 'Mollie Miller, Stephen Lofaro, Sandra M. Middleton', 'John McNamara', 'Hayley Mills, Barry Bostwick, Joy Creel, Leanna Creel, Monica Lacy, John M. Jackson, Sasha Mitchell, Lightfield Lewis', null, 'Inheriting a family resort in Hawaii, the Wyatts find it in such a run-down condition that they decide to sell it after trying to fix it up. Amidst confusing goings-on among the triplet teenage girls and the boys they meet, Jeffrey meets an old high school rival who promises to keep the resort as-is if Jeffrey will sell it to him. He has other plans in mind, however, and they are not limited merely to Jeffrey''s resort', 'Inheriting a family resort in Hawaii, the Wyatts find it in such a run-down condition that they decide to sell it after trying to fix it up. Amidst confusing goings-on among the triplet teenage girls and the boys they meet, Jeffrey meets an old high school rival who promises to keep the resort as-is if Jeffrey will sell it to him. He has other plans in mind, however, and they are not limited merely to Jeffrey''s resort', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlf0WUL5iakSIfYc8bRVbpSlPoR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92682'),
  ('578881742210297753', 'Parental Guidance', 1997, 'Drama', 'Lucile Hadžihalilović, Gaspar Noé, Dominique Colin', 'Lucile Hadžihalilović', 'Denise Aron-Schropfer, Michel Trillot, Sandra Sammartino, Delphine Allange, Jacques Gallo, Françoise Pironneau, Lois Da Silva, John Milko', null, 'A ten year old girl is received by her aunt because of her mother''s confinement to a mental hospital. But the aunt lives with a man, Jean-Pierre, who seems to be a little too nice with the girl.', 'A ten year old girl is received by her aunt because of her mother''s confinement to a mental hospital. But the aunt lives with a man, Jean-Pierre, who seems to be a little too nice with the girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/867Nr0wjmReQxLWIwMnak2MpPjd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80990'),
