  ('857983728488590425', 'Parenthood', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Donald McAlpine, Ron Howard, Beth Kuhn', 'Babaloo Mandel, Lowell Ganz', 'Steve Martin, Mary Steenburgen, Dianne Wiest, Jason Robards, Rick Moranis, Tom Hulce, Martha Plimpton, Keanu Reeves', 'PG-13', 'The story of the Buckman family and friends, attempting to bring up their children. They suffer/enjoy all the events that occur: estranged relatives, the ''black sheep'' of the family, the eccentrics, the skeletons in the closet, and the rebellious teenagers.', 'The story of the Buckman family and friends, attempting to bring up their children. They suffer/enjoy all the events that occur: estranged relatives, the ''black sheep'' of the family, the eccentrics, the skeletons in the closet, and the rebellious teenagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e51tNNQBJpJi9xkyuj0QFhyBcz7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1552'),
  ('395493608329111746', 'Parents', 1989, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Bob Balaban, Andrew Poulos, Robin Vidgeon', 'Christopher Hawthorne', 'Randy Quaid, Mary Beth Hurt, Sandy Dennis, Bryan Madorsky, Juno Mills-Cockell, Kathryn Grody, Deborah Rush, Graham Jarvis', 'R', 'Michael is a young boy living in a typical 1950s suburbanite home... except for his bizarre and horrific nightmares, and continued unease around his parents. Young Michael begins to suspect his parents are cooking more than just hamburgers on the grill outside, but has trouble explaining his fears to his new-found friend Sheila, or the school''s social worker.', 'Michael is a young boy living in a typical 1950s suburbanite home... except for his bizarre and horrific nightmares, and continued unease around his parents. Young Michael begins to suspect his parents are cooking more than just hamburgers on the grill outside, but has trouble explaining his fears to his new-found friend Sheila, or the school''s social worker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGRD9xksz3t4qdOMXcrf6NWtNsO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27607'),
  ('24033417248152936', 'Parents in Perpetuity', 2024, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Safy Nebbou, Laëtita Galouchko', 'Julie Jézéquel', 'Natacha Lindinger, Éric Caravaca, Jules Houplain, Naidra Ayadi, Capucine Malarre, Marie-Julie Baup, Isabelle Côte Willems, Florence Janas', null, 'Laurence and Éric are the parents of Guillaume, aged 17. Guillaume is arrested by the police and is accused of rape with a weapon.', 'Laurence and Éric are the parents of Guillaume, aged 17. Guillaume is arrested by the police and is accused of rape with a weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fI7pii3cpT1CreTWMAen8tGkie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145958'),
  ('131432596595527742', 'Parents in Progress', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Laura Chiossone, Manfredo Archinto, Alberto Monte', 'Laura Nuccilli', 'Anna Foglietta, Paolo Calabresi, Marina Rocco, Elena Radonicich, Francesco Turbanti, Paolo Mazzarelli, Marina Occhionero, Lucia Mascino', null, 'Simona is a single mother in her early ‘40s who is wholly devoted to her son, Filippo. To get over her insecurities as a parent and make her son happy on his eighth birthday, she decides to throw him a birthday party in their small flat and invite over his school friends and their parents. For Simona, this birthday is about to pose quite the surprising dilemma between allowing her son to embrace his true self and a mother’s fierce desire to protect her child from their potentially cruel surroundings. This is the last conundrum she was expecting to have to face on a day that is already rife with anxiety.', 'Simona is a single mother in her early ‘40s who is wholly devoted to her son, Filippo. To get over her insecurities as a parent and make her son happy on his eighth birthday, she decides to throw him a birthday party in their small flat and invite over his school friends and their parents. For Simona, this birthday is about to pose quite the surprising dilemma between allowing her son to embrace his true self and a mother’s fierce desire to protect her child from their potentially cruel surroundings. This is the last conundrum she was expecting to have to face on a day that is already rife with anxiety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vh9UWDKWRq0AVYTgjEVVb6diNXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606312'),
  ('733165157110857587', 'Pari', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Prosit Roy, Jishnu Bhattacharjee', 'Abhishek Banerjee', 'Anushka Sharma, Parambrata Chatterjee, Rajat Kapoor, Ritabhari Chakraborty, Mansi Multani, Mithu Chakrabarty, Dibyendu Bhattacharya, Imran Rasheed', 'PG-13', 'Arnab tries to help Ruksahana, who is found under mysterious circumstances in a house. He lets her stay at his home until he discovers something strange about her.', 'Arnab tries to help Ruksahana, who is found under mysterious circumstances in a house. He lets her stay at his home until he discovers something strange about her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/togwv0TGqXkIA2YuYIY9VDLEkdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461649'),
  ('908006314720658111', 'Pariah', 1998, 'Drama', 'Randolph Kret', 'Randolph Kret', 'JJ Snyder, Damon Jones, Dave Oren Ward, Davidlee Wilson, Aimee Chaffin, Angela Jones, Anna Padgett, Dan Weene', null, 'An interracial couple is attacked and the woman is gang-raped in a random attack. This prompts the woman to commit suicide and the man decides to seek revenge from the inside by joining the gang. However, once inside he learns of the reasons (poverty, social rejection) for their existence and starts developing a kinship until he is asked to kill someone to prove his loyalty.', 'An interracial couple is attacked and the woman is gang-raped in a random attack. This prompts the woman to commit suicide and the man decides to seek revenge from the inside by joining the gang. However, once inside he learns of the reasons (poverty, social rejection) for their existence and starts developing a kinship until he is asked to kill someone to prove his loyalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcLFz3TKrOvhkzKFRdGzniWEtVj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109525'),
  ('497986254707490521', 'Pariah', 2011, 'Drama', 'Dee Rees, Bradford Young', 'Dee Rees', 'Adepero Oduye, Pernell Walker, Aasha Davis, Charles Parnell, Sahra Mellesse, Kim Wayans, Shamika Cotton, Raymond Anthony Thomas', null, 'A Brooklyn teenager juggles conflicting identities and risks friendship, heartbreak, and family in a desperate search for sexual expression.', 'A Brooklyn teenager juggles conflicting identities and risks friendship, heartbreak, and family in a desperate search for sexual expression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lX9Ss9LH3bsAoGWDvsPv4zZG9fa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73939'),
  ('699780546679990838', 'Parinda', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Vidhu Vinod Chopra', 'Shivkumar Subramaniam', 'Jackie Shroff, Anil Kapoor, Nana Patekar, Madhuri Dixit, Anupam Kher, Suresh Oberoi, Tom Alter, Kamal Chopra', null, 'Brothers Kishan and Karan grow up in Bombay. Karan soon leaves to study in America while Kishan enters into a life of crime, falling under the sway of Anna Seth, a drug lord. When Karan returns to Bombay, Kishan intends to keep him as far away from his criminal life as possible, but things don''t go as planned.', 'Brothers Kishan and Karan grow up in Bombay. Karan soon leaves to study in America while Kishan enters into a life of crime, falling under the sway of Anna Seth, a drug lord. When Karan returns to Bombay, Kishan intends to keep him as far away from his criminal life as possible, but things don''t go as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iVDKpzPr1egzNsKjIDL2maVEe5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58045'),
  ('773560450359089491', 'Parineeta', 2005, 'Romance, Drama', 'Pradeep Sarkar, Natarajan Subramaniam', 'Vidhu Vinod Chopra', 'Saif Ali Khan, Vidya Balan, Sanjay Dutt, Sabyasachi Chakraborty, Raima Sen, Dia Mirza, Achyut Potdar, Supriya Shukla', null, 'Childhood sweethearts Lalita and Shekhar wish to get married someday. However, Shekhar''s growing suspicions about Lalita coupled with his conniving father''s antics threaten to tear them apart.', 'Childhood sweethearts Lalita and Shekhar wish to get married someday. However, Shekhar''s growing suspicions about Lalita coupled with his conniving father''s antics threaten to tear them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PupxvUzTVqkSJvvbDILOjLQwuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20651'),
  ('269160554809375517', 'Paris', 2008, 'Drama', 'Cédric Klapisch, Christophe Beaucarne, Euric Allaire', 'Cédric Klapisch', 'Juliette Binoche, Romain Duris, Fabrice Luchini, Albert Dupontel, François Cluzet, Karin Viard, Gilles Lellouche, Mélanie Laurent', null, 'Pierre, a professional dancer, suffers from a serious heart disease. While he is waiting for a transplant which may (or may not) save his life, he has nothing better to do than look at the people around him, from the balcony of his Paris apartment.', 'Pierre, a professional dancer, suffers from a serious heart disease. While he is waiting for a transplant which may (or may not) save his life, he has nothing better to do than look at the people around him, from the balcony of his Paris apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcJAgm2N0FW0PkCew9A1yv8r6zF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8279'),
  ('484238378252343526', 'Paris 05:59 / Théo & Hugo', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Olivier Ducastel, Jacques Martineau, Maxence Germain', 'Olivier Ducastel, Jacques Martineau', 'Geoffrey Couët, François Nambot, Georges Daaboul, Elodie Adler, Claire Deschamps, Jeffry Kaplow, Marieff Ditier, Mario Fanfani', null, 'Théo and Hugo meet in a club and form an immediate bond. Once the desire and elation of this first moment has passed, the two young men, now sober, wander through the empty streets of nocturnal Paris, having to confront the love they sense blossoming between them.', 'Théo and Hugo meet in a club and form an immediate bond. Once the desire and elation of this first moment has passed, the two young men, now sober, wander through the empty streets of nocturnal Paris, having to confront the love they sense blossoming between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcxPzjmNJ797OS19ohuvgrDx4Yt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382892'),
  ('146500686229400169', 'Paris 2024 Olympic Closing Ceremony', 2024, 'Documentary, Family, History', 'Simon Staffurth, Thomas Jolly, Thierry Reboul', null, 'Arthur Cadre, Thomas Bach, Ezra Koenig, Thomas Mars, Deck d''Arcy, Laurent Brancowitz, Christian Mazzalai, ROB', null, 'Like an indelible memory, this Olympic closing ceremony will be marked by audacity, fraternity and emotion. In the heart of the Stade de France, athletes from all over the world will represent their countries one last time in an incredible moment of celebration and sharing. With their eyes riveted to the flame, the emotion will be immense as we close the great Olympic book of Paris 2024.', 'Like an indelible memory, this Olympic closing ceremony will be marked by audacity, fraternity and emotion. In the heart of the Stade de France, athletes from all over the world will represent their countries one last time in an incredible moment of celebration and sharing. With their eyes riveted to the flame, the emotion will be immense as we close the great Olympic book of Paris 2024.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Kb7DTk4cxo8rlr7bhcOPZFNzHW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1322488'),
  ('403036896978588518', 'Paris 2024 Olympic Opening Ceremony', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Simon Staffurth, Thomas Jolly, Victor le Masne', 'Leïla Slimani, Fanny Herrero, Patrick Boucheron', 'Jamel Debbouze, Zinédine Zidane, Lady Gaga, Christian Andreu, Mario Duplantier, Joe Duplantier, Jean-Michel Labadie, Aya Nakamura', null, 'On 26 July 2024, the largest-ever Olympic Games Opening Ceremony took place, beginning at 7.30 p.m. CET. The Opening Ceremony of the Olympic Games Paris 2024 was an unprecedented experience drawing on the natural light of the setting sun with all its nuances to illuminate the world’s best athletes as they travelled down the Seine, in the heart of the French capital.', 'On 26 July 2024, the largest-ever Olympic Games Opening Ceremony took place, beginning at 7.30 p.m. CET. The Opening Ceremony of the Olympic Games Paris 2024 was an unprecedented experience drawing on the natural light of the setting sun with all its nuances to illuminate the world’s best athletes as they travelled down the Seine, in the heart of the French capital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFmpoT9nBf39USY016dCLjGnVsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1311546'),
  ('713930701810262658', 'Paris 36', 2008, 'Drama', 'Christophe Barratier, Tom Stern', 'Christophe Barratier, Julien Rappeneau', 'Gérard Jugnot, Clovis Cornillac, Kad Merad, Nora Arnezeder, Pierre Richard, Bernard-Pierre Donnadieu, Maxence Perrin, François Morel', null, 'A star is born in a time of both celebration and instability in this historical drama with music from director Christophe Barratier. In the spring of 1936, Paris is in a state of uncertainty; while the rise of the Third Reich in Germany worries many, a leftist union-oriented candidate, Léon Blum, has been voted into power, and organized labor is feeling its new power by standing up to management.', 'A star is born in a time of both celebration and instability in this historical drama with music from director Christophe Barratier. In the spring of 1936, Paris is in a state of uncertainty; while the rise of the Third Reich in Germany worries many, a leftist union-oriented candidate, Léon Blum, has been voted into power, and organized labor is feeling its new power by standing up to management.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgLxYWhbq1nCPgs9SqvBZvsNOax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15457'),
  ('1060567903252882975', 'Paris Awakens', 1991, 'Drama', 'Olivier Assayas, Denis Lenoir, Étienne Albrecht', 'Olivier Assayas', 'Judith Godrèche, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Thomas Langmann, Martin Lamotte, Antoine Basler, Ounie Lecomte, Michèle Foucher, Eric Daviron', null, 'Adrien is a nineteen year old who has not seen his father, Clément, for four years. Adrien returns home and the two try to repair their relationship. Clément lives with Louise, a twenty-something woman who wants to be an actress. Adrien starts a flirtatious relationship with Louise, which strains his newfound bond with Clément.', 'Adrien is a nineteen year old who has not seen his father, Clément, for four years. Adrien returns home and the two try to repair their relationship. Clément lives with Louise, a twenty-something woman who wants to be an actress. Adrien starts a flirtatious relationship with Louise, which strains his newfound bond with Clément.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7I3vyAwXPZHkxPQeEtPTMEHWowG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66552'),
  ('480912301615702402', 'Paris Belongs to Us', 1961, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Jacques Rivette, Charles L. Bitsch', 'Jacques Rivette, Jean Gruault', 'Betty Schneider, Giani Esposito, Françoise Prévost, Daniel Crohem, François Maistre, Brigitte Juslin, Noëlle Leiris, Monique Le Porrier', null, 'A young woman joins a theatrical troupe where she slowly believes that the director is involved with a secret group and that he is in grave danger.', 'A young woman joins a theatrical troupe where she slowly believes that the director is involved with a secret group and that he is in grave danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6d5k00vjGDjDn3g7znRoJYCALen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43026'),
  ('34644547018984590', 'París bien vale una moza', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Manuel Rojas, José Luis Pérez Tristán, Pedro Lazaga Sabater', 'José María Palacio', 'Alfredo Landa, Paz Isern, Antonio Ferrandis, Ricardo Merino, José Sacristán, Josele Román, Alfonso del Real, Francisco Parra', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5NYBVyiPwqM6AcyI8PN19FMssm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448977'),
  ('899947250936921808', 'Paris Blues', 1961, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Martin Ritt, Christian Matras, André Smagghe', 'Walter Bernstein, Jack Sher, Irene Kamp', 'Paul Newman, Joanne Woodward, Sidney Poitier, Diahann Carroll, Louis Armstrong, Barbara Laage, André Luguet, Marie Versini', null, 'During the 1960s, two American jazz musicians living in Paris meet and fall in love with two American tourist girls and must decide between music and love.', 'During the 1960s, two American jazz musicians living in Paris meet and fall in love with two American tourist girls and must decide between music and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yvlRKuzIkymNapRJxMQbJJkrhw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33710'),
  ('835724814157119709', 'Paris by Night', 1989, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mary Selway, Christopher Hall, Jane Studd', 'David Hare', 'Charlotte Rampling, Michael Gambon, Robert Hardy, Iain Glen, Jane Asher, Andrew Ray, Niamh Cusack, Linda Bassett', null, 'Clara Bell is a busy Euro MP with a husband and child at home and a high powered career - but on a trip to Paris her ordered existence is overturned by a murder and a chance encounter.', 'Clara Bell is a busy Euro MP with a husband and child at home and a high powered career - but on a trip to Paris her ordered existence is overturned by a murder and a chance encounter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLnBl0xfBlBCyYo4NtJ2Uk43P74.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475628'),
  ('795332620020229101', 'Paris by Night', 2012, 'Crime, Drama', 'Philippe Lefebvre, Jérôme Alméras', 'Simon Michaël, Philippe Isard, Philippe Lefebvre', 'Roschdy Zem, Samuel Le Bihan, Grégory Fitoussi, Jean-Pierre Martins, Jean-Paul Muel, Sara Forestier, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Kamel Labroudi', null, 'Police commander Simon Weiss, head of the division that supervises Paris’s demi-monde, starts out on his nightly tour of bars, discos and strip clubs, making sure once again that the owners don’t bend the rules too far. Weiss knows he’s between a rock and hard place: it’s obvious that criminal gangs run rampant in his special domain, and even more obvious that they’re protected by higher-ups in the department.', 'Police commander Simon Weiss, head of the division that supervises Paris’s demi-monde, starts out on his nightly tour of bars, discos and strip clubs, making sure once again that the owners don’t bend the rules too far. Weiss knows he’s between a rock and hard place: it’s obvious that criminal gangs run rampant in his special domain, and even more obvious that they’re protected by higher-ups in the department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVrIGR1Vk9c6frrCAZRq7n3JzDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106685'),
  ('677812441690895541', 'Paris Can Wait', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Crystel Fournier, Eleanor Coppola, Pierre-Louis Turquet', 'Eleanor Coppola', 'Diane Lane, Arnaud Viard, Alec Baldwin, Elise Tielrooy, Élodie Navarre, Serge Onteniente, Pierre Cuq, Cédric Monnet', 'PG', 'Anne is at a crossroads in her life. Long married to a successful, driven but inattentive movie producer, she unexpectedly finds herself taking a car trip from Cannes to Paris with Jacques, a business associate of her husband. What should be a seven-hour drive turns into a carefree two-day adventure replete with diversions involving picturesque sights, fine food and wine, humor, wisdom and romance - reawakening Anne''s senses and giving her a new lust for life.', 'Anne is at a crossroads in her life. Long married to a successful, driven but inattentive movie producer, she unexpectedly finds herself taking a car trip from Cannes to Paris with Jacques, a business associate of her husband. What should be a seven-hour drive turns into a carefree two-day adventure replete with diversions involving picturesque sights, fine food and wine, humor, wisdom and romance - reawakening Anne''s senses and giving her a new lust for life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLzfHNU1JldQpC5TNEvQMnWQxx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375867'),
  ('925579502547038676', 'Paris Christmas Waltz', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Michael Damian, Viorel Sergovici', 'Michael Damian, Janeen Damian', 'Jen Lilley, Matthew Morrison, Paul Freeman, Debbie Matenopoulos, Stephanie Siadatan, Matt Salinger, Bryan Bounds, Jade Ewen', 'G', 'Emma relinquishes her job so a colleague with a family will keep his. Contemplating life’s next steps, Emma meets a professional dancer, Leo whose love for competitive dancing is waning, until a once in a lifetime opportunity arises for the novice to join the pro and sweep all of Paris off its feet.', 'Emma relinquishes her job so a colleague with a family will keep his. Contemplating life’s next steps, Emma meets a professional dancer, Leo whose love for competitive dancing is waning, until a once in a lifetime opportunity arises for the novice to join the pro and sweep all of Paris off its feet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyMGmj4zDSNNUdJyzqbu9Lk0tEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127936'),
  ('605811228898047741', 'Paris Countdown', 2013, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Edgar Marie, Danny Elsen', 'Edgar Marie', 'Jacques Gamblin, Olivier Marchal, Carlo Brandt, Reda Kateb, Igor Skreblin, Francis Renaud, James Kazama, Laure Marsac', 'NR', 'Unable to repay their debts, Milan and Victor, best friends and co-owners of a Paris nightclub, are lured into a drug deal that goes bad. Tortured by police, they negotiate their freedom against an overwhelming testimony that condemns their psychotic liaison to prison. Six years later, the men''s nightmare begins again when the pyschopath is granted his freedom. Now, not having talked for years, the old friends are united again in order to survive.', 'Unable to repay their debts, Milan and Victor, best friends and co-owners of a Paris nightclub, are lured into a drug deal that goes bad. Tortured by police, they negotiate their freedom against an overwhelming testimony that condemns their psychotic liaison to prison. Six years later, the men''s nightmare begins again when the pyschopath is granted his freedom. Now, not having talked for years, the old friends are united again in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujXEdfZsFXqeEywdUgxDTjGGqzU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200346'),
  ('1146121083957011938', 'Paris Express', 2010, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Hervé Renoh, Vincent Muller', 'Hervé Renoh', 'Michaël Youn, Géraldine Nakache, Jimmy Jean-Louis, Catalina Denis, Didier Flamand, Natalia Dontcheva, Lord Kossity, Frédéric Chau', null, 'From multicultural Paris to designer Paris, Montmartre to the Champs-Elysées, sleazy sidewalks to high-end galleries... Watch out! Sam the courier is a man on a mission! On his scooter, Sam breaks every rule of the road to make good on the "express delivery" promise of the courier service he works for. But however hard he tries, Sam never gets a bonus from his boss, never beats his slicker colleagues and never gets past his Dad, a cop who books him every time. All Sam has up is Nadia, and she will turn on him if he doesn''t show up for her sister''s wedding. Trouble is, Sam has one more delivery to make and his day has just gone from bad to worse...', 'From multicultural Paris to designer Paris, Montmartre to the Champs-Elysées, sleazy sidewalks to high-end galleries... Watch out! Sam the courier is a man on a mission! On his scooter, Sam breaks every rule of the road to make good on the "express delivery" promise of the courier service he works for. But however hard he tries, Sam never gets a bonus from his boss, never beats his slicker colleagues and never gets past his Dad, a cop who books him every time. All Sam has up is Nadia, and she will turn on him if he doesn''t show up for her sister''s wedding. Trouble is, Sam has one more delivery to make and his day has just gone from bad to worse...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhse79Bx2nkapzzIrPrPanrY0rU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40194'),
  ('409910858439581144', 'Paris Follies', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Marc Fitoussi, Agnès Godard', 'Marc Fitoussi', 'Isabelle Huppert, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Michael Nyqvist, Pio Marmaï, Audrey Dana, Anaïs Demoustier, Marina Foïs, Clément Métayer', null, 'Long married 50-somethings Brigitte and Xavier are prize cattle breeders in regional France. Life is good, but the departure of their children from home has thrown Brigitte’s world into flux, as she finds herself locked into routine. She keeps hoping for something else, something more. A party held by students on the adjoining property accelerates this latent crisis and Brigitte impulsively sets off for Paris under the guise of a doctor’s appointment. The city immediately invigorates her, and when she meets a charming Danish gentleman, she impulsively allows herself to be flattered by his attentions…', 'Long married 50-somethings Brigitte and Xavier are prize cattle breeders in regional France. Life is good, but the departure of their children from home has thrown Brigitte’s world into flux, as she finds herself locked into routine. She keeps hoping for something else, something more. A party held by students on the adjoining property accelerates this latent crisis and Brigitte impulsively sets off for Paris under the guise of a doctor’s appointment. The city immediately invigorates her, and when she meets a charming Danish gentleman, she impulsively allows herself to be flattered by his attentions…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUgESB67BfeiEpF3R7RukVEU6xf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258435'),
  ('425515943462332524', 'Paris Frills', 1945, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Becker, Nicolas Hayer', 'Maurice Aubergé, Jacques Becker, Maurice Griffe', 'Raymond Rouleau, Micheline Presle, Jean Chevrier, Gabrielle Dorziat, Françoise Lugagne, Jeanne Fusier-Gir, Christiane Barry, Rosine Luguet', null, 'Philippe Clarence, a famous Parisian dressmaker, seduces his friend''s fiancee. But, for the first time in his life, this is for real. The film is also a sharp picture of the fashion world.', 'Philippe Clarence, a famous Parisian dressmaker, seduces his friend''s fiancee. But, for the first time in his life, this is for real. The film is also a sharp picture of the fashion world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k37aJHae0WIkoA1KgDUgGFjzxnW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121128'),
  ('871565342158250377', 'Paris Holiday', 1958, 'Romance, Comedy, Action', 'Gerd Oswald, Roger Hubert, Paul Feyder', 'Edmund Beloin, Dean Riesner', 'Bob Hope, Fernandel, Anita Ekberg, Martha Hyer, Preston Sturges, André Morell, Alan Gifford, Maurice Teynac', null, 'Comedian Bob Hunter is aided by his French counterpart Fernydel and two beautiful blondes when he is targeted for death by a powerful European counterfeiting ring.', 'Comedian Bob Hunter is aided by his French counterpart Fernydel and two beautiful blondes when he is targeted for death by a powerful European counterfeiting ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eo6SRdDvE8raANLMSENLKGdaPLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27364'),
  ('45600477454929131', 'Paris in August', 1966, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre', 'Rodolphe-Maurice Arlaud', 'Charles Aznavour, Susan Hampshire, Michel de Ré, Daniel Ivernel, Etchika Choureau, Alan Scott, Jacques Marin, Héléna Manson', null, 'A man is alone in Paris during the month of August while his woman and children go on vacation. He meets a young English girl posing as a model who came to Paris for a shoot.', 'A man is alone in Paris during the month of August while his woman and children go on vacation. He meets a young English girl posing as a model who came to Paris for a shoot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLbYSPPlUVckJwSneFpxMIp9lLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563300'),
  ('500490067016544264', 'Paris Is Always Paris', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Luciano Emmer, Francesco Rosi, Émile Roussel', 'Luciano Emmer, Sergio Amidei, Giulio Macchi', 'Aldo Fabrizi, Lucia Bosè, Jeannette Batti, Ave Ninchi, Janine Marsay, Galeazzo Benti, Henri Génès, Franco Interlenghi', null, 'A group of Italian soccer fans arrive in Paris for a match, but most of them go their separate ways to explore the sights, have a bit of an adventure, and maybe even find some romance.', 'A group of Italian soccer fans arrive in Paris for a match, but most of them go their separate ways to explore the sights, have a bit of an adventure, and maybe even find some romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0oVhZwnpd7NcR5ArnF4ZOrWYR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324417'),
  ('380414307087930902', 'Paris Is Burning', 1991, 'Documentary', 'Jennie Livingston, Paul Gibson', null, 'Pepper LaBeija, Octavia St. Laurent, Venus Xtravaganza, Dorian Corey, Willi Ninja, Paris Dupree, Freddie Pendavis, Sol Williams Pendavis', 'R', 'Where does voguing come from, and what, exactly, is throwing shade? This landmark documentary provides a vibrant snapshot of the 1980s through the eyes of New York City''s African American and Latinx Harlem drag-ball scene. Made over seven years, PARIS IS BURNING offers an intimate portrait of rival fashion "houses," from fierce contests for trophies to house mothers offering sustenance in a world rampant with homophobia, transphobia, racism, AIDS, and poverty. Featuring legendary voguers, drag queens, and trans women — including Willi Ninja, Pepper LaBeija, Dorian Corey, and Venus Xtravaganza.', 'Where does voguing come from, and what, exactly, is throwing shade? This landmark documentary provides a vibrant snapshot of the 1980s through the eyes of New York City''s African American and Latinx Harlem drag-ball scene. Made over seven years, PARIS IS BURNING offers an intimate portrait of rival fashion "houses," from fierce contests for trophies to house mothers offering sustenance in a world rampant with homophobia, transphobia, racism, AIDS, and poverty. Featuring legendary voguers, drag queens, and trans women — including Willi Ninja, Pepper LaBeija, Dorian Corey, and Venus Xtravaganza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90rCWH41mj9hjHUEy2SOHfuAOl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31225'),
  ('836530579211427790', 'Paris Is Us', 2019, 'Drama', 'Jean-Charles Bastion, Elisabeth Vogler', 'Rémi Bassaler, Paul Saïsset', 'Noémie Schmidt, Grégoire Isvarine, Marie Mottet, Lou Castel, Mathias Minne, Margaux Bonin, Julia Kouakou, Alexandre Schreiber', null, 'Dreams and reality collide as a young woman navigates a tumultuous relationship amid rising social tensions, protests and tragedies in Paris.', 'Dreams and reality collide as a young woman navigates a tumultuous relationship amid rising social tensions, protests and tragedies in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Yr5JOC5slZWf1uCA7Va6V7drEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504321'),
  ('930837410197338679', 'Paris Je T''aime', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Maxime Alexandre, Michel Amathieu, Michael Seresin', 'Bruno Podalydès, Paul Mayeda Berges, Gurinder Chadha', 'Steve Buscemi, Natalie Portman, Willem Dafoe, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Axel Kiener, Julie Bataille, Bruno Podalydès, Florence Muller', 'R', 'Olivier Assayas, Gus Van Sant, Wes Craven and Alfonso Cuaron are among the 20 distinguished directors who contribute to this collection of 18 stories, each exploring a different aspect of Parisian life. The colourful characters in this drama include a pair of mimes, a husband trying to choose between his wife and his lover, and a married man who turns to a prostitute for advice.', 'Olivier Assayas, Gus Van Sant, Wes Craven and Alfonso Cuaron are among the 20 distinguished directors who contribute to this collection of 18 stories, each exploring a different aspect of Parisian life. The colourful characters in this drama include a pair of mimes, a husband trying to choose between his wife and his lover, and a married man who turns to a prostitute for advice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcke8Uvw8QDToAZQ94UGo7VU0g6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2266'),
  ('945608222363899034', 'Paris or Perish', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Reem Kherici, Nicolas Massart', 'Reem Kherici, Morgan Spillemaecker, Philippe Lacheau', 'Reem Kherici, Cécile Cassel, Tarek Boudali, Philippe Lacheau, Shirley Bousquet, Salim Kéchiouche, Stéphane Rousseau, Joséphine Draï', 'G', 'Maya is living the ultimate fashionistas dream: she is working as a stylist for one of the French trend setters, in the capital of haute-couture: Paris. One of the IT girls of fashion, shes following her dreams until one night, when her life takes a sudden turn: shes being deported back to Morocco, after being stopped for over speeding, because her Visa expired some time ago. So in no more than 24 hours, shes deported back to her family and original country. The strong cultural shock and the judgmental differences are pushing the woman to obtain back her place in the city of dreams and her dreams, no matter the costs. But that doesn''t mean she will have to return alone, as she finds other things also among her way back to the city.', 'Maya is living the ultimate fashionistas dream: she is working as a stylist for one of the French trend setters, in the capital of haute-couture: Paris. One of the IT girls of fashion, shes following her dreams until one night, when her life takes a sudden turn: shes being deported back to Morocco, after being stopped for over speeding, because her Visa expired some time ago. So in no more than 24 hours, shes deported back to her family and original country. The strong cultural shock and the judgmental differences are pushing the woman to obtain back her place in the city of dreams and her dreams, no matter the costs. But that doesn''t mean she will have to return alone, as she finds other things also among her way back to the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0TqmtksDVWgEO6J5XtW4yHFfGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203665'),
  ('538185425916126497', 'Paris Pigalle', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cédric Anger, Thomas Hardmeier, Catherine Olaya', 'Cédric Anger', 'Guillaume Canet, Gilles Lellouche, Michel Fau, Camille Razat, Xavier Beauvois, Elisa Bachir Bey, Inge van Bruystegem, Valeria Nicov', null, 'Paris, 1982. Franck and Serge are police investigators in charge of making a good catch in the Parisian porn industry. In order to infiltrate the mafia, they take over a peep show in Pigalle riddled with debts. In attempt to jump start the business, they begin to produce short porn films.', 'Paris, 1982. Franck and Serge are police investigators in charge of making a good catch in the Parisian porn industry. In order to infiltrate the mafia, they take over a peep show in Pigalle riddled with debts. In attempt to jump start the business, they begin to produce short porn films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYcrgwcwXqZ19t0wyKDmsdClRBQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510460'),
  ('919920952252087268', 'Paris Prestige', 2017, 'Drama', 'Ekoué Labitey, Hamé, Sina Frifra', 'Hamé, Ekoué Labitey', 'Reda Kateb, Slimane Dazi, Mélanie Laurent, Constantine Attia, Bakary Keita, Willy L''Barge, Yassine Azzouz, Sandor Funtek', null, 'Nasser, a 30-something Parisian with a troubled past, returns to Paris after some jail time. Margot, his probation officer, urges him to work at LE PRESTIGE, his brother''s bar located right next to the Moulin Rouge, in the heart of Pigalle - one of Paris’ most diverse and rawest neighborhoods. But deep wounds between the two brothers make this collaboration difficult from the start, and even more so when Nasser decides to get back in the game by throwing exclusive parties against his brother''s will.', 'Nasser, a 30-something Parisian with a troubled past, returns to Paris after some jail time. Margot, his probation officer, urges him to work at LE PRESTIGE, his brother''s bar located right next to the Moulin Rouge, in the heart of Pigalle - one of Paris’ most diverse and rawest neighborhoods. But deep wounds between the two brothers make this collaboration difficult from the start, and even more so when Nasser decides to get back in the game by throwing exclusive parties against his brother''s will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjzWeVBnRaPIsxLDvunV7mXqHjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422949'),
  ('1010105788821995816', 'Paris Trout', 1991, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Robert Elswit, Brenda Kalosh, David Womark', 'Peter Dexter', 'Dennis Hopper, Barbara Hershey, Ed Harris, Ray McKinnon, Tina Lifford, Darnita Henry, Eric Ware, RonReaco Lee', null, 'Paris Trout is a vile Southern bigot. He owns a store and is a loanshark. He often sues people, and so his lawyer, Harry Seagraves, eventually meets Paris'' wife Hannah. A former schoolteacher, she made the mistake of her life when she married Paris, who brutalizes her. Soon Paris goes beyond the overgenerous bounds of what a man in his position can get away with even in the segregated South, leading to a spiral of perverse insanity.', 'Paris Trout is a vile Southern bigot. He owns a store and is a loanshark. He often sues people, and so his lawyer, Harry Seagraves, eventually meets Paris'' wife Hannah. A former schoolteacher, she made the mistake of her life when she married Paris, who brutalizes her. Soon Paris goes beyond the overgenerous bounds of what a man in his position can get away with even in the segregated South, leading to a spiral of perverse insanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boLdI99ZK1jmtJyaVnHPDoxacyG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54191'),
  ('875363936677823944', 'Paris Under Watch', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Cédric Jimenez, Léo Hinstin, Arnaud Duprey', 'Audrey Diwan, Cédric Jimenez, Arnaud Duprey', 'Mélanie Doutey, Olivier Barthélémy, Francis Renaud, Valérie Sibilia, Féodor Atkine, Alain Zef, Ruth Elkrief, Thomas Misrachi', null, 'An anonymous hacker has hacked all of Paris'' cameras and observes the city unbeknownst to its inhabitants. Petty crimes and moments of stolen intimacy, he sees everything. Until the day that an explosion lays waste to the Gare d''Austerlitz. The police starts tracking down an Al Queda satellite group. The hacker succeeds in finding images of the explosion and discovers that it was a young couple who planted the bomb. Using the city''s cameras, he decides to hunt down the criminals.', 'An anonymous hacker has hacked all of Paris'' cameras and observes the city unbeknownst to its inhabitants. Petty crimes and moments of stolen intimacy, he sees everything. Until the day that an explosion lays waste to the Gare d''Austerlitz. The police starts tracking down an Al Queda satellite group. The hacker succeeds in finding images of the explosion and discovers that it was a young couple who planted the bomb. Using the city''s cameras, he decides to hunt down the criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ldBuSFHriLcZWt4FuGkkVqKCQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98277'),
  ('1114473925351793434', 'Paris When It Sizzles', 1964, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Charles Lang, Richard Quine, Paul Feyder', 'Julien Duvivier, Henri Jeanson', 'William Holden, Audrey Hepburn, Grégoire Aslan, Raymond Bussières, Christian Duvaleix, Michel Thomass, Dominique Boschero, Evi Marandi', 'NR', 'Hollywood producer Alexander Meyerheimer has hired drunken writer Richard Benson to write his latest movie. Benson has been in Paris supposedly working on the script for months, but instead has spent the time living it up. Benson now has just two days to the deadline and thus hires a temporary secretary, Gabrielle Simpson, to help him finish on time.', 'Hollywood producer Alexander Meyerheimer has hired drunken writer Richard Benson to write his latest movie. Benson has been in Paris supposedly working on the script for months, but instead has spent the time living it up. Benson now has just two days to the deadline and thus hires a temporary secretary, Gabrielle Simpson, to help him finish on time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aojHngnnK0kTYjvCwtlfAj8xf4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22829'),
  ('772744806596442448', 'Paris-Brest', 2020, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Philippe Lioret', 'Zoé Galeron, Philippe Lioret', 'Anthony Bajon, Catherine Arditi, Valérie Karsenti, Gilles Cohen, Kévin Azaïs, Daphné Patakia, Alexia Chardard', null, 'Colin returns to Brest to discover that the petty theft he committed five years previously allowed his opportunistic parents to place his grandmother, Manou, in a home to die and lay their hands on her fortune. Now he is going to have to look the old lady in the eye. Before that, he spends Christmas with his parents and announces that he has written a novel that is soon to be published: an autobiographical work of fiction about them and their schemes…', 'Colin returns to Brest to discover that the petty theft he committed five years previously allowed his opportunistic parents to place his grandmother, Manou, in a home to die and lay their hands on her fortune. Now he is going to have to look the old lady in the eye. Before that, he spends Christmas with his parents and announces that he has written a novel that is soon to be published: an autobiographical work of fiction about them and their schemes…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xa34hOWKc9UMIqH43UmHbCPSAi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:684795'),
  ('386220830141131323', 'Paris-Manhattan', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sophie Lellouche, Laurent Machuel', 'Sophie Lellouche', 'Alice Taglioni, Patrick Bruel, Marine Delterme, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Michel Aumont, Woody Allen, Marie-Christine Adam, Margaux Chatelier', null, 'Alice, an obsessed Woody Allen fan, meets Pierre in a night-club and falls in love with him. But when Pierre sees Alice''s sister Hélène, things start to get complicated.', 'Alice, an obsessed Woody Allen fan, meets Pierre in a night-club and falls in love with him. But when Pierre sees Alice''s sister Hélène, things start to get complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ojaHghrQL9POiX6lm8mmsirGrH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123235'),
  ('1045232564447696564', 'París-Tombuctú', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Luis García Berlanga, Hans Burmann', 'Luis García Berlanga, Javier G. Amezua, Jorge Berlanga', 'Michel Piccoli, Concha Velasco, Amparo Soler Leal, Juan Diego, Santiago Segura, Antonio Resines, Javier Gurruchaga, Guillermo Montesinos', null, 'The frustration and vital weariness of Michel des Assantes, a prestigious plastic surgeon in Paris, is unbearable: he has a wife whom he does not love, a son who is foreign to him and friends whom he despises but, at the same time, he is incapable of taking his own life. One day, he buys a bike from a bizarre cyclist who was to make the Paris-Timbuktu route and sets out to make the journey: then, Timbuktu becomes for him the Promised Land.', 'The frustration and vital weariness of Michel des Assantes, a prestigious plastic surgeon in Paris, is unbearable: he has a wife whom he does not love, a son who is foreign to him and friends whom he despises but, at the same time, he is incapable of taking his own life. One day, he buys a bike from a bizarre cyclist who was to make the Paris-Timbuktu route and sets out to make the journey: then, Timbuktu becomes for him the Promised Land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQB9Xp9XySrm9Gj3NGK4ul4r5uR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71793'),
  ('819841060808980030', 'Paris, 13th District', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paul Guilhaume, Jacques Audiard, Jean-Baptiste Pouilloux', 'Céline Sciamma, Jacques Audiard, Léa Mysius', 'Lucie Zhang, Makita Samba, Noémie Merlant, Jehnny Beth, Camille Léon-Fucien, Oceane Cairaty, Anaïde Rozam, Pol White', 'R', 'Émilie meets Camille who is attracted to Nora, who crosses paths with Amber. Three girls and a boy – They''re friends, sometimes lovers and often both.', 'Émilie meets Camille who is attracted to Nora, who crosses paths with Amber. Three girls and a boy – They''re friends, sometimes lovers and often both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSXPsrausCYVsDnQaJfhzqR9fV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746131'),
