  ('718590348523902068', 'Paris, Love, Cut', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Arnaud Viard, Isabelle Dumas', 'Arnaud Viard', 'Irène Jacob, Arnaud Viard, Louise Coldefy, Frédérique Bel, Hamza Meziani, Sophie Blondy, Vincent Colombe, Matthieu Charneau', null, 'At 45 Arnaud wants to have a child with Chloe, shoot his second movie....but he is blocked.After leaving Chloe he went back to teaching theater and met Gabrielle...', 'At 45 Arnaud wants to have a child with Chloe, shoot his second movie....but he is blocked.After leaving Chloe he went back to teaching theater and met Gabrielle...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYIVygrrdD9lqmXdjuoyehnF1ae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332399'),
