  ('680616286627164809', 'Paris, Texas', 1984, 'Drama', 'Wim Wenders, Robby Müller, Gary Chason', 'Sam Shepard, L.M. Kit Carson', 'Harry Dean Stanton, Nastassja Kinski, Dean Stockwell, Hunter Carson, Aurore Clément, Bernhard Wicki, Sam Berry, Claresie Mobley', 'R', 'A man wanders out of the desert not knowing who he is. His brother finds him, and helps to pull his memory back of the life he led before he walked out on his family and disappeared four years earlier.', 'A man wanders out of the desert not knowing who he is. His brother finds him, and helps to pull his memory back of the life he led before he walked out on his family and disappeared four years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sP27Qm4THyRZyHjHYMfIDtJP6YE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655'),
  ('802025799579237900', 'Paris, Wine & Romance', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Alexander Krumov, Natasha Roth, Alex Zamm', 'Joelle Sellner, Alex Wright', 'Jen Lilley, Dan Jeannotte, Alexandra Guelff, Greg Canestrari, Lolita Davidovich, Roxanne McKee, Michael D. Xavier, Pierre Rousselet', 'G', 'Isabella is the ambitious new owner of her family’s Oregon winery whose dream of becoming world-renowned takes a big step forward when she enters a prestigious wine competition in Paris. Upon arrival, Isabella meets her biggest competitor, Jacques, from one of the world’s foremost winemaking families. Impressed by Isabella and her expertise in wine, a budding romance develops between them.', 'Isabella is the ambitious new owner of her family’s Oregon winery whose dream of becoming world-renowned takes a big step forward when she enters a prestigious wine competition in Paris. Upon arrival, Isabella meets her biggest competitor, Jacques, from one of the world’s foremost winemaking families. Impressed by Isabella and her expertise in wine, a budding romance develops between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Zeeuo6MANQanNiiKEk91OQpuzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594694'),
  ('1021099805648172156', 'Paris: Les souverains russes et le président de la République aux Champs-Élysées', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre Promio', null, 'Félix François Faure, Czar Nicholas II of Russia, Alexandra Feodorovna', null, 'Russian sovereign Nicholas II and Alexandra Fiodorovna, and President Felix Faure, parading down the Champs-Elysées in a carriage, followed by horsemen.', 'Russian sovereign Nicholas II and Alexandra Fiodorovna, and President Felix Faure, parading down the Champs-Elysées in a carriage, followed by horsemen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZHsMcDkQSI9WfTvvMWpRwxMbug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262852'),
  ('485528425277627571', 'Parisian Hustle', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hamé, Ekoué Labitey, César Decharme', 'Hamé, Ekoué Labitey', 'Garance Marillier, Sandor Funtek, Virginie Acariès, Léticia Belliccini, Bakary Keita, Brahim Bettayeb, Éléonore Bernheim, Slimane Dazi', null, 'The story hones in on Mia, a 25-year-old Parisian who works in a nail bar on Rue des Dames. Unbeknownst to her employer and in exchange for money, she arranges access, for some of the salon’s female clients, to sought-after parties attended by high-profile footballers…', 'The story hones in on Mia, a 25-year-old Parisian who works in a nail bar on Rue des Dames. Unbeknownst to her employer and in exchange for money, she arranges access, for some of the salon’s female clients, to sought-after parties attended by high-profile footballers…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4sZBJZpihDGwewcdFUYDXmQ7bj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958502'),
  ('909457744232263994', 'Parisian Love', 1925, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Louis J. Gasnier, Allen G. Siegler', 'Lois Hutchinson', 'Clara Bow, Donald Keith, Lillian Leighton, Lou Tellegen, J. Gordon Russell, Hazel Keener, Jean De Briac, Otto Matieson', null, 'Armand and Marie survive in the streets until charitable (and wealthy) scientist Pierre Marcel takes Armand in after a botched robbery. Marie, a fiery Apache, swears revenge on Marcel for taking her lover away from her.', 'Armand and Marie survive in the streets until charitable (and wealthy) scientist Pierre Marcel takes Armand in after a botched robbery. Marie, a fiery Apache, swears revenge on Marcel for taking her lover away from her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SWV0SGRFPElI6A4wfn7Bt8vnQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116746'),
  ('1071829265461420596', 'Parisienne', 2016, 'Drama', 'Danielle Arbid, Hélène Louvart', 'Julie Peyr, Pierre Schoeller', 'Manal Issa, Vincent Lacoste, Paul Hamy, Damien Chapelle, Clara Ponsot, Bastien Bouillon, Dominique Blanc, India Hair', null, '18-year-old Lina arrives in Paris for her studies. She comes to look for what she has never found in Lebanon, her country of origin: a certain form of freedom. The survival instinct as the only baggage, she sails from one Paris to another to the rhythm of her romantic encounters.', '18-year-old Lina arrives in Paris for her studies. She comes to look for what she has never found in Lebanon, her country of origin: a certain form of freedom. The survival instinct as the only baggage, she sails from one Paris to another to the rhythm of her romantic encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aC9yQRvvOGJe8P1AHTfNWhrzxyP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355234'),
  ('606398468168122156', 'Pariyerum Perumal', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mari Selvaraj, G. Sridhar', 'Mari Selvaraj', 'Kathir, Anandhi, Yogi Babu, G. Marimuthu, Lijeesh, Supergood Subramani, Shanmugarajan, Hari Krishnan', null, 'A law student from a lower caste begins a friendship with his classmate, a girl who belongs to a higher caste, and the men in her family start giving him trouble over this.', 'A law student from a lower caste begins a friendship with his classmate, a girl who belongs to a higher caste, and the men in her family start giving him trouble over this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78YoIO3gzkZPC1jotfDmolNDmgT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462718'),
  ('254004215339127988', 'Park', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kurt Voelker, Christophe Lanzenberg, Michael K. DeVaney', 'Kurt Voelker', 'William Baldwin, Anne Dudek, David Fenner, Trent Ford, Dagney Kerr, Ricki Lake, Melanie Lynskey, Izabella Miko', 'R', 'Park takes place all in one day in a public park in Los Angeles, as 11 disaffected Angelenos find both love and loss in unexpected ways', 'Park takes place all in one day in a public park in Los Angeles, as 11 disaffected Angelenos find both love and loss in unexpected ways', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oh9kKeskxBIbM3kUT3O6CzDBwTJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15023'),
  ('1136933655901266539', 'Park Benches', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Bruno Podalydès, Yves Cape', 'Olivia Basset, Bruno Podalydès', 'Denis Podalydès, Florence Muller, Pierre Arditi, Hippolyte Girardot, Josiane Balasko, Michel Vuillermoz, Didier Bourdon, Chantal Lauby', null, 'As she does every morning, Lucie takes advantage of her journey to work to lose herself for a while in the pages of a good book. And as she does every morning, she joins her colleagues at the office with a smile. It''s a working day just like any other. Then suddenly all activity in the office stops. All attention is turned towards the window of the opposite building opposite and abanner reading: Man Alone. Is it a hoax? A cry for help? Everyone has his own interpretation, and will try, by any means possible, to discover what lies behind this mysterious message.', 'As she does every morning, Lucie takes advantage of her journey to work to lose herself for a while in the pages of a good book. And as she does every morning, she joins her colleagues at the office with a smile. It''s a working day just like any other. Then suddenly all activity in the office stops. All attention is turned towards the window of the opposite building opposite and abanner reading: Man Alone. Is it a hoax? A cry for help? Everyone has his own interpretation, and will try, by any means possible, to discover what lies behind this mysterious message.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLBJjOMQ42oz04lwtBOilEjjAsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44866'),
  ('1045579156972269618', 'Park Plaza 605', 1953, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Bernard Knowles, Robert Lynn, Philip Green', 'Bertram Ostrer, Albert Fennell, Bernard Knowles', 'Tom Conway, Eva Bartok, Joy Shelton, Sidney James, Richard Wattis, Carl Jaffe, Frederick Schiller, Robert Adair', 'NR', 'Suave private investigator Norman Conquest intercepts a secret message and meets a beautiful but foreign blonde lady in room 605 of the Park Plaza hotel. But when Conquest wakes up in the room the next morning he is lying next to a dead body. With the mysterious blonde nowhere to be seen, Conquest soon becomes the police s number one suspect with Inspector Williams following his every move. In order to clear his name, Conquest enlists the help of Pixie Everard (Joy Shelton), but the going gets rough when he discovers that the murder is connected to a stash of stolen diamonds. As gun-happy gangs of communists and Nazi sympathizers turn up the heat, Conquest has to solve the murder whilst staying one step ahead of both the gangs and the police.', 'Suave private investigator Norman Conquest intercepts a secret message and meets a beautiful but foreign blonde lady in room 605 of the Park Plaza hotel. But when Conquest wakes up in the room the next morning he is lying next to a dead body. With the mysterious blonde nowhere to be seen, Conquest soon becomes the police s number one suspect with Inspector Williams following his every move. In order to clear his name, Conquest enlists the help of Pixie Everard (Joy Shelton), but the going gets rough when he discovers that the murder is connected to a stash of stolen diamonds. As gun-happy gangs of communists and Nazi sympathizers turn up the heat, Conquest has to solve the murder whilst staying one step ahead of both the gangs and the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huOlKuf9vSgV8n7bqfllDGx0TQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173697'),
  ('1050397157613106961', 'Park Row', 1952, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Samuel Fuller, John L. Russell, Joseph Depew', 'Samuel Fuller', 'Gene Evans, Mary Welch, Bela Kovacs, Herbert Heyes, Tina Pine, George O''Hanlon, J.M. Kerrigan, Forrest Taylor', 'NR', 'In New York''s 1880s newspaper district, a dedicated journalist manages to set up his own paper. It is an immediate success but attracts increasing opposition from one of the bigger papers and its newspaper heiress owner.', 'In New York''s 1880s newspaper district, a dedicated journalist manages to set up his own paper. It is an immediate success but attracts increasing opposition from one of the bigger papers and its newspaper heiress owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHx9RhWqr7MndUhJqd6Bs4Gs0jp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26242'),
  ('923132336760891993', 'Parker', 2013, 'Action, Crime', 'Taylor Hackford, J. Michael Muro, David Leitch', 'John J. McLaughlin', 'Jason Statham, Jennifer Lopez, Michael Chiklis, Wendell Pierce, Clifton Collins Jr., Bobby Cannavale, Patti LuPone, Carlos Carrasco', 'R', 'A thief with a unique code of professional ethics is double-crossed by his crew and left for dead. Assuming a new disguise and forming an unlikely alliance with a woman on the inside, he looks to hijack the score of the crew''s latest heist.', 'A thief with a unique code of professional ethics is double-crossed by his crew and left for dead. Assuming a new disguise and forming an unlikely alliance with a woman on the inside, he looks to hijack the score of the crew''s latest heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocTaizFzASVPClHsx6VRBi5yP9Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119283'),
  ('249239876979609928', 'Parking', 1985, 'Music, Fantasy, Romance', 'Jacques Demy, Jean-François Robin', 'Jacques Demy', 'Francis Huster, Laurent Malet, Keiko Itō, Gérard Klein, Jean Marais, Marie-France Pisier, Hugues Quester, Éva Darlan', null, 'Rock star Orpheus writes love songs for Eurydice, who designs his album covers. Torn between her and his sound engineer, Calaïs, he discovers Eurydice has died of an overdose. Desperate, he descends into the Underworld to bargain with Hades.', 'Rock star Orpheus writes love songs for Eurydice, who designs his album covers. Torn between her and his sound engineer, Calaïs, he discovers Eurydice has died of an overdose. Desperate, he descends into the Underworld to bargain with Hades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNjwMC0ZdItjryEd8P942NXP7mF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202192'),
  ('1102271060240838803', 'Parking', 2008, 'Drama', 'Chung Mong-hong, Chung Mong-hong', 'Chung Mong-hong', 'Chang Chen, Gwei Lun-mei, Jack Kao, Chapman To Man-Chat, Leon Dai, Peggy Tseng, Jiu Kong, Na-Do', null, 'On Mother''s Day in Taipei, Chen Mo makes a date for dinner with his wife, hoping to bring their estranged relationship back together. While buying a cake on his way home, a car unexpectedly double parks next to his car, preventing his exit.', 'On Mother''s Day in Taipei, Chen Mo makes a date for dinner with his wife, hoping to bring their estranged relationship back together. While buying a cake on his way home, a car unexpectedly double parks next to his car, preventing his exit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcG0vKMQtr5eDkCtp2qJq2Ru9F5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8935'),
  ('766880718010352269', 'Parkland', 2013, 'History, Drama', 'Peter Landesman, Vincent Palmo Jr., Barry Ackroyd', 'Peter Landesman', 'Zac Efron, Marcia Gay Harden, Paul Giamatti, Billy Bob Thornton, Jacki Weaver, Ron Livingston, Jeremy Strong, James Badge Dale', 'PG-13', 'November 22nd, 1963 was a day that changed the world forever — when young American President John F. Kennedy was assassinated in Dallas, Texas. This film follows, almost in real time, a handful of individuals forced to make split-second decisions after an event that would change their lives and forever alter the world’s landscape.', 'November 22nd, 1963 was a day that changed the world forever — when young American President John F. Kennedy was assassinated in Dallas, Texas. This film follows, almost in real time, a handful of individuals forced to make split-second decisions after an event that would change their lives and forever alter the world’s landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23jc1Hclf1FFxpyYs9A4SxfRbK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209262'),
  ('169765450874836722', 'Parlor, Bedroom and Bath', 1931, 'Comedy', 'Edward Sedgwick, Leonard Smith', null, 'Buster Keaton, Charlotte Greenwood, Reginald Denny, Cliff Edwards, Dorothy Christy, Joan Peers, Sally Eilers, Natalie Moorhead', 'NR', 'Jeffrey Haywood wants to marry to Virginia Embrey. However, Virginia refused to marry unless her older sister, the hard-to-please Angelica gets married first. Angelica, in turn, finds every man she knows too dull and predictable, and for this reason prefers to stay single. Jeff then tries to make Angelica interested in the mild-mannered and timid Reggie Irving passing him off as a notorious playboy to intrigue her. He asks his friend Polly to teach Reggie "how to treat a woman right", but he turns to be a disastrous learner.', 'Jeffrey Haywood wants to marry to Virginia Embrey. However, Virginia refused to marry unless her older sister, the hard-to-please Angelica gets married first. Angelica, in turn, finds every man she knows too dull and predictable, and for this reason prefers to stay single. Jeff then tries to make Angelica interested in the mild-mannered and timid Reggie Irving passing him off as a notorious playboy to intrigue her. He asks his friend Polly to teach Reggie "how to treat a woman right", but he turns to be a disastrous learner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6vmo8pJjRBoByhdtIIJ7S10cvv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53571'),
  ('894950843006038285', 'Parmanu: The Story of Pokhran', 2018, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Abhishek Sharma, Kunal Gupta, Aseem Mishra', 'Abhishek Sharma, Saiwyn Quadras, Sanyukta Shaikh Chawla', 'John Abraham, Diana Penty, Boman Irani, Zachary Coffin, Mark Bennington, Arush Nand, Yogendra Tiku, Vikas Kumar', null, 'A look at India''s second confidential nuclear test series at Pokhran lead by Dr. APJ Abdul Kalam, during the time of PM Atal Bihari Vajpayee''s tenure.', 'A look at India''s second confidential nuclear test series at Pokhran lead by Dr. APJ Abdul Kalam, during the time of PM Atal Bihari Vajpayee''s tenure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58X8iBxgT5n4aVBLkDFSnOrIHlD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465642'),
  ('1123749730178111279', 'Paro Pinaki Ki Kahani', 2026, 'Drama, Romance, Crime, Thriller', 'Hanuman Soni, Rudra Jadon, Divyam Jha, Mahek Lalwani, Rajwardhan Shitole, Aarav Singh, Pranav Vidwat', 'Rudra Jadon', 'Eshita Singh, Dhananjay Sardeshpande, Madan Deodhar, Lalit Kumar, Ramdas Andhare', null, 'Pinaki, a manhole cleaner from a small town, shares an unusual yet tender bond with Mariyam, a vegetable vendor he meets during their daily commute to the city. When Mariyam suddenly disappears one morning, Pinaki is left anxious and searching for answers, setting him on an emotional journey that challenges his courage, hope, and love.', 'Pinaki, a manhole cleaner from a small town, shares an unusual yet tender bond with Mariyam, a vegetable vendor he meets during their daily commute to the city. When Mariyam suddenly disappears one morning, Pinaki is left anxious and searching for answers, setting him on an emotional journey that challenges his courage, hope, and love.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FmU8MoyOmXNJCru3ys11h6jGvQZn.jpg', 'plex:movie:paro-pinaki-ki-kahani'),
  ('154101302681813918', 'Parole Violators', 1994, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Patrick G. Donahue, Mike Pierce', 'Patrick G. Donahue, Sean P. Donahue', 'Sean P. Donahue, Pamela Bosley, Michael Kiel, Rey Garcia, Lindsey Rhodeos, Leeds Landain, Mike Donahue, Christine Moon', null, 'TV show host Miles Long, trades his camera in for a 9mm hand gun when his girlfriends daughter is kidnapped by a parolee that he put behind bars while on the police force.', 'TV show host Miles Long, trades his camera in for a 9mm hand gun when his girlfriends daughter is kidnapped by a parolee that he put behind bars while on the police force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lb4ti1hqJGICZVn9OM0u4bk1DuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108501'),
  ('1016845190741175876', 'Parole, Inc.', 1948, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Gilbert Warrenton, Alfred Zeisler', 'Sherman L. Lowe', 'Michael O''Shea, Turhan Bey, Evelyn Ankers, Virginia Lee, Charles Bradstreet, Lyle Talbot, Michael Whalen, James Cardwell', 'NR', 'A federal agent''s life is in danger when he''s exposed while investigating a parole scheme.', 'A federal agent''s life is in danger when he''s exposed while investigating a parole scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j81QqwJk13RvM6W0JqL8x991xbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51146'),
  ('80758748113899557', 'Paroles et musique', 1984, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Élie Chouraqui, Robert Alazraki', 'Élie Chouraqui', 'Catherine Deneuve, Christopher Lambert, Richard Anconina, Jacques Perrin, Nick Mancuso, Dayle Haddon, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Dominique Lavanant', null, 'When Peter, Margaux''s American writer husband, leaves Paris in a funk and heads home, she finds herself the single parent of two near teens. She also gets a new assignment at work: to find, sign, and promote new rock singers. She discovers a duo, Jeremy and Michel, and jump-starts their music careers. Jeremy is attracted to the older Margaux, asserts himself with her, befriends her children, and neglects Michel and their music. The kids go to New York to be with their father Peter, freeing Margaux to respond to Jeremy. Does that relationship have any future? And what of the musical duo?', 'When Peter, Margaux''s American writer husband, leaves Paris in a funk and heads home, she finds herself the single parent of two near teens. She also gets a new assignment at work: to find, sign, and promote new rock singers. She discovers a duo, Jeremy and Michel, and jump-starts their music careers. Jeremy is attracted to the older Margaux, asserts himself with her, befriends her children, and neglects Michel and their music. The kids go to New York to be with their father Peter, freeing Margaux to respond to Jeremy. Does that relationship have any future? And what of the musical duo?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsC4MgxFXledGXZFr2Wiq06MGmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63111'),
  ('530668421297228694', 'Parrish', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'Delmer Daves, Chuck Hansen, Russell Llewellyn', 'Delmer Daves', 'Troy Donahue, Claudette Colbert, Karl Malden, Dean Jagger, Connie Stevens, Diane McBain, Sharon Hugueny, Dub Taylor', null, 'Parrish McLean lives with his mother Ellen on Sala Post''s tobacco plantation in the Connecticut River Valley. His mother winds up marrying Sala''s rival Judd Raike, ruthless planter who wants to drive Sala out of business. Judd insists that Parrish learn the business from the ground up.', 'Parrish McLean lives with his mother Ellen on Sala Post''s tobacco plantation in the Connecticut River Valley. His mother winds up marrying Sala''s rival Judd Raike, ruthless planter who wants to drive Sala out of business. Judd insists that Parrish learn the business from the ground up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ap2J9y6tdgU0ErqH8ncbVQ2vj0P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28284'),
  ('1063753391267999289', 'Parrot Sketch Not Included: Twenty Years of Monty Python', 1989, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Ian MacNaughton', 'Terry Jones, John Cleese, Michael Palin', 'Graham Chapman, John Cleese, Terry Gilliam, Eric Idle, Terry Jones, Michael Palin, Steve Martin', 'NR', 'Steve Martin presents selected sketches from "Monty Python''s Flying Circus (1969)". It''s the well known sketches, though the parrot sketch is not included. Steve Martin has some funny comments on the Pythons.', 'Steve Martin presents selected sketches from "Monty Python''s Flying Circus (1969)". It''s the well known sketches, though the parrot sketch is not included. Steve Martin has some funny comments on the Pythons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdKLqimStYgo9nCR4PA4St8eiJ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107215'),
