  ('822314378113605889', 'Parsifal', 1982, 'Drama, Music', 'Hans-Jürgen Syberberg, Igor Luther', 'Richard Wagner', 'Armin Jordan, Wolfgang Schöne, Martin Sperr, Hans Tschammer, Robert Lloyd, Michael Kutter, Karin Krick, Reiner Goldberg', null, 'A psychological interpretation of the opera mixing in references to the history of Germany, Wagner’s life, German literature and philosophy. The action is centered on Wagner’s death mask. Kundry is the main character – one might read the film as the story of her redemption rather than that of Amfortas.', 'A psychological interpretation of the opera mixing in references to the history of Germany, Wagner’s life, German literature and philosophy. The action is centered on Wagner’s death mask. Kundry is the main character – one might read the film as the story of her redemption rather than that of Amfortas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDyqdBFp84grpTPrP0FfjOtL5QT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176167'),
  ('1001164029849892861', 'Part Time Pal', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Lillian Randolph, Harry Lang', 'NR', 'Tom is given the task of guarding the fridge during the night by Mammy-Two-Shoes, but as soon as he has started he is tricked by Jerry into falling into the basement, where he lands in a barrel of cider. Now drunk, Tom staggers around in the house getting up to no good with Jerry.', 'Tom is given the task of guarding the fridge during the night by Mammy-Two-Shoes, but as soon as he has started he is tricked by Jerry into falling into the basement, where he lands in a barrel of cider. Now drunk, Tom staggers around in the house getting up to no good with Jerry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5VLbJlOT94yGbaPeV0jtRVbMoH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40370'),
  ('898530362002772229', 'Part-Time Lifeguards', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Galettini', 'Salvador Valverde Calvo', 'Emilio Disi, Berugo Carambula, Gino Renni, Alberto Fernández de Rosa, Adrián Martel, Mario Castiglione, Mónica Gonzaga, Jorge Montejo', null, 'This time, the Brigada Z gang, take a little vacation in Mar del Plata but their money is stolen. In order to enjoy their vacation, they become lifeguards and accidentally discover a band of thieves that robs Casinos. Emilio, Gino, Berugo and Alberto don''t forget they''re cops so they decide to investigate.', 'This time, the Brigada Z gang, take a little vacation in Mar del Plata but their money is stolen. In order to enjoy their vacation, they become lifeguards and accidentally discover a band of thieves that robs Casinos. Emilio, Gino, Berugo and Alberto don''t forget they''re cops so they decide to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjPOihkqOPvPRPOetT6QH7lUtit.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149039'),
  ('898372134296227791', 'Part-Time Lifeguards II: The Crazy Beach', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Galettini', 'Salvador Valverde Calvo', 'Emilio Disi, Guillermo Francella, Mónica Gonzaga, Patricia Sarán, Juan Manuel Tenuta, Gino Renni, Joe Rígoli, Betina Varde', null, 'Emilio and Guillermo are two sports club employees, that are fired due to their incompetence at work. They overhead that their favourite girls are going on vacation to Mar del Plata, and they decide to go. Once there they go to the casino and lose all their money, they find jobs as lifeguards.', 'Emilio and Guillermo are two sports club employees, that are fired due to their incompetence at work. They overhead that their favourite girls are going on vacation to Mar del Plata, and they decide to go. Once there they go to the casino and lose all their money, they find jobs as lifeguards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHLEeoM9jwqDRkOSpeb2SWpsFVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149031'),
  ('850316121821172588', 'Part-Time Lifeguards III', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Rodolfo Ledo', 'Salvador Valverde Calvo, Salvador Valverde Freire', 'Emilio Disi, Guillermo Francella, Pamela David, Gino Renni, Pablo Granados, Yayo Guridi, Pachu Peña, Luciana Salazar', null, 'Three friends at a beach resort work together to stop a gang from making a potion that can manipulate people''s desires.', 'Three friends at a beach resort work together to stop a gang from making a potion that can manipulate people''s desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFzOIeaUNHgR9c2au4ySVTQVxxU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160686'),
  ('139360444436671044', 'Part-Time Spy', 2017, 'Action, Comedy', 'Kim Deok-su, Jang Tae-hyeon', 'Jeong Seong-hun', 'Kang Ye-won, Han Chae-a, Namkoong Min, Jo Jae-yun, Kim Min-kyo, Kim Sung-eun, Kwak Ja-hyung, Dong Hyun-bae', null, 'A desperate 35 year-old Young-sil is more than ready for full time job. And finally she gets a call from National security department as an intern. But her joy lasts no long, soon asked to leave. Accidently she discovers a secret about her boss and she suggest a deal of full time job to help him; secret spy.', 'A desperate 35 year-old Young-sil is more than ready for full time job. And finally she gets a call from National security department as an intern. But her joy lasts no long, soon asked to leave. Accidently she discovers a secret about her boss and she suggest a deal of full time job to help him; secret spy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yt9VjqsjJznvyWdG4FXfcnCzxow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448166'),
  ('49909641143604935', 'Parthenope', 2024, 'Drama', 'Paolo Sorrentino, Daria D''Antonio, Jacopo Bonvicini', 'Paolo Sorrentino', 'Celeste Dalla Porta, Stefania Sandrelli, Gary Oldman, Silvio Orlando, Luisa Ranieri, Peppe Lanzetta, Isabella Ferrari, Silvia Degrandi', 'R', 'Parthenope, born in the sea near Naples in 1950, is beautiful, enigmatic, and intelligent. She is shamelessly courted by many. However, beauty comes at a cost.', 'Parthenope, born in the sea near Naples in 1950, is beautiful, enigmatic, and intelligent. She is shamelessly courted by many. However, beauty comes at a cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3BL39ca5pliALDTzUdC9ZIB9gk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1109255'),
  ('41397745115130407', 'Particle', 2012, 'Drama', 'Erdem Tepegöz', 'Erdem Tepegöz', 'Jale Arıkan, Rüçhan Çalışkur, Ergun Kuyucu, Özay Fecht, Mesude Türkmen, Remzi Pamukçu, Dilay Demirok, Sencar Sağdıç', null, 'How much space does Zeynep take up in this vast universe? This is a city brimming with the struggling and the unemployed; aren’t their lives a bit like the infinite, tiny particles flying through the air? Zeynep is already trying hard to make ends meet when she gets fired from her job at a textile mill. The Particle follows her as she searches for a job. We follow her in and out of workspaces. Zeynep’s world – the streets and homes in Tarlabaşı – are dark and suffocating.', 'How much space does Zeynep take up in this vast universe? This is a city brimming with the struggling and the unemployed; aren’t their lives a bit like the infinite, tiny particles flying through the air? Zeynep is already trying hard to make ends meet when she gets fired from her job at a textile mill. The Particle follows her as she searches for a job. We follow her in and out of workspaces. Zeynep’s world – the streets and homes in Tarlabaşı – are dark and suffocating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5wktbdsWuC4TsfnamnVg24kDpQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199277'),
  ('350085068742772946', 'Particle Fever', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Mark Levinson', 'Martin Aleksa, Nima Arkani-Hamed, Savas Dimopoulos', 'Martin Aleksa, Nima Arkani-Hamed, Savas Dimopoulos, Monica Dunford, Fabiola Gianotti, David Kaplan, Mike Lamont', null, 'As the Large Hadron Collider is about to be launched for the first time, physicists are on the cusp of the greatest scientific discovery of all time - or perhaps their greatest failure.', 'As the Large Hadron Collider is about to be launched for the first time, physicists are on the cusp of the greatest scientific discovery of all time - or perhaps their greatest failure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MHs9BrHt6ZjlPvaL4CP1ULYV2Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202141'),
  ('1141075224879428247', 'Particles', 2019, 'Drama', 'Blaise Harrison, Colin Lévêque', 'Blaise Harrison, Mariette Désert', 'Thomas Daloz, Salvatore Ferro, Léo Couilfort, Nicolas Marcant, Néa Lueders, Emma Josserand, Johana Untersinger, Thomas Jansson', null, 'As winter sets in and P.A. sees the world shifting around him, he starts to observe strange phenomena in the environment. The changes are imperceptible at first, but gradually his whole world seems to be on the brink.', 'As winter sets in and P.A. sees the world shifting around him, he starts to observe strange phenomena in the environment. The changes are imperceptible at first, but gradually his whole world seems to be on the brink.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmDf7lvS6OWPB1HLJRVNaeasaAd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582926'),
