  ('163200253565866886', 'Partners', 1982, 'Comedy, Crime', 'James Burrows, Victor J. Kemper', 'Francis Veber', 'Ryan O''Neal, John Hurt, Kenneth McMillan, Robyn Douglass, Jay Robinson, Denise Galik, Joseph R. Sicari, Michael McGuire', 'R', 'After a series of murders in Los Angeles''s gay community, heterosexual police officer Sgt. Benson is assigned to go undercover as half of a gay couple with Officer Kerwin, a Records Clerk', 'After a series of murders in Los Angeles''s gay community, heterosexual police officer Sgt. Benson is assigned to go undercover as half of a gay couple with Officer Kerwin, a Records Clerk', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHVThPfNan8kBdQdw6aSC9cbZu2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72340'),
