  ('548416238194084467', 'Partners in Crime', 2012, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Pascal Thomas', 'Clémence de Biéville, Pascal Thomas, Nathalie Lafaurie', 'Catherine Frot, André Dussollier, Nicolas Marié, Agathe de La Boulaye, Linh-Dan Pham, Éric Naggar, Bernard Verley, Hervé Pierre', null, 'Prudence and Bélisaire Beresford have decided to take things easy. But when a rich Russian heiress disappears, Prudence can''t resist and Bélisaire is forced onto the adventure. Their investigation will put them on the trail of a mysterious scientist who holds the secret to eternal youth...', 'Prudence and Bélisaire Beresford have decided to take things easy. But when a rich Russian heiress disappears, Prudence can''t resist and Bélisaire is forced onto the adventure. Their investigation will put them on the trail of a mysterious scientist who holds the secret to eternal youth...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sggDsiPiWE6GW4T7gdzuFQ3IAgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125395'),
  ('931948739784758608', 'Partners in Crime', 2014, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Chang Jung-Chi, Jimmy Kwongwai Yu', 'Monica & Shaballe', 'Wu Chien-ho, Yao Ai-ning, Kai-Yuan Cheng, Deng Yukai, Chen-Ling Wen, Yu-Ching Hung, Vincent Liang, Brando Huang', null, 'An ordinary day in an ordinary campus, a girl who was loved by everyone killed herself. Everyone is asking why, but no one knows the truth, except these three: a good student, a bad student, and a weird student. For they know the truth of this incident, they decide to do something unordinary for her, as a revenge. They are the partners in crime. However, with the discovery of the girl’s secret diary, we are about to journey back to our high school lives. As an old saying goes, “High school never ends!”', 'An ordinary day in an ordinary campus, a girl who was loved by everyone killed herself. Everyone is asking why, but no one knows the truth, except these three: a good student, a bad student, and a weird student. For they know the truth of this incident, they decide to do something unordinary for her, as a revenge. They are the partners in crime. However, with the discovery of the girl’s secret diary, we are about to journey back to our high school lives. As an old saying goes, “High school never ends!”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGYFuHqxfysGxM3xJtxptQAGeIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279092'),
  ('965087550797083613', 'Parts Per Billion', 2014, 'Science Fiction', 'Brian Horiuchi, John Guleserian', 'Brian Horiuchi', 'Josh Hartnett, Teresa Palmer, Alexis Bledel, Rosario Dawson, Penn Badgley, Gena Rowlands, Frank Langella, Hill Harper', 'R', 'The interwoven stories of three couples which are forced to make life-altering decisions in the face of a disastrous war. Inspired and sometimes blinded by their love, Len, Mia, Andy, Esther, Anna and Erik are as flawed and beautiful as any of the billions who are facing this human-made biological disaster.', 'The interwoven stories of three couples which are forced to make life-altering decisions in the face of a disastrous war. Inspired and sometimes blinded by their love, Len, Mia, Andy, Esther, Anna and Erik are as flawed and beautiful as any of the billions who are facing this human-made biological disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47igAIVIJS8c6ZekhL8UORuwRWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270654'),
  ('1134565962426002581', 'Parts: The Clonus Horror', 1979, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Robert S. Fiveson', 'Ron Smith, Bob Sullivan', 'Peter Graves, Eileen Dietz, Paulette Breen, Frank Ashmore, Dick Sargent, Zale Kessler, William Bufkin, Tony Haig', 'R', 'An escaped clone tries to expose a government plot to clone everyone and make a perfect society.', 'An escaped clone tries to expose a government plot to clone everyone and make a perfect society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFAQLUDuoa2XVAVYMhLTXFh5bGD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98851'),
  ('1084766366319046991', 'Party', 1984, 'Drama', 'Govind Nihalani, Govind Nihalani, Arunabh Bhattacharjee', 'Vishnu Vaman Shirwadkar', 'Vijaya Mehta, Deepa Sahi, Rohini Hattangadi, Shafi Inamdar, Gulan Kripalani, Amrish Puri, Manohar Singh, K.K. Raina', null, 'Celebrities arrive at an extravagant party in Bombay to honour Divakar for his contributions to arts and cinema. However, gossip, uninvited guests and a dead body show up to mar the celebrations.', 'Celebrities arrive at an extravagant party in Bombay to honour Divakar for his contributions to arts and cinema. However, gossip, uninvited guests and a dead body show up to mar the celebrations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpwyMapM7f2gQKRIyJODW9doCBL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131318'),
  ('840697193383678312', 'Party', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Renato Berta, Carlos Ferreiro', 'Agustina Bessa-Luís, Jacques Parsi', 'Michel Piccoli, Irene Papas, Leonor Silveira, Rogério Samora, Sofia Alves, Ricardo Trêpa', null, 'The battle of the sexes? The forces of despair and seduction? On S. Miguel in the Azores, Rogério, a young man with old money, and his enigmatic wife Leonor host a garden party at their villa. The intriguing guests are an older unmarried couple, the philosophical and observant Irene, and Michel, a roué. While Rogério and Irene talk, Michel and Leonor go down to the sea. The conversations upset Rogério and capture Leonor''s imagination. Five years later, the four dine at the villa. Michel and Leonor again leave the other two. Intentions and undercurrents are subtle. One of the four proves strong, one weak, and two must choose. Wind and rain bring down the curtain on both acts.', 'The battle of the sexes? The forces of despair and seduction? On S. Miguel in the Azores, Rogério, a young man with old money, and his enigmatic wife Leonor host a garden party at their villa. The intriguing guests are an older unmarried couple, the philosophical and observant Irene, and Michel, a roué. While Rogério and Irene talk, Michel and Leonor go down to the sea. The conversations upset Rogério and capture Leonor''s imagination. Five years later, the four dine at the villa. Michel and Leonor again leave the other two. Intentions and undercurrents are subtle. One of the four proves strong, one weak, and two must choose. Wind and rain bring down the curtain on both acts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeIZwSwdMrAuuBSj5Ji0aNA6Gu3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203949'),
  ('825703398863038307', 'Party 7', 2000, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Katsuhito Ishii, Hiroshi Machida', 'Katsuhito Ishii', 'Masatoshi Nagase, Keisuke Horibe, Yoshinori Okada, Akemi Kobayashi, Tadanobu Asano, Yoshio Harada, Tatsuya Gashûin, Ryo Kase', null, 'Seven characters, introduced at the start of the film, get thrown together into the same hotel room: a thief who''s stolen a suitcase of money from the mob, his ex-girlfriend, her obsessive boyfriend, the mob soldier sent to retrieve the briefcase, another mobster sent to kill them, master voyeur Captain Banana and his new apprentice, The Mister Yellow. Who will end up with the money?', 'Seven characters, introduced at the start of the film, get thrown together into the same hotel room: a thief who''s stolen a suitcase of money from the mob, his ex-girlfriend, her obsessive boyfriend, the mob soldier sent to retrieve the briefcase, another mobster sent to kill them, master voyeur Captain Banana and his new apprentice, The Mister Yellow. Who will end up with the money?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51IgVbBHglYn0JXtI5TxJaoOQW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31140'),
  ('230202464339474516', 'Party Central', 2014, 'Family, Comedy, Animation, Fantasy', 'Kelsey Mann', 'Kelsey Mann', 'Billy Crystal, John Goodman, Charlie Day, Dave Foley, Sean Hayes, Joel Murray, Peter Sohn, Julia Sweeney', 'PG', 'Mike and Sulley are back at Monsters University for a fun-filled weekend with their Oozma Kappa fraternity brothers. The gang is throwing their first party, but no one’s showing up. Luckily for them, Mike and Sulley have come up with a plan to make sure “Party Central” is the most epic party the school has ever seen.', 'Mike and Sulley are back at Monsters University for a fun-filled weekend with their Oozma Kappa fraternity brothers. The gang is throwing their first party, but no one’s showing up. Luckily for them, Mike and Sulley have come up with a plan to make sure “Party Central” is the most epic party the school has ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whqMDEZq4TYv0zU0UV0iw4i2qi8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258152'),
  ('203094597701591818', 'Party Crashers', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Andrucha Waddington, Ricardo Della Rosa', 'Andrucha Waddington, Nina Crintzs, Marcelo Vindicato', 'Marcelo Adnet, Eduardo Sterblitch, Mariana Ximenes, Stepan Nercessian, Elena Sopova, Susana Vieira, Luis Gustavo, Luis Carlos Miele', null, '"Party Crashers" chronicles the amusing encounter between Marco Polo (Marcelo Adnet), a Copacabana trickster, and Beto (Eduardo Sterblitch), a shy and insecure man, on the New Year''s Eve in Rio. Together they crash parties and create a lot of confusion in search of the beautiful Laura.', '"Party Crashers" chronicles the amusing encounter between Marco Polo (Marcelo Adnet), a Copacabana trickster, and Beto (Eduardo Sterblitch), a shy and insecure man, on the New Year''s Eve in Rio. Together they crash parties and create a lot of confusion in search of the beautiful Laura.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iY9ucqKxL2G4cYRk5Lgc4YZynZu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132712'),
  ('800948949287908523', 'Party Crashers 2', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Andrucha Waddington, Fernando Young, Kity Féo', 'Renato Fagundes', 'Eduardo Sterblitch, Marcelo Adnet, Mariana Ximenes, Stepan Nercessian, Danton Mello, Elena Sopova, Mikhail Bronnikov, Laila Zaid', null, 'The quartet of coup plotters is back, but before they need to resolve some minor internal disagreements, since Marco has struck a blow at his best friend, Beto, who, desolate, stops at a psychiatric clinic. It is up to Laura and Nelson to help him out of the institution.', 'The quartet of coup plotters is back, but before they need to resolve some minor internal disagreements, since Marco has struck a blow at his best friend, Beto, who, desolate, stops at a psychiatric clinic. It is up to Laura and Nelson to help him out of the institution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDUCug8zOh8IKEZSk5xDZUdf8wR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428519'),
  ('1040542421766654778', 'Party Girl', 1930, 'Drama', 'Victor Halperin, Robert Newhard, Henry Cronjager', 'Victor Halperin, Monte M. Katterjohn, George Draney', 'Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Jeanette Loff, Judith Barrie, Marie Prevost, John St. Polis, Sammy Blum, Harry Northrup, Almeda Fowler', null, 'Jay Rountree, a young, rising businessman and a son of a wealthy manufacturer gets caught up in a web involving an escort service or ''party girls'' and trapped into an unhappy marriage.', 'Jay Rountree, a young, rising businessman and a son of a wealthy manufacturer gets caught up in a web involving an escort service or ''party girls'' and trapped into an unhappy marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33A5yIkUT532vO2wQuiTrGzVCpo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220909'),
  ('364259535947444524', 'Party Girl', 1958, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Nicholas Ray, Erich von Stroheim Jr., Robert J. Bronner', 'George Wells', 'Robert Taylor, Cyd Charisse, Lee J. Cobb, John Ireland, Kent Smith, Claire Kelly, Corey Allen, Lewis Charles', 'NR', 'Slick lawyer Thomas Farrell has made a career of defending mobsters in trials. It''s not until he meets a lovely showgirl at a mob party that he realizes that there''s more to life than winning trials. Farrell tries to quit the racket, but mob boss Rico Angelo threatens to hurt the showgirl if Farrell leaves him.', 'Slick lawyer Thomas Farrell has made a career of defending mobsters in trials. It''s not until he meets a lovely showgirl at a mob party that he realizes that there''s more to life than winning trials. Farrell tries to quit the racket, but mob boss Rico Angelo threatens to hurt the showgirl if Farrell leaves him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqCFJKx2C6pqdDQOP2d7aXvN7OO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25633'),
  ('636652507081680270', 'Party Girl', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Daisy von Scherler Mayer, Julie Carr, Paul C. Arianas', 'Harry Birckmayer, Daisy von Scherler Mayer', 'Parker Posey, Guillermo Díaz, Liev Schreiber, Omar Townsend, Anthony DeSando, Sasha von Scherler, Donna Mitchell, Simon Verhoeven', 'R', 'Although Mary has little income, she still finds ways to spend her nights at clubs. After being arrested for throwing an illegal rave, she asks her aunt Judy for bail money. Judy then finds Mary a job at her library so that Mary can repay her. Initially, Mary finds the job as a clerk boring and stifling, and prefers to get to know a street food vendor whom she likes. However, Mary must refocus her life once she loses her job and apartment.', 'Although Mary has little income, she still finds ways to spend her nights at clubs. After being arrested for throwing an illegal rave, she asks her aunt Judy for bail money. Judy then finds Mary a job at her library so that Mary can repay her. Initially, Mary finds the job as a clerk boring and stifling, and prefers to get to know a street food vendor whom she likes. However, Mary must refocus her life once she loses her job and apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfGEUftQVjvJHTTc3OKbzfsBamT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36196'),
  ('109358647437771420', 'Party Girl', 2014, 'Drama', 'Marie Amachoukeli, Samuel Theis, Claire Burger', 'Claire Burger, Marie Amachoukeli, Samuel Theis', 'Angélique Litzenburger, Joseph Bour, Mario Theis, Samuel Theis, Séverine Litzenburger, Cynthia Litzenburger', null, 'Angélique is a 60-year-old bar hostess. She still likes to party, she still likes men. At night, she makes them drink, in a cabaret by the French-German border. As time goes by, clients become rare. But Michel, her regular client, is still in love with her. One day, he asks Angélique to marry him.', 'Angélique is a 60-year-old bar hostess. She still likes to party, she still likes men. At night, she makes them drink, in a cabaret by the French-German border. As time goes by, clients become rare. But Michel, her regular client, is still in love with her. One day, he asks Angélique to marry him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woul0s4PWeTRbeQH4TdBqOr19Gq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266030'),
  ('1149475851635552428', 'Party Hard, Die Young', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Nadja Berke, Dominik Hartl, Thomas W. Kiennast', null, 'Elisabeth Wabitsch, Michael Glantschnig, Marlon Boess, Markus Freistätter, Valerie Huber, Antonia Moretti, Hisham Morscher, Thomas Otrok', null, 'Julia and her friends, celebrating their high school graduation in Croatia, find themselves the targets of a masked killer who begins picking them off, one by one.', 'Julia and her friends, celebrating their high school graduation in Croatia, find themselves the targets of a masked killer who begins picking them off, one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ShNMA2iIjd2BdkVssXu22Md52b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492118'),
  ('704285424690578660', 'Party Line', 1988, 'Thriller, Horror', 'William Webb, John Huneck, Michael Curtis', 'Richard Brandes', 'Richard Hatch, Shawn Weatherly, Leif Garrett, Greta Blackburn, Richard Roundtree, Terence McGovern, Shelli Place, Patricia Patts', 'R', 'A rich brother and sister are crazed killers. She lures men into her bed, and he attacks them and murders them. A detective is assigned to find the killers and bring them in.', 'A rich brother and sister are crazed killers. She lures men into her bed, and he attacks them and murders them. A detective is assigned to find the killers and bring them in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3YteSeX1nXoprdsojPlXiSWIpy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124114'),
  ('234717836660873565', 'Party Monster', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Fenton Bailey, Randy Barbato, Teodoro Maniaci', 'Randy Barbato, Fenton Bailey', 'Macaulay Culkin, Seth Green, Chloë Sevigny, Natasha Lyonne, Wilmer Valderrama, Wilson Cruz, Diana Scarwid, Dylan McDermott', 'R', 'The New York club scene of the 80s and 90s was a world like no other. Into this candy-colored, mirror ball playground stepped Michael Alig, a wannabe from nowhere special. Under the watchful eye of veteran club kid James St. James, Alig quickly rose to the top... and there was no place to go but down.', 'The New York club scene of the 80s and 90s was a world like no other. Into this candy-colored, mirror ball playground stepped Michael Alig, a wannabe from nowhere special. Under the watchful eye of veteran club kid James St. James, Alig quickly rose to the top... and there was no place to go but down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DVWGtV1OA3W8kZxiimdNsepS6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1415'),
  ('203483795421887843', 'Party Monster: The Shockumentary', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Fenton Bailey, Randy Barbato', null, 'Michael Alig, James St. James', null, 'Tells the story of the rise and fall of Michael Alig, a kid from Middle America who aspired to take the place of Andy Warhol. Michael quickly rose to become the biggest party promoter in New York and King of the so-called Club Kids. But after spiraling into drug addiction, Michael brutally murdered his roommate Angel Melendez.', 'Tells the story of the rise and fall of Michael Alig, a kid from Middle America who aspired to take the place of Andy Warhol. Michael quickly rose to become the biggest party promoter in New York and King of the so-called Club Kids. But after spiraling into drug addiction, Michael brutally murdered his roommate Angel Melendez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thyUsE0hr2me9HC0qQlZ8fzhWqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34424'),
  ('306581248792231038', 'Party of Fools', 2024, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Manon Rieutord, Victoire Nyault, Lisa Benard', 'Christelle Berthevas, Arnaud des Pallières', 'Mélanie Thierry, Carole Bouquet, Marina Foïs, Josiane Balasko, Lucie Zhang, Yolande Moreau, Dominique Frot, Miss Ming', null, 'Paris, 1894. Who is Fanni, who claims to be voluntarily locked up in a women-only mental institution? Searching for her mother among the multitude of so-called ''madwomen'', Fanni discovers a community of modern heroines who defy her expectations, along with the unexpected friendship of fellow patients. The sumptuous and renowned ''Party of Fools'' of the asylum is in preparation. Politicians, artists, and socialites will flock to it. It’s her last hope of escaping the closing trap.', 'Paris, 1894. Who is Fanni, who claims to be voluntarily locked up in a women-only mental institution? Searching for her mother among the multitude of so-called ''madwomen'', Fanni discovers a community of modern heroines who defy her expectations, along with the unexpected friendship of fellow patients. The sumptuous and renowned ''Party of Fools'' of the asylum is in preparation. Politicians, artists, and socialites will flock to it. It’s her last hope of escaping the closing trap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxuxZO6Qi6GlpRsE6CH7EmyhhEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712022'),
  ('950486608435219086', 'Party Over', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ivo Lopes Araújo, Hilton Lacerda', 'Hilton Lacerda', 'Irandhir Santos, Hermila Guedes, Suzy Lopes, Guga Patriota, Leandro Villa, Safira Moreira, Ariclenes Barroso', null, 'Returning early from his vacation after the Carnival period to investigate the murder of a young French tourist, Breno Wanderley is faced with possible reflections of his own history from which he cannot escape. Between Ash Wednesday and post-Carnival Sunday, Breno tries to unravel the crime and sees in his son, also called Breno, a chance to reinvent himself in a broken and sullen city.​', 'Returning early from his vacation after the Carnival period to investigate the murder of a young French tourist, Breno Wanderley is faced with possible reflections of his own history from which he cannot escape. Between Ash Wednesday and post-Carnival Sunday, Breno tries to unravel the crime and sees in his son, also called Breno, a chance to reinvent himself in a broken and sullen city.​', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSGIE8iWDfsjJU1JJ0SlNvA02pG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650040'),
  ('909171570164900928', 'Party Town', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Dani de la Orden, Isaac Vila', 'David Serrano, Diego San José, Daniel González', 'Andreu Buenafuente, Berto Romero, Belén Cuesta, Jorge Sanz, Goyo Jiménez, Llimoo, Josep Maria Riera, Àgata Roca', null, 'Two brothers, Juan and Richi, once had a duo act, Supergalactic, with a one-off pop hit in the 1990s. When the mayor of their hometown asks them to reunite, the two decide to overlook their differences for one last taste of stardom – and a quick payday. However, their fans, local traditions and hidden agendas complicate their plans', 'Two brothers, Juan and Richi, once had a duo act, Supergalactic, with a one-off pop hit in the 1990s. When the mayor of their hometown asks them to reunite, the two decide to overlook their differences for one last taste of stardom – and a quick payday. However, their fans, local traditions and hidden agendas complicate their plans', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/andk1U3PJpnyFKYbFbZcm4aTKFx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378087'),
  ('346143582040333983', 'Partysaurus Rex', 2012, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Mark A. Walsh', 'Mark A. Walsh', 'Wallace Shawn, Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Corey Burton, Tony Cox, Donald Fullilove, Emily Hahn, Don Rickles', 'G', 'When Rex finds himself left behind in the bathroom, he puts his limbs to use by getting a bath going for a bunch of new toy friends.', 'When Rex finds himself left behind in the bathroom, he puts his limbs to use by getting a bath going for a bunch of new toy friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Y7NBliUme8KFqBh4MvQ1NOSDNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130925'),
  ('509410179505898642', 'Parugu', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Bhaskar, Brahma Kadali, Vijay C Chakravarthy', 'Bhaskar', 'Allu Arjun, Sheela Kaur, Prakash Raj, Sunil Varma, Saptagiri, Subbaraju, Jayaprakash Reddy, Poonam Bajwa', null, 'A group of friends are forcibly transported to a village and kept imprisoned, as the village head, who believes that they have helped in his daughter''s elopement with her lover.', 'A group of friends are forcibly transported to a village and kept imprisoned, as the village head, who believes that they have helped in his daughter''s elopement with her lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJqzhEAp1WHch8GCnvcphrLt4a4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23776'),
  ('867383924867706474', 'Paruthiveeran', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, Action', 'Ameer, Ramji', 'Ameer', 'Karthi, Priyamani, Ponvannan, Saravanan, Sujatha Sivakumar, Ganja Karuppu, Sampath Raj, Samuthirakani', null, 'A village tough finally succumbs to the unconditional love of his angelic cousin, but his romance faces insurmountable challenges, including family opposition and his own delinquent personality.', 'A village tough finally succumbs to the unconditional love of his angelic cousin, but his romance faces insurmountable challenges, including family opposition and his own delinquent personality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otDs2Cfi2MPZ5DmsH7QaN8clEpR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69598'),
  ('599206884769569639', 'Pas de Deux', 1968, 'Music, Drama', 'Norman McLaren, Jacques Fogel', null, 'Margaret Mercier, Vincent Warren', null, 'Two ballet dancers perform a dance enhanced with surreal after-image visuals.', 'Two ballet dancers perform a dance enhanced with surreal after-image visuals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38dqY0PA5dLbIJOZMyYXKkp4dnr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129303'),
  ('574607564181296086', 'Pas de Deux: The Story of a Success', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Andrea Barzini, Marco Pieroni', 'Andrea Barzini, Teodosio Losito', 'Kledi Kadiu, Laura Chiatti, Genti Kame, Stefania Barca, Monica Vallerini, Nathalie Guetta, Andrea Sartoretti, Riccardo Zinna', null, 'Beni is an Albanian who came clandestinely to Italy with the mirage of a career as a dancer. He will find himself the victim of a scam, performing in second-rate shows and almost a prisoner of an organization bordering on legality. He will overcome a thousand difficulties thanks to his determination, his passion for dance and his love for a dancer who seemed unattainable.', 'Beni is an Albanian who came clandestinely to Italy with the mirage of a career as a dancer. He will find himself the victim of a scam, performing in second-rate shows and almost a prisoner of an organization bordering on legality. He will overcome a thousand difficulties thanks to his determination, his passion for dance and his love for a dancer who seemed unattainable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfexwmIlmB5AdNt7D80dl2l8lH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65039'),
  ('75399771918365082', 'Pas vu, pas pris', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Pierre Carles', null, 'François Léotard, Alain Duhamel, Anne Sinclair, Francois-Henri de Virieu, Bernard Benyamin, Jacques Chancel, Patrick Poivre d''Arvor, Michel Denisot', null, '"Pas vu, pas pris" starts with a subject filmed 2 years ago ; ordered then forbidden to broadcasting by Canal + : it was "Pas vu à la télé". Bernard Benyamin, Henri de Virieux, Patrick de Carolis, Anne Sinclair, Charles Villeneuve (amongst others) appear before the candid camera of Pierre Carles, for once subjected to an investigation that concerns their profession. After proclaiming that there is no taboo subject on television, they discover a pirate document showing Étienne Moujeotte and François Léotard in a business discussion about the destinies of TF1. Question asked : would they have agreed to broadcast this document and if not, why not ? The investigation itself is objectively searching : anything can be said on TV except one thing, the more or less close collusion of journalists and the political powers. Pierre Carles gives us a sharp reflection on the scope of this "fourth power" that the media have become, and on the compromises of those who are its masters.', '"Pas vu, pas pris" starts with a subject filmed 2 years ago ; ordered then forbidden to broadcasting by Canal + : it was "Pas vu à la télé". Bernard Benyamin, Henri de Virieux, Patrick de Carolis, Anne Sinclair, Charles Villeneuve (amongst others) appear before the candid camera of Pierre Carles, for once subjected to an investigation that concerns their profession. After proclaiming that there is no taboo subject on television, they discover a pirate document showing Étienne Moujeotte and François Léotard in a business discussion about the destinies of TF1. Question asked : would they have agreed to broadcast this document and if not, why not ? The investigation itself is objectively searching : anything can be said on TV except one thing, the more or less close collusion of journalists and the political powers. Pierre Carles gives us a sharp reflection on the scope of this "fourth power" that the media have become, and on the compromises of those who are its masters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Lt4X56DQgd6bqyWxymryUJAvu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61761'),
  ('1029982887123645312', 'Pascali''s Island', 1988, 'Drama', 'James Dearden, Roger Deakins', 'James Dearden', 'Ben Kingsley, Charles Dance, Helen Mirren, Kevork Malikyan, Nadim Sawalha, T. P. McKenna, Giorgos Oikonomou, Vernon Dobtcheff', 'PG-13', '1908: Pascali, a spy for the Sultan, sends reports to Istanbul that nobody reads. His suspicions are roused when a British archaeologist appears, who may not be quite what he seems.', '1908: Pascali, a spy for the Sultan, sends reports to Istanbul that nobody reads. His suspicions are roused when a British archaeologist appears, who may not be quite what he seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNBIQ68VmeAgmXzKN07w4AQqRnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116345'),
  ('16632534737539690', 'Pascual Duarte', 1976, 'Drama', 'Ricardo Franco, Luis Cuadrado', 'Ricardo Franco, Emilio Martínez Lázaro, Elías Querejeta', 'José Luis Gómez, Diana Perez de Guzman, Paca Ojea, Héctor Alterio, Eduardo Calvo, Joaquín Hinojosa, Maribel Ferrero', null, 'In Extremadura, Spain, Pascual Duarte, a humble, simple and ignorant peasant, condemned to a boring and humiliating existence with no future, commits a horrible act during a day of such heat that enervates his disturbed mind and his anger, which he will not be able to calm down until, after following a bloody path of senseless violence, he faces his own tragic destiny.', 'In Extremadura, Spain, Pascual Duarte, a humble, simple and ignorant peasant, condemned to a boring and humiliating existence with no future, commits a horrible act during a day of such heat that enervates his disturbed mind and his anger, which he will not be able to calm down until, after following a bloody path of senseless violence, he faces his own tragic destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/romzbGGeGoQvbq3Z1aufE9oSfOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98964'),
  ('133519923167150631', 'Pasha', 1968, 'Drama, Crime', 'Georges Lautner, Roger de Broin, Maurice Fellous', 'Michel Audiard, Georges Lautner, Albert Simonin', 'Jean Gabin, Dany Carrel, André Pousse, Robert Dalban, Jean Gaven, Louis Arbessier, Gérard Buhr, Maurice Garrel', null, 'Six months before his retirement from the criminal police, inspector Joss finds his colleague Gouvion dead, in a poorly faked suicide attempt. Joss loses his temper, and investigates on his own, which leads him through the bas-fond of Paris...', 'Six months before his retirement from the criminal police, inspector Joss finds his colleague Gouvion dead, in a poorly faked suicide attempt. Joss loses his temper, and investigates on his own, which leads him through the bas-fond of Paris...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDGHxgQ8nd9BwEa1Pzqk3VbEdzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55316'),
