  ('565442257121506978', 'Paskal', 2018, 'Action, War, Drama, History, Adventure, Crime', 'Heng Aik Siong, Yong Choon Lin, Adrian Teh', 'Anwari Ashraf, Adrian Teh', 'Hairul Azreen, Ammar Alfian Aziz, Henley Hii, Taufiq Hanafi, Gambit Saifullah, Hafizul Kamal, Theebaan Govindasamy, Jasmine Suraya Chin', null, 'The true events of Lieutenant Commander Arman Anwar of PASKAL, an elite unit in the Royal Malaysian Navy, and his team''s mission to rescue the MV Bunga Laurel, a tanker which was hijacked by Somalian Pirates in 2011.', 'The true events of Lieutenant Commander Arman Anwar of PASKAL, an elite unit in the Royal Malaysian Navy, and his team''s mission to rescue the MV Bunga Laurel, a tanker which was hijacked by Somalian Pirates in 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAI8whpvqWxxucVGJdDiGOfCjMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546230'),
  ('557646613191621754', 'Pasolini', 2014, 'History, Drama', 'Abel Ferrara, Stefano Falivene, Luca Cenname', 'Maurizio Braucci', 'Willem Dafoe, Ninetto Davoli, Riccardo Scamarcio, Valerio Mastandrea, Roberto Zibetti, Andrea Bosca, Giada Colagrande, Damiano Tamilia', null, 'We are with Pasolini during the last hours of his life, as he talks with his beloved family and friends, writes, gives a brutally honest interview, shares a meal with Ninetto Davoli, and cruises for the roughest rough trade in his gun-metal gray Alfa Romeo. Over the course of the action, Pasolini’s life and his art are constantly refracted and intermingled to the point where they become one.', 'We are with Pasolini during the last hours of his life, as he talks with his beloved family and friends, writes, gives a brutally honest interview, shares a meal with Ninetto Davoli, and cruises for the roughest rough trade in his gun-metal gray Alfa Romeo. Over the course of the action, Pasolini’s life and his art are constantly refracted and intermingled to the point where they become one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmlo7J7FjX6XJA7iNRPGqjx5atx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283700'),
  ('564309751638131818', 'Pass the Gravy', 1928, 'Comedy', 'Leo McCarey, Fred Guiol', 'Leo McCarey, Hal Roach', 'Max Davidson, Martha Sleeper, Spec O''Donnell, Bert Sprotte, Gene Morgan', 'NR', 'Schultz raises prize chickens and roosters that are always getting into neighbor Max Davidson''s garden and eating the seeds, leading to constant feuding between the two men. When their children announce their engagement the two men decide to bury the hatchet and Davidson suggests a dinner at his house. He gives his young son, Ignatz, two dollars to buy a chicken but the boy pockets the money and kills Schultz'' first place rooster instead. Once seated at the table all but Schultz discover what they are eating and desperately try to hide the bad news from Schultz who is sure to kill Davidson if he knows the truth.', 'Schultz raises prize chickens and roosters that are always getting into neighbor Max Davidson''s garden and eating the seeds, leading to constant feuding between the two men. When their children announce their engagement the two men decide to bury the hatchet and Davidson suggests a dinner at his house. He gives his young son, Ignatz, two dollars to buy a chicken but the boy pockets the money and kills Schultz'' first place rooster instead. Once seated at the table all but Schultz discover what they are eating and desperately try to hide the bad news from Schultz who is sure to kill Davidson if he knows the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r75ujAab9Ga5UUZ7hnQQKk9mRYW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128300'),
  ('911087200177450342', 'Passage à l''Acte', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Martin Arnold', null, null, null, 'An avant-garde sonic and visual reediting of a short clip from the classic 1962 film "To Kill a Mockingbird".', 'An avant-garde sonic and visual reediting of a short clip from the classic 1962 film "To Kill a Mockingbird".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAgZaAC2xXW7pJzA1QPAxNpwGQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93480'),
