  ('1085708950071047129', 'Passenger', 1963, 'Drama, War', 'Andrzej Munk, Krzysztof Winiewicz, Andrzej Brzozowski', 'Zofia Posmysz, Andrzej Munk', 'Aleksandra Śląska, Anna Ciepielewska, Janusz Bylczyński, Krzesislawa Dubielówna, Anna Gołębiowska, Barbara Horawianka, Anna Jaraczówna, Maria Kościałkowska', null, 'A German woman on a ship returning to Europe notices a face of another woman which brings recollections from the past. She tells her husband that she had been an overseer in Auschwitz during the war, but she has actually saved a woman''s life.', 'A German woman on a ship returning to Europe notices a face of another woman which brings recollections from the past. She tells her husband that she had been an overseer in Auschwitz during the war, but she has actually saved a woman''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ux3lFO5AcyoFiO3hLXVNo133fDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25939'),
  ('508024664064781451', 'Passenger 57', 1992, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Kevin Hooks, Mark Irwin, Gary Marcus', 'Dan Gordon, David Loughery', 'Wesley Snipes, Bruce Payne, Tom Sizemore, Alex Datcher, Bruce Greenwood, Robert Hooks, Elizabeth Hurley, Michael Horse', 'R', 'Airline security specialist John Cutter, finally returning to the job after his wife''s death, finds himself stuck on a flight being hijacked by notorious terrorist Charles Rane. Unfortunately for the terrorists, they''re also stuck with him.', 'Airline security specialist John Cutter, finally returning to the job after his wife''s death, finds himself stuck on a flight being hijacked by notorious terrorist Charles Rane. Unfortunately for the terrorists, they''re also stuck with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VBN8pQxGHjeZWcNv1V1xSw0OKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10538'),
  ('723424010370922885', 'Passenger Side', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Matt Bissonnette', 'Matt Bissonnette', 'Adam Scott, Joel Bissonnette, Robin Tunney, Gale Harold, Richard Medina, Mickey Cottrell, Vitta Quinn, Dimitri Coats', null, 'Two brothers spend the day driving around Los Angeles county looking for the meaning of their lives, or cheap street drugs, depending on who you happen to believe.', 'Two brothers spend the day driving around Los Angeles county looking for the meaning of their lives, or cheap street drugs, depending on who you happen to believe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2oO4hNikdnEOtynS7GGWpeZfjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46737'),
  ('38952204537356948', 'Passengers', 2008, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Romance', 'Rodrigo García, Igor Jadue-Lillo', 'Ronnie Christensen', 'Anne Hathaway, Patrick Wilson, Andre Braugher, Dianne Wiest, David Morse, William B. Davis, Ryan Robbins, Clea DuVall', 'PG-13', 'After a plane crash, a young therapist, Claire, is assigned by her mentor to counsel the flight''s five survivors. When they share their recollections of the incident -- which some say include an explosion that the airline claims never happened -- Claire is intrigued by Eric, the most secretive of the passengers.', 'After a plane crash, a young therapist, Claire, is assigned by her mentor to counsel the flight''s five survivors. When they share their recollections of the incident -- which some say include an explosion that the airline claims never happened -- Claire is intrigued by Eric, the most secretive of the passengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUgzf27luTXvxrzH0jKgSNPwhMC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13944'),
  ('729470588151552301', 'Passengers', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Morten Tyldum, Rodrigo Prieto, Paula Loos', 'Jon Spaihts', 'Jennifer Lawrence, Chris Pratt, Michael Sheen, Laurence Fishburne, Andy Garcia, Vince Foster, Kara Flowers, Conor Brophy', 'PG-13', 'A spacecraft traveling to a distant colony planet and transporting thousands of people has a malfunction in its sleep chambers. As a result, two passengers are awakened 90 years early.', 'A spacecraft traveling to a distant colony planet and transporting thousands of people has a malfunction in its sleep chambers. As a result, two passengers are awakened 90 years early.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jK9S6HANSf2no64v1x1HxfcpmcA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274870'),
