  ('1039871135349189971', 'Passing Fancy', 1933, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu', 'Tadao Ikeda', 'Takeshi Sakamoto, Tomio Aoki, Nobuko Fushimi, Den Obinata, Chōko Iida, Reikō Tani, Seiji Nishimura, Seiichi Katô', null, 'In Depression-era Tokyo, a struggling middle-aged single father with a young son comes across a homeless young lady and convinces a bar owner to take her in.', 'In Depression-era Tokyo, a struggling middle-aged single father with a young son comes across a homeless young lady and convinces a bar owner to take her in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoxgzp1QLDHnR2GgXB56F6HkX19.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117412'),
  ('354114096648215418', 'Passing Summer', 2001, 'Drama', 'Angela Schanelec, François Rossier, Reinhold Vorschneider', 'Angela Schanelec', 'Ursina Lardi, Andreas Patton, Anne Tismer, Wolfgang Michael, Sophie Aigner, Clara Enge, Nina Weniger, Devid Striesow', null, 'A woman faces a variety of emotional crises as she spends the summer interacting in various ways with friends, family, and lovers.', 'A woman faces a variety of emotional crises as she spends the summer interacting in various ways with friends, family, and lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHIr166uxSXN5XAc2iFCIZX39cI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49942'),
  ('385895194864641890', 'Passion', 1954, 'Adventure, Western', 'Allan Dwan, John Alton', 'Józef Lejtes, Beatrice A. Dresher', 'Cornel Wilde, Yvonne De Carlo, Raymond Burr, Lon Chaney Jr., Rodolfo Acosta, John Qualen, Anthony Caruso, Frank De Kova', 'NR', 'In old Spanish California, dashing cattleman Juan Obregon returns to the rancho of his friend Gaspar Melo, to find he''s fathered a son on Rosa, one of Gaspar''s identical twin daughters. Overjoyed, he plans to formalize his "unofficial" marriage. But trouble brews; Melo''s land is of unclear title and the new Don Domingo hopes to grab it for his own profit. Violence results. Without even knowing who survived, Juan (accompanied by Rosa''s tomboy sister Tonya) rides for revenge, through spectacular pastoral and wilderness scenery.', 'In old Spanish California, dashing cattleman Juan Obregon returns to the rancho of his friend Gaspar Melo, to find he''s fathered a son on Rosa, one of Gaspar''s identical twin daughters. Overjoyed, he plans to formalize his "unofficial" marriage. But trouble brews; Melo''s land is of unclear title and the new Don Domingo hopes to grab it for his own profit. Violence results. Without even knowing who survived, Juan (accompanied by Rosa''s tomboy sister Tonya) rides for revenge, through spectacular pastoral and wilderness scenery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtt3sRHDvEfYoAzhpajWq8f9GYk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120124'),
  ('868404741458607615', 'Passion', 1996, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'James Lapine, John Bailey, Paul Gemignani', 'James Lapine, Stephen Sondheim', 'Donna Murphy, Jere Shea, Marin Mazzie, Gregg Edelman, Tom Aldredge, Linda Balgord, T.J. Meyers, William Parry', 'NR', 'Giorgio, a young soldier, is in love with Clara. But they are separated when Giorgio is posted far away, where he meets the unhappy, unhealthy, and unattractive Fosca, who develops a passionate love for Giorgio and tries to make him love her. This rendition of Stephen Sondheim''s Tony Award-winning musical was recorded on the stage with it''s original all-star Broadway cast. Originally broadcast as part of "American Playhouse" on PBS (season thirteen, episode six).', 'Giorgio, a young soldier, is in love with Clara. But they are separated when Giorgio is posted far away, where he meets the unhappy, unhealthy, and unattractive Fosca, who develops a passionate love for Giorgio and tries to make him love her. This rendition of Stephen Sondheim''s Tony Award-winning musical was recorded on the stage with it''s original all-star Broadway cast. Originally broadcast as part of "American Playhouse" on PBS (season thirteen, episode six).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ahekxHToTOEZcXPCLqFrgt8JW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100956'),
  ('366246183306174443', 'Passion', 1998, 'Drama, Crime', 'György Fehér, Miklós Gurbán, Tibor Máthé', 'Béla Tarr, György Fehér', 'Ildikó Bánsági, János Derzsi, Péter Haumann, István Lénárt, László Gálffi, Géza Bereményi, Zoltán Bezerédy, Djoko Rosic', null, 'A woman and her lover plot to kill her older husband.', 'A woman and her lover plot to kill her older husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VVVvOvV9iVIMBuHJ8vTETlMVsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149514'),
  ('983253059664036933', 'Passion', 2008, 'Drama', 'Ryusuke Hamaguchi, Tadashi Nohara, Yuichi Yuzawa', 'Ryusuke Hamaguchi', 'Aoba Kawai, Ryuta Okamoto, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Fusako Urabe, Nao Okabe, Yui Sakuma, Yue, Mayumi Tenkô', null, 'A young couple''s announcement of their engagement to their friends is followed by a series of interactions and conflicts that forces everyone to reflect on their lives.', 'A young couple''s announcement of their engagement to their friends is followed by a series of interactions and conflicts that forces everyone to reflect on their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/em1O57xmPso5qpz8FLe64atAPGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348869'),
  ('497228565625695186', 'Passion', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'José Luis Alcaine, Brian De Palma, Tanja Däberitz', 'Brian De Palma', 'Rachel McAdams, Noomi Rapace, Karoline Herfurth, Paul Anderson, Dominic Raacke, Rainer Bock, Benjamin Sadler, Michael Rotschopf', 'R', 'The rivalry between the manipulative boss of an advertising agency and her talented protégée escalates from stealing credit to public humiliation to murder.', 'The rivalry between the manipulative boss of an advertising agency and her talented protégée escalates from stealing credit to public humiliation to murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9DoB4Rsuc8wdkSZCJWB6fq9QPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109099'),
  ('1069212378463641261', 'Passion Fish', 1992, 'Drama', 'Steve Apicella, Annie Maver, John Sayles', 'John Sayles', 'Mary McDonnell, Alfre Woodard, Vondie Curtis-Hall, David Strathairn, Leo Burmester, Nora Dunn, Mary Portser, Angela Bassett', 'R', 'After an accident leaves her a paraplegic, a former soap opera star struggles to recover both emotionally and mentally, until she meets her newest nurse, who has struggles of her own.', 'After an accident leaves her a paraplegic, a former soap opera star struggles to recover both emotionally and mentally, until she meets her newest nurse, who has struggles of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g60GELLr2oGnlJX5Yidkl9ufFYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41768'),
  ('676435563258178639', 'Passion Flower', 1930, 'Drama', 'William C. deMille, Harold Rosson, Douglas Shearer', 'Martin Flavin', 'Kay Francis, Kay Johnson, Charles Bickford, Winter Hall, Lewis Stone, Zasu Pitts, Dickie Moore, Mary Carlisle', 'NR', 'A bored society woman invites scandal and heartache when she falls in love with her low-born chauffeur.', 'A bored society woman invites scandal and heartache when she falls in love with her low-born chauffeur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZfttVChX1l9oR8qOYOZCGmPnYX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174762'),
  ('104828671513428668', 'Passion in the Desert', 1997, 'Adventure', 'Lavinia Currier, Alexey Rodionov', 'Lavinia Currier', 'Ben Daniels, Michel Piccoli, Paul M. Meston, Kenneth Collard, Nadia Odeh, Auda Mohammed Badoul, Mohammed Ali', 'PG-13', 'Young French officer Augustin Robert escorts artist Jean-Michel Venture de Paradis to Egypt during Napoleon''s Egyptian campaign. Napoleon sent de Paradis to record Egypt''s great monuments and temples that are destroyed by French soldiers in acts of barbarism. During combat, Augustin and Jean-Michel are separated from their regiment, and they start wandering through the desert fighting for their life. In one of the canyons Augustin meets a leopard he names Simoom and a strange bond between them appears.', 'Young French officer Augustin Robert escorts artist Jean-Michel Venture de Paradis to Egypt during Napoleon''s Egyptian campaign. Napoleon sent de Paradis to record Egypt''s great monuments and temples that are destroyed by French soldiers in acts of barbarism. During combat, Augustin and Jean-Michel are separated from their regiment, and they start wandering through the desert fighting for their life. In one of the canyons Augustin meets a leopard he names Simoom and a strange bond between them appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3jjf0LGUY6G3ICkdAVLQV7Txii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60951'),
  ('1047510232014175421', 'Passion of Love', 1981, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ettore Scola, Paola Scola, Claudio Ragona', 'Ruggero Maccari, Ettore Scola', 'Valeria D''Obici, Bernard Giraudeau, Laura Antonelli, Massimo Girotti, Bernard Blier, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Gerardo Amato, Sandro Ghiani', null, 'In the 1860''s, Giorgio (Giraudeau), a young Italian soldier is sent to a remote post, far away from his lover, Clara (Antonelli). He is lodged in the house of the colonel (Girotti). He becames friends with the colonel and the local doctor (Trintignant). Among the inhabitants of the house, there is a strange young woman - Fosca (d''Obici) who is both unattractive and mad. However, she has a passion that Giorgio will have to cope with.', 'In the 1860''s, Giorgio (Giraudeau), a young Italian soldier is sent to a remote post, far away from his lover, Clara (Antonelli). He is lodged in the house of the colonel (Girotti). He becames friends with the colonel and the local doctor (Trintignant). Among the inhabitants of the house, there is a strange young woman - Fosca (d''Obici) who is both unattractive and mad. However, she has a passion that Giorgio will have to cope with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acDSsWcsm0lnwEgfqjz5LUaYBtF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42147'),
  ('773372773570402562', 'Passion of Mind', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alain Berliner, Coralie Fargeat, Eduardo Serra', 'Ronald Bass, David Field', 'Demi Moore, William Fichtner, Eloise Eonnet, Julianne Nicholson, Sinéad Cusack, Joss Ackland, Peter Riegert, Stellan Skarsgård', 'PG-13', 'A psychological romantic thriller where fantasy and reality become indistinguishable for a woman leading a double life in her dreams.', 'A psychological romantic thriller where fantasy and reality become indistinguishable for a woman leading a double life in her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7lzVd2YHz85pgOugGJCJ983bQB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19214'),
  ('616663743769498990', 'Passion of Spies', 1967, 'Animation', 'Yefim Gamburg, Mikhail Druyan', 'Lazar Lagin', 'Eduard Nazarov', null, 'A parody of the spy movies of the ''50s and ''60s', 'A parody of the spy movies of the ''50s and ''60s', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTzDC4vri8urG2qrgyGCSQo0w4v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90543'),
  ('528845287638469766', 'Passion Plantation', 1976, 'Drama', 'Mario Pinzauti, Maurizio Centini, Vincenzo Nobile', 'Mario Pinzauti', 'Malisa Longo, Antonio Gismondo, Rita Manna, Percy Hogan, Serafino Profumo, Attilio Dottesio, Achille Antonaglia, Calogero Caruana', null, 'In the pre-civil war American south, Emanuelle, a plantation owner''s daughter, while outwardly a dainty southern belle, brutally abuses the slaves in her charge. When her fiance is bitten by a snake, he falls for Emanuelle''s beautiful African-American maid who''s kindness and skill saved his life. Insanely jealous, Emanuelle continues her sadistic behaviour towards her charges, and when her fiance announces he plans to wed the maid, Emanuelle "gives" her to her even more brutal hired men, and her fiance is powerless to stop them. Can Emanuelle learn an important lesson in love before it''s too late for everyone?', 'In the pre-civil war American south, Emanuelle, a plantation owner''s daughter, while outwardly a dainty southern belle, brutally abuses the slaves in her charge. When her fiance is bitten by a snake, he falls for Emanuelle''s beautiful African-American maid who''s kindness and skill saved his life. Insanely jealous, Emanuelle continues her sadistic behaviour towards her charges, and when her fiance announces he plans to wed the maid, Emanuelle "gives" her to her even more brutal hired men, and her fiance is powerless to stop them. Can Emanuelle learn an important lesson in love before it''s too late for everyone?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51A8PTrZ5VBlaJNtnylvNyvHAcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122791'),
  ('737755619814635262', 'Passion Play', 2011, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy, Horror', 'Mitch Glazer, Christopher Doyle, Hans Bjerno', 'Mitch Glazer', 'Megan Fox, Mickey Rourke, Bill Murray, Rhys Ifans, Kelly Lynch, Chuck Liddell, Chris Browning, Mark Sivertsen', 'R', 'An angel under the thumb of a ruthless gangster is saved by a trumpet player down on his luck.', 'An angel under the thumb of a ruthless gangster is saved by a trumpet player down on his luck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wx0W9Iak86peVoZnH8bBGA98chA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38753'),
  ('159747217112363157', 'Passionate Partners', 1993, 'Drama', 'Antonio Bonifacio', 'Daniele Stroppa', 'Demetra Hampton, John Armstead, Teodosio Losito, Cinzia Monreale, Marco Carbonaro, Cristina Rinaldi, Cristina Garavaglia', null, 'Kreola arrives in Santa Domingo to join her photographer husband Andy. Although Andy is initially jealous of Marco, who is in town looking for his missing girlfriend who did not return from Santa Domingo with her coworkers after a girls getaway. When Kreola and Andy site the missing girl Iris in the company of their gruff, dominating sea captain Leon, Andy suggests Kreola distract him so that Marco has a chance of getting Iris back. Kreola scoffs at this but eventually does fall under Leon''s spell. Andy''s writer friend Jo Ann blames the island atmosphere for the tendency for puritanical Westerners to reject their inhibitions. When Andy and Marco cannot free their women from Leon''s influence, things get drastic.', 'Kreola arrives in Santa Domingo to join her photographer husband Andy. Although Andy is initially jealous of Marco, who is in town looking for his missing girlfriend who did not return from Santa Domingo with her coworkers after a girls getaway. When Kreola and Andy site the missing girl Iris in the company of their gruff, dominating sea captain Leon, Andy suggests Kreola distract him so that Marco has a chance of getting Iris back. Kreola scoffs at this but eventually does fall under Leon''s spell. Andy''s writer friend Jo Ann blames the island atmosphere for the tendency for puritanical Westerners to reject their inhibitions. When Andy and Marco cannot free their women from Leon''s influence, things get drastic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olmdG2RQ1otCqKKdmanARyjNmJb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248127'),
  ('526153617106549053', 'Passione', 2010, 'History, Music, Documentary', 'John Turturro, Marco Pontecorvo, Cinzia Castania', 'John Turturro', 'Massimo Ranieri, John Turturro, Peppe Barra, Raiz, Max Casella, James Senese, Pietra Montecorvino, Valentina Adorato', null, 'Songs and singers from Naples, musicians and poets, real and legendary characters are the protagonists of a film that crosses one of the most beautiful, famous and controversial metropolises in the world. An exceptional orchestra for a repertoire that speaks of love, sex, jealousy, immigration, protest.', 'Songs and singers from Naples, musicians and poets, real and legendary characters are the protagonists of a film that crosses one of the most beautiful, famous and controversial metropolises in the world. An exceptional orchestra for a repertoire that speaks of love, sex, jealousy, immigration, protest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4Vli7q1SZZNv5Gh4k8ATvXiJ5D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56891'),
  ('281058228058276428', 'Passionless Moments', 1983, 'Drama', 'Jane Campion, Gerard Lee, Jane Campion', 'Jane Campion, Gerard Lee', 'David Benton, Ann Burriman, Alan Brown, Sean Callinan, Paul Chubb, Sue Collie, Yves Stening', null, 'A series of the awkward trials of everyday living.', 'A series of the awkward trials of everyday living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4Lh8UHVtze7X2RmlfJiCWCjLdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144717'),
  ('718140363296903168', 'Passions', 1994, 'Drama', 'Kira Muratova, Emmanuil Segal, Tatyana Komarova', 'Renata Litvinova, Yevhen Holubenko, Kira Muratova', 'Svetlana Kolenda, Renata Litvinova, Albina Skarga, Sergei Popov, Alexandra Svenskaya, Aleksei Shevchenkov, Nikolay Shatokhin, Umirzak Shmanov', null, 'Blonde Lilia and brunette Violetta are fascinated by horse racing, and the young racers are more than a little attracted to them, too. However, the worlds of sporting and romance don''t always coexist peacefully as the two girls learn the hard way through a series of touching, surreal, and sometimes heartbreaking encounters. One of the most beautifully photographed Russian films in recent years, this acclaimed modern classic was hailed at numerous film festivals including the Berlin Film Festival and Russia''s Kinotavr Festival, where it won the Jury and Critics Prizes. Amazon', 'Blonde Lilia and brunette Violetta are fascinated by horse racing, and the young racers are more than a little attracted to them, too. However, the worlds of sporting and romance don''t always coexist peacefully as the two girls learn the hard way through a series of touching, surreal, and sometimes heartbreaking encounters. One of the most beautifully photographed Russian films in recent years, this acclaimed modern classic was hailed at numerous film festivals including the Berlin Film Festival and Russia''s Kinotavr Festival, where it won the Jury and Critics Prizes. Amazon', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tn5QwE1sOKAr1ukv42UTmPGx4c4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146967'),
  ('364305267285565966', 'Passions of a Private Secretary', 2008, 'Drama', 'Yutaka Ogi, Hiroaki Niizuma', 'Tadashi Shimizu, Yutaka Ogi', 'Tsugumi Nagasawa, Mayu Asada, Daisuke Iijima, Akira Yamamoto, Mutsuo Yoshioka', null, 'Inspired by the work of Japanese eroticist Oniroku Dan, this scintillating thriller follows the career trajectory of an executive secretary as she ascends the latter of success and has a chance encounter with an ex-colleague. Before long, she''s fallen into a dangerous world of taboo sex and sadomasochism', 'Inspired by the work of Japanese eroticist Oniroku Dan, this scintillating thriller follows the career trajectory of an executive secretary as she ascends the latter of success and has a chance encounter with an ex-colleague. Before long, she''s fallen into a dangerous world of taboo sex and sadomasochism', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDf1SISqS7lxEzlfoqWx02EtSBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150262'),
  ('528259843177190271', 'Passport to Paris', 1999, 'Comedy, Family', 'Alan Metter, Steven Wacks, Matt Hinkley', 'Elizabeth Kruger, Craig Shapiro', 'Mary-Kate Olsen, Ashley Olsen, Peter White, Matt Winston, Yvonne Sciò, Brocker Way, Ethan Peck, François Giroday', 'G', 'Sent to Paris to visit their grandfather, the twins fall in love with France, not to mention two French boys.', 'Sent to Paris to visit their grandfather, the twins fall in love with France, not to mention two French boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwSUZWucryjWJ4ZLjDhy94MHev5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54004'),
