  ('590620849636397830', 'Past Perfect', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Maria Sole Tognazzi, Giulio Pietromarchi, Simonetta Valentini', 'Maria Sole Tognazzi, Daniele Prato', 'Valentina Cervi, Paola Cortellesi, Claudio Gioè, Ignazio Oliva, Claudio Santamaria, Pierfrancesco Favino, Gianmarco Tognazzi, F. Haydee Borelli', null, 'A pair of summer and winter weekends intertwine in a series of flashbacks involving five friends. Their dreams and expectations overlap with memories of events that took place in the house that they are sharing, which has a particular significance for all of them.', 'A pair of summer and winter weekends intertwine in a series of flashbacks involving five friends. Their dreams and expectations overlap with memories of events that took place in the house that they are sharing, which has a particular significance for all of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgYv0Y8olW7gpVdwnE6Iz1XIbzm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64825'),
