  ('408221913692843292', 'Pat and Margaret', 1994, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Gavin Millar, Regina Dunphy, David Reid', 'Victoria Wood', 'Victoria Wood, Julie Walters, Celia Imrie, Duncan Preston, Thora Hird, Deborah Grant, Don Henderson, Shirley Stelfox', null, 'Unexpected events occur when Pat, a glamorous British-born star of American soaps, returns home to plug her auto-biography on television and meets, for the first time since they were teenagers, Margaret her plain and frumpy younger sister. The meeting is painful for both women highlighting the vast differences in their lives and resurrecting painful memories of their unhappy childhood with an uncaring, errant mother. The tabloid press smell a juicy story and a race ensues to trace the whereabouts of the long lost parent.', 'Unexpected events occur when Pat, a glamorous British-born star of American soaps, returns home to plug her auto-biography on television and meets, for the first time since they were teenagers, Margaret her plain and frumpy younger sister. The meeting is painful for both women highlighting the vast differences in their lives and resurrecting painful memories of their unhappy childhood with an uncaring, errant mother. The tabloid press smell a juicy story and a race ensues to trace the whereabouts of the long lost parent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWl7Rx2OqSzd39f7wJGUIR70zrx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211211'),
  ('369304493825542056', 'Pat and Mike', 1952, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Cukor, Jack Greenwood, William H. Daniels', 'Garson Kanin, Ruth Gordon', 'Spencer Tracy, Katharine Hepburn, Aldo Ray, William Ching, Sammy White, George Mathews, Gussie Moran, Babe Didrikson Zaharias', null, 'Pat Pemberton is a brilliant athlete, except when her domineering fiancé is around. The ladies golf championship is in her reach until she gets flustered by his presence at the final holes. He wants them to get married and forget the whole thing, but she cannot give up on herself that easily. She enlists the help of Mike Conovan, a slightly shady sports promoter. Together they face mobsters, a jealous boxer, and a growing mutual attraction.', 'Pat Pemberton is a brilliant athlete, except when her domineering fiancé is around. The ladies golf championship is in her reach until she gets flustered by his presence at the final holes. He wants them to get married and forget the whole thing, but she cannot give up on herself that easily. She enlists the help of Mike Conovan, a slightly shady sports promoter. Together they face mobsters, a jealous boxer, and a growing mutual attraction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hSJWY1ygsOVAtPEz9Nb5q5FeyA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33575'),
  ('553725884000825514', 'Pat Garrett & Billy the Kid', 1973, 'Western, Drama, History', 'John Coquillon, Sam Peckinpah, Gordon T. Dawson', 'Rudy Wurlitzer', 'James Coburn, Kris Kristofferson, Richard Jaeckel, Katy Jurado, Chill Wills, Barry Sullivan, Jason Robards, Bob Dylan', 'R', 'Pat Garrett is hired as a lawman on behalf of a group of wealthy New Mexico cattle barons to bring down his old friend Billy the Kid.', 'Pat Garrett is hired as a lawman on behalf of a group of wealthy New Mexico cattle barons to bring down his old friend Billy the Kid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0LXWfTXoDOoeYzZw0u1KmZhVIL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11577'),
  ('420317134733172047', 'Pataakha', 2018, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Ranjan Palit', 'Vishal Bhardwaj', 'Sanya Malhotra, Radhikka Madan, Sunil Grover, Vijay Raaz, Namit Das, Abhishek Duhan, Saanand Verma, Usha Nagar', null, 'In a dusty Rajasthan village, two sisters, Badki and Chhutki, are constantly at each other''s throats over trivial matters. Their father, a widower, struggles to keep them from tearing each other apart. Their meddling neighbour, Dipper, enjoys stirring up trouble between them. But when marriage takes them to different worlds, they discover how much they need each other.', 'In a dusty Rajasthan village, two sisters, Badki and Chhutki, are constantly at each other''s throats over trivial matters. Their father, a widower, struggles to keep them from tearing each other apart. Their meddling neighbour, Dipper, enjoys stirring up trouble between them. But when marriage takes them to different worlds, they discover how much they need each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kG9T9y7eN8FGBK9jESJNlmuRdyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542460'),
  ('1014263146358347795', 'Patagonia', 2023, 'Drama', 'Simone Bozzelli, Giuseppe Barletta, Leonardo Mirabilia', 'Simone Bozzelli, Tommaso Favagrossa', 'Andrea Fuorto, Augusto Mario Russi, Elettra Dallimore-Mallaby, Alexander Benigni, Lina Bartolozzi, Maria Catia Lamperini, Tiziana Di Tonno, Sara Giusti', null, 'After spending his entire life in a small town with his elderly aunt, 20-year-old Yuri escapes with Agostino, a children''s entertainer who lives on the road in a motor home. Yuri is caught in a whirlpool of love and dependence with Agostino.', 'After spending his entire life in a small town with his elderly aunt, 20-year-old Yuri escapes with Agostino, a children''s entertainer who lives on the road in a motor home. Yuri is caught in a whirlpool of love and dependence with Agostino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34dlgSwWCW62EwZL12HP4dC0ZRN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1010170'),
