  ('210512989314461032', 'Paterson', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jim Jarmusch, Erica Hohf, Peter Agliata', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Adam Driver, Golshifteh Farahani, Rizwan Manji, Barry Shabaka Henley, William Jackson Harper, Chasten Harmon, Method Man, Dominic Liriano', 'R', 'A week in the life of Paterson, a poet bus driver, and his wife Laura, a very creative artist, who live in Paterson, New Jersey, hometown of many famous poets and artists.', 'A week in the life of Paterson, a poet bus driver, and his wife Laura, a very creative artist, who live in Paterson, New Jersey, hometown of many famous poets and artists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuJ1ZlfqwuAr9H5Qr1U9KILylse.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370755'),
