  ('964474737423412107', 'Patiala House', 2011, 'Drama', 'Nikkhil Advani, Santosh Thundiyil', 'Nikkhil Advani', 'Akshay Kumar, Anushka Sharma, Rishi Kapoor, Dimple Kapadia, Masha Paur, Soni Razdan, Neelu Kohli, Hard Kaur', null, 'Parghat Singh ''Gattu'' Kahlon is a middle aged shopkeeper who secretly practices bowling at night in order to keep his dream of playing for England alive. Even though his family members despise him for giving up his dreams only due to his father''s wish, they find a ray of hope and convince him to play for England while they plan to hide the truth from his father.', 'Parghat Singh ''Gattu'' Kahlon is a middle aged shopkeeper who secretly practices bowling at night in order to keep his dream of playing for England alive. Even though his family members despise him for giving up his dreams only due to his father''s wish, they find a ray of hope and convince him to play for England while they plan to hide the truth from his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16Q863XEtms2HH8LaCZQmp3tRoz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53299'),
