  ('732691383906941323', 'Patient Seven', 2016, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Danny Draven, Paul Davis, Ómar Örn Hauksson', 'Paul Davis, Sam Dickson, Richard Falkner', 'Michael Ironside, Jack Plotnick, Drew Fonteiro, Rane Jameson, Anna Rose Moore, Daniel Lench, Sirry Jons, Amanda Graeff', null, 'Dr. Marcus, a renowned psychiatrist, has selected 6 severe mentally ill and dangerous patients from the Spring Valley Mental Hospital to interview as part of research for his new book. As Dr. Marcus interviews each patient, one by one the horrors they have committed begin to unfold. However, Dr. Marcus soon learns that there is one patient who ties them all together - Patient Seven.', 'Dr. Marcus, a renowned psychiatrist, has selected 6 severe mentally ill and dangerous patients from the Spring Valley Mental Hospital to interview as part of research for his new book. As Dr. Marcus interviews each patient, one by one the horrors they have committed begin to unfold. However, Dr. Marcus soon learns that there is one patient who ties them all together - Patient Seven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5r7gdj65mfcghrzEob42YRyvAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410126'),
  ('894736589311008208', 'Patient Zero', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Stefan Ruzowitzky, Benedict Neuenfels, Richard Usher', 'Mike Le', 'Matt Smith, Natalie Dormer, Clive Standen, Agyness Deyn, Stanley Tucci, John Bradley, Colin McFarlane, James Northcote', 'R', 'After an unprecedented global pandemic has turned the majority of humankind into violent infected beings, Morgan, a man gifted with the ability to speak the infected''s new language, leads the last survivors on a hunt for patient zero and a cure.', 'After an unprecedented global pandemic has turned the majority of humankind into violent infected beings, Morgan, a man gifted with the ability to speak the infected''s new language, leads the last survivors on a hunt for patient zero and a cure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jOqatpfh0aKYhl6fN83RK69UtC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295011'),
  ('623669694310989279', 'Patients', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Grand Corps Malade, Mehdi Idir', 'Fadette Drouard, Grand Corps Malade', 'Pablo Pauly, Soufiane Guerrab, Moussa Mansaly, Nailia Harzoune, Franck Falise, Yannick Renier, Alban Ivanov, Jason Divengele', null, 'After a serious sport accident in a swimming pool, Ben, now an incomplete quadriplegic, arrives in a rehabilitation center. He meets with other handicapped persons (tetraplegics, paraplegics, traumatized crania), all victims of accidents, as well as a handicapped since his early childhood. They go through impotence, despair and resignation, with their daily struggle to learn how to move a finger or to hold a fork. Some of them slowly find a little mobility while others receive the verdict of the handicap for life. Despite everything, hope and friendship help them endure their difficulties.', 'After a serious sport accident in a swimming pool, Ben, now an incomplete quadriplegic, arrives in a rehabilitation center. He meets with other handicapped persons (tetraplegics, paraplegics, traumatized crania), all victims of accidents, as well as a handicapped since his early childhood. They go through impotence, despair and resignation, with their daily struggle to learn how to move a finger or to hold a fork. Some of them slowly find a little mobility while others receive the verdict of the handicap for life. Despite everything, hope and friendship help them endure their difficulties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sv2Xdpk4nzY2qKAg5oG2qZkTrY9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434616'),
  ('23255026379763895', 'Patlabor 2: The Movie', 1993, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Mamoru Oshii, Kazuchika Kise, Seichi Tanaka', 'Kazunori Ito', 'Mina Tominaga, Toshio Furukawa, Ryusuke Ohbayashi, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Michihiro Ikemizu, Daisuke Gori, Shigeru Chiba, Issei Futamata', 'PG-13', 'A Japanese police unit who use giant anthropomorphic robots (called Labors) is caught up in a political struggle between the civilian authorities and the military when a terrorist act is blamed on an Air Force jet. With the aid of a government agent, the team gets close to a terrorist leader to stop things from going out of control when after the military is impelled to impose martial law.', 'A Japanese police unit who use giant anthropomorphic robots (called Labors) is caught up in a political struggle between the civilian authorities and the military when a terrorist act is blamed on an Air Force jet. With the aid of a government agent, the team gets close to a terrorist leader to stop things from going out of control when after the military is impelled to impose martial law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIyWhMyMEHnavjUhbusOXDwrJgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14572'),
  ('179695845053442599', 'Patlabor WXIII The Movie', 2002, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Fumihiko Takayama, Takuji Endo, Hisao Shirai', 'Miki Tori', 'Hiroaki Hirata, Katsuhiko Watabiki, Atsuko Tanaka, Ryusuke Ohbayashi, Mina Tominaga, Toshio Furukawa, Michihiro Ikemizu, Akimasa Omori', 'R', 'Set in the year 2000, when the level of Labor accidents begin to escalate around Tokyo Bay, police detectives Kusumi and Hata are assigned to investigate. What they discover leads to a series of government cover-ups, conspiracy concerning a new biological weapon entitled WXIII-Wasted Thirteen and a tragic, personal connection to Hata. The only hope to stop this threat is to cooperate with the military and lead WXIII into a showdown with the Labors of Special Vehicle Division 2.', 'Set in the year 2000, when the level of Labor accidents begin to escalate around Tokyo Bay, police detectives Kusumi and Hata are assigned to investigate. What they discover leads to a series of government cover-ups, conspiracy concerning a new biological weapon entitled WXIII-Wasted Thirteen and a tragic, personal connection to Hata. The only hope to stop this threat is to cooperate with the military and lead WXIII into a showdown with the Labors of Special Vehicle Division 2.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgitZmF0cejES0dyuS7ZGvJ8NEQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16402'),
