  ('263746461502389952', 'Patrik, Age 1.5', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ella Lemhagen, Marek Wieser, Patric Hjelm', 'Ella Lemhagen', 'Gustaf Skarsgård, Torkel Petersson, Tom Ljungman, Amanda Davin, Annika Hallin, Jacob Ericksson, Anette Sevreus, Mats Blomgren', null, 'Göran and Sven have been cleared for adoption and they have a possibility to adopt a swedish orphan, Patrik 1,5. But when Patrik arrives he turns out to be someone else, not the little boy they were expecting. A comma had been misplaced, and in comes a 15-year-old homophobic with a criminal past.', 'Göran and Sven have been cleared for adoption and they have a possibility to adopt a swedish orphan, Patrik 1,5. But when Patrik arrives he turns out to be someone else, not the little boy they were expecting. A comma had been misplaced, and in comes a 15-year-old homophobic with a criminal past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFHcajKXeiPVOArumZOqjFYDx1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15179'),
  ('379684145723710513', 'Patriot Games', 1992, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Phillip Noyce, Donald McAlpine, David R. Ellis', 'W. Peter Iliff, Donald E. Stewart', 'Harrison Ford, Anne Archer, Thora Birch, Sean Bean, Patrick Bergin, Polly Walker, James Fox, Samuel L. Jackson', 'R', 'When CIA Analyst Jack Ryan interferes with an IRA assassination, a renegade faction targets Jack and his family as revenge.', 'When CIA Analyst Jack Ryan interferes with an IRA assassination, a renegade faction targets Jack and his family as revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IT7gnszrRthduYxCLqaIkM55Un.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9869'),
