  ('969842700652889841', 'Patriots Day', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Drama, History, Thriller', 'Christopher T. Sadler, Eric Heffron, Kevin Scott', 'Joshua Zetumer, Peter Berg, Matt Cook', 'Mark Wahlberg, John Goodman, J.K. Simmons, Kevin Bacon, Michelle Monaghan, Alex Wolff, Themo Melikidze, Michael Beach', 'R', 'In the aftermath of an unspeakable act of terror, Police Sergeant Tommy Saunders joins courageous survivors, first responders and investigators in a race against the clock to hunt down the Boston Marathon bombers before they strike again.', 'In the aftermath of an unspeakable act of terror, Police Sergeant Tommy Saunders joins courageous survivors, first responders and investigators in a race against the clock to hunt down the Boston Marathon bombers before they strike again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIDxsJTrOC7NhgOo3GziiHyKfsQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388399'),
  ('777253473380011208', 'Patriots Time', 2022, 'Action, War, Drama', 'Serikbol Utepbergenov, Kayrat Temirgaliev', 'Akbar Kurmanbayev, Dmitriy Aleynikov, Yerkebulan Bekturov', 'Daniyar Alshinov, Sanurzhan Suleymenov, Dasten Shakirov, Sayat Isembayev, Bekzat Eleusizov, Zarina Khadzhimetova, Askar Ilyasov', null, 'The brothers Sultan and Bekzat Ibrayev are serving faithfully in the Armed Forces of Kazakhstan, and at the same time they are in family disagreement. Sultan is a valiant intelligence officer and Bekzat is a talented fighter pilot. While an international terrorist organization prepares a carefully planned attack on the country''s strategically important facilities, the brothers have to face not only a mortal threat, but also face a family confrontation related to their dead father. Circumstances force them to unite in order to save human lives, and the brothers eventually understand that their homeland and family are the most valuable thing they have.', 'The brothers Sultan and Bekzat Ibrayev are serving faithfully in the Armed Forces of Kazakhstan, and at the same time they are in family disagreement. Sultan is a valiant intelligence officer and Bekzat is a talented fighter pilot. While an international terrorist organization prepares a carefully planned attack on the country''s strategically important facilities, the brothers have to face not only a mortal threat, but also face a family confrontation related to their dead father. Circumstances force them to unite in order to save human lives, and the brothers eventually understand that their homeland and family are the most valuable thing they have.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4QM6oF4UNNhQh1f9pRdXvyKW5s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965571'),
  ('1122067465696499554', 'Pattanapravesham', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Sathyan Anthikad, Vipin Mohan', 'Sreenivasan', 'Mohanlal, Sreenivasan, Ambika, Karamana Janardanan Nair, Thilakan, K. P. A. C. Azeez, KPAC Lalitha, N L Balakrishnan', null, 'CID officers Ramdas and Vijayan go to Kerala to find the murderer of a police officer. While doing so, they face a dangerous crime syndicate that deals in drug trafficking.', 'CID officers Ramdas and Vijayan go to Kerala to find the murderer of a police officer. While doing so, they face a dangerous crime syndicate that deals in drug trafficking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0DQy5dWMkUXPXeT0X9ucLcYxZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280306'),
  ('395982343242045648', 'Patterns', 1956, 'Drama', 'Fielder Cook, Charles H. Maguire, Boris Kaufman', 'Rod Serling', 'Van Heflin, Everett Sloane, Ed Begley, Beatrice Straight, Elizabeth Wilson, Joanna Roos, Valerie Cossart, Eleni Kiamos', null, 'To eliminate internal opposition, a cruel CEO sabotages and humiliates a good-natured executive in an effort to force his resignation — and make the reticent new hire his new yes man.', 'To eliminate internal opposition, a cruel CEO sabotages and humiliates a good-natured executive in an effort to force his resignation — and make the reticent new hire his new yes man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFaLK81bTKW1SZMSgK9efvsvFdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86782'),
  ('197737891381569659', 'Patti Cake$', 2017, 'Music, Drama', 'Geremy Jasper, Federico Cesca', 'Geremy Jasper', 'Danielle Macdonald, Bridget Everett, Siddharth Dhananjay, Mamoudou Athie, Cathy Moriarty, McCaul Lombardi, Patrick Brana, Wass Stevens', 'R', 'Straight out of Jersey comes Patricia Dombrowski, a.k.a. Killa P, a.k.a. Patti Cake$, an aspiring rapper fighting through a world of strip malls and strip clubs on an unlikely quest for glory.', 'Straight out of Jersey comes Patricia Dombrowski, a.k.a. Killa P, a.k.a. Patti Cake$, an aspiring rapper fighting through a world of strip malls and strip clubs on an unlikely quest for glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11MVxyp77zUPwc4cmqsUumNQYWK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426256'),
  ('175803576758035541', 'Patti Smith: Electric Poet', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Sophie Peyrard, Anne Cutaia', null, 'Patti Smith', null, 'At the age of 20, Patti Smith arrives in New York and upsets the codes of rock, poetry, and genre. She has become a living legend without ever leaving the sidelines. A poet, actress, and musician. Also militant. An artist with a thousand lives, now 74 years old. The documentary follows the course of Patti Smith''s life. Childhood first, and the artist who says: "I wanted to be someone special. I felt distant. Not just from other children, I felt far from the whole world. I spent my childhood in think I was an alien. " Little Patti grew up in rural New Jersey and received a religious education from her Jehovah''s Witness mother. But Patti Smith leaves the movement, which does not suit her artistic inclinations.', 'At the age of 20, Patti Smith arrives in New York and upsets the codes of rock, poetry, and genre. She has become a living legend without ever leaving the sidelines. A poet, actress, and musician. Also militant. An artist with a thousand lives, now 74 years old. The documentary follows the course of Patti Smith''s life. Childhood first, and the artist who says: "I wanted to be someone special. I felt distant. Not just from other children, I felt far from the whole world. I spent my childhood in think I was an alien. " Little Patti grew up in rural New Jersey and received a religious education from her Jehovah''s Witness mother. But Patti Smith leaves the movement, which does not suit her artistic inclinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oowhBBNyEIuNP8KIgXInFpFqH53.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:924357'),
  ('1108988679313958117', 'Patton', 1970, 'War, Drama, History', 'Franklin J. Schaffner, Fred J. Koenekamp, Brian Bilgorri', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Edmund H. North', 'George C. Scott, Karl Malden, Stephen Young, Michael Strong, Carey Loftin, Albert Dumortier, Frank Latimore, Morgan Paull', 'PG', '"Patton" tells the tale of General George S. Patton, famous tank commander of World War II. The film begins with Patton''s career in North Africa and progresses through the invasion of Germany and the fall of the Third Reich. Side plots also speak of Patton''s numerous faults such his temper and habit towards insubordination.', '"Patton" tells the tale of General George S. Patton, famous tank commander of World War II. The film begins with Patton''s career in North Africa and progresses through the invasion of Germany and the fall of the Third Reich. Side plots also speak of Patton''s numerous faults such his temper and habit towards insubordination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLM7jIEPTjj4CF7F1IrzzNjLUCu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11202'),
  ('2238431905169677', 'Patton Oswalt: Annihilation', 2017, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Bobcat Goldthwait, Dylan Sanford', 'Patton Oswalt', 'Patton Oswalt', null, 'Patton Oswalt, despite a personal tragedy, produces his best standup yet. Focusing on the tribulations of the Trump era and life after the loss of a loved one, Oswalt continues his journey to contribute joy to the world.', 'Patton Oswalt, despite a personal tragedy, produces his best standup yet. Focusing on the tribulations of the Trump era and life after the loss of a loved one, Oswalt continues his journey to contribute joy to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRMJ7WQ2zcsGrkyWlLs2SFQnvlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479263'),
  ('1043284429360688082', 'Patton Oswalt: I Love Everything', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Marcus Raboy', 'Patton Oswalt', 'Patton Oswalt', null, 'Turning 50. Finding love again. Buying a house. Experiencing existential dread at Denny''s. Life comes at Patton Oswalt fast in this stand-up special.', 'Turning 50. Finding love again. Buying a house. Experiencing existential dread at Denny''s. Life comes at Patton Oswalt fast in this stand-up special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4yZffgUlNm1wQl5esd7iWWsfmj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696575'),
  ('799899519381041672', 'Patton Oswalt: My Weakness Is Strong', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Jason Woliner', 'Patton Oswalt', 'Patton Oswalt', 'NR', 'The critically-acclaimed comedian, actor, writer, and voice of Remy the Rat (the Oscar®-winning Ratatouille) takes time out from his many film and television outings to return to the comedy stage for his fourth stand-up special.', 'The critically-acclaimed comedian, actor, writer, and voice of Remy the Rat (the Oscar®-winning Ratatouille) takes time out from his many film and television outings to return to the comedy stage for his fourth stand-up special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fk7grnwQtt1W9PkJj0Gc2sc300N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27317'),
  ('188069772813146590', 'Patton Oswalt: Talking for Clapping', 2016, 'Comedy, Documentary, TV Movie', null, 'Patton Oswalt', 'Patton Oswalt', null, 'Patton Oswalt delivers a fresh hour plus of stand-up, covering everything from misery to defeat to hopelessness. It''s his most upbeat special to date.', 'Patton Oswalt delivers a fresh hour plus of stand-up, covering everything from misery to defeat to hopelessness. It''s his most upbeat special to date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oCDs7Wfz7CkcuhCiSialjkFdWJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392891'),
  ('600929190518694607', 'Patty Hearst', 1988, 'Drama', 'Paul Schrader, Bojan Bazelli, Stephen P. Dunn', 'Nicholas Kazan', 'Natasha Richardson, William Forsythe, Ving Rhames, Frances Fisher, Olivia Barash, Dana Delany, Marek Johnson, Kitty Swink', 'R', 'The true story of a rich girl who was abducted by American revolutionaries in the 1970s. Her time spent with her captors made her question herself and her way of life. She eventually joined their cause, sparking controversy.', 'The true story of a rich girl who was abducted by American revolutionaries in the 1970s. Her time spent with her captors made her question herself and her way of life. She eventually joined their cause, sparking controversy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKXJOVLOVG7lO2enlB89n9tkv7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70202'),
  ('133456763159992914', 'Paul', 2011, 'Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Greg Mottola, Lawrence Sher', 'Nick Frost, Simon Pegg', 'Simon Pegg, Nick Frost, Seth Rogen, Jason Bateman, Kristen Wiig, Bill Hader, Blythe Danner, Joe Lo Truglio', 'R', 'For the past 60 years, a space-traveling smart-ass named Paul has been locked up in a top-secret military base, advising world leaders about his kind. But when he worries he’s outlived his usefulness and the dissection table is drawing uncomfortably close, Paul escapes on the first RV that passes by his compound in Area 51. Fortunately, it contains the two earthlings who are most likely to rescue and harbor an alien on the run.', 'For the past 60 years, a space-traveling smart-ass named Paul has been locked up in a top-secret military base, advising world leaders about his kind. But when he worries he’s outlived his usefulness and the dissection table is drawing uncomfortably close, Paul escapes on the first RV that passes by his compound in Area 51. Fortunately, it contains the two earthlings who are most likely to rescue and harbor an alien on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKhexH8nS08lVlSmwSs00cHFxbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39513'),
  ('247845936387436288', 'Paul à Québec', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'François Bouvier, Steve Asselin', 'François Bouvier, Michel Rabagliati', 'François Létourneau, Julie Le Breton, Gilbert Sicotte, Louise Portal, Julien Poulin, Patrice Robitaille, Brigitte Lafleur, Mathieu Quesnel', null, 'In 1999, Paul and his partner Julie experienced beautiful moments with their young daughter. They are looking for a house in Montreal and frequently see their family, notably Julie''s parents who live in St-Nicolas, a suburb of Quebec City. But the illness has hit Roland hard, the proud and generous patriarch of the family, who tries as best he can to hide the ultimatum he is suffering from his children. Life being what it is, Roland will have to be admitted to a palliative care center while his loved ones, including Paul, will have to come to terms with the idea of ​​his death. In the process, Paul will take up drawing.', 'In 1999, Paul and his partner Julie experienced beautiful moments with their young daughter. They are looking for a house in Montreal and frequently see their family, notably Julie''s parents who live in St-Nicolas, a suburb of Quebec City. But the illness has hit Roland hard, the proud and generous patriarch of the family, who tries as best he can to hide the ultimatum he is suffering from his children. Life being what it is, Roland will have to be admitted to a palliative care center while his loved ones, including Paul, will have to come to terms with the idea of ​​his death. In the process, Paul will take up drawing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fu5MRrQS20rTF1kTt1N9PaCZorf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356320'),
  ('790161457428347658', 'Paul Blart: Mall Cop', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Steve Carr, Russ T. Alsobrook, Marty Eli Schwartz', 'Kevin James, Nick Bakay', 'Kevin James, Keir O''Donnell, Jayma Mays, Raini Rodriguez, Shirley Knight, Stephen Rannazzisi, Peter Gerety, Bobby Cannavale', 'PG', 'When a shopping mall is taken over by a gang of organized crooks, it''s up to a mild-mannered security guard to save the day.', 'When a shopping mall is taken over by a gang of organized crooks, it''s up to a mild-mannered security guard to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4zZv0Q1VKURFZFEl2vwjaE2q0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14560'),
  ('460313778065554324', 'Paul Blart: Mall Cop 2', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Family', 'Dean Semler, K.C. Colwell, Craig Comstock', 'Kevin James, Nick Bakay', 'Kevin James, Raini Rodriguez, Neal McDonough, Daniella Alonso, Eduardo Verástegui, David Henrie, Shirley Knight, Gary Valentine', 'PG', 'Security guard Paul Blart is headed to Las Vegas to attend a Security Guard Expo with his teenage daughter Maya before she departs for college. While at the convention, he inadvertently discovers a heist - and it''s up to Blart to apprehend the criminals.', 'Security guard Paul Blart is headed to Las Vegas to attend a Security Guard Expo with his teenage daughter Maya before she departs for college. While at the convention, he inadvertently discovers a heist - and it''s up to Blart to apprehend the criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qML63w7vgspicwLK6xXGLK17cM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256961'),
  ('1111345810870040724', 'Paul Bunyan', 1958, 'Family, Animation', 'Les Clark', null, 'Thurl Ravenscroft, Max Smith, Bob Stevens, Parley Baer, Dal McKennon, Bob Amsberry, Ken Christy', 'NR', 'A retelling of the classic Canadian / American tall tale of the enormous lumberjack and his loyal companion, an equally huge blue ox.', 'A retelling of the classic Canadian / American tall tale of the enormous lumberjack and his loyal companion, an equally huge blue ox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DtpX8vi3o5kB5R537hClAbTbQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44293'),
  ('246197040404609683', 'Paul Mirabel : Zèbre', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Nathanaël Munnich, Richard Bismuth', 'Paul Mirabel', 'Paul Mirabel', null, 'Since 2021, Paul Mirabel has been touring across France to share his first show. So nonchalant that he provokes laughter from the audience just by moving toward a water bottle, Paul performs with the sincerity of a dreamy guy who doesn’t denounce or demand anything, but brilliantly highlights the absurdities of everyday life that no one pays attention to anymore.', 'Since 2021, Paul Mirabel has been touring across France to share his first show. So nonchalant that he provokes laughter from the audience just by moving toward a water bottle, Paul performs with the sincerity of a dreamy guy who doesn’t denounce or demand anything, but brilliantly highlights the absurdities of everyday life that no one pays attention to anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bybuHhRQWzmoGolgbvtqNYdyyvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1212257'),
  ('733910777899302933', 'Paul Robeson: Tribute to an Artist', 1979, 'Documentary', 'Saul J. Turell', 'Saul J. Turell', 'Paul Robeson, Sidney Poitier', null, 'This Academy Award-winning documentary short Paul Robeson: Tribute to an Artist, narrated by Sidney Poitier, traces the career of Paul Robeson through his activism and his socially charged performances of his signature song, “Ol’ Man River.”', 'This Academy Award-winning documentary short Paul Robeson: Tribute to an Artist, narrated by Sidney Poitier, traces the career of Paul Robeson through his activism and his socially charged performances of his signature song, “Ol’ Man River.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbozWKzdiBCVk0YpvtVXfG2rvfx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113745'),
  ('1030058850835748439', 'Paul Sanchez Is Back!', 2018, 'Thriller', 'Patricia Mazuy, Frédéric Noirhomme', 'Yves Thomas, Patricia Mazuy', 'Laurent Lafitte, Zita Hanrot, Idir Chender, Anthony Paliotti, Simon P.R. Bewick, Achille Reggiani, Eric Bernardini, Luc Palun', null, 'The reappearance of notorious criminal Paul Sanchez becomes an obsession for a young police officer who will do anything to catch him.', 'The reappearance of notorious criminal Paul Sanchez becomes an obsession for a young police officer who will do anything to catch him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VKN39sCzPsxV4lGSTG5t11sRjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499728'),
  ('605493528898747311', 'Paul Tomkowicz: Street Railway Switchman', 1953, 'Documentary', 'Roman Kroitor', null, 'Paul Tomkowicz, Tommy Tweed', null, 'A self-narrated portrait of a Polish immigrant in Winnipeg whose unglamorous job keeping streetcar switches working reveals dignity, resilience, and pride in everyday labor.', 'A self-narrated portrait of a Polish immigrant in Winnipeg whose unglamorous job keeping streetcar switches working reveals dignity, resilience, and pride in everyday labor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwoopx9SwomzbA07tBIgJ5Uxsn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285768'),
  ('1007741511420452501', 'Paul, Apostle of Christ', 2018, 'Drama', 'Andrew Hyatt', 'Andrew Hyatt, Terence Berden', 'Jim Caviezel, James Faulkner, Olivier Martinez, Joanne Whalley, John Lynch, Yorgos Karamihos, Antonia Campbell-Hughes, Alessandro Sperduti', 'PG-13', 'Risking his life, Luke ventures to Rome to visit Paul -- the apostle who''s bound in chains and held captive in Nero''s darkest and bleakest prison cell. Haunted by the shadows of his past misdeeds, Paul wonders if he''s been forgotten as he awaits his grisly execution. Before Paul''s death, Luke resolves to write another book that details the birth of what will come to be known as the church.', 'Risking his life, Luke ventures to Rome to visit Paul -- the apostle who''s bound in chains and held captive in Nero''s darkest and bleakest prison cell. Haunted by the shadows of his past misdeeds, Paul wonders if he''s been forgotten as he awaits his grisly execution. Before Paul''s death, Luke resolves to write another book that details the birth of what will come to be known as the church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NUXG94dGMKYgJL1BkJGKynMb3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476968'),
  ('148141200286354266', 'Paula', 2016, 'Drama', 'Christian Schwochow, Frank Lamm', 'Stefan Kolditz, Stephan Suschke', 'Carla Juri, Albrecht Schuch, Roxane Duran, Joel Basman, Stanley Weber, Nicki von Tempelhoff, Jonas Leonhardi, Nadja Zwanziger', null, 'Painting is an unacceptable vocation for a woman in provincial Germany in the year 1900, but budding artist Paula Becker is determined to make her own rules.', 'Painting is an unacceptable vocation for a woman in provincial Germany in the year 1900, but budding artist Paula Becker is determined to make her own rules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVJCCTcaHZ76ShDyzdJe4pCd5hJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406302'),
  ('1061060787512119690', 'Paula-Paula', 2010, 'Drama', 'Jesús Franco, Jesús Franco, Beatriz Alcalá', 'Jesús Franco', 'Paula Davis, Carmen Montes, Lina Romay', null, 'A vicious maniac has claimed the life of gorgeous exotic dancer Paula and it isn''t likely before police single out her lover Paula as the likely killer. As the investigations get underway, detectives find themselves thrust into a treacherous world of lust and perversion', 'A vicious maniac has claimed the life of gorgeous exotic dancer Paula and it isn''t likely before police single out her lover Paula as the likely killer. As the investigations get underway, detectives find themselves thrust into a treacherous world of lust and perversion', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25AXIwOdctlnaaxK1ZBhmqCN0J1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86476'),
  ('770805455808172020', 'Paulette', 2012, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Jérôme Enrico', 'Jérôme Enrico', 'Bernadette Lafont, Carmen Maura, Dominique Lavanant, Françoise Bertin, André Penvern, Axelle Laffont, Paco Boublard, Jean-Baptiste Anoumon', null, 'Paulette lives alone in a housing project in the Paris suburbs. With her meager pension, she can no longer make ends meet.', 'Paulette lives alone in a housing project in the Paris suburbs. With her meager pension, she can no longer make ends meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrOmk9UVy5MW1fMpwVAMMlmCdWk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159121'),
  ('633855583114482040', 'Paulette''s Chair', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Music', 'Yojiro Arai, Hiroyasu Ishida', 'Hiroyasu Ishida', 'Seina Tanaka, Mai Omori, Miki Inoue', null, 'Paulette plays in the back yard, in the shade of a tall tree, with her doll, somewhere out in the countryside. Secretly watching other children have fun without her makes her sad. Then suddenly the wooden chair she is sitting on begins to move, and throws her off. She bravely gets on the chair again, which starts to buck like a wild horse, making her very happy. Racing through the countryside, the chair then throws her off, right into the middle of the group of playing children, helping her overcome her shyness.', 'Paulette plays in the back yard, in the shade of a tall tree, with her doll, somewhere out in the countryside. Secretly watching other children have fun without her makes her sad. Then suddenly the wooden chair she is sitting on begins to move, and throws her off. She bravely gets on the chair again, which starts to buck like a wild horse, making her very happy. Racing through the countryside, the chair then throws her off, right into the middle of the group of playing children, helping her overcome her shyness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7PKpIUjFic6Go3qDCq8enfhMxJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294622'),
  ('573003675437368448', 'Paulie', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'John Roberts, Tony Pierce-Roberts, Mark Vargo', 'Laurie Craig', 'Gena Rowlands, Tony Shalhoub, Cheech Marin, Bruce Davison, Trini Alvarado, Jay Mohr, Buddy Hackett, Hallie Eisenberg', 'PG', 'Paulie, a talking parrot, recounts his travels looking for his original owner to a Russian janitor who helps him to the end of his journey.', 'Paulie, a talking parrot, recounts his travels looking for his original owner to a Russian janitor who helps him to the end of his journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiW8TWjIuFveTcA5BCU7KMjPaaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36568'),
  ('894778916864648223', 'Paulina', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Santiago Mitre, Gustavo Biazzi', 'Mariano Llinás, Santiago Mitre', 'Dolores Fonzi, Oscar Martínez, Esteban Lamothe, Cristian Salguero, Verónica Llinás, Laura López Moyano, Ezequiel Díaz, Andrea Quattrocchi', null, 'Paulina is a young lawyer with a promising career in Buenos Aires, who chooses to go back to her home town. Her father, Fernando, is a well known judge. Against his will, Paulina decides to teach in a suburban high school as part of an inclusion program. One night, after the second week working there, she''s brutally assaulted by a gang. With the disapproval of the people around her, she decides to go back to work, in the neighborhood where she was attacked, without realizing that her attackers may be even closer than she thought.', 'Paulina is a young lawyer with a promising career in Buenos Aires, who chooses to go back to her home town. Her father, Fernando, is a well known judge. Against his will, Paulina decides to teach in a suburban high school as part of an inclusion program. One night, after the second week working there, she''s brutally assaulted by a gang. With the disapproval of the people around her, she decides to go back to work, in the neighborhood where she was attacked, without realizing that her attackers may be even closer than she thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2G3YO44XGJmKoWHqmQBS1USqTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336664'),
  ('555922959501901252', 'Pauline', 2009, 'Drama', 'Céline Sciamma, Nathalie Kauffmann, Julien Poupard', 'Daphné Charbonneau', 'Anaïs Demoustier, Adèle Haenel', null, 'A young woman chronicles her childhood of neglect and isolation.', 'A young woman chronicles her childhood of neglect and isolation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCM4h1IaDtj9rjjDarXfOk7byVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347136'),
