  ('554271728107393845', 'Pauline détective', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Marc Fitoussi, Céline Bozon', 'Marc Fitoussi', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Audrey Lamy, Claudio Santamaria, Antoine Chappey, Anne Benoît, Sabrina Impacciatore, Michèle Moretti, Wladimir Yordanoff', null, 'After she has been dumped by her boyfriend, Pauline allows her sister to take her to a palace on the Italian Riviera. Instead of savouring the delights of a carefree existence, Pauline prefers to take on the role of an amateur sleuth, convinced that a crime has been committed in the environs. She ropes a handsome lifeguard into her investigation...', 'After she has been dumped by her boyfriend, Pauline allows her sister to take her to a palace on the Italian Riviera. Instead of savouring the delights of a carefree existence, Pauline prefers to take on the role of an amateur sleuth, convinced that a crime has been committed in the environs. She ropes a handsome lifeguard into her investigation...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7huLPsnvReXpEgaXmi972FGeXfE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137370'),
  ('842946951039820205', 'Paulo Coelho''s Best Story', 2014, 'Drama, History', 'Daniel Augusto, Amanda Maciel Antunes, Manu Cerqueira', 'Carolina Kotscho', 'Júlio Andrade, Ravel Andrade, Fabiana Gugli, Lucci Ferreira, Fabiula Nascimento, Enrique Díaz, Letícia Colin, Luis Carlos Miele', null, 'Paulo Coelho is the world’s most translated living author, his books having sold over 165 million copies. But he was not always the inspirational global phenomenon he is today. Like the heroes in his spiritual classics THE ALCHEMIST and THE PILGRIMAGE, he long-searched for his calling, flirting with death, escaping madness, falling in love, and making rock ’n’ roll history in Brazil, all-the-while striving for success as a writer. A wild ride through a lifetime of stranger-than-fiction adventures, PAULO COELHO’S BEST STORY is a profoundly moving film that goes straight to the heart of the most beloved literary guru of our time, revealing the most incredible wonder of all: the man behind the masterpieces.', 'Paulo Coelho is the world’s most translated living author, his books having sold over 165 million copies. But he was not always the inspirational global phenomenon he is today. Like the heroes in his spiritual classics THE ALCHEMIST and THE PILGRIMAGE, he long-searched for his calling, flirting with death, escaping madness, falling in love, and making rock ’n’ roll history in Brazil, all-the-while striving for success as a writer. A wild ride through a lifetime of stranger-than-fiction adventures, PAULO COELHO’S BEST STORY is a profoundly moving film that goes straight to the heart of the most beloved literary guru of our time, revealing the most incredible wonder of all: the man behind the masterpieces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVPYM2L2H4AxurEWf4GUllqTDCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228176'),
  ('423365216756756856', 'Pauly Shore Is Dead', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Pauly Shore, Brian Pratt', 'Kirk Fox, Pauly Shore', 'Pauly Shore, Jaime Bergman, Kirk Fox, Charlie Sheen, Vince Vaughn, Fred Durst, Verne Troyer, W. Earl Brown', 'R', 'Hollywood comedian/actor Pauly Shore loses everything: his house, nobody in Hollywood wants to represent him, he moves back home with his mom and is now parking cars at the Comedy Store. Then one night when he''s up in his mom''s loft, a dead famous comedian appears who tells Pauly to kill himself cause he''ll go down as a comedic genius who died before his time. Pauly then fakes his own death, and the media goes crazy.', 'Hollywood comedian/actor Pauly Shore loses everything: his house, nobody in Hollywood wants to represent him, he moves back home with his mom and is now parking cars at the Comedy Store. Then one night when he''s up in his mom''s loft, a dead famous comedian appears who tells Pauly to kill himself cause he''ll go down as a comedic genius who died before his time. Pauly then fakes his own death, and the media goes crazy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5o7LfDgSKurbBQTw6lL1pouKDQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27202'),
  ('362546068675531811', 'Paura', 2012, 'Horror', 'Antonio Manetti, Marco Manetti, Gian Filippo Corticelli', 'Antonio Manetti, Michele Cogo, Marco Manetti', 'Peppe Servillo, Francesca Cuttica, Lorenzo Pedrotti, Domenico Diele, Claudio Di Biagio, Paolo Sassanelli, Claudia Genolini, Massimo Triggiani', null, 'Three young musicians think they have luck on their side when they score the keys to a beautiful villa outside of Rome for the weekend. Unfortunately, they soon discover that they are not alone.', 'Three young musicians think they have luck on their side when they score the keys to a beautiful villa outside of Rome for the weekend. Unfortunately, they soon discover that they are not alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3RzYG600cF2em06cywkinRu3W8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88718'),
  ('767197337173999943', 'Pause!', 1977, null, 'Peter Kubelka', null, 'Arnulf Rainer', null, 'Short film by Peter Kubelka. Arnulf Rainer contorts his mind and body before the camera.', 'Short film by Peter Kubelka. Arnulf Rainer contorts his mind and body before the camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BQvIaPMRf3fGFbePy0TfcOwhd1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141417'),
  ('250036855597895067', 'Pavane', 2026, 'Romance, Drama', 'Lee Jong-pil, Kim Sung-an, Lee Seung-bin', 'Lee Jong-pil, Son Mi', 'Ko A-sung, Moon Sang-min, Byun Yo-han, Lee E-dam, Han Yu-eun, Seo Yi-ra, Shin Jung-keun, Park Hae-joon', 'R', 'Three lonely strangers meet at their department store jobs and find solace in each other''s company while they explore connection and the nature of love.', 'Three lonely strangers meet at their department store jobs and find solace in each other''s company while they explore connection and the nature of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOXc8stx1CLvM6GC0ABKfWOkbYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1268609'),
  ('592322476537844999', 'Pavarotti', 2019, 'Documentary, History, Music', 'Ron Howard', 'Mark Monroe', 'Luciano Pavarotti, Bono, Harvey Goldsmith, Nicoletta Mantovani, Plácido Domingo, José Carreras, Madelyn Renée Monti, Andrea Griminelli', 'PG-13', 'Featuring never-before-seen footage, concert performances and intimate interviews, filmmaker Ron Howard examines the life and career of famed opera tenor Luciano Pavarotti.', 'Featuring never-before-seen footage, concert performances and intimate interviews, filmmaker Ron Howard examines the life and career of famed opera tenor Luciano Pavarotti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bf0Iim4D6XXrAAJGwHXyrWFqUz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561325'),
  ('17812028608834199', 'Pavilion of Women', 2001, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Yim Ho, Poon Hang-Sang, Stephen Wang', 'Luo Yan, Paul Collins', 'Willem Dafoe, Luo Yan, Shek Sau, Ding Yi, John Cho, Kate McGregor-Stewart, Liu Xin, Amy Hill', 'R', 'With World War II looming, a prominent family in China must confront the contrasting ideas of traditionalism, communism and Western thinking, while dealing with the most important ideal of all: love and its meaning in society.', 'With World War II looming, a prominent family in China must confront the contrasting ideas of traditionalism, communism and Western thinking, while dealing with the most important ideal of all: love and its meaning in society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnBjjOXY8vSDtNu7resdcy1cuVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52616'),
  ('375449974691849789', 'Pavithram', 1994, 'Family, Drama', 'Santosh Sivan, T. K. Rajeev Kumar', 'P Balachandran', 'Mohanlal, Shobana, Vinduja Menon, Sreenivasan, KPAC Lalitha, Innocent, Thilakan, Srividya', null, 'A young man''s relationship with his career, fiancee and brother is brought under stress by the birth of an unexpected sister. The film deals with the relationship between siblings Unnikrishnan and Meenakshi who have an almost 30 year age difference between them.', 'A young man''s relationship with his career, fiancee and brother is brought under stress by the birth of an unexpected sister. The film deals with the relationship between siblings Unnikrishnan and Meenakshi who have an almost 30 year age difference between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqZqkIYnxG49BGSNA6clgdTmPYh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249441'),
  ('675873797261992835', 'Pavlov’s Dog', 2025, 'Drama', '성이성', null, 'Yoo Jung, Ryu Won-I, So Jin, Kim Ji-ah, Kang Min-woo', null, 'Yeong-ae, who was raped daily by a masked man, gradually finds herself falling for him. Upon discovering that the masked man was actually her husband, she breaks up with him and begins to rely on Jin-seong, who occasionally visits and treats her kindly. However, Jin-seong is hiding a secret of his own.', 'Yeong-ae, who was raped daily by a masked man, gradually finds herself falling for him. Upon discovering that the masked man was actually her husband, she breaks up with him and begins to rely on Jin-seong, who occasionally visits and treats her kindly. However, Jin-seong is hiding a secret of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uooHq9VrlQ8wC8NgC6fJcurL0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1505315'),
  ('524469332402101243', 'PAW Patrol: Jet to the Rescue', 2020, 'Animation, Family', 'Charles E. Bastien', 'Louise Moon', 'Anya Cooke, Caoimhe Judd, Lilly Bartlam, Berkley Silverman, David López, Joey Nijem, Ashton Frank, Justin Paul Kelly', 'G', 'A royal relative steals a gem with the power to make things fly, the Paw Patrol takes to the skies to stop him and save Barkingburg.', 'A royal relative steals a gem with the power to make things fly, the Paw Patrol takes to the skies to stop him and save Barkingburg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHcn3PbjVHxBweDZxWpYH3JfugS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743439'),
  ('33037041432125133', 'PAW Patrol: Mighty Pups', 2018, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Action', null, null, 'Max Calinescu, Devan Cohen, Drew Davis, Samuel Faraci, Kallan Holley, Jaxon Mercey, Carter Thorne, Deanne Degruijter', 'G', 'When their latest scheme goes awry, Mayor Humdinger and his nephew Harold accidentally divert a meteor towards Adventure Bay. The meteor''s golden energy grants the PAW Patrol superpowers. The heroic Mighty Pups are on a roll to super-save the day.', 'When their latest scheme goes awry, Mayor Humdinger and his nephew Harold accidentally divert a meteor towards Adventure Bay. The meteor''s golden energy grants the PAW Patrol superpowers. The heroic Mighty Pups are on a roll to super-save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qIEgqQWao5VcBE3jsXWOSTYZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552095'),
  ('445841476028756249', 'PAW Patrol: Ready, Race, Rescue!', 2019, 'Animation, Family', 'Charles E. Bastien', 'Steven Sullivan', 'Drew Davis, Julius Cho, Anya Cooke, Cal Dodd, Isaac Emberson-Heeks, Addison Holley, Kallan Holley, Caoimhe Judd', null, 'It’s the Adventure Bay 500! The pups have built an awesome race track and are ready to be the pit crew for their race hero, The Whoosh! But when the legendary racer is unable to drive in the championship race, he calls on his biggest fan-pup Marshall to take the wheel and race in his place! Marshall has to overcome his lack of confidence and his dastardly competition, The Cheetah, to fulfill his dream of becoming the fastest race-pup ever!', 'It’s the Adventure Bay 500! The pups have built an awesome race track and are ready to be the pit crew for their race hero, The Whoosh! But when the legendary racer is unable to drive in the championship race, he calls on his biggest fan-pup Marshall to take the wheel and race in his place! Marshall has to overcome his lack of confidence and his dastardly competition, The Cheetah, to fulfill his dream of becoming the fastest race-pup ever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0fA2vc5v25YqKZs0rsMb2o0GVi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624620'),
  ('919075259033720822', 'PAW Patrol: The Dino Movie', 2026, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Cal Brunker', 'Cal Brunker, Bob Barlen', 'Carter Young, Mckenna Grace, Hayden Chamberlen, Rain Janjua, Henry Bolan, Lucien Duncan-Reid, Nylan Parthipan, William Desrosiers', null, 'The PAW Patrol pups crash land on an uncharted tropical island filled with dinosaurs after their ship gets caught in a mysterious storm. They meet Rex, a pup who has been stranded on the island for years and has become an expert in all things dino-related. When the Patrol’s archrival, Mayor Humdinger, begins recklessly mining in hopes of exploiting the island for its natural resources, he inadvertently causes a huge, dormant volcano to erupt. The pups are thrown into a series of high-stakes, dino-sized rescues bigger than anything they’ve done before, as they must stop Humdinger before everything on the island goes extinct.', 'The PAW Patrol pups crash land on an uncharted tropical island filled with dinosaurs after their ship gets caught in a mysterious storm. They meet Rex, a pup who has been stranded on the island for years and has become an expert in all things dino-related. When the Patrol’s archrival, Mayor Humdinger, begins recklessly mining in hopes of exploiting the island for its natural resources, he inadvertently causes a huge, dormant volcano to erupt. The pups are thrown into a series of high-stakes, dino-sized rescues bigger than anything they’ve done before, as they must stop Humdinger before everything on the island goes extinct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9l3xIPL8Kb6ssC9GIPOslFCXL2P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1185806'),
  ('780204194577524224', 'PAW Patrol: The Mighty Movie', 2023, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Guillermot Dupinet, Cal Brunker', 'Cal Brunker, Bob Barlen', 'Mckenna Grace, Taraji P. Henson, Christian Convery, Marsai Martin, Ron Pardo, Lil Rel Howery, Kim Kardashian, Chris Rock', 'PG', 'A magical meteor crash lands in Adventure City and gives the PAW Patrol pups superpowers, transforming them into The Mighty Pups.', 'A magical meteor crash lands in Adventure City and gives the PAW Patrol pups superpowers, transforming them into The Mighty Pups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTvePCU7exLepwg5hWySjwxojQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893723'),
  ('919642771039016812', 'PAW Patrol: The Movie', 2021, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Cal Brunker', 'Bob Barlen, Billy Frolick, Cal Brunker', 'Iain Armitage, Will Brisbin, Marsai Martin, Lilly Bartlam, Kingsley Marshall, Keegan Hedley, Callum Shoniker, Shayle Simons', 'G', 'Ryder and the pups are called to Adventure City to stop Mayor Humdinger from turning the bustling metropolis into a state of chaos.', 'Ryder and the pups are called to Adventure City to stop Mayor Humdinger from turning the bustling metropolis into a state of chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXavWyam2VPR6bOhLwwuP3K2Hw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675445'),
  ('206985176807588897', 'Paweł & Gaweł', 1938, 'Comedy', 'Mieczysław Krawicz, Stanisław Lipiński', 'Jan Fethke, Ludwik Starski, Napoleon Sądek', 'Eugeniusz Bodo, Adolf Dymsza, Helena Grossówna, Józef Orwid, Ludwik Sempoliński, Tadeusz Fijewski, Halina Doree, Karol Dorwski', null, 'Two neighbours with similar names, Paweł and Gaweł, meet a violinist girl Violetta who pretends to be a child. When Paweł learns she''s not a child anymore, he falls in love with her. And vice versa.', 'Two neighbours with similar names, Paweł and Gaweł, meet a violinist girl Violetta who pretends to be a child. When Paweł learns she''s not a child anymore, he falls in love with her. And vice versa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOAnnhTN1A19bb8NYpH7Ewt5YHL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393083'),
