  ('26955320235523651', 'Pawn Sacrifice', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Edward Zwick, Bradford Young, Silver Butler', 'Steven Knight, Stephen J. Rivele, Christopher Wilkinson', 'Tobey Maguire, Peter Sarsgaard, Liev Schreiber, Michael Stuhlbarg, Lily Rabe, Sophie Nélisse, Seamus Davey-Fitzpatrick, Conrad Pla', 'PG-13', 'During the height of the Cold War, American chess prodigy Bobby Fischer finds himself caught between two superpowers when he challenges the Soviet Empire.', 'During the height of the Cold War, American chess prodigy Bobby Fischer finds himself caught between two superpowers when he challenges the Soviet Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vcLstd2hYn0XhyuEKaPbBZAqSh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245698'),
  ('1024295522551282106', 'Pawn Shop Chronicles', 2013, 'Action, Comedy', 'Wayne Kramer, James Whitaker, Dan Katzman', 'Adam Minarovich', 'Paul Walker, Elijah Wood, Norman Reedus, Brendan Fraser, Vincent D''Onofrio, Pell James, Thomas Jane, Lukas Haas', 'R', 'The stories of a missing wife, a couple of meth heads and an Elvis impersonator are connected by the items found in a small town''s pawn shop.', 'The stories of a missing wife, a couple of meth heads and an Elvis impersonator are connected by the items found in a small town''s pawn shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jQUcZ2uWUe2jIxa5efNuMhdhts.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199420'),
  ('997227678055267559', 'Pawn Street', 2016, 'Drama', 'Irene Dionisio, Caroline Champetier, Giuseppe Bonito', 'Irene Dionisio', 'Fabrizio Falco, Roberto De Francesco, Christina Andrea Rosamilia, Alfonso Santagata, Salvatore Cantalupo, Maria Eugenia D''Aquino, Anna Ferruzzo, Nicole De Leo', null, 'In Torino, a bittersweet crowd is bringing its own belongings to a pawn shop, waiting for a ransom or the final auction. Between the thousands of faces that tell the human inventory of the crisis, three stories intertwine unconsciously in the thin line of moral debt. Sandra, a young trans, in order to escape her past sells her fur coat. Her gaze will cross Stefano’s, a novice who just started working at the bank, and who drags her towards a tender obsession. Michele, a retired porter, asks for a loan to a family member, who will turn out to be fatally the wrong person to ask a favour from.', 'In Torino, a bittersweet crowd is bringing its own belongings to a pawn shop, waiting for a ransom or the final auction. Between the thousands of faces that tell the human inventory of the crisis, three stories intertwine unconsciously in the thin line of moral debt. Sandra, a young trans, in order to escape her past sells her fur coat. Her gaze will cross Stefano’s, a novice who just started working at the bank, and who drags her towards a tender obsession. Michele, a retired porter, asks for a loan to a family member, who will turn out to be fatally the wrong person to ask a favour from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWBCvlOaUbHqTJAVpr8KYgHzx0M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408428'),
  ('800366512524627097', 'Paws', 1997, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Steve Newman, Karl Zwicky, Geoff Burton', 'Harry Cripps', 'Billy Connolly, Nathan Cavaleri, Emilie François, Joe Petruzzi, Caroline Gillmer, Rachael Blake, Sandy Gore, Freyja Meere', null, 'A talking Terrier with impressive computer skills teams up with two youngsters to stop a million dollars from falling into the wrong hands.', 'A talking Terrier with impressive computer skills teams up with two youngsters to stop a million dollars from falling into the wrong hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCua7YDCdNYKkXK2OZavuJIvnvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89868'),
  ('189019178681184789', 'Paws of Fury: The Legend of Hank', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Rob Minkoff, Chris Bailey, Jason Ryan', 'Andrew Bergman, Norman Steinberg, Richard Pryor', 'Michael Cera, Samuel L. Jackson, Ricky Gervais, Kylie Kuioka, Mel Brooks, George Takei, Gabriel Iglesias, Djimon Hounsou', 'PG', 'A hard-on-his-luck hound finds himself in a town full of cats in need of a hero to defend them from a ruthless villain''s wicked plot to wipe their village off the map. With help from a reluctant mentor, our underdog must assume the role of town samurai and team up with the villagers to save the day.', 'A hard-on-his-luck hound finds himself in a town full of cats in need of a hero to defend them from a ruthless villain''s wicked plot to wipe their village off the map. With help from a reluctant mentor, our underdog must assume the role of town samurai and team up with the villagers to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMDUDwAArpfGdtTTZ25SfwngGwt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366672'),
  ('576369431323913001', 'Pay Day', 1922, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin, Charles Reisner, Tom Harrington', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Phyllis Allen, Mack Swain, Edna Purviance, Syd Chaplin, Albert Austin, John Rand, Loyal Underwood', 'NR', 'A bricklayer and his wife clash over his end-of-the-week partying.', 'A bricklayer and his wife clash over his end-of-the-week partying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v80aLZhte1YJeINfBfq0OCflNqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53429'),
  ('197634577762509534', 'Pay It Forward', 2000, 'Drama', 'Mimi Leder, Oliver Stapleton, David H. Venghaus Jr.', 'Leslie Dixon', 'Kevin Spacey, Helen Hunt, Angie Dickinson, Haley Joel Osment, Jay Mohr, Jim Caviezel, Jon Bon Jovi, David Ramsey', 'PG-13', 'Like some other kids, 12-year-old Trevor McKinney believed in the goodness of human nature. Like many other kids, he was determined to change the world for the better. Unlike most other kids, he succeeded.', 'Like some other kids, 12-year-old Trevor McKinney believed in the goodness of human nature. Like many other kids, he was determined to change the world for the better. Unlike most other kids, he succeeded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62OIokwaxFwBFWM147ijLJsaVJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10647'),
  ('89501133227739484', 'Pay the Ghost', 2015, 'Horror', 'Uli Edel, Sharone Meir, Grant Lucibello', 'Daniel Kay', 'Nicolas Cage, Sarah Wayne Callies, Veronica Ferres, Lyriq Bent, Lauren Beatty, Kalie Hunter, Jack Fulton, Stephen McHattie', null, 'One year after his young son disappeared during a Halloween carnival, Mike Cole is haunted by eerie images and terrifying messages he can’t explain. Together with his estranged wife, he will stop at nothing to unravel the mystery and find their son—and, in doing so, he unearths a legend that refuses to remain buried in the past.', 'One year after his young son disappeared during a Halloween carnival, Mike Cole is haunted by eerie images and terrifying messages he can’t explain. Together with his estranged wife, he will stop at nothing to unravel the mystery and find their son—and, in doing so, he unearths a legend that refuses to remain buried in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHG1QcxaRCiFIdSK1HZA6zOEFsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290637'),
  ('70739057736192839', 'Payback', 1995, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Anthony Hickox, David Bridges', 'Sam Bernard', 'C. Thomas Howell, Joan Severance, Marshall Bell, Richard Burgi, John Toles-Bey, R.G. Armstrong, Lisa Robin Kelly, Steve Wilcox', 'R', 'Oscar Bonsetter tells a dying prisoner that he will take revenge on the sadistic guard who killed him. In exchange, Oscar is told of a stash of money. Oscar is eventually released from prison but when he goes to get revenge, he gets sidetracked by the now-handicapped guard and his alluring wife, Rose. The tension builds as Oscar becomes more and more attracted to Rose.', 'Oscar Bonsetter tells a dying prisoner that he will take revenge on the sadistic guard who killed him. In exchange, Oscar is told of a stash of money. Oscar is eventually released from prison but when he goes to get revenge, he gets sidetracked by the now-handicapped guard and his alluring wife, Rose. The tension builds as Oscar becomes more and more attracted to Rose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEyK8GrVbyWqeSFBWSnCavH6gMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73109'),
  ('679843226796136316', 'Payback', 1999, 'Action, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Ericson Core, Mark Cotone, Laura Nisbet Peters', 'Brian Helgeland, Terry Hayes', 'Mel Gibson, Gregg Henry, Maria Bello, David Paymer, Bill Duke, Deborah Kara Unger, John Glover, William Devane', 'R', 'With friends like these, who needs enemies? That''s the question bad guy Porter is left asking after his wife and partner steal his heist money and leave him for dead -- or so they think. Five months and an endless reservoir of bitterness later, Porter''s partners and the crooked cops on his tail learn how bad payback can be.', 'With friends like these, who needs enemies? That''s the question bad guy Porter is left asking after his wife and partner steal his heist money and leave him for dead -- or so they think. Five months and an endless reservoir of bitterness later, Porter''s partners and the crooked cops on his tail learn how bad payback can be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Bqlv2kbOyZFqfiPNgzdBscqYPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2112'),
  ('915947468822253438', 'Payback', 2021, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Joseph Mensch', 'Metin Aksoy, Joseph Mensch', 'Matt Levett, Toby Leonard Moore, Anna Baryshnikov, Lev Gorn, Rade Šerbedžija, Elena Satine, Boris Lee Krutonog, David Vadim', 'NR', 'Mike Markovich, a young stockbroker at a Mob-controlled Wall Street firm, is betrayed and imprisoned for six years. When he is released, his deadly quest for vengeance begins.', 'Mike Markovich, a young stockbroker at a Mob-controlled Wall Street firm, is betrayed and imprisoned for six years. When he is released, his deadly quest for vengeance begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fBgegGLGEUUM5Z9fZacxLsB0c2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604782'),
  ('437648773836974804', 'Paycheck', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jeffrey L. Kimball, John Woo, Nancy Anna Brown', 'Dean Georgaris', 'Ben Affleck, Uma Thurman, Aaron Eckhart, Paul Giamatti, Colm Feore, Joe Morton, Michael C. Hall, Kathryn Morris', 'PG-13', 'Michael Jennings is a genius who''s hired – and paid handsomely – by high-tech firms to work on highly sensitive projects, after which his short-term memory is erased so he''s incapable of breaching security. But at the end of a three-year job, he''s told he isn''t getting a paycheck and instead receives a mysterious envelope. In it are clues he must piece together to find out why he wasn''t paid – and why he''s now in hot water.', 'Michael Jennings is a genius who''s hired – and paid handsomely – by high-tech firms to work on highly sensitive projects, after which his short-term memory is erased so he''s incapable of breaching security. But at the end of a three-year job, he''s told he isn''t getting a paycheck and instead receives a mysterious envelope. In it are clues he must piece together to find out why he wasn''t paid – and why he''s now in hot water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icoa6KslkhXKnxLreZ6vXnDimpQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9620'),
  ('397045671397845935', 'Payday', 1973, 'Drama, Music', 'Richard C. Glouner, Gary Grillo, Richard Bremerkamp', 'Don Carpenter', 'Rip Torn, Ahna Capri, Elayne Heilveil, Michael C. Gwynne, Jeff Morris, Cliff Emmich, Henry O. Arnold, Bobby Smith', 'R', 'Country singer Maury Dann lives life in the fast lane, counting on his rakish charm and raw talent to excuse his reckless behavior. Touring on the road in the rural south with his dedicated manager, his loyal driver and his long-suffering girlfriend, Maury seduces groupies, brawls and breaks the law, brashly relying on his team to cover for him. Heedlessly alienating all those who care for him, Maury blindly keeps the pedal to the metal.', 'Country singer Maury Dann lives life in the fast lane, counting on his rakish charm and raw talent to excuse his reckless behavior. Touring on the road in the rural south with his dedicated manager, his loyal driver and his long-suffering girlfriend, Maury seduces groupies, brawls and breaks the law, brashly relying on his team to cover for him. Heedlessly alienating all those who care for him, Maury blindly keeps the pedal to the metal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9S8prT0PeOm9OvOt7MNA89KsSx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80911'),
  ('12969884525379080', 'Paydirt', 2020, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Allan Aguilar, Mike Snow, Christian Sesma', 'Christian Sesma', 'Luke Goss, Val Kilmer, Mike Hatton, Paul Sloan, Nick Vallelonga, Mirtha Michelle, Veronika Bozeman, Murielle Telio', 'NR', 'A parolee teams up with his old crew determined to find a buried bag of cash stolen a decade ago from a DEA bust gone bad, while being tracked by a retired Sheriff.', 'A parolee teams up with his old crew determined to find a buried bag of cash stolen a decade ago from a DEA bust gone bad, while being tracked by a retired Sheriff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAGGV80ZO10YcmUJXK7YSBh1yvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696002'),
  ('879697976244424431', 'Payment Deferred', 1932, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Lothar Mendes, Merritt B. Gerstad, Douglas Shearer', 'Ernest Vajda, Claudine West', 'Charles Laughton, Maureen O''Sullivan, Dorothy Peterson, Verree Teasdale, Ray Milland, Billy Bevan, Halliwell Hobbes, William Stack', null, 'Bank clerk William Marble is desperate for money to pay his family''s bills. When his wealthy nephew visits, Marble asks him for a loan, but the young man refuses. Marble decides to kill his nephew. It is a twisted path to justice after Marble is transformed by the crime he committed and the wealth he gains.', 'Bank clerk William Marble is desperate for money to pay his family''s bills. When his wealthy nephew visits, Marble asks him for a loan, but the young man refuses. Marble decides to kill his nephew. It is a twisted path to justice after Marble is transformed by the crime he committed and the wealth he gains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeoAI9u7yHelzuzvvWYFHIeblu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36519'),
  ('422238079183569396', 'Payment in Blood', 1967, 'Western', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Aldo Pinelli, Ivo Bevilacqua', 'Tito Carpi, Enzo G. Castellari', 'Edd Byrnes, Guy Madison, Ennio Girolami, Luisa Baratto, Federico Boido, Aysanoa Runachagua, Giulio Maculani, Piero Vida', null, 'Chamaco finds himself on the wrong end of a firing squad after tracking an ex-Confederate to interrogate him about General Beauregard''s missing gold. He''s saved by a stranger who calls himself Stuart Byrnes. Stuart claims to know the location of Beauregard''s strongbox, and so Chamaco takes him to Blake''s camp. After a sort of initiation by the gang, Stuart leads Blake''s men back across the border to Durango to retrieve the gold.', 'Chamaco finds himself on the wrong end of a firing squad after tracking an ex-Confederate to interrogate him about General Beauregard''s missing gold. He''s saved by a stranger who calls himself Stuart Byrnes. Stuart claims to know the location of Beauregard''s strongbox, and so Chamaco takes him to Blake''s camp. After a sort of initiation by the gang, Stuart leads Blake''s men back across the border to Durango to retrieve the gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzlJY3srMqRHu9yh3rYeeRDPlAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143936'),
  ('634199950594995696', 'Payment on Demand', 1951, 'Drama', 'Curtis Bernhardt, Leo Tover, Lowell J. Farrell', 'Curtis Bernhardt, Bruce Manning', 'Bette Davis, Barry Sullivan, Jane Cowl, Kent Taylor, Betty Lynn, John Sutton, Frances Dee, Peggie Castle', null, 'David gives his wife, Joyce, an unexpected—and unpleasant—surprise when he suddenly demands a divorce. When she then learns that David has taken up with a younger woman, Joyce decides to make the most of this separation by taking a solo trip to the Caribbean. However, just before diving into a vacation fling, she runs into Emily, an old chum whose own divorce has left her embittered. Joyce then debates giving married life one last chance.', 'David gives his wife, Joyce, an unexpected—and unpleasant—surprise when he suddenly demands a divorce. When she then learns that David has taken up with a younger woman, Joyce decides to make the most of this separation by taking a solo trip to the Caribbean. However, just before diving into a vacation fling, she runs into Emily, an old chum whose own divorce has left her embittered. Joyce then debates giving married life one last chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i735e0FTx0nZwrJB8dn0qCwkkUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83667'),
  ('742451721711155545', 'Payoff', 2003, 'Crime, Comedy, Action', 'Gilles Paquet-Brenner, Denis Rouden', 'Renaud Bendavid, Gilles Paquet-Brenner', 'Stomy Bugsy, Titoff, Noémie Lenoir, Jean Yanne, Élodie Navarre, Daniel Duval, Etienne Chicot, Tomasz Białkowski', null, 'Two very different cops are forced to work together...', 'Two very different cops are forced to work together...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4hCKWV9A57aRhGfADoeuUtRDul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107059'),
  ('590893805074664936', 'Payroll', 1961, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sidney Hayers, Ernest Steward, Clive Reed', 'George Baxt', 'Michael Craig, Françoise Prévost, Billie Whitelaw, William Lucas, Kenneth Griffith, Tom Bell, Barry Keegan, Edward Cast', 'NR', 'A vicious gang of crooks plan to steal the wages of a local factory, but their carefully laid plans go wrong, when the factory employs an armoured van to carry the cash. The gang still go ahead with the robbery, but when the driver of the armoured van is killed in the raid, his wife plans revenge, and with the police closing in, the gang start to turn on each other.', 'A vicious gang of crooks plan to steal the wages of a local factory, but their carefully laid plans go wrong, when the factory employs an armoured van to carry the cash. The gang still go ahead with the robbery, but when the driver of the armoured van is killed in the raid, his wife plans revenge, and with the police closing in, the gang start to turn on each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPbHVqRudV3n40BxgrbnHSJcBhC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60759'),
  ('43833994164684456', 'Paz!', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Renato De Maria, Alessia Cerasaro, Gian Filippo Corticelli', 'Ivan Cotroneo, Renato De Maria, Francesco Piccolo', 'Claudio Santamaria, Flavio Pistilli, Max Mazzotta, Cristiano Callegaro, Matteo Taranto, Fabrizia Sacchi, Roberto Citran, Antonio Rezza', null, 'Inspired by the work of Italian underground comic book prodigy Andrea Pazienza, "Paz!" is a 24-hour slice of life of a group of university students sharing a flat in 1970s Bologna, grappling with drugs, classes, girls and half-hearted political activism.', 'Inspired by the work of Italian underground comic book prodigy Andrea Pazienza, "Paz!" is a 24-hour slice of life of a group of university students sharing a flat in 1970s Bologna, grappling with drugs, classes, girls and half-hearted political activism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kG3kwXQqA2Qo7LeVbiEVuL65F5n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56482'),
  ('928397691928114038', 'PCU', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Hart Bochner, Reynaldo Villalobos, Martin Walters', 'Adam Leff, Zak Penn', 'Jeremy Piven, Chris Young, David Spade, Megan Ward, Sarah Trigger, Jon Favreau, Alex Désert, Gale Mayron', 'PG-13', 'Nervous high school senior Tom Lawrence visits Port Chester University, where he gets a taste of politically correct college life when he''s guided by fraternity wild man Droz and his housemates at The Pit. But Droz and his pals have rivals in nasty preppy Rand McPherson and the school''s steely president. With their house threatened with expulsion, Droz and company decide to throw a raging party where the various factions will collide.', 'Nervous high school senior Tom Lawrence visits Port Chester University, where he gets a taste of politically correct college life when he''s guided by fraternity wild man Droz and his housemates at The Pit. But Droz and his pals have rivals in nasty preppy Rand McPherson and the school''s steely president. With their house threatened with expulsion, Droz and company decide to throw a raging party where the various factions will collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTToUzy9Im9nu2W8fz7TPWoDWN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14425'),
  ('688020146970313948', 'Peace', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Kazuhiro Soda, Kazuhiro Soda', 'Kazuhiro Soda', 'Shiro Hashimoto, Hiroko Kashiwagi, Toshio Kashiwagi', null, 'What is peace? What is coexistence? And what are the basis for them? PEACE is a visual-essay-like observational documentary, which contemplates these questions by observing the daily lives of people and cats in Okayama city, Japan, where life and death, acceptance and rejection are intermingled.', 'What is peace? What is coexistence? And what are the basis for them? PEACE is a visual-essay-like observational documentary, which contemplates these questions by observing the daily lives of people and cats in Okayama city, Japan, where life and death, acceptance and rejection are intermingled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5C1cgVlzKaugGXRZs30klZnsm8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286716'),
  ('340909065439397119', 'Peace Breaker', 2017, 'Crime, Action', 'Lien Yi-chi', 'Lin Yu-Chen, Yu Shang-Min', 'Aaron Kwok, Wang Qianyuan, Liu Tao, Yu Ailei, Feng Jiayi, Zheng Kai, Hao Xuankai, Matt Wu', null, 'A morally bent detective has one of the worst days of his life after he tries to cover up an accidental crime.', 'A morally bent detective has one of the worst days of his life after he tries to cover up an accidental crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pL5uxsdD3kBxKl0oJW2VdCWtcS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473256'),
  ('195206777773645488', 'Peace Hotel', 1995, 'Action, Crime, Western', 'Wai Ka-Fai, Yuen Bun, Ma Yuk-Sing', 'Wai Ka-Fai, Chow Yun-Fat', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Cecilia Yip Tung, Chin Ho, Annabelle Lau Hiu-Tung, Lo Fan, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Lau Shun, Mai Kei', null, 'After his wife''s murder, Ping sets up a Peace Hotel to act as a sanctuary for anyone who needs protecting. One day, a mysterious woman shows up who seeks shelter from a gang hunting her. Vowing to never turn anyone away, Ping must decide whether to help the women or risk confronting the gang.', 'After his wife''s murder, Ping sets up a Peace Hotel to act as a sanctuary for anyone who needs protecting. One day, a mysterious woman shows up who seeks shelter from a gang hunting her. Vowing to never turn anyone away, Ping must decide whether to help the women or risk confronting the gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAo95rbWXpALy6coB8bfU92s2rU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50840'),
  ('1103884124493833034', 'Peace on Earth', 1939, 'Animation, War', 'Hugh Harman', 'Jack Cosgriff, Hugh Harman', 'Mel Blanc, Sara Berner, Bernice Hansen', null, 'Two baby squirrels ask grandpa to explain what "men" are when he comes in singing "peace on earth, goodwill to men". Grandpa tells the story of man''s last war. This classic animation short was an Academy Award Best Short Subject, Cartoons nominee.', 'Two baby squirrels ask grandpa to explain what "men" are when he comes in singing "peace on earth, goodwill to men". Grandpa tells the story of man''s last war. This classic animation short was an Academy Award Best Short Subject, Cartoons nominee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSvlAiGpxtUkMX9C8ZcPp7sNNQh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46242'),
  ('102209091497650352', 'Peace to Him Who Enters', 1961, 'Drama, War', 'Aleksandr Alov, Vladimir Naumov, Anatoliy Kuznetsov', 'Aleksandr Alov, Vladimir Naumov, Leonid Zorin', 'Viktor Avdyushko, Aleksandr Demyanenko, Stanislav Khitrov, Lidiya Shaporenko, Vera Bokadoro, Mykola Hrynko, Nikolai Timofeyev, Izolda Izvitskaya', null, 'The time is World War II. Lidiya Shaporenko plays a pregnant German woman, trapped behind Russian lines. When the woman goes into labor, three loyal Soviets deliver her to a field hospital: a newly graduated officer, an affable truck driver, and a soldier shell-shocked into muteness. The dangerous trip to the hospital ends up a rite of passage for all concerned. The winner of a special gold medal at the Venice Film Festival, Peace to Him Who Enters was originally released in the USSR in 1961 under the title Mir Vkhodyashchemu.', 'The time is World War II. Lidiya Shaporenko plays a pregnant German woman, trapped behind Russian lines. When the woman goes into labor, three loyal Soviets deliver her to a field hospital: a newly graduated officer, an affable truck driver, and a soldier shell-shocked into muteness. The dangerous trip to the hospital ends up a rite of passage for all concerned. The winner of a special gold medal at the Venice Film Festival, Peace to Him Who Enters was originally released in the USSR in 1961 under the title Mir Vkhodyashchemu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1H4LjpOp7v0sq1gutehxtxCmK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204194'),
  ('1038340362217267105', 'Peace, Love & Misunderstanding', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Andre Fleuren, Richard Cowan, Stephen P. Del Prete', 'Christine Mengert, Joseph Muszynski', 'Catherine Keener, Elizabeth Olsen, Nat Wolff, Jane Fonda, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Chace Crawford, Marissa O''Donnell, Kyle MacLachlan', null, 'A conservative lawyer named Diane takes her two teenage children Jake and Zoe to meet their estranged, hippie grandmother in Woodstock after her husband asks for a divorce.', 'A conservative lawyer named Diane takes her two teenage children Jake and Zoe to meet their estranged, hippie grandmother in Woodstock after her husband asks for a divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIOHApxy3ngIbWvUWGDjSMSCoqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98545'),
  ('279300858685484843', 'Peaceful', 2021, 'Drama', 'Yves Cape, Mathieu Caudroy, Emmanuelle Bercot', 'Emmanuelle Bercot, Marcia Romano', 'Catherine Deneuve, Benoît Magimel, Cécile de France, Gabriel Sara, Oscar Morgan, Lou Lampros, Melissa George, Clément Ducol', null, 'A son in denial of a serious illness. A mother facing the unbearable. And between them a doctor fighting to do his job and bring them to acceptance. The three of them have one year and four seasons to come together and understand what it means to die while living.', 'A son in denial of a serious illness. A mother facing the unbearable. And between them a doctor fighting to do his job and bring them to acceptance. The three of them have one year and four seasons to come together and understand what it means to die while living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFLciAbjeEB4TFbKvJXQtywwoSk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654323'),
  ('1075349737496792980', 'Peaceful Death', 2020, 'Drama', 'Banmei Takahashi, Yasutaka Mori', null, 'Tasuku Emoto, Maki Sakai, Eiji Okuda, Kimiko Yo, Ryudo Uzaki, Naoko Ohtani', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fIfR3E8BqtLqeNJFQ4L5dAjtFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:780080'),
  ('229548922255929676', 'Peaceful Warrior', 2006, 'Drama', 'Victor Salva, Sharone Meir', 'Kevin Bernhardt', 'Scott Mechlowicz, Nick Nolte, Amy Smart, Tim DeKay, Ashton Holmes, Paul Wesley, Agnes Bruckner, B.J. Britt', 'PG-13', 'A chance encounter with a stranger changes the life of a college gymnast.', 'A chance encounter with a stranger changes the life of a college gymnast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4VQCZe3aSo7TmmsxcyLqaoMR1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13689'),
  ('689568333064714608', 'Peacemaker', 1990, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Kevin Tenney, Daniel Duncan, Phil Robinson', 'Kevin Tenney', 'Lance Edwards, Hilary Shepard, Robert Forster, Robert Davi, Sharon Schaffer, Kyra Stempel, Bert Remsen, John Denos', null, 'Two aliens arrive on Earth trying to kill each other. This is not easy, since they seem to be able to regenerate lost body parts and survive bullet wounds. Both of them happen to meet a young pathologist Dori Caisson, and each alien tells her that he is a peacemaker (an intergalactic cop) and that the other one is a bad guy. Whom can she trust?', 'Two aliens arrive on Earth trying to kill each other. This is not easy, since they seem to be able to regenerate lost body parts and survive bullet wounds. Both of them happen to meet a young pathologist Dori Caisson, and each alien tells her that he is a peacemaker (an intergalactic cop) and that the other one is a bad guy. Whom can she trust?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyDSoAwUfEVOEJOG8vLJEhUfAbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78242'),
  ('543162350080988198', 'Peacetime', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Daniel Filho, Cristina Cirne, Cris D''amato', 'Bosco Brasil', 'Tony Ramos, Dan Stulbach, Louise Cardoso, Daniel Filho, Aílton Graça, Anselmo Vasconcelos, Ewa Stulbach, Bernardo Jablonski', null, 'Rio de Janeiro, April 18, 1945. Brazil''s foreign policy aligns closely with that of the United States and opens a brief period of democratic rule after the end of World War 2. For years, hundreds of people were arrested and tortured by the Vargas regime. But with the external pressure, several political prisoners gain freedom.', 'Rio de Janeiro, April 18, 1945. Brazil''s foreign policy aligns closely with that of the United States and opens a brief period of democratic rule after the end of World War 2. For years, hundreds of people were arrested and tortured by the Vargas regime. But with the external pressure, several political prisoners gain freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6h2ou2xX8YECug32wzRSjLmNYoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27457'),
  ('1111166470620445588', 'Peach Girl', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kōji Shintoku', 'Junpei Yamaoka', 'Mizuki Yamamoto, Mackenyu, Kei Inoo, Mei Nagano, Yuika Motokariya, Kensei Mikami, Takeshi Masu, Momoko Kikuchi', null, 'While everyone thinks that Momo is a wild party girl, the reality is that she is shy and lonely. Can Momo confess her love to her classmate, Toji, or will her best friend Sae steal him away? It''s a bittersweet drama of growing up and fitting in.', 'While everyone thinks that Momo is a wild party girl, the reality is that she is shy and lonely. Can Momo confess her love to her classmate, Toji, or will her best friend Sae steal him away? It''s a bittersweet drama of growing up and fitting in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEMwEGN2T4JU8oql7b6Uq1h3yRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438551'),
  ('494220991884071933', 'Peacock', 2005, 'Drama', 'Gu Changwei, Yang Shu', 'Qiang Li', 'Zhang Jingchu, Li Feng, Lü Yulai, Huang Meiying, Ping Zong, Bao Zhenjiang, Tian Xiaojie, Lan Wang', null, 'Brings viewers into a small Chinese city and inspires familiarity with the rhythms of everyday existence, with people''s dreams, shortcomings and illusions in a way that is universal.', 'Brings viewers into a small Chinese city and inspires familiarity with the rhythms of everyday existence, with people''s dreams, shortcomings and illusions in a way that is universal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwdCPLbXAYG5DWuvVOjTB3JFACv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11728'),
  ('488382056151746087', 'Peacock', 2010, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Michael Lander, Philippe Rousselot', 'Michael Lander, Ryan Roy', 'Cillian Murphy, Elliot Page, Susan Sarandon, Jaimi Paige, Josh Lucas, Virginia Newcomb, Keith Carradine, Bill Pullman', 'PG-13', 'A minor train accident in rural Nebraska gradually unveils a mystery involving the town''s reclusive bank clerk.', 'A minor train accident in rural Nebraska gradually unveils a mystery involving the town''s reclusive bank clerk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEtrsxfNw9qmAeML3QSzOe0hrS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11761'),
  ('1080929385889281346', 'Peacock', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Bernhard Wenger, Eva Roth, Albin Wildner', 'Bernhard Wenger', 'Albrecht Schuch, Julia Franz Richter, Anton Noori, Theresa Frostad Eggesbø, Salka Weber, Maria Hofstätter, Branko Samarovski, Tilo Nest', null, 'Matthias is a master of pretense, from cultured boyfriend to perfect son or marital coach. He makes a career of being someone else. The real challenge begins when he has to be himself.', 'Matthias is a master of pretense, from cultured boyfriend to perfect son or marital coach. He makes a career of being someone else. The real challenge begins when he has to be himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beSHeoX1KDSfUBcfeEIkx23oPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1245728'),
  ('192683921810213998', 'Peaky Blinders: The Immortal Man', 2026, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tom Harper, Amie English, George Steel', 'Steven Knight', 'Cillian Murphy, Barry Keoghan, Rebecca Ferguson, Tim Roth, Stephen Graham, Sophie Rundle, Ned Dennehy, Packy Lee', 'R', 'After his estranged son gets embroiled in a Nazi plot, self-exiled gangster Tommy Shelby must return to Birmingham to save his family — and his nation.', 'After his estranged son gets embroiled in a Nazi plot, self-exiled gangster Tommy Shelby must return to Birmingham to save his family — and his nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRMalasZEzsZi4w2VFuYusfSfqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:875828'),
  ('125398434926456432', 'Peaky Blinders: The Real Story', 2026, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Robin Bextor', 'Robin Bextor', 'Andrew Insol, Steven Knight, Grant Montgomery, Carl Chinn, Michael Hogan', 'R', 'A behind-the-scenes documentary uncovering the real history of Birmingham''s Peaky Blinders, separating fact from fiction in the hit TV series and exploring the creative vision behind its unique style.', 'A behind-the-scenes documentary uncovering the real history of Birmingham''s Peaky Blinders, separating fact from fiction in the hit TV series and exploring the creative vision behind its unique style.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FjJTp2pn1etVCViw04f0b3YArkmW.jpg', 'plex:movie:peaky-blinders-the-real-story'),
  ('434365260316601686', 'Pearl', 2018, 'Drama', 'Elsa Amiel, Colin Lévêque', 'Laurent Larivière', 'Julia Föry, Arieh Worthalter, Vidal Arzoni, Peter Mullan, Agata Buzek, Khoudiedji Sidibe, Camille Bouzaglo, Barbara Ménage', null, 'Competitive bodybuilder Léa Pearl is preparing to compete for the prestigious Miss Heaven title. Her coach, Al, a former bodybuilding star, hopes that, thanks to Léa, he will be back in the spotlight once again. But at the last minute, Léa''s ex arrives with their son Joseph, who she hasn''t seen in four years.', 'Competitive bodybuilder Léa Pearl is preparing to compete for the prestigious Miss Heaven title. Her coach, Al, a former bodybuilding star, hopes that, thanks to Léa, he will be back in the spotlight once again. But at the last minute, Léa''s ex arrives with their son Joseph, who she hasn''t seen in four years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMvenpRLYfyYG4LhYhmDjSCDVOH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485164'),
  ('352124439779630821', 'Pearl', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ti West, Ben Milsom, Eliot Rockett', 'Ti West, Mia Goth', 'Mia Goth, David Corenswet, Tandi Wright, Matthew Sunderland, Emma Jenkins-Purro, Alistair Sewell, Amelia Reid, Gabe McDonnell', 'R', 'Trapped on her family’s isolated farm, Pearl must tend to her ailing father under the bitter and overbearing watch of her devout mother. Lusting for a glamorous life like she’s seen in the movies, Pearl’s ambitions, temptations, and repressions collide.', 'Trapped on her family’s isolated farm, Pearl must tend to her ailing father under the bitter and overbearing watch of her devout mother. Lusting for a glamorous life like she’s seen in the movies, Pearl’s ambitions, temptations, and repressions collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5uIG81pXyHKg7cUFIu84Wjn4NS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949423'),
  ('511399441967416814', 'Pearl Harbor', 2001, 'War, Romance, History, Action', 'John Schwartzman, Michael Bay, Paul Sonski', 'Randall Wallace', 'Ben Affleck, Kate Beckinsale, Josh Hartnett, Cuba Gooding Jr., Jon Voight, Tom Sizemore, Alec Baldwin, Ewen Bremner', 'PG-13', 'The lifelong friendship between Rafe McCawley and Danny Walker is put to the ultimate test when the two ace fighter pilots become entangled in a love triangle with beautiful Naval nurse Evelyn Johnson. But the rivalry between the friends-turned-foes is immediately put on hold when they find themselves at the center of Japan''s devastating attack on Pearl Harbor on Dec. 7, 1941.', 'The lifelong friendship between Rafe McCawley and Danny Walker is put to the ultimate test when the two ace fighter pilots become entangled in a love triangle with beautiful Naval nurse Evelyn Johnson. But the rivalry between the friends-turned-foes is immediately put on hold when they find themselves at the center of Japan''s devastating attack on Pearl Harbor on Dec. 7, 1941.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8A0Cvp8WQmZ3bjbnsL53lY0dsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676'),
  ('259802200899925538', 'Pearl in Paradise', 2018, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Gary Yates, Tyler Walzak, David Carruthers', 'Christine Conradt', 'Jill Wagner, Kristoffer Polaha, Rob Kipa-Williams, Naomi Sequeira, Dina Gillespie, Wame Valentine, Amelia Reid, Jarred Blakiston', null, 'Magazine photographer Alex Anderson and author Colin Page head to Fiji in search of the illusive blue pearl that Colin wrote about in his bestselling novel Pearl in Paradise. Alex stands to land the creative director position if she can photograph the pearl for the magazine’s 30th anniversary issue, and Colin hopes that by writing a guest article about the long-lost gem he can boost sales of his failing other books and not lose his publisher. As the two head off to their search, neither is aware yet that finding love could be the rarest adventure of all.', 'Magazine photographer Alex Anderson and author Colin Page head to Fiji in search of the illusive blue pearl that Colin wrote about in his bestselling novel Pearl in Paradise. Alex stands to land the creative director position if she can photograph the pearl for the magazine’s 30th anniversary issue, and Colin hopes that by writing a guest article about the long-lost gem he can boost sales of his failing other books and not lose his publisher. As the two head off to their search, neither is aware yet that finding love could be the rarest adventure of all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A19g63NzdhCrgk8s8Oa3SVhEQux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531836'),
  ('72440278287659977', 'Pearl in the Crown', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Kazimierz Kutz, Stanisław Loth, Ryszard Zaorski', 'Kazimierz Kutz', 'Lucja Kowolik, Olgierd Łukaszewicz, Jan Englert, Franciszek Pieczka, Jerzy Cnota, Bernard Krawczyk, Tadeusz Madeja, Henryk Maruszczyk', null, 'When it is discovered that the Zygmunt mine in Upper Silesia has been deemed unprofitable and is to be closed by flooding, the miners go on strike and a violent demonstration ensues.', 'When it is discovered that the Zygmunt mine in Upper Silesia has been deemed unprofitable and is to be closed by flooding, the miners go on strike and a violent demonstration ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZ6m8vJjxoWRSCp7RpY92xD2ymS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155965'),
  ('207958667505186484', 'Pearl Jam Twenty', 2011, 'Documentary, Music', 'Cameron Crowe', 'Cameron Crowe', 'Eddie Vedder, Stone Gossard, Jeff Ament, Mike McCready, Matt Cameron, Chris Cornell, Kevin Shuss, Cameron Crowe', 'NR', 'Carved from over 1,200 hours of footage spanning the band’s career, Pearl Jam: Twenty is the definitive portrait of Pearl Jam. Part concert film, part intimate insider-hang, and part testimonial to the power of music.', 'Carved from over 1,200 hours of footage spanning the band’s career, Pearl Jam: Twenty is the definitive portrait of Pearl Jam. Part concert film, part intimate insider-hang, and part testimonial to the power of music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d38PBlEsj5W9Od581GuWLeTuy4F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72744'),
  ('354034123546639436', 'Pearl Jam: MTV Unplugged', 1992, 'Music, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Joel Gallen', null, 'Eddie Vedder, Stone Gossard, Mike McCready, Jeff Ament, Dave Abbruzzese', null, 'A performance by Pearl Jam on MTV’s Unplugged. The band plays acoustic versions of songs from their debut album Ten, including ''Black'' and ''Alive'', plus ''State Of Love And Trust'', which was not included on the original album.', 'A performance by Pearl Jam on MTV’s Unplugged. The band plays acoustic versions of songs from their debut album Ten, including ''Black'' and ''Alive'', plus ''State Of Love And Trust'', which was not included on the original album.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PLopYjAf6drsdYN4jZhCqfQ7r5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103846'),
  ('755151838892361285', 'Pearl Jam: Single Video Theory', 1998, 'Music, Documentary', 'Mark Pellington, Bobby Bukowski, Joe Kessler', null, 'Eddie Vedder, Stone Gossard, Jeff Ament, Mike McCready', null, 'This video is not your typical collection of music videos. Rather than being simply a straightforward presentation of videos, Single Video Theory also contains footage of the band members recording their album in the studio. The camera captures the actual recording sessions as well as the band members chatting candidly about their concept and ideas for the music. Directed by Mark Pellington and shot in 16mm over 3 days in 1997.', 'This video is not your typical collection of music videos. Rather than being simply a straightforward presentation of videos, Single Video Theory also contains footage of the band members recording their album in the studio. The camera captures the actual recording sessions as well as the band members chatting candidly about their concept and ideas for the music. Directed by Mark Pellington and shot in 16mm over 3 days in 1997.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70Dnw4i1XglJbtAgzPZENMaGPxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19040'),
  ('39633363899316384', 'Pearl of the South Pacific', 1955, 'Adventure', 'Allan Dwan, John Alton, Lew Borzage', 'Jesse Lasky Jr.', 'Virginia Mayo, Dennis Morgan, David Farrar, Murvyn Vye, Lance Fuller, Basil Ruysdael, Lisa Montell, Carol Thurston', 'NR', 'Two beachcombers with a yacht join woman-with-a-past Rita on a quest for black pearls on a secret island. Arrived, they find another white man has made himself high priest; but George, the latter''s handome son, is fair game for Rita, who lands in the guise of a missionary! The inevitable conflict over the pearls brings violence and corruption to the quiet island.', 'Two beachcombers with a yacht join woman-with-a-past Rita on a quest for black pearls on a secret island. Arrived, they find another white man has made himself high priest; but George, the latter''s handome son, is fair game for Rita, who lands in the guise of a missionary! The inevitable conflict over the pearls brings violence and corruption to the quiet island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8YcUg4BGwsQbwC68XyK0i9M7Zj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122159'),
  ('727063547443231122', 'Pearls and Pigs', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Perttu Leppä, Veira Airaksinen, Pia Rickman', 'Perttu Leppä', 'Mikko Leppilampi, Laura Birn, Amanda Pilke, Unto Helo, Timo Lavikainen, Jimi Pääkallo, Pekka Valkeejärvi, Outi Mäenpää', null, 'When their bootlegging father ends up in jail, four twenty-something brothers need money to pay his debts to local crooks. Next, their 9-year-old half-sister is dumped on their doorstep by her prostitute mother. A karaoke set helps reveal that the little girl is quite a singer, just as a talent contest for children is coming up on national television offering more than enough money to the winner.', 'When their bootlegging father ends up in jail, four twenty-something brothers need money to pay his debts to local crooks. Next, their 9-year-old half-sister is dumped on their doorstep by her prostitute mother. A karaoke set helps reveal that the little girl is quite a singer, just as a talent contest for children is coming up on national television offering more than enough money to the winner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUmJWFUbVb7P9vQeXRZDQz2H4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54764'),
  ('430817578382965054', 'Pearls of the Deep', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Květa Ondráková, Zdenka Petřková, Věra Chytilová', 'Bohumil Hrabal, Jaromil Jireš, Jiří Menzel', 'Pavla Maršálková, Ferdinand Krůta, Alois Vachek, Emil Iserle, Miroslav Nohýnek, Slávka Španková, Bohumil Hrabal, Jiří Menzel', null, 'A quintet of vignettes based on short stories by Bohumil Hrabal: an eventful trip to the motorcycle races results in drunkenness, long-winded discussions, and death; two elderly men create false biographies; insurance agents visit an eccentric painter/goat farmer and his mother; guests at a wedding reception remain oblivious to outlying misery; and a working-class boy romances a Roma girl.', 'A quintet of vignettes based on short stories by Bohumil Hrabal: an eventful trip to the motorcycle races results in drunkenness, long-winded discussions, and death; two elderly men create false biographies; insurance agents visit an eccentric painter/goat farmer and his mother; guests at a wedding reception remain oblivious to outlying misery; and a working-class boy romances a Roma girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spwskcYw4Uid4y2TyyN7CCPgn3F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106124'),
  ('317089867314020909', 'Peas & Whiskers', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Lasse Björne, Gösta Ekman', 'Gösta Ekman, Rolf Börjlind', 'Gösta Ekman, Margaretha Krook, Lena Nyman, Kent Andersson, Sten Ljunggren, Claes Jansson, Sanna Ekman, Robert Sjöblom', null, 'Life isn''t easy for the indecisive 40-year-old Claes-Henrik. Should he choose his mom or his girlfriend?', 'Life isn''t easy for the indecisive 40-year-old Claes-Henrik. Should he choose his mom or his girlfriend?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmJj9jd0k4j6U2DAGAT6lxqhZ4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49718'),
  ('798257296177971851', 'Peasants', 1982, 'Drama', 'Sergey Zaytsev, Iskra Babich, Inna Lyubchenko', 'Iskra Babich, Valentin Mikhaylov', 'Pyotr Glebov, Vera Alkhovskaya, Aleksandr Mikhaylov, Irina Ivanova, Mikhail Buzylyov-Kretso, Pyotr Krylov, Aleksandr Pavlov, Anatoliy Solonitsyn', null, 'Pavel''s mother hates his fiancee. When Pavel serves in the Army she writes him that Nastya is no longer faithful to him. Pavel decides not to return to his native town. But many years later he returns to his fathers funeral and finds out that Nastya died sometime ago. She left three kids orphans and her elder daughter is also a daughter of Pavel.', 'Pavel''s mother hates his fiancee. When Pavel serves in the Army she writes him that Nastya is no longer faithful to him. Pavel decides not to return to his native town. But many years later he returns to his fathers funeral and finds out that Nastya died sometime ago. She left three kids orphans and her elder daughter is also a daughter of Pavel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djtsBQW8d0ZQOIYlpE7IYuofgKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260584'),
  ('312348479872502378', 'Peçanha Contra o Animal', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Vinicius Videla, Tiago Rios', 'Antonio Tabet', 'Antonio Tabet, Pedro Benevides, Fábio de Luca, Rafael Portugal, Evelyn Castro, Estevam Nabote, Gabriel Totoro, Joel Vieira', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nH0EycssY8aFJxElTsGSRirP9qr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879163'),
  ('237348308980445898', 'Pecker', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Waters, Robert M. Stevens', 'John Waters', 'Edward Furlong, Christina Ricci, Bess Armstrong, Mark Joy, Mary Kay Place, Martha Plimpton, Brendan Sexton III, Mink Stole', 'R', 'A Baltimore teenager who picks up a second-hand camera starts snapping his way to stardom, soon turning into a nationwide sensation, with a fateful choice between his life and his art.', 'A Baltimore teenager who picks up a second-hand camera starts snapping his way to stardom, soon turning into a nationwide sensation, with a fateful choice between his life and his art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ox6Myr2r36zr7aqnisQGZp2EW33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11855'),
  ('1082458776073450415', 'Pecos Bill', 1948, 'Western, Animation', 'Clyde Geronimi', 'Joe Rinaldi, Erdman Penner', 'Roy Rogers, Bob Nolan, Luana Patten', 'NR', 'The life of the legendary Texas cowboy with his horse, Widowmaker, and how his romance with Slue Foot Sue disrupted it.', 'The life of the legendary Texas cowboy with his horse, Widowmaker, and how his romance with Slue Foot Sue disrupted it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1C7yYeUTMguxMcvp9HtTFT3pShR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204017'),
  ('1038547667047658880', 'Pecos Pest', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna, Scott Bradley', null, 'Daws Butler, Shug Fisher', 'NR', 'Jerry''s eccentric uncle, Pecos, a Texan mouse, comes to spend the night with him before his musical performance on television the next day. He decides to rehearse with his guitar for the performance but each time he plays, one of his guitar strings snaps off. Fortunately, he is able to replace them by plucking off one of Tom''s whiskers each time. Tom is rather reluctant about this and tries to hide to protect his whiskers from Uncle Pecos.', 'Jerry''s eccentric uncle, Pecos, a Texan mouse, comes to spend the night with him before his musical performance on television the next day. He decides to rehearse with his guitar for the performance but each time he plays, one of his guitar strings snaps off. Fortunately, he is able to replace them by plucking off one of Tom''s whiskers each time. Tom is rather reluctant about this and tries to hide to protect his whiskers from Uncle Pecos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKsf1alQOIvvqMHljMtyIWqpW0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75097'),
  ('1026140979431480962', 'Peculiar Attraction', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Juan Iribas, Enrique Carreras', 'Juan Carlos Mesa', 'Alberto Olmedo, Jorge Porcel, Beatriz Salomón, Sandra Villarruel, Silvia Pérez, Judith Gabbani, Adrián Martel, Adolfo García Grau', null, 'A television director decides to make a show about the invasion of transvestites in Mar del Plata. He commissions one of his editors, Jorge Trolombati, who must infiltrate and impersonate one.', 'A television director decides to make a show about the invasion of transvestites in Mar del Plata. He commissions one of his editors, Jorge Trolombati, who must infiltrate and impersonate one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcGmCf3c0UD7a8BfKHq8ba7Jafn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366980'),
  ('645493789473697980', 'Peculiar Penguins', 1934, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, null, 'NR', 'Penguins dance and play in Antarctica.', 'Penguins dance and play in Antarctica.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kW2IFGz81V8vnaTZBdB1ImdFzk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109299'),
  ('1142602745447930331', 'Peculiarities of the National Fishing', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Aleksandr Rogozhkin, Valeri Martynov, Yuri Nikolayev', 'Aleksandr Rogozhkin', 'Aleksei Buldakov, Viktor Bychkov, Semyon Strugachyov, Ville Haapasalo, Sergey Russkin, Andrey Krasko, Olga Samoshina, Aleksandr Zavyalov', null, 'General Ivolgin, forester Kuzmich, and good-natured Lyova lose their way on a fishing trip and wind up in a neighboring country, where they decide to have a good time anyway but end up leaving their vodka and fishing equipment behind.', 'General Ivolgin, forester Kuzmich, and good-natured Lyova lose their way on a fishing trip and wind up in a neighboring country, where they decide to have a good time anyway but end up leaving their vodka and fishing equipment behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zHuIitFhPOLh24pTfGfwxAetli.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20882'),
  ('251190184401106963', 'Peculiarities of the National Hunt', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Aleksandr Rogozhkin, Andrei Zhegalov, Nikolai Astakhov', 'Aleksandr Rogozhkin', 'Aleksei Buldakov, Ville Haapasalo, Viktor Bychkov, Semyon Strugachyov, Sergey Russkin, Sergey Gusinskiy, Igor Sergeev, Igor Dobryakov', null, 'A Finn preparing a work on the Russian hunting traditions and customs, comes to Russia to collect materials and is invited to take part in a hunting party. His flamboyant companions include an Army general, with more than a passing resemblance to Aleksander Lebed, a police detective, local forest ranger (a devotee of Zen Buddhism) and some big-city types from St. Petersburg. Inevitably, their good intentions soon give way to endless drinking, visits to local farm girls and much else besides.', 'A Finn preparing a work on the Russian hunting traditions and customs, comes to Russia to collect materials and is invited to take part in a hunting party. His flamboyant companions include an Army general, with more than a passing resemblance to Aleksander Lebed, a police detective, local forest ranger (a devotee of Zen Buddhism) and some big-city types from St. Petersburg. Inevitably, their good intentions soon give way to endless drinking, visits to local farm girls and much else besides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knfyxxvcXAlDX9K6gqDKMA1v81o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451928'),
  ('383761389260353148', 'Peculiarities of the National Hunt in the Winter', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Aleksandr Rogozhkin, Yuriy Shaygardanov', 'Aleksandr Rogozhkin', 'Aleksei Buldakov, Viktor Bychkov, Semyon Strugachyov, Mikhail Porechenkov, Andrey Krasko, Sergey Gusinskiy, Irina Osnovina, Andrey Fedortsov', null, 'Now the peculiarities of the national hunt are investigated during the winter season.', 'Now the peculiarities of the national hunt are investigated during the winter season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saMcVgvwfpGNt5aTLDTGlwVbewd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20883'),
  ('630521498206709420', 'Pedal the World', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Felix Starck', null, 'Felix Starck', null, '"What is the meaning of life?". I posed this question almost daily a year ago, so I decided to get to the bottom of the mystery. I wanted to explore the world by my own power - on a bicycle. Untrained, I set off in June 2013 with over 55 kg of luggage and a video camera. 18,000 kilometers through a total of 22 countries with the goal of fulfilling a dream: the dream of absolute freedom and the discovery of our globe. Now experience together with me a really great adventure - a documentary that is not a script, but life itself. A unique challenge - with nature as an ally and the world as... opponent.', '"What is the meaning of life?". I posed this question almost daily a year ago, so I decided to get to the bottom of the mystery. I wanted to explore the world by my own power - on a bicycle. Untrained, I set off in June 2013 with over 55 kg of luggage and a video camera. 18,000 kilometers through a total of 22 countries with the goal of fulfilling a dream: the dream of absolute freedom and the discovery of our globe. Now experience together with me a really great adventure - a documentary that is not a script, but life itself. A unique challenge - with nature as an ally and the world as... opponent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCtWKw2Bzx6XkEK2dgeeb7JUewP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361712'),
  ('881441316622173618', 'Pédale dure', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Gabriel Aghion', 'Pierre Palmade, Bertrand Blier, Gabriel Aghion', 'Gérard Darmon, Michèle Laroque, Dany Boon, Jacques Dutronc, Guillaume Cramoisan, Ruben Alves, Dominique Besnehard, Eebra Tooré', null, 'Loic and Seb are a couple living in Paris''s gay district, the Marais. Seb is the owner of the district''s most trendy, chic and camp nightclub. It''s a world devoid of judging eyes where the clientele can be themselves. Things are just terrific. What''s more, Loic''s dream of transmitting his heart and soul to another human being is about to come true: he''s going to be a father. He gave his sperm. Things are just terrific. Marie Haguette, their accomplice, is offering them this gift, the most beautiful gift that two gay guys could receive: a baby! She''s three-months pregnant, that dicey moment when things could go wrong... Maybe this is why Loic has morning sickness, contractions and cravings. Things are just terrific. Except for love, Love with a capital L of course, upsets the pie-cart. Marie falls madly in love with Charles, a wonderful stranger, but at least he''s straight. What''s more, he''s coming to dinner tomorrow night. What should Loic and Seb do?', 'Loic and Seb are a couple living in Paris''s gay district, the Marais. Seb is the owner of the district''s most trendy, chic and camp nightclub. It''s a world devoid of judging eyes where the clientele can be themselves. Things are just terrific. What''s more, Loic''s dream of transmitting his heart and soul to another human being is about to come true: he''s going to be a father. He gave his sperm. Things are just terrific. Marie Haguette, their accomplice, is offering them this gift, the most beautiful gift that two gay guys could receive: a baby! She''s three-months pregnant, that dicey moment when things could go wrong... Maybe this is why Loic has morning sickness, contractions and cravings. Things are just terrific. Except for love, Love with a capital L of course, upsets the pie-cart. Marie falls madly in love with Charles, a wonderful stranger, but at least he''s straight. What''s more, he''s coming to dinner tomorrow night. What should Loic and Seb do?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xz4gvvqMXDKYa5ncs32J34li9R3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59705'),
  ('658506920177343127', 'Pedestrian Love', 1914, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Marcel Perez', null, 'Marcel Perez', null, 'The story of the meeting and falling in love of a man and a woman. The story is told by showing the characters from below the knees only. A man in smart shoes prepares to go out. His maid gives him his coat, he dusts off his shoes and leaves. As he leaves the building an elegant woman drops her purse. He returns it to her and follows her home.', 'The story of the meeting and falling in love of a man and a woman. The story is told by showing the characters from below the knees only. A man in smart shoes prepares to go out. His maid gives him his coat, he dusts off his shoes and leaves. As he leaves the building an elegant woman drops her purse. He returns it to her and follows her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npRl9QLveNaP0IJ25HMIaohDOKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174066'),
  ('356177664589412984', 'Pedestrian Subway', 1974, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Sławomir Idziak, Krzysztof Kieślowski, Joanna Krauze', 'Ireneusz Iredyński, Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Teresa Budzisz-Krzyżanowska, Andrzej Seweryn, Anna Jaraczówna, Zygmunt Maciejewski, Jan Orsza-Łukasiewicz, Janusz Skalski, Marcel Łoziński, Wojciech Wiszniewski', null, 'A school teacher from a small town in Poland comes to Warsaw to see his estranged wife, a window dresser, in the hope that she will return to him rather than give him a divorce.', 'A school teacher from a small town in Poland comes to Warsaw to see his estranged wife, a window dresser, in the hope that she will return to him rather than give him a divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYtt1i5DTwvXuBI6PtJRLU0PCB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406066'),
  ('624448362976927650', 'Pedicab Driver', 1989, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Ng Min-Kan, Chan Shu-Man', 'Yuen Kai-Chi, Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Nina Li Chi, Sun Yueh, Max Mok Siu-Chung, Fennie Yuen Kit-Ying, Lowell Lo Koon-Ting, Mang Hoi, John Shum Kin-Fun', null, 'Lo Tung and his friend Malted Candy, pedicab drivers working the streets of Macao, have both fallen in love. The problem is that both their objects of affection - one a baker, the other a prostitute - are working under cruel and lecherous bosses. Somehow, the pair must find a way to win the ladies'' hearts and free them from their unpleasant jobs.', 'Lo Tung and his friend Malted Candy, pedicab drivers working the streets of Macao, have both fallen in love. The problem is that both their objects of affection - one a baker, the other a prostitute - are working under cruel and lecherous bosses. Somehow, the pair must find a way to win the ladies'' hearts and free them from their unpleasant jobs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSZYsyvikyM7VJj9x7H9vl82uVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29014'),
