  ('66856309497201618', 'Pee Nak 4', 2024, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Phontharis Chotkijsadarsopon, Arnon Chunprasert, Adirek Phothong', 'Adirek Phothong, Sureewan Sirisapphokakun', 'Witthawat Rattanaboonbaramee, Bhuripat Vejvongsatechavat, Phiravich Attachitsataporn, Rathavit Kijworalak, Atiwat Saengtien, Pannawit Phattanasiri, Worawat Boonchuen, Mintra Chauwangkam', null, 'While visiting his hometown, a celebrity teams up with his quirky friends to confront a ghost from his past who''s wreaking havoc at a run-down temple.', 'While visiting his hometown, a celebrity teams up with his quirky friends to confront a ghost from his past who''s wreaking havoc at a run-down temple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GCdOC7L7uJvB60cvi4ratmhS6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172533'),
  ('655419834066175784', 'Pee-wee''s Big Adventure', 1985, 'Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Victor J. Kemper, Tim Burton, Robert Engelman', 'Phil Hartman, Paul Reubens, Michael Varhol', 'Paul Reubens, E. G. Daily, Mark Holton, Diane Salinger, Judd Omen, Irving Hellman, Monte Landis, Damon Martin', 'PG', 'The eccentric and childish Pee-wee Herman embarks on a big adventure when his beloved bicycle is stolen. Armed with information from a fortune-teller and a relentless obsession with his prized possession, Pee-wee encounters a host of odd characters and bizarre situations as he treks across the country to recover his bike.', 'The eccentric and childish Pee-wee Herman embarks on a big adventure when his beloved bicycle is stolen. Armed with information from a fortune-teller and a relentless obsession with his prized possession, Pee-wee encounters a host of odd characters and bizarre situations as he treks across the country to recover his bike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/414IUXc54mrhX88ZUQiRDLXn01i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5683'),
