  ('607971460915081069', 'Pee-wee''s Playhouse Christmas Special', 1988, 'Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Paul Reubens, Wayne Orr, Benita Allen', 'John Paragon, Paul Reubens', 'Paul Reubens, Kevin Carlson, Laurence Fishburne, Aaron Fletcher, Ric Heitzman, Suzanne Kent, William Marshall, George McGrath', null, 'Pee-wee Herman and pals are celebrating Christmas in the Playhouse in their own creative ways: Pee-wee makes a list for Santa Claus 1.5 miles long, teaches Little Richard how to ice skate, goes for a sleigh ride with Magic Johnson, enslaves Frankie Avalon and Annette Funicello into making Christmas cards, receives a long phone call from Dinah Shore, even has more musical fun with k.d. lang, the Del Rubio Triplettes and Charo! Finally, Big Red arrives and announces that Pee-wee''s Christmas list was so big, he didn''t have enough presents for all the children of the world. Will Pee-wee follow his own advice and help others?', 'Pee-wee Herman and pals are celebrating Christmas in the Playhouse in their own creative ways: Pee-wee makes a list for Santa Claus 1.5 miles long, teaches Little Richard how to ice skate, goes for a sleigh ride with Magic Johnson, enslaves Frankie Avalon and Annette Funicello into making Christmas cards, receives a long phone call from Dinah Shore, even has more musical fun with k.d. lang, the Del Rubio Triplettes and Charo! Finally, Big Red arrives and announces that Pee-wee''s Christmas list was so big, he didn''t have enough presents for all the children of the world. Will Pee-wee follow his own advice and help others?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTgwm9t1z7PIOGa06lGY6ITlh3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49041'),
