  ('969801746417245591', 'Peking Opera Blues', 1986, 'Action, Comedy', 'Tsui Hark, Yeung-Wah Kam, Poon Hang-Sang', 'Raymond To Kwok-Wai', 'Brigitte Lin, Sally Yeh, Cherie Chung Cho-Hung, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Cheung Kwok-Keung, Wu Ma, Paul Chun Pui, Ku Feng', null, 'In 1913 Beijing, three fierce women—disguised rebel Tsao Wan, jewel-seeking Sheung Hung, and opera heiress Pat Neil—embark on a daring quest filled with intrigue and betrayal, challenging societal norms amidst political turmoil and the vibrant world of Peking Opera.', 'In 1913 Beijing, three fierce women—disguised rebel Tsao Wan, jewel-seeking Sheung Hung, and opera heiress Pat Neil—embark on a daring quest filled with intrigue and betrayal, challenging societal norms amidst political turmoil and the vibrant world of Peking Opera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IcSrruE0hpBvqo40DRfX65nBRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39776'),
  ('76536915366235642', 'Pekka ja Pätkä ketjukolarissa', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Armand Lohikoski, Mikko Sergejeff, Pentti Valkeala', 'Armand Lohikoski', 'Esa Pakarinen, Masa Niemi, Siiri Angerkoski, Armas Jokio, Irja Kuusla, Vieno Kekkonen, Armand Lohikoski, Uuno Montonen', null, 'Justiina Puupää drives her husband Pekka and his friend Pätkä to look for work. The two decide to make money the easy way and try to have an accident after first getting accident insurance. After trying their luck, they hurt their heads and in the hospital, the comrades see each other''s more outrageous antics.', 'Justiina Puupää drives her husband Pekka and his friend Pätkä to look for work. The two decide to make money the easy way and try to have an accident after first getting accident insurance. After trying their luck, they hurt their heads and in the hospital, the comrades see each other''s more outrageous antics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pA9Tei197jfuIAfrn4cghnBiWyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76677'),
  ('632627311300456828', 'Pekka ja Pätkä lumimiehen jäljillä', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Osmo Harkimo, Pentti Unho, Armand Lohikoski', 'Reino Helismaa, Armand Lohikoski', 'Esa Pakarinen, Masa Niemi, Siiri Angerkoski, Anneli Sauli, Tuija Halonen, Olavi Virta, Åke Lindman, Vihtori Välimäki', null, 'Pete and Runt travel to Lapland to hunt the snowman in the hope of a cash reward, and take Justiina along as a bait.', 'Pete and Runt travel to Lapland to hunt the snowman in the hope of a cash reward, and take Justiina along as a bait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95A4FwBcujUJWa5GuKda8wJ6BpQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61070'),
  ('434435731219499006', 'Pekka ja Pätkä mestarimaalareina', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Olavi Tuomi, Armand Lohikoski', 'Armand Lohikoski', 'Esa Pakarinen, Masa Niemi, Siiri Angerkoski, Armas Jokio, Anja Hatakka, Heikki Savolainen, Leo Jokela, Matti Aulos', null, 'Justiina pushes Pekka and Pätkä to take painting lessons after realizing that art can be a way to earn a living. With the help of the yard children, a painting is created that wins first prize at a contemporary art exhibition. In the meantime, the men, along with their assistant Miss Kaihokielo, have been charged with art theft. After the misunderstanding is cleared up, the Puupääs use the art prize money to convert the house''s bomb shelter into a children''s clubroom.', 'Justiina pushes Pekka and Pätkä to take painting lessons after realizing that art can be a way to earn a living. With the help of the yard children, a painting is created that wins first prize at a contemporary art exhibition. In the meantime, the men, along with their assistant Miss Kaihokielo, have been charged with art theft. After the misunderstanding is cleared up, the Puupääs use the art prize money to convert the house''s bomb shelter into a children''s clubroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApmOcM8myPUpYZiW8lv5Cu64jGR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76678'),
  ('633032182455454328', 'Pekka ja Pätkä puistotäteinä', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Armand Lohikoski, Pentti Valkeala', 'Reino Helismaa', 'Esa Pakarinen, Masa Niemi, Siiri Angerkoski, Risto Jussila, Eila Peitsalo, Olavi Virta, Litja Ilmari, Varma Lahtinen', null, 'Justina urges Pete and Runt to get a job. As a result they meet an orphan boy named Otto while working as a park nannies. They offer to shelter the boy, but at the same time the father Antti, who has returned from the sea, is looking for his son together with Miss Raikas.', 'Justina urges Pete and Runt to get a job. As a result they meet an orphan boy named Otto while working as a park nannies. They offer to shelter the boy, but at the same time the father Antti, who has returned from the sea, is looking for his son together with Miss Raikas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQ0MsSBLhvJ9Dot6GN4TkHK2K78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120280'),
  ('1096277379415421345', 'Pekka ja Pätkä sammakkomiehinä', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Armand Lohikoski, Olavi Tuomi, Mikko Sergejeff', 'Armand Lohikoski', 'Esa Pakarinen, Masa Niemi, Siiri Angerkoski, Sirkka-Liisa Wilén, Armas Jokio, Pentti Viljanen, Pentti Irjala, Juhani Kumpulainen', null, 'Pekka Puupää and Pätkä, who return to Helsinki from an unsuccessful variety show tour, are forced into refresher training, where they are trained as frogmen. During the diving exercises, the friends encounter the mermaid Helmi, whom they help into the bathtub at home, to Justiina''s shock. The friends, who have become civilians, eventually end up on a plane bound for Suez, being cornered by UN soldiers.', 'Pekka Puupää and Pätkä, who return to Helsinki from an unsuccessful variety show tour, are forced into refresher training, where they are trained as frogmen. During the diving exercises, the friends encounter the mermaid Helmi, whom they help into the bathtub at home, to Justiina''s shock. The friends, who have become civilians, eventually end up on a plane bound for Suez, being cornered by UN soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73N34SV9VV2VUodGNAym6stVslE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76679'),
  ('906886595985955705', 'Pelé', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Michael Latham, David Tryhorn, Ben Nicholas', null, 'Pelé, Zagallo, Gilberto Gil, Benedita da Silva, Fernando Henrique Cardoso, Amarildo, Rivelino, Robert F. Kennedy', 'PG-13', 'Against the backdrop of a turbulent era in Brazil, this documentary captures Pelé''s extraordinary path from breakthrough talent to national hero. Mixing rare archival footage and exclusive interviews, this documentary celebrates the legendary Brazilian footballer who personified football as art.', 'Against the backdrop of a turbulent era in Brazil, this documentary captures Pelé''s extraordinary path from breakthrough talent to national hero. Mixing rare archival footage and exclusive interviews, this documentary celebrates the legendary Brazilian footballer who personified football as art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tX2gco2U4MlKEWwM4UkiIf1C74e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785976'),
  ('1104041489643546635', 'Pelé Forever', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Anibal Massaini Neto, Conrado Sanchez', 'Armando Nogueira', 'Pelé, Celeste Arantes, Jorge Arantes, Assíria Nascimento, Armando Nogueira, Washington Olivetto, Zoca, Carlos Alberto Torres', null, 'The life of the "King of Football" Pelé is shown through testimonials from former players, friends and important celebrities of the time. Following a chronological order, several of his goals, key moves and facts that marked his career are displayed.', 'The life of the "King of Football" Pelé is shown through testimonials from former players, friends and important celebrities of the time. Following a chronological order, several of his goals, key moves and facts that marked his career are displayed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqdh3dEGHqllqu6UDtteD7GZYkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68169'),
  ('674689830534724236', 'Pelé: Birth of a Legend', 2016, 'Drama', 'Jeff Zimbalist, Michael Zimbalist, Matthew Libatique', 'Jeff Zimbalist, Michael Zimbalist', 'Kevin de Paula, Leonardo Lima Carvalho, Seu Jorge, Milton Gonçalves, Seth Michaels, Vincent D''Onofrio, André Mattos, Mariana Nunes', 'PG', 'The life story of Brazilian football legend, Pele.', 'The life story of Brazilian football legend, Pele.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJoDgK9PUClJOlpA1xUixj8dvsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245913'),
  ('900271069800765634', 'Pelican Blood', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Katrin Gebbe, Moritz Schultheiß', 'Katrin Gebbe', 'Nina Hoss, Yana Marinova, Sebastian Rudolph, Murathan Muslu, Sophie Pfennigstorf, Dimitar Banenkin, Adelia-Constance Giovanni Ocleppo, Katerina Lipovska', null, 'Wiebke, a professional horse trainer, faces a unique challenge when she adopts Raya, a five-year-old girl, who is prone to violent outbursts because of her traumatic past.', 'Wiebke, a professional horse trainer, faces a unique challenge when she adopts Raya, a five-year-old girl, who is prone to violent outbursts because of her traumatic past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzPM5k6FfpevcwguTjn7NNxAdhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495332'),
  ('480051180530704340', 'Películas', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Tiago Resende', 'Tiago Resende', 'António Barbosa', null, 'Películas is the name of a poetry book by Luís Miguel Nava, a homosexual poet, born in Viseu, who died in Brussels and whose magnificent poetic work remains widely unknown. Drawn from the filmmaker’s family super8 film archive, and excerpts from the film Un chant d''amour, by Jean Genet, the film builds a “body” marked by memories, by various skins, by Nava''s films, by his poems and by its landscapes.', 'Películas is the name of a poetry book by Luís Miguel Nava, a homosexual poet, born in Viseu, who died in Brussels and whose magnificent poetic work remains widely unknown. Drawn from the filmmaker’s family super8 film archive, and excerpts from the film Un chant d''amour, by Jean Genet, the film builds a “body” marked by memories, by various skins, by Nava''s films, by his poems and by its landscapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3K2hrJI1t12Fo30w2Vf4GhoeNPY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779429'),
  ('815777280010799732', 'Peligro en tu mirada', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Raúl Caballero', null, 'Cassandra Sánchez Navarro, Erick Elías, Elizabeth Valdez, Mauricio Islas, Juan Martín Jáuregui, Néstor Rodulfo, Rodolfo Arias', null, 'A female photographer is coerced into spying on the affaire of a political candidate, becoming the sole witness of a crime of which he is falsely accused', 'A female photographer is coerced into spying on the affaire of a political candidate, becoming the sole witness of a crime of which he is falsely accused', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ac0l8GzNS80OLgyi9aUYNtu2ULu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:841297'),
  ('84527575835053584', 'Peligro...! Mujeres en acción', 1969, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'René Cardona Jr., Juan Manuel Herrera', 'René Cardona Jr.', 'Julio Alemán, Alma Delia Fuentes, Elizabeth Campbell, Amadee Chabot, Liza Castro, Barbara Angely, Elsa Cárdenas, Nadia Milton', null, 'A new adventure of secret agent Alex Dynamo on land, in the air, and in the treacherous swamps. Alex Dynamo goes up against the S.O.S. organization, a sinister group of beautiful girls driven by a lust for blood.', 'A new adventure of secret agent Alex Dynamo on land, in the air, and in the treacherous swamps. Alex Dynamo goes up against the S.O.S. organization, a sinister group of beautiful girls driven by a lust for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Xxe2xF1raaUdOcgTD54H4F534n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315015'),
