  ('588419845715875643', 'Penitentiary', 1979, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Jamaa Fanaka, Marty Ollstein', 'Jamaa Fanaka', 'Leon Isaac Kennedy, Thommy Pollard , Hazel Spears , Donovan Womack , Floyd ''Wildcat'' Chatman , Chuck Mitchell, Gloria Delaney, Wilbur ''Hi-Fi'' White', 'R', 'A hitchhiker named Martel Gordone gets in a fight with two bikers over a prostitute, and one of the bikers is killed. Gordone is arrested and sent to prison, where he joins the prison''s boxing team in an effort to secure an early parole and to establish his dominance over the prison''s toughest gang.', 'A hitchhiker named Martel Gordone gets in a fight with two bikers over a prostitute, and one of the bikers is killed. Gordone is arrested and sent to prison, where he joins the prison''s boxing team in an effort to secure an early parole and to establish his dominance over the prison''s toughest gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XQOTbjwaFSSEdoJlhTcwRsJxG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65448'),
  ('354785880122690612', 'Penitentiary II', 1982, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Jamaa Fanaka', 'Jamaa Fanaka', 'Leon Isaac Kennedy, Glynn Turman, Ernie Hudson, Mr. T, Peggy Blow , Sephton Moody, Donovan Womack , Malik Carter', 'R', 'An ex-con, on parole and trying to straighten his life out, decides to resume his boxing career when one of his prison enemies escapes and kills his girlfriend.', 'An ex-con, on parole and trying to straighten his life out, decides to resume his boxing career when one of his prison enemies escapes and kills his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWutEQwpVOJQjJAmPQioJJHkFaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65452'),
  ('987385681204569180', 'Penitentiary III', 1987, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Jamaa Fanaka, Marty Ollstein', 'Jamaa Fanaka', 'Leon Isaac Kennedy, Anthony Geary, Steve Antin, Rick Zumwalt, Raymond Kessler, Danny Trejo, Jim Bailey, Ric Mancini', 'R', 'A man is framed for murder and sent to prison. He is beaten and tortured, then forced to fight the prison''s worst killer, a martial-arts fighting midget called Thud.', 'A man is framed for murder and sent to prison. He is beaten and tortured, then forced to fight the prison''s worst killer, a martial-arts fighting midget called Thud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8bYskyPBLoke3ctxsfmDJ8ZsAq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72335'),
  ('945919057101503617', 'Penn & Teller Get Killed', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Arthur Penn, Jan Weincke, Tony Adler', 'Penn Jillette, Teller', 'Penn Jillette, Teller, Caitlin Clarke, David Patrick Kelly, Leonardo Cimino, Celia McGuire, Bill Randolph, John Miller', 'R', 'The "bad boys of magic" go over the edge in this mind-blowing, role-switching comedy murder mystery set in the dizzying world of Atlantic City casinos. In a TV interview, Penn mentions his idea of a fun practical joke: "I wish someone were trying to kill me. It would give focus to my life, excitement. I''d be like James Bond." Twenty million people hear him. One decides to deliver a punchline he''ll never forget. Made by people who thought Psycho was a comedy, Penn & Teller Get Killed (they also wrote the piece) features Caitlin Clarke as the femme fatale and David Patrick Kelly as the Edgar Allan Poe-esque nutcase with a new mission. Arthur Penn, known for hip masterpieces like Bonnie and Clyde, Alice''s Restaurant and Little Big Man, directs with roller-coaster pacing and subversive intelligence.', 'The "bad boys of magic" go over the edge in this mind-blowing, role-switching comedy murder mystery set in the dizzying world of Atlantic City casinos. In a TV interview, Penn mentions his idea of a fun practical joke: "I wish someone were trying to kill me. It would give focus to my life, excitement. I''d be like James Bond." Twenty million people hear him. One decides to deliver a punchline he''ll never forget. Made by people who thought Psycho was a comedy, Penn & Teller Get Killed (they also wrote the piece) features Caitlin Clarke as the femme fatale and David Patrick Kelly as the Edgar Allan Poe-esque nutcase with a new mission. Arthur Penn, known for hip masterpieces like Bonnie and Clyde, Alice''s Restaurant and Little Big Man, directs with roller-coaster pacing and subversive intelligence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UAa8AVZfNiISv3K8eKfyuzSAxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37146'),
  ('500204573882263764', 'Pennies from Heaven', 1981, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Herbert Ross, L. Andrew Stone, Emmitt-Leon O''Neill', 'Dennis Potter', 'Steve Martin, Bernadette Peters, Jessica Harper, Vernel Bagneris, John McMartin, John Karlen, Jay Garner, Robert Fitch', 'R', 'During the Great Depression, a sheet music salesman seeks to escape his dreary life through popular music and a love affair with an innocent schoolteacher.', 'During the Great Depression, a sheet music salesman seeks to escape his dreary life through popular music and a love affair with an innocent schoolteacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dlangnB2vOcviHEwWy1IRGHLtk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17450'),
  ('477109522045610166', 'Pennu Case', 2026, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Febin Sidharth, Shinoz', 'Adv. Shukkur, Febin Sidharth, Sunu A V, Ganesh Malayath, Reshmi Radhakrishnan', 'Nikhila Vimal, Hakkim Shajahan, Aju Varghese, Irshad, Ramesh Pisharody', null, 'A lighthearted tale follows someone navigating daily life''s ups and downs, blending humor with touching moments as they stumble, discover, and evolve through their experiences.', 'A lighthearted tale follows someone navigating daily life''s ups and downs, blending humor with touching moments as they stumble, discover, and evolve through their experiences.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FwBS7vxCTJhA2ufHbe7kL8HxAawd.jpg', 'plex:movie:pennu-case-2026'),
  ('255303799368912508', 'Pennum Porattum', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Rajesh Madhavan, Sabin Uralikandy, Ajay Vijayan', 'Ravi Sankar', 'Raina Radhakrishnan, Tovino Thomas, Varsha Valsan, Akshaya Vijayakumar, Shanooj Alanalloor', null, 'When a woman and her dog face public hostility, a village''s hidden tensions erupt. A stark examination of mob mentality, social judgment, and how communities can turn cruel when seeking to punish perceived wrongs.', 'When a woman and her dog face public hostility, a village''s hidden tensions erupt. A stark examination of mob mentality, social judgment, and how communities can turn cruel when seeking to punish perceived wrongs.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fm9WNMd4pQFOB3l6GudBw2YwVsN9.jpg', 'plex:movie:pennum-porattum-2026'),
  ('1127990108025255413', 'Penny Dreadful', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Richard Brandes, Joplin Wu', 'Richard Brandes, Diane Doniol-Valcroze, Arthur K. Flam', 'Rachel Miner, Mimi Rogers, Chad Todhunter, Mickey Jones, Liz Davies, Michael Berryman, Lucy Rogers-Ciaffa, Elyse Mirto', 'R', 'Young Penny goes on a retreat with her psychologist; the intention is to help her overcome her phobia, an intense fear of cars. Unexpected events find her in a nightmarish situation where her worst fears come true.', 'Young Penny goes on a retreat with her psychologist; the intention is to help her overcome her phobia, an intense fear of cars. Unexpected events find her in a nightmarish situation where her worst fears come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHAUNz0qg8wUM9UFiT7rq2wiu50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15543'),
  ('310246311108721969', 'Penny Gold', 1973, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jack Cardiff, Ken Hodges', 'David D. Osborn, Liz Charles-Williams', 'James Booth, Francesca Annis, Nicky Henson, Joss Ackland, Richard Heffer, Sue Lloyd, Joseph O''Conor, Una Stubbs', null, 'While investigating a murder case, a detective stumbles upon a rare-stamp swindle involving the victim''s twin sister.', 'While investigating a murder case, a detective stumbles upon a rare-stamp swindle involving the victim''s twin sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9Cyte4VlrWnlAmzeDNjMS1nvav.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205082'),
  ('216419655662258785', 'Penny Paradise', 1938, 'Comedy', 'Gordon Dines, Basil Dearden, Ronald Neame', 'Thomas Browne, Thomas Thompson, Walter Meade', 'Edmund Gwenn, Betty Driver, Jimmy O''Dea, Ethel Coleridge, Maire O''Neill, Jack Livesey, Syd Crossley, James Harcourt', null, 'A Liverpool tug boat captain finds he''s won a fortune on the penny pools and it changes his life. However, after giving up his job and throwing a large expensive party, he discovers that he may not really have won after all.', 'A Liverpool tug boat captain finds he''s won a fortune on the penny pools and it changes his life. However, after giving up his job and throwing a large expensive party, he discovers that he may not really have won after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wO2opl1mDMHs87vbuxQf3ZLxA1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212699'),
  ('104171996332939539', 'Penny Pincher!', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Laurent Dailland, Fred Cavayé', 'Laurent Turner, Nicolas Cuche', 'Dany Boon, Laurence Arné, Noémie Schmidt, Patrick Ridremont, Karina Marimon, Nicolas Lumbreras, Christophe Canard, Christophe Favre', null, 'François Gautier is stingy! Saving puts the joy, it causes pay sweats. His life is set for the sole purpose of never spend anything. A life that will switch in one day: he falls in love and discovers he has a daughter he did not know existed. Forced to lie in order to hide his terrible default, this will be the beginning for François problems. Because lie can sometimes be expensive. Very expensive…', 'François Gautier is stingy! Saving puts the joy, it causes pay sweats. His life is set for the sole purpose of never spend anything. A life that will switch in one day: he falls in love and discovers he has a daughter he did not know existed. Forced to lie in order to hide his terrible default, this will be the beginning for François problems. Because lie can sometimes be expensive. Very expensive…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axdQyS20MtoBnXLpzJhn3g6etqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382511'),
  ('829938942468033355', 'Penny Pinchers', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kim Jung-hwan, Nam Dong-hyub', 'Kim Jung-hwan', 'Song Joong-ki, Han Ye-seul, Lee Sang-yeob, Shin So-yul, Ra Mi-ran, Lee Jae-won, Kim Ji-na, Han Sa-myeong', null, 'Ji-woong is a loser who can''t find a job so he lies to his mother for money, but one day she abruptly cuts him off and he becomes homeless. That same day, salvation arrives in the form of Hong-sil who''s extremely stingy. Her hobby is visiting the bank to make savings deposits, and her specialty is selling empty glass bottles and old newspapers for cash.', 'Ji-woong is a loser who can''t find a job so he lies to his mother for money, but one day she abruptly cuts him off and he becomes homeless. That same day, salvation arrives in the form of Hong-sil who''s extremely stingy. Her hobby is visiting the bank to make savings deposits, and her specialty is selling empty glass bottles and old newspapers for cash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvF0c1S2JNUQrog2ZzDyhLwGgpJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92038'),
  ('497754026248040099', 'Penny Serenade', 1941, 'Drama, Romance', 'Morris Stoloff, Gene Anderson, George Stevens', 'Morrie Ryskind', 'Cary Grant, Irene Dunne, Beulah Bondi, Edgar Buchanan, Ann Doran, Eva Lee Kuney, Leonard Willey, Wallis Clark', 'NR', 'Julie and Roger are a love-struck married couple who desperately want to have a child. Tragedy after tragedy gets in their way, as the two attempt to rise above their troubles and fulfill their dreams of parenthood.', 'Julie and Roger are a love-struck married couple who desperately want to have a child. Tragedy after tragedy gets in their way, as the two attempt to rise above their troubles and fulfill their dreams of parenthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MC1fE5FSEIP9xf0N2VD68zRKv2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43795'),
  ('1060160910638412990', 'Penny Wisdom', 1937, 'Comedy', 'David Miller, William V. Skall', 'Robert Lees, Frederic I. Rinaldo', 'Pete Smith, Prudence Penny, Harold Minjir, Gertrude Short, William Worthington', 'NR', 'A Pete Smith Specialty short on saving an important dinner after the household''s cook suddenly quits.', 'A Pete Smith Specialty short on saving an important dinner after the household''s cook suddenly quits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wpqonMHzh5TxridHAwPMNC0QOy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233708'),
  ('1152905561475702356', 'Pennywise: The Story of ‘It’', 2021, 'Documentary, Horror', 'John Campopiano, Chris Griffiths', 'Gary Smart, John Campopiano', 'Tim Curry, Seth Green, Richard Thomas, Emily Perkins, Dennis Christopher, Tim Reid, Michael Cole, Brandon Crane', null, 'Thirty-plus years after its release, the popular two-part miniseries "It" and its infamous villain Pennywise live on in the minds of horror fans around the world. This documentary captures not only the buzz the "It" saga generated in 1990 but also the lasting impact it has had on an entire generation and the horror genre at large. Several years in the making, the film features exclusive interviews with many of the cult classic''s key players, from cast members Richard Thomas, Seth Green, and Tim Curry, who portrayed the notorious monster clown Pennywise, to director Tommy Lee Wallace and special effects makeup artist Bart Mixon. The documentary also boasts a wealth of archival material and never-before-seen footage.', 'Thirty-plus years after its release, the popular two-part miniseries "It" and its infamous villain Pennywise live on in the minds of horror fans around the world. This documentary captures not only the buzz the "It" saga generated in 1990 but also the lasting impact it has had on an entire generation and the horror genre at large. Several years in the making, the film features exclusive interviews with many of the cult classic''s key players, from cast members Richard Thomas, Seth Green, and Tim Curry, who portrayed the notorious monster clown Pennywise, to director Tommy Lee Wallace and special effects makeup artist Bart Mixon. The documentary also boasts a wealth of archival material and never-before-seen footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6LfGKuA19tt0ckc8UN91rAmJF8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512356'),
  ('587537550104037520', 'Penoza: The Final Chapter', 2019, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Willem Helwig, Susanne Groen, Roxanne Stam', 'Diederik Van Rooijen', 'Monic Hendrickx, Niels Gomperts, Sigrid ten Napel, Stijn Taverne, Olga Zuiderhoek, Raymond Thiry, Loek Peters, Hajo Bruins', null, 'The Black Widow is not dead ... Drug Queen Carmen van Walraven is hiding in Canada and leads an anonymous life there. One evening a colleague is harassed and Carmen helps her. In self-defense, she kills the perpetrator, is arrested and extradited to the Netherlands. While her children are in shock that their mother is still alive, there are also some people who still have to settle something with Carmen. Everyone is again dragged into an emotional rollercoaster. Carmen will now have deal with her past to save her family.', 'The Black Widow is not dead ... Drug Queen Carmen van Walraven is hiding in Canada and leads an anonymous life there. One evening a colleague is harassed and Carmen helps her. In self-defense, she kills the perpetrator, is arrested and extradited to the Netherlands. While her children are in shock that their mother is still alive, there are also some people who still have to settle something with Carmen. Everyone is again dragged into an emotional rollercoaster. Carmen will now have deal with her past to save her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqRXm3OXSVWuGp3bl8YO4szmos3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551115'),
  ('1066912198143520303', 'Pensione Edelweiss', 1959, 'Thriller', 'Ottorino Franco Bertolini, Víctor Merenda', 'Frédéric Dard, André Maurois', 'Henri Vidal, Dawn Addams, Lino Ventura, Howard Vernon, Marco Guglielmi, John Kitzmiller, Lauretta Masiero, Giacomo Furia', null, 'A man who was injured in an accident has a visitor in his hospital. The visitor suggests a strange deal.', 'A man who was injured in an accident has a visitor in his hospital. The visitor suggests a strange deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjXAbruqPSSeclaGyiAXGELwlph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79373'),
  ('111638029712663194', 'Pent-House Mouse', 1963, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Tom is living the life of luxury, high atop a fancy apartment building. Jerry is starving way down below when he spots a lunchbox on a girder at a construction site. Jerry goes in, the girder goes up, and the lunchbox falls off, landing on Tom, and the chase is on.', 'Tom is living the life of luxury, high atop a fancy apartment building. Jerry is starving way down below when he spots a lunchbox on a girder at a construction site. Jerry goes in, the girder goes up, and the lunchbox falls off, landing on Tom, and the chase is on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljpUopFHo5oVvsaLnWrTUDlWDM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148687'),
  ('274048758193305677', 'Pentathlon', 1994, 'Action, Thriller', 'Bruce Malmuth, Buddy Joe Hooker, Mikhail Suslov', 'Gary T. McDonald, William Stadiem, Gary DeVore', 'Dolph Lundgren, David Soul, Renée Coleman, Roger E. Mosley, Evan James Malmuth, David Drummond, Daniel Riordan, Philip Bruns', null, 'When East German Eric Brogar wins a gold medal in the pentathlon, he escapes to freedom in the west with the help of a beautiful American athlete. But his demanding coach, Heinrich Mueller vows revenge and Eric''s best friend and his father pay the ultimate price for his freedom when they are killed by the Secret Police. In Los Angeles, Eric starts to train for the gold again. But when Mueller comes to America, Eric must win the most deadly game of all… the fight for his life.', 'When East German Eric Brogar wins a gold medal in the pentathlon, he escapes to freedom in the west with the help of a beautiful American athlete. But his demanding coach, Heinrich Mueller vows revenge and Eric''s best friend and his father pay the ultimate price for his freedom when they are killed by the Secret Police. In Los Angeles, Eric starts to train for the gold again. But when Mueller comes to America, Eric must win the most deadly game of all… the fight for his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kD5SvLTd1MSvuwPrshoIaGIDlgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30526'),
  ('644615889145073320', 'Penthouse', 1933, 'Crime, Mystery', 'W.S. Van Dyke, Harold Rosson, Lucien N. Andriot', 'Frances Goodrich, Albert Hackett', 'Warner Baxter, Myrna Loy, Charles Butterworth, Mae Clarke, Phillips Holmes, C. Henry Gordon, Martha Sleeper, Nat Pendleton', 'NR', 'Gertie Waxted knows how notorious gangster Jim Crelliman runs his rackets, because she''s long been under the hoodlum''s thumb. She''s secretly helping lawyer Jackson Durant in a snoop job aimed at pinning a murder on the thug. Her life will be in peril when that secret gets out.', 'Gertie Waxted knows how notorious gangster Jim Crelliman runs his rackets, because she''s long been under the hoodlum''s thumb. She''s secretly helping lawyer Jackson Durant in a snoop job aimed at pinning a murder on the thug. Her life will be in peril when that secret gets out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUJCt9wBvsspffPacWFo66F8VoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34977'),
  ('120869783545863021', 'Penthouse North', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Alexandre Champagne, Joseph Ruben, Chris Seager', 'David Loughery', 'Michelle Monaghan, Michael Keaton, Barry Sloane, Andrew W. Walker, Kaniehtiio Horn, Trevor Hayes, Phillip Jarrett, Timothy Paul Coderre', 'R', 'After losing her sight while working as a photojournalist in Afghanistan, Sara Frost, now reclusive, lives quietly in a New York penthouse with her boyfriend, until a smooth but sadistic criminal looking for a hidden fortune enters her life.', 'After losing her sight while working as a photojournalist in Afghanistan, Sara Frost, now reclusive, lives quietly in a New York penthouse with her boyfriend, until a smooth but sadistic criminal looking for a hidden fortune enters her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgRYyBsi8v1OOXkvTZQaDu3keIY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199591'),
  ('639437206748417411', 'Pentimento', 1979, 'Drama, Horror', 'Frans Zwartjes, Frans Zwartjes', 'Frans Zwartjes', 'Helen Hedy, Moniek Toebosch, Trix Zwartjes, Ronald Beer, Koos Fasel, Marian Smit, Armand Perrenet, Babeth', null, 'In a monumental building a group of scientists submit women to obscure experiments in which sexuality and cruelty constantly merge into one another. "Pentimento" is an art-historical term for a hidden image underneath the actual image giving an indication of how the latter evolved to its current state.', 'In a monumental building a group of scientists submit women to obscure experiments in which sexuality and cruelty constantly merge into one another. "Pentimento" is an art-historical term for a hidden image underneath the actual image giving an indication of how the latter evolved to its current state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f03Jl8ITjIcLatpqpiBZWnUNB3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152943'),
  ('428834495485252937', 'Penumbra', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ramiro García Bogliano, Adrián García Bogliano, Ernesto Herrera', 'Ramiro García Bogliano, Adrián García Bogliano', 'Cristina Brondo, Camila Bordonaba, Berta Muñiz, Arnaldo André, Mirella Pascual, Victoria Witemburg, Gustavo Garzón, Hernán Penner', null, 'A woman hesitantly rents an apartment to an eerie man who she soon realizes has a part in the solar eclipse that is taking place.', 'A woman hesitantly rents an apartment to an eerie man who she soon realizes has a part in the solar eclipse that is taking place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBIiSL5tGKH1gXcYLpo24V7b4Ou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82999'),
  ('112770453872500653', 'Peony Pavilion', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yonfan, Henry Chung Yau-Tim', 'Yonfan', 'Joey Wong, Rie Miyazawa, Daniel Wu, Brigitte Lin, Yonfan', null, 'In 1930s Suzhou, the fifth wife of an opium-addicted aristocrat, her husband''s female cousin, and a handsome instructor develop an intense relationship.', 'In 1930s Suzhou, the fifth wife of an opium-addicted aristocrat, her husband''s female cousin, and a handsome instructor develop an intense relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vp4GgM9wJKaTvzvSzD4WKPMla0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49677'),
  ('712756714600638264', 'People : Jet Set 2', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Fabien Onteniente, Josep M. Civit', 'Fabien Onteniente', 'Rupert Everett, José Garcia, Patrice Cols, Élie Semoun, Ornella Muti, Lambert Wilson, Jean-Claude Brialy, Rossy de Palma', null, 'John-John is the best party promoter in Ibiza. He''s responsible for the wildest parties ever. A party fixed by John-John is bound to be a success, and everyone will queue to get on the guest list. The former party prince among the jet setters in Paris, Charles de Poulignac, is therefore in no doubt about where he should go in order to revenge his former clients. He flies to Ibiza, where he hopes to make an alliance with John-John, and put an end to life as persona non grata in Paris, and again take his place as the party prince of Paris. Written by HardHouseClubber', 'John-John is the best party promoter in Ibiza. He''s responsible for the wildest parties ever. A party fixed by John-John is bound to be a success, and everyone will queue to get on the guest list. The former party prince among the jet setters in Paris, Charles de Poulignac, is therefore in no doubt about where he should go in order to revenge his former clients. He flies to Ibiza, where he hopes to make an alliance with John-John, and put an end to life as persona non grata in Paris, and again take his place as the party prince of Paris. Written by HardHouseClubber', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LJD2p9uDogRYvleolC750Kg9l5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71183'),
  ('102502932787499629', 'People Are Bunny', 1959, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Daws Butler', 'NR', 'Daffy Duck needs to get Bugs Bunny into QTTV''s studio ASAP in order to win the thousand dollar prize.', 'Daffy Duck needs to get Bugs Bunny into QTTV''s studio ASAP in order to win the thousand dollar prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39y1eKKqojQ8wDlK880dWsPJ5cz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45251'),
