  ('339164823263457574', 'People in Luck', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Jean Girault, Philippe de Broca, Jack Pinoteau', 'Jacques Vilfrid, Jean Girault, Philippe de Broca', 'Mireille Darc, Guy Tréjan, Louis de Funès, Noël Roquevert, François Périer, Francis Blanche, Yvonne Clech, Claudine Coster', null, 'A light French comedy of 5 segments.', 'A light French comedy of 5 segments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKpNEFiCSdDugOMD2rYfRr8yQWM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63961'),
  ('472764725538165577', 'People in Places', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Juan Cavestany, Juan Cavestany', 'Miguel Esteban, Nacho Marraco', 'David Luque, Diego Martín, Eulalia Ramón, Jorge Cabrera, Raquel Guerrero, Adriana Ugarte, Alberto San Juan, Alicia Rubio', null, 'A fragmented view of contemporary Spain, drawing conclusions about the persistence of the human condition, strangeness, and the chaos within relationships.', 'A fragmented view of contemporary Spain, drawing conclusions about the persistence of the human condition, strangeness, and the chaos within relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tR4miHd9pwXBt6iyTP3rWv0qEvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212836'),
  ('162077497582298128', 'People in Swimsuits Aren''t (Necessarily) Shallow', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Eric Assous', 'Eric Assous', 'Isabelle Gélinas, Agnès Soral, Gad Elmaleh, Serge Hazanavicius, Véronique Boulanger, Sandrine Le Berre, Vanessa Gravina, Maher Kamoun', null, 'A week on St-Martin with vacationing Parisians. Camille surprises her lover Philippe, who''s with his wife and children. Lonely Laurette, a secretary, hopes to meet a man. Aziz brings his enthusiastic brother Rafik because his boss had two tickets he couldn''t use. Lovers Pauline and the pregnant, cranky Anita find their vacation complicated by an ex-lover of Pauline''s. The playboy Jimmy is the hotel M.C., and Carla, free-spirited and sensual, coaches Laurette in the ways of seduction. She is hot and cold to these wiles, alternately attracting and putting off Aziz, hoping Jimmy will try to seduce her, and afraid he might. By week''s end, with the help of Camille''s diary, we''ll know the outcomes.', 'A week on St-Martin with vacationing Parisians. Camille surprises her lover Philippe, who''s with his wife and children. Lonely Laurette, a secretary, hopes to meet a man. Aziz brings his enthusiastic brother Rafik because his boss had two tickets he couldn''t use. Lovers Pauline and the pregnant, cranky Anita find their vacation complicated by an ex-lover of Pauline''s. The playboy Jimmy is the hotel M.C., and Carla, free-spirited and sensual, coaches Laurette in the ways of seduction. She is hot and cold to these wiles, alternately attracting and putting off Aziz, hoping Jimmy will try to seduce her, and afraid he might. By week''s end, with the help of Camille''s diary, we''ll know the outcomes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pvW8H92BTJt5SpABVhwwT2MViv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70946'),
  ('290063543308358405', 'People in the Summer Night', 1948, 'Drama', 'Valentin Vaala, Eino Heino', 'Lea Joutseno, Usko Kemppi, Valentin Vaala', 'Eila Pehkonen, Martti Katajisto, Emma Väänänen, Eero Roine, Matti Oravisto, Toivo Hämeranta, Tyyne Haarla, Maija Nuutinen', null, 'A story set over one night in a small rural community we watch various relationships and actions among local people; these include birth, death, and conflicts fuelled by alcohol. The fates of various characters become interlaced over a long and light-filled summer night in the Finnish countryside. Lumberjacks, a deer-eyed young man Nokia, a family of poor farmers, a young girl and her lover. New life is born, old life dies, man is slain in his prime, and his widow continues her life.', 'A story set over one night in a small rural community we watch various relationships and actions among local people; these include birth, death, and conflicts fuelled by alcohol. The fates of various characters become interlaced over a long and light-filled summer night in the Finnish countryside. Lumberjacks, a deer-eyed young man Nokia, a family of poor farmers, a young girl and her lover. New life is born, old life dies, man is slain in his prime, and his widow continues her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cD50mv2fyOftm794fvv8b3u1RpD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260606'),
  ('427016010656082727', 'People Just Do Nothing: Big in Japan', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Matthew Wicks, Jack Clough', 'Allan Mustafa, Steve Stamp', 'Asim Chaudhry, Allan Mustafa, Hugo Chegwin, Steve Stamp, Daniel Sylvester Woolford, Lily Brazier, George Keywood, Ayumi Ito', null, 'Since the end of their pirate radio station, life has been quiet for the Kurupt FM boys, but everything is about to change. News reaches them that one of their songs has been used on a popular game show in Japan. They''ve made it. Their music is reaching hundreds of thousands of people. It''s finally time for them to enjoy the fame and fortune that they''ve always known they deserved. Chabuddy G steps excitedly back into his management role as Grindah, Beats, Steves and Decoy begin their journey to international stardom - but is Japan really ready for Kurupt FM?', 'Since the end of their pirate radio station, life has been quiet for the Kurupt FM boys, but everything is about to change. News reaches them that one of their songs has been used on a popular game show in Japan. They''ve made it. Their music is reaching hundreds of thousands of people. It''s finally time for them to enjoy the fame and fortune that they''ve always known they deserved. Chabuddy G steps excitedly back into his management role as Grindah, Beats, Steves and Decoy begin their journey to international stardom - but is Japan really ready for Kurupt FM?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2wft3qQX1fCqPTUdujwxhj9S23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685169'),
  ('1150885508224836435', 'People Like Us', 2012, 'Drama', 'Alex Kurtzman, Salvatore Totino', 'Jody Lambert, Roberto Orci, Alex Kurtzman', 'Chris Pine, Elizabeth Banks, Olivia Wilde, Michelle Pfeiffer, Mark Duplass, Devin Brochu, Barbara Eve Harris, Dean Chekvala', 'PG-13', 'After flying home to L.A. for the funeral of his estranged record-producer father, a struggling man discovers that the will stipulates that he must deliver $150,000 in cash to a 30-year-old alcoholic sister he never knew existed, and her troubled 12-year-old son.', 'After flying home to L.A. for the funeral of his estranged record-producer father, a struggling man discovers that the will stipulates that he must deliver $150,000 in cash to a 30-year-old alcoholic sister he never knew existed, and her troubled 12-year-old son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXfIwSJogLjQdmX9Qzhkeuv3HQI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98548'),
  ('234249556831944599', 'People of No Importance', 1956, 'Drama', 'Henri Verneuil, Louis Page', 'François Boyer, Henri Verneuil', 'Jean Gabin, Françoise Arnoul, Pierre Mondy, Yvette Etiévant, Dany Carrel, Nane Germon, André Dalibert, Pierre Fromont', null, 'During a stay at a roadside inn, long-distance lorry driver Jean Viard meets a young woman Clothilde who works there. Their friendship soon develops into a passionate love affair, even though Jean is already married and is old enough to be Clothilde’s father. Things take a turn for the worse when Jean loses his job and his wife finds out about his affair. But Clothilde’s predicament is even more distressing...', 'During a stay at a roadside inn, long-distance lorry driver Jean Viard meets a young woman Clothilde who works there. Their friendship soon develops into a passionate love affair, even though Jean is already married and is old enough to be Clothilde’s father. Things take a turn for the worse when Jean loses his job and his wife finds out about his affair. But Clothilde’s predicament is even more distressing...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7id6puGPOog2S4beWR4EdNwIzXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59496'),
  ('1018682331144345056', 'People of Rome', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Ettore Scola, Franco Di Giacomo, Paola Scola', 'Ettore Scola, Paola Scola, Silvia Scola', 'Giorgio Colangeli, Antonello Fassari, Fabio Ferrari, Fiorenzo Fiorentini, Arnoldo Foà, Sabrina Impacciatore, Salvatore Marino, Valerio Mastandrea', null, 'Rome 2003, the camera follows citizens of Rome. Night, in a flat, a woman prepares her husband''s lunch. The man takes a bus, but the camera follow another bus ... a woman cleans the mayor''s office... A man interviews passengers on a bus about immigration...... the owner of a bar is racist person... a survivor woman of Holocaust remembers the Ghetto deportation... deportation that is filmed by a director... Stefania Sandrelli plays with her grand daughter in a park a man tries to seduce the bus driver...gay night life... sunrise at Piazza Navona, a noble man and a tramp are sitting together. - - - Gente di Roma is a 2003 Italian comedy mockumentary film directed by Ettore Scola. It is close to Federico Fellini''s Roma. The film is dedicated to Alberto Sordi, who Scola wanted to close the film, as a noble man, but he could not film him because he died. Scola''s daughters helped to co-write the script. (From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia)', 'Rome 2003, the camera follows citizens of Rome. Night, in a flat, a woman prepares her husband''s lunch. The man takes a bus, but the camera follow another bus ... a woman cleans the mayor''s office... A man interviews passengers on a bus about immigration...... the owner of a bar is racist person... a survivor woman of Holocaust remembers the Ghetto deportation... deportation that is filmed by a director... Stefania Sandrelli plays with her grand daughter in a park a man tries to seduce the bus driver...gay night life... sunrise at Piazza Navona, a noble man and a tramp are sitting together. - - - Gente di Roma is a 2003 Italian comedy mockumentary film directed by Ettore Scola. It is close to Federico Fellini''s Roma. The film is dedicated to Alberto Sordi, who Scola wanted to close the film, as a noble man, but he could not film him because he died. Scola''s daughters helped to co-write the script. (From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLziEgc6viePMk9swenNZUbMsA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58089'),
  ('641398523477753419', 'People of the Mountains', 1942, 'Drama', 'István Szőts, Ferenc Fekete', 'István Szőts', 'János Görbe, Alice Szellay, Péterke Ferency, József Bihari, Lajos Gárday, Oszkár Borovszky, Lenke Egyed, Imre Toronyi', null, 'A simple, religious Hungarian woodcutter lives with his wife and boy child with a small community of squatters among the peaceful mountains of Transylvania until a lumber company claims their land and forces them all to become company workers or else leave the land. This 1942 Hungarian film takes a detailed and unflinching look at the hardships of mountain living, and the realistic approach proved influential to the Neorealist movement in Italian cinema. Hungarian master director Istvan Szots won the Biennale Cup at the Venice Film Festival for his auspicious debut, but the film was banned by the Nazis as "too Catholic" and not publicly exhibited until after World War II.', 'A simple, religious Hungarian woodcutter lives with his wife and boy child with a small community of squatters among the peaceful mountains of Transylvania until a lumber company claims their land and forces them all to become company workers or else leave the land. This 1942 Hungarian film takes a detailed and unflinching look at the hardships of mountain living, and the realistic approach proved influential to the Neorealist movement in Italian cinema. Hungarian master director Istvan Szots won the Biennale Cup at the Venice Film Festival for his auspicious debut, but the film was banned by the Nazis as "too Catholic" and not publicly exhibited until after World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGeuP6cGDjSccksLHFrb2ugdMb3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172295'),
  ('741034728801212411', 'People of the Po Valley', 1947, 'Documentary', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Piero Portalupi', 'Michelangelo Antonioni', 'Rina Morelli', null, 'A documentary short detailing the life of Italians living on the Po River in the 1940s.', 'A documentary short detailing the life of Italians living on the Po River in the 1940s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kEz16wQQtyRnf4vhEfgCRc7tKO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159220'),
  ('358154719385364993', 'People on Sunday', 1930, 'Drama', 'Robert Siodmak, Edgar G. Ulmer, Eugen Schüfftan', 'Billy Wilder', 'Erwin Splettstößer, Brigitte Borchert, Wolfgang von Waltershausen, Christl Ehlers, Annie Schreyer, Kurt Gerron, Valeska Gert, Heinrich Gretler', null, 'A semi-documentary experimental 1930 German silent film created by amateurs with a small budget. With authentic scenes of the metropolis city of Berlin, it''s the first film from the later famous screenwriters/directors Billy Wilder and Fred Zinnemann.', 'A semi-documentary experimental 1930 German silent film created by amateurs with a small budget. With authentic scenes of the metropolis city of Berlin, it''s the first film from the later famous screenwriters/directors Billy Wilder and Fred Zinnemann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWIkCmYaRDlA78WMIfRUlURuLCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347'),
  ('33281674031503564', 'People We Meet on Vacation', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Brett Haley, Rob Givens, Rod Smith', 'Yulin Kuang, Amos Vernon, Nunzio Randazzo', 'Emily Bader, Tom Blyth, Sarah Catherine Hook, Jameela Jamil, Miles Heizer, Tommy Do, Lucien Laviscount, Alan Ruck', 'PG-13', 'Poppy''s a free spirit. Alex loves a plan. After years of summer vacations, these polar-opposite pals wonder if they could be a perfect romantic match.', 'Poppy''s a free spirit. Alex loves a plan. After years of summer vacations, these polar-opposite pals wonder if they could be a perfect romantic match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peG6482ALJQ9Tbvv2P38BquVk0f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034716'),
  ('560082507773376738', 'People Will Talk', 1951, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Milton Krasner', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz', 'Cary Grant, Jeanne Crain, Finlay Currie, Hume Cronyn, Walter Slezak, Sidney Blackmer, Basil Ruysdael, Katherine Locke', 'NR', 'A successful, unorthodox doctor befriends a young woman with suicidal ideations due to her pregnancy by her ex, a military reservist killed in action.', 'A successful, unorthodox doctor befriends a young woman with suicidal ideations due to her pregnancy by her ex, a military reservist killed in action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7wdYUwie8kBsEojZCF5gbTfVii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23152'),
  ('905345525160400708', 'People, Places, Things', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Jim Strouse, Chris Teague', 'Jim Strouse', 'Jemaine Clement, Regina Hall, Stephanie Allynne, Jessica Williams, Michael Chernus, Aundrea Gadsby, Gia Gadsby, Matthew Maher', 'R', 'Will Henry is a newly single graphic novelist balancing being a parent to his young twin daughters and teaching a classroom full of college students, all the while trying to navigate the rich complexities of new love and letting go of the woman who left him.', 'Will Henry is a newly single graphic novelist balancing being a parent to his young twin daughters and teaching a classroom full of college students, all the while trying to navigate the rich complexities of new love and letting go of the woman who left him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Tt4phUBTF2Uhdth5ZW9KdYV87Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308027'),
  ('397377472829046807', 'People''s Hero', 1987, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Derek Yee, Wilson Chan Pui-Ka', 'Derek Yee, Keith Lee Pak-Ling, Kwan Yiu-Wing', 'Ti Lung, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Elaine Jin Yan-Ling, Paul Chun Pui, Ronald Wong, Bowie Lam Bo-Yee, Benz Kong To-Hoi', null, 'Ex-gangster Sonny Koo finds himself in the middle of a bank holdup by two inexperienced crooks. The robbery goes awry, but before order can be restored, Sonny assumes control. He proceeds to turn the hostage situation to his advantage, and uses the bank''s customers and personnel as leverage to free his girlfriend from prison. On the outside, sympathetic cop Captain Chan debates with his captain over how to handle the situation.', 'Ex-gangster Sonny Koo finds himself in the middle of a bank holdup by two inexperienced crooks. The robbery goes awry, but before order can be restored, Sonny assumes control. He proceeds to turn the hostage situation to his advantage, and uses the bank''s customers and personnel as leverage to free his girlfriend from prison. On the outside, sympathetic cop Captain Chan debates with his captain over how to handle the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGmxvXdyIDACEZO5MjIxh2Tk5IU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181633'),
  ('614154717617642595', 'Pepe', 1960, 'Comedy, Music', 'George Sidney, Joseph MacDonald, David Silver', 'Dorothy Kingsley, Claude Binyon', 'Cantinflas, Dan Dailey, Shirley Jones, Carlos Montalbán, Vicki Trickett, Matt Mattox, Hank Henry, Suzanne Lloyd', 'NR', 'Mario "Cantinflas" Moreno is a hired hand, Pepe, employed on a ranch. A boozing Hollywood director buys a white stallion that belongs to Pepe''s boss. Pepe, determined to get the horse back (as he considers it his family), decides to take off to Hollywood. There he meets film stars including Jimmy Durante, Frank Sinatra, Zsa Zsa Gabór, Bing Crosby, Maurice Chevalier and Jack Lemmon in drag as Daphne from Some Like It Hot. He is also surprised by things that were new in America at the time, such as automatic swinging doors. When he finally reaches the man who bought the horse, he is led to believe there is no hope of getting it back. However, the last scene shows both him and the stallion back at the ranch with several foals.', 'Mario "Cantinflas" Moreno is a hired hand, Pepe, employed on a ranch. A boozing Hollywood director buys a white stallion that belongs to Pepe''s boss. Pepe, determined to get the horse back (as he considers it his family), decides to take off to Hollywood. There he meets film stars including Jimmy Durante, Frank Sinatra, Zsa Zsa Gabór, Bing Crosby, Maurice Chevalier and Jack Lemmon in drag as Daphne from Some Like It Hot. He is also surprised by things that were new in America at the time, such as automatic swinging doors. When he finally reaches the man who bought the horse, he is led to believe there is no hope of getting it back. However, the last scene shows both him and the stallion back at the ranch with several foals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arRzNskTTaIoLTv9yNz5OUktodP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82792'),
  ('333403695374472520', 'Pepe El Toro', 1953, 'Drama', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Ignacio Torres, Antonio Guerrero Tello', 'Carlos Orellana, Ismael Rodríguez', 'Pedro Infante, Evita Muñoz ''Chachita'', Amanda del Llano, Irma Dorantes, Fernando Soto, Freddy Fernández ''El Pichi'', Juan Orraca, Armando Velasco', null, 'The simple life and the values ​​of loyalty and solidarity of the poor people in the environment of professional boxing, is the plot of this film, where Pepe el Toro shows the effort and tragedies that are experienced in this profession.', 'The simple life and the values ​​of loyalty and solidarity of the poor people in the environment of professional boxing, is the plot of this film, where Pepe el Toro shows the effort and tragedies that are experienced in this profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Vsqen1KolgeTIKzdMzffHJo9oZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30324'),
  ('100133181028776064', 'Pépé le Moko', 1937, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Julien Duvivier, Jules Kruger, Marc Fossard', 'Henri La Barthe, Julien Duvivier', 'Jean Gabin, Mireille Balin, Gabriel Gabrio, Lucas Gridoux, Gilbert Gil, Line Noro, Saturnin Fabre, Fernand Charpin', null, 'Pépé le Moko, one of France''s most wanted criminals, hides out in the Casbah section of Algiers. He knows police will be waiting for him if he tries to leave the city. When Pépé meets Gaby, a gorgeous woman from Paris who is lost in the Casbah, he falls for her.', 'Pépé le Moko, one of France''s most wanted criminals, hides out in the Casbah section of Algiers. He knows police will be waiting for him if he tries to leave the city. When Pépé meets Gaby, a gorgeous woman from Paris who is lost in the Casbah, he falls for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6FTSnCSBVJVPa7M1LuVroLN0ag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26252'),
  ('212774782075153304', 'Pepe, der Paukerschreck', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Harald Reinl, Franz Xaver Lederle', 'Franz Seitz Junior', 'Hansi Kraus, Uschi Glas, Hannelore Elsner, Theo Lingen, Gustav Knuth, Hans Clarin, Ruth Stephan, Rudolf Schündler', null, 'Mommsen Gymnasium director Taft secretly places his nephew as a spy with the difficult class of Pepe Nietnagel. During the celebration for the 100th anniversary, a simulated fire forces the school to shut down for a week. The director''s attempt to get a tough teacher assigned by the department of education results in the exact opposite because of Nietnagel''s intervention.', 'Mommsen Gymnasium director Taft secretly places his nephew as a spy with the difficult class of Pepe Nietnagel. During the celebration for the 100th anniversary, a simulated fire forces the school to shut down for a week. The director''s attempt to get a tough teacher assigned by the department of education results in the exact opposite because of Nietnagel''s intervention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbvrkQySwv5ZOu6ZUyGShof7ZWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11094'),
  ('428672025450718046', 'Pepi, Luci, Bom', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pedro Almodóvar, Paco Femenía, Miguel Ángel Pérez Campos', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Carmen Maura, Eva Siva, Alaska, Félix Rotaeta, Concha Grégori, Kiti Mánver, Cecilia Roth, Fabio McNamara', 'NR', 'After a young heiress is assaulted by a policeman, she seeks revenge by befriending the policeman’s mousy wife and introducing her to her circle of outrageous punk friends.', 'After a young heiress is assaulted by a policeman, she seeks revenge by befriending the policeman’s mousy wife and introducing her to her circle of outrageous punk friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xL72JwMDJLGZBUtXgjx7eERJ8nj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4499'),
  ('120301089170713690', 'Peppermint', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Costas Kapakas, Yorgos Kyriakos, Giannis Daskalothanasis', 'Costas Kapakas', 'Georges Corraface, Giorgos Gerontidakis, Markella Pappa, Anny Loulou, Alexandros Mylonas, Tasos Palatzidis, Nikoletta Vlavianou, Zoi Voudouri', null, 'With the sweet taste of love''s first kiss in his mouth, an engineer takes a trip down memory lane after receiving an invitation from an old friend. Thirty years after that innocent peck on the lips, fate reunites two estranged soulmates.', 'With the sweet taste of love''s first kiss in his mouth, an engineer takes a trip down memory lane after receiving an invitation from an old friend. Thirty years after that innocent peck on the lips, fate reunites two estranged soulmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpkpxJ2vheXYiHPnhQzwkWcWVo4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47961'),
  ('985950520563098682', 'Peppermint', 2018, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ivan Kraljević, Robert Parker Clemente, Allison Rushton', 'Chad St. John', 'Jennifer Garner, John Gallagher Jr., John Ortiz, Juan Pablo Raba, Annie Ilonzeh, Jeff Hephner, Cailey Fleming, Eddie Shin', 'R', 'A grieving mother transforms herself into a vigilante following the murders of her husband and daughter, eluding the authorities to deliver her own personal brand of justice.', 'A grieving mother transforms herself into a vigilante following the murders of her husband and daughter, eluding the authorities to deliver her own personal brand of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrzxS0vcbzIIay1sdYm0rgI2QfJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458594'),
  ('39097278986606306', 'Peppermint Candy', 2000, 'Drama', 'Lee Chang-dong, Kim Hyung-koo, Kim Hyun-jin', 'Lee Chang-dong', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Moon So-ri, Kim Yeo-jin, Suh Jung, Go Seo-hee, Kim In-kwon, Lee Dae-yeon, Gong Hyung-jin', null, 'In the spring of 1999, a group of old friends gather to celebrate their 20 year reunion. Among the group is Yeong-ho, a cold, unhappy man, whose demeanor puts a damper on the festivities. The seriousness of Yeong-ho''s depression becomes apparent when he climbs a railroad bridge and looks like he might jump. At this crucial moment, memories of seven crucial episodes from Yeong-ho''s past flood his mind.', 'In the spring of 1999, a group of old friends gather to celebrate their 20 year reunion. Among the group is Yeong-ho, a cold, unhappy man, whose demeanor puts a damper on the festivities. The seriousness of Yeong-ho''s depression becomes apparent when he climbs a railroad bridge and looks like he might jump. At this crucial moment, memories of seven crucial episodes from Yeong-ho''s past flood his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPP0gFDgdXRa1YgP8Cn8arzOHI3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41245'),
  ('191449625004160605', 'Peppermint Frappé', 1967, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Carlos Saura, Luis Cuadrado, José Luis Ruiz Marcos', 'Carlos Saura, Angelino Fons, Rafael Azcona', 'Geraldine Chaplin, José Luis López Vázquez, Alfredo Mayo, Emiliano Redondo, María José Charfole, Francisco Venegas, Pedro Luis Lozano, Víctor Manuel Moreno', null, 'Julián, a middle-aged single doctor, is reunited with Pablo, a childhood friend who has just married Elena, a beautiful young woman.', 'Julián, a middle-aged single doctor, is reunited with Pablo, a childhood friend who has just married Elena, a beautiful young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBoDIvqSU88rWLcpzNmnstc8FBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105584'),
  ('880465437959901697', 'Peppermint Soda', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Diane Kurys, Philippe Rousselot, Alain Le Henry', 'Diane Kurys, Alain Le Henry', 'Éléonore Klarwein, Odile Michel, Yves Rénier, Anouk Ferjac, Jacqueline Boyer, Michel Puterflam, Robert Rimbaud, Marie Véronique Maurin', null, 'In the fall of 1963, Anne is becoming a teenager. She lives in Paris with her mother and her older sister, Frédérique. They''re just back from summer at the beach with their father. School starts. A turbulent year awaits them both.', 'In the fall of 1963, Anne is becoming a teenager. She lives in Paris with her mother and her older sister, Frédérique. They''re just back from summer at the beach with their father. School starts. A turbulent year awaits them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yQt2mefAXqNniQXiIrqaqbxMOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80220'),
  ('684594256947907445', 'Per amore, solo per amore', 1993, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Ugo Chiti, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Diego Abatantuono, Penélope Cruz, Alessandro Haber, Stefania Sandrelli, Ugo Conti, Mariangela D''Abbraccio, Valeria Sabel, Renato De Carmine', null, 'In 1st century BC Palestine, Joseph is a carpenter who wants to travel and see the world, but destiny makes him meet young Mary. The two fall in love and marry. One day, Mary becomes pregnant and tells Joseph an unbelievable truth... He decides to stay on her side, but things won''t be easy.', 'In 1st century BC Palestine, Joseph is a carpenter who wants to travel and see the world, but destiny makes him meet young Mary. The two fall in love and marry. One day, Mary becomes pregnant and tells Joseph an unbelievable truth... He decides to stay on her side, but things won''t be easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGy0E6JJ1pDzSkdIp4KwsASuMNS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64965'),
