  ('934687942151811553', 'Per Aspera Ad Astra', 2026, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama, Comedy', 'Han Yan, Simu Feng, Han Guanhua, Wu Gang, Wang Gang, Liu Xiaosha', 'Han Yan, Huang Channing, 高璐, 刘达林, 徐忱, 马佩斯, Gao Lu', 'Dylan Wang, Victoria Song, Zu Feng, Luo Haiqiong, Wang Duo', null, 'If you were given a chance to customize a dream, what would you do? The film tells a story that in the near future, the virtual dream system named "Liang Meng" comes into being, allowing people to do whatever they like in the dreams they create. However, a crisis triggered by "dream" is approaching stealthily.', 'If you were given a chance to customize a dream, what would you do? The film tells a story that in the near future, the virtual dream system named "Liang Meng" comes into being, allowing people to do whatever they like in the dreams they create. However, a crisis triggered by "dream" is approaching stealthily.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Foq9iQJYum7BlLD26M6MZTAVL0gW.jpg', 'plex:movie:per-aspera-ad-astra-2026'),
  ('59645032532441172', 'Per il mio bene', 2024, 'Drama', 'Mimmo Verdesca, Federico Annicchiarico', 'Monica Zapelli, Pierpaolo De Mejo, Mimmo Verdesca', 'Barbora Bobuľová, Marie-Christine Barrault, Stefania Sandrelli, Sara Ciocca, Leo Gullotta, Grazia Schiavo, Fabio Grossi, Gualtiero Burzi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEMNITlU22SCBhZw6ZwxBBIiHk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1383555'),
  ('4121485301984252', 'Per te', 2025, 'Drama', 'Alessandro Aronadio, Andrea Reitano', 'Alessandro Aronadio, Ivano Fachin, Renato Sannio', 'Edoardo Leo, Teresa Saponangelo, Javier Leoni, Giorgio Montanini, Eleonora Giovanardi, Guia Jelo, Daniele Parisi', null, 'In 2021, an 11-year-old boy named Mattia Piccoli was named Standard-bearer of the Republic by President Sergio Mattarella for "the love and care with which he daily follows his father''s illness." This film tells his story and that of his father, Paolo, who, in his early forties, slowly begins to lose pieces of his memory. But just as the world begins to fade, he chooses to stay close to what truly matters, strengthened also by the love of his wife Michela. Together with his son, he embarks on a journey of shared daily life, sudden laughter, and silences that speak.', 'In 2021, an 11-year-old boy named Mattia Piccoli was named Standard-bearer of the Republic by President Sergio Mattarella for "the love and care with which he daily follows his father''s illness." This film tells his story and that of his father, Paolo, who, in his early forties, slowly begins to lose pieces of his memory. But just as the world begins to fade, he chooses to stay close to what truly matters, strengthened also by the love of his wife Michela. Together with his son, he embarks on a journey of shared daily life, sudden laughter, and silences that speak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWuuunAQuSAlUTbPBJrycYAFS5A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266016'),
  ('1091157862725276560', 'Per tutta la vita', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Fabrizio Lucci, Paolo Costella', 'Paolo Costella, Paolo Genovese, Antonella Lattanzi', 'Ambra Angiolini, Luca Bizzarri, Carolina Crescentini, Claudia Gerini, Paolo Kessisoglu, Filippo Nigro, Claudia Pandolfi, Fabio Volo', null, 'Four married couples find out their marriage is invalid because it was officiated by a fraudulent priest and have to decide what to do next.', 'Four married couples find out their marriage is invalid because it was officiated by a fraudulent priest and have to decide what to do next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puBoQMQiPJQBz1sjMSfYBpc7QoA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743173'),
  ('893110587027745676', 'Perceval', 1978, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Éric Rohmer, Néstor Almendros', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Fabrice Luchini, André Dussollier, Solange Boulanger, Catherine Schroeder, Francisco Orozco, Deborah Nathan, Alain Serve, Daniel Tarrare', null, 'The film chronicles Perceval''s knighthood, maturation and eventual peerage amongst the Knights of the Round Table, and also contains brief episodes from the story of Gawain and the crucifixion of Christ.', 'The film chronicles Perceval''s knighthood, maturation and eventual peerage amongst the Knights of the Round Table, and also contains brief episodes from the story of Gawain and the crucifixion of Christ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvywz6133UMPfKRVcMWav151Ci5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75733'),
  ('760494198640141807', 'Perched on a Tree', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Edmond Séchan, Bernard Guillou, Henri Helman', 'Jean Halain', 'Louis de Funès, Geraldine Chaplin, Olivier de Funès, Alice Sapritch, Paul Préboist, Roland Armontel, Franco Volpi, Jean Panisse', null, 'Henry Roubier, a French promoter, and Enrico Mazzini, an Italian, have signed an agreement guaranteeing them a stranglehold on European highways. While driving on the roads of the south, Roubier takes two young hitchhikers, but an unfortunate swerve the car rushes by Henri and its occupants on the top of a pine tree onto the side of a cliff.', 'Henry Roubier, a French promoter, and Enrico Mazzini, an Italian, have signed an agreement guaranteeing them a stranglehold on European highways. While driving on the roads of the south, Roubier takes two young hitchhikers, but an unfortunate swerve the car rushes by Henri and its occupants on the top of a pine tree onto the side of a cliff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91SYK4YPHZYwyM8Zp049xQDMrOL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11914'),
  ('857284278273495281', 'Percoco: Il Primo Mostro D’Italia', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Pierluigi Ferrandini, Filippo Silvestris, Veronica Nardelli', 'Pierluigi Ferrandini', 'Gianluca Vicari, Giuseppe Scoditti, Rebecca Metcalf Cortese, Federica Pagliaroli, Laura Gigante, Gegia, Fabrizio Traversa, Antonio Monsellato', null, 'Italian film directed by Pierluigi Ferrandini. On the night of May 26, 1956, a terrible bloody event occurred within the home. In Bari at the dawn of the economic boom, the twenty-six-year-old Franco Percoco, coming from a "normal" lower middle class family, carried out a family massacre - the first after the war to have great media coverage - and was consigned to the news as the "Monster of Bari ".', 'Italian film directed by Pierluigi Ferrandini. On the night of May 26, 1956, a terrible bloody event occurred within the home. In Bari at the dawn of the economic boom, the twenty-six-year-old Franco Percoco, coming from a "normal" lower middle class family, carried out a family massacre - the first after the war to have great media coverage - and was consigned to the news as the "Monster of Bari ".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSTbxRv3DmZuRspEWabCjoMlYAd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096556'),
  ('660999676494937459', 'Percy', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Ralph Thomas, Ernest Steward, Tony Reading', 'Hugh Leonard, Terence Feely', 'Hywel Bennett, Denholm Elliott, Elke Sommer, Britt Ekland, Cyd Hayman, Janet Key, Tracey Crisp, Antonia Ellis', 'R', 'Edwin Antony (Hywel Bennett) is emasculated in an accident which kills a young philanderer. Doctors successfully replace his member with that of the dead man, but refuse to tell him the full story of the organ''s origin. So Edwin begins a search which takes him to the philanderer''s wife - and also to his many, many girlfriends...', 'Edwin Antony (Hywel Bennett) is emasculated in an accident which kills a young philanderer. Doctors successfully replace his member with that of the dead man, but refuse to tell him the full story of the organ''s origin. So Edwin begins a search which takes him to the philanderer''s wife - and also to his many, many girlfriends...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiRANHhjh3p5f9vFp6heKPpedNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94222'),
  ('503909733660652849', 'Percy', 2020, 'Drama', 'Luc Montpellier, Lisa Beach, Clark Johnson', 'Garfield Lindsay Miller, Hilary Pryor', 'Christopher Walken, Roberta Maxwell, Christina Ricci, Zach Braff, Adam Beach, Luke Kirby, Zoe Fish, Blake Taylor', 'PG-13', 'Percy Schmeiser, a third-generation farmer, gets sued by a corporate giant for allegedly using their patented seeds. With little resources to fight a legal battle, Percy joins forces with up-and-coming attorney Jackson Weaver and environmental activist Rebecca Salcau for a monumental case that leads all the way to the Supreme Court.', 'Percy Schmeiser, a third-generation farmer, gets sued by a corporate giant for allegedly using their patented seeds. With little resources to fight a legal battle, Percy joins forces with up-and-coming attorney Jackson Weaver and environmental activist Rebecca Salcau for a monumental case that leads all the way to the Supreme Court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcSldNnc8KgbBVcMlUkUA19isv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548755'),
  ('321560011360199496', 'Percy Jackson & the Olympians: The Lightning Thief', 2010, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Chris Columbus, Stephen Goldblatt, Sandi Tanaka', 'Craig Titley', 'Logan Lerman, Brandon T. Jackson, Alexandra Daddario, Jake Abel, Pierce Brosnan, Sean Bean, Steve Coogan, Rosario Dawson', 'PG', 'Accident prone teenager, Percy discovers he''s actually a demi-God, the son of Poseidon, and he is needed when Zeus'' lightning is stolen. Percy must master his new found skills in order to prevent a war between the Gods that could devastate the entire world.', 'Accident prone teenager, Percy discovers he''s actually a demi-God, the son of Poseidon, and he is needed when Zeus'' lightning is stolen. Percy must master his new found skills in order to prevent a war between the Gods that could devastate the entire world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brzpTyZ5bnM7s53C1KSk1TmrMO6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32657'),
  ('668551379025949415', 'Percy Jackson: Sea of Monsters', 2013, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Thor Freudenthal, Matt Paull, Josy Capkun', 'Marc Guggenheim', 'Logan Lerman, Brandon T. Jackson, Alexandra Daddario, Douglas Smith, Leven Rambin, Jake Abel, Katelyn Mager, Grey Damon', 'PG', 'In their quest to confront the ultimate evil, Percy and his friends battle swarms of mythical creatures to find the mythical Golden Fleece and to stop an ancient evil from rising.', 'In their quest to confront the ultimate evil, Percy and his friends battle swarms of mythical creatures to find the mythical Golden Fleece and to stop an ancient evil from rising.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAu90qEpLqwqiZLsMqpaMVr55oN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76285'),
  ('13104326401976695', 'Percy''s Progress', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Ralph Thomas', 'Sid Colin', 'Leigh Lawson, Elke Sommer, Denholm Elliott, Judy Geeson, Harry H. Corbett, Vincent Price, Adrienne Posta, Julie Ege', 'R', 'Percy, the man with the world''s first penis transplant, discovers that there is a chemical in the world''s water that makes men impotent.', 'Percy, the man with the world''s first penis transplant, discovers that there is a chemical in the world''s water that makes men impotent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3M3YyvDSgFv3ZEueuNnuLgSch6S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77647'),
  ('198701310494494042', 'Perdiamoci di vista', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Verdone, Danilo Desideri, Roberto Giandalia', 'Francesca Marciano, Carlo Verdone', 'Carlo Verdone, Asia Argento, Aldo Maccione, Anita Bartolucci, Luis Molteni, Roberto Sbaratto, Néstor Garay, Mariangela Giordano', null, 'Comic tale of a cynical TV star''s slow-combustion romance with a young paraplegic.', 'Comic tale of a cynical TV star''s slow-combustion romance with a young paraplegic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ms2ZZcudDGNV9MnPx9DxFVCG4FE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58189'),
  ('1089370281905440208', 'Perdida', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Alejandro Montiel, Laura Díez, Javier Petit', 'Mili Roque Pitt, Jorge Maestro, Alejandro Montiel', 'Luisana Lopilato, Amaia Salamanca, Rafael Spregelburd, Nicolás Furtado, Oriana Sabatini, Pedro Casablanc, Arantxa Martí, Carlos Alcántara', 'R', 'A policewoman whose childhood friend disappeared in Patagonia years ago starts a new search to find answers, and soon finds her own life in danger.', 'A policewoman whose childhood friend disappeared in Patagonia years ago starts a new search to find answers, and soon finds her own life in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzMBxfaRllUwPazFo0wjqlireCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513223'),
  ('711892243167768960', 'Pérdida Total', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Enrique Begné', 'Ernesto Anaya, Enrique Begné', 'Leonardo Ortizgris, Hector Kotsifakis, Jorge A. Jimenez, Joaquín Cosío, Alejandro Calva, Tato Alexander, Ana Sofía Gatica, Enrique Arreola', null, 'Claudio is a skilled con artist desperate for money. In a misguided attempt to claim insurance on his truck, he tries to destroy it, only to discover the lifeless body of the son of a powerful crime boss hidden inside. Arrested and taken to Torreón, Claudio is seen by the prosecutor as a cunning criminal in disguise. To escape his predicament, he must turn the tables and act as bait to lure out the ruthless leader, El Rojo, plunging him deeper into a dangerous game of deception and survival.', 'Claudio is a skilled con artist desperate for money. In a misguided attempt to claim insurance on his truck, he tries to destroy it, only to discover the lifeless body of the son of a powerful crime boss hidden inside. Arrested and taken to Torreón, Claudio is seen by the prosecutor as a cunning criminal in disguise. To escape his predicament, he must turn the tables and act as bait to lure out the ruthless leader, El Rojo, plunging him deeper into a dangerous game of deception and survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Z1oA2wzFKSSgj3nI5mfwQOXA1P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1372586'),
  ('611540425034636938', 'Perdido por perdido', 1993, null, 'Alberto Lecchi, José Luis García', 'Daniel Romañach, Alberto Lecchi', 'Ricardo Darín, Enrique Pinti, Carolina Papaleo, Jorge Schubert, Ana María Picchio', null, 'Vidal (Darín) is about to be bankrupt, so he sets up a fake car robbery with a small-time mobster to collect insurance and split the money. But his perfect plan becomes entangled by his increasingly dangerous ties to the mob and the meddling of a rogue insurance investigator (Pinti), who eventually strikes a deal with Vidal and decides to team up with him and his wife (Papaleo) to bring down the mob and expose the corruption that links a high-ranking executive to the mafia.', 'Vidal (Darín) is about to be bankrupt, so he sets up a fake car robbery with a small-time mobster to collect insurance and split the money. But his perfect plan becomes entangled by his increasingly dangerous ties to the mob and the meddling of a rogue insurance investigator (Pinti), who eventually strikes a deal with Vidal and decides to team up with him and his wife (Papaleo) to bring down the mob and expose the corruption that links a high-ranking executive to the mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftaBqIrbNasESPxf7xLkaI9Jjpg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80393'),
  ('810062902881273844', 'Perdiendo mi virginidad', 2019, 'Drama', 'Iván Cuevas', 'Adolfo Martínez Solares', 'Luis Gatica, Alicia Encinas, Leonardo Daniel, Amara Villafuerte, Estefanía Franco, María Torres, Aitor Iturrioz, Miriam Arrieta', null, 'Two stories are told of virgin girls who, while studying at university, fall in love with their teacher. But both stories will not have the same outcome.', 'Two stories are told of virgin girls who, while studying at university, fall in love with their teacher. But both stories will not have the same outcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMwzNdgyrCPxuWEDZqDir2XM2YR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678521'),
  ('5306975026268530', 'Perdiendo mi virginidad 2', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Enrique Murillo', 'Adolfo Martínez Solares', 'Lorena Herrera, Radamés de Jesús, José Armando Gastelum, Amara Villafuerte, Rosario Serna, Archie Lafranco, Brenda Barragán, Nabila Alejandra Rojas', null, 'A student, seeing the feeling he has with the girls at his school and seeing the fame that he created as a gigolo, decides to start prostitution on the internet. This leads him to date all kinds of women, especially those who are still virgins.', 'A student, seeing the feeling he has with the girls at his school and seeing the fame that he created as a gigolo, decides to start prostitution on the internet. This leads him to date all kinds of women, especially those who are still virgins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YrS0yBslYLPc9tr0XKmI9WECQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1095820'),
  ('252973854242983184', 'Perdoa-Me Por Me Traíres', 1983, 'Drama', 'Braz Chediak, Hélio Silva', 'Braz Chediak, Gilvan Pereira, Nelson Rodrigues Filho', 'Vera Fischer, Nuno Leal Maia, Lídia Brondi, Rubens Correia, Sadi Cabral, Anselmo Vasconcelos, Zaira Zambelli, Jorge Dória', null, 'Glorinha, a middle-class 15 year old girl, always thought her mother Judite had killed herself, and that her father Gilberto has gone crazy as result. Her friend Nair takes her to a high-class bordello, where she wants to work. When uncle Raul, who raised her, discovers her prostitution, he decides to finally tell her all the truth about her parents'' story.', 'Glorinha, a middle-class 15 year old girl, always thought her mother Judite had killed herself, and that her father Gilberto has gone crazy as result. Her friend Nair takes her to a high-class bordello, where she wants to work. When uncle Raul, who raised her, discovers her prostitution, he decides to finally tell her all the truth about her parents'' story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2TtRVdQvimrpV2O6Xyog13nMYt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237780'),
  ('794954554256309791', 'Pereira Declares', 1995, 'Drama', 'João Cayatte, Júlio Alves, Roberto Faenza', 'Sergio Vecchio, Roberto Faenza', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Stefano Dionisi, Nicoletta Braschi, Daniel Auteuil, Joaquim de Almeida, Marthe Keller, Teresa Madruga, Nicolau Breyner', 'NR', 'Lisbon, 1938. Mr. Pereira is the editor of the culture section of an evening paper. Although fascism is on the rise in Europe, like in nearby civil war Spain or even inside Portugal itself in the form of Salazar''s regime, Pereira only concerns himself with writing bios and translating French novels. Things change after he hires a young writer as his assistant, getting to know also his girlfriend – both opponents to the regime – and reluctantly helps them when they begin to get in trouble for subversive activities. Eventually, he''s forced to take a stand...', 'Lisbon, 1938. Mr. Pereira is the editor of the culture section of an evening paper. Although fascism is on the rise in Europe, like in nearby civil war Spain or even inside Portugal itself in the form of Salazar''s regime, Pereira only concerns himself with writing bios and translating French novels. Things change after he hires a young writer as his assistant, getting to know also his girlfriend – both opponents to the regime – and reluctantly helps them when they begin to get in trouble for subversive activities. Eventually, he''s forced to take a stand...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcC09OL0ajVDYRFl38psXBfLx4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47367'),
  ('869498716945415894', 'Perez Family', 1949, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Agustín Martínez Solares', null, 'Joaquín Pardavé, Sara García, Manolo Fábregas, Beatriz Aguirre, José Elías Moreno, Alma Rosa Aguirre, Lilia Prado, Felipe de Alba', null, 'Gumaro Pérez must fulfill all the whims of his wife, who is sworn lady of society even though the Pérez are not a wealthy family. In order not to look bad with his wife, Gumaro asks for a loan, but when he receives it, all his co-workers take it from him since he owes everyone money.', 'Gumaro Pérez must fulfill all the whims of his wife, who is sworn lady of society even though the Pérez are not a wealthy family. In order not to look bad with his wife, Gumaro asks for a loan, but when he receives it, all his co-workers take it from him since he owes everyone money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAgOhbe2yCJxrWPbiyjf81ua3ap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345806'),
  ('890318426343433597', 'Perez.', 2014, 'Drama', 'Edoardo De Angelis', 'Filippo Gravino, Edoardo De Angelis', 'Luca Zingaretti, Marco D''Amore, Simona Tabasco, Giampaolo Fabrizio, Massimiliano Gallo, Saman Anthony, Ida Brandi, Salvatore Cantalupo', null, 'Demetrio Perez is a tough prosecutor torn between the corruption inherent in his job and the desire to do right by his family. But when opportunity presents itself and his daughter Thea falls in love with a Mafioso’s son, Perez has to cut through the morality of his law-abiding roots and become as dirty as the dangerous criminals he represents.', 'Demetrio Perez is a tough prosecutor torn between the corruption inherent in his job and the desire to do right by his family. But when opportunity presents itself and his daughter Thea falls in love with a Mafioso’s son, Perez has to cut through the morality of his law-abiding roots and become as dirty as the dangerous criminals he represents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tyGiBtcJYLcA72btXe838C9hnb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288313'),
  ('1056071926412551796', 'Perfect', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Bridges, Gordon Willis', 'Aaron Latham, James Bridges', 'John Travolta, Jamie Lee Curtis, Anne DeSalvo, Marilu Henner, Laraine Newman, Mathew Reed, Jann Wenner, Stefan Gierasch', 'R', 'A female aerobics instructor meets a male reporter doing a story on health clubs, but it isn''t love at first sight.', 'A female aerobics instructor meets a male reporter doing a story on health clubs, but it isn''t love at first sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tb1jZGi23w2pIittaBBdaN6CGRI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49370'),
  ('752417856828267368', 'Perfect Addiction', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Castille Landon, Józef Grzymała, Maciej Sobieraj', 'Stephanie Sanditz', 'Kiana Madeira, Ross Butler, Matthew Noszka, Bree Winslow, Nicholas Duvernay, Manu Bennett, Ryan Bown, Poppy Gilbert', 'R', 'A female boxing trainer discovers that her champion cage-fighter boyfriend has been cheating on her with her sister and decides to seek revenge by training up his arch-rival to challenge him.', 'A female boxing trainer discovers that her champion cage-fighter boyfriend has been cheating on her with her sister and decides to seek revenge by training up his arch-rival to challenge him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucO3NFIvMff71cBRR5EgYXPKWMC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845659'),
  ('813082017831892012', 'Perfect Bid: The Contestant Who Knew Too Much', 2017, 'Documentary', 'CJ Wallis', null, 'Bob Barker, Drew Carey, Kevin Pollak, Theodore Slauson, Roger Dobkowitz', 'NR', 'Maths teacher Ted Slauson became adept at recording and memorizing prices of products featured on the iconic game show The Price is Right, an obsession dating back to the show''s inception in 1972. This passion and dedication for the show culminated in him helping a contestant place a perfect bid during a 2008 showcase, an innocent act that would create one of the biggest controversies in television industry history.', 'Maths teacher Ted Slauson became adept at recording and memorizing prices of products featured on the iconic game show The Price is Right, an obsession dating back to the show''s inception in 1972. This passion and dedication for the show culminated in him helping a contestant place a perfect bid during a 2008 showcase, an innocent act that would create one of the biggest controversies in television industry history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0ZpJq0QyNyPqJz57DqyORqqrPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491766'),
  ('190712728165901702', 'Perfect Blue', 1998, 'Animation, Thriller', 'Satoshi Kon, Hisao Shirai, Hideki Hamasu', 'Sadayuki Murai', 'Junko Iwao, Rica Matsumoto, Shiho Niiyama, Masaaki Okura, Shinpachi Tsuji, Emiko Furukawa, Yosuke Akimoto, Yoku Shioya', 'R', 'Rising pop star Mima quits singing to pursue a career as an actress. After she takes up a role on a popular detective show, her handlers and collaborators begin turning up murdered. Harboring feelings of guilt and haunted by visions of her former self, Mima''s reality and fantasy meld into a frenzied paranoia.', 'Rising pop star Mima quits singing to pursue a career as an actress. After she takes up a role on a popular detective show, her handlers and collaborators begin turning up murdered. Harboring feelings of guilt and haunted by visions of her former self, Mima''s reality and fantasy meld into a frenzied paranoia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WTiOCfDPP8XV4jqfloiVWf7KHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10494'),
  ('503053751131141474', 'Perfect Blue: Yume Nara Samete', 2002, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Toshiki Sato, Yasuhito Hironaka', 'Masahiro Kobayashi, Shinji Imaoka', 'Ayaka Maeda, Masahiro Toda, Nao Omori, Makiko Watanabe, Yumi Shimizu, Tarō Suwa, Yûki Ariga, Kenji Mizuhashi', null, 'Perfect Blue: Yume Nara Samete (パーfectブルー 夢なら醒めて, Pāfekuto Burū: Yume Nara Samete) is a 2002 Japanese psychological thriller film directed by Toshiki Satō and adapted from the novel of the same name by Yoshikazu Takeuchi. The story centers on Ai, a teen pop idol transitioning to a recording career, whose life unravels amid fixation from a obsessive convenience store clerk, leading to themes of distorted self-perception, narcissistic delusions, and violent events.', 'Perfect Blue: Yume Nara Samete (パーfectブルー 夢なら醒めて, Pāfekuto Burū: Yume Nara Samete) is a 2002 Japanese psychological thriller film directed by Toshiki Satō and adapted from the novel of the same name by Yoshikazu Takeuchi. The story centers on Ai, a teen pop idol transitioning to a recording career, whose life unravels amid fixation from a obsessive convenience store clerk, leading to themes of distorted self-perception, narcissistic delusions, and violent events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZxIfoIF95LwBNLUAxAm8I57NTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86976'),
  ('678089582713583936', 'Perfect Body', 1997, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Douglas Barr, Karl Herrmann, Blair Roth', 'Melissa Gould', 'Amy Jo Johnson, Brett Cullen, Wendie Malick, Ray Baker, Tara Boger, Ron Melendez, Julie Patzwald, Cathy Rigby', null, 'Obsessed with perfection, young gymnast Andie Bradley nearly starves herself to realize her dream of making the Olympic gymnastics team.', 'Obsessed with perfection, young gymnast Andie Bradley nearly starves herself to realize her dream of making the Olympic gymnastics team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wK7H98hX3BJsarYbg89WRDX2TLG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86186'),
  ('343134858837547110', 'Perfect Creature', 2007, 'Action, Science Fiction, Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Glenn Standring, Leon Narbey', 'Glenn Standring', 'Dougray Scott, Saffron Burrows, Leo Gregory, Scott Wills, Stuart Wilson, Craig Hall, Robbie Magasiva, Stephen Ure', 'R', 'The vampire myth is given a stylish 1960s treatment, where a human cop partners with a vampire cop to stop a vamp bent on creating a war between the two "separate but equal" races.', 'The vampire myth is given a stylish 1960s treatment, where a human cop partners with a vampire cop to stop a vamp bent on creating a war between the two "separate but equal" races.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dimESyMjhfzmukbisslB3djbXhQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18726'),
  ('965815861845512288', 'Perfect Day', 1929, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott', 'Leo McCarey, Hal Roach', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Edgar Kennedy, Kay Deslys, Isabelle Keith', 'NR', 'Two families embark on a pleasant Sunday picnic but manage to run into a variety of issues with their temperamental automobile. Each incident requires repeated exits and reboardings by Laurel, Hardy, their wives and grouchy, gout-ridden Uncle Edgar.', 'Two families embark on a pleasant Sunday picnic but manage to run into a variety of issues with their temperamental automobile. Each incident requires repeated exits and reboardings by Laurel, Hardy, their wives and grouchy, gout-ridden Uncle Edgar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxsWl62K6E4AeEncbdq3A1qNNYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48736'),
  ('576930147039967048', 'Perfect Days', 2023, 'Drama', 'Wim Wenders, Takuma Hayashi, Takamasa Araki', 'Wim Wenders, Takuma Takasaki', 'Koji Yakusho, Tokio Emoto, Arisa Nakano, Aoi Yamada, Yumi Aso, Sayuri Ishikawa, Tomokazu Miura, Min Tanaka', 'PG', 'Hirayama is content with his life as a toilet cleaner in Tokyo. Outside of his structured routine, he cherishes music on cassette tapes, books, and taking photos of trees. Through unexpected encounters, he reflects on finding beauty in the world.', 'Hirayama is content with his life as a toilet cleaner in Tokyo. Outside of his structured routine, he cherishes music on cassette tapes, books, and taking photos of trees. Through unexpected encounters, he reflects on finding beauty in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjEk5Wwx6TYVqw29zSaUHclMIgp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:976893'),
  ('1020933121287583439', 'Perfect Endings', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Ribeiro', 'Daniel Ribeiro', 'Artur Volpi, Julianna Gerais, Marcos Oli, Michel Joelsas, Bruno Rocha, Cleomácio Inácio, Igor Cosso, Sidney Santiago', null, 'Like the perfect ending of a great film - that is the way filmmaker João describes the end of his 10-year relationship with Hugo. Despite breaking up, they remained best friends. However, reentering the dating scene brought a whirlwind of emotions, revealing that reality can’t be controlled like a movie script.', 'Like the perfect ending of a great film - that is the way filmmaker João describes the end of his 10-year relationship with Hugo. Despite breaking up, they remained best friends. However, reentering the dating scene brought a whirlwind of emotions, revealing that reality can’t be controlled like a movie script.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foC2sC3lvPvbqw7kg8gpnP18iJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1125953'),
  ('1144422602314343007', 'Perfect Exchange', 1993, 'Mystery, Comedy, Romance, Thriller, Action', 'Wong Jing, Cheung Siu-Kin, Cash Chin Man-Kei', 'Wong Jing', 'Andy Lau, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Kwan Hoi-San, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, Anita Lee Yuen-Wah, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Liu Kai-Chi', null, 'Mindy Chan (Andy Lau) is a top-notched gambler/swindler. His girlfriend Lily (Christy Chung) and friend Ah Chi are card dealers at the casino where bad guy Lau and his mistress Mona (Anita Lee) frequent. Chor Hung (Tony Leung Ka-Fai), a play on the Chinese name for famed retired actress Cherie Chung, is a senior security guard at the local prison. During a card game, Ah Chi and Mindy swindle millions of dollars from Lau, but they are caught. Lau makes a deal with Mindy - in exchange for Ah Chi (who had been kidnapped), Mindy needs to go to prison and find out where a guy named Robinson (Kwan Hoi-San) has hidden $3 billion dollars worth of bonds.', 'Mindy Chan (Andy Lau) is a top-notched gambler/swindler. His girlfriend Lily (Christy Chung) and friend Ah Chi are card dealers at the casino where bad guy Lau and his mistress Mona (Anita Lee) frequent. Chor Hung (Tony Leung Ka-Fai), a play on the Chinese name for famed retired actress Cherie Chung, is a senior security guard at the local prison. During a card game, Ah Chi and Mindy swindle millions of dollars from Lau, but they are caught. Lau makes a deal with Mindy - in exchange for Ah Chi (who had been kidnapped), Mindy needs to go to prison and find out where a guy named Robinson (Kwan Hoi-San) has hidden $3 billion dollars worth of bonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynmdYgWc9gH0aKEZF1uQjmzBDxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320955'),
  ('35112009487390840', 'Perfect Friday', 1970, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Peter Hall, Alan Hume, Christopher Dryhurst', 'Anthony Greville-Bell, Scott Forbes', 'Ursula Andress, Stanley Baker, David Warner, Patience Collier, T. P. McKenna, David Waller, Joan Benham, Julian Orchard', 'R', 'The deputy manager of a London bank has worked out a way to rob the branch of £200,000. When he becomes involved with the attractive Lady Dorset he decides to go ahead with his plan. He needs her help and that of her philandering spendthrift husband. It all comes down to a matter of trust.', 'The deputy manager of a London bank has worked out a way to rob the branch of £200,000. When he becomes involved with the attractive Lady Dorset he decides to go ahead with his plan. He needs her help and that of her philandering spendthrift husband. It all comes down to a matter of trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnlGtQgg6yYnnq9PAo5BJmo1TA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91583'),
  ('795431178634789717', 'Perfect Game', 2011, 'Drama', 'Park Hee-kon, Park Ho-chan, Jung Se-kyo', 'Park Hee-kon', 'Cho Seung-woo, Yang Dong-geun, Choi Jung-won, Don Lee, Cho Jin-woong, Son Byung-ho, Hyun Jyu-ni, Kim Young-min', null, 'The Lotte Giants'' Choi Dong-won and the Haitai Tigers'' Seon Dong-ryeol are rival pitchers in 1980s baseball. The film reenacts the legendary match of May 16, 1987, which baseball fans today still recall as "the perfect match," when Choi and Sun compete as pitchers for the last time.', 'The Lotte Giants'' Choi Dong-won and the Haitai Tigers'' Seon Dong-ryeol are rival pitchers in 1980s baseball. The film reenacts the legendary match of May 16, 1987, which baseball fans today still recall as "the perfect match," when Choi and Sun compete as pitchers for the last time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEg7jEKv67nG0tf1I7XMc1tSdfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118469'),
  ('639068073542633373', 'Perfect High', 2015, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Vanessa Parise, Mahlon Todd Williams', 'Anne-Marie Hess', 'Bella Thorne, Israel Broussard, Daniela Bobadilla, Ross Butler, Matreya Fedor, Jasmine Sky Sarin, Ryan Grantham, Lucia Walters', null, 'Sweet suburban teen Amanda is introduced by her new friends to prescription drug-sharing, but the recreational fun soon leads her to a life-altering heroin addiction.', 'Sweet suburban teen Amanda is introduced by her new friends to prescription drug-sharing, but the recreational fun soon leads her to a life-altering heroin addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fczW7OKea75pH5pag7YxwNQlTfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346570'),
  ('680437627150918416', 'Perfect Little Angels', 1998, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Peter Benison, Timothy Bond', 'Andrew Neiderman, Bart Baker', 'Cheryl Ladd, Jody Thompson, Michael York, Jade Pawluk, Brendan Fehr, Tanja Reichert, David Paetkau, John Hawkes', null, 'Having just moved to a new town, widow Elaine Freedman and her teenage daughter Justine are greeted by the effusive, terribly nice Dr. Calvin Lawrence. Sensing that Justine is bit testy and out of sorts, Dr. Lawrence recommends that she begin taking a special vitamin which he manufactures in his own home. Before long, Justine is the model of perfection -- just like all the other teenagers in town.', 'Having just moved to a new town, widow Elaine Freedman and her teenage daughter Justine are greeted by the effusive, terribly nice Dr. Calvin Lawrence. Sensing that Justine is bit testy and out of sorts, Dr. Lawrence recommends that she begin taking a special vitamin which he manufactures in his own home. Before long, Justine is the model of perfection -- just like all the other teenagers in town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuApazKh2R1uY7ECSL7TVq1hZ3J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276778'),
  ('604732526295879845', 'Perfect Love', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Catherine Breillat, Laurent Dailland, Mathias Honoré', 'Catherine Breillat', 'Isabelle Renauld, Francis Renaud, Laura Saglio, Alain Soral, Michèle Rème, Alice Mitterrand, Tom Rocheteau, Delphine De Malherbe', null, 'In Dunkirk, a man and a woman meet and fall in love, then hate each other.', 'In Dunkirk, a man and a woman meet and fall in love, then hate each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4rZx40SkiUalPUxBnIfROywQGB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64584'),
  ('728918637714623648', 'Perfect Match', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Ron Oliver', 'Patricia Resnick', 'Danica McKellar, Paul Greene, Linda Gray, Elise Gatien, Robin Givens, Anthony Konechny, Erica Tremblay', null, 'When an engaged couple can’t agree on anything, the mother of the groom hires a wedding planner and an event planner to help put together the wedding of their dreams. The two planners are as different as night and day, but as they too learn to compromise, they discover opposites do indeed attract and can combine to produce incredible results!', 'When an engaged couple can’t agree on anything, the mother of the groom hires a wedding planner and an event planner to help put together the wedding of their dreams. The two planners are as different as night and day, but as they too learn to compromise, they discover opposites do indeed attract and can combine to produce incredible results!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBdSYs5IVVigcoFPImFopbQO9c4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344123'),
  ('757031315706460744', 'Perfect Match...', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Anne-Marie Etienne', null, 'Carole Bouquet, Marc Lavoine, Florence Foresti, Patrice Demonière, François-Eric Gendron, Jean Senejoux, Jean-Claude Adelin, Marc Fayet', null, 'Valentin, a young man with a dark sense of humor, has lost everything: his girlfriend, his job and his apartment. He squats with an absent uncle in a nice neighbourhood. On the same landing lives Hélène and her son Jérémy. Strong and independent, Hélène is a successful author who fights social inequalities and prejudices through her books. Between them, a cat who comes and goes, a son in search of a father, a sister in search of a lover, an stuck editor and their differences... Who knows, maybe one day all that will bring them closer?', 'Valentin, a young man with a dark sense of humor, has lost everything: his girlfriend, his job and his apartment. He squats with an absent uncle in a nice neighbourhood. On the same landing lives Hélène and her son Jérémy. Strong and independent, Hélène is a successful author who fights social inequalities and prejudices through her books. Between them, a cat who comes and goes, a son in search of a father, a sister in search of a lover, an stuck editor and their differences... Who knows, maybe one day all that will bring them closer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ag96dJfHKApaSHZNcEgZplZJlNv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13745'),
  ('302876781420038785', 'Perfect Nanny', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Hadrien Bichet, Lucie Borleteau, Alexis Kavyrchine', 'Maïwenn, Jérémie Elkaïm, Lucie Borleteau', 'Leïla Bekhti, Karin Viard, Antoine Reinartz, Assya Da Silva, Nöelle Renaude, Rehab Mehal', null, 'When Myriam, the mother of two young children, decides, despite the reluctance of her husband to resume her activity in a law firm, the couple is looking for a nanny. After a severe casting, they hire Louise, who quickly conquers the affection of children and gradually occupies a central place in the home. Gradually the trap of mutual dependence will close, until the tragedy.', 'When Myriam, the mother of two young children, decides, despite the reluctance of her husband to resume her activity in a law firm, the couple is looking for a nanny. After a severe casting, they hire Louise, who quickly conquers the affection of children and gradually occupies a central place in the home. Gradually the trap of mutual dependence will close, until the tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCziTuOrxalOFnmKNCTwD7u8jpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582895'),
  ('808068075888891472', 'Perfect Number', 2012, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Lee Chol-o, Pang Eun-jin, Choi Chan-min', 'Kim Tae-yun, Lee Gong-ju, Lee Jung-hwa', 'Ryoo Seung-bum, Lee Yo-won, Cho Jin-woong, Kim Yoon-sung, Kim Bo-ra, Lee Seok-jun, Lim Sung-min, Kwak Min-ho', null, 'A brilliant math teacher formulates the perfect cover-up after his neighbor murders her abusive ex-husband.', 'A brilliant math teacher formulates the perfect cover-up after his neighbor murders her abusive ex-husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osnCFdOjqFIiI6fnR9yp5lPjQST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138665'),
  ('270667514376632579', 'Perfect Obedience', 2014, 'Drama', 'Luis Urquiza, Alejandro Giacomán, Alejandro Zuno', 'Ernesto Alcocer, Luis Urquiza', 'Juan Manuel Bernal, Alfonso Herrera, Luis Ernesto Franco, Sebastián Aguirre, Alejandro De Hoyos, Claudette Maillé, Juan Ignacio Aranda, Miguel Loyo', 'NR', 'The fictional Father Ángel de la Cruz is based on Legion of Christ founder Marcial Maciel, whose long history of child abuse was not addressed until 2006 and only publicly acknowledged in 2009. But director Luis Urquiza chooses to structure his film through the largely uncomprehending, wondering eyes of 13-year-old Julián, who travels from the arms of his loving pastoral family into the austere, hallowed halls of the seminary. Singling out the boy as his intimate disciple, installing him in his palatial private quarters and redubbing him “Sacramento Santos,” Father Ángel begins Julian’s instruction into the mysteries of “perfect obedience,” whose cardinal rule is: Never question a superior’s actions.', 'The fictional Father Ángel de la Cruz is based on Legion of Christ founder Marcial Maciel, whose long history of child abuse was not addressed until 2006 and only publicly acknowledged in 2009. But director Luis Urquiza chooses to structure his film through the largely uncomprehending, wondering eyes of 13-year-old Julián, who travels from the arms of his loving pastoral family into the austere, hallowed halls of the seminary. Singling out the boy as his intimate disciple, installing him in his palatial private quarters and redubbing him “Sacramento Santos,” Father Ángel begins Julian’s instruction into the mysteries of “perfect obedience,” whose cardinal rule is: Never question a superior’s actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7I4RNEiqqLysrsK2yW2TwGNKrH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264420'),
  ('595783251823548882', 'Perfect Opposites', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Matt Cooper, Bernd Heinl, Nicole Burke', null, 'Piper Perabo, Martin Henderson, Jason Winer, Andrew Keegan, Kathleen Wilhoite, Jennifer Tilly, Artie Lange, Derek Basco', 'PG-13', 'The story of two college graduates from the Midwest who move to Los Angeles, where their love is tested for the first time.', 'The story of two college graduates from the Midwest who move to Los Angeles, where their love is tested for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpqIGV3DZCYGvNRRn4cqSDgNa4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44593'),
  ('1066358919651574721', 'Perfect Proposal', 2015, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Yoon Jae-goo, Lee Tae-yoon', 'Yoon Jae-goo', 'Lim Soo-jung, Yoo Yeon-seok, Lee Kyung-young, Jin Kyung, Park Cheol-min, Min Do-hee, Kwak Min-ho, Lee Yang-hee', null, 'An indebted young woman gets a proposal from a handsome man to apply for work on a luxury yacht with his boss, the difficult, infirm old chairman of a large company, where they can manipulate him to get their hands on his wealth.', 'An indebted young woman gets a proposal from a handsome man to apply for work on a luxury yacht with his boss, the difficult, infirm old chairman of a large company, where they can manipulate him to get their hands on his wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7qBOFa56GzvQEWMzb0SiXKjzUX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342021'),
