  ('131779742555369603', 'Perfect Strangers', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Wissam Smayra, Sofian El Fani', 'Paolo Genovese, Filippo Bologna, Paolo Costella', 'Mona Zaki, Nadine Labaki, Eyad Nassar, Adel Karam, Diamand Abou Abboud, Georges Khabbaz, Fouad Yammine, Sinead Chaaya', null, 'A dinner party unravels when a tight group of friends agree to leave their phones unlocked on the table, exposing juicy interactions and dark secrets.', 'A dinner party unravels when a tight group of friends agree to leave their phones unlocked on the table, exposing juicy interactions and dark secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xanRnnwGExIEXvXlOAls9Hhq54l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833591'),
