  ('195114231230673008', 'Performance: A Dangerous Game', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Lucio Pellegrini, Francesca Borromeo, Radek Ładczuk', 'Lucio Pellegrini', 'Adriano Giannini, Elodie, Eduardo Scarpetta, Elena Lietti, Tea Falco, Massimo Coppola, Stefano Abbati, Iaia Forte', null, 'Giada and Carlo have been a couple for many years, both artists. He is a writer looking for a new story to tell, she is a dancer struggling as she directs her first experimental dance show. When Peter Drago comes into their lives, neither can imagine how much everything is about to change. Carlo is fascinated by him, finding in him a new creative inspiration, while Giada is increasingly restless, fearing that her past may come back to surface. But the truth always finds a way to emerge.', 'Giada and Carlo have been a couple for many years, both artists. He is a writer looking for a new story to tell, she is a dancer struggling as she directs her first experimental dance show. When Peter Drago comes into their lives, neither can imagine how much everything is about to change. Carlo is fascinated by him, finding in him a new creative inspiration, while Giada is increasingly restless, fearing that her past may come back to surface. But the truth always finds a way to emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQbyabXxKAS44yXb5BcNmInre5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1437237'),
