  ('848186172012796608', 'Perfumed Nightmare', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kidlat Tahimik, Hartmut Lerch, Kidlat Tahimik', 'Kidlat Tahimik', 'Kidlat Tahimik, Mang Fely, Dolores Santamaria, Georgette Baudry, Katrin de Guia, Hartmut Lerch, Valéry Giscard d''Estaing, Harold Wilson', null, 'Kidlat, a Filipino jeepney driver, is fascinated by the idea of the American space programme and by Western society as a whole. When he moves to Paris, disillusionment sets in as his dreams are gradually shattered.', 'Kidlat, a Filipino jeepney driver, is fascinated by the idea of the American space programme and by Western society as a whole. When he moves to Paris, disillusionment sets in as his dreams are gradually shattered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdIFmlnSbadQn4AQor4ktOzuPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84765'),
