  ('994897103261229612', 'Perro callejero 2', 1981, 'Crime, Drama', 'Gilberto Gazcón', 'Gilberto Gazcón', 'Valentín Trujillo, Blanca Guerra, Patricia Rivera, Narciso Busquets, Ana Luisa Peluffo, Eric del Castillo, Sergio Goyri, Rojo Grau', null, 'After serving his three-year sentence, Perro, who was only visited by Father Maromas, returns to his old environment. There, Chava recruits him back into drug trafficking.', 'After serving his three-year sentence, Perro, who was only visited by Father Maromas, returns to his old environment. There, Chava recruits him back into drug trafficking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6chKP6v5tnmYu9UkEQ2hWqGAFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301903'),
