  ('887122601552758016', 'Pet Pals And Marco Polo''s Code', 2010, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Sergio Manfio, Josep Esteve, Eva Fontanals', 'Sergio Manfio, Antonio Garrido, Francesco Manfio', 'Monica Ward, Laura Lenghi, Paolo Lombardi, Edoardo Nevola, Gigi Rosa, Paola Giannetti, Gerolamo Alchieri, Enrico Di Troia', null, 'The Pet Pals are put to the test when the Evil Crow Witch is determined to drain the canals of Venice. Armed with a touch of magic, the Pet Pals combine their strengths to uncover the secret code before the Evil Witch does.', 'The Pet Pals are put to the test when the Evil Crow Witch is determined to drain the canals of Venice. Armed with a touch of magic, the Pet Pals combine their strengths to uncover the secret code before the Evil Witch does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnQ5qiuZiQqmN9ysRLFmkK5hSgS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73594'),
