  ('437586653575358066', 'Pete ''n'' Tillie', 1972, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Martin Ritt, John A. Alonzo', 'Julius J. Epstein', 'Walter Matthau, Carol Burnett, Geraldine Page, Barry Nelson, René Auberjonois, Lee Montgomery, Henry Jones, Kent Smith', 'PG', 'A fun-loving bachelor woos and weds a secretary, but the bonds of this marriage aren''t strong enough to stop his philandering from continuing.', 'A fun-loving bachelor woos and weds a secretary, but the bonds of this marriage aren''t strong enough to stop his philandering from continuing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySF4iAKMynUobtjFUWeJuEoduuV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107774'),
