  ('530905276734765206', 'Pete Kelly''s Blues', 1955, 'Crime, Drama, Music', 'Jack Webb, Harry D''Arcy, Harold Rosson', 'Richard L. Breen', 'Jack Webb, Janet Leigh, Edmond O''Brien, Peggy Lee, Andy Devine, Lee Marvin, Ella Fitzgerald, Martin Milner', 'NR', 'In 1927, a Kansas City, Missouri cornet player and his band perform nightly at a seedy speakeasy until a racketeer tries to extort them in exchange for protection.', 'In 1927, a Kansas City, Missouri cornet player and his band perform nightly at a seedy speakeasy until a racketeer tries to extort them in exchange for protection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGlHz9Isou2Y4scIPvt3MWnEzcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43321'),
  ('398595821706544953', 'Pete''s Christmas', 2013, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Nisha Ganatra, Colin Hoult, Colin Hoult', 'Peter McKay, Brian Sawyer, Gregg Rossen', 'Zachary Gordon, Molly Parker, Bailee Madison, Bruce Dern, Racine Bebamikawe, Lynne Deragon, Vince Groulx, Jacob Kraemer', null, 'An overlooked middle child finds himself in the unexpected spotlight when he realizes his family''s terrible Christmas day keeps repeating. As the only one experiencing the day over and over, he decides to use his unique gift to give the holidays a makeover and his family a Christmas they will never forget.', 'An overlooked middle child finds himself in the unexpected spotlight when he realizes his family''s terrible Christmas day keeps repeating. As the only one experiencing the day over and over, he decides to use his unique gift to give the holidays a makeover and his family a Christmas they will never forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUThHZFYM6mEH3REIQ76BGMdkAi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237710'),
  ('822860308147629034', 'Pete''s Dragon', 1977, 'Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Frank V. Phillips, Don Chaffey, Don Bluth', 'Malcolm Marmorstein', 'Sean Marshall, Helen Reddy, Jim Dale, Mickey Rooney, Red Buttons, Shelley Winters, Jane Kean, Jim Backus', 'G', 'Pete, a young orphan, runs away to a Maine fishing town with his best friend a lovable, sometimes invisible dragon named Elliott! When they are taken in by a kind lighthouse keeper, Nora, and her father, Elliott''s prank playing lands them in big trouble. Then, when crooked salesmen try to capture Elliott for their own gain, Pete must attempt a daring rescue.', 'Pete, a young orphan, runs away to a Maine fishing town with his best friend a lovable, sometimes invisible dragon named Elliott! When they are taken in by a kind lighthouse keeper, Nora, and her father, Elliott''s prank playing lands them in big trouble. Then, when crooked salesmen try to capture Elliott for their own gain, Pete must attempt a daring rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noShGNQKAgMqNanJL5EiZlf6LCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11114'),
  ('785270450905031756', 'Pete''s Dragon', 2016, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'David Lowery, Bojan Bazelli, Kim Sinclair', 'Malcolm Marmorstein', 'Oakes Fegley, Bryce Dallas Howard, Wes Bentley, Karl Urban, Oona Laurence, Robert Redford, Isiah Whitlock Jr., John Kassir', 'PG', 'For years, old wood carver Mr. Meacham has delighted local children with his tales of the fierce dragon that resides deep in the woods of the Pacific Northwest. To his daughter, Grace, who works as a forest ranger, these stories are little more than tall tales... until she meets Pete, a mysterious 10-year-old with no family and no home who claims to live in the woods with a giant, green dragon named Elliott. And from Pete''s descriptions, Elliott seems remarkably similar to the dragon from Mr. Meacham''s stories. With the help of Natalie, an 11-year-old girl whose father Jack owns the local lumber mill, Grace sets out to determine where Pete came from, where he belongs, and the truth about this dragon.', 'For years, old wood carver Mr. Meacham has delighted local children with his tales of the fierce dragon that resides deep in the woods of the Pacific Northwest. To his daughter, Grace, who works as a forest ranger, these stories are little more than tall tales... until she meets Pete, a mysterious 10-year-old with no family and no home who claims to live in the woods with a giant, green dragon named Elliott. And from Pete''s descriptions, Elliott seems remarkably similar to the dragon from Mr. Meacham''s stories. With the help of Natalie, an 11-year-old girl whose father Jack owns the local lumber mill, Grace sets out to determine where Pete came from, where he belongs, and the truth about this dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9x4Ogk8KUXTfU649NS6lS9TCmu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294272'),
  ('487568927260683245', 'Peter & the Wolf', 2006, 'Animation, Family, Music', 'Mikołaj Jaroszewicz, Suzie Templeton', 'Sergei Prokofiev', null, 'G', 'Peter is a slight lad, solitary, locked out of the woods by his protective grandfather, his only friend a duck. In town, he''s bullied. When a wolf menaces the duck - as well as grandfather''s fat cat and an ill-flying bird that Peter has befriended - Peter bravely tries to tree the wolf. Grandfather, the townspeople, and the hunters who have antagonized Peter figure in the dénouement.', 'Peter is a slight lad, solitary, locked out of the woods by his protective grandfather, his only friend a duck. In town, he''s bullied. When a wolf menaces the duck - as well as grandfather''s fat cat and an ill-flying bird that Peter has befriended - Peter bravely tries to tree the wolf. Grandfather, the townspeople, and the hunters who have antagonized Peter figure in the dénouement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkJHVuvdzlL3KC8ehyemD3py6Eb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14518'),
  ('422635000489393943', 'Peter and the Wolf', 1946, 'Animation, Family', 'Clyde Geronimi', 'Eric Gurney, Sergei Prokofiev, Dick Huemer', 'Sterling Holloway', 'PG', 'Disney''s animated adaptation of Prokofiev''s masterpiece, in which every character is represented musically by a different instrument. Young Peter decides to go hunting for the wolf that''s been prowling around the village. Along the way, he is joined by his friends the bird, the duck and the cat. All the fun comes to end, however, when the wolf makes an appearance. Will Peter and his friends live to tell of their adventures?', 'Disney''s animated adaptation of Prokofiev''s masterpiece, in which every character is represented musically by a different instrument. Young Peter decides to go hunting for the wolf that''s been prowling around the village. Along the way, he is joined by his friends the bird, the duck and the cat. All the fun comes to end, however, when the wolf makes an appearance. Will Peter and his friends live to tell of their adventures?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjXh8JWgWXVXKfNOdY2915yyPQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31518'),
  ('574916764166871013', 'Peter and the Wolf', 1995, 'Family, Animation', 'Elaine Suranie, Jean Flynn, David E. West', 'Janis Diamond, George Daugherty', 'Kirstie Alley, Ross Malinger, Lloyd Bridges', null, 'Sergei Prokofiev''s symphonic masterpiece, first performed in Russia in 1936, has been lauded not only for the spectacular musical score, but also for the story itself--of a young boy who outwits a wily wolf. George Daugherty brings this timeless tale to modern audiences by seamlessly weaving live-action with animation and music by the RCA Symphony Orchestra. The story opens as a grandfather (Lloyd Bridges) hosts his daughter (Kirstie Alley) and grandson (Ross Malinger from Sleepless in Seattle) during a visit to his country cottage. After lunch, the trio settles in as grandfather recounts "The Story" of Peter''s adventures with a bird, cat, and dizzy duck on the outskirts "of a very dark forest." The film morphs into a clever cartoon designed by the legendary Chuck Jones (of Wile E. Coyote fame). The "story within a story" leaps to life while the accompanying musical instruments also emerge as playful personalities.', 'Sergei Prokofiev''s symphonic masterpiece, first performed in Russia in 1936, has been lauded not only for the spectacular musical score, but also for the story itself--of a young boy who outwits a wily wolf. George Daugherty brings this timeless tale to modern audiences by seamlessly weaving live-action with animation and music by the RCA Symphony Orchestra. The story opens as a grandfather (Lloyd Bridges) hosts his daughter (Kirstie Alley) and grandson (Ross Malinger from Sleepless in Seattle) during a visit to his country cottage. After lunch, the trio settles in as grandfather recounts "The Story" of Peter''s adventures with a bird, cat, and dizzy duck on the outskirts "of a very dark forest." The film morphs into a clever cartoon designed by the legendary Chuck Jones (of Wile E. Coyote fame). The "story within a story" leaps to life while the accompanying musical instruments also emerge as playful personalities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ao8U9teLB9FWumCzzvFshfHP6Ej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70032'),
  ('25306657487912669', 'Peter and Vandy', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jay DiPietro, Frankie DeMarco', 'Jay DiPietro', 'Jason Ritter, Jess Weixler, Jesse L. Martin, Tracie Thoms, Noah Bean, David Rasche, Bobby Aiello, Bruce Altman', null, 'Flashbacks and flash-forwards illustrate the rise and fall of a love affair between two New Yorkers.', 'Flashbacks and flash-forwards illustrate the rise and fall of a love affair between two New Yorkers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Isyd8exCJrYjXfZHQaRa9BgWAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34128'),
  ('295541031437696377', 'Peter Bell', 2002, 'Family, Comedy', 'Maria Peters', 'Maria Peters, Chris van Abkoude', 'Quinten Schram, Katja Herbers, Angela Groothuizen, Felix Strategier, Rick Engelkes, Arjan Ederveen, Stijn Westenend, Willem Nijholt', null, 'Peter is a cheerful -- but not very obedient -- boy from a very ordinary family in pre-war Rotterdam. His many pranks amuse some and cause a lot of trouble to others, even making the front pages of the big city newspapers. His growing popularity brings him many new friends, but also some very powerful enemies.', 'Peter is a cheerful -- but not very obedient -- boy from a very ordinary family in pre-war Rotterdam. His many pranks amuse some and cause a lot of trouble to others, even making the front pages of the big city newspapers. His growing popularity brings him many new friends, but also some very powerful enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sW3OSCbUbGtMGmbxSWW2x6VtpMN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28827'),
  ('983026116892586603', 'Peter Capusotto y sus 3 Dimensiones', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Saborido, Gabriel Pomeraniec', 'Diego Capusotto, Pedro Saborido', 'Diego Capusotto, Ivana Acosta, Jacqueline Decibe, Alfonso Sierra', null, 'Violencia Rivas, one of the characters created by Diego Capusotto and Pedro Saborido for their television program Peter Capusotto and their videos, reflects on the world of entertainment, while other characters of the same origin appear as examples of the different edges of the subject. Together they draw a satire on entertainment as a concept and industry, starting with "three-dimensional cinema", and analyzing with "practical" examples how the media, advertising, the Internet, and social networks are shaping a being alienated and docile, to thus form an anesthetized and consumerist society.', 'Violencia Rivas, one of the characters created by Diego Capusotto and Pedro Saborido for their television program Peter Capusotto and their videos, reflects on the world of entertainment, while other characters of the same origin appear as examples of the different edges of the subject. Together they draw a satire on entertainment as a concept and industry, starting with "three-dimensional cinema", and analyzing with "practical" examples how the media, advertising, the Internet, and social networks are shaping a being alienated and docile, to thus form an anesthetized and consumerist society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXmEIhaSy0LwoeVngFKjYKMw7C6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143999'),
  ('122604630485379289', 'Peter Falk versus Columbo', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Pascal Cuissot, Gaëlle Royer', null, 'Peter Falk, William Link, Julian Schlossberg, Annette Insdorf, Jeremy Kagan, Elaine Kagan, Steven Spielberg, Pascal Cuissot', null, 'For millions of viewers, Peter Falk is Columbo. Despite playing the quintessential blue-collar TV detective of the ''70s and ''80s, his early career is rarely explored. Using archive footage, interviews and extracts from his films and the TV show, the documentary pays tribute to the immortal character of Columbo, while shedding light on the actor’s life, one full of twists and turns, ups and downs.', 'For millions of viewers, Peter Falk is Columbo. Despite playing the quintessential blue-collar TV detective of the ''70s and ''80s, his early career is rarely explored. Using archive footage, interviews and extracts from his films and the TV show, the documentary pays tribute to the immortal character of Columbo, while shedding light on the actor’s life, one full of twists and turns, ups and downs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PfVNpD1eO0cowwKlxhbH1gbsyG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590390'),
  ('790043916091439363', 'Peter Gabriel: Secret World Live', 1994, 'Music, Documentary', 'François Girard', 'Robert Lepage, Peter Gabriel', 'Peter Gabriel, Tony Levin, David Rhodes, Paula Cole, Manu Katché, Papa Wemba, Lakshminarayana Shankar, Jean-Claude Naimro', null, 'Filmed in Modena, Italy across two nights in November 1993 as part of Peter Gabriel''s acclaimed Secret World Live tour in support of the Us album, the show is elaborately presented and choreographed with two stages joined by a narrow pier. Peter Gabriel has always been a charismatic live performer with the ability to draw his audience into the onstage world he has created and rarely has this been better captured than on Secret World Live.', 'Filmed in Modena, Italy across two nights in November 1993 as part of Peter Gabriel''s acclaimed Secret World Live tour in support of the Us album, the show is elaborately presented and choreographed with two stages joined by a narrow pier. Peter Gabriel has always been a charismatic live performer with the ability to draw his audience into the onstage world he has created and rarely has this been better captured than on Secret World Live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Y6TcAwWSUtIewgnIJv237kWEJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54253'),
  ('214028858770637869', 'Peter Ibbetson', 1935, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Henry Hathaway, Charles Lang, Ray Lissner', 'Vincent Lawrence, Waldemar Young', 'Gary Cooper, Ann Harding, John Halliday, Ida Lupino, Douglass Dumbrille, Virginia Weidler, Dickie Moore, Doris Lloyd', 'NR', 'When his mother dies, young Peter Ibbetson leaves Paris and his best friend, Mary, behind to live with a severe uncle in England. Years later, Peter is an architect with little time for women, until he begins a project with the Duke and Duchess of Towers. When Peter and the duchess become great friends, she reveals that she is Mary — but the duke soon suspects his wife of infidelity and challenges Peter to a duel, threatening the pair''s second chance.', 'When his mother dies, young Peter Ibbetson leaves Paris and his best friend, Mary, behind to live with a severe uncle in England. Years later, Peter is an architect with little time for women, until he begins a project with the Duke and Duchess of Towers. When Peter and the duchess become great friends, she reveals that she is Mary — but the duke soon suspects his wife of infidelity and challenges Peter to a duel, threatening the pair''s second chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQJvgDUJRtsUiv4UzGzBCGel95d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57412'),
  ('15473921776974568', 'Peter in Magicland', 1990, 'Animation, Family', 'Wolfgang Urchs', 'Wolfgang Urchs', 'André Schmidtsdorf, Nathalie del Castillo, Manfred Lichtenfeld, Michael Habeck, Friedrich W. Bauschulte, Udo Wachtveitl, Pascal Breuer, Bill Ramsey', null, 'After Sumsemann the beetle loses one of his arms to a troll, he invites brother and sister Peterchen and Annaliese to join him on a journey to the moon in a quest to retrieve his lost arm.', 'After Sumsemann the beetle loses one of his arms to a troll, he invites brother and sister Peterchen and Annaliese to join him on a journey to the moon in a quest to retrieve his lost arm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksks3BKxqgpdbvWBqx24XSvVFLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62892'),
  ('502128436797053642', 'Peter Kay: Live at the Top of the Tower', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Marcus Mortimer', 'Peter Kay', 'Peter Kay, Dave Spikey, Steve Edge, Peter Slater, Paddy McGuinness, Jayne Bickerton, Smug Roberts, Archie Kelly', null, 'Peter Kay''s hilarious stand up show. This is a live recording of his show in Blackpool which is one of the fastest selling comedy titles ever. Filmed in front of a packed, partisan crowd, Live At The Top Of The Tower is the freshest most hilarious stand up show from the country''s funniest new comedian.', 'Peter Kay''s hilarious stand up show. This is a live recording of his show in Blackpool which is one of the fastest selling comedy titles ever. Filmed in front of a packed, partisan crowd, Live At The Top Of The Tower is the freshest most hilarious stand up show from the country''s funniest new comedian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wl7M0qIj8SQf2ZVligHbIsGup48.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36044'),
  ('523167903682304069', 'Peter Knife', 1984, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Alfonso Rosas Priego Jr., Javier Durán, Agustín Lara Alvarado', 'Ramón Obón', 'Andrés García, Sergio Goyri, Adalberto Martínez, Maribel Guardia, Ana Luisa Peluffo, Bruno Rey, Rubi Re, Carmelina Encinas', null, 'The story of the coolest, street-smart hustler ever to walk the streets of Mexico City, based on the international hit song. The police are after him, his rivals are after him, and all the while the most beautiful women of Mexico are in the cup of his hand.', 'The story of the coolest, street-smart hustler ever to walk the streets of Mexico City, based on the international hit song. The police are after him, his rivals are after him, and all the while the most beautiful women of Mexico are in the cup of his hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bheQKzOvf52PZpK60XyUxGz55nE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255745'),
  ('355753970302015141', 'Peter Pan', 1924, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Herbert Brenon, James Wong Howe, Roy Pomeroy', 'Willis Goldbeck', 'Betty Bronson, Virginia Brown Faire, Ernest Torrence, Mary Brian, Anna May Wong, Jack Murphy, Philippe De Lacy, Edward Kipling', null, 'Peter Pan enters the nursery of the Darling children and, with the help of fairy dust, leads them off to Never Never Land, where they meet the nefarious Captain Hook.', 'Peter Pan enters the nursery of the Darling children and, with the help of fairy dust, leads them off to Never Never Land, where they meet the nefarious Captain Hook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZhpeVmPNaez39BKzH2AgLRDoAJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120672'),
  ('508197585901510051', 'Peter Pan', 1953, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Clyde Geronimi, Wilfred Jackson, Marc Davis', null, 'Bobby Driscoll, Kathryn Beaumont, Hans Conried, Bill Thompson, Heather Angel, Paul Collins, Tommy Luske, Candy Candido', 'G', 'Leaving the safety of their nursery behind, Wendy, Michael and John follow Peter Pan to a magical world where childhood lasts forever. But while in Neverland, the kids must face Captain Hook and foil his attempts to get rid of Peter for good.', 'Leaving the safety of their nursery behind, Wendy, Michael and John follow Peter Pan to a magical world where childhood lasts forever. But while in Neverland, the kids must face Captain Hook and foil his attempts to get rid of Peter for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJJOs1iyrhKfZceANxoPxPwNGF1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10693'),
  ('141747373073473827', 'Peter Pan', 1955, 'Fantasy, Music, TV Movie', 'Clark Jones, Jerome Robbins, Jerome Robbins', 'Adolph Green, Betty Comden, Carolyn Leigh', 'Mary Martin, Cyril Ritchard, Kathleen Nolan, Margalo Gillmore, Sondra Lee, Heller Halliday, Joe E. Marks, Norman Shelly', 'G', 'This musical version of the tale of the boy who wouldn''t grow up aired live on television on March 7, 1955. It was so popular that it was restaged the following year, and again four years later.', 'This musical version of the tale of the boy who wouldn''t grow up aired live on television on March 7, 1955. It was so popular that it was restaged the following year, and again four years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5hYIipuLI41eXWxN7r92AC4RH2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368186'),
  ('191602196093606436', 'Peter Pan', 1960, 'TV Movie, Fantasy, Family, Comedy, Music', 'Vincent J. Donehue', 'Jerome Robbins, Betty Comden, Adolph Green', 'Mary Martin, Cyril Ritchard, Lynn Fontanne, Maureen Bailey, Margalo Gillmore, Sondra Lee, Joe E. Marks, Norman Shelly', null, 'In this magical tale about the boy who refuses to grow up, Peter Pan and his mischievous fairy sidekick Tinkerbell visit the nursery of Wendy, Michael and John Darling. With a sprinkling of pixie dust, Peter and his new friends fly out the nursery window and over London to Never-Never Land. The children experience many wonderful and exciting adventures with the Lost Boys, Tiger Lily''s Indian tribe, and Peter''s arch enemy the dastardly pirate Captain Hook.', 'In this magical tale about the boy who refuses to grow up, Peter Pan and his mischievous fairy sidekick Tinkerbell visit the nursery of Wendy, Michael and John Darling. With a sprinkling of pixie dust, Peter and his new friends fly out the nursery window and over London to Never-Never Land. The children experience many wonderful and exciting adventures with the Lost Boys, Tiger Lily''s Indian tribe, and Peter''s arch enemy the dastardly pirate Captain Hook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCQ42aTmU4cuHwzfu8rCvYQuCyx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51120'),
  ('867843862641089610', 'Peter Pan', 1988, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Richard Trueblood, Davyd Cherkaskyi, Dani Montano', 'Paul Leadon', 'Phillip Hinton, Keith Scott, Daniel Floyd, Jonathon Panic, Caz Adams, Olivia Martin, Jaye Rosenberg, Michael Anthony', null, 'This animated fairy tale for kids tells the classic story of Peter Pan, the boy who never grew up. Determined never to become an adult, Peter stays forever young in a magical word called Neverland, where he leads a band of mischevious kids called the Lost Boys. Unfortunately, Neverland''s chief other inhabitant is a pirate named Captain Hook, who would like nothing more than to put a permanent end to Peter''s fun.', 'This animated fairy tale for kids tells the classic story of Peter Pan, the boy who never grew up. Determined never to become an adult, Peter stays forever young in a magical word called Neverland, where he leads a band of mischevious kids called the Lost Boys. Unfortunately, Neverland''s chief other inhabitant is a pirate named Captain Hook, who would like nothing more than to put a permanent end to Peter''s fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3068r7upUZru100Px4iY7xHwGE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46188'),
  ('891427415026204694', 'Peter Pan', 2003, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'P.J. Hogan, Donald McAlpine, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Michael Goldenberg, P.J. Hogan', 'Jeremy Sumpter, Jason Isaacs, Rachel Hurd-Wood, Ludivine Sagnier, Olivia Williams, Harry Newell, Freddie Popplewell, Lynn Redgrave', 'PG', 'In stifling Edwardian London, Wendy Darling mesmerizes her brothers every night with bedtime tales of swordplay, swashbuckling and the fearsome Captain Hook. But the children become the heroes of an even greater story, when Peter Pan flies into their nursery one night and leads them over moonlit rooftops through a galaxy of stars and to the lush jungles of Neverland.', 'In stifling Edwardian London, Wendy Darling mesmerizes her brothers every night with bedtime tales of swordplay, swashbuckling and the fearsome Captain Hook. But the children become the heroes of an even greater story, when Peter Pan flies into their nursery one night and leads them over moonlit rooftops through a galaxy of stars and to the lush jungles of Neverland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QdU3TZZrIvXFzoHOwafZAynFjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10601'),
  ('1049460356881644353', 'Peter Pan & Wendy', 2023, 'Family, Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Bojan Bazelli, Thomas Ma, Grant Van Der Slagt', 'Toby Halbrooks, David Lowery', 'Alexander Molony, Ever Anderson, Jude Law, Yara Shahidi, Alyssa Wapanatâhk, Jim Gaffigan, Joshua Blue Pickering, Jacobi Jupe', 'PG', 'Wendy Darling, a young girl afraid to leave her childhood home behind, meets Peter Pan, a boy who refuses to grow up. Alongside her brothers and a tiny fairy, Tinker Bell, she travels with Peter to the magical world of Neverland. There, she encounters an evil pirate captain, Captain Hook, and embarks on a thrilling adventure that will change her life forever.', 'Wendy Darling, a young girl afraid to leave her childhood home behind, meets Peter Pan, a boy who refuses to grow up. Alongside her brothers and a tiny fairy, Tinker Bell, she travels with Peter to the magical world of Neverland. There, she encounters an evil pirate captain, Captain Hook, and embarks on a thrilling adventure that will change her life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NXAlFEE7WDssbXSMgdacsUD58Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420808'),
  ('745786884205383314', 'Peter Pan Goes Wrong', 2016, 'Comedy, Family, Music', 'Dewi Humphreys', 'Henry Lewis, Henry Shields, Jonathan Sayer', 'David Suchet, Henry Shields, Nancy Zamit, Greg Tannahill, Charlie Russell, Dave Hearn, Henry Lewis, Jonathan Sayer', null, 'The Olivier Award-winning Mischief Theatre brings Peter Pan Goes Wrong to BBC One. As part of its commitment to community theatre, the BBC has commissioned The Cornley Polytechnic Drama Society, an amateur dramatics group, to recreate the JM Barrie classic as part of their festive programming. But can they pull it off? Narrated by David Suchet and filmed in front of a live audience, watch as Peter Pan flies through the air, Captain Hook and his pirates set adrift in the lagoon, and Tinkerbell is due to light up the stage in a stunning electrical costume... what can possibly go wrong?! With their trademark comic mayhem, expect hilarious stunts, chaos, technical hitches, flying mishaps and cast disputes on the way to Neverland with hilarious and disastrous results.', 'The Olivier Award-winning Mischief Theatre brings Peter Pan Goes Wrong to BBC One. As part of its commitment to community theatre, the BBC has commissioned The Cornley Polytechnic Drama Society, an amateur dramatics group, to recreate the JM Barrie classic as part of their festive programming. But can they pull it off? Narrated by David Suchet and filmed in front of a live audience, watch as Peter Pan flies through the air, Captain Hook and his pirates set adrift in the lagoon, and Tinkerbell is due to light up the stage in a stunning electrical costume... what can possibly go wrong?! With their trademark comic mayhem, expect hilarious stunts, chaos, technical hitches, flying mishaps and cast disputes on the way to Neverland with hilarious and disastrous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w51RLl8xLyFbSWDndMw5lgaxx3K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432484'),
  ('391053188243892972', 'Peter Pan''s Neverland Nightmare', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Scott Chambers, Ben J. Williams, Vince Knight', 'Scott Chambers', 'Megan Placito, Martin Portlock, Kit Green, Peter DeSouza-Feighoney, Teresa Banham, Ardy Yusuf, Olumide Olorunfemi, Campbell Wallace', 'NR', 'Wendy Darling strikes out in an attempt to rescue her brother Michael from the clutches of the evil Peter Pan who intends to send him to Neverland. Along the way she meets a twisted Tinkerbell, who is hooked on what she thinks is fairy dust.', 'Wendy Darling strikes out in an attempt to rescue her brother Michael from the clutches of the evil Peter Pan who intends to send him to Neverland. Along the way she meets a twisted Tinkerbell, who is hooked on what she thinks is fairy dust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhTG3gMlJa0nFlOS7WNKUJ2EDro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020414'),
  ('87020233774394249', 'Peter Rabbit', 2018, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Andrew Power, Danielle Blake, Barney Shakespeare', 'Will Gluck, Rob Lieber', 'James Corden, Rose Byrne, Domhnall Gleeson, Margot Robbie, Elizabeth Debicki, Daisy Ridley, Colin Moody, Sam Neill', 'PG', 'Peter Rabbit''s feud with Mr. McGregor escalates to greater heights than ever before as they rival for the affections of the warm-hearted animal lover who lives next door.', 'Peter Rabbit''s feud with Mr. McGregor escalates to greater heights than ever before as they rival for the affections of the warm-hearted animal lover who lives next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lugOvdaNpbVGQK9TyMRDiUbLtY6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381719'),
  ('48688575406121365', 'Peter Rabbit 2: The Runaway', 2021, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Will Gluck, Peter Menzies Jr.', 'Will Gluck, Patrick Burleigh', 'James Corden, Rose Byrne, Domhnall Gleeson, David Oyelowo, Margot Robbie, Elizabeth Debicki, Aimee Horne, Colin Moody', 'PG', 'Peter Rabbit runs away from his human family when he learns they are going to portray him in a bad light in their book. Soon, he crosses paths with an older rabbit who ropes him into a heist.', 'Peter Rabbit runs away from his human family when he learns they are going to portray him in a bad light in their book. Soon, he crosses paths with an older rabbit who ropes him into a heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cycDz68DtTjJrDJ1fV8EBq2Xdpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522478'),
  ('909134868480219511', 'Peter the First, Part I', 1937, 'Drama, War, History', 'Vladimir Petrov, Vyacheslav Gardanov, Vladimir Yakovlev', 'Vladimir Petrov, Aleksei Tolstoy', 'Nikolai Simonov, Mikhail Zharov, Nikolai Cherkasov, Mikhail Tarkhanov, Viktor Dobrovolsky, Alla Tarasova, Konstantin Gibshman, Nikolai Orlov', null, 'This, the first Soviet depiction of Peter the Great, set the stage for what would become the post-Revolutionary line concerning the early Romanovs. Rulers like Ivan the Terrible and Peter the Great were widely admired for their dedication to Russia and their absolute determination to enhance her position in the world. But praise for the hated later Romanovs conflicted too heavily with the very beliefs that had brought about the Revolution in 1917.', 'This, the first Soviet depiction of Peter the Great, set the stage for what would become the post-Revolutionary line concerning the early Romanovs. Rulers like Ivan the Terrible and Peter the Great were widely admired for their dedication to Russia and their absolute determination to enhance her position in the world. But praise for the hated later Romanovs conflicted too heavily with the very beliefs that had brought about the Revolution in 1917.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHlhjWUqrtROM89uCtf8jOJrypL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139461'),
  ('263986772831968998', 'Peter von Kant', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'François Ozon, Thibault Frey, Marion Dehaene', 'François Ozon', 'Denis Ménochet, Isabelle Adjani, Khalil Ben Gharbia, Hanna Schygulla, Stefan Crepon, Aminthe Audiard', null, 'Peter von Kant, a successful, famous director, lives with his assistant Karl, whom he likes to mistreat and humiliate. Through the great actress Sidonie, he meets and falls in love with Amir, a handsome young man of modest means. He offers to share his apartment and help Amir break into the world of cinema. Several months later, Amir becomes a star. But as soon as he acquires fame, he breaks up with Peter, leaving him alone to face himself.', 'Peter von Kant, a successful, famous director, lives with his assistant Karl, whom he likes to mistreat and humiliate. Through the great actress Sidonie, he meets and falls in love with Amir, a handsome young man of modest means. He offers to share his apartment and help Amir break into the world of cinema. Several months later, Amir becomes a star. But as soon as he acquires fame, he breaks up with Peter, leaving him alone to face himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZTjS0XmJHCAcp0jWj6tR64hAeJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807862'),
  ('167545445601677630', 'Peter-No-Tail', 1981, 'Romance, Family, Animation, Drama', 'Jan Gissberg, Stig Lasseby', 'Leif Krantz', 'Mats Åhlfeldt, Ewa Fröling, Ernst-Hugo Järegård, Carl Billquist, Björn Gustafson, Wallis Grahn, Lena-Pia Bernhardsson, Charlie Elvegård', null, 'Peter-No-Tail is a cat who''s born without a proper tail on a farm by the Swedish countryside. Due to economical difficulties, the farmer is forced to get rid of Peter. The farmer can''t bring himself to drown the cat, so he sneaks Peter inside the car of a family who are renting a house close to the farm for their summer vacation. When the family finally reach their home in Uppsala, Sweden, they find Peter and decide to keep him. Without a tail, he becomes the talk of the town among the other cats and, especially Mike, who teases him cruelly. Mean Mike and his two companions, Bill and Bull, are notorious for the nasty tricks they like to play on other cats. Mike is currently trying to court Molly Silk-Nose, but his rough and silly approach does not impress her, since she becomes interested in the kind and gentle Peter. But Mike won''t give up that easily and he has a plan for how he''ll get his revenge.', 'Peter-No-Tail is a cat who''s born without a proper tail on a farm by the Swedish countryside. Due to economical difficulties, the farmer is forced to get rid of Peter. The farmer can''t bring himself to drown the cat, so he sneaks Peter inside the car of a family who are renting a house close to the farm for their summer vacation. When the family finally reach their home in Uppsala, Sweden, they find Peter and decide to keep him. Without a tail, he becomes the talk of the town among the other cats and, especially Mike, who teases him cruelly. Mean Mike and his two companions, Bill and Bull, are notorious for the nasty tricks they like to play on other cats. Mike is currently trying to court Molly Silk-Nose, but his rough and silly approach does not impress her, since she becomes interested in the kind and gentle Peter. But Mike won''t give up that easily and he has a plan for how he''ll get his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TOVrc6wQV7wlMTeNHmeOUlk07G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47542'),
  ('135085746356791633', 'Peter-No-Tail in Americat', 1985, 'Animation, Family', 'Stig Lasseby, Jan Gissberg', null, 'Erik Lindgren, Ewa Fröling, Ernst-Hugo Järegård, Carl Billquist, Björn Gustafson, Stellan Skarsgård, Mille Schmidt, Agneta Prytz', null, 'Peter-No-Tail (Pelle Svanslös) is a cat who was born without a tail. He compensates this by studying hard and, much to the dismay of his arch-rival Magnus (Måns), he receives a fancy university degree very few cats in the university town Uppsala, Sweden have obtained. Peter is visited by his American relative Pelle Swanson who invites him to visit his new home country America - in the movie called Americat. There everything is bigger and everything seems possible.', 'Peter-No-Tail (Pelle Svanslös) is a cat who was born without a tail. He compensates this by studying hard and, much to the dismay of his arch-rival Magnus (Måns), he receives a fancy university degree very few cats in the university town Uppsala, Sweden have obtained. Peter is visited by his American relative Pelle Swanson who invites him to visit his new home country America - in the movie called Americat. There everything is bigger and everything seems possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zs4HsWp79Hdh1M5mc4atmtxIAW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62429'),
  ('61400677453134098', 'Peter''s Friends', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Keith Young, Christopher Newman, Carl Oprey', 'Martin Bergman, Rita Rudner', 'Kenneth Branagh, Stephen Fry, Emma Thompson, Hugh Laurie, Imelda Staunton, Alphonsia Emmanuel, Rita Rudner, Phyllida Law', 'R', 'After inheriting a large country estate from his late father, Peter invites his friends from college: married couple Roger and Mary, the lonely Maggie, fashionable Sarah, and writer Andrew, who brings his American TV star wife, Carol. Sarah''s new boyfriend, Brian, also attends. It has been 10 years since college, and they find their lives are very different.', 'After inheriting a large country estate from his late father, Peter invites his friends from college: married couple Roger and Mary, the lonely Maggie, fashionable Sarah, and writer Andrew, who brings his American TV star wife, Carol. Sarah''s new boyfriend, Brian, also attends. It has been 10 years since college, and they find their lives are very different.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ly4EB83JlOkjBD6wOTU0ReXMQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11790'),
  ('979702281960189009', 'Peter''s To-Do List', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Jon Watts', 'Erik Sommers, Chris McKenna', 'Tom Holland, Jacob Batalon, Hemky Madera, Tony Revolori, Tuwaine Barrett, Kristen Alminta, Brendan Murphy, Angourie Rice', 'PG-13', 'On the eve of his departure to Europe, Peter Parker tells Ned Leeds that he has several things to do before they leave.', 'On the eve of his departure to Europe, Peter Parker tells Ned Leeds that he has several things to do before they leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LoW0WMYHwhxXQr1wz6xCVRiX9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758025'),
  ('743827621121947668', 'Peterloo', 2018, 'History, Drama', 'Dan Channing-Williams, Sophie Freeman, Frank Macpherson', 'Mike Leigh', 'Rory Kinnear, Maxine Peake, Pearce Quigley, David Moorst, Rachel Finnegan, Tom Meredith, Simona Bitmate, Robert Wilfort', 'PG-13', 'An epic portrayal of the events surrounding the infamous 1819 Peterloo Massacre, where a peaceful pro-democracy rally at St Peter’s Field in Manchester turned into one of the bloodiest and most notorious episodes in British history. The massacre saw British government forces charge into a crowd of over 60,000 that had gathered to demand political reforms and protest against rising levels of poverty.', 'An epic portrayal of the events surrounding the infamous 1819 Peterloo Massacre, where a peaceful pro-democracy rally at St Peter’s Field in Manchester turned into one of the bloodiest and most notorious episodes in British history. The massacre saw British government forces charge into a crowd of over 60,000 that had gathered to demand political reforms and protest against rising levels of poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUQD6QBwNgSiiOAcNcTOd4qGRId.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399440'),
  ('66313054008378738', 'Petey Wheatstraw', 1977, 'Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Horror', 'Cliff Roquemore, Nicholas Josef von Sternberg', 'Cliff Roquemore', 'Rudy Ray Moore, Jimmy Lynch, Leroy Daniels, Ernest Mayhand, Ebony Wright, Steve Gallon, G. Tito Shaw, Ted Clemmons', 'R', 'Petey Wheatstraw is a candidate to become the devil''s son-in-law. The storyline is a scaffolding on which Rudy Ray Moore''s standup humor can be unfolded. Beginning life as the afterbirth to a watermelon, the young Wheatstraw becomes a martial artist, but is unable to best the evil comedy team of Leroy and Skillet, who also indulge in wholesale murder. Satan restores the comedians'' victims to life, and charges Petey with the task of marrying his clock-stoppingly ugly daughter to give him a grandchild. When Petey attempts to default on the deal, he is pursued by the devil''s henchmen.', 'Petey Wheatstraw is a candidate to become the devil''s son-in-law. The storyline is a scaffolding on which Rudy Ray Moore''s standup humor can be unfolded. Beginning life as the afterbirth to a watermelon, the young Wheatstraw becomes a martial artist, but is unable to best the evil comedy team of Leroy and Skillet, who also indulge in wholesale murder. Satan restores the comedians'' victims to life, and charges Petey with the task of marrying his clock-stoppingly ugly daughter to give him a grandchild. When Petey attempts to default on the deal, he is pursued by the devil''s henchmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQFFMMMupaCAdWcgnBjVVlbK5wq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34792'),
  ('37947237307765075', 'Petia and Little Red Riding Hood', 1958, 'Family, Comedy, Animation', 'Boris Stepantsev, Yevgeni Raykovskiy, Aleksandr Astafyev', 'Vladimir Suteev', 'Sergei Martinson, Valentina Tumanova, Valentina Sperantova, Sergei Filippov, Yuliya Yulskaya', null, 'A boy finds his way into the Little Red Riding Hood cartoon in order to save the girl from the Big Bad Wolf.', 'A boy finds his way into the Little Red Riding Hood cartoon in order to save the girl from the Big Bad Wolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/entKhDnmIWoCcSHrV1vr07FFMzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77297'),
  ('826131294902981516', 'Petit frère et petite sœur', 1897, 'Documentary, Family', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Marcel Koehler, Madeleine Koehler', null, 'In a grove, a small boy and a small girl are dancing together.', 'In a grove, a small boy and a small girl are dancing together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adT2RVg116CDt9AKetzlPW9BT8C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321756'),
  ('370757467590501078', 'Petite Maman', 2021, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jérémy Debord, Marine Longuet, Céline Sciamma', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Joséphine Sanz, Gabrielle Sanz, Nina Meurisse, Stéphane Varupenne, Margot Abascal, Florès Cardo, Josée Schuller, Guylène Péan', 'PG', 'After the death of her beloved grandmother, eight-year-old Nelly meets a strangely familiar girl her own age in the woods. Instantly forming a connection with this mysterious new friend, Nelly embarks on a fantastical journey of discovery which helps her come to terms with this newfound loss.', 'After the death of her beloved grandmother, eight-year-old Nelly meets a strangely familiar girl her own age in the woods. Instantly forming a connection with this mysterious new friend, Nelly embarks on a fantastical journey of discovery which helps her come to terms with this newfound loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxl2ARZO2vRfUGDfqSz2bostauE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749004'),
  ('594607166065652051', 'Petition', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Zhao Liang', null, null, null, 'The dysfunctional Chinese justice system allows citizens with grievances against their local governments to petition the court to clear or correct their record. Yet in order to do so, the petitioners must travel to Beijing to file paperwork and wait an indefinite period to plead their case. Following the saga of a group of petitioners over the years of 1996 and 2008, Petition unfolds like a novel by Zola or Dickens. This was filmed surreptitiously from the point of view of the petitioners, and not the justice officials, the police, or those heavies sent by the municipalities.', 'The dysfunctional Chinese justice system allows citizens with grievances against their local governments to petition the court to clear or correct their record. Yet in order to do so, the petitioners must travel to Beijing to file paperwork and wait an indefinite period to plead their case. Following the saga of a group of petitioners over the years of 1996 and 2008, Petition unfolds like a novel by Zola or Dickens. This was filmed surreptitiously from the point of view of the petitioners, and not the justice officials, the police, or those heavies sent by the municipalities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fG1mjOJ9E63WrGvWhvyl9rwtuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124991'),
  ('658324874021306512', 'Petra', 2018, 'Drama', 'Jaime Rosales, Hélène Louvart', 'Jaime Rosales, Michel Gaztambide, Clara Roquet', 'Bárbara Lennie, Àlex Brendemühl, Marisa Paredes, Oriol Pla, Joan Botey, Petra Martínez, Carme Pla, Chema del Barco', null, 'Petra doesn’t know who her father is. Her entire life, it’s been hidden from her. After the death of her mother, she embarks on a search that leads her to Jaume, a famous artist and a powerful, ruthless man. On her path to uncovering the truth, Petra also meets Jaume’s son, Lucas, as well as Marisa, his mother and Jaume’s wife. That is when the story of these characters begins to intertwine in a spiral of malice, family secrets and violence that drives them all to the edge. But fate’s cruel logic is derailed by a twist that opens a path to hope and redemption.', 'Petra doesn’t know who her father is. Her entire life, it’s been hidden from her. After the death of her mother, she embarks on a search that leads her to Jaume, a famous artist and a powerful, ruthless man. On her path to uncovering the truth, Petra also meets Jaume’s son, Lucas, as well as Marisa, his mother and Jaume’s wife. That is when the story of these characters begins to intertwine in a spiral of malice, family secrets and violence that drives them all to the edge. But fate’s cruel logic is derailed by a twist that opens a path to hope and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diWhCjEddiKR4NHiuriTteyynGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449020'),
  ('829742089835453020', 'Petria''s Wreath', 1980, 'Drama', 'Srđan Karanović, Ivo Laurenčić, Tomislav Pinter', null, 'Mirjana Karanović, Dragan Maksimović, Pavle Vuisić, Marko Nikolić, Olivera Marković, Veljko Mandić, Ljiljana Krstić, Milivoje ''Mića'' Tomić', null, 'This film takes place in a small mining town in Serbia, within a time span covering the prewar, war, and postwar period. A story about tragic life of an illiterate woman from village, about her life with three men she loved. Her life, torn between dreams and reality, is a life of suffering, loneliness, disappointment, hope and love.', 'This film takes place in a small mining town in Serbia, within a time span covering the prewar, war, and postwar period. A story about tragic life of an illiterate woman from village, about her life with three men she loved. Her life, torn between dreams and reality, is a life of suffering, loneliness, disappointment, hope and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3e5I9ViRatHO0LeCc6lJkXHALp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283124'),
  ('328919820768271812', 'Petrol Kings', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Zeki Alasya', 'Zeki Alasya', 'Zeki Alasya, Metin Akpınar, Suna Yıldızoğlu, Mine Sun, Perran Kutman, Ali Şen, Osman Alyanak, Yalçın Avşar', null, 'Zeki and Metin are two close friends who want to get married with the girls they love but they are both broke. One day they find petrol from their garden and everything changes. They become rich by selling the petrol that they found in their garden. The value of the house triples all of a sudden.', 'Zeki and Metin are two close friends who want to get married with the girls they love but they are both broke. One day they find petrol from their garden and everything changes. They become rich by selling the petrol that they found in their garden. The value of the house triples all of a sudden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51VXzeU1kvW3qVtIOpUHTuKkl9v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132855'),
  ('507321258084841846', 'Pétrole ! Pétrole !', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Christian Gion', 'Christian Gion', 'Jean-Pierre Marielle, Bernard Blier, Catherine Alric, Henri Guybet, Charles Gérard, Michel Modo, Okacha Touita', null, 'Le PDG d''une importante société pétrolière voit ses manoeuvres illicites déjouées par un jeune concurrent dont la femme n''est autre que la fille de son fournisseur arabe.', 'Le PDG d''une importante société pétrolière voit ses manoeuvres illicites déjouées par un jeune concurrent dont la femme n''est autre que la fille de son fournisseur arabe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxrYjaTb9ZJwEtzO897iBHidRJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76454'),
  ('352264801328440436', 'Petrov''s Flu', 2021, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Nadezhda Ilyukevich, Aleksandr Yegorov, Aleksandr Vdovenko', 'Kirill Serebrennikov', 'Semen Serzin, Chulpan Khamatova, Yulia Peresild, Yuri Kolokolnikov, Yura Borisov, Ivan Dorn, Aleksandr Ilyin Jr, Sergey Dreyden', null, 'A day in the life of a comic book artist and his family in Russia. While suffering from the flu, Petrov is carried by his friend Igor on a long walk, drifting in and out of fantasy and reality.', 'A day in the life of a comic book artist and his family in Russia. While suffering from the flu, Petrov is carried by his friend Igor on a long walk, drifting in and out of fantasy and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21tEnMDu4eZ2kYPcdcwibxEqiYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609490'),
  ('469740480971368654', 'Pets', 1973, 'Drama', 'Raphael Nussbaum', 'Raphael Nussbaum, Richard Reich', 'Candice Rialson, Ed Bishop, Joan Blackman, Teri Guzman, Frank Parker, Matt Green, K.T. Stevens, Mike Cartel', 'R', 'Naive, but brash and sultry teenage runaway Bonnie finds herself lost and adrift in America. The lovely young lass runs afoul of a colorful array of evil oddballs who all treat her like an object.', 'Naive, but brash and sultry teenage runaway Bonnie finds herself lost and adrift in America. The lovely young lass runs afoul of a colorful array of evil oddballs who all treat her like an object.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bc367oSa46SMJWZhd3L51Xbl4yD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90949'),
  ('894194127611161960', 'Pets on a Train', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Thriller', 'Benoît Daffis, Jean-Christian Tassy', 'Jean-François Tosti, Eric Tosti, David Alaux', 'Damien Ferrette, Hervé Jolly, Kaycie Chase, Frantz Confiac, Emmanuel Garijo, Nicolas Marié, Stéphane Ronchewski, Sébastien Desjours', 'PG', 'When a train unexpectedly starts up, taking only pets with it, the animals discover that Hans, a badger with a grudge is behind it all. While the crash seems inevitable, the animals can count on Falcon, a roguish Raccoon who will do anything to save them.', 'When a train unexpectedly starts up, taking only pets with it, the animals discover that Hans, a badger with a grudge is behind it all. While the crash seems inevitable, the animals can count on Falcon, a roguish Raccoon who will do anything to save them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b10qy1KwrfmH0MGS2rBUJ0BxgYB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1107216'),
  ('439561004508020091', 'Pets or Meat: The Return to Flint', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Michael Moore, Edward Lachman', 'Michael Moore', 'Michael Moore, Janet K. Rauch, Fred Ross, Rhonda Britton, Roger B. Smith, George H. W. Bush', null, 'Follow-up to Roger & Me.', 'Follow-up to Roger & Me.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uatVKyLQvLCUsSVuqQcK52XMx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123097'),
  ('368434452289161306', 'Pets United', 2019, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Reinhard Klooss', 'Reinhard Klooss', 'Natalie Dormer, Eddie Marsan, Jeff Burrell, Harvey Friedman, Jan Odle, Bryan Larkin, Naomi McDonald, Tom Haywood', null, 'When Roger (a Robin Hood-esque, stray dog) and Belle (an elegant yet spoilt pet cat) are thrown together amidst the chaos of a robot take-over of their home city, they must push all their preconceptions aside in order to survive, as they embark on a high-stakes, action-packed adventure.', 'When Roger (a Robin Hood-esque, stray dog) and Belle (an elegant yet spoilt pet cat) are thrown together amidst the chaos of a robot take-over of their home city, they must push all their preconceptions aside in order to survive, as they embark on a high-stakes, action-packed adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtwqIYSOCRwEndZTg9s6iWjEZc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638134'),
  ('162097214782902188', 'Petta', 2019, 'Action', 'Karthik Subbaraj, Srinivasan Elangovan, Charukesh Sekar', 'Karthik Subbaraj', 'Rajinikanth, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Vijay Sethupathi, Sananth, M. Sasikumar, Bobby Simha, Simran, Trisha Krishnan', null, 'A hostel warden becomes the target of a dreaded politician and his gangster son, but little do they realise that it is they who should fear him.', 'A hostel warden becomes the target of a dreaded politician and his gangster son, but little do they realise that it is they who should fear him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icrS7HzjT9DsionJLSnYFfjR9rW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534993'),
  ('712369178907180742', 'Pettin'' in the Park', 1934, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Bernard B. Brown', null, null, null, 'While at the park, a group of birds engage in a swimming contest. Another cartoon by Warner Brothers promoting a song from its movie "Gold Diggers of 1933".', 'While at the park, a group of birds engage in a swimming contest. Another cartoon by Warner Brothers promoting a song from its movie "Gold Diggers of 1933".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofBs2DjpfDSbdGz6Jpoo0y3WJQx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174440'),
  ('441551896339419357', 'Pettson and Findus: A Little Nuisance, a Great Friendship', 2014, 'Family, Comedy, Animation', 'Mathias Neumann, Ali Samadi Ahadi', 'Thomas Springer', 'Ulrich Noethen, Marianne Sägebrecht, Max Herbrechter, Roxana Samadi, Ali Samadi Ahadi, Lilian-Maria, Kristiina Tuomi, Navid Navid', null, 'Old farmer Pettson gets a kitten from his neighbour Mrs Kosonen and calls the cat Viiru. When Viiru starts to talk, the two become inseparable friends.', 'Old farmer Pettson gets a kitten from his neighbour Mrs Kosonen and calls the cat Viiru. When Viiru starts to talk, the two become inseparable friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSZRDkiwFYYJyrT7tPA7S0xo4Xy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262682'),
  ('941491770814528786', 'Pettson and Findus: Findus Moves House', 2018, 'Family, Animation', 'Mathias Neumann, Ali Samadi Ahadi', 'Thomas Springer', 'Stefan Kurt, Marianne Sägebrecht, Max Herbrechter, Roxana Samadi', null, 'The old man Petterson is trying to sleep but his cat Findus is keeping him awake, so they both agree that Findus shall have his own house.', 'The old man Petterson is trying to sleep but his cat Findus is keeping him awake, so they both agree that Findus shall have his own house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pXr7yT18nfOg2qkNM06RvdOBij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532811'),
  ('906650128058523401', 'Pettson and Findus: The Best Christmas Ever', 2016, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Mathias Neumann, Ali Samadi Ahadi', 'Thomas Springer', 'Max Herbrechter, Stefan Kurt, Marianne Sägebrecht, Roxana Samadi, Ali N. Askin', null, 'Pettson and Findus find themselves snowed in their house. The little cat is scared that Christmas is ruined, but Pettson promises that they will celebrate "the best Christmas ever".', 'Pettson and Findus find themselves snowed in their house. The little cat is scared that Christmas is ruined, but Pettson promises that they will celebrate "the best Christmas ever".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRd9oTEp1HHl4GQAVkFMmqLwOXN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423516'),
  ('544601847450141676', 'Petty Romance', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kim Joung-hoon, Choi Young-hwan', 'Kim Joung-hoon, Jo Jin-kuk, Shin Kwang-Ho', 'Lee Sun-kyun, Choi Kang-hee, Oh Jung-se, Ryu Hyun-kyung, Baek Do-bin, Lee Won-jong, Cho Eun-ji, Hwang Bo-ra', null, 'A comic artist and an unemployed sex columnist are trying to work together in order to win a lucrative comic-book competition.', 'A comic artist and an unemployed sex columnist are trying to work together in order to win a lucrative comic-book competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pclmmZAGZimdokF3ZmMF2yAn54K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63465'),
  ('416064445650618949', 'Petulia', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Lester, Nicolas Roeg, John D. Bloss', 'Lawrence B. Marcus', 'Julie Christie, George C. Scott, Richard Chamberlain, Arthur Hill, Shirley Knight, Pippa Scott, Kathleen Widdoes, Richard Dysart', 'R', 'Dr. Archie Bollen is having a midlife crisis. He''s just divorced his wife and is establishing a new life for himself. One night, he catches the eye of Petulia Danner, a charming, free-spirited young woman. Petulia''s vibrant personality hides her fear of her abusive husband, David, whose father is a powerful society figure. As Petulia and Archie''s feelings for each other grow, they must decide what it is they truly want.', 'Dr. Archie Bollen is having a midlife crisis. He''s just divorced his wife and is establishing a new life for himself. One night, he catches the eye of Petulia Danner, a charming, free-spirited young woman. Petulia''s vibrant personality hides her fear of her abusive husband, David, whose father is a powerful society figure. As Petulia and Archie''s feelings for each other grow, they must decide what it is they truly want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0r0HPm4PEPNZL93lwE1fCGvL0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42634'),
  ('37255579019967470', 'Peut-être', 1999, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Cédric Klapisch, Philippe Le Sourd', 'Alexis Galmot, Santiago Amigorena, Christian Vincent', 'Romain Duris, Jean-Paul Belmondo, Géraldine Pailhas, Julie Depardieu, Emmanuelle Devos, Dominique Frot, Léa Drucker, Mathieu Genet', null, 'Arthur is invited to a New Year''s Eve party to celebrate the year 2000. His girlfriend Lucie would like a baby from him but he refuses. Through the ceiling of the toilets, he discovers a passage leading to this futurist Paris. There, he meets an old man Ako who affirms he is his son and that he wants to exist. Otherwise he will vanish into the air. Arthur is still hesitant because his life is an unfulfilled one: a has a little lucrative job, is uncertain about his future and things are getting out of hand when Ako discovers the passage and interferes in the party.', 'Arthur is invited to a New Year''s Eve party to celebrate the year 2000. His girlfriend Lucie would like a baby from him but he refuses. Through the ceiling of the toilets, he discovers a passage leading to this futurist Paris. There, he meets an old man Ako who affirms he is his son and that he wants to exist. Otherwise he will vanish into the air. Arthur is still hesitant because his life is an unfulfilled one: a has a little lucrative job, is uncertain about his future and things are getting out of hand when Ako discovers the passage and interferes in the party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crHfjsE7ZE8yMa7bilCLbOsaHZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11957'),
  ('960452772792973401', 'Peyote', 2013, 'Drama', 'Omar Flores Sarabia', 'Sabdyel Almazan, Omar Flores Sarabia', 'Joe Diazzi, Carlos Luque', null, 'Pablo, a shy teenager, meets Marco, who is a few years older than him. Together they go on a impromptu road trip to the Mexican desert, a trip that will make them face what they mean to each other. This experience will turn Pablo’s life around: his points of view, his strength and his own sexuality. Two guys and a video camera that will record their friendship, struggles and the possibility to find another destiny.', 'Pablo, a shy teenager, meets Marco, who is a few years older than him. Together they go on a impromptu road trip to the Mexican desert, a trip that will make them face what they mean to each other. This experience will turn Pablo’s life around: his points of view, his strength and his own sexuality. Two guys and a video camera that will record their friendship, struggles and the possibility to find another destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Z8uydukbZFRSEJo1oaP6mOUl55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238965'),
  ('331837070993359568', 'Peyote Queen', 1965, 'Animation', 'Storm De Hirsch', null, null, null, 'Peyote Queen opens with black-and-white perforations that pulsate to the beat of drumming and escalate to light-bathed split screens and kaleidoscopic effects. Switching to lively organ accompaniment, the film pours out a stream of simple scratchings that rollick across the screen. Fish, breasts, flowers, boats, water, lips, hearts, stars—the hieroglyphs explode with color and celebrate the female creative force. The surge slows with the return of ritual drumming, this time with chanting, and a self-reflective coda. -- National Film Preservation Foundation', 'Peyote Queen opens with black-and-white perforations that pulsate to the beat of drumming and escalate to light-bathed split screens and kaleidoscopic effects. Switching to lively organ accompaniment, the film pours out a stream of simple scratchings that rollick across the screen. Fish, breasts, flowers, boats, water, lips, hearts, stars—the hieroglyphs explode with color and celebrate the female creative force. The surge slows with the return of ritual drumming, this time with chanting, and a self-reflective coda. -- National Film Preservation Foundation', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0AAeY2w09a5mYHfxPmXIYRStXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132370'),
  ('967806057036801765', 'Peyton Place', 1957, 'Drama, Romance', 'William C. Mellor, Mark Robson, Jack Gertsman', 'John Michael Hayes', 'Lana Turner, Hope Lange, Lee Philips, Lloyd Nolan, Diane Varsi, Arthur Kennedy, Russ Tamblyn, Terry Moore', null, 'In the outwardly respectable New England community of Peyton Place, shopkeeper Constance McKenzie tries to make up for a past indiscretion -- which resulted in her illegitimate daughter Allison -- by adopting a chaste, prudish attitude towards all things sexual. In spite of herself, Constance can''t help but be attracted to handsome new teacher Michael Rossi. Meanwhile, the restless Allison, who''d like to be as footloose and fancy-free as the town''s "fast girl" Betty Anderson, falls sincerely in love with mixed-up mama''s boy Norman Page.', 'In the outwardly respectable New England community of Peyton Place, shopkeeper Constance McKenzie tries to make up for a past indiscretion -- which resulted in her illegitimate daughter Allison -- by adopting a chaste, prudish attitude towards all things sexual. In spite of herself, Constance can''t help but be attracted to handsome new teacher Michael Rossi. Meanwhile, the restless Allison, who''d like to be as footloose and fancy-free as the town''s "fast girl" Betty Anderson, falls sincerely in love with mixed-up mama''s boy Norman Page.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSANpoBLMbejWTtiKz630eSaDpi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43236'),
  ('116797964948963055', 'PG: Psycho Goreman', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Horror', 'Chris Nash, Steven Kostanski, Andrew Appelle', 'Steven Kostanski', 'Nita-Josee Hanna, Owen Myre, Matthew Ninaber, Steven Vlahos, Adam Brooks, Alexis Hancey, Kristen MacCulloch, Anna Tierney', 'R', 'Siblings Mimi and Luke unwittingly resurrect an ancient alien overlord. Using a magical amulet, they force the monster to obey their childish whims, and accidentally attract a rogues’ gallery of intergalactic assassins to small-town suburbia.', 'Siblings Mimi and Luke unwittingly resurrect an ancient alien overlord. Using a magical amulet, they force the monster to obey their childish whims, and accidentally attract a rogues’ gallery of intergalactic assassins to small-town suburbia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28Y3pxfkRZMhLsw4if6e3J0HD7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670428'),
  ('830998429261762533', 'Phaedra', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jules Dassin, George Koukopoulos, Roy Millichip', 'Jules Dassin', 'Melina Mercouri, Anthony Perkins, Raf Vallone, Elizabeth Ercy, Tzavalas Karousos, Zorz Sarri, Andreas Filippides, Olympia Papadouka', 'NR', 'A modern retelling of the Greek myth of Phaedra. The young and fiery second wife of an extremely wealthy shipping magnate meets her estranged stepson Alexis and sparks immediately fly. Their love seems doomed from the beginning when she convinces him to come to Paris to meet his father.', 'A modern retelling of the Greek myth of Phaedra. The young and fiery second wife of an extremely wealthy shipping magnate meets her estranged stepson Alexis and sparks immediately fly. Their love seems doomed from the beginning when she convinces him to come to Paris to meet his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHlKqqqrHbkdZ0iaRCbDVbcehLH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48110'),
  ('595790319000957243', 'Phantasm', 1979, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Don Coscarelli, Don Coscarelli', 'Don Coscarelli', 'A. Michael Baldwin, Bill Thornbury, Reggie Bannister, Kathy Lester, Angus Scrimm, Terrie Kalbus, Kenneth V. Jones, Susan Harper', 'R', 'A teenage boy and his friends face off against a mysterious grave robber, known only as the Tall Man, who employs a lethal arsenal of unearthly weapons.', 'A teenage boy and his friends face off against a mysterious grave robber, known only as the Tall Man, who employs a lethal arsenal of unearthly weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eR0uJ0Wje1lYJ4aHEpkcjgIM8d7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9638'),
  ('508822819644008214', 'Phantasm II', 1988, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Don Coscarelli, Daryn Okada, John Joseph Duffin', 'Don Coscarelli', 'James Le Gros, Reggie Bannister, Angus Scrimm, Paula Irvine, Samantha Phillips, Kenneth Tigar, Ruth C. Engel, Mark Anthony Major', 'R', 'Mike, after his release from a psychiatric hospital, teams up with his old pal Reggie to hunt down the Tall Man, who is at it again. A mysterious, beautiful girl has also become part of Mike''s dreams, and they must find her before the Tall Man does.', 'Mike, after his release from a psychiatric hospital, teams up with his old pal Reggie to hunt down the Tall Man, who is at it again. A mysterious, beautiful girl has also become part of Mike''s dreams, and they must find her before the Tall Man does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZ5mPtOXcvmg224oBM2k1db5Fnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15158'),
  ('144898507311843036', 'Phantasm III: Lord of the Dead', 1994, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Don Coscarelli, Chris Chomyn, Jeff Shiffman', 'Don Coscarelli', 'A. Michael Baldwin, Reggie Bannister, Bill Thornbury, Gloria Lynne Henry, Kevin Connors, Cindy Ambuehl, John Davis Chandler, Brooks Gardner', 'R', 'The Tall Man, that imposing menace from Morningside Mortuary, is back and once again haunting the thoughts of the now-adult Mike and his friend, ex-Ice Cream vendor Reggie. The two continue their hunt for the mysterious figure and in his path of destruction encounter a variety of dangerous situations, friends and enemies.', 'The Tall Man, that imposing menace from Morningside Mortuary, is back and once again haunting the thoughts of the now-adult Mike and his friend, ex-Ice Cream vendor Reggie. The two continue their hunt for the mysterious figure and in his path of destruction encounter a variety of dangerous situations, friends and enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFv3H39YgyL568PTse5jGB6Ll8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16139'),
  ('408270647757768582', 'Phantasm IV: Oblivion', 1998, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Don Coscarelli, Chris Chomyn, Jeff Shiffman', 'Don Coscarelli', 'Angus Scrimm, A. Michael Baldwin, Bill Thornbury, Reggie Bannister, Heidi Marnhout, Bob Ivy, Christopher L. Stone, Chloe Kay', 'R', 'Taking off immediately where the last one ended, Mike travels across dimensions and time, fleeing from the Tall Man while trying to find the origins of his enemy and what really happened the night that his brother died. Meanwhile, Reggie battles spheres and the undead in a quest to find Mike before the Tall Man can complete his transformation.', 'Taking off immediately where the last one ended, Mike travels across dimensions and time, fleeing from the Tall Man while trying to find the origins of his enemy and what really happened the night that his brother died. Meanwhile, Reggie battles spheres and the undead in a quest to find Mike before the Tall Man can complete his transformation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/412lNlGrB8eHBOKlNhOgxI9bCtL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16146'),
