  ('54041459461738416', 'Phantom', 2015, 'Thriller, Action', 'Kabir Khan, Aseem Mishra', 'Kabir Khan, Parveez Sheikh', 'Saif Ali Khan, Katrina Kaif, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Rajesh Tailang, Sabyasachi Chakraborty, Denzil Smith, Shahnawaz Pradhan, Mir Sarwar', null, 'Phantom is an action thriller that unfolds across various countries around the world. The plot revolves around protagonist Daniyal, whose journey to seek justice takes him from India to Europe, America and the volatile Middle East. However, he finds out that in a mission like this, there is always a price to pay, in this case, a very personal price.', 'Phantom is an action thriller that unfolds across various countries around the world. The plot revolves around protagonist Daniyal, whose journey to seek justice takes him from India to Europe, America and the volatile Middle East. However, he finds out that in a mission like this, there is always a price to pay, in this case, a very personal price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssFJ8BABZC5sk8Bn09gzRmKt6ni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353879'),
