  ('146375421251037021', 'Phantom Detective', 2016, 'Action, Drama', 'Jo Sung-hee, Byun Bong-sun, Song Hyun-suk', 'Jo Sung-hee', 'Lee Je-hoon, Kim Sung-kyun, Park Keun-hyong, Roh Jeong-eui, Go Ara, Kim Dong-hwi, Choi Seung-yoon, Kim Ha-na', 'NR', 'Hong Gil-dong is an infallible private detective with an exceptional memory and quirky personality. While chasing the only target he failed to find, he gets entangled in a much bigger conspiracy than he bargained for.', 'Hong Gil-dong is an infallible private detective with an exceptional memory and quirky personality. While chasing the only target he failed to find, he gets entangled in a much bigger conspiracy than he bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ABeeYbYTARUUIiqcQbRS4rQUgR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394170'),
