  ('515940210200413263', 'Phantom Lady', 1944, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Elwood Bredell, Robert Siodmak, Lester Horton', 'Bernard C. Schoenfeld', 'Franchot Tone, Ella Raines, Alan Curtis, Aurora Miranda, Thomas Gomez, Fay Helm, Elisha Cook Jr., Andrew Tombes', 'NR', 'A devoted secretary embarks on a dangerous mission to try to find the elusive woman who may prove her boss didn''t murder his wife.', 'A devoted secretary embarks on a dangerous mission to try to find the elusive woman who may prove her boss didn''t murder his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSPH9NlSVbXIfBA8DLRRET3YBBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37992'),
  ('1082586935486524266', 'Phantom of Chinatown', 1940, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Phil Rosen, Fred Jackman Jr.', 'George Waggner', 'Keye Luke, Lotus Long, Grant Withers, Charles Miller, Huntley Gordon, Virginia Carpenter, John Dilson, Paul McVey', 'NR', 'In the middle of a pictorial lecture on his recent expedition to the Mongolian Desert, Dr. John Benton,the famous explorer, drinks from the water bottle on his lecture table, collapses and dies. His last words "Eternal Fire" are the only clue Chinese detective Jimmy Wong and Captain Street of the police department have to work on.', 'In the middle of a pictorial lecture on his recent expedition to the Mongolian Desert, Dr. John Benton,the famous explorer, drinks from the water bottle on his lecture table, collapses and dies. His last words "Eternal Fire" are the only clue Chinese detective Jimmy Wong and Captain Street of the police department have to work on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ciPiNGAXdaGjc3FKALWKEwYJny.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23298'),
  ('588097068236725532', 'Phantom of Death', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Giorgio Di Battista, Ruggero Deodato, Roberto Tatti', 'Gianfranco Clerici, Gigliola Battaglini, Vincenzo Mannino', 'Michael York, Edwige Fenech, Donald Pleasence, Mapi Galán, Fabio Sartor, Renato Cortesi, Antonella Ponziani, Carola Stagnaro', 'R', 'Police Comissioner Datti is investigating the murder of a female doctor whose murderer seems to be a thirty-fivish year old man. Soon another murder follows: Pianist Robert Dominici''s girlfriend is found killed. The killer also challenges Datti on the phone and says he can''t be caught since he has a secret which makes him invulnerable. In the meantime the clues seems to point in strange directions...', 'Police Comissioner Datti is investigating the murder of a female doctor whose murderer seems to be a thirty-fivish year old man. Soon another murder follows: Pianist Robert Dominici''s girlfriend is found killed. The killer also challenges Datti on the phone and says he can''t be caught since he has a secret which makes him invulnerable. In the meantime the clues seems to point in strange directions...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7ccBCVMzHPjy9APVRhIePew46t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29169'),
  ('1027732975984662516', 'Phantom of the Mall: Eric''s Revenge', 1989, 'Horror', 'Richard Friedman, Harry Mathias, Steve Ray', 'Frederick Urich, Scott J. Schneid', 'Derek Rydall, Kari Whitman, Rob Estes, Pauly Shore, Morgan Fairchild, Ken Foree, Kelly Rutherford, Jonathan Goldsmith', 'R', 'A young man named Eric apparently dies in a suspicious house fire after saving his girlfriend, Melody. One year later, a new mall is constructed atop where Eric''s house once stood, where a shadowy, uninvited guest is preying on the mall''s crooked developers.', 'A young man named Eric apparently dies in a suspicious house fire after saving his girlfriend, Melody. One year later, a new mall is constructed atop where Eric''s house once stood, where a shadowy, uninvited guest is preying on the mall''s crooked developers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYRa7WT8NMvdcgtBtx1rL7iHtib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86326'),
  ('736670304686417370', 'Phantom of the Megaplex', 2000, 'Comedy, Family, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Blair Treu, Tony Lucibello, Yolanda Graci', 'Stu Krieger', 'Taylor Handley, Corinne Bohrer, Caitlin Wachs, Jacob Smith, Rich Hutchman, John Novak, Colin Fox, Mickey Rooney', 'G', 'Pete Riley is a 17-year-old who lands a part-time job at a multiplex in his neighbourhood. He and his friends are excited when it''s announced that the theatre will play host to the premier of a major motion picture, with a number of Hollywood celebrities in attendance. However, when the big night comes, Pete has to contend with disappearing staff, malfunctioning equipment, and a broken popcorn machine.', 'Pete Riley is a 17-year-old who lands a part-time job at a multiplex in his neighbourhood. He and his friends are excited when it''s announced that the theatre will play host to the premier of a major motion picture, with a number of Hollywood celebrities in attendance. However, when the big night comes, Pete has to contend with disappearing staff, malfunctioning equipment, and a broken popcorn machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saZEFau4Y4EYvXQgdAcVTxiDopy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26450'),
  ('63756310104546777', 'Phantom of the Opera', 1943, 'Horror, Romance', 'Arthur Lubin, W. Howard Greene, Hal Mohr', 'Samuel Hoffenstein, Eric Taylor', 'Nelson Eddy, Susanna Foster, Claude Rains, Edgar Barrier, Leo Carrillo, Jane Farrar, J. Edward Bromberg, Fritz Feld', 'NR', 'Following a tragic accident that leaves him disfigured, crazed composer Erique Claudin transformed into a masked phantom who schemes to make beautiful young soprano Christine Dubois the star of the opera and wreak revenge on those who stole his music.', 'Following a tragic accident that leaves him disfigured, crazed composer Erique Claudin transformed into a masked phantom who schemes to make beautiful young soprano Christine Dubois the star of the opera and wreak revenge on those who stole his music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2C8aHB3xnN8LvlsNLHKumBXzgVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15855'),
  ('785495980502552177', 'Phantom of the Paradise', 1974, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'Burt Bluestein, Michael J. Dmytryk, Robert Enrietto', 'Brian De Palma, Louisa Rose', 'William Finley, Paul Williams, Jessica Harper, George Memmoli, Gerrit Graham, Archie Hahn, Jeffrey Comanor, Peter Elbling', 'PG', 'Singer-songwriter Winslow Leach seeks revenge on the nefarious music producer Swan, who steals both Winslow''s music and his favorite singer for the grand opening of Swan''s new rock palace, the Paradise.', 'Singer-songwriter Winslow Leach seeks revenge on the nefarious music producer Swan, who steals both Winslow''s music and his favorite singer for the grand opening of Swan''s new rock palace, the Paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDOtGWeSQNwB3dG7Amt1K0JW0az.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27327'),
  ('239538950635408570', 'Phantom of the Rue Morgue', 1954, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Horror', 'Roy Del Ruth, J. Peverell Marley, Frank Mattison', 'Harold Medford, James R. Webb', 'Karl Malden, Claude Dauphin, Patricia Medina, Steve Forrest, Allyn Ann McLerie, Anthony Caruso, Veola Vonn, Dolores Dorn', 'NR', 'When several women are found mutilated and murdered, the Paris police are baffled as to who the killer may be. All evidence points to Dupin, but soon it becomes apparent that it is someone (or something) stronger and deadlier than a human.', 'When several women are found mutilated and murdered, the Paris police are baffled as to who the killer may be. All evidence points to Dupin, but soon it becomes apparent that it is someone (or something) stronger and deadlier than a human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nKlCGTNQFODw9dS7MaljAyIqsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37463'),
  ('596394257551332864', 'Phantom of the Theatre', 2016, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Raymond Yip Wai-Man', 'Li Jing Ling, Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Yang Mei Yuan', 'Ruby Lin, Tony Yang, Simon Yam, Jing Gangshan, Hung Huang, Lin Jiangguo, Hu Ming, Natalie Meng Yao', null, 'A haunted theatre, filled with the vengeful spirits of a tragically-trapped performance troupe murdered in a fire 13 years ago, waits for the once-grand palatial playhouse to re-open with a new show - and bring in new victims.', 'A haunted theatre, filled with the vengeful spirits of a tragically-trapped performance troupe murdered in a fire 13 years ago, waits for the once-grand palatial playhouse to re-open with a new show - and bring in new victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSfg9D4Duh2Y54OfY4cmC0znjSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394051'),
  ('150930832521212904', 'Phantom Pain', 2009, 'Drama', 'Matthias Emcke', 'Matthias Emcke', 'Til Schweiger, Jana Pallaske, Stipe Erceg, Julia Brendler, Alwara Höfels, Luna Schweiger, Stephan Grossmann, Sönke Möhring', null, 'Marc is a passionate cyclist and urban slacker who avoids work and responsibility. Marc''s life changes from one moment to the next when he suffers a life-changing accident. He can either wallow in self-pity or tackle the beast called life with the help of love and willpower.', 'Marc is a passionate cyclist and urban slacker who avoids work and responsibility. Marc''s life changes from one moment to the next when he suffers a life-changing accident. He can either wallow in self-pity or tackle the beast called life with the help of love and willpower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1nSoFMu8lyWJa2qMm2cGMPVEQx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24633'),
  ('921733166904585568', 'Phantom Racer', 2009, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Terry Ingram, Michael Balfry', 'Jason Bourque, Keith Shaw', 'Jackson Berlin, Adam Battrick, Greg Evigan, Chad Willett, Nicole Eggert, Brenna O''Brien, Winston Rekert, Luciana Carro', null, 'Seventeen years after being killed in a fiery accident, a racing car driver returns from the dead to seek vengeance on his enemies.', 'Seventeen years after being killed in a fiery accident, a racing car driver returns from the dead to seek vengeance on his enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiyTWEj4pVIVFM1ltM6T95Yrwi3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33326'),
  ('1022790997448942105', 'Phantom Raiders', 1940, 'Crime, Romance, Adventure', 'Jacques Tourneur, Clyde De Vinna', 'Joseph Fields', 'Walter Pidgeon, Donald Meek, Joseph Schildkraut, Florence Rice, Nat Pendleton, Cecil Kellaway, John Carroll, Steffi Duna', 'NR', 'In this second Carter mystery, a mysterious rash of cargo ships sinking in Panama leads insurers Llewellyns of London to hire vacationer Nick Carter and his eccentric associate Bartholomew to investigate. Nick recognizes influential nightclub owner Al Taurez as a shady operator, but getting the goods on him depends on slick diversions involving the heavyweight champ of the Pacific Tuna Fleet, a Panamanian bombshell armed with American slang, a young couple in love and a whole raft of crooks and cutthroats.', 'In this second Carter mystery, a mysterious rash of cargo ships sinking in Panama leads insurers Llewellyns of London to hire vacationer Nick Carter and his eccentric associate Bartholomew to investigate. Nick recognizes influential nightclub owner Al Taurez as a shady operator, but getting the goods on him depends on slick diversions involving the heavyweight champ of the Pacific Tuna Fleet, a Panamanian bombshell armed with American slang, a young couple in love and a whole raft of crooks and cutthroats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xn7OI55dXG6xyphrj1cVIiaKbcp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47403'),
  ('262595556193178993', 'Phantom Summer', 2022, 'Horror, Music, Romance, Fantasy', 'Matheus Marchetti, Catharina Bergo', 'Matheus Marchetti', 'Bruno Germano, João Felipe Saldanha, Tuna Dwek, Beto Sargentelli, Daniel Paulin, Nani Porto, Marcos Oli, Matheus Paiva', null, 'Somewhere in the Brazilian seaside, teenagers Lucas and Martin fall in love while investigating the disappearance of a local kid. But their blossoming romance is threatened by sinister forces lurking beneath that idyllic summery landscape.', 'Somewhere in the Brazilian seaside, teenagers Lucas and Martin fall in love while investigating the disappearance of a local kid. But their blossoming romance is threatened by sinister forces lurking beneath that idyllic summery landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Au7HRK0wAr6mRN6df55SMsy0cCB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:919670'),
  ('929584382850552611', 'Phantom Thread', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paul Thomas Anderson, Denis Schnegg, Richard Oxford', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Daniel Day-Lewis, Vicky Krieps, Lesley Manville, Camilla Rutherford, Gina McKee, Brian Gleeson, Harriet Sansom Harris, Lujza Richter', 'R', 'In 1950s London, a renowned dressmaker''s meticulous lifestyle begins drastically changing as his relationship with his young muse intensifies.', 'In 1950s London, a renowned dressmaker''s meticulous lifestyle begins drastically changing as his relationship with his young muse intensifies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgoWjp9Sh0MI97eAMZCnIoVfgvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400617'),
  ('445320244576284612', 'Phantom Town', 1999, 'Horror, Western, Family', 'Jeff Burr, Viorel Sergovici', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'John Patrick White, Taylor Locke, Lauren Summers, Jim Metzler, Belinda Montgomery, Gabriel Spahiu, Jimmy Herman, Jeff Burr', 'PG', 'When a sixteen year-old boy and his two young siblings set off on a quest to find their missing parents, their search leads them to a ghost town in the middle of the desert. They soon discover that this is no ordinary tourist spot. In fact, according to the maps, it doesn''t exist at all! Finding their way into this mysterious place, the kids must confront the sinister force that dwells beneath it in order to rescue their parents - and save themselves.', 'When a sixteen year-old boy and his two young siblings set off on a quest to find their missing parents, their search leads them to a ghost town in the middle of the desert. They soon discover that this is no ordinary tourist spot. In fact, according to the maps, it doesn''t exist at all! Finding their way into this mysterious place, the kids must confront the sinister force that dwells beneath it in order to rescue their parents - and save themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIw6oziIiipGqoWVM2CTtG5J3Nu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180886'),
  ('203674215253285349', 'Phantom: The Submarine', 1999, 'Action, Thriller', 'Byung-chun Min, Hong Kyung-pyo', 'Bong Joon Ho, Byung-chun Min, Jang Joon-hwan', 'Choi Min-soo, Jung Woo-sung, Yun Ju-sang, Son Byung-ho, Go Dong-eop, Kim Young-ho, Sul Kyung-gu, Jung Eun-pyo', null, 'Korea''s first nuclear submarine and a crew with no record of existence embark on a do-or-die mission into the deep waters of the Pacific.', 'Korea''s first nuclear submarine and a crew with no record of existence embark on a do-or-die mission into the deep waters of the Pacific.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kucw7dQ6fLhu9lygGaFzlTx9KuN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224130'),
