  ('114322658264779357', 'Phat Girlz', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Nnegest Likké, Dean Lent, John L. Demps Jr.', 'Nnegest Likké', 'Mo''Nique, Jimmy Jean-Louis, Godfrey, Kendra C. Johnson, Joyful Drake, Eric Roberts, Dayo Ade, Jack Noseworthy', 'PG-13', 'Two large women struggle to find love and acceptance in a culture where thin is in. Their lives take a dramatic turn when they meet the men of their dreams in completely unexpected ways.', 'Two large women struggle to find love and acceptance in a culture where thin is in. Their lives take a dramatic turn when they meet the men of their dreams in completely unexpected ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzylksiJ8hmzvsHIDBTuqYZJYTe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30139'),
