  ('798202867098394210', 'Phffft', 1954, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Robson, Charles Lang, Carter DeHaven Jr.', 'George Axelrod', 'Judy Holliday, Jack Lemmon, Jack Carson, Kim Novak, Luella Gear, Donald Randolph, Donald Curtis, Shirlee Allard', 'NR', 'Robert and Nina Tracey resolve to live separate lives when their eight-year marriage dissolves into disagreements and divorce. But their separate attempts to get back out on the dating scene have a funny way of bringing them together.', 'Robert and Nina Tracey resolve to live separate lives when their eight-year marriage dissolves into disagreements and divorce. But their separate attempts to get back out on the dating scene have a funny way of bringing them together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGxxzqCSvyJ7loS3j3B39vaIqGy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80316'),
