  ('1021138590640427051', 'Phineas and Ferb Christmas Vacation!', 2009, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Zac Moncrief', 'Jon Colton Barry, Piero Piluso', 'Vincent Martella, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Ashley French, Richard O''Brien, Caroline Rhea, Dan Povenmire, Dee Bradley Baker, Jeff ''Swampy'' Marsh', 'G', 'Phineas and Ferb turn the city of Danville into a giant thank you card for Santa Claus because they feel nobody ever thanks him for all the joy he brings to the world. Doofenshmirtz uses a device called the "Naughty-inator" to put the city of Danville on Santa''s naughty list.', 'Phineas and Ferb turn the city of Danville into a giant thank you card for Santa Claus because they feel nobody ever thanks him for all the joy he brings to the world. Doofenshmirtz uses a device called the "Naughty-inator" to put the city of Danville on Santa''s naughty list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2qp7j0C0FDQEHWFn2RbmlNqNf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405312'),
  ('905263581751146577', 'Phineas and Ferb The Movie: Across the 2nd Dimension', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie, Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Robert Hughes, Dan Povenmire', 'Jon Colton Barry, Dan Povenmire, Jeff ''Swampy'' Marsh', 'Vincent Martella, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Dee Bradley Baker, Ashley French, Dan Povenmire, Richard O''Brien, Jeff ''Swampy'' Marsh, Alyson Stoner', 'G', 'Phineas and Ferb get trapped in an alternate dimension where the evil Doofenshmirtz rules the tri-state area. They must find a way back home with the help of their pet platypus named Perry, who they discover is a secret agent.', 'Phineas and Ferb get trapped in an alternate dimension where the evil Doofenshmirtz rules the tri-state area. They must find a way back home with the help of their pet platypus named Perry, who they discover is a secret agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/updMFSOZwEftfkJRpozwBlRlYI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71689'),
