  ('835249215949549797', 'Phobia 2', 2009, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Songyos Sugmakanan, Visute Poolvoralaks, Banjong Pisanthanakun', 'Banjong Pisanthanakun, Chantavit Dhanasevi, Nitis Napichayasutin', 'Jirayu La-ongmanee, Ray MacDonald, Choomporn Theppitak, Apasiri Nitibhon, Worrawech Danuwong, Gacha Plienwithi, Sarinrat Thomas, Chatpawee Trichachawanwong', null, 'An anthology of five macabre short stories about hungry ghosts, comatose brain dead, a group of bright-eyed actors, an unscrupulous car salesman, and careless backpack tourists.', 'An anthology of five macabre short stories about hungry ghosts, comatose brain dead, a group of bright-eyed actors, an unscrupulous car salesman, and careless backpack tourists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v37TI8J9GrH0TtDg1gqxmSqG9QU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37963'),
