  ('92855860756385514', 'Phoebe in Wonderland', 2008, 'Drama', 'Daniel Barnz, Bobby Bukowski', 'Daniel Barnz', 'Elle Fanning, Felicity Huffman, Patricia Clarkson, Bill Pullman, Campbell Scott, Ian Colletti, Bailee Madison, Madhur Jaffrey', 'PG-13', 'The fantastical tale of a little girl who won''t - or can''t - follow the rules. Confounded by her clashes with the rule-obsessed world around her, Phoebe seeks enlightenment from her unconventional drama teacher, even as her brilliant but anguished mother looks to Phoebe herself for inspiration.', 'The fantastical tale of a little girl who won''t - or can''t - follow the rules. Confounded by her clashes with the rule-obsessed world around her, Phoebe seeks enlightenment from her unconventional drama teacher, even as her brilliant but anguished mother looks to Phoebe herself for inspiration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiLMczPwwJE9sKjkg4Khdh3oFFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19079'),
  ('108799452710245656', 'Phoenix', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Danny Cannon, James L. Carter', 'Danny Cannon', 'Ray Liotta, Anthony LaPaglia, Anjelica Huston, Daniel Baldwin, Jeremy Piven, Xander Berkeley, Giancarlo Esposito, Brittany Murphy', 'R', 'Gambling fever -- along with a brutal bookie -- leads three crooked cops into a double-dealing scheme that lands them in hot water way over their heads.', 'Gambling fever -- along with a brutal bookie -- leads three crooked cops into a double-dealing scheme that lands them in hot water way over their heads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkppRmx4iBvAeKlopfNTO8hnKxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28047'),
  ('838961586529960055', 'Phoenix', 2014, 'Drama', 'Christian Petzold, Hans Fromm, Ires Jung', 'Harun Farocki', 'Nina Hoss, Ronald Zehrfeld, Nina Kunzendorf, Trystan Pütter, Michael Maertens, Imogen Kogge, Felix Römer, Uwe Preuss', 'PG-13', 'In the aftermath of WWII, German-Jewish cabaret singer Nelly has to undergo facial reconstructive surgery following her survival from Auschwitz. Without recognising Nelly, her former husband Johnny asks her to help him claim his wife’s inheritance. To see if he''s betrayed her, she agrees, becoming her own doppelgänger.', 'In the aftermath of WWII, German-Jewish cabaret singer Nelly has to undergo facial reconstructive surgery following her survival from Auschwitz. Without recognising Nelly, her former husband Johnny asks her to help him claim his wife’s inheritance. To see if he''s betrayed her, she agrees, becoming her own doppelgänger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJuKu5Rpg92AkzyC5rbYbqsNPI9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254578'),
  ('493794648158795774', 'Phoenix 2772', 1980, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Mystery, Drama', 'Taku Sugiyama, Osamu Tezuka, Kazuko Nakamura', 'Osamu Tezuka, Taku Sugiyama', 'Kaneto Shiozawa, Katsue Miwa, Shuichi Ikeda, Kazue Takahashi, Kazuo Kumakura, Hiroshi Otake, Keiko Takeshita, Shūichirō Moriyama', null, 'Phoenix 2772 starts with twelve minutes without dialogue, much like a silent film, recalling the birth and education of Godo. In this brave new world, children are born in test tubes and are raised by computers and robots. Godo learns the skills that will make him into a great pilot, assisted by the robotic wonder Olga. Everything that Godo needs is provided for him until he eventually goes for training with his automaton companion. He soon realizes that the world is not what he expected...', 'Phoenix 2772 starts with twelve minutes without dialogue, much like a silent film, recalling the birth and education of Godo. In this brave new world, children are born in test tubes and are raised by computers and robots. Godo learns the skills that will make him into a great pilot, assisted by the robotic wonder Olga. Everything that Godo needs is provided for him until he eventually goes for training with his automaton companion. He soon realizes that the world is not what he expected...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUdYO27T2g55OCzEdAQWz39PdnG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57635'),
  ('1118735954544946421', 'Phoenix Forgotten', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Justin Barber, Jay Keitel', 'T.S. Nowlin, Justin Barber', 'Florence Hartigan, Luke Spencer Roberts, Chelsea Lopez, Justin Matthews, Clint Jordan, Cyd Strittmatter, Roberto Medina, Jeanine Jackson', 'PG-13', 'Twenty years after three teenagers disappeared in the wake of mysterious lights appearing above Phoenix, Arizona, unseen footage from that night has been discovered, chronicling the final hours of their fateful expedition.', 'Twenty years after three teenagers disappeared in the wake of mysterious lights appearing above Phoenix, Arizona, unseen footage from that night has been discovered, chronicling the final hours of their fateful expedition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0BbjmTPSqF1QnZxHNc1GQ4JIHc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443319'),
