  ('637483261655345567', 'Phone', 2002, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Ahn Byeong-ki, Mun Yong-sik, Choi Sung-won', 'Ahn Byeong-ki', 'Ha Ji-won, Kim Yu-mi, Choi Woo-jae, Choi Ji-yeon, Eun Seo-woo, Choi Jung-yoon, Jeong Seong-hwan, Lee Seo-yeon', null, 'Soon after getting a new phone, a woman notices strange things starting to happen. When she investigates, she discovers that everyone who has had her phone number before her has died suddenly and mysteriously.', 'Soon after getting a new phone, a woman notices strange things starting to happen. When she investigates, she discovers that everyone who has had her phone number before her has died suddenly and mysteriously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXsnmaK7iSl8wiBCNDG2JP4lOiT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32242'),
  ('492828244618875085', 'Phone Bhoot', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Gurmmeet Singh, K.U. Mohanan', 'Jasvinder Singh Bath, Ravi Shankaran', 'Ishaan Khatter, Siddhant Chaturvedi, Katrina Kaif, Jackie Shroff, Sheeba Chaddha, Nidhi Bisht, Surender Thakur, Manu Rishi Chadha', null, 'Two crazy, jobless, horror-film addicts Major and Gullu, under immense family pressure to find work, hit upon the idea to float a unique ghost-capturing service when they meet a spirit, Ragini, who makes their business a success but in return asks them for a favour which they are compelled to honour.', 'Two crazy, jobless, horror-film addicts Major and Gullu, under immense family pressure to find work, hit upon the idea to float a unique ghost-capturing service when they meet a spirit, Ragini, who makes their business a success but in return asks them for a favour which they are compelled to honour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xswHNJUpzUTwmZq0Zr5ZxRZhBYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726207'),
  ('457922294400734593', 'Phone Booth', 2003, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Joel Schumacher, Matthew Libatique, Glen Trotiner', 'Larry Cohen', 'Colin Farrell, Kiefer Sutherland, Forest Whitaker, Radha Mitchell, Katie Holmes, Paula Jai Parker, Arian Ash, Tia Texada', 'R', 'A slick New York publicist who picks up a ringing receiver in a phone booth is told that if he hangs up, he''ll be killed... and the little red light from a laser rifle sight is proof that the caller isn''t kidding.', 'A slick New York publicist who picks up a ringing receiver in a phone booth is told that if he hangs up, he''ll be killed... and the little red light from a laser rifle sight is proof that the caller isn''t kidding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6lIwPKVDa6Q76qH2TbIBqPhXL3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1817'),
  ('944983172285835197', 'Phone Call from a Stranger', 1952, 'Drama', 'Jean Negulesco, Milton Krasner', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Shelley Winters, Gary Merrill, Michael Rennie, Bette Davis, Keenan Wynn, Evelyn Varden, Warren Stevens, Beatrice Straight', 'NR', 'Four strangers board a plane and become fast friends, but a catastrophic crash leaves only one survivor. He then sets off on a journey to discover who these people were, but ultimately discovers the devastating truth about himself.', 'Four strangers board a plane and become fast friends, but a catastrophic crash leaves only one survivor. He then sets off on a journey to discover who these people were, but ultimately discovers the devastating truth about himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMw7gMaG1wIdAX4BYuUHJ61Ml7w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76229'),
  ('70645438822401863', 'Phone Call to the Bar', 2011, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Hajime Hashimoto, Kazushige Tanaka', 'Ryota Kosawa, Yasushi Sutô', 'Yo Oizumi, Ryuhei Matsuda, Koyuki, Toshiyuki Nishida, Satomi Achiwa, Tamae Ando, Yoshiki Arizono, Renji Ishibashi', null, 'In the Susukino red light district of Sapporo, a private detective (Yo Oizumi) drinks alcohol with his driver Takada (Ryuhei Matsuda) in his favourite bar. There he receives a phone call from a woman who identifies herself as Kyoko Kondo. The woman asks the detective to complete a simple task. The detective, having an excellent sense for danger, thinks the work is easy and accepts the case. The next day he begins the investigation.', 'In the Susukino red light district of Sapporo, a private detective (Yo Oizumi) drinks alcohol with his driver Takada (Ryuhei Matsuda) in his favourite bar. There he receives a phone call from a woman who identifies herself as Kyoko Kondo. The woman asks the detective to complete a simple task. The detective, having an excellent sense for danger, thinks the work is easy and accepts the case. The next day he begins the investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3oJEavlNKf2CKL803vnYyr5xkQY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91989'),
  ('1009720453363278813', 'Phool Aur Kaante', 1991, 'Action, Romance, Drama', 'Kuku Kohli, Shravan Kumar Rathod, Nadeem Saifi', 'Iqbal Durrani', 'Ajay Devgn, Madhoo, Amrish Puri, Raza Murad, Goga Kapoor, Satyendra Kapoor, Aruna Irani, Jagdeep', null, 'Ajay, the son of criminal leader Nageshwar, leads a peaceful family life. However, when the rivals kidnap Ajay''s son, Nageshwar forces him to join the life of crime to rescue his child.', 'Ajay, the son of criminal leader Nageshwar, leads a peaceful family life. However, when the rivals kidnap Ajay''s son, Nageshwar forces him to join the life of crime to rescue his child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNxSSYUK2RZtTo9rKCyzVq1twzM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230437'),
  ('461788909069398699', 'Phoonk', 2008, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Ram Gopal Varma, Savita Singh', null, 'Sudeepa, Amruta Khanvilkar, Ahsaas Channa, Ashwini Kalsekar, Shrey Bawa, K.K. Raina, Ganesh Yadav, Jyoti Subhash', null, 'A realtor fires one of his co-workers and out of spite, the co-worker and his wife does black magic on his daughter. Being an atheist, he shuns his mother and wife''s theories on the supernatural and relies on a doctor for his daughter''s treatment.', 'A realtor fires one of his co-workers and out of spite, the co-worker and his wife does black magic on his daughter. Being an atheist, he shuns his mother and wife''s theories on the supernatural and relies on a doctor for his daughter''s treatment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6v5Tcek4RzzlopN7bVF8jjnh9gs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15979'),
  ('510308333629684679', 'Phosphor', 2023, 'War, Drama', 'Kostyantyn Linartovych, Ivan Trach', 'Kostyantyn Linartovych, Slavko Polyatynchuk', 'Dmytro Linartovych, Olha Filhraf, Petro Pidlisnyi, Viktor Voitsekhovskyi', null, 'Returning wounded from the war Maksym was overcome by self-doubt, in his physiological state. He is undergoing rehabilitation. He loses contact with his wife. He is tormented by dreams. In one of his dreams Maksym goes to the island to catch a lot of fish, as the paramedic advised him. Maksym takes a boat, net, dynamite from the best man and sails to the island.', 'Returning wounded from the war Maksym was overcome by self-doubt, in his physiological state. He is undergoing rehabilitation. He loses contact with his wife. He is tormented by dreams. In one of his dreams Maksym goes to the island to catch a lot of fish, as the paramedic advised him. Maksym takes a boat, net, dynamite from the best man and sails to the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDUzZpU4cXZ61rmxJR4CEFwvzhj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172384'),
  ('18526133529742574', 'Photo de famille', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alexis Kavyrchine, Mathilde Cavillan, Cécilia Rouaud', 'Cécilia Rouaud', 'Vanessa Paradis, Camille Cottin, Pierre Deladonchamps, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Chantal Lauby, Laurent Capelluto, Marc Ruchmann, Claudette Walker', null, 'Gabrielle is a "statue" for tourists, much to the chagrin of her teenage son. Elsa is in angry at the world and desperate to become pregnant. Mao is a chronically depressed video game designer who drowns his melancholy in alcohol and psychoanalysis. They are brother and sisters but do not hang out. Ever. Their parents Pierre and Claudine, separated for a long time, have really done nothing to strengthen the bonds of the family - yet, at their grandfather''s funeral, they are going to have to meet, and together answer the question: "What to do with grandma?"', 'Gabrielle is a "statue" for tourists, much to the chagrin of her teenage son. Elsa is in angry at the world and desperate to become pregnant. Mao is a chronically depressed video game designer who drowns his melancholy in alcohol and psychoanalysis. They are brother and sisters but do not hang out. Ever. Their parents Pierre and Claudine, separated for a long time, have really done nothing to strengthen the bonds of the family - yet, at their grandfather''s funeral, they are going to have to meet, and together answer the question: "What to do with grandma?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTcdEoF8gGix4AQny7u9OA3YQ8m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490450'),
  ('960058230901334489', 'Photocopier', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Wregas Bhanuteja, Gunnar Nimpuno, Melinda Risa', 'Wregas Bhanuteja', 'Shenina Cinnamon, Lutesha, Chicco Kurniawan, Jerome Kurnia, Dea Panendra, Giulio Parengkuan, Ruth Marini, Lukman Sardi', null, 'When photos of her at a party cause her to lose a scholarship, a student investigates whether something devastating happened to her that night.', 'When photos of her at a party cause her to lose a scholarship, a student investigates whether something devastating happened to her that night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjNNm0eZKNZ40Fqlc9QewDxy0by.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858815'),
  ('270964055584999304', 'Photograph', 1895, 'Comedy', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Auguste Lumière', null, 'A photographer has his camera all set up to take a gentleman''s picture. The subject checks his face in a hand mirror, and the photographer poses him. Just as the photographer is about to take the picture, the subject gets up to look at the camera more closely. The frustrated photographer soon becomes quite impatient.', 'A photographer has his camera all set up to take a gentleman''s picture. The subject checks his face in a hand mirror, and the photographer poses him. Just as the photographer is about to take the picture, the subject gets up to look at the camera more closely. The frustrated photographer soon becomes quite impatient.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUj3M5SPlxFQkjQWKwNaMrzlTv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178680'),
  ('820583959693897432', 'Photograph', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ritesh Batra, Aarshna Shah, Lawrence Dcunha', 'Ritesh Batra', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Sanya Malhotra, Farrukh Jaffar, Akash Sinha, Abdul Quadir Amin, Sachin Khedekar, Denzil Smith, Brinda Trivedi', null, 'A struggling street photographer, pressured to marry by his grandmother, convinces a shy stranger to pose as his fiancée. The pair develops a connection that transforms them in ways that they could not expect.', 'A struggling street photographer, pressured to marry by his grandmother, convinces a shy stranger to pose as his fiancée. The pair develops a connection that transforms them in ways that they could not expect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4t8Vgj9UL1TCGmyZHbQxPtSCXrp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514586'),
  ('690846040905990337', 'Photographing Fairies', 1997, 'Mystery, Fantasy, Drama', 'Nick Willing', 'Chris Harrald, Nick Willing', 'Toby Stephens, Emily Woof, Ben Kingsley, Frances Barber, Bernard Gallagher, Phil Davis, Edward Hardwicke, Rachel Shelley', 'R', 'Photographer Charles Castle is numbed with grief following the death of his beautiful bride. He goes off to war, working in the trenches as a photographer. Following the war and still in grief Charles is given some photographs purporting to be of fairies. His search for the truth leads him to Burkinwell, a seemingly peaceful village seething with secrets', 'Photographer Charles Castle is numbed with grief following the death of his beautiful bride. He goes off to war, working in the trenches as a photographer. Following the war and still in grief Charles is given some photographs purporting to be of fairies. His search for the truth leads him to Burkinwell, a seemingly peaceful village seething with secrets', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95rYK0G003rj8WDavXslmTO4pRE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26644'),
  ('97745240600671389', 'Physical Evidence', 1989, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Michael Crichton, John A. Alonzo', 'Bill Phillips', 'Burt Reynolds, Theresa Russell, Ned Beatty, Kay Lenz, Ted McGinley, Tom O''Brien, Kenneth Welsh, Ray Baker', 'R', 'A police officer suspended and now accused of murder is forced to join forces with his court-appointed attorney to assemble the pieces of a deadly puzzle to find the missing link before time runs out.', 'A police officer suspended and now accused of murder is forced to join forces with his court-appointed attorney to assemble the pieces of a deadly puzzle to find the missing link before time runs out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tBOiYvoDKlimXBrK5MCXXKkyHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41938'),
  ('359445111943686412', 'Piaffe', 2023, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Ann Oren', 'Thais Guisasola, Ann Oren', 'Simone Bucio, Simon(è) Jaikiriuma Paetau, Sebastian Rudolph, Lea Draeger, Josef Ostendorf, Ruth Rosenfeld, Nico Ehrenteit, Tristan Bumm', null, 'When her sibling Zara suffers a nervous breakdown, the introvert Eva is forced to take on Zara’s job as a Foley artist. She struggles to create sounds for a commercial featuring a horse, and then a horsetail starts growing out of her body. Empowered by her tail, she lures a botanist into an affair, through a game of submission. Piaffe is a visceral journey into control, gender, and artifice.', 'When her sibling Zara suffers a nervous breakdown, the introvert Eva is forced to take on Zara’s job as a Foley artist. She struggles to create sounds for a commercial featuring a horse, and then a horsetail starts growing out of her body. Empowered by her tail, she lures a botanist into an affair, through a game of submission. Piaffe is a visceral journey into control, gender, and artifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYTb4rnjBMLUoxjUbgaT3DB5eHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:996933'),
