  ('952130914906931561', 'Piano Piano Kid', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Tunç Başaran, Colin Mounier', 'Tunç Başaran, Ümit Ünal', 'Rutkay Aziz, Emin Sivas, Serap Aksoy, Ayşegül Ünsal, Meral Çetinkaya, Yaman Okay, Taner Barlas, Yalçın Güzelce', null, 'In 1940s Turkey, the war is recently over, but the wounds are still fresh, and the WWII is going on next door. A different family lives in each room of a mansion. They all lead a scarce life but hold on to life with hope.', 'In 1940s Turkey, the war is recently over, but the wounds are still fresh, and the WWII is going on next door. A different family lives in each room of a mansion. They all lead a scarce life but hold on to life with hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTUM9oExpkROFc4CHcMJnGyRjyx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85694'),
