  ('612639488157077350', 'Pianomania', 2009, 'Documentary, Music', 'Robert Cibis, Lilian Franck', null, 'Lang Lang, Stefan Knüpfer, Pierre-Laurent Aimard, Hyung-Ki Joo, Alfred Brendel, Aleksey Igudesman, Ingomar Rainer, Till Fellner', null, 'Pianomania takes the audience on a humorous journey through the secret world of sound and accompanies Stefan Knüpfer in his extraordinary work with the greatest pianists in the world. To select the instrument that corresponds to the vision of the virtuoso, according it to his desire and accompany him until he goes on stage, Stefan Knüpfer has developed nerves of steel, a boundless passion and above ability to translate words into sounds.', 'Pianomania takes the audience on a humorous journey through the secret world of sound and accompanies Stefan Knüpfer in his extraordinary work with the greatest pianists in the world. To select the instrument that corresponds to the vision of the virtuoso, according it to his desire and accompany him until he goes on stage, Stefan Knüpfer has developed nerves of steel, a boundless passion and above ability to translate words into sounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2iN8MDKveKsMBXK7HTExO0W3J0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64632'),
  ('422428022081379770', 'Piazza Fontana: The Italian Conspiracy', 2012, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, History', 'Marco Tullio Giordana, Roberto Forza, Francesca Polic Greco', 'Sandro Petraglia, Stefano Rulli, Marco Tullio Giordana', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Pierfrancesco Favino, Michela Cescon, Laura Chiatti, Fabrizio Gifuni, Luigi Lo Cascio, Giorgio Colangeli, Omero Antonutti', null, 'On December 12, 1969, a bomb kills 17 people at the Piazza Fontana national bank in Milan, Italy, marking the beginning of the Years of Lead. Local anarchists are scapegoated for the massacre by police and the media, but a lone prosecutor uncovers a conspiracy of far-right groups, corrupt secret services, and other interests that seek to undermine democracy.', 'On December 12, 1969, a bomb kills 17 people at the Piazza Fontana national bank in Milan, Italy, marking the beginning of the Years of Lead. Local anarchists are scapegoated for the massacre by police and the media, but a lone prosecutor uncovers a conspiracy of far-right groups, corrupt secret services, and other interests that seek to undermine democracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inb8F0LJtAGoWmfLppwmPmPmSf5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98120'),
  ('1127000903084134209', 'Pib and Pog', 1995, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Peter Peake', 'Peter Peake', 'Andrew Wilson, Joanna Wake, Nigel Betts, Roy Macready, Peter Peake', null, 'Cheery kids-TV characters of Pib and Pog lose their cool with one another, sparking a manic cartoon showdown between the two.', 'Cheery kids-TV characters of Pib and Pog lose their cool with one another, sparking a manic cartoon showdown between the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEMdpYZZXlnw6ggCLPTk8iDv8zV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54736'),
