  ('176448578849092178', 'Picardía mexicana', 1978, null, 'Abel Salazar', null, 'Vicente Fernández, Héctor Suárez, Adalberto Martínez, Jacqueline Andere, Pedro Weber ''Chatanuga'', Luis de Alba, Dolores Camarillo, Delia Magaña', null, 'An academic tags along among a crew of rowdy delivery-truck drivers, taking notes on their colorful and idiomatic use of language.', 'An academic tags along among a crew of rowdy delivery-truck drivers, taking notes on their colorful and idiomatic use of language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNguKu5kiqF41DVL5syOwJ0K6Tk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372439'),
  ('136837528030159376', 'Picasso Trigger', 1988, 'Action, Crime', 'Andy Sidaris, Howard Wexler, H.M. Freedman', 'Andy Sidaris', 'Steve Bond, Dona Speir, Hope Marie Carlton, Harold Diamond, John Aprea, Roberta Vasquez, Guich Koock, Rodrigo Obregón', 'R', 'Double agent Picasso Trigger is assassinated in Paris by double-crossing bad guy Miguel Ortiz. Then Ortiz begins eliminating agents of The Agency who were involved in his brother''s death. The Agency (belatedly) springs into action to stop Ortiz'' heinous activities. The usual gunplay, romance, and nifty toys with bombs ensue.', 'Double agent Picasso Trigger is assassinated in Paris by double-crossing bad guy Miguel Ortiz. Then Ortiz begins eliminating agents of The Agency who were involved in his brother''s death. The Agency (belatedly) springs into action to stop Ortiz'' heinous activities. The usual gunplay, romance, and nifty toys with bombs ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1f7GDCqPe7qneZGwe6iYdiZonLn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50560'),
  ('491656502009459924', 'Piccadilly', 1929, 'Drama, Crime', 'E.A. Dupont, Werner Brandes', 'Arnold Bennett', 'Gilda Gray, Anna May Wong, Jameson Thomas, Charles Laughton, Cyril Ritchard, King Hou Chang, Hannah Jones, Gordon Begg', null, 'A young Chinese woman, working in the kitchen at a London dance club, is given the chance to become the club''s main act.', 'A young Chinese woman, working in the kitchen at a London dance club, is given the chance to become the club''s main act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/biZjt8E9ljayP80tZPXgWKBiiyn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51079'),
  ('992314179719088531', 'Piccadilly Zero Hour 12', 1963, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Rudolf Zehetgruber, Hans Jura', 'Rudolf Zehetgruber', 'Helmut Wildt, Hanns Lothar, Ann Smyrner, Karl Lieffen, Pinkas Braun, Klaus Kinski, Camilla Spira, Rudolf Fernau', null, 'Mike Hilton served eight years in prison for being innocent. When he is released from prison early, he wants revenge on the men who were responsible. But the ex-commissioner in charge at the time, Jack Bellamy, has given in to drunkenness. And Mike''s lawyer Cunningham continues to make crooked deals. He holds the key to solving the case. When Bellamy picks himself up again, he and Hilton are able to bring Cunningham and the gangster Whity to justice.', 'Mike Hilton served eight years in prison for being innocent. When he is released from prison early, he wants revenge on the men who were responsible. But the ex-commissioner in charge at the time, Jack Bellamy, has given in to drunkenness. And Mike''s lawyer Cunningham continues to make crooked deals. He holds the key to solving the case. When Bellamy picks himself up again, he and Hilton are able to bring Cunningham and the gangster Whity to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YVBVMO7lLXbmc0R3leYXXlE8YW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99624'),
  ('669578087944490600', 'Picco', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Philip Koch', 'Philip Koch', 'Constantin von Jascheroff, Joel Basman, Frederick Lau, Martin Kiefer, Aram Arami, Leonie Benesch, Rainer Bock, Konstantin Frolov', null, 'Kevin is new in youth prison. Due to over-occupancy he has to share a cell with Tommy, Andy and Marc. A partnership of convenience in a system where only the strong prevail and which is dominated by violence and latent aggression. Oppression and beatings are a daily occurence. It is hard for Kevin to establish himself. Especially Marc and Andy are after him. He''s afraid of not sticking it out. Only Tommy gives him an amicable advice: In this system, you''re either a victim or a culprit. If he doesn''t want to be a loser anymore, he has to start fighting... A piece of advice that will trigger most dire consequences', 'Kevin is new in youth prison. Due to over-occupancy he has to share a cell with Tommy, Andy and Marc. A partnership of convenience in a system where only the strong prevail and which is dominated by violence and latent aggression. Oppression and beatings are a daily occurence. It is hard for Kevin to establish himself. Especially Marc and Andy are after him. He''s afraid of not sticking it out. Only Tommy gives him an amicable advice: In this system, you''re either a victim or a culprit. If he doesn''t want to be a loser anymore, he has to start fighting... A piece of advice that will trigger most dire consequences', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDf4oe9KtlFNEOzi0qWa0v42bBd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56161'),
  ('64136353569058302', 'Piccola posta', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Tonino Delli Colli, Lucio Fulci', 'Lucio Fulci, Sandro Continenza, Steno', 'Alberto Sordi, Franca Valeri, Peppino De Filippo, Sergio Raimondi, Anna Maria Pancani, Nanda Primavera, Amalia Pellegrini, Memmo Carotenuto', null, 'Polish countess Lady Eva is the authoritative signature of the correspondence of an Italian women''s magazine; behind the fascinating name hides a Roman girl whose advice will create a series of tangled and comic situations.', 'Polish countess Lady Eva is the authoritative signature of the correspondence of an Italian women''s magazine; behind the fascinating name hides a Roman girl whose advice will create a series of tangled and comic situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLFpigDlzXH50TUlIbHiPRGMEiJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56436'),
  ('331865050295696710', 'Piccoli crimini coniugali', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Paolo Giacomo Marino, Alex Infascelli, Arnaldo Catinari', 'Francesca Manieri, Alex Infascelli', 'Sergio Castellitto, Margherita Buy', null, 'Following a terrible accident at home, Elia loses his memory. His wife tries to help him through a long conversation to piece together their life and perhaps give him a chance to reinvent himself.', 'Following a terrible accident at home, Elia loses his memory. His wife tries to help him through a long conversation to piece together their life and perhaps give him a chance to reinvent himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4eG5V6OaCHKozMv8pQkzAUxwW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449223'),
