  ('170193130949768931', 'Piccolo', 1959, 'Animation', 'Dušan Vukotić', 'Dušan Vukotić', null, null, 'Two men in adjoining duplexes, good friends, are enchanted by the song of a bird. One buys a small harmonica and learns to play it; he keeps his neighbor awake. The neighbor buys a larger harmonica, and an arms race ensues; the instruments get larger, until it''s a piano vs. a pipe organ, and then they start bringing in larger groups of friends until an entire orchestra is playing the 1812 Overture. The houses collapse from all this, atop the dueling orchestras, and on their way up to heaven, the man puts his small harmonica up for sale.', 'Two men in adjoining duplexes, good friends, are enchanted by the song of a bird. One buys a small harmonica and learns to play it; he keeps his neighbor awake. The neighbor buys a larger harmonica, and an arms race ensues; the instruments get larger, until it''s a piano vs. a pipe organ, and then they start bringing in larger groups of friends until an entire orchestra is playing the 1812 Overture. The houses collapse from all this, atop the dueling orchestras, and on their way up to heaven, the man puts his small harmonica up for sale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqMMYWZc0crjAY4SYs6jn1IHzLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254670'),
  ('343415076065009389', 'Piccolo mondo antico', 1941, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Lucio De Caro, Fernando Previtali, Dino Risi', 'Mario Bonfantini, Mario Soldati, Emilio Cecchi', 'Alida Valli, Massimo Serato, Ada Dondini, Annibale Betrone, Mariu Pascoli, Giacinto Molteni, Elvira Bonecchi, Enzo Biliotti', null, 'Franco, a young man of noble descent, marries Luisa, daughter of a humble clerk, against his grandmother''s will.', 'Franco, a young man of noble descent, marries Luisa, daughter of a humble clerk, against his grandmother''s will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/258gtLCK79JCAlHjl9UPZomXqux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213615'),
  ('921774849258870918', 'Piccolo, Saxo & Cie', 2006, 'Animation, Family', 'Eric Gutierrez, Marco Villamizar', 'Juliette Sales, Isabelle de Catalogne', 'Jean-Baptiste Maunier, Eugène Christo-Foroux, Anaïs Croze, Camille Donda, Michel Elias, Patrick Préjean, Marie-Eugénie Maréchal, Lewis Weill', null, 'A collection of brass and string instruments band together to form a grand symphonic orchestra, then embark on a mission to find the evil doctor who stole some of their other instruments and musical notes so he could build the perfect instrument.', 'A collection of brass and string instruments band together to form a grand symphonic orchestra, then embark on a mission to find the evil doctor who stole some of their other instruments and musical notes so he could build the perfect instrument.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IM96wqjuZvuOjbcPXCkZCtoRSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69868'),
  ('157448987360645117', 'Piché: The Landing of a Man', 2010, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Sylvain Archambault, Ronald Plante', 'Ian Lauzon', 'Michel Côté, Maxime Le Flaguais, Léo Arguello, Pierre Chaves, Normand D''Amour, Isabelle Guérard, Nathalie Cavezzali, Sarah-Jeanne Labrosse', null, 'Toronto, August 2001. Commander Robert Piche left Pearson Airport heading for Lisbon on an Airbus 330. Due to a significant fuel loss, he was headed for an almost certain crash. However, he courageously kept his cool and skillfully glided the plane to a safe landing, saving the 306 passengers on board. Back in Canada, Piche''s criminal past and extraordinary life came to light, explaining somewhat how he was able to commit this heroic act.', 'Toronto, August 2001. Commander Robert Piche left Pearson Airport heading for Lisbon on an Airbus 330. Due to a significant fuel loss, he was headed for an almost certain crash. However, he courageously kept his cool and skillfully glided the plane to a safe landing, saving the 306 passengers on board. Back in Canada, Piche''s criminal past and extraordinary life came to light, explaining somewhat how he was able to commit this heroic act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xkRMFOO0mp20OqtHAb9EtwNXrr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49331'),
  ('980010153727344472', 'Pick a Star', 1937, 'Comedy, Music', 'Edward Sedgwick', 'Thomas J. Dugan, Arthur V. Jones, Richard Flournoy', 'Patsy Kelly, Jack Haley, Rosina Lawrence, Mischa Auer, Lyda Roberti, Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Charles Halton', 'NR', 'A Cinderella story of a young country girl who comes to Hollywood and achieves movie stardom with the help of a publicity man.', 'A Cinderella story of a young country girl who comes to Hollywood and achieves movie stardom with the help of a publicity man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBFFypjm6lOZHyfRurNqf4gbmm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127040'),
  ('663830775477301126', 'Pick Up Your Belongings', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Bernard Guillou, Claude Agostini', 'Claude Gallot, Bernard Guillou', 'Pierre Richard, Jean Carmet, Julien Guiomar, Sylvie Joly, Danielle Minazzoli, Béatrice Camurat, Hélène Surgère, Fanny Bastien', null, 'Pierre Cohen, a sophisticated Parisian psychologist, goes to his brother''s farm in order to protect it from very hostile local landowners.', 'Pierre Cohen, a sophisticated Parisian psychologist, goes to his brother''s farm in order to protect it from very hostile local landowners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2UdriEPvhj9Yo82GKcARtZzvSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79748'),
  ('221057920653339899', 'Pick-up', 1975, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Bernard Hirschenson, Bernard Hirschenson', 'John Winter', 'Jill Senter, Alan Long, Gini Eastwood, Tom Quinn, Bess Douglass, Don Penny, Elizabeth Sinn, Nate Clark', 'R', 'Sexy hippie chicks Carol and Maureen get more than they bargained for when they hitch a ride with groovy hippie dude Chuck in his nifty mobile bus home. The trio get lost in the Florida Everglades following a fierce rain storm and embark on a startling spiritual journey of self-discovery.', 'Sexy hippie chicks Carol and Maureen get more than they bargained for when they hitch a ride with groovy hippie dude Chuck in his nifty mobile bus home. The trio get lost in the Florida Everglades following a fierce rain storm and embark on a startling spiritual journey of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4hakWRf9b3Cif4Ywnw11sRo72U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54873'),
  ('107837420164723369', 'Pick-Up Girls', 1981, 'Comedy, Action', 'Jesús Franco, Juan Soler', 'Jesús Franco', 'Antonio Mayans, Lina Romay, Doris Regina, Rosa Valenty, Miguel Ángel Aristu, Albino Graziani, Lorna Green, Nadine Pascal', null, 'Private eye Al Crosby is paid by millionaire Harry Feldman to take his place at a meeting with Emilio, a gangster. He is drugged and photographed in compromising positions by two hookers, Suzy and Bijou, then he is nearly killed by Mrs. Feldman. Al tries to blackmail Mrs. Feldman, and he is beaten up by three women and forced to tell of Harry''s whereabouts, leading to Harry''s murder. Al enlists the help of Harry''s mistress, Coco, plus Suzy and Bijou whom Al gets out of prison, to expose Mrs Feldman as having inherited money by devious ways and being a brothel owner.', 'Private eye Al Crosby is paid by millionaire Harry Feldman to take his place at a meeting with Emilio, a gangster. He is drugged and photographed in compromising positions by two hookers, Suzy and Bijou, then he is nearly killed by Mrs. Feldman. Al tries to blackmail Mrs. Feldman, and he is beaten up by three women and forced to tell of Harry''s whereabouts, leading to Harry''s murder. Al enlists the help of Harry''s mistress, Coco, plus Suzy and Bijou whom Al gets out of prison, to expose Mrs Feldman as having inherited money by devious ways and being a brothel owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNPkAGTNuZtmAXFKpFhBvQPRi4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329872'),
  ('641904712532164395', 'Picking Up Girls', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lau Siu-Kwan', 'Lau Siu-Kwan', 'Otomo Rena, Charlie Cho Cha-Lee, Dennis Tang Chung-Kwan, Chan Pooi-Kei, Chu Ben-Ke, Tsai Hung, Man Wah Tsui, Wai Wang', null, 'The misadventures of a family of sex maniacs.', 'The misadventures of a family of sex maniacs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iZbg22txHEkh4uR7emv3a6nSOd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581852'),
  ('742112186163299887', 'Picking Up the Pieces', 2000, 'Comedy, Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Alfonso Arau, Vittorio Storaro', 'Bill Wilson', 'Woody Allen, Sharon Stone, Alfonso Arau, Brian Brophy, Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Cheech Marin, David Schwimmer, Kiefer Sutherland', 'R', 'A small New Mexican village discovers a severed hand that is considered a miracle of God, when it actually belongs to a murdered spouse with a husband in search of it.', 'A small New Mexican village discovers a severed hand that is considered a miracle of God, when it actually belongs to a murdered spouse with a husband in search of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5z7UhWHKTsoIR0x5dh0z8EMJd8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31774'),
  ('457997538164808819', 'Pickled Pink', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng, Hawley Pratt', 'Bob Kurtz', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'An alcoholic is returning home from a night of partying and encounters the homeless Pink Panther in a park. He invites the panther to come and stay with him, but he has a wife who disapproves of him bringing in any guests. So, he has to keep the Pink Panther hidden, which tends to be rather painful for the hapless panther.', 'An alcoholic is returning home from a night of partying and encounters the homeless Pink Panther in a park. He invites the panther to come and stay with him, but he has a wife who disapproves of him bringing in any guests. So, he has to keep the Pink Panther hidden, which tends to be rather painful for the hapless panther.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghYjXruLcqNs6d9RrZhkMvcdjJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205133'),
  ('424501050680727524', 'Pickpocket', 1959, 'Crime, Drama', 'Léonce-Henri Burel, Robert Bresson, Jacques Ballanche', 'Robert Bresson', 'Martin LaSalle, Marika Green, Jean Pélégri, Dolly Scal, Pierre Leymarie, Kassagi, Pierre Étaix, César Gattegno', 'NR', 'Michel takes up pickpocketing on a lark and is arrested soon after. His mother dies shortly after his release, and despite the objections of his only friend, Jacques, and his mother''s neighbor Jeanne, Michel teams up with a couple of petty thieves in order to improve his craft. With a police inspector keeping an eye on him, Michel also tries to get a straight job, but the temptation to steal is hard to resist.', 'Michel takes up pickpocketing on a lark and is arrested soon after. His mother dies shortly after his release, and despite the objections of his only friend, Jacques, and his mother''s neighbor Jeanne, Michel teams up with a couple of petty thieves in order to improve his craft. With a police inspector keeping an eye on him, Michel also tries to get a straight job, but the temptation to steal is hard to resist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxpvceDv9fhFc4OAs82fmdzu17Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:690'),
  ('89970329047059503', 'Pickpocket', 1997, 'Drama', 'Jia Zhangke, Nelson Yu Lik-wai', 'Jia Zhangke', 'Wang Hongwei, Hao Hongjian, Baitao Zuo, Ma Jinrei, Liu Junying, Yonghao Liang, An Qunyan, Dongdong Jiang', null, 'A small town pickpocket whose friends have moved on to higher trades finds himself bitter and unable to adapt.', 'A small town pickpocket whose friends have moved on to higher trades finds himself bitter and unable to adapt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAhJeNYIARl0T6mHISxfiWThvIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52103'),
  ('500389505178000724', 'Pickpockets', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Peter Webber, Paulo Perez', 'Martín Mauregui, Sandro Romero Rey, Simon Stephens', 'Carlos Bardem, Natalia Reyes, Emiliano Pernia, Duban Prado, Marcela Mar, Julio Pachón, Carlos Camacho, Ulises Gonzalez', null, 'An aspiring teen thieves learn what it takes to be successful pickpockets on the streets of Bogotá', 'An aspiring teen thieves learn what it takes to be successful pickpockets on the streets of Bogotá', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JYpjCTvWRRcBF5pRO5ZQONsGgg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517829'),
  ('238594717295383519', 'Pickup', 1951, 'Drama, Crime', 'Paul Ivano, Hugo Haas', 'Arnold Lipp, Hugo Haas', 'Hugo Haas, Beverly Michaels, Allan Nixon, Howland Chamberlain, Jo-Carroll Dennison, Bernard Gorcey, Mark Lowell, Jack Daley', 'NR', 'Jan Horak is a middle-aged railroad dispatcher stationed at a forsaken spot in the desert, within driving distance of the nearest town. A widower, he has saved his money and goes to town to buy a dog, meets Betty, a flashy blonde who gains his confidence and marries him to acquire his $7,000 "fortune."', 'Jan Horak is a middle-aged railroad dispatcher stationed at a forsaken spot in the desert, within driving distance of the nearest town. A widower, he has saved his money and goes to town to buy a dog, meets Betty, a flashy blonde who gains his confidence and marries him to acquire his $7,000 "fortune."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIsgm2kYwOF4zBv80n0IRug4VC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33437'),
  ('582921029153789299', 'Pickup on South Street', 1953, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Samuel Fuller, Joseph MacDonald, Ad Schaumer', 'Samuel Fuller', 'Richard Widmark, Jean Peters, Thelma Ritter, Murvyn Vye, Richard Kiley, Willis Bouchey, Milburn Stone, Parley Baer', 'NR', 'In New York City, an insolent pickpocket, Skip McCoy, inadvertently sets off a chain of events when he targets ex-prostitute Candy and steals her wallet. Unaware that she has been making deliveries of highly classified information to the communists, Candy, who has been trailed by FBI agents for months in hopes of nabbing the spy ringleader, is sent by her ex-boyfriend, Joey, to find Skip and retrieve the valuable microfilm he now holds.', 'In New York City, an insolent pickpocket, Skip McCoy, inadvertently sets off a chain of events when he targets ex-prostitute Candy and steals her wallet. Unaware that she has been making deliveries of highly classified information to the communists, Candy, who has been trailed by FBI agents for months in hopes of nabbing the spy ringleader, is sent by her ex-boyfriend, Joey, to find Skip and retrieve the valuable microfilm he now holds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/et4fY4BxLyAPwxvUFUbzCUrGsjR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25955'),
  ('400713810726344937', 'Picnic', 1949, 'Drama', 'Curtis Harrington', 'Curtis Harrington', 'Raymond S. Harrington, Isabel Harrington', null, 'Beginning in the reality of American middle-class life, Picnic portrays the idealistic dream-quest of the protagonist, from which he is finally cast off. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'Beginning in the reality of American middle-class life, Picnic portrays the idealistic dream-quest of the protagonist, from which he is finally cast off. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPF6ZHuLhGeRiss89h9YpegOiJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325154'),
  ('651652770522128338', 'Picnic', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joshua Logan, Ray Cory, James Wong Howe', 'Daniel Taradash', 'William Holden, Kim Novak, Rosalind Russell, Betty Field, Susan Strasberg, Cliff Robertson, Arthur O''Connell, Verna Felton', 'PG', 'Labor Day in a small Kansas farm town. Hal, a burly and resolute drifter, jumps off a dusty freight train car with the purpose of visiting Alan, a former college classmate and son of the richest man in town.', 'Labor Day in a small Kansas farm town. Hal, a burly and resolute drifter, jumps off a dusty freight train car with the purpose of visiting Alan, a former college classmate and son of the richest man in town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKCSA9JUp9JkztAjzODPTrtZmzC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39940'),
  ('356266606553271123', 'Picnic', 1996, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Shunji Iwai, Noboru Shinoda', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Chara, Tadanobu Asano, Koichi Hashizume, Naomasa Musaka, Fujiko Yamamoto, Shifumi Yamaguchi, Takaaki Kabuto, Kazue Itō', null, 'Believing that the world will end that very day, three mental patients Coco, Tsumuji, and Satoru set out upon a journey. Walking upon the tops of the walls of the city, they seek to find a picnic spot with the best vantage point to view the final event.', 'Believing that the world will end that very day, three mental patients Coco, Tsumuji, and Satoru set out upon a journey. Walking upon the tops of the walls of the city, they seek to find a picnic spot with the best vantage point to view the final event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTYvLoQnIA6BfSeDG93fZwcWQ2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40886'),
  ('472901976420815186', 'Picnic at Hanging Rock', 1975, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Peter Weir, Russell Boyd, Mark Egerton', 'Cliff Green', 'Rachel Roberts, Vivean Gray, Helen Morse, Kirsty Child, Tony Llewellyn-Jones, Jacki Weaver, Anne-Louise Lambert, Karen Robson', 'PG', 'In the early 1900s, Miranda attends a girls boarding school in Australia. One Valentine''s Day, the school''s typically strict headmistress treats the girls to a picnic field trip to an unusual but scenic volcanic formation called Hanging Rock. Despite rules against it, Miranda and several other girls venture off. It''s not until the end of the day that the faculty realizes the girls and one of the teachers have disappeared mysteriously.', 'In the early 1900s, Miranda attends a girls boarding school in Australia. One Valentine''s Day, the school''s typically strict headmistress treats the girls to a picnic field trip to an unusual but scenic volcanic formation called Hanging Rock. Despite rules against it, Miranda and several other girls venture off. It''s not until the end of the day that the faculty realizes the girls and one of the teachers have disappeared mysteriously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BAXwmFN4pZDNb9N6kzmAAwdssi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11020'),
  ('959844295659430683', 'Picnic on the Grass', 1959, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jean Renoir, Georges Leclerc', 'Jean Renoir', 'Paul Meurisse, Catherine Rouvel, Jacqueline Morane, Fernand Sardou, Jean-Pierre Granval, Hélène Duc, Ingrid Nordine, Charles Blavette', null, 'New Europe presidential candidate Etienne Alexis is a scientist promoting artificial insemination for social betterment and therapy to eliminate passion. To celebrate his engagement to a cousin, he hosts an aseptic picnic, where Mother Nature asserts herself. A shepherd''s flute conjures a windstorm throwing Alexis together with the luscious Nénette, a farm lass who, although unimpressed with men, wants to have a baby.', 'New Europe presidential candidate Etienne Alexis is a scientist promoting artificial insemination for social betterment and therapy to eliminate passion. To celebrate his engagement to a cousin, he hosts an aseptic picnic, where Mother Nature asserts herself. A shepherd''s flute conjures a windstorm throwing Alexis together with the luscious Nénette, a farm lass who, although unimpressed with men, wants to have a baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBeayRLDWw8l3eDkaqlqWlYsgXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43101'),
  ('289817656224005591', 'Picnic with Weismann', 1968, 'Animation', 'Jan Švankmajer, Peter Puluj', 'Jan Švankmajer', null, null, 'Various objects are having a sunny outing together in the nature.', 'Various objects are having a sunny outing together in the nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6eY1LCUJjOwqymhq2m3D1U4uWJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19011'),
  ('401450445532177768', 'Picture Bride', 1995, 'Drama, History', 'Kayo Hatta, Claudio Rocha', 'Kayo Hatta, Mari Hatta', 'Youki Kudoh, Akira Takayama, Tamlyn Tomita, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Toshirō Mifune, Yōko Sugi, Christianne Mays, Warren Fabro', 'PG-13', 'Riyo, an orphaned 17-year old, sails from Yokohama to Hawaii in 1918 to marry Matsuji, a man she has never met. Hoping to escape a troubled past and start anew, Riyo is bitterly disappointed upon her arrival: her husband is twice her age. The miserable girl finds solace with her new friend Kana, a young mother who helps Riyo accept her new life.', 'Riyo, an orphaned 17-year old, sails from Yokohama to Hawaii in 1918 to marry Matsuji, a man she has never met. Hoping to escape a troubled past and start anew, Riyo is bitterly disappointed upon her arrival: her husband is twice her age. The miserable girl finds solace with her new friend Kana, a young mother who helps Riyo accept her new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1lUr4NWgOi4ftXLrUWGI49IvKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30304'),
  ('625432025455133269', 'Picture Claire', 2001, 'Thriller', 'Bruce McDonald, Mirosław Baszak', 'Semi Chellas', 'Juliette Lewis, Gina Gershon, Mickey Rourke, Callum Keith Rennie, Camilla Rutherford, Kelly Harms, Peter Stebbings, Tracy Wright', 'R', 'Quebec native Claire Beaucage has a one-night stand with a photographer of some renown. Despite the language barrier between them, he invites her to visit him in Toronto. She shows up on his doorstep after an arson attack leaves her homeless, but soon finds herself caught up in a case of murder and mistaken identity.', 'Quebec native Claire Beaucage has a one-night stand with a photographer of some renown. Despite the language barrier between them, he invites her to visit him in Toronto. She shows up on his doorstep after an arson attack leaves her homeless, but soon finds herself caught up in a case of murder and mistaken identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wEsMBXd4GlEhwF2Kpo6jU35fn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28311'),
  ('38112981399078750', 'Picture Mommy Dead', 1966, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bert I. Gordon, Ellsworth Fredericks', 'Robert Sherman', 'Don Ameche, Martha Hyer, Susan Gordon, Zsa Zsa Gabor, Maxwell Reed, Wendell Corey, Signe Hasso, Anna Lee', null, 'Susan Shelley is released from an asylum where she''s been confined to after the shock suffered over the fiery death of her mother. Her father has a new wife, who has only married him for the money left to him by his dead wife. Susan is still haunted by her mother''s memory, and her step-mother is conspiring with her lover to get the troubled girl to lead them to her mother''s missing diamond necklace.', 'Susan Shelley is released from an asylum where she''s been confined to after the shock suffered over the fiery death of her mother. Her father has a new wife, who has only married him for the money left to him by his dead wife. Susan is still haunted by her mother''s memory, and her step-mother is conspiring with her lover to get the troubled girl to lead them to her mother''s missing diamond necklace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m84WhfxJuGVcwoENn3rmEBi6VJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109102'),
  ('422162049429748258', 'Picture of Beauty', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Maxim Ford', 'Maxim Ford, Pau Ros', 'Danielle Rose, Taylor Sands, Paweł Hajnos, Magdalena Bochan-Jachimek, Joanna Mazewska, Joanna Sobocinska, Lidia Banach, Misha Czumaczenko', null, 'In an early 20th century village, a painter with an unusual commission finds two pretty girls two model for him. The girls slowly come of age while exploring their sexuality and finding liberation in a repressed society.', 'In an early 20th century village, a painter with an unusual commission finds two pretty girls two model for him. The girls slowly come of age while exploring their sexuality and finding liberation in a repressed society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mH9ngk8aY6a96rlMRoHcSMb1Wno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469877'),
  ('1472677090330104', 'Picture of Light', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Peter Mettler', 'Peter Mettler', 'Brian Ladoon', null, 'A documentary of an expedition to Churchill, Manitoba to film the Northern Lights.', 'A documentary of an expedition to Churchill, Manitoba to film the Northern Lights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juFVJIJKTuhsnxyFEdffXmBcE2j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259231'),
  ('698018083780110788', 'Picture Perfect', 1997, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Glenn Gordon Caron, Howard McMaster, Christopher Surgent', 'Arleen Sorkin, Paul Slansky, Glenn Gordon Caron', 'Jennifer Aniston, Jay Mohr, Kevin Bacon, Olympia Dukakis, Illeana Douglas, Kevin Dunn, Anne Twomey, Faith Prince', 'PG-13', 'A young advertising executive''s life becomes increasingly complicated when, in order to impress her boss, she pretends to be engaged to a man she has just met.', 'A young advertising executive''s life becomes increasingly complicated when, in order to impress her boss, she pretends to be engaged to a man she has just met.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYnvr4o7GEaA2uyt4Q1ASUI5Obv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9413'),
  ('569914546728244315', 'Picture Perfect Mysteries: Dead Over Diamonds', 2020, 'TV Movie, Crime, Mystery', 'Tyler Walzak, Ron Oliver', 'Marcy Holland', 'Alexa PenaVega, Carlos PenaVega, Erik Estrada, Debs Howard, Paul McGillion, Milo Shandel, Glynis Davies, Sunita Prasad', null, 'Photographer Allie and Detective Sam''s investigation into a priceless stolen necklace leads to danger and an unexpected death.', 'Photographer Allie and Detective Sam''s investigation into a priceless stolen necklace leads to danger and an unexpected death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17V3Q36cB6vRgD6ulf9tWYakbcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661328'),
  ('722077040084754321', 'Picture Perfect Mysteries: Exit Stage Death', 2020, 'TV Movie, Crime, Mystery', 'Tyler Walzak, Iain Carson-Huggins, Virgo Velasquez', 'Marcy Holland', 'Alexa PenaVega, Carlos PenaVega, Willie Aames, Sunita Prasad, Trezzo Mahoro, Paul McGillion, Marci T. House, Jesse Moss', null, 'While backstage on opening night of a new play by celebrated murder mystery author/director Neil Khan, photographer Allie Adams discovers the body of the show’s leading lady, murdered before the curtain went up. As Willow Haven PD Detective Sam Acosta launches his investigation, he invites Allie – who has been helpful in solving his first two murder cases since joining the force -- to unofficially assist him on the. case. However, Allie’s involvement makes her a target for murder herself when she gets too close to the truth.', 'While backstage on opening night of a new play by celebrated murder mystery author/director Neil Khan, photographer Allie Adams discovers the body of the show’s leading lady, murdered before the curtain went up. As Willow Haven PD Detective Sam Acosta launches his investigation, he invites Allie – who has been helpful in solving his first two murder cases since joining the force -- to unofficially assist him on the. case. However, Allie’s involvement makes her a target for murder herself when she gets too close to the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHFJ15cZ1pfk60XTcTl9GYxnhf6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:733278'),
  ('473433635631665964', 'Picture Perfect Sister-in-Law', 2026, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Dave Thomas, Christian Ortega, Jeff Hardwick', 'Shannon Latimer', 'Eddie Davenport, Analisa Wall, Nick Clark, Adam Harper, Roy Coulter', 'TV-14', 'Three years after escaping a notorious child abductor known as the ''Carousel Kiler'', former investigative journalist Parker Bennington has rebuilt her life as a university lecturer near her brother''s family. But when disturbing symbols from the past—carousel music boxes—start appearing, and her sister-in-law begins acting strangely, Parker suspects someone is targeting her again.', 'Three years after escaping a notorious child abductor known as the ''Carousel Kiler'', former investigative journalist Parker Bennington has rebuilt her life as a university lecturer near her brother''s family. But when disturbing symbols from the past—carousel music boxes—start appearing, and her sister-in-law begins acting strangely, Parker suspects someone is targeting her again.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FbbUMJHai0BUDaITE4Ihobaow0IJ.jpg', 'plex:movie:picture-perfect-sister-in-law'),
  ('6485174165352941', 'Picture Snatcher', 1933, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Lloyd Bacon, Sol Polito, Maxwell Arnow', 'William Keighley', 'James Cagney, Ralph Bellamy, Patricia Ellis, Alice White, Ralf Harolde, Robert Emmett O''Connor, Robert Barrat, G. Pat Collins', 'NR', 'An ex-con uses his street smarts to become a successful photojournalist.', 'An ex-con uses his street smarts to become a successful photojournalist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2V2AwXXjc44S56dVmN272hgnEkt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49064'),
  ('909272096473435827', 'Picture This', 2008, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Stephen Herek, Bernard Couture, Normand Labelle', 'Temple Mathews', 'Ashley French, Robbie Amell, Kevin Pollak, Shenae Grimes-Beech, Lauren Collins, Cindy Busby, Marie-Marguerite Sabongui, Angela Galuppo', 'PG-13', 'Bookish and unpopular Mandy finds her luck finally changing when Drew, the school hottie, invites her to the year''s biggest party. But with being grounded and Drew''s ex-girlfriend bent on thwarting her, Mandy may be destined to remain a geek. Can a little ingenuity and some help from her friends save the day?', 'Bookish and unpopular Mandy finds her luck finally changing when Drew, the school hottie, invites her to the year''s biggest party. But with being grounded and Drew''s ex-girlfriend bent on thwarting her, Mandy may be destined to remain a geek. Can a little ingenuity and some help from her friends save the day?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0Mc2OzARakkTmnm8sihEQSoVaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15671'),
  ('127222734529045785', 'Picture This', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Prarthana Mohan, David Higgs, Nanw Rowlands', 'Nikita Lalwani, Nathan Ramos-Park, Shuang Hu', 'Simone Ashley, Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Sindhu Vee, Luke Fetherston, Nikesh Patel, Adil Ray, Anoushka Chadha, Eben Figueiredo', null, 'Single and without a man on the horizon, Pia runs a failing photography studio in London with her best friend Jay. As her sister Sonal prepares for marriage and her mother Laxmi urges her to partner up, a spiritual guru predicts Pia will meet the love of her life among her next five dates. With her family intervening, Pia embarks on a hilarious yet heartfelt quest for love.', 'Single and without a man on the horizon, Pia runs a failing photography studio in London with her best friend Jay. As her sister Sonal prepares for marriage and her mother Laxmi urges her to partner up, a spiritual guru predicts Pia will meet the love of her life among her next five dates. With her family intervening, Pia embarks on a hilarious yet heartfelt quest for love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnUN0QoLE4Afay6iPa5f3tv8Wug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1204892'),
  ('62965048851738339', 'Pictures', 1996, 'Drama, Horror', 'Elio Quiroga', 'Elio Quiroga', 'Gustavo Salmerón, Mercedes Ortega, Miguel Molina, Diana Peñalver, Myriam De Maeztu, Amparo Muñoz, Simón Andreu, María Asquerino', null, 'Azucena is 22 years old and lives with her mother, who, due to a past trauma, can no longer speak. Azucena works in a photography lab with her best friend Paqui, and has just broken up with her latest boyfriend Dani. Azucena lives in fear of sex and physical contact, hiding in her own sheltered world. Cesar, a plastic artist feels an obsessive attraction for Azucena, as a result, making her his inspiration. This obsession is painfully observed by Jacinto, the unstable artist''s lover, who is himself involved in a violent and destructive relationship with Cesar.', 'Azucena is 22 years old and lives with her mother, who, due to a past trauma, can no longer speak. Azucena works in a photography lab with her best friend Paqui, and has just broken up with her latest boyfriend Dani. Azucena lives in fear of sex and physical contact, hiding in her own sheltered world. Cesar, a plastic artist feels an obsessive attraction for Azucena, as a result, making her his inspiration. This obsession is painfully observed by Jacinto, the unstable artist''s lover, who is himself involved in a violent and destructive relationship with Cesar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQ9HoXSGD9RNSDM4ZFH9FEE8IZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104611'),
  ('969133902076910421', 'Pictures of Ghosts', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Kleber Mendonça Filho, Pedro Sotero', 'Kleber Mendonça Filho', 'Kleber Mendonça Filho, Rubens Santos, Sonia Braga, Maeve Jinkings, Lucrecia Martel, Clara Pinheiro de Oliveira, Severino Cavalcanti, Nilo Coelho', null, 'Downtown Recife’s classic movie palaces from the 20th century are mostly gone. That city area is now an archaeological site of sorts that reveals aspects of life in society which have been lost. And that’s just part of the story.', 'Downtown Recife’s classic movie palaces from the 20th century are mostly gone. That city area is now an archaeological site of sorts that reveals aspects of life in society which have been lost. And that’s just part of the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFYGUmC7efpLkHUCbhIBppYiFd8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1112548'),
  ('573030577211284883', 'Pictures of Hollis Woods', 2007, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Tony Bill, Paul Sarossy, Heike Brandstatter', null, 'Jodelle Ferland, Sissy Spacek, Alfre Woodard, Judith Ivey, James Tupper, Julie Ann Emery, Ridge Canipe', 'PG', 'After running away from her last foster placement with the Regan family, twelve year old Hollis Woods is placed with a new foster mother, the loving, retired art teacher, Josie Cahill.', 'After running away from her last foster placement with the Regan family, twelve year old Hollis Woods is placed with a new foster mother, the loving, retired art teacher, Josie Cahill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zr4tJDmEYfoDBihet90v9Lve1bM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55703'),
  ('428299454464220688', 'Pictures of the Old World', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Dušan Hanák', 'Dušan Hanák', 'Ladislav Chudík', null, 'A raw and telling portrait of a people left behind by the modern world, inspired by the work of photographer Martin Martinček - whose pictures of the inhabitants of the Liptov region in central Slovakia, encompassed by the Tatra mountains, distilled entire lifetimes into luminous and intransient images. Dušan Hanák''s continuation of these photographs takes the shape of a poetic visual essay, capturing more comprehensive vignettes of their isolated human experiences.', 'A raw and telling portrait of a people left behind by the modern world, inspired by the work of photographer Martin Martinček - whose pictures of the inhabitants of the Liptov region in central Slovakia, encompassed by the Tatra mountains, distilled entire lifetimes into luminous and intransient images. Dušan Hanák''s continuation of these photographs takes the shape of a poetic visual essay, capturing more comprehensive vignettes of their isolated human experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGDQSKebiD9QEzypQwhNFsMGvid.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124414'),
  ('217555993838060874', 'Pie in the Sky', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bryan Gordon, Bernd Heinl, Gregory Jacobs', 'Bryan Gordon', 'Josh Charles, Anne Heche, John Goodman, Christine Lahti, Christine Ebersole, Peter Riegert, Dey Young, Bob Balaban', null, 'A young man obsessed with traffic patterns attempts to reunite with his first love.', 'A young man obsessed with traffic patterns attempts to reunite with his first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZs2BzP1nbrcHCDX3QEHa3Nn0y4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110972'),
  ('661907362336878854', 'Piece by Piece', 2024, 'Animation, Music, Documentary, Comedy', 'Morgan Neville, Howard E. Baker, Bjarne Hansen', 'Jason Zeldes, Morgan Neville, Aaron Wickenden', 'Pharrell Williams, Chad Hugo, Gwen Stefani, Kendrick Lamar, Timbaland, Justin Timberlake, Busta Rhymes, Jay-Z', 'PG', 'A unique cinematic experience that invites audiences on a vibrant journey through the life of cultural icon Pharrell Williams. Told through the lens of LEGO® animation, turn up the volume on your imagination and witness the evolution of one of music''s most innovative minds.', 'A unique cinematic experience that invites audiences on a vibrant journey through the life of cultural icon Pharrell Williams. Told through the lens of LEGO® animation, turn up the volume on your imagination and witness the evolution of one of music''s most innovative minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmOPcP8WRvm8cok4Hz3REwD7rlJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1236419'),
