  ('319143662906145723', 'Pierino torna a scuola', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Laurenti, Silvio Fraschetti, Luigina Lovari', 'Mariano Laurenti, Alvaro Vitali, Carmine De Benedittis', 'Alvaro Vitali, Nadia Bengala, Elena Fabrizi, Bruno Minniti, Alfonso Tomas, Giulio Massimini, Daniela Di Bitonto, Franco Caracciolo', null, 'Had come of age and unemployed, Peter decides to go back to school to take the elementary school. However, his academic performance continues to be poor so much so that his grandmother to play for the votes of a report card to the football pools coupon. The grandmother with the votes of Peter will win, using the amount paid to renew their tavern, without giving any money to his nephew, who will retaliate by closing all his family in the bathrooms of the new restaurant. Eventually Peter was rejected despite the efforts of his teachers, but Peter does not seem to be over: receives, in fact, a visit to Camazzo, her neighbor and Head of the third class of the Navy, which gives him an envelope containing the fateful "call to Arms".', 'Had come of age and unemployed, Peter decides to go back to school to take the elementary school. However, his academic performance continues to be poor so much so that his grandmother to play for the votes of a report card to the football pools coupon. The grandmother with the votes of Peter will win, using the amount paid to renew their tavern, without giving any money to his nephew, who will retaliate by closing all his family in the bathrooms of the new restaurant. Eventually Peter was rejected despite the efforts of his teachers, but Peter does not seem to be over: receives, in fact, a visit to Camazzo, her neighbor and Head of the third class of the Navy, which gives him an envelope containing the fateful "call to Arms".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/poG89L5EuTABykSHEcBrvp0W9qZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103134'),
  ('724352163243985201', 'Piernas cruzadas', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Rafael Villaseñor Kuri, Xavier Cruz', 'Jorge Patiño', 'Alfredo Landa, María José Cantudo, Hilda Aguirre, Charly Valentino, Julissa, Eduardo de la Peña, Carmen Salinas, Rafael Inclán', null, 'Lucerito is a Spanish star who has come to Mexico, accompanied by her godfather and her agent, to find work. Rosario is from upper class society and has grown tired of the demands made upon her by her family. When they meet each other in a Mexican hotel, they discover that they could be each other''s identical twin and decide to change places.', 'Lucerito is a Spanish star who has come to Mexico, accompanied by her godfather and her agent, to find work. Rosario is from upper class society and has grown tired of the demands made upon her by her family. When they meet each other in a Mexican hotel, they discover that they could be each other''s identical twin and decide to change places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNC1yOIYqcOgqMVg3EEdJRm87uO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137173'),
  ('298048298513973354', 'Pierre and Marie', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claude Pinoteau, Pierre Lhomme', 'Claude Pinoteau', 'Isabelle Huppert, Charles Berling, Philippe Noiret, Christian Charmetant, Philippe Morier-Genoud, Marie-Laure Descoureaux', null, 'A humoristic view of the lives of Maria Skłodowska-Curie and Pierre Curie and their discoveries around radioactivity.', 'A humoristic view of the lives of Maria Skłodowska-Curie and Pierre Curie and their discoveries around radioactivity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgT5bAUF8VAYi6yeVKHIRJ77VDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81045'),
  ('683820210344069887', 'Pierrepoint: The Last Hangman', 2005, 'Drama, History', 'Adrian Shergold, Danny Cohen', 'Jeff Pope, Bob Mills', 'Timothy Spall, Juliet Stevenson, Mary Stockley, Lizzie Hopley, Joyia Fitch, Sheyla Shehovich, Simon Armstrong, Ann Bell', null, 'Following in his father''s footsteps, Albert Pierrepoint becomes one of Britain''s most prolific executioners, hiding his identity as a grocery deliveryman. But when his ambition to be the best inadvertently exposes his gruesome secret, he becomes a minor celebrity & faces a public outcry against the practice of hanging. Based on true events.', 'Following in his father''s footsteps, Albert Pierrepoint becomes one of Britain''s most prolific executioners, hiding his identity as a grocery deliveryman. But when his ambition to be the best inadvertently exposes his gruesome secret, he becomes a minor celebrity & faces a public outcry against the practice of hanging. Based on true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UtVig6YXpZ06AoLUIiC1hMJVu4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15185'),
  ('14890016085413157', 'Pierrette''s Escapades', 1900, 'Romance', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'Julia Petit, Melle de Fretières', null, '"Les Fredaines de Pierrette" is the collective name of four short films of 20 meters each ("Arrivée de Pierrette et de Pierrot", "Arrivée d''Arlequin", "Suite de la danse", and "Départ d''Arlequin et de Pierrette"), attributed to Alice Guy (although not confirmed in any primary source), in which Columbine resists Pierrette''s courting in favor of Harlequin. From July 1901, the series were made available hand-colored.', '"Les Fredaines de Pierrette" is the collective name of four short films of 20 meters each ("Arrivée de Pierrette et de Pierrot", "Arrivée d''Arlequin", "Suite de la danse", and "Départ d''Arlequin et de Pierrette"), attributed to Alice Guy (although not confirmed in any primary source), in which Columbine resists Pierrette''s courting in favor of Harlequin. From July 1901, the series were made available hand-colored.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjXSOYq9DFISyng8rKju7xooyKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119975'),
