  ('927495814129986209', 'Pig', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rozz Williams, Nico Bruinsma', null, 'Rozz Williams, James Hollan', null, 'A young man journeys through a desert, where he is kidnapped by a sadistic stranger clad in a pig mask. The stranger proceeds to brutally torture the young man, who then finds himself escaping into his imagination, with fantasy and reality intersecting.', 'A young man journeys through a desert, where he is kidnapped by a sadistic stranger clad in a pig mask. The stranger proceeds to brutally torture the young man, who then finds himself escaping into his imagination, with fantasy and reality intersecting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQLT9GIf3UKyc9ZVdKZIAms4koS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1569'),
  ('1005946934118744192', 'Pig', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Pat Scola, Simon Max Hill, Kiya Entwisle', 'Michael Sarnoski', 'Nicolas Cage, Alex Wolff, Adam Arkin, Nina Belforte, Gretchen Corbett, Dalene Young, Darius Pierce, Elijah Ungvary', 'R', 'A truffle hunter who lives alone in the Oregon wilderness must visit Portland to find the mysterious person who stole his beloved foraging pig.', 'A truffle hunter who lives alone in the Oregon wilderness must visit Portland to find the mysterious person who stole his beloved foraging pig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1InMm4Mbjx8wCKvIy5gglo5i3HN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635731'),
  ('12600566756498950', 'Pig Hunt', 2008, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'James Isaac, Adam Kane, Natalie Tyler', 'Robert Mailer Anderson, Zack Anderson', 'Travis Aaron Wade, Tina Huang, Howard Johnson Jr., Rajiv Shah, Jason Foster, Lanie Grainger, Trevor Bullock, Nick Tagas', null, 'When John takes his San Francisco friends to his deceased uncle''s remote ranch to hunt wild pigs, it seems like a typical guys weekend with guns - despite the presence of John''s sexy girlfriend Brooks. But as John and his crew trek deeper into the forest, they begin tracking the awful truth about his uncle''s demise and the legend of The Ripper -- a murderous three-thousand-pound black boar!', 'When John takes his San Francisco friends to his deceased uncle''s remote ranch to hunt wild pigs, it seems like a typical guys weekend with guns - despite the presence of John''s sexy girlfriend Brooks. But as John and his crew trek deeper into the forest, they begin tracking the awful truth about his uncle''s demise and the legend of The Ripper -- a murderous three-thousand-pound black boar!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwezNwgYPuk4ONQs8ZGFCoHH7Xz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22731'),
  ('1031580441345065460', 'Pig Killer', 2022, 'Horror, Crime, Mystery', 'Chad Ferrin, Silawn Lewis', 'Chad Ferrin', 'Jake Busey, Ginger Lynn, Susan Priver, Lew Temple, Silvia Spross, Cassandra Gava, Cyril O''Reilly, Bai Ling', null, 'Inspired by the terrifying story of Robert ''Willy'' Pickton, the pig farmer cum prolific lady killer whose horrific crimes shocked the world, PIG KILLER graphically depicts the rape, torture, slaughter and dismemberment of forty-nine young women on a pig farm. With his herculean hog, Balthazar, by his side, Willy and his menagerie of colorful cohorts terrorize Vancouver''s seedy downtown until his arrest which uncovered a horrific series of brutal Canadian murders.', 'Inspired by the terrifying story of Robert ''Willy'' Pickton, the pig farmer cum prolific lady killer whose horrific crimes shocked the world, PIG KILLER graphically depicts the rape, torture, slaughter and dismemberment of forty-nine young women on a pig farm. With his herculean hog, Balthazar, by his side, Willy and his menagerie of colorful cohorts terrorize Vancouver''s seedy downtown until his arrest which uncovered a horrific series of brutal Canadian murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6R1Iin86tA0r1HuKVdb1iBN26l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018829'),
  ('770521409755702941', 'Pigalle', 1995, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Karim Dridi, John Mathieson', 'Karim Dridi', 'Véra Briole, Francis Renaud, Raymond Gil, Blanca Li, Philippe Ambrosini, Jean-Michel Fête, Patrick Chauvel, Jean Claude Grenier', null, 'It''s a grim world of prostitution, drug dens, transvestites, junkies and murderers. The seediest side of urban life is examined in this tragedy. The film follows the complex, interwoven lives of four characters as they live their harsh and gritty nocturnal lives on the city streets. The main characters are Fifi a pickpocket who is simultaneously involved with Divine, a transvestite hooker and Vera a peep show dancer who refuses to be a hooker. Vera lives with her would-be pimp Jesus le Gitan, a small-scale drug dealer. When the area riff-raff become embroiled in hostilities, two of main characters are slowly killed in horrible ways. Fifi is then left to avenge their deaths.', 'It''s a grim world of prostitution, drug dens, transvestites, junkies and murderers. The seediest side of urban life is examined in this tragedy. The film follows the complex, interwoven lives of four characters as they live their harsh and gritty nocturnal lives on the city streets. The main characters are Fifi a pickpocket who is simultaneously involved with Divine, a transvestite hooker and Vera a peep show dancer who refuses to be a hooker. Vera lives with her would-be pimp Jesus le Gitan, a small-scale drug dealer. When the area riff-raff become embroiled in hostilities, two of main characters are slowly killed in horrible ways. Fifi is then left to avenge their deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KYOb6C4JwXWIbKjaNtPSJRCFkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203954'),
  ('275043341012969663', 'Pigeon: Impossible', 2009, 'Action, Animation', 'Lucas Martell', 'Lucas Martell', null, null, 'The tale of Walter, a rookie secret agent faced with a problem seldom covered in basic training: what to do when a curious pigeon gets trapped inside your multi-million dollar, government-issued nuclear briefcase.', 'The tale of Walter, a rookie secret agent faced with a problem seldom covered in basic training: what to do when a curious pigeon gets trapped inside your multi-million dollar, government-issued nuclear briefcase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHz1mmS2TSkD1c4DVHpuwjDO2pG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47227'),
  ('851620172777309523', 'Pigeons in the Square', 1982, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé, Vincent Berczi', 'Olivér Tóth', 'Jean Painlevé', null, 'An enthusiastic grandfather sits with children in a Parisian park talking about pigeons. First. their physical appearance—eye, wings and tail, and color—and their varieties. Then, he encourages the children to imitate their walk. He points out courtship and mating rituals, then provides an illustrated discussion of how they eat. This section is punctuated by a flock of pigeons fighting over a small, hard ball each wants to eat; the narrator''s describes it as if it were a soccer match. He concludes with a discussion of pigeons taking off, landing, and flying; he uses slow motion and stop-time photography to show his audience.', 'An enthusiastic grandfather sits with children in a Parisian park talking about pigeons. First. their physical appearance—eye, wings and tail, and color—and their varieties. Then, he encourages the children to imitate their walk. He points out courtship and mating rituals, then provides an illustrated discussion of how they eat. This section is punctuated by a flock of pigeons fighting over a small, hard ball each wants to eat; the narrator''s describes it as if it were a soccer match. He concludes with a discussion of pigeons taking off, landing, and flying; he uses slow motion and stop-time photography to show his audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbqpuPUAyRk4WY8PP80FkCzoFek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162784'),
  ('542193151630183655', 'Pigeons on the Roof', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Otto Alexander Jahrreiss, Hannes Hubach', 'Otto Alexander Jahrreiss', 'Katja Riemann, Olli Dittrich, Leonard Carow, Beat Marti, Guido Broscheit, Sara Fazilat, Mirko Lang, Jochen Wigand', null, 'Youssef''s falafel are the bestseller. Unfortunately, his small snack bar on Berliner Sonnenallee lacks the required splash guard. The meticulous Peggy of the Public Order Office knows no mercy: The desperate Lebanese has to close the shop, but then the unlikely happens: The shy official falls in love with the spirited Orientals. In this episodic big city comedy, the elementary particles of love collide. Katja Riemann and Olli Dittrich prove their incredible versatility in ten different roles', 'Youssef''s falafel are the bestseller. Unfortunately, his small snack bar on Berliner Sonnenallee lacks the required splash guard. The meticulous Peggy of the Public Order Office knows no mercy: The desperate Lebanese has to close the shop, but then the unlikely happens: The shy official falls in love with the spirited Orientals. In this episodic big city comedy, the elementary particles of love collide. Katja Riemann and Olli Dittrich prove their incredible versatility in ten different roles', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZSpqoh0tHs8IdIXhn067ampChH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79472'),
  ('934808145010620695', 'Piggies', 2009, 'Drama', 'Robert Gliński', 'Joanna Didik, Robert Gliński', 'Filip Garbacz, Bogdan Koca, Dorota Wierzbicka-Matarrelli, Piotr Jagielski, Tomasz Tyndyk, Janusz Chabior', null, 'Tomek is 14 and a good student. He''s interested in astronomy and plays football to please his father. The only thing is, he lives in a poor little border town plagued by unemployment, whereas across the river lies Germany with all its relative affluence. Tomek meets Marta at a disco and falls in love with her. He starts to think up ways of earning money in order to keep her interested. He approaches a pimp who seeks out local boys for his German clients. Tomek has no idea of the brutal fate which awaits him.', 'Tomek is 14 and a good student. He''s interested in astronomy and plays football to please his father. The only thing is, he lives in a poor little border town plagued by unemployment, whereas across the river lies Germany with all its relative affluence. Tomek meets Marta at a disco and falls in love with her. He starts to think up ways of earning money in order to keep her interested. He approaches a pimp who seeks out local boys for his German clients. Tomek has no idea of the brutal fate which awaits him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrc0b1uzb7Ssx5whoqHBL18J2U7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53821'),
  ('439254210890202179', 'Piggy', 2018, 'Drama, Horror', 'Carlota Pereda, Rita Noriega', 'Carlota Pereda', 'Laura Galán, Paco Hidalgo, Elisabet Casanovas, Mireia Vilapuig, Sara Barroso, Jorge Elorza, Alejandro Chaparro, Pascual Laborda', null, 'Sara is an overweight teen who lives in the shadow of a clique of cool girls holidaying in her village. Not even her childhood friend, Claudia, defends her when she''s bullied at the local pool in front of an unknown man. Her clothes are stolen and Sara must get home wearing nothing but her bikini.', 'Sara is an overweight teen who lives in the shadow of a clique of cool girls holidaying in her village. Not even her childhood friend, Claudia, defends her when she''s bullied at the local pool in front of an unknown man. Her clothes are stolen and Sara must get home wearing nothing but her bikini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etj9vWikudVetTeXKXuT0o6FJY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508152'),
  ('619866519971855996', 'Piggy', 2022, 'Drama, Horror', 'Carlota Pereda, Rita Noriega, Sara San Martín', 'Carlota Pereda', 'Laura Galán, Richard Holmes, Carmen Machi, Irene Ferreiro, Camille Aguilar, Claudia Salas, José Pastor, Fernando Delgado-Hierro', 'NR', 'A bullied overweight teenager sees a glimpse of hope when her tormentors are brutally abducted by a mesmerizing stranger.', 'A bullied overweight teenager sees a glimpse of hope when her tormentors are brutally abducted by a mesmerizing stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIFeu5gF7ofAxI9NqrWbJAjjKn6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848058'),
  ('909323032518718440', 'Piglet', 2025, 'Horror', 'Andrea M. Catinella, Viktorija Faith', 'Harrison Thomas Boxley', 'Alina Desmond, Alex Butler, Shayli Reagan, Lauren Staerck, Valery Danko, Alina Varakuta, Jeremy Vinogradov, Rory Forder', 'R', 'On Kate''s 21st birthday camping trip, her friends encounter Piglet, a monstrous human-pig hybrid who brutally murders one of them. They uncover Piglet''s origins and Kate must confront her past to survive the relentless killer.', 'On Kate''s 21st birthday camping trip, her friends encounter Piglet, a monstrous human-pig hybrid who brutally murders one of them. They uncover Piglet''s origins and Kate must confront her past to survive the relentless killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mW7PYDUeWYwTdbtzThqLMfdNa56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1352774'),
  ('789008521845757725', 'Piglet''s Big Movie', 2003, 'Animation, Family', 'Francis Glebas, Fumio Maezono, Yumiko Suzuki', 'Brian Hohlfeld', 'John Fiedler, Jim Cummings, Nikita Hopkins, Ken Sansom, Peter Cullen, Kath Soucie, Andre Stojka, Tom Wheatley', 'G', 'When the gang from the Hundred Acre Wood begin a honey harvest, young Piglet is excluded and told that he is too small to help. Feeling inferior, Piglet disappears and his pals Eeyore, Rabbit, Tigger, Roo and Winnie the Pooh must use Piglet''s scrapbook as a map to find him. In the process they discover that this very small animal has been a big hero in a lot of ways.', 'When the gang from the Hundred Acre Wood begin a honey harvest, young Piglet is excluded and told that he is too small to help. Feeling inferior, Piglet disappears and his pals Eeyore, Rabbit, Tigger, Roo and Winnie the Pooh must use Piglet''s scrapbook as a map to find him. In the process they discover that this very small animal has been a big hero in a lot of ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cytspPjtacOInHroA6h2dIekDrp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13691'),
  ('1104730247021311604', 'Piglets', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Luc Feit, Marcus Sauermann, Kolja Brandt', 'Marcus Sauermann', 'Christoph Marti, Tobias Bonn, Andreja Schneider', null, 'Two men are on the verge of making love, but an old neighbor does everything she can to ruin their adventure.', 'Two men are on the verge of making love, but an old neighbor does everything she can to ruin their adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SckXRquBDBtQpOZ5jnOxcUJln6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46819'),
  ('966273251231193794', 'Pigs', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Karl DiPelino', 'Karl DiPelino, Chris Ragonetti', 'Jefferson Brown, Darryn Lucio, Christopher Elliott, Melanie Marden, Tyrone Greenidge, Heidi Rayden, Leslie Ferreira, Sarah Scheffer', 'R', 'A college ladies man accepts a challenge from his dorm buddies - sleep with the entire alphabet, A through Z, before graduation. The rules are simple: the rarer the first letter of the girl''s last name, the higher the payout. All goes well until he falls for the "X". Now he''s torn between his feelings for the girl and winning the bet for his friends.', 'A college ladies man accepts a challenge from his dorm buddies - sleep with the entire alphabet, A through Z, before graduation. The rules are simple: the rarer the first letter of the girl''s last name, the higher the payout. All goes well until he falls for the "X". Now he''s torn between his feelings for the girl and winning the bet for his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYsi3rb3PJdR0M5mZ99nSXTV6XZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18755'),
  ('782752940449386110', 'Pigs 3', 2020, 'Action, Crime', 'Władysław Pasikowski, Maciej Lisiecki, Kacper Habisiak', 'Władysław Pasikowski', 'Bogusław Linda, Marcin Dorociński, Cezary Pazura, Jan Frycz, Sebastian Fabijański, Tomasz Schuchardt, Mirosław Baka, Dominika Walo', null, 'Having spent years in prison, Franz Maurer is released and goes out into a new Poland, where nothing is as he remembered it to be. Who and what is waiting for the man who, for the last 25 years... hasn’t been doing anything? How will he find himself in a world where old principles and loyalty have ceased to exist? We will get to know that when fate reunites Franz and “Nowy”. Their meeting will change everything.', 'Having spent years in prison, Franz Maurer is released and goes out into a new Poland, where nothing is as he remembered it to be. Who and what is waiting for the man who, for the last 25 years... hasn’t been doing anything? How will he find himself in a world where old principles and loyalty have ceased to exist? We will get to know that when fate reunites Franz and “Nowy”. Their meeting will change everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zACDb1jD9P5M6R5lW6XC0tCwGAS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642700'),
  ('1137485660046111450', 'Pigs and Battleships', 1961, 'Crime, Drama', 'Shōhei Imamura, Shinsaku Himeda, Yasuo Iwaki', 'Hisashi Yamanouchi', 'Hiroyuki Nagato, Jitsuko Yoshimura, Masao Mishima, Tetsuro Tamba, Shirō Ōsaka, Takeshi Katō, Shoichi Ozawa, Yōko Minamida', null, 'In the city of Yokosuka, Kinta and his lover Haruko, both involved with yakuza, brave the post-occupation period with a goal to be together.', 'In the city of Yokosuka, Kinta and his lover Haruko, both involved with yakuza, brave the post-occupation period with a goal to be together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WfCDU8hF3zgFGf9IXdyL0j7Rot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31104'),
  ('710192646923718427', 'Pigs Have Wings', 1977, 'Romance, Drama', 'Paolo Pietrangeli, Mimmola Girosi', 'Paolo Pietrangeli', 'Cristiana Mancinelli, Franco Bianchi, Benedetta Fantoli, Susanna Javicoli, Marco Lucantoni, Anna Nogara, Lou Castel, Paolo Lavorini', null, 'Rome, 70s. Rocco and Antonia, high school students, meet during a political rally. The two young people share age, political ideas, dissatisfaction with their parents. Moreover, by attending, they realize they have fallen in love. It is the discovery of sex and passion. After some time, however, their relationship goes into crisis.', 'Rome, 70s. Rocco and Antonia, high school students, meet during a political rally. The two young people share age, political ideas, dissatisfaction with their parents. Moreover, by attending, they realize they have fallen in love. It is the discovery of sex and passion. After some time, however, their relationship goes into crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xa408WyDPFQdtV5NU1CqMgz1IYP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105523'),
  ('1058831825622155088', 'Pigs in a Polka', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Sara Berner, Bea Benaderet, Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'A tuxedo-clad wolf Master of Ceremonies announces the evening''s program: the tale of the Big Bad Wolf and the Three Little Pigs, set to the music of Johannes Brahms''s Hungarian Dances. Queue the fairy tale.', 'A tuxedo-clad wolf Master of Ceremonies announces the evening''s program: the tale of the Big Bad Wolf and the Three Little Pigs, set to the music of Johannes Brahms''s Hungarian Dances. Queue the fairy tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsi0qVI5XER2LD1IK81hRJg6Z0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100323'),
  ('219611348843536179', 'Pigs Is Pigs', 1937, 'Comedy, Family, Animation', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Bernice Hansen, Martha Wentworth', 'NR', 'A hungry little pig eats a couple of pies off the windowsill. When it''s time for dinner, he ties together the spaghetti of all the other little pigs and eats it all. That night, he has a nightmare where he is force-fed by a mad scientist.', 'A hungry little pig eats a couple of pies off the windowsill. When it''s time for dinner, he ties together the spaghetti of all the other little pigs and eats it all. That night, he has a nightmare where he is force-fed by a mad scientist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxA79Jnp86dbyfsBihbWxLSTQx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100327'),
  ('873243093614409638', 'Pigs Is Pigs', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Gary Owens, Bill Thompson, Bob Hamlin, Thurl Ravenscroft, Max Smith, Bill Lee', 'NR', 'Flannery, a railway agent does everything by the book. He gets into a scrape with a customer, McMorehouse, who wants to pay 44 cents freight for two guinea pigs which he considers pets. Flannery, however, considers them pigs (freight 48 cents), a decision he begins to regret when the animals begin to reproduce.', 'Flannery, a railway agent does everything by the book. He gets into a scrape with a customer, McMorehouse, who wants to pay 44 cents freight for two guinea pigs which he considers pets. Flannery, however, considers them pigs (freight 48 cents), a decision he begins to regret when the animals begin to reproduce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JxuMr30JsP6NxCelB0HdgjqmfP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56011'),
  ('313687821740632459', 'Pigskin Parade', 1936, 'Comedy, Music', 'David Butler, Ad Schaumer, Arthur C. Miller', 'Jack Yellen, Harry Tugend, William M. Conselman', 'Stuart Erwin, Patsy Kelly, Jack Haley, Johnny Downs, Betty Grable, Arline Judge, Dixie Dunbar, Judy Garland', 'NR', 'Bessie and Winston "Slug" Winters are married coaches whose mission is to whip their college football team into shape. Just in time, they discover a hillbilly farmhand and his sister. The hillbilly farmhand''s ability to throw melons enables him to become their star passing ace.', 'Bessie and Winston "Slug" Winters are married coaches whose mission is to whip their college football team into shape. Just in time, they discover a hillbilly farmhand and his sister. The hillbilly farmhand''s ability to throw melons enables him to become their star passing ace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lss1DRv5XB6hM0r2QNhLsDrp2vm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83633'),
  ('470605139682611103', 'Pigsty', 1969, 'Drama', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Fabio Garriba, Sergio Citti', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Pierre Clémenti, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Alberto Lionello, Ugo Tognazzi, Anne Wiazemsky, Margarita Lozano, Marco Ferreri, Franco Citti', null, 'Two dramatic stories. In an undetermined past, a young cannibal (who killed his own father) is condemned to be torn to pieces by some wild beasts. In the second story, Julian, the young son of a post-war German industrialist, is on the way to lie down with his farm''s pigs, because he doesn''t like human relationships.', 'Two dramatic stories. In an undetermined past, a young cannibal (who killed his own father) is condemned to be torn to pieces by some wild beasts. In the second story, Julian, the young son of a post-war German industrialist, is on the way to lie down with his farm''s pigs, because he doesn''t like human relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FZmcZ9EH4sk9WxLe90m0ddRpnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48688'),
  ('592204094144079886', 'Pigtails', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Koji Tanaka, Yoshimi Itazu, Kisuke Koizumi', 'Miho Maruo', 'Junichi Suwabe, Kana Hanazawa, Yusuke Kobayashi', null, 'The earth shook. The sea roared. And then… There is a small house solitary standing by the seaside. A young girl has been living there alone since that fateful day. Mail is no longer delivered, but even this morning, she’s hanging out the laundry as usual. She’s unaware that all around her, the clothes pegs are quarreling, the pillow argues with the umbrella about the outside world, and the new toothbrush is unsuccessfully trying to charm the grumpy older ones. Do objects exist to be used until they are consumed or broken? Are they afraid of being thrown away once their life cycle is complete? A delicate story of hope in a cruel and gentle world after an unnamed disaster.', 'The earth shook. The sea roared. And then… There is a small house solitary standing by the seaside. A young girl has been living there alone since that fateful day. Mail is no longer delivered, but even this morning, she’s hanging out the laundry as usual. She’s unaware that all around her, the clothes pegs are quarreling, the pillow argues with the umbrella about the outside world, and the new toothbrush is unsuccessfully trying to charm the grumpy older ones. Do objects exist to be used until they are consumed or broken? Are they afraid of being thrown away once their life cycle is complete? A delicate story of hope in a cruel and gentle world after an unnamed disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rj4qNHQ1pK6aa0xdY0qM2U8TyfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421474'),
  ('29650311217701291', 'Pihu', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Vinod Kapri, Yogesh Jani', null, 'Pihu Myra Vishwakarma, Prerna Sharma', null, 'The social thriller starring a two year-old baby girl. She is living in a home where the adults are going through a complicated phase. Being a toddler, she is occasionally trapped in the accidental situations.', 'The social thriller starring a two year-old baby girl. She is living in a home where the adults are going through a complicated phase. Being a toddler, she is occasionally trapped in the accidental situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRsqo4iSRvUK8eFsmT4y16BbmnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563987'),
  ('706965449838335191', 'Pikachu & Pichu', 2000, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Masafumi Mima, Yuji Asada', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Ikue Otani, Satomi Korogi, Yumi Touma, Ryoka Yuzuki, Inuko Inuyama, Rikako Aikawa, Megumi Hayashibara, Mika Kanai', null, 'It''s double trouble in the big city! Pikachu is lost, and the Pichu Bros. must help their new pal get back before Ash notices his Pokémon is missing. It''s a race against the clock that has the duo dragging Pikachu into one disaster after another!', 'It''s double trouble in the big city! Pikachu is lost, and the Pichu Bros. must help their new pal get back before Ash notices his Pokémon is missing. It''s a race against the clock that has the duo dragging Pikachu into one disaster after another!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/236O6h9x7rlZx70iMzZpk7iMgzz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36753'),
  ('17896663404237440', 'Pikachu''s PikaBoo', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Hisao Shirai, Yuji Asada', 'Yukiyoshi Ôhashi', 'Ikue Otani, Satomi Korogi, Mika Kanai, Yuji Ueda, Chinami Nishimura, Megumi Hayashibara, Rikako Aikawa, Inuko Inuyama', 'NR', 'At a giant beachside mansion, Pikachu and some of its buddies decide to play a game of hide-and-seek. Pikachu is “it,” and it goes off in search of its friends. Meanwhile, Larvitar, sick of being all by itself, kicks a rock in anger. The rock hurtles through the air—and hits a lawnmower, turning it on and sending it tearing off after Pikachu and its friends! The group draws the lawnmower into a maze and even gets it into the water, but the lawnmower just keeps on chasing. The Pokémon build a road out of logs, hoping to get the lawnmower into a shack, but Psyduck trips and ruins the whole setup. How will the friends ever escape the lawnmower? This fantasy will have you on the edge of your seat!', 'At a giant beachside mansion, Pikachu and some of its buddies decide to play a game of hide-and-seek. Pikachu is “it,” and it goes off in search of its friends. Meanwhile, Larvitar, sick of being all by itself, kicks a rock in anger. The rock hurtles through the air—and hits a lawnmower, turning it on and sending it tearing off after Pikachu and its friends! The group draws the lawnmower into a maze and even gets it into the water, but the lawnmower just keeps on chasing. The Pokémon build a road out of logs, hoping to get the lawnmower into a shack, but Psyduck trips and ruins the whole setup. How will the friends ever escape the lawnmower? This fantasy will have you on the edge of your seat!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9I4TpMjSxT8M936yTXPpm8dkeGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293245'),
  ('237540400235571845', 'Pikachu''s Vacation', 1998, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Masafumi Mima, Akihiro Tamagawa', 'Takeshi Shudo', 'Ikue Otani, Satomi Korogi, Rikako Aikawa, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Kouichi Sakaguchi, Naoki Tatsuta, Urara Takano', 'G', 'Pikachu and the gang learn responsibility, teamwork as well as cooperation during their Summer vacation at Pokemon Island.', 'Pikachu and the gang learn responsibility, teamwork as well as cooperation during their Summer vacation at Pokemon Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLoIdgQhAuPnHM8AqPecY8cjWWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33376'),
  ('909180459932345095', 'Pikadero', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ben Sharrock, Nick Cooke', 'Ben Sharrock', 'Bárbara Goenaga, Joseba Usabiaga, Lander Otaola, Zorion Eguileor, Itziar Lazkano, Peio Arnaez', null, 'Unable to fly the nest due to the economic crisis that grips Spain, a penniless, young couple have trouble consummating their fledgling relationship in their parents'' homes.', 'Unable to fly the nest due to the economic crisis that grips Spain, a penniless, young couple have trouble consummating their fledgling relationship in their parents'' homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiEHXGqCeaOpVzIBLdFn6toh0CQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360809'),
  ('56833257144893219', 'Pikkupojat', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Ere Kokkonen, Juha Jalasti', 'Spede Pasanen', 'Hannele Lauri, Spede Pasanen, Vesa-Matti Loiri, Simo Salminen, Marita Nordberg, Riitta Väisänen, Satu Silvo, Heikki Kinnunen', null, 'OK, imagine four men in their 40s and 50s. You there? OK, now imagine them wearing suits and playing on a sandbox as characters aged 4, 5 and 6. Pasanen even has his trademark beard, for Christ''s sake!', 'OK, imagine four men in their 40s and 50s. You there? OK, now imagine them wearing suits and playing on a sandbox as characters aged 4, 5 and 6. Pasanen even has his trademark beard, for Christ''s sake!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ju8XfppMIvRLFZckBLeZ3cYFM8E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38215'),
  ('1009577300356300976', 'Piku', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shoojit Sircar, Kamaljeet Negi, Swetha N Kutty', 'Juhi Chaturvedi', 'Deepika Padukone, Amitabh Bachchan, Irrfan Khan, Moushumi Chatterjee, Raghubir Yadav, Jisshu Sengupta, Swaroopa Ghosh, Avijit Dutt', null, 'A taxi driver is caught between a dysfunctional relationship between a woman and her father as he drives them to Kolkata.', 'A taxi driver is caught between a dysfunctional relationship between a woman and her father as he drives them to Kolkata.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yo7EZWiLpLGhqs3YnlDGDBPjfTb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332835'),
  ('708486959876651263', 'Pil''s Adventures', 2021, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Julien Fournet', 'Julien Fournet', 'Kaycie Chase, Pierre Tessier, Enrique Carballido, Paul Borne, Julien Crampon, Gauthier Battoue, Barbara Tissier, Emmanuel Curtil', 'PG', 'Pil, a little vagabond girl, lives on the streets of the medieval city of Roc-en-Brume, along with her three tame weasels. She survives of food stolen from the castle of the sinister Regent Tristain. One day, to escape his guards, Pil disguises herself as a princess. Thus she embarks upon a mad, delirious adventure, together with Crobar, a big clumsy guard who thinks she''s a noble, and Rigolin, a young crackpot jester. Pil is going to have to save Roland, rightful heir to the throne under the curse of a spell. This adventure will turn the entire kingdom upside down, and teach Pil that nobility can be found in all of us.', 'Pil, a little vagabond girl, lives on the streets of the medieval city of Roc-en-Brume, along with her three tame weasels. She survives of food stolen from the castle of the sinister Regent Tristain. One day, to escape his guards, Pil disguises herself as a princess. Thus she embarks upon a mad, delirious adventure, together with Crobar, a big clumsy guard who thinks she''s a noble, and Rigolin, a young crackpot jester. Pil is going to have to save Roland, rightful heir to the throne under the curse of a spell. This adventure will turn the entire kingdom upside down, and teach Pil that nobility can be found in all of us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s460WnGrUOm2v18k39ZfjJF21MU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676705'),
  ('904019579520705937', 'Pilar''s Diary in the Amazon', 2026, 'Adventure, Children', 'Rodrigo Van Der Put, Eduardo Vaisman, Adrian Teijido, Guilherme Camurati', 'João Costa Van Hombeeck', 'Lina Flor, Miguel Soares, Sophia Ataíde, Thúlio Naab, Marcelo Adnet', null, 'Young explorer Pilar travels to the Amazon through her magic net. After meeting Maiara, a riverside dweller whose community was destroyed, Pilar and her friends seek to reunite her friend''s family and prevent deforestation.', 'Young explorer Pilar travels to the Amazon through her magic net. After meeting Maiara, a riverside dweller whose community was destroyed, Pilar and her friends seek to reunite her friend''s family and prevent deforestation.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FkFBWjlAhdGgVFYXFN6hI5Pflezy.jpg', 'plex:movie:pilars-diary-in-the-amazon'),
  ('982832370176130074', 'Pilgrim', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Marcus Dunstan', 'Marcus Dunstan, Noah Feinberg, Patrick Melton', 'Reign Edwards, Beth Curry, Antonio Raul Garcia, Peter Giles, Tessa Goss, Courtney Henggeler, Elyse Levesque, Kerr Smith', 'NR', 'In an attempt to remind her family of their privilege and help them bond, Ms. Anna Barker invites Pilgrim reenactors to stay with them over Thanksgiving. When the “actors” refuse to break character, the Barker family learns that there is such a thing as too much gratitude.', 'In an attempt to remind her family of their privilege and help them bond, Ms. Anna Barker invites Pilgrim reenactors to stay with them over Thanksgiving. When the “actors” refuse to break character, the Barker family learns that there is such a thing as too much gratitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uswFh1UtkV2hkvkTfczQXNodjFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643866'),
  ('868530213729479681', 'Pilgrim''s Progress', 1978, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Ken Anderson, Roger Boller', 'Ken Anderson', 'Peter Thomas, Liam Neeson, Maurice O''Callaghan, Ronnie Irvine, David Huntley, Stella McCusker, George Beverly Shea', null, 'Journey with Pilgrim to the Celestial City, as John Bunyan''s famous allegory leaps from its pages into movie from. You''ll experience the Slough of Despond, the Hill of Difficulty, Vanity Fair; Meet Pliable, Mr. Obstinate, Worldly Wiseman, Evangelist, Mr. Interpreter, and Pilgrim''s constant foe, Apollyon. Follow Pilgrim to the Cross, where he finds real sanctification. A powerful visualization of the Christian life.', 'Journey with Pilgrim to the Celestial City, as John Bunyan''s famous allegory leaps from its pages into movie from. You''ll experience the Slough of Despond, the Hill of Difficulty, Vanity Fair; Meet Pliable, Mr. Obstinate, Worldly Wiseman, Evangelist, Mr. Interpreter, and Pilgrim''s constant foe, Apollyon. Follow Pilgrim to the Cross, where he finds real sanctification. A powerful visualization of the Christian life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdwKglbAWHQK3mI9OzSN1g2KlEg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67897'),
  ('343043001160184559', 'Pilgrim''s Progress', 2008, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Danny Carrales', 'Danny Carrales', 'Daniel Kruse, Jeremiah Guelzo, Hugh McLean, Reid Dalton, Rodney Harter, Adam Salvia, Bob Burchette, David Partie', null, 'Follow Christian and his companions on a great journey from the City of Destruction to the gates of Heaven as they face obstacles large and small, man-made and demon-spawned. Beyond the gripping drama, Bunyan’s powerful allegory teaches us all the hazards and hopes of the Christian life, and it features the triumphant glory that awaits all who faithfully follow the King of kings!', 'Follow Christian and his companions on a great journey from the City of Destruction to the gates of Heaven as they face obstacles large and small, man-made and demon-spawned. Beyond the gripping drama, Bunyan’s powerful allegory teaches us all the hazards and hopes of the Christian life, and it features the triumphant glory that awaits all who faithfully follow the King of kings!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nK9NYlsFMuM1ssJHNc8V8zTew4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46019'),
  ('346418472880432422', 'Pilgrimage', 1933, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Edward O''Fearna, George Schneiderman, John Ford', 'Philip Klein, Barry Conners', 'Henrietta Crosman, Heather Angel, Norman Foster, Lucille La Verne, Maurice Murphy, Marian Nixon, Jay Ward, Robert Warwick', 'NR', 'A mother from Arkansas is very possessive of her grown son. To prevent him from getting married she has him drafted into WW I.', 'A mother from Arkansas is very possessive of her grown son. To prevent him from getting married she has him drafted into WW I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6l8qyIdtPdrBI3gloCoKNiiu66M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114348'),
  ('219936058319893735', 'Pilgrimage', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Brendan Muldowney, Charlie Endean, Sophie Higel', 'Jamie Hannigan', 'Tom Holland, Richard Armitage, Jon Bernthal, Stanley Weber, John Lynch, Éric Godon, Tristan McConnell, Rúaidhrí Conroy', 'PG', 'In 13th century Ireland a group of monks must escort a sacred relic across a landscape fraught with peril.', 'In 13th century Ireland a group of monks must escort a sacred relic across a landscape fraught with peril.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nM6cRkfL09d9SuOurX83mYN3n9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340442'),
  ('983663155270062142', 'Pillars of the Sky', 1956, 'Western', 'Marshall Green, Harold Lipstein, George Marshall', 'Sam Rolfe', 'Jeff Chandler, Dorothy Malone, Ward Bond, Keith Andes, Lee Marvin, Sydney Chaplin, Willis Bouchey, Michael Ansara', 'NR', 'First Sergeant Emmett Bell faces off with Apache chieftain Kamiakin in this nuanced portrayal of racial tensions between Native Americans and white settlers in 1860s Oregon Country.', 'First Sergeant Emmett Bell faces off with Apache chieftain Kamiakin in this nuanced portrayal of racial tensions between Native Americans and white settlers in 1860s Oregon Country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8PWdCTexteS26Eu1wt0YWiPy1i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39109'),
  ('408484007878877714', 'Pillion', 2025, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Harry Lighton, Nick Morris, Toby Spanton', 'Harry Lighton', 'Harry Melling, Alexander Skarsgård, Lesley Sharp, Douglas Hodge, Jake Shears, Mat Hill, Nick Figgis, Zoe Engerer', 'NR', 'Colin, a timid gay man, is swept off his feet when Ray, an enigmatic and impossibly handsome biker, takes him on as his submissive in a crazy and erotic BDSM-focused relationship.', 'Colin, a timid gay man, is swept off his feet when Ray, an enigmatic and impossibly handsome biker, takes him on as his submissive in a crazy and erotic BDSM-focused relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Pd6ChSQjSXy4snJiorSdzg2cG3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1287141'),
  ('958845228230513673', 'Pillow Fight, No. 2', 1898, null, 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'A group of children in a pillow fight.', 'A group of children in a pillow fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5WNVhrNG118whWeR7J4TE5bQx2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194616'),
  ('326933113142121779', 'Pillow of Death', 1945, 'Horror, Mystery, Crime', 'Wallace Fox, Bernard B. Brown, Jerome Ash', 'George Bricker', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Brenda Joyce, J. Edward Bromberg, Rosalind Ivan, Clara Blandick, George Cleveland, Wilton Graff, Bernard Thomas', null, 'Attorney Wayne Fletcher and his secretary have an affair. When Wayne''s wife is found smothered to death, he becomes the prime suspect. As the police investigate the murder, a psychic with questionable motives tries to contact the deceased woman. Soon, Wayne begins seeing visions of his dead wife, and other people involved with the case begin to be killed, one by one.', 'Attorney Wayne Fletcher and his secretary have an affair. When Wayne''s wife is found smothered to death, he becomes the prime suspect. As the police investigate the murder, a psychic with questionable motives tries to contact the deceased woman. Soon, Wayne begins seeing visions of his dead wife, and other people involved with the case begin to be killed, one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZoTrZ5zQMFmBOpnMDcZ0fCAxe4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64077'),
  ('336707539972443843', 'Pillow Party Massacre', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Andrea Juneau, Erik Skybak, Calvin Morie McCarthy', 'Calvin Morie McCarthy', 'Laura Welsh, Neil Green, Jon Meggison, Amy DiLorenzo, Jax Kellington, Stephanie Leet, Steve Larkin, Calvin Morie McCarthy', 'R', 'After a bullying incident leads to tragedy, four former High school friends reconnect at a vacation home where a maniacal killer stalks the night.', 'After a bullying incident leads to tragedy, four former High school friends reconnect at a vacation home where a maniacal killer stalks the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0IGE0CCfHxsbCNJEPkYgLKdaSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1104670'),
  ('614933510714309862', 'Pillow Talk', 1959, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Arthur E. Arling, Michael Gordon, Phil Bowles', 'Stanley Shapiro, Maurice Richlin', 'Doris Day, Rock Hudson, Tony Randall, Thelma Ritter, Nick Adams, Julia Meade, Allen Jenkins, Marcel Dalio', 'NR', 'Playboy songwriter Brad Allen''s succession of romances annoys his neighbor, interior designer Jan Morrow, who shares a telephone party line with him and hears all his breezy routines. After Jan unsuccessfully lodges a complaint against him, Brad sets about to seduce her in the guise of a sincere and upstanding Texas rancher. When mutual friend Jonathan discovers that his best friend is moving in on the girl he desires, however, sparks fly.', 'Playboy songwriter Brad Allen''s succession of romances annoys his neighbor, interior designer Jan Morrow, who shares a telephone party line with him and hears all his breezy routines. After Jan unsuccessfully lodges a complaint against him, Brad sets about to seduce her in the guise of a sincere and upstanding Texas rancher. When mutual friend Jonathan discovers that his best friend is moving in on the girl he desires, however, sparks fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugvyj5nl9QmTYuaGUTefVYBDePE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4952'),
  ('1063767735878661809', 'Pillow to Post', 1945, 'Comedy', 'Vincent Sherman, Wesley Anderson', 'Charles Hoffman', 'Ida Lupino, Sydney Greenstreet, William Prince, Stuart Erwin, Johnny Mitchell, Ruth Donnelly, Barbara Brown, Frank Orth', 'NR', 'With a war on and most men being drafted, Howard Oil Supply Company has no salesmen left. So daughter Jean hits the road and does not make one sale. She finally gets one tentative sale with the Black Hills Oil Co., but Earl wants dinner with her. With the shortage of housing due to the war, Jean needs a military husband to get a place to stay in Clayfield, which is next to Camp Clay. She gets Lt. Mallory to act as her husband just to register. Then things go wrong as his commanding officer is there and believes them to be married. It gets worse as Don''s mother shows up and then Jean''s father.', 'With a war on and most men being drafted, Howard Oil Supply Company has no salesmen left. So daughter Jean hits the road and does not make one sale. She finally gets one tentative sale with the Black Hills Oil Co., but Earl wants dinner with her. With the shortage of housing due to the war, Jean needs a military husband to get a place to stay in Clayfield, which is next to Camp Clay. She gets Lt. Mallory to act as her husband just to register. Then things go wrong as his commanding officer is there and believes them to be married. It gets worse as Don''s mother shows up and then Jean''s father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AejWOpc3vZIwwd5xuCSp5xzTnEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106826'),
  ('661098073114304103', 'Pilot', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Kim Han-kyul, Kim Sung-an, Kim Min-jae', 'Cho Eu-gene, Erik Ahrnbom', 'Cho Jung-seok, Lee Ju-myoung, Han Seon-hwa, Shin Seung-ho, Kim Ji-hyun, Oh Min-ae, Seo Jae-hee, Yoo Jae-suk', null, 'Han Jung-woo, a pilot with top-class skills, is flying high and even appears on a famous TV show. But everything comes crashing down when a careless mistake causes him to lose everything, even his job. Blacklisted in the industry, no airline is willing to hire him. Desperate with no other choice, Han Jung-woo transforms completely into his younger sister''s identity and succeeds in landing a job as a pilot.', 'Han Jung-woo, a pilot with top-class skills, is flying high and even appears on a famous TV show. But everything comes crashing down when a careless mistake causes him to lose everything, even his job. Blacklisted in the industry, no airline is willing to hire him. Desperate with no other choice, Han Jung-woo transforms completely into his younger sister''s identity and succeeds in landing a job as a pilot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqyXcutZbbTsBrETstMl7XLMgOF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965094'),
  ('970969186535115222', 'Pilot Pirx''s Inquest', 1979, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Marek Piestrak, Mieczyslaw Kobek, Airi Kasera', 'Vladimir Valutskiy, Marek Piestrak', 'Sergei Desnitsky, Vladimir Ivashov, Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy, Tõnu Saar, Zbigniew Lesień, Bolesław Abart, Ferdynand Matysik, Igor Przegrodzki', null, 'Pirx, an experienced pilot, is hired to go on a top-secret mission to evaluate some ''nonlinears'' (an experimental model of android) for use as crewmembers on future space flights. Pirx and this intriguing crew are sent out to launch two satellites into the rings of Saturn, but he is determined to find out and identify a hostile unhuman coworker among them.', 'Pirx, an experienced pilot, is hired to go on a top-secret mission to evaluate some ''nonlinears'' (an experimental model of android) for use as crewmembers on future space flights. Pirx and this intriguing crew are sent out to launch two satellites into the rings of Saturn, but he is determined to find out and identify a hostile unhuman coworker among them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tX3nA2vsTeDWSU25QZf9kkqjb4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67102'),
  ('73951565410762466', 'Pimp My Bride', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Bellocq, Charlie Lenormand, Manon Doursat', 'Daive Cohen', 'Camille Lellouche, Lionel Erdogan, Michèle Laroque, Gérard Darmon, Chloé Astor, Frank Bellocq, Brahim Bihi, Myriam Bourguignon', null, 'Benoît finds himself in debt and has to ask his rich parents for help once again. His plan to get money : make them believe he''s getting married with his model friend Emily. The young couple is invited to Morocco to meet the whole family. When Emily cancels on the way to the airport, Benoit decides to invite his big mouth Uber-driver Fiona instead. It''s only for the week-end... What could go wrong?', 'Benoît finds himself in debt and has to ask his rich parents for help once again. His plan to get money : make them believe he''s getting married with his model friend Emily. The young couple is invited to Morocco to meet the whole family. When Emily cancels on the way to the airport, Benoit decides to invite his big mouth Uber-driver Fiona instead. It''s only for the week-end... What could go wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olt1BuQYd3gwxW3StVhWQAdq7TS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1235502'),
  ('668890589569667803', 'Pimpinero: Blood and Oil', 2024, 'Action, Adventure', 'Andrés Baiz, Mateo Londoño', 'Andrés Baiz, María Camila Arias', 'Juanes, Alejandro Speitzer, Alberto Guerra, Laura Osma, Norberto Rivera', 'R', 'When Juan, a young gasoline smuggler, is forced to work for a mysterious organization in the desert bordering Colombia and Venezuela, his girlfriend Diana embarks on a journey to uncover the secrets that inhabit this no-man’s-land.', 'When Juan, a young gasoline smuggler, is forced to work for a mysterious organization in the desert bordering Colombia and Venezuela, his girlfriend Diana embarks on a journey to uncover the secrets that inhabit this no-man’s-land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kukotsflOSVGXQezuXohj41dbfL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1326059'),
  ('558937747919106687', 'Pin', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sandor Stern, Guy Dufaux, René Pothier', 'Sandor Stern', 'Jonathan Banks, David Hewlett, Cynthia Preston, Terry O''Quinn, Bronwen Mantel, John Pyper-Ferguson, Helene Udy, Patricia Collins', 'R', 'Pin, a plastic medical dummy, has been the fixation of Leon since youth. Now grown up and orphaned in an accident, Leon brings Pin home to live with him and his sister Ursula, much to her reluctance. Soon, however, Leon''s fixation on Pin spirals out of control, and Ursula must face the devastating consequences.', 'Pin, a plastic medical dummy, has been the fixation of Leon since youth. Now grown up and orphaned in an accident, Leon brings Pin home to live with him and his sister Ursula, much to her reluctance. Soon, however, Leon''s fixation on Pin spirals out of control, and Ursula must face the devastating consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouUfJtdHPkRXFJ0zDLPvgbPHPjd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41966'),
  ('43031522283504516', 'Pin Up Girl', 1944, 'Music, Romance, Comedy', 'H. Bruce Humberstone, Emil Newman, Ernest Palmer', 'Robert Ellis, Helen Logan, Earl Baldwin', 'Betty Grable, John Harvey, Martha Raye, Joe E. Brown, Eugene Pallette, Skating Vanities, Dorothea Kent, Dave Willock', 'NR', 'Glamorous Lorry Jones, the toast of a Missouri military canteen, has become "engaged" to almost every serviceman she''s signed her pin-up photo for. Now she''s leaving home to go into government service (not, as she fantasizes, to join the USO). On a side trip to New York, her vivid imagination leads her to True Love with naval hero Tommy Dooley; but increasingly involved Musical Comedy Complications follow.', 'Glamorous Lorry Jones, the toast of a Missouri military canteen, has become "engaged" to almost every serviceman she''s signed her pin-up photo for. Now she''s leaving home to go into government service (not, as she fantasizes, to join the USO). On a side trip to New York, her vivid imagination leads her to True Love with naval hero Tommy Dooley; but increasingly involved Musical Comedy Complications follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2u3CODs81HCcb7Xl8Uz2GVL7Sg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43502'),
  ('738669065934484500', 'Pin/Ya', 2024, 'Drama', 'Omar Deroca', null, 'Angelica Hart, Candy Veloso, Gboy Pablo, Julianne Richards, Jackie Lyn Barcebal, Racquel Enriquez, Miaka Chan, Ralph Engle', null, 'A strong childhood bond between two girls grows into something more. Learning to play with fire as they explore their bodies, Pin and Aya soon learn that their feelings for each other are beyond friendship. With their friendship at stake, will they take a chance at love?', 'A strong childhood bond between two girls grows into something more. Learning to play with fire as they explore their bodies, Pin and Aya soon learn that their feelings for each other are beyond friendship. With their friendship at stake, will they take a chance at love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGKreGg9s4ruL25UFt7budrGJfy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1380126'),
  ('1033367845457553464', 'Pina', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Wim Wenders, Hélène Louvart, Jörg Widmer', 'Wim Wenders', 'Regina Advento, Malou Airaudo, Ruth Amarante, Pina Bausch, Jorge Puerta, Mechthild Großmann, Rainer Behr, Andrey Berezin', 'PG', 'Pina is a feature-length dance film in 3D with the ensemble of the Tanztheater Wuppertal Pina Bausch, featuring the unique and inspiring art of the great German choreographer, who died in the summer of 2009.', 'Pina is a feature-length dance film in 3D with the ensemble of the Tanztheater Wuppertal Pina Bausch, featuring the unique and inspiring art of the great German choreographer, who died in the summer of 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKKtIJYtaGwcgpMfnVR2byYhfz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57276'),
  ('496270349046929394', 'Pinball Summer', 1980, 'Comedy', 'George Mihalka, Rodney Gibbons', 'Richard Zelniker', 'Michael Zelniker, Carl Marotte, Karen Stephen, Helene Udy, Thomas Kovacs, Joey McNamara, Joy Boushel, J. Robert Maze', 'R', 'It''s a summer of fun for two teenaged boys who spend their time chasing two sisters, annoying a biker gang, and basically getting into typical sophomoric hijinks whenever they can.', 'It''s a summer of fun for two teenaged boys who spend their time chasing two sisters, annoying a biker gang, and basically getting into typical sophomoric hijinks whenever they can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEDhUFpZvCB28Xu4PGGw0ZSc4AQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98094'),
  ('821230366670038611', 'Pinball: The Man Who Saved the Game', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, History, Romance', 'Austin Bragg, Meredith Bragg, Jon Keng', 'Austin Bragg, Meredith Bragg', 'Mike Faist, Crystal Reed, Dennis Boutsikaris, Christopher Convery, Connor Ratliff, Mike Doyle, Kenneth Tigar, Damian Young', null, 'The dramatic comedy is based on the true story of writer and pinball wizard Roger Sharpe, chronicling his journey to overturn New York City’s 35-year ban on pinball.', 'The dramatic comedy is based on the true story of writer and pinball wizard Roger Sharpe, chronicling his journey to overturn New York City’s 35-year ban on pinball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjGphbx4ZDwAYYWImpY427KGw7B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:855262'),
  ('303922910000858939', 'Pineapple Express', 2008, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'David Gordon Green, Tim Orr, Gary Hymes', 'Seth Rogen, Evan Goldberg', 'Seth Rogen, James Franco, Gary Cole, Danny McBride, Rosie Perez, Kevin Corrigan, Craig Robinson, Amber Heard', 'R', 'A stoner and his dealer are forced to go on the run from the police after the pothead witnesses a cop commit a murder.', 'A stoner and his dealer are forced to go on the run from the police after the pothead witnesses a cop commit a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6E50WjeOYjDZg9HXgPjYdGtY2jG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10189'),
  ('1028669185198745263', 'Pinecone', 2026, 'Animation, Family', null, null, null, null, 'This story is about love, overcoming fear, and learning not to judge others just because they’re different. Sometimes the things we’re afraid of, turn out to be the things we needed all along. I can’t wait for you all to meet Pinecone and experience his adventure set in nineteenth-century Irel', 'This story is about love, overcoming fear, and learning not to judge others just because they’re different. Sometimes the things we’re afraid of, turn out to be the things we needed all along. I can’t wait for you all to meet Pinecone and experience his adventure set in nineteenth-century Irel', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faGb17pJnCPF7eA6RXqb2rIJH5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1663234'),
  ('308120395384067522', 'Ping Pong', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fumihiko Sori, Akira Sako, Shinsuke Ohno', 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Yosuke Kubozuka, Arata Iura, Sam Lee, Shido Nakamura, Koji Ohkura, Naoto Takenaka, Mari Natsuki, Suzuki Matsuo', null, 'As children, the introverted Smile was being bullied by a gang of kids until the brash Peco comes by and chases all of them them away. Peco then takes Smile under his wings and teaches him how to play the game of ping pong. From there a life long best friend relationship comes into existence between these two polar opposite kids.', 'As children, the introverted Smile was being bullied by a gang of kids until the brash Peco comes by and chases all of them them away. Peco then takes Smile under his wings and teaches him how to play the game of ping pong. From there a life long best friend relationship comes into existence between these two polar opposite kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4Xr2r4D5Jo0GvaKtCz3IKjwxao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25675'),
  ('786137047943274865', 'Ping Pong Playa', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jessica Yu, Frankie DeMarco', 'Jessica Yu, Jimmy Tsai', 'Jimmy Tsai, Andrew Vo, Khary Payton, Jim Lau, Roger Fan, Elizabeth Sung, Javin Reid, Kevin Chung', 'PG-13', 'Streetwise swaggering Christopher "C-Dub" Wang is a suburban guy who waxes political on all things Asian American and clings to pro basketball pipe dreams. But when misfortune strikes his family, C-dub must overcome living at home, working a dead-end job and his worldly older brother, to run his Mom''s ping pong classes and defend the family''s athletic dynasty.', 'Streetwise swaggering Christopher "C-Dub" Wang is a suburban guy who waxes political on all things Asian American and clings to pro basketball pipe dreams. But when misfortune strikes his family, C-dub must overcome living at home, working a dead-end job and his worldly older brother, to run his Mom''s ping pong classes and defend the family''s athletic dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TKQLP4kK8QfhjN6785cHEgAQcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14204'),
  ('939064544519103032', 'Ping Pong Summer', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, History, Family', 'Michael Tully, Wyatt Garfield, Cedric Vara', 'Michael Tully', 'Marcello Conte, Helena May Seabrook, John Hannah, Lea Thompson, Emmi Shockley, Joseph McCaughtry, Andy Riddle, Judah Friedlander', null, 'In 1985 a summer vacation in Ocean City, Md., changes the life of a shy white teen who''s obsessed with table tennis and hip-hop music.', 'In 1985 a summer vacation in Ocean City, Md., changes the life of a shy white teen who''s obsessed with table tennis and hip-hop music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2GYdbshaBeWZn0V4tFLyiyg0BS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246011'),
  ('914870229995009314', 'Ping-Pong: The Triumph', 2023, 'Drama', 'Yu Baimei, Deng Chao, Max Da-Yung Wang', 'Hui Meng, Pei Liu, Yu Baimei', 'Deng Chao, Sun Li, Timmy Xu, Duan Bowen, Cai Yida, Ding Guansen, Sun Xilun, Alan Aruna', null, 'In the early 1990s when the Chinese men''s table tennis team is at a low ebb, head coach Cai Zhenhua is tasked with forming a new team to finally fight to the top at the 1995 World Ping Championship in Tianjin, China.', 'In the early 1990s when the Chinese men''s table tennis team is at a low ebb, head coach Cai Zhenhua is tasked with forming a new team to finally fight to the top at the 1995 World Ping Championship in Tianjin, China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybx2iOsx6lTRlmSAphaeNm21SVk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022150'),
  ('577775057607472487', 'Pingami', 1994, 'Action, Thriller', 'Sathyan Anthikad, Vipin Mohan', 'Raghunath Paleri', 'Mohanlal, Thilakan, Sukumaran, Jagathy Sreekumar, Janardhanan, Innocent, Kanaka, Puneet Issar', null, 'Captain Vijay forms a bond with Kumaran, a severely injured man. However, when he dies, Vijay decides to investigate and ends up finding answers related to his life.', 'Captain Vijay forms a bond with Kumaran, a severely injured man. However, when he dies, Vijay decides to investigate and ends up finding answers related to his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSuMxvLkAlGqBCgv4LIiYCqRCSy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198352'),
  ('737782915279512288', 'Pingpong', 2006, 'Drama', 'Matthias Luthardt, Christian Marohl', 'Matthias Luthardt, Meike Hauck', 'Sebastian Urzendowsky, Marion Mitterhammer, Clemens Berg, Falk Rockstroh', null, 'The film shows the apparently intact world of a middle class family, whose harmonious façade crumbles due to the unexpected visit of their relative Paul, a young man of 16 years. Paul arrives looking for love and support after the suicide of his father.', 'The film shows the apparently intact world of a middle class family, whose harmonious façade crumbles due to the unexpected visit of their relative Paul, a young man of 16 years. Paul arrives looking for love and support after the suicide of his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwRkRCySguUIAUOwmQOprmp7G5q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80136'),
  ('846280682550295658', 'Pinjar', 2003, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Chandra Prakash Dwivedi, Santosh Thundiyil', 'Chandra Prakash Dwivedi', 'Urmila Matondkar, Manoj Bajpayee, Sanjay Suri, Sandali Sinha, Isha Koppikar, Lillete Dubey, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Farida Jalal', null, 'In the days leading up to Partition, a Hindu woman is abducted by a Muslim man. Soon, she finds herself not only forced into marriage, but living in a new country as the borders between India and Pakistan are drawn', 'In the days leading up to Partition, a Hindu woman is abducted by a Muslim man. Soon, she finds herself not only forced into marriage, but living in a new country as the borders between India and Pakistan are drawn', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld5kHH5HxKlgYLDlhYQpYgLymu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198727'),
  ('775661104104349494', 'Pink', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jogi Malang, Aniruddha Roy Chowdhury, Avik Mukhopadhyay', 'Ritesh Shah', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Taapsee Pannu, Kirti Kulhari, Andrea Tariang, Angad Bedi, Dhritiman Chatterjee, Piyush Mishra, Vijay Varma', null, 'After being molested, Minal and her friends try to file an FIR against a politician''s nephew. When the subsequent case gets rigged, a retired lawyer helps them to fight the case.', 'After being molested, Minal and her friends try to file an FIR against a politician''s nephew. When the subsequent case gets rigged, a retired lawyer helps them to fight the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xNhnyKm2M5FEOY7xv5iKiQ5P3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415358'),
  ('904003512910257160', 'Pink and Gray', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Isao Yukisada, Takahiro Imai', 'Isao Yukisada, Ryuta Horai', 'Yuto Nakajima, Masaki Suda, Kaho, Yuya Yagira, Yukino Kishii, Makita Sports, Jingi Irie, Jun Hashimoto', null, 'Popular actor Rengo Shiraki dies suddenly. Due to his sudden death, unpopular actor Daiki Kawata attracts the spotlight due to his close friendship with Rengo. Did Rengo Shiraki commit suicide or was he murdered?', 'Popular actor Rengo Shiraki dies suddenly. Due to his sudden death, unpopular actor Daiki Kawata attracts the spotlight due to his close friendship with Rengo. Did Rengo Shiraki commit suicide or was he murdered?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvEYbXctJji73vnMUaF2VvNiMR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382258'),
  ('956184566560198066', 'Pink Cadillac', 1989, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Buddy Van Horn, Jack N. Green, Matt Earl Beesley', 'John Eskow', 'Clint Eastwood, Bernadette Peters, Timothy Carhart, Jim Carrey, John Dennis Johnston, Michael Des Barres, Jimmie F. Skaggs, Bill Moseley', 'PG-13', 'A skip tracer helps out a bail-jumper after her child is kidnapped by a group of ethno-nationalist thugs, of which her husband is a member, going by the name of Birthright. The baby is taken as leverage because, although initially oblivious, she has their money!', 'A skip tracer helps out a bail-jumper after her child is kidnapped by a group of ethno-nationalist thugs, of which her husband is a member, going by the name of Birthright. The baby is taken as leverage because, although initially oblivious, she has their money!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m96aE0SFkKHRzIIosvVrahhehrT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20006'),
  ('186753723890773085', 'Pink DaVinci', 1975, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', 'John W. Dunn', null, null, 'Leonardo da Vinci (the Little Man) plans to paint the Mona Lisa with a frown, but The Pink Panther insists on a smile, which he paints on the Mona Lisa soon after Da Vinci paints her frown.', 'Leonardo da Vinci (the Little Man) plans to paint the Mona Lisa with a frown, but The Pink Panther insists on a smile, which he paints on the Mona Lisa soon after Da Vinci paints her frown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNAH2SaydDV1EhdTJPqfyKv19HI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379195'),
  ('921248915041300944', 'Pink Floyd: Live at Pompeii', 1972, 'Music, Documentary', 'Adrian Maben, Willy Kurant, Gábor Pogány', null, 'Roger Waters, David Gilmour, Richard Wright, Nick Mason', null, 'British progressive rock band Pink Floyd perform at the ancient Roman Amphitheater in the ruins of Pompeii, Italy in 1971. Although the band perform a typical live set from the era, there is no audience beyond the basic film crew.', 'British progressive rock band Pink Floyd perform at the ancient Roman Amphitheater in the ruins of Pompeii, Italy in 1971. Although the band perform a typical live set from the era, there is no audience beyond the basic film crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxjgbHH14nEMx3YtFDLJ04omQhH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25771'),
  ('963425214902677071', 'Pink Floyd: The Final Cut', 1983, 'Music', 'Willie Christie, Theo de Rosé', 'Roger Waters', 'Roger Waters, Alex McAvoy', null, 'Pink Floyd released a 19-minute "video EP" in 1983 for The Final Cut, essentially four music videos in a continuous sequence, directed by Willie Christie, who was Roger Waters'' brother-in-law. Scottish actor Alex McAvoy, who played the teacher in the film version of The Wall, had a prominent role in the video EP. Waters appears (though all but his mouth is silhouetted) as a patient singing the lyrics to a psychologist on the grounds of the Fletcher Memorial Home.', 'Pink Floyd released a 19-minute "video EP" in 1983 for The Final Cut, essentially four music videos in a continuous sequence, directed by Willie Christie, who was Roger Waters'' brother-in-law. Scottish actor Alex McAvoy, who played the teacher in the film version of The Wall, had a prominent role in the video EP. Waters appears (though all but his mouth is silhouetted) as a patient singing the lyrics to a psychologist on the grounds of the Fletcher Memorial Home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frhHelozNTThRid5b4WmhGiw060.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92476'),
  ('178490377117936252', 'Pink Floyd: The Story of Wish You Were Here', 2012, 'Documentary, Music', 'John Edginton', null, 'Roger Waters, David Gilmour, Nick Mason, Storm Thorgerson, Richard Wright', 'PG', 'Wish You Were Here, released in September 1975, was the follow up album to the globally successful The Dark Side Of The Moon and is cited by many fans, as well as band members Richard Wright and David Gilmour, as their favorite Pink Floyd album. On release it went straight to Number One in both the UK and the US and topped the charts in many other countries around the world. This program tells the story of the making of this landmark release through new interviews with Roger Waters, David Gilmour and Nick Mason and archive interviews with the late Richard Wright. Also featured are sleeve designer Storm Thorgerson, guest vocalist Roy Harper, front cover burning man Ronnie Rondell and others involved in the creation of the album. In addition, original recording engineer Brian Humphries revisits the master tapes at Abbey Road Studios to illustrate aspects of the songs construction.', 'Wish You Were Here, released in September 1975, was the follow up album to the globally successful The Dark Side Of The Moon and is cited by many fans, as well as band members Richard Wright and David Gilmour, as their favorite Pink Floyd album. On release it went straight to Number One in both the UK and the US and topped the charts in many other countries around the world. This program tells the story of the making of this landmark release through new interviews with Roger Waters, David Gilmour and Nick Mason and archive interviews with the late Richard Wright. Also featured are sleeve designer Storm Thorgerson, guest vocalist Roy Harper, front cover burning man Ronnie Rondell and others involved in the creation of the album. In addition, original recording engineer Brian Humphries revisits the master tapes at Abbey Road Studios to illustrate aspects of the songs construction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNoWIRIh3VQPMEEYpQnGSmyJk3F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116835'),
  ('828110376119451056', 'Pink Ice', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Hawley Pratt, Friz Freleng', 'John W. Dunn', 'Rich Little', null, 'In South Africa, a talking Pink Panther is the owner of a diamond mine and has unearthed a large gem. He puts it in his safe, which has a combination lock that functions like a telephone dial, and a man tunnels into the safe and filches the jewel. The Pink Panther suspects gophers of perpetrating the theft, but a dastardly pair of rival miners, operating the neighboring DeBoors mine, have taken the diamond and claim it and the diamond-yielding territory as their own. The pair of men ineptly try to eliminate the panther, and the debonaire Pink Panther defeats them, obtaining an even larger diamond and removing it from the DeBoors camp.', 'In South Africa, a talking Pink Panther is the owner of a diamond mine and has unearthed a large gem. He puts it in his safe, which has a combination lock that functions like a telephone dial, and a man tunnels into the safe and filches the jewel. The Pink Panther suspects gophers of perpetrating the theft, but a dastardly pair of rival miners, operating the neighboring DeBoors mine, have taken the diamond and claim it and the diamond-yielding territory as their own. The pair of men ineptly try to eliminate the panther, and the debonaire Pink Panther defeats them, obtaining an even larger diamond and removing it from the DeBoors camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3GNiBTmNYo4xGN5BQAzH0grdns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379047'),
  ('487155608306738646', 'Pink Narcissus', 1971, 'Fantasy', 'James Bidgood, James Bidgood, Gary Goch', 'James Bidgood', 'Bobby Kendall, Don Brooks, Charles Ludlam, Arthur Williams, Don Kvares, Eddie Barton, Larry Rey, Harvey Yerkes', 'NR', 'An outrageous erotic poem focusing on the daydreams of a beautiful boy prostitute who, from the seclusion of his ultra-kitsch apartment, conceives a series of interlinked narcissistic fantasies populated by matadors, dancing boys, slaves, and leather-clad bikers.', 'An outrageous erotic poem focusing on the daydreams of a beautiful boy prostitute who, from the seclusion of his ultra-kitsch apartment, conceives a series of interlinked narcissistic fantasies populated by matadors, dancing boys, slaves, and leather-clad bikers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaZiiGE6820KyFF9XkzPB9Rx9qn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42497'),
  ('353975840315833326', 'Pink Pajamas', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng, Hawley Pratt', 'John W. Dunn', null, 'NR', 'Night has fallen, and the Pink Panther is looking for a place to sleep. A flop house denies him access, but he fortunately finds a key on the ground that gives him entry to a man''s home. The man, a drunk, arrives home after one of his binges and, casting eyes on the pink feline in his bed, thinks he''s having an alcoholic hallucination so he calls Alcoholics Anonymous to send someone to help him quit drinking.', 'Night has fallen, and the Pink Panther is looking for a place to sleep. A flop house denies him access, but he fortunately finds a key on the ground that gives him entry to a man''s home. The man, a drunk, arrives home after one of his binges and, casting eyes on the pink feline in his bed, thinks he''s having an alcoholic hallucination so he calls Alcoholics Anonymous to send someone to help him quit drinking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/579lEthcDYR97VRFPzhL67e3cwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296264'),
  ('891913169141903352', 'Pink Panic', 1967, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Hawley Pratt', null, null, null, 'The Pink Panther stays in the haunted Dead Dog Hotel on a stormy night.', 'The Pink Panther stays in the haunted Dead Dog Hotel on a stormy night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebohLs9UA3egKUDLoPLjLRVDFni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379133'),
  ('820013618205235797', 'Pink Panzer', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, War', 'Hawley Pratt', 'David Detiege', 'Paul Frees', null, 'The next-door neighbor neglects to return the Pink Panther''s lawn mower, resulting in a feud that escalates into all-out war.', 'The next-door neighbor neglects to return the Pink Panther''s lawn mower, resulting in a feud that escalates into all-out war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVJKSSFhYbSK7UcWKKrLku4NXq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379049'),
  ('350453824493011761', 'Pink Punch', 1966, 'Animation', 'Hawley Pratt', 'Michael O''Connor', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'When the Pink Panther tries to promote his drink with a series of signs, the starry dot atop the "i" in "pink" gains a mind of its own and, to frustrate the Pink Panther, turns green. Infuriated, the panther tries to eradicate the green dot, only to find that the dot has a guardian - another green dot of a much larger size.', 'When the Pink Panther tries to promote his drink with a series of signs, the starry dot atop the "i" in "pink" gains a mind of its own and, to frustrate the Pink Panther, turns green. Infuriated, the panther tries to eradicate the green dot, only to find that the dot has a guardian - another green dot of a much larger size.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9Z1YOGeoaor9J3a5PkQw09zuRy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379014'),
  ('341231205108773745', 'Pink Punch', 2004, 'Drama', 'Beto Gómez', 'Alfonso Suárez, Beto Gómez', 'Jose Yenque, Rodrigo Oviedo, Marius Biegai, Jaime Camil, Omar Chaparro, Eduardo España, Roberto Espejo, Julio Cesar Fido', null, 'Jimmy Morales is a young fighter with a short career but with a promising future in the world of boxing. One night, after watching a movie, he witnesses a cold-blooded murder committed by Germán Corona, a known gangster of the neighborhood. Their eyes meet, Jimmy fears the worst, but the murderer runs away inexplicably. From that moment, a peculiar relationship between the boxer and gangster develop.', 'Jimmy Morales is a young fighter with a short career but with a promising future in the world of boxing. One night, after watching a movie, he witnesses a cold-blooded murder committed by Germán Corona, a known gangster of the neighborhood. Their eyes meet, Jimmy fears the worst, but the murderer runs away inexplicably. From that moment, a peculiar relationship between the boxer and gangster develop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIlv8HPqHPm8uHtjK3zcZwH23Nu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243672'),
  ('254123096379829992', 'Pink Sauce', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Manuel Gómez Pereira, Fernando Arribas', 'Joaquín Oristrell, Juan Luis Iborra, Manuel Gómez Pereira', 'Verónica Forqué, Maribel Verdú, Juanjo Puigcorbé, Jose Coronado, Julieta Serrano, Carmen Balagué, Fernando Colomo, Carlos Hipólito', null, 'Ana''s husband is the perfect wealthy middle-class man. Koro''s husband is a cook with no more ambitions. One day, Ana meets Koro in a night club and she proposes Ana to seduce each others husbands. The following morning Ana thinks this was a joke, but things are not always what it seems. Written by Dulzz', 'Ana''s husband is the perfect wealthy middle-class man. Koro''s husband is a cook with no more ambitions. One day, Ana meets Koro in a night club and she proposes Ana to seduce each others husbands. The following morning Ana thinks this was a joke, but things are not always what it seems. Written by Dulzz', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PCANgdfEsSguJZGOJMJYKKK7Vz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73498'),
  ('489950618471438249', 'Pink String and Sealing Wax', 1945, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Robert Hamer, Stanley Pavey', 'Diana Morgan', 'Mervyn Johns, Googie Withers, Gordon Jackson, Garry Marsh, Jean Ireland, Sally Ann Howes, Mary Merrall, Catherine Lacey', null, 'Melodrama set in Victorian Brighton. Scheming pub landlady uses the timorous son of a domineering pharmacist to assist in the poisoning of her drunkard husband. (The title is from the way pharmacists used to wrap parcels containing poison).', 'Melodrama set in Victorian Brighton. Scheming pub landlady uses the timorous son of a domineering pharmacist to assist in the poisoning of her drunkard husband. (The title is from the way pharmacists used to wrap parcels containing poison).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/goK4IFiiZv9GA984JrZ11gKW0Tj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76068'),
  ('516874728304873669', 'Pink Z-Z-Z', 1978, 'Animation', 'Sid Marcus', 'Tony Benedict', null, null, 'A constantly meowing alley cat keeps the Pink Panther awake.', 'A constantly meowing alley cat keeps the Pink Panther awake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rl6NMrduLmkY3fKqhyaUFkPda4J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379257'),
  ('546825459951020249', 'Pink, Plunk, Plink', 1966, 'Animation, Music, Comedy', 'Hawley Pratt', 'Michael O''Connor', 'Henry Mancini', null, 'The Pink Panther learns to play the violin, and interrupts a performance of Beethoven''s Fifth Symphony with the Pink Panther Theme played on various instruments.', 'The Pink Panther learns to play the violin, and interrupts a performance of Beethoven''s Fifth Symphony with the Pink Panther Theme played on various instruments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IqfYaKpYMsaXOC0cKfR0cixGR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379081'),
  ('983651377553824146', 'Pinkfinger', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng, Hawley Pratt', 'Bob Kurtz', 'Dave Barry, Paul Frees', null, 'Intrigued by the idea of being a spy, the Pink Panther comes upon a gang of foreign agents scheming to detonate a series of black-ball bombs.', 'Intrigued by the idea of being a spy, the Pink Panther comes upon a gang of foreign agents scheming to detonate a series of black-ball bombs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rU1N75pimrfElVBSprPTZaM0pwt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379045'),
  ('715576838221337730', 'Pinkus''s Shoe Palace', 1916, 'Comedy', 'Ernst Lubitsch', 'Hanns Kräly, Erich Schönfelder', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Ossi Oswalda, Guido Herzfeld, Erich Schönfelder, Hanns Kräly, Fritz Rasp', null, 'Sally Pinkus is an German-Jewish boy who takes a job as a shoe store clerk after being expelled from school for goofing around. Soon fired for trying to court the owner''s daughter, Pinkus lands another job in a more ''upmarket'' shoe salon, only to be fired again, before charming a rich benefactress to fund his ultimate dream: Pinkus'' Shoe Palace.', 'Sally Pinkus is an German-Jewish boy who takes a job as a shoe store clerk after being expelled from school for goofing around. Soon fired for trying to court the owner''s daughter, Pinkus lands another job in a more ''upmarket'' shoe salon, only to be fired again, before charming a rich benefactress to fund his ultimate dream: Pinkus'' Shoe Palace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QEwezlaorNhJ3zE4qnLSWNGy2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48257'),
  ('263881103882492614', 'Pinky', 1949, 'Drama', 'Elia Kazan, Joseph MacDonald', 'Philip Dunne, Dudley Nichols', 'Jeanne Crain, Ethel Barrymore, Ethel Waters, William Lundigan, Basil Ruysdael, Kenny Washington, Nina Mae McKinney, Griff Barnett', null, 'Pinky, a light skinned black woman, returns to her grandmother''s house in the South after graduating from a Northern nursing school. Pinky tells her grandmother that she has been "passing" for white while at school in the North. In addition, she has fallen in love with a young white doctor, who knows nothing about her black heritage.', 'Pinky, a light skinned black woman, returns to her grandmother''s house in the South after graduating from a Northern nursing school. Pinky tells her grandmother that she has been "passing" for white while at school in the North. In addition, she has fallen in love with a young white doctor, who knows nothing about her black heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KF6DKLq5vVVjLriBnCttJGTiHA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62727'),
  ('1131727114668953341', 'Pino Daniele - Nero a metà', 2025, 'Documentary, Music', 'Marco Spagnoli, Gianluca Palma', 'Marco Spagnoli, Stefano Senardi', 'Pino Daniele, Tullio De Piscopo, James Senese, Tony Esposito, Enzo Avitabile, Enzo Gragnianiello, Tony Cercola, Fausta Vetere', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXUBW2kBbQgxNwAVcIn3iAZdWkq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1397970'),
  ('542854186183314691', 'Pinocchio', 1911, 'Fantasy', 'Giulio Antamoro', null, 'Polidor, Augusto Mastripietri, Natalino Guillaume, Lea Giunchi', null, 'Carpenter Geppetto carves a block of wood into a puppet and names him Pinocchio. As soon as his feet have been made, Pinocchio runs out the door and a series of adventures begins.', 'Carpenter Geppetto carves a block of wood into a puppet and names him Pinocchio. As soon as his feet have been made, Pinocchio runs out the door and a series of adventures begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozWbSweEOCWxqKk8UAekOEDn9NK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233088'),
  ('547684243317805792', 'Pinocchio', 1940, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Hamilton Luske, Ben Sharpsteen, Jack Kinney', null, 'Dickie Jones, Cliff Edwards, Christian Rub, Evelyn Venable, Walter Catlett, Mel Blanc, Charles Judels, Frankie Darro', 'G', 'When the gentle woodcarver Geppetto builds a marionette to be his substitute son, a benevolent fairy brings the toy to life. The puppet, named Pinocchio, is not yet a human boy. He must earn the right to be real by proving that he is brave, truthful, and unselfish.', 'When the gentle woodcarver Geppetto builds a marionette to be his substitute son, a benevolent fairy brings the toy to life. The puppet, named Pinocchio, is not yet a human boy. He must earn the right to be real by proving that he is brave, truthful, and unselfish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnZJrLRnoQHpzEJdka1KYfsAF3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10895'),
  ('733177906297137851', 'Pinocchio', 1971, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Corey Allen, Ray Dennis Steckler, Martin Slavin', 'Corey Allen, Chris Warfield', 'Alex Roman, Monica Gayle, Dyanne Thorne, Karen Smith, Debbie Osborne, Vincene Wallace, Neola Graef, Gwen Van Dam', null, 'A bawdy burlesque version of the famous fairy tale, Geppeta is a frustrated and nubile young virgin. She carves Pinocchio as a gorgeous young hunk. Geppeta''s fairy godmother magically transforms the young stud into a living man, who is quickly brought to work in the local whorehouse as a prize stud and exhibitionist.', 'A bawdy burlesque version of the famous fairy tale, Geppeta is a frustrated and nubile young virgin. She carves Pinocchio as a gorgeous young hunk. Geppeta''s fairy godmother magically transforms the young stud into a living man, who is quickly brought to work in the local whorehouse as a prize stud and exhibitionist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJt55LEOLmHT11JiLn9VpyJVLej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28779'),
  ('58482863075018561', 'Pinocchio', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Masakazu Higuchi', 'Roger Scott Olsen', 'Pat Musick, Cam Clarke, Jim Cummings, Jeannie Elias, Frank Welker', 'G', 'The Little Wooden Toy. The unforgettable story of a little wooden boy who longs with all his heart to become real. When a small spark of magic escapes from the Blue Fairy''s home, it travels down toy maker Gepetto''s chimney, bringing one small log to life. Then, when Gepetto''s toys stop being sold regularly, he decides to make a toy for his own using this same log. Soon, his new wooden puppet is complete, which instantly comes to life getting mixed up in all kinds of troubles. Soon, however, with the guidance of the talking cricket and the Blue Fairy, Pinocchio learns what is needed for him to earn his heart''s desire of becoming a real boy. Written by Frederick Irizarry.', 'The Little Wooden Toy. The unforgettable story of a little wooden boy who longs with all his heart to become real. When a small spark of magic escapes from the Blue Fairy''s home, it travels down toy maker Gepetto''s chimney, bringing one small log to life. Then, when Gepetto''s toys stop being sold regularly, he decides to make a toy for his own using this same log. Soon, his new wooden puppet is complete, which instantly comes to life getting mixed up in all kinds of troubles. Soon, however, with the guidance of the talking cricket and the Blue Fairy, Pinocchio learns what is needed for him to earn his heart''s desire of becoming a real boy. Written by Frederick Irizarry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuj0K10ZIa6ExMQQQWySL0B5lnW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134434'),
  ('887228803843317395', 'Pinocchio', 2002, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Roberto Benigni, Dante Spinotti, Enrico Lucidi', 'Roberto Benigni, Vincenzo Cerami', 'Roberto Benigni, Nicoletta Braschi, Mino Bellei, Carlo Giuffrè, Peppe Barra, Franco Javarone, Max Cavallari, Bruno Arena', null, 'Roberto Benigni adapts the classic children''s tale by Carlo Collodi for the big-budget family-oriented comedy Pinocchio.', 'Roberto Benigni adapts the classic children''s tale by Carlo Collodi for the big-budget family-oriented comedy Pinocchio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aN2Pa9FnbJA2g4mnHPCWajwtdQ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10599'),
  ('440143560284427310', 'Pinocchio', 2009, 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Alberto Sironi, Franco Lecca, Franco Nardella', 'Ivan Cotroneo, Carlo Mazzotta', 'Bob Hoskins, Robbie Kay, Luciana Littizzetto, Margherita Buy, Violante Placido, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Toni Bertorelli, Francesco Pannofino', null, 'The enchanted story of Pinocchio.', 'The enchanted story of Pinocchio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOiT5YjhS7nQGoPOhaEaaEwjBxS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33821'),
  ('284561733550738641', 'Pinocchio', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Lorenzo Mattotti, Enzo D''Alò, Jacopo Armani', 'Enzo D''Alò, Umberto Marino', 'Gabriele Caprio, Rocco Papaleo, Paolo Ruffini, Maurizio Micheli, Lucio Dalla, Pino Quartullo, Andy Luotto, Mino Caprio', null, 'Geppetto the carpenter carves the object of his hidden desires out of a log: a puppet that will keep him company and will be like a son to him. He will call him Pinocchio. Imagine his surprise when he discovers that the puppet moves, as if by magic, and is gifted with a life on its own.', 'Geppetto the carpenter carves the object of his hidden desires out of a log: a puppet that will keep him company and will be like a son to him. He will call him Pinocchio. Imagine his surprise when he discovers that the puppet moves, as if by magic, and is gifted with a life on its own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4I6ngsboK7RiuN4PGDxEI8EO2U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136619'),
  ('654296031369052912', 'Pinocchio', 2013, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Anna Justice, Deniz Göktürk Kobanbay, Mathias Neumann', 'Anna Justice', 'Mario Adorf, Ulrich Tukur, Inka Friedrich, Benjamin Sadler, Sandra Hüller, Florian Lukas, Michelangelo Fortuzzi, Anke Engelke', null, 'The world''s most loved fairy tale is back in a whole new fantastic imagining in Pinocchio. When a piece of pine-wood falls into the hands of the poor old toy maker, Geppetto, he carves it into a puppet which he names Pinocchio. To Geppetto''s delight, Pinocchio comes to life - and like most little boys, he''s full of reckless whims and wild ideas! His crazy escapades lead him into a series of madcap adventures from joining the circus to visiting the inside of whale! Along his journey, and throughout all the fun, Pinocchio learns to be considerate and courageous and learns what it takes to become a real boy.', 'The world''s most loved fairy tale is back in a whole new fantastic imagining in Pinocchio. When a piece of pine-wood falls into the hands of the poor old toy maker, Geppetto, he carves it into a puppet which he names Pinocchio. To Geppetto''s delight, Pinocchio comes to life - and like most little boys, he''s full of reckless whims and wild ideas! His crazy escapades lead him into a series of madcap adventures from joining the circus to visiting the inside of whale! Along his journey, and throughout all the fun, Pinocchio learns to be considerate and courageous and learns what it takes to become a real boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnzqKzAVMihmyolJ7ouR3kzJTou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246790'),
  ('50820042286284119', 'Pinocchio', 2019, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Matteo Garrone, Nicolai Brüel, Cedric De La Forest Divonne', 'Matteo Garrone, Massimo Ceccherini', 'Federico Ielapi, Roberto Benigni, Marine Vacth, Gigi Proietti, Massimo Ceccherini, Rocco Papaleo, Alessio Di Domenicantonio, Marcello Fonte', 'PG-13', 'Old woodcarver Geppetto fashions a wooden puppet, Pinocchio, who magically comes to life. Pinocchio longs for adventure and is easily led astray, encountering magical beasts, fantastical spectacles, while making friends and foes along his journey. However, his dream is to become a real boy, which can only come true if he finally changes his ways.', 'Old woodcarver Geppetto fashions a wooden puppet, Pinocchio, who magically comes to life. Pinocchio longs for adventure and is easily led astray, encountering magical beasts, fantastical spectacles, while making friends and foes along his journey. However, his dream is to become a real boy, which can only come true if he finally changes his ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9c3EG58062cl5zjBqSkDhoKIOtD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413518'),
  ('188309693383419701', 'Pinocchio', 2022, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Don Burgess, Lee Grumett, Victoria Burrows', 'Carlo Collodi', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Tom Hanks, Benjamin Evan Ainsworth, Angus Wright, Cynthia Erivo, Sheila Atim, Lorraine Bracco, Keegan-Michael Key', 'PG', 'A wooden puppet embarks on a thrilling adventure to become a real boy.', 'A wooden puppet embarks on a thrilling adventure to become a real boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaZhjKrJeWczQ3AotKoQObppEbH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532639'),
  ('554657718471970483', 'Pinocchio 3000', 2004, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Daniel Robichaud', 'Claude Scasso', 'Malcolm McDowell, Sonja Ball, Howard Ryshpan, Whoopi Goldberg, Howie Mandel, Bobby Edner, Barbara Tissier, Matt Holland', null, 'This is the story of a little robot known as Pinocchio 3000 whose greatest wish is to become a real boy. The year is 3000. Geppetto, with the help of his faithful assistant, Spencer the cyber penguin, and by the holographic fairy Cyberina, creates Pinocchio, a prototype superrobot equipped for emotions. But before he can be given a heart and become a real boy, Cyberina insists that Pinocchio learn the difference between right and wrong.', 'This is the story of a little robot known as Pinocchio 3000 whose greatest wish is to become a real boy. The year is 3000. Geppetto, with the help of his faithful assistant, Spencer the cyber penguin, and by the holographic fairy Cyberina, creates Pinocchio, a prototype superrobot equipped for emotions. But before he can be given a heart and become a real boy, Cyberina insists that Pinocchio learn the difference between right and wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtTJzlzJf5FuY4qWjleSsLIgYjD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23056'),
  ('379536433330798584', 'Pinocchio and the Emperor of the Night', 1987, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Hal Sutherland', 'Barry O''Brien, Dennis O''Flaherty, Robby London', 'Scott Grimes, Tom Bosley, Rickie Lee Jones, James Earl Jones, Don Knotts, Ed Asner, Lana Beeson, Linda Gary', 'G', 'Pinocchio and his friends, a glow worm and a marionette, search for a magic music box, putting them in danger from the evil Scalawag and the Emperor of the Night.', 'Pinocchio and his friends, a glow worm and a marionette, search for a magic music box, putting them in danger from the evil Scalawag and the Emperor of the Night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xPvpjR7kYJ93gWXqMdPIR3JI8Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39045'),
  ('122292525408873448', 'Pinocchio: A True Story', 2021, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Vasily Rovensky, Fedor Mezentsev', 'Vadim Sveshnikov, Maksim Sveshnikov, Vasily Rovensky', 'Pauly Shore, Filipp Lebedev, Jon Heder, Diomid Vinogradov, Tom Kenny, Anton Eldarov, Eliza Martirosova, Andrey Kurganov', 'PG', 'Young Pinocchio runs away from his genius creator Jepetto. Accompanied by his horse Tibalt, he aims to see the world while joining the traveling circus ran by hustler Modjafocco.', 'Young Pinocchio runs away from his genius creator Jepetto. Accompanied by his horse Tibalt, he aims to see the world while joining the traveling circus ran by hustler Modjafocco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9g6yLno4P14UWiURoL2H2NUp39h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597840'),
  ('1140887751929066130', 'Pinocchio: Unstrung', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rhys Frake-Waterfield, Vince Knight, Max Arlott', 'Rhys Frake-Waterfield', 'Jude Evan Lloyd, Robert Englund, Cameron Bell, Jessica Balmer, Richard Brake, Scott Chambers, Kelly Rian Sanson, Peter DeSouza-Feighoney', null, 'We follow James as his grandfather, Geppetto, introduces him to a seemingly magical doll to become best friends. However, unaware of Pinocchio''s naïve nature, as James introduces him to the world it results in the doll going on a crusade to eliminate all things “bad.”', 'We follow James as his grandfather, Geppetto, introduces him to a seemingly magical doll to become best friends. However, unaware of Pinocchio''s naïve nature, as James introduces him to the world it results in the doll going on a crusade to eliminate all things “bad.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJNdizFlxOW89edX3Rzr6OliSFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232569'),
  ('215513146274120345', 'Pinocchio''s Christmas', 1980, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Arthur Rankin, Jr., Jules Bass', 'Romeo Muller', 'Todd Porter, George S. Irving, Alan King, Bob McFadden, Allen Swift, Ray Owens, Patricia Bright, Diane Leslie', null, 'As Geppetto prepares for Christmas, Pinocchio joins a puppet show to earn money for a present. There he meets and elopes with the beautiful girl puppet, Julietta, leaving Geppetto alone and worried.', 'As Geppetto prepares for Christmas, Pinocchio joins a puppet show to earn money for a present. There he meets and elopes with the beautiful girl puppet, Julietta, leaving Geppetto alone and worried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46n9xy5tMG74jpepbfISVj03GIh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50934'),
  ('955290246141504861', 'Pinocchio''s Revenge', 1996, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Kevin Tenney, Eric Anderson', 'Kevin Tenney', 'Rosalind Allen, Todd Allen, Candace McKenzie, Brit Smith, Aaron Lustig, Lewis van Bergen, Janet MacLachlan, Ron Canada', 'R', 'Defense attorney Jennifer Garrick acquires a Pinocchio puppet from a condemned serial killer. Her pre-teen daughter, Zoe, mistakes the puppet as a birthday present and grows attached to her new friend. Suddenly, accidents begin to happen to those who cross Zoe. Zoe claims it''s her Pinocchio doll but her therapist thinks otherwise. Pinocchio promises he''ll behave if Zoe will cut his strings...', 'Defense attorney Jennifer Garrick acquires a Pinocchio puppet from a condemned serial killer. Her pre-teen daughter, Zoe, mistakes the puppet as a birthday present and grows attached to her new friend. Suddenly, accidents begin to happen to those who cross Zoe. Zoe claims it''s her Pinocchio doll but her therapist thinks otherwise. Pinocchio promises he''ll behave if Zoe will cut his strings...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xcAec4SQITtb5h9fxR8HifEWsd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30926'),
  ('321445793177470220', 'Pinot simple-flic', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Jugnot, Eduardo Serra, Charlotte Fraisse', 'Pierre Geller, Gérard Jugnot, Christian Biegalski', 'Gérard Jugnot, Fanny Bastien, Patrick Fierry, Pierre Mondy, Jean-Claude Brialy, Jean Rougerie, Gérard Loussine, Claire Magnin', null, 'The film starts in the 13th arrondissement of Paris in 1984. Robert Pinot is a police officer as ordinary as clumsy. One day, he stops a certain Josyane, a young drug addict who is also doubled as a pickpocket, nicknamed Marylou. Having discovered that she comes from the same village, Nanteuil, then him, he takes compassion for the young girl and decides to take her under his wing to keep her away from Tony, a dangerous dealer with whom she is in love.', 'The film starts in the 13th arrondissement of Paris in 1984. Robert Pinot is a police officer as ordinary as clumsy. One day, he stops a certain Josyane, a young drug addict who is also doubled as a pickpocket, nicknamed Marylou. Having discovered that she comes from the same village, Nanteuil, then him, he takes compassion for the young girl and decides to take her under his wing to keep her away from Tony, a dangerous dealer with whom she is in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKaRTRLRTh9L5YV4OOdrQxXT4oB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42394'),
