  ('229583063894430459', 'Pintus @Taormina', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Cenci', null, 'Angelo Pintus, Francesco Montanari, Malika Ayane, Antonio Mezzancella', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hbi5gvjKzmTT63sT7tDkNGrWEC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1046760'),
  ('782724982399821695', 'Pioneer', 2013, 'Thriller', 'Erik Skjoldbjærg, Jallo Faber, Kristian Mejdell Nissen', 'Hans Gunnarsson, Nikolaj Frobenius, Erik Skjoldbjærg', 'Aksel Hennie, Wes Bentley, Stephen Lang, Stephanie Sigman, Jonathan LaPaglia, Ane Dahl Torp, Jørgen Langhelle, André Eriksen', 'R', 'Pioneer is set in the early ''80s, at the beginning of the Norwegian Oil Boom. Enormous oil and gas deposits are discovered in the North Sea and the authorities aim to bring the oil ashore through a pipeline from depths of 500 meters. A professional diver, Petter, obsessed with reaching the bottom of the Norwegian Sea has the discipline, strength and courage to take on the world''s most dangerous mission. But a sudden, tragic accident changes everything. Petter is sent on a perilous journey where he loses sight of who''s pulling the strings. Gradually he realizes that he is in way over his head and that his life is at stake.', 'Pioneer is set in the early ''80s, at the beginning of the Norwegian Oil Boom. Enormous oil and gas deposits are discovered in the North Sea and the authorities aim to bring the oil ashore through a pipeline from depths of 500 meters. A professional diver, Petter, obsessed with reaching the bottom of the Norwegian Sea has the discipline, strength and courage to take on the world''s most dangerous mission. But a sudden, tragic accident changes everything. Petter is sent on a perilous journey where he loses sight of who''s pulling the strings. Gradually he realizes that he is in way over his head and that his life is at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpJyl76W6erraH08kf19nmpCwn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168399'),
  ('328660859594192276', 'Pioneer Days', 1930, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, null, 'Mickey and Minnie are on a wagon train; they camp for the night, unaware that Indians have spotted them and are doing a war dance. The attack comes, and Minnie is captured.', 'Mickey and Minnie are on a wagon train; they camp for the night, unaware that Indians have spotted them and are doing a war dance. The attack comes, and Minnie is captured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psKkoXOHFQI7Mmy7Yn7idzQ7L3h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162932'),
  ('470483702858566353', 'Pioneers in Ingolstadt', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Dietrich Lohmann, Gunter Krää', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Hanna Schygulla, Harry Baer, Irm Hermann, Rudolf Waldemar Brem, Walter Sedlmayr, Klaus Löwitsch, Ulli Lommel, Carla Egerer', null, 'Berta, a naive young maid, searches for love when the army engineers come to town to build a bridge.', 'Berta, a naive young maid, searches for love when the army engineers come to town to build a bridge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gB7DPvbNCXygc6P1dt9iz0e9HRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191703'),
  ('601716906097416353', 'Piovono mucche', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Luca Vendruscolo, Arianna Dell''Arti, Luca Coassin', 'Luca Vendruscolo, Massimo De Lorenzo', 'Luca Amorosino, Don Anselmo, Domenico Battaglia, Barbara Bonanni, Massimo De Lorenzo, Carlo Luca De Ruggieri, Andrea Sartoretti, Luca Dionisi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPbqiC4E1HW3E6RdJtbYvsa47si.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64048'),
  ('64748055359521391', 'Pipeline', 2021, 'Crime, Action', 'Kim Gyeong-seok, Yoo Ha', 'Yoo Ha, Kim Kyung-chan', 'Seo In-guk, Lee Soo-hyuk, Um Mun-suk, Yoo Seung-mok, Tae Hang-ho, Bae Yu-ram, Bae Da-bin, Seo Dong-won', null, 'A wealthy oil tycoon decides to steal oil from a pipeline running between Honam and Seoul-Busan motorway. To carry out this heist, he enlists the help of an experienced drilling engineer and his team.', 'A wealthy oil tycoon decides to steal oil from a pipeline running between Honam and Seoul-Busan motorway. To carry out this heist, he enlists the help of an experienced drilling engineer and his team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3ntFdJZz9yMQsQeQMr2uLkJtXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618200'),
  ('992716131534258929', 'Piper', 2007, 'Comedy, Music', 'Carlo Vanzina, Claudio Zamarion, Dario Acocella', 'Enrico Vanzina, Cesare Frugoni', 'Massimo Ghini, Martina Stella, Maurizio Mattioli, Matteo Branciamore, Carol Alt, Anna Falchi, Matteo Barzini, Christian Ginepro', null, 'Rome, 1965. The entire city awaits the inauguration of the Piper. While the journalist Roberto Benetti falls in love with Sabrina May, the kept woman of a politician, thus giving up a scoop, the young Mario, leader of the band "I demoni", meets Milena, who has fled from Venice to sing. A fortuitous event will offer the two young people the opportunity to perform in the legendary club.', 'Rome, 1965. The entire city awaits the inauguration of the Piper. While the journalist Roberto Benetti falls in love with Sabrina May, the kept woman of a politician, thus giving up a scoop, the young Mario, leader of the band "I demoni", meets Milena, who has fled from Venice to sing. A fortuitous event will offer the two young people the opportunity to perform in the legendary club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZALWjUcyG9wKbckCEJoakW181U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567815'),
  ('1128097593852404896', 'Pippa', 2023, 'War, Drama', 'Tess Joseph, Priya Seth, Raja Menon', 'Ravinder Randhawa, Raja Menon, Tanmay Mohan', 'Ishaan Khatter, Mrunal Thakur, Priyanshu Painyuli, Soni Razdan, Soham Majumdar, Chandrachoor Rai, Inaamulhaq, Avijit Dutt', null, 'The story of Captain Balram Singh Mehta of India’s 45 Cavalry regiment who, along with his siblings, fought on the eastern front during the Indo-Pakistani war of 1971. Named after the Russian amphibious war tank “PT-76”, which floats on water like an empty ‘pippa’ (tin) of ghee, the film traces Mehta''s coming-of-age as he steps up to prove himself in a war to liberate Bangladesh.', 'The story of Captain Balram Singh Mehta of India’s 45 Cavalry regiment who, along with his siblings, fought on the eastern front during the Indo-Pakistani war of 1971. Named after the Russian amphibious war tank “PT-76”, which floats on water like an empty ‘pippa’ (tin) of ghee, the film traces Mehta''s coming-of-age as he steps up to prove himself in a war to liberate Bangladesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bD664CWGigcjlT8wf2VR3KZCtK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:733038'),
  ('727235343508092753', 'Pippi Goes on Board', 1969, 'Family', 'Olle Hellbom, Kalle Bergholm', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Inger Nilsson, Pär Sundberg, Maria Persson, Margot Trooger, Hans Clarin, Paul Esser, Ulf G. Johnsson, Göthe Grefbo', 'G', 'Pippi Longstocking lives alone in Villekulla because her mother is an angel in heaven and her father is a pirate king in the Southern Seas. She befriends her next door neighbors, siblings Tommy and Annika, who are swept into Pippi''s wild adventures.', 'Pippi Longstocking lives alone in Villekulla because her mother is an angel in heaven and her father is a pirate king in the Southern Seas. She befriends her next door neighbors, siblings Tommy and Annika, who are swept into Pippi''s wild adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0P2jdOykhoNhq4did5lHTWqlSs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40696'),
  ('588163723253961745', 'Pippi in the South Seas', 1970, 'Adventure, Family', 'Olle Hellbom, Kalle Bergholm', 'Olle Hellbom', 'Inger Nilsson, Pär Sundberg, Maria Persson, Beppe Wolgers, Martin Ljung, Jarl Borssén, Alfred Schieske, Wolfgang Völz', 'G', 'Pippi Longstocking, accompanied by friends Tommy and Annika, adventures on the South Seas to search for her father, who has been kidnapped by pirates.', 'Pippi Longstocking, accompanied by friends Tommy and Annika, adventures on the South Seas to search for her father, who has been kidnapped by pirates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyi9bkhQ5q4FwL6f3mdNcgJAyyN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12127'),
  ('795872257181729210', 'Pippi Longstocking', 1969, 'Adventure, Family', 'Olle Hellbom, Kalle Bergholm', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Inger Nilsson, Pär Sundberg, Maria Persson, Margot Trooger, Hans Clarin, Paul Esser, Ulf G. Johnsson, Göthe Grefbo', 'G', 'Pippi Longstocking, a super-strong redheaded little girl, moves into her father''s cottage Villa Villekulla, and has adventures with her next-door neighbors Tommy and Annika in this compilation film of the classic Swedish TV series. This was followed by Pippi Goes on Board.', 'Pippi Longstocking, a super-strong redheaded little girl, moves into her father''s cottage Villa Villekulla, and has adventures with her next-door neighbors Tommy and Annika in this compilation film of the classic Swedish TV series. This was followed by Pippi Goes on Board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqJmideoqOi1WBf7UctK0REgkqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12097'),
  ('1037907560658502728', 'Pippi Longstocking', 1997, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Clive A. Smith, Ute von Münchow-Pohl, Edson Basarin', 'Catharina Stackelberg', 'Elin Larsson, Börje Ahlstedt, Max Wallér-Zandén, Jasmine Heikura, Wallis Grahn, Peter Carlsson, Pontus Gustafsson, Gunilla Röör', 'G', 'Pippi Longstocking is an extraordinary little girl who lives alone in her house, while her father sails the seven seas. Pippi''s irrepressibly fun nature makes her easy to befriend, as neighbors Tommy and Annika find, but can also earn ire, especially from social worker Mrs. Prysselius.', 'Pippi Longstocking is an extraordinary little girl who lives alone in her house, while her father sails the seven seas. Pippi''s irrepressibly fun nature makes her easy to befriend, as neighbors Tommy and Annika find, but can also earn ire, especially from social worker Mrs. Prysselius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nndjAapR3epDSxuNSpgRdfP7L6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12630'),
  ('565827708105005706', 'Pippi on the Run', 1970, 'Family', 'Olle Hellbom, Kalle Bergholm', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Inger Nilsson, Maria Persson, Pär Sundberg, Hans Alfredson, Öllegård Wellton, Fredrik Ohlsson, Benno Sterzenbach, Walter Richter', 'G', 'Fed up with their strict parents, Tommy and Annika run away from home, with their friend Pippi Longstocking to look after them in their long trek.', 'Fed up with their strict parents, Tommy and Annika run away from home, with their friend Pippi Longstocking to look after them in their long trek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iUh3aslpUL2ek7SDp78axm3w3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11626'),
  ('953438233007396570', 'Pippin', 1981, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'David Sheehan, Kathryn Doby, Bob Fosse', 'Stephen Schwartz', 'Ben Vereen, William Katt, Chita Rivera, Martha Raye, Leslie Denniston, Benjamin Rayson, Christopher Chadman, Carmine Rizzo', null, 'A mysterious performance troupe led by a Leading Player tells the story of Pippin, a young prince on his search for meaning and significance. Taped at Hamilton Place in Hamilton, Ontario, Canada.', 'A mysterious performance troupe led by a Leading Player tells the story of Pippin, a young prince on his search for meaning and significance. Taped at Hamilton Place in Hamilton, Ontario, Canada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HAQ5NoSfmEXfU9u11hpzjCYqAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43134'),
  ('721151548918423472', 'Piranha', 1972, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'William Gibson', 'Richard Finder', 'William Smith, Peter Brown, Ahna Capri, Tom Simcox, John Villegas, Julie Tecca, Ernie Fracis, Miguel Berzares', 'PG', 'Wildlife photographer Terry and her brother Art go to Venezuela for a photo shoot. They hire Jim Pendrake to guide them through the jungle. However, the trio run afoul of evil local hunter Caribe.', 'Wildlife photographer Terry and her brother Art go to Venezuela for a photo shoot. They hire Jim Pendrake to guide them through the jungle. However, the trio run afoul of evil local hunter Caribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQXoWx4gBZjgoqPcFXrSCYWkXyQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87464'),
  ('778073589831200992', 'Piranha', 1978, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Joe Dante, Jamie Anderson, Susan Arnold', 'John Sayles', 'Bradford Dillman, Heather Menzies, Kevin McCarthy, Keenan Wynn, Dick Miller, Barbara Steele, Belinda Balaski, Melody Thomas Scott', 'R', 'When flesh-eating piranhas are accidentally released into a summer resort''s rivers, the guests become their next meal.', 'When flesh-eating piranhas are accidentally released into a summer resort''s rivers, the guests become their next meal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaz0Le3fT3R8jzlkXkNV7JAsd7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24831'),
  ('324198647918632188', 'Piranha', 1995, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Scott P. Levy, Brad Hardin, Patrick J. Statham', 'Alex Simon', 'William Katt, Alexandra Paul, Monte Markham, Darleen Carr, Mila Kunis, Soleil Moon Frye, Kehli O''Byrne, James Karen', 'R', 'Doctor Baines has been conducting genetic experiments on piranhas and has made them virtually unstoppable. Unfortunately, his assistants, Maggie and Paul, accidentally release the hybrids into the Lost River Lake threatening to destroy everyone in their path. Can they prevent the flesh-eating piranhas from escaping into the ocean and spawning?', 'Doctor Baines has been conducting genetic experiments on piranhas and has made them virtually unstoppable. Unfortunately, his assistants, Maggie and Paul, accidentally release the hybrids into the Lost River Lake threatening to destroy everyone in their path. Can they prevent the flesh-eating piranhas from escaping into the ocean and spawning?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUzAJwxeGiODOVmsIGrgXcy9aj1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48374'),
  ('464878192826338175', 'Piranha 3D', 2010, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Alexandre Aja, John R. Leonetti, Grégory Levasseur', 'Josh Stolberg', 'Elisabeth Shue, Jerry O''Connell, Steven R. McQueen, Jessica Szohr, Kelly Brook, Ving Rhames, Christopher Lloyd, Dina Meyer', 'R', 'Each year the population of sleepy Lake Victoria, Arizona explodes from 5,000 to 50,000 residents for the annual Spring Break celebration. But then, an earthquake opens an underwater chasm, releasing an enormous swarm of ancient Piranha that have been dormant for thousands of years, now with a taste for human flesh. This year, there''s something more to worry about than the usual hangovers and complaints from locals, a new type of terror is about to be cut loose on Lake Victoria.', 'Each year the population of sleepy Lake Victoria, Arizona explodes from 5,000 to 50,000 residents for the annual Spring Break celebration. But then, an earthquake opens an underwater chasm, releasing an enormous swarm of ancient Piranha that have been dormant for thousands of years, now with a taste for human flesh. This year, there''s something more to worry about than the usual hangovers and complaints from locals, a new type of terror is about to be cut loose on Lake Victoria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMLS2OFBbNYMSB1ZbVp4q2S4zTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43593'),
  ('194222137849293284', 'Piranha 3DD', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller, Comedy', 'John Gulager, Alexandre Lehmann, Alisa Fredericks', 'Joel Soisson, Patrick Melton, Marcus Dunstan', 'Danielle Panabaker, Matt Bush, Katrina Bowden, Jean-Luc Bilodeau, David Koechner, Chris Zylka, Adrian Martinez, Paul James Jordan', 'R', 'After the events at Lake Victoria, the prehistoric school of blood-thirsty piranhas make their way into swimming pools, plumbing, and a newly opened water park.', 'After the events at Lake Victoria, the prehistoric school of blood-thirsty piranhas make their way into swimming pools, plumbing, and a newly opened water park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOLA3IrZATSz5FQ6fmG0Q6sSVyq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71668'),
  ('832977634458257797', 'Piranha II: The Spawning', 1982, 'Horror', 'James Cameron, Alessandro Vivarelli, Ruggero Salvadori', 'Charles H. Eglee, Ovidio G. Assonitis, James Cameron', 'Tricia O''Neil, Steve Marachuk, Lance Henriksen, Ricky Paull Goldin, Ted Richert, Leslie Graves, Carole Davis, Connie Lynn Hadden', 'R', 'A scuba diving instructor, her biochemist boyfriend, and her police chief ex-husband try to link a series of bizarre deaths to a mutant strain of piranha fish whose lair is a sunken freighter ship off a Caribbean island resort.', 'A scuba diving instructor, her biochemist boyfriend, and her police chief ex-husband try to link a series of bizarre deaths to a mutant strain of piranha fish whose lair is a sunken freighter ship off a Caribbean island resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbcbLYbhc8ZmQmNHAt8E8knij88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31646'),
  ('740912041518001881', 'Piranhaconda', 2012, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Jim Wynorski, Angela Tillison, Tate Steinsiek', 'Mike MacLean', 'Michael Madsen, Rachel Hunter, Rib Hillis, Terri Ivens, Chris De Christopher, Shandi Finnessey, Michael Swan, Kurt Yaeger', null, 'A hybrid creature - half piranha and half anaconda -- attacks a low-budget horror movie crew on location near her nest when her egg is stolen. Now they must outrun and kill the deadly piranhaconda as well as stop the mad scientist who stole the egg - before they all become dinner.', 'A hybrid creature - half piranha and half anaconda -- attacks a low-budget horror movie crew on location near her nest when her egg is stolen. Now they must outrun and kill the deadly piranhaconda as well as stop the mad scientist who stole the egg - before they all become dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqgQghwDwyv4PzyaoMUnhgtiCjt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115084'),
  ('1085975838826189861', 'Piranhas', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Daniele Ciprì, Nicola Scorza, Claudio Giovannesi', 'Maurizio Braucci, Roberto Saviano, Claudio Giovannesi', 'Francesco Di Napoli, Artem Tkachuk, Viviana Aprea, Pasquale Marotta, Ciro Pellechia, Mattia Piano Del Balzo, Ciro Vecchione, Alfredo Turitto', 'NR', 'A gang of teenage boys stalk the streets of Naples armed with hand guns and AK-47s to do their mob bosses'' bidding – until they decide to be the bosses themselves.', 'A gang of teenage boys stalk the streets of Naples armed with hand guns and AK-47s to do their mob bosses'' bidding – until they decide to be the bosses themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fcIdggCiqoz3vddPhb9TkHlEYC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574436'),
  ('427618286724682651', 'Piratas en el Callao', 2005, 'History, Animation, Adventure', 'Eduardo Schuldt', 'Pipo Gallo, Hernán Garrido-Lecca', 'Stephanie Cayo, Mario Velásquez, Carlos Alcántara, Katia Condos, Enrique Victoria, María Pili Barreda, Magda Botteri, Salvador del Solar', null, 'A young boy travels back to the 17th century to battle pirates off the coast of Peru.', 'A young boy travels back to the 17th century to battle pirates off the coast of Peru.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnlcE9CmL4vSuBUMVR9RpevPV8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137495'),
  ('553051081917331735', 'Pirate TV', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Michel Leclerc, Guillaume Deffontaines', 'Michel Leclerc, Thomas Lilti', 'Félix Moati, Sara Forestier, Éric Elmosnino, Maïwenn, Zinedine Soualem, François-Eric Gendron, Carla Besnaïnou, Emmanuelle Béart', null, 'It all began when camcorders replaced cameras. Making TV programs then became within everyone''s reach. Jean-Lou, Yasmina, Victor, Clara, Adonis, and the others didn''t only want to create their own television channel, they above all wanted to make a revolution. Thus Télé Gaucho was born, as anarchic and provocative as the main channels were conformist and reactionary. Five years of mayhem, brutal pirate TV demonstrations, drunken parties, and thwarted love.. And that was my idyllic interlude.', 'It all began when camcorders replaced cameras. Making TV programs then became within everyone''s reach. Jean-Lou, Yasmina, Victor, Clara, Adonis, and the others didn''t only want to create their own television channel, they above all wanted to make a revolution. Thus Télé Gaucho was born, as anarchic and provocative as the main channels were conformist and reactionary. Five years of mayhem, brutal pirate TV demonstrations, drunken parties, and thwarted love.. And that was my idyllic interlude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGRJjg8YlccKb2aMGe3Bu28UflF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147684'),
  ('1117412115172742501', 'Piratensender Powerplay', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Rolf Deppe, Sigi Rothemund, Beate Bach', 'Sigi Rothemund', 'Thomas Gottschalk, Mike Krüger, Rainer Basedow, Evelyn Hamann, Willy Harlander, Ralf Wolter, Beate Hasenau, Gunther Philipp', null, 'Tommy and Mike operate a famous pirate radio station, Germany''s most listened-to radio station. The police and the operators of the Bavarian Broadcast Company try to stop their illegal broadcast.', 'Tommy and Mike operate a famous pirate radio station, Germany''s most listened-to radio station. The police and the operators of the Bavarian Broadcast Company try to stop their illegal broadcast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4l58tFPxE1SdbNguszr6R9y8Sv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11840'),
  ('869949221127495910', 'Pirates', 1986, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Roman Polanski, Witold Sobociński, Andrzej Kostenko', 'John Brownjohn, Roman Polanski, Gérard Brach', 'Walter Matthau, Cris Campion, Damien Thomas, Olu Jacobs, Charlotte Lewis, Roy Kinnear, Roger Ashton-Griffiths, David Kelly', 'PG-13', 'The adventures of pirate Captain Red and his first mate Frog.', 'The adventures of pirate Captain Red and his first mate Frog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuSnexGO0vq0ynefeHJvSwGYPU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11483'),
  ('1018990416876190600', 'Pirates Down the Street', 2020, 'Family, Action, Adventure', 'Pim van Hoeve', 'Sander de Regt, Reggie Naus', 'Tygo Gernandt, Egbert Jan Weeber, Samuel Reurekas, Sarah Janneh, Matti Stooker, Celeste Holsheimer, David Lucieer, Nyncke Beekhuyzen', null, 'When a pirate family''s arrival shakes up a coastal town, the kids next door offer to help them blend in and fight a bitter rival.', 'When a pirate family''s arrival shakes up a coastal town, the kids next door offer to help them blend in and fight a bitter rival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10j4f3yiazg01cuiRWMmnkdBS6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645290'),
  ('1029254384302542000', 'Pirates Down the Street II: The Ninjas from Across', 2022, 'Family, Action, Adventure', 'Pim van Hoeve', 'Reggie Naus, Sander de Regt', 'Tygo Gernandt, Egbert Jan Weeber, Samuel Reurekas, Sarah Janneh, Matti Stooker, Celeste Holsheimer, Kyana Pacis, Peter van Heeringen', null, 'The pirates feel right at home in Sandborough, but the atmosphere cools right down when the ninjas come to live in the street. After all, pirates and ninjas are sworn enemies! While pirate captain Hector Blunderbuss struggles to get rid of his new neighbours, son Billy and ninja daughter Yuka become friends. The pirates challenge the ninjas to the ultimate battle at the village''s annual hexathlon. Who will win the match? Ninjas are faster and more agile of course, but pirates are the best cheats in all of the seven seas...', 'The pirates feel right at home in Sandborough, but the atmosphere cools right down when the ninjas come to live in the street. After all, pirates and ninjas are sworn enemies! While pirate captain Hector Blunderbuss struggles to get rid of his new neighbours, son Billy and ninja daughter Yuka become friends. The pirates challenge the ninjas to the ultimate battle at the village''s annual hexathlon. Who will win the match? Ninjas are faster and more agile of course, but pirates are the best cheats in all of the seven seas...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDsvma9dAwnDPVuCFi99YpWvBk0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:946310'),
  ('1044740541154060187', 'Pirates of Silicon Valley', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Ousama Rawi, Martyn Burke, Christina Fong', 'Martyn Burke', 'Noah Wyle, Anthony Michael Hall, Joey Slotnick, J.G. Hertzler, Wayne Péré, Sheila Shaw, Gema Zamprogna, John DiMaggio', 'NR', 'The story about the men who made the world of technology what it is today, their struggles during college, the founding of their companies, and the ingenious actions they took to build up the global corporate empires of Apple Computer Inc. and Microsoft Corporation.', 'The story about the men who made the world of technology what it is today, their struggles during college, the founding of their companies, and the ingenious actions they took to build up the global corporate empires of Apple Computer Inc. and Microsoft Corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdAMdi7iFN7EP0zuaPp3mESBOH8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3293'),
  ('708002140058106268', 'Pirates of the 20th Century', 1980, 'Adventure, Action, Crime', 'Boris Durov, Leonid Akimov, Vladimir Karpichev', 'Boris Durov, Stanislav Govorukhin', 'Nikolay Eryomenko, Pyotr Velyaminov, Talgat Nigmatulin, Rein Aren, Dilorom Kambarova, Natalya Khorokhorina, Maija Eglite, Tadeusz Kasyanov', null, 'A Soviet cargo ship carrying medical opium gets attacked by pirates of an unknown nationality. The crew is left to die on a sinking ship but they manage to escape and now must fight the pirates for survival.', 'A Soviet cargo ship carrying medical opium gets attacked by pirates of an unknown nationality. The crew is left to die on a sinking ship but they manage to escape and now must fight the pirates for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXhou3BnWvZHEmGImz0vaoh98FZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140966'),
  ('574237391964492680', 'Pirates of the Caribbean: At World''s End', 2007, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Gore Verbinski, Dariusz Wolski, George Marshall Ruge', 'Ted Elliott, Terry Rossio', 'Johnny Depp, Geoffrey Rush, Orlando Bloom, Keira Knightley, Jack Davenport, Bill Nighy, Jonathan Pryce, Lee Arenberg', 'PG-13', 'After losing Captain Jack Sparrow to the locker of Davy Jones, Will Turner, Elizabeth Swann, and Captain Barbossa journey to the ends of the earth to rescue him. And as the East India Trading Company tightens its grip on the seas under Lord Cutler Beckett—now in control of Davy Jones—the fate of piracy hangs by a thread. Now, they must unite the pirate lords for one final stand. But as loyalties are tested and alliances shift, each must ultimately choose where they stand in the battle for freedom on the high seas.', 'After losing Captain Jack Sparrow to the locker of Davy Jones, Will Turner, Elizabeth Swann, and Captain Barbossa journey to the ends of the earth to rescue him. And as the East India Trading Company tightens its grip on the seas under Lord Cutler Beckett—now in control of Davy Jones—the fate of piracy hangs by a thread. Now, they must unite the pirate lords for one final stand. But as loyalties are tested and alliances shift, each must ultimately choose where they stand in the battle for freedom on the high seas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGWpG4YhpQwVmjyHEGkxEkeRf0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285'),
  ('148063188093330727', 'Pirates of the Caribbean: Dead Man''s Chest', 2006, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Gore Verbinski, Dariusz Wolski, John Dexter', 'Ted Elliott, Terry Rossio', 'Johnny Depp, Orlando Bloom, Keira Knightley, Jack Davenport, Bill Nighy, Jonathan Pryce, Lee Arenberg, Mackenzie Crook', 'PG-13', 'Captain Jack Sparrow’s got a blood debt to pay: he owes his soul to the legendary Davy Jones, ghastly Ruler of the Ocean Depths. To escape eternal servitude aboard the Flying Dutchman, ever-crafty Jack must track down the still-beating heart of Jones. But he won’t do it alone: Will Turner and Elizabeth Swann are drawn back into another one of his perilous quests—assuming they can evade execution for aiding a pirate.', 'Captain Jack Sparrow’s got a blood debt to pay: he owes his soul to the legendary Davy Jones, ghastly Ruler of the Ocean Depths. To escape eternal servitude aboard the Flying Dutchman, ever-crafty Jack must track down the still-beating heart of Jones. But he won’t do it alone: Will Turner and Elizabeth Swann are drawn back into another one of his perilous quests—assuming they can evade execution for aiding a pirate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXEqmloGyP7UXAiphJUu2v2pcuE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58'),
  ('872319678526908629', 'Pirates of the Caribbean: Dead Men Tell No Tales', 2017, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Joachim Rønning, Espen Sandberg, Paul Cameron', 'Jeff Nathanson', 'Johnny Depp, Javier Bardem, Geoffrey Rush, Brenton Thwaites, Kaya Scodelario, Golshifteh Farahani, Kevin McNally, Stephen Graham', 'PG-13', 'Thrust into an all-new adventure, a down-on-his-luck Capt. Jack Sparrow feels the winds of ill-fortune blowing even more strongly when deadly ghost sailors led by his old nemesis, the evil Capt. Salazar, escape from the Devil''s Triangle. Jack''s only hope of survival lies in seeking out the legendary Trident of Poseidon, but to find it, he must forge an uneasy alliance with a brilliant and beautiful astronomer and a headstrong young man in the British navy.', 'Thrust into an all-new adventure, a down-on-his-luck Capt. Jack Sparrow feels the winds of ill-fortune blowing even more strongly when deadly ghost sailors led by his old nemesis, the evil Capt. Salazar, escape from the Devil''s Triangle. Jack''s only hope of survival lies in seeking out the legendary Trident of Poseidon, but to find it, he must forge an uneasy alliance with a brilliant and beautiful astronomer and a headstrong young man in the British navy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lAPOAFYFWIO3SQRemEY2wInQMC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166426'),
  ('1049813832268997557', 'Pirates of the Caribbean: On Stranger Tides', 2011, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Rob Marshall, Timothy R. Price, Peter Kohn', 'Terry Rossio, Ted Elliott', 'Johnny Depp, Penélope Cruz, Geoffrey Rush, Ian McShane, Kevin McNally, Sam Claflin, Àstrid Bergès-Frisbey, Stephen Graham', 'PG-13', 'When Jack crosses paths with a woman from his past, he''s not sure if it''s love...or if she''s a ruthless con artist using him to find the fabled Fountain of Youth.', 'When Jack crosses paths with a woman from his past, he''s not sure if it''s love...or if she''s a ruthless con artist using him to find the fabled Fountain of Youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keGfSvCmYj7CvdRx36OdVrAEibE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1865'),
  ('137585194978942931', 'Pirates of the Caribbean: Tales of the Code: Wedlocked', 2011, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Nic Sadler, James Ward Byrkit', 'Terry Rossio, Ted Elliott', 'John Vickery, Vanessa Branch, Lauren Maher, David Bailie, Martin Horsey, Walter Williamson, Jack Donner, Fred Maske', 'PG-13', 'Wenches Scarlett and Giselle fix each other up for their wedding, in which they would each marry their groom. Upon realizing that both their grooms were the same man, Jack Sparrow, the two wenches found themselves in an auction led by the Auctioneer. This short film serves as a prequel to The Curse of the Black Pearl, and explains just why Jack Sparrow''s boat the Jolly Mon was seen sinking at the beginning of the whole story; why the wenches were so upset with him; and how Cotton lost his tongue.', 'Wenches Scarlett and Giselle fix each other up for their wedding, in which they would each marry their groom. Upon realizing that both their grooms were the same man, Jack Sparrow, the two wenches found themselves in an auction led by the Auctioneer. This short film serves as a prequel to The Curse of the Black Pearl, and explains just why Jack Sparrow''s boat the Jolly Mon was seen sinking at the beginning of the whole story; why the wenches were so upset with him; and how Cotton lost his tongue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJfzdiL6XkFRB5Oh57D7VijT4OK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230652'),
  ('547562336666407764', 'Pirates of the Caribbean: The Curse of the Black Pearl', 2003, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Gore Verbinski, Dariusz Wolski, Gary Romolo Fiorelli', 'Terry Rossio, Ted Elliott', 'Johnny Depp, Geoffrey Rush, Orlando Bloom, Keira Knightley, Jack Davenport, Jonathan Pryce, Lee Arenberg, Mackenzie Crook', 'PG-13', 'When wily pirate Captain Barbossa seizes Jack Sparrow’s beloved ship, the Black Pearl, and kidnaps the governor’s daughter, Elizabeth Swann, blacksmith Will Turner reluctantly teams up with the unpredictable pirate Jack to rescue her—only to uncover a terrifying curse that turns Barbossa’s crew into the undead.', 'When wily pirate Captain Barbossa seizes Jack Sparrow’s beloved ship, the Black Pearl, and kidnaps the governor’s daughter, Elizabeth Swann, blacksmith Will Turner reluctantly teams up with the unpredictable pirate Jack to rescue her—only to uncover a terrifying curse that turns Barbossa’s crew into the undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvDwL2gTf6yxujbsWbsGQB3Z9Wa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22'),
  ('719658582087508851', 'Pirates of Tortuga', 1961, 'Action, Adventure', 'Robert D. Webb', 'Melvin Levy, Pat Silver, Jesse Lasky Jr.', 'Ken Scott, Letícia Román, Dave King, John Richardson, Rafer Johnson, Robert Stephens, Rachel Stephens, Stanley Adams', 'NR', 'After a lengthy voyage, Capt. Bart docks his ship in a London harbor and is given a new mission by British Admiralty: capture the notorious Henry Morgan, a pirate who has been wreaking havoc throughout the Caribbean. After recruiting some former shipmates for his crew, Capt. Bart sets sail in search of the infamous buccaneer, and is joined by a beautiful female stowaway in the process.', 'After a lengthy voyage, Capt. Bart docks his ship in a London harbor and is given a new mission by British Admiralty: capture the notorious Henry Morgan, a pirate who has been wreaking havoc throughout the Caribbean. After recruiting some former shipmates for his crew, Capt. Bart sets sail in search of the infamous buccaneer, and is joined by a beautiful female stowaway in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqEbFMXShYZfy3diWXlEx1BJfIl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79716'),
  ('321383703450070546', 'Pirosmani', 1969, 'Drama, History', 'Giorgi Shengelaia, Konstantin Apryatin, Otar Gegechkori', 'Giorgi Shengelaia, Erlom Akhvlediani', 'Avtandil Varazi, David Abashidze, Givi Aleksandria, Spartak Bagashvili, Teimuraz Beridze, Zurab Kapianidze, Shota Daushvili, Aleqsandre Rekhviashvili', null, 'A biography of the Georgian primitive artist Nikoloz Pirosmanishvili (1862–1918), better known as Pirosmani, who died of starvation and sold his paintings to bars and restaurants for food and drink. The film experiments with color control techniques based on the painter’s style.', 'A biography of the Georgian primitive artist Nikoloz Pirosmanishvili (1862–1918), better known as Pirosmani, who died of starvation and sold his paintings to bars and restaurants for food and drink. The film experiments with color control techniques based on the painter’s style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXCfzNcX0NcOgYeaB9hIXqDc0rB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88302'),
  ('746278484954047569', 'Pisito de solteras', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Merino, Leopoldo Villaseñor, Andrés Vich', 'Jaime de Armiñán', 'Alfredo Landa, Mari Carmen Prendes, Mónica Randall, Tina Sainz, Mirta Miller, Silvia Tortosa, Luis Varela, Rafael Hernández', null, 'The shy professor Emilio is about to celebrate a wedding nobody wants. At the last minute he escapes and settles in a Madrid apartment shared by four friends of his ex-fiancee. The unhappy man is like a little lamb in a wolf''s lair - in this case four wolves.', 'The shy professor Emilio is about to celebrate a wedding nobody wants. At the last minute he escapes and settles in a Madrid apartment shared by four friends of his ex-fiancee. The unhappy man is like a little lamb in a wolf''s lair - in this case four wolves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4ODjLHyeakWjhNoYXjFlRKP6Rw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184915'),
  ('765738009445552102', 'Pistas para volver a casa', 2015, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama', 'Jazmín Stuart, Daniel Ortega', 'Jazmín Stuart', 'Érica Rivas, Juan Minujín, Hugo Arana, Beatriz Spelzini, María Merlino, Natalia Díaz, Gustavo Comini, Chucho Fernández', null, 'Two siblings on a mission. After their elderly father gets hurt in an accident, they run to his side. He has breaking news about their mother, who abandoned them. He also hid something valuable and now brother and sister must work together.', 'Two siblings on a mission. After their elderly father gets hurt in an accident, they run to his side. He has breaking news about their mother, who abandoned them. He also hid something valuable and now brother and sister must work together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTWnsZDSKw9T1tW4003XU2DZZCK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315544'),
