  ('590511960611989476', 'Pistol Opera', 2001, 'Crime, Action', 'Seijun Suzuki, Yonezō Maeda, Michizô Kitô', 'Izo Hashimoto, Kazunori Ito', 'Makiko Esumi, Sayoko Yamaguchi, Hanae Kan, Mikijiro Hira, Masatoshi Nagase, Kirin Kiki, Kenji Sawada, Haruko Katō', null, 'An assassin fends off numerous attacks from her comrades, who are trying to move up in rank by killing off the competition.', 'An assassin fends off numerous attacks from her comrades, who are trying to move up in rank by killing off the competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3GWHrSGMRpzobEziWEyh7xpqOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37712'),
  ('778204868359042605', 'Pistol Whipped', 2008, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Roel Reiné', 'J. D. Zeik', 'Steven Seagal, Lance Henriksen, Blanchard Ryan, Bernie McInerney, Antoni Corone, Matt Salinger, Paul Calderon, Arthur J. Nascarella', 'R', 'Steven Seagal stars in this gritty, no-holds barred action film as an elite ex-cop with a gambling problem and a mountain of debt. When a mysterious man offers to clear his debts in exchange for the assassination of the city''s most notorious gangsters, he make s decision that will change his life - forever.', 'Steven Seagal stars in this gritty, no-holds barred action film as an elite ex-cop with a gambling problem and a mountain of debt. When a mysterious man offers to clear his debts in exchange for the assassination of the city''s most notorious gangsters, he make s decision that will change his life - forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLnFzCelnRz1jne83MKPVvwhmeb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17314'),
  ('422373898795860854', 'Pistol: The Birth of a Legend', 1991, 'Drama, Family', 'Frank C. Schröder, Randy Walsh', null, 'Millie Perkins, Nick Benedict, Adam Guier, Murrell Garland, Tom Lester, Buddy Petrie, Darrel Campbell, Wendy Leblanc', 'G', 'A story about the great basketball player "Pistol" Pete Maravich when he was in the eighth grade. He plays on the varsity basketball team at Daniel High School but has some very difficult obstacles standing in his way of playing. The only support he has is from his father, retired basketball pro Press Maravich.', 'A story about the great basketball player "Pistol" Pete Maravich when he was in the eighth grade. He plays on the varsity basketball team at Daniel High School but has some very difficult obstacles standing in his way of playing. The only support he has is from his father, retired basketball pro Press Maravich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4R0VvSecMgQ3QG8aZ8ksR40IRe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50503'),
  ('1063665847608371787', 'Pistolera', 2020, 'Action, Drama', 'Damian Chapa', 'Romina Di Lella', 'Romina Di Lella, Robert Davi, Danny Trejo, Damian Chapa, Matias Tobal, Rihanna Barrie, Cameron Barrie, Marta Blanc', null, 'A ruthless drug lord murders the family of a little girl in Spain, he makes a fatal mistake: letting her live, setting in motion a bloody chain of events in this tale of revenge and its cost.', 'A ruthless drug lord murders the family of a little girl in Spain, he makes a fatal mistake: letting her live, setting in motion a bloody chain of events in this tale of revenge and its cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SdWGKAnhcVtHUKOxprEL9kWMoN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746600'),
  ('78580722649537668', 'Pistoleros famosos', 1981, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'José Loza', 'José Loza, Roberto Gonzalez Benavidez', 'Mario Almada, Fernando Almada, Álvaro Zermeño, Lorenzo de Monteclaro, Roberto Cañedo, Rossy Mendoza, Ada Carrasco, Eleazar García', null, 'A gunfighter after killing the ones responsible for his brother''s death, joins by mistake a gang of smugglers', 'A gunfighter after killing the ones responsible for his brother''s death, joins by mistake a gang of smugglers', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6ZlyEUtiLKQE4HlqKEtSadM1C5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487689'),
  ('252042187041766600', 'Pit of Darkness', 1961, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Basil Emmott, Lance Comfort', 'Lance Comfort', 'William Franklyn, Moira Redmond, Bruno Barnabe, Leonard Sachs, Nigel Green, Nanette Newman, Anthony Booth, Jacqueline Jones', null, 'When Richard Logan, the partner in a safe making firm, is found unconscious, on an old deserted bomb site, he finds that he has no recollection of the last three weeks. Then he discovers that the private detective, hired by his wife, has been found murdered, and a safe that his firm installed in a large country house, has been cleverly opened, and the contents are missing. So with the help of his wife, he sets out to uncover the truth.', 'When Richard Logan, the partner in a safe making firm, is found unconscious, on an old deserted bomb site, he finds that he has no recollection of the last three weeks. Then he discovers that the private detective, hired by his wife, has been found murdered, and a safe that his firm installed in a large country house, has been cleverly opened, and the contents are missing. So with the help of his wife, he sets out to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yX4xOoatkNCsD3L35IeaQxDVdBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45258'),
  ('1002467871001393201', 'Pit Stop', 1969, 'Action, Drama', 'Jack Hill, Austin McKinney', 'Jack Hill', 'Brian Donlevy, Richard Davalos, Ellen Burstyn, Sid Haig, Beverly Washburn, George Washburn, Steve Pendleton, Robert Krist', 'NR', 'Rick Bowman, a drag racing street punk, comes to the attention of crafty businessman Grant Willard. Willard bails him out of jail and offers him sponsorship as a stock car driver. Bowman accepts and enters the demolition derby-adjacent world of "figure eight" racing. As Bowman moves up in the ranks, his regard for his friends slips-- giving way to outright obsession with becoming the best.', 'Rick Bowman, a drag racing street punk, comes to the attention of crafty businessman Grant Willard. Willard bails him out of jail and offers him sponsorship as a stock car driver. Bowman accepts and enters the demolition derby-adjacent world of "figure eight" racing. As Bowman moves up in the ranks, his regard for his friends slips-- giving way to outright obsession with becoming the best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IX7KbthFQ9CX9bdOyhinI9ygue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92378'),
  ('222286194125977218', 'Pitbull', 2005, 'Action, Crime', 'Patryk Vega, Mirosław Kuba Brożek', 'Patryk Vega', 'Marcin Dorociński, Janusz Gajos, Andrzej Grabowski, Rafał Mohr, Krzysztof Stroiński, Ryszard Filipski, Małgorzata Foremniak, Jolanta Fraszyńska', null, 'Police officers from the Warsaw Homicide Department are trying to arrest a dangerous Armenian criminal.', 'Police officers from the Warsaw Homicide Department are trying to arrest a dangerous Armenian criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsYAQKRssp1LO2hA6jysA2IRNp1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74919'),
