  ('449389979061055502', 'Pitbull: Tough Women', 2016, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Mirosław Kuba Brożek, Patryk Vega', 'Patryk Vega', 'Sebastian Fabijański, Joanna Kulig, Piotr Stramowski, Alicja Bachleda-Curuś, Maja Ostaszewska, Magdalena Cielecka, Andrzej Grabowski, Artur Żmijewski', null, 'Two new female police officers struggle to survive a force filled with corrupt superiors and the brutal world of the criminal mafia.', 'Two new female police officers struggle to survive a force filled with corrupt superiors and the brutal world of the criminal mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsK9VuKFm3CG84UxWLyiHXw7L6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425961'),
  ('480755198747796527', 'Pitbull. Last Dog', 2018, 'Action, Crime', 'Jakub Wielecki, Władysław Pasikowski, Kacper Habisiak', 'Władysław Pasikowski', 'Marcin Dorociński, Krzysztof Stroiński, Dorota ''Doda'' Rabczewska, Rafał Mohr, Cezary Pazura, Adam Woronowicz, Marian Dziędziel, Agnieszka Kawiorska', null, 'A policeman gets killed and the short-staffed police chief sends for a few experienced officers to support him in his fight with organized crime. Meanwhile, a conflict between local gangster groups escalates.', 'A policeman gets killed and the short-staffed police chief sends for a few experienced officers to support him in his fight with organized crime. Meanwhile, a conflict between local gangster groups escalates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgEI3cOcL23o0gMlvrNS2cfJXYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512768'),
  ('38399679658203575', 'Pitch', 1997, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Spencer Rice, Kenny Hotz, Chris Romeike', null, 'Kenny Hotz, Spencer Rice, Samuel Z. Arkoff, Gérard Depardieu, Roger Ebert, Whoopi Goldberg, Fred Williamson, Al Pacino', null, 'A Canadian documentary featuring two young filmmakers attending the Toronto Film Festival to pitch a film concept to various celebrities. Their film idea, titled "The Dawn", concerns a Mafia don who goes for a hernia operation but gets a sex change instead. During the 1996 Toronto Fest, they approach Roger Ebert, Norman Jewison (at a packed press conference), Eric Stoltz (leaving a limo), Al Pacino, and others without much success. On a roll, they leave Toronto for Hollywood, getting advice from Arthur Hiller and Neil Simon and finding an agent who expresses interest in their pitch.', 'A Canadian documentary featuring two young filmmakers attending the Toronto Film Festival to pitch a film concept to various celebrities. Their film idea, titled "The Dawn", concerns a Mafia don who goes for a hernia operation but gets a sex change instead. During the 1996 Toronto Fest, they approach Roger Ebert, Norman Jewison (at a packed press conference), Eric Stoltz (leaving a limo), Al Pacino, and others without much success. On a roll, they leave Toronto for Hollywood, getting advice from Arthur Hiller and Neil Simon and finding an agent who expresses interest in their pitch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwL7faAN2Rei2gOZvGejNqcDhIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52862'),
  ('345296834141954907', 'Pitch Black', 2000, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Action', 'David Twohy, David Eggby, Ian ''Thistle'' Thorburn', 'Jim Wheat, Ken Wheat, David Twohy', 'Vin Diesel, Radha Mitchell, Cole Hauser, Lewis Fitz-Gerald, Claudia Black, Keith David, Rhiana Griffith, John Moore', 'R', 'When their ship crash-lands on a remote planet, the marooned passengers soon learn that escaped convict Riddick isn''t the only thing they have to fear. Deadly creatures lurk in the shadows, waiting to attack in the dark, and the planet is rapidly plunging into the utter blackness of a total eclipse. With the body count rising, the doomed survivors are forced to turn to Riddick with his eerie eyes to guide them through the darkness to safety. With time running out, there''s only one rule: Stay in the light.', 'When their ship crash-lands on a remote planet, the marooned passengers soon learn that escaped convict Riddick isn''t the only thing they have to fear. Deadly creatures lurk in the shadows, waiting to attack in the dark, and the planet is rapidly plunging into the utter blackness of a total eclipse. With the body count rising, the doomed survivors are forced to turn to Riddick with his eerie eyes to guide them through the darkness to safety. With time running out, there''s only one rule: Stay in the light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3AnlxZ5CZnhKKzjgFyY6EHxmOyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2787'),
  ('20984453790686487', 'Pitch Perfect', 2012, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Jason Moore, George Bamber, Tommy Martin', 'Kay Cannon', 'Anna Kendrick, Anna Camp, Brittany Snow, Skylar Astin, Rebel Wilson, Ester Dean, Hana Mae Lee, Adam Devine', 'PG-13', 'College student Beca knows she does not want to be part of a clique, but that''s exactly where she finds herself after arriving at her new school. Thrust in among mean gals, nice gals and just plain weird gals, Beca finds that the only thing they have in common is how well they sing together. She takes the women of the group out of their comfort zone of traditional arrangements and into a world of amazing harmonic combinations in a fight to the top of college music competitions.', 'College student Beca knows she does not want to be part of a clique, but that''s exactly where she finds herself after arriving at her new school. Thrust in among mean gals, nice gals and just plain weird gals, Beca finds that the only thing they have in common is how well they sing together. She takes the women of the group out of their comfort zone of traditional arrangements and into a world of amazing harmonic combinations in a fight to the top of college music competitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsFoJk9g8W3zgaipRrrURk7LbiF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114150'),
  ('485008517402588499', 'Pitch Perfect 2', 2015, 'Comedy, Music', 'Elizabeth Banks, Daniel Silverberg, James Roque Jr.', 'Kay Cannon', 'Anna Kendrick, Brittany Snow, Hailee Steinfeld, Rebel Wilson, Ester Dean, Adam Devine, Skylar Astin, Hana Mae Lee', 'PG-13', 'The Bellas are back, and they are better than ever. After being humiliated in front of none other than the President of the United States of America, the Bellas are taken out of the Aca-Circuit. In order to clear their name, and regain their status, the Bellas take on a seemingly impossible task: winning an international competition no American team has ever won. In order to accomplish this monumental task, they need to strengthen the bonds of friendship and sisterhood and blow away the competition with their amazing aca-magic! With all new friends and old rivals tagging along for the trip, the Bellas can hopefully accomplish their dreams.', 'The Bellas are back, and they are better than ever. After being humiliated in front of none other than the President of the United States of America, the Bellas are taken out of the Aca-Circuit. In order to clear their name, and regain their status, the Bellas take on a seemingly impossible task: winning an international competition no American team has ever won. In order to accomplish this monumental task, they need to strengthen the bonds of friendship and sisterhood and blow away the competition with their amazing aca-magic! With all new friends and old rivals tagging along for the trip, the Bellas can hopefully accomplish their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFBQUufCV4c8WZoNhtGM17p884H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254470'),
  ('484783219314566079', 'Pitch Perfect 3', 2017, 'Music, Comedy', 'James Roque Jr., Kristina M. Peterson, Trish Sie', 'Kay Cannon, Mike White', 'Anna Kendrick, Rebel Wilson, Brittany Snow, Hailee Steinfeld, Elizabeth Banks, Anna Camp, Alexis Knapp, Ruby Rose', 'PG-13', 'After the highs of winning the world championships, the Bellas find themselves split apart and discovering there aren''t job prospects for making music with your mouth. But when they get the chance to reunite for an overseas USO tour, this group of awesome nerds will come together to make some music, and some questionable decisions, one last time.', 'After the highs of winning the world championships, the Bellas find themselves split apart and discovering there aren''t job prospects for making music with your mouth. But when they get the chance to reunite for an overseas USO tour, this group of awesome nerds will come together to make some music, and some questionable decisions, one last time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4tbRRX0OSOHcgz2869rEjcBwOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353616'),
  ('335222125172574261', 'Piter FM', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Oksana Bychkova, Zaur Bolotaev, Yuliya Egorova', 'Nana Grinshtein, Oksana Bychkova, Andrey Migachev', 'Yekaterina Fedulova, Evgeny Tsyganov, Irina Rakhmanova, Kirill Pirogov, Tatyana Kravchenko, Aleksandr Bashirov, Artyom Semakin, Andrey Krasko', null, 'Masha, who works for a radio station, and Maxim, a street sweeper with an architectural degree, cross paths with each other when they are at an indecisive point in their lives.', 'Masha, who works for a radio station, and Maxim, a street sweeper with an architectural degree, cross paths with each other when they are at an indecisive point in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OBg9S8JCH7AFNQ7LDb3pJbBX4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64736'),
