  ('1048554854719348662', 'Pitfall', 1962, 'Mystery, Fantasy, Crime', 'Hiroshi Teshigahara, Hiroshi Segawa', 'Kōbō Abe', 'Hisashi Igawa, Sumie Sasaki, Sen Yano, Hideo Kanze, Kunie Tanaka, Kei Satō, Kazuo Miyahara, Akemi Nara', null, 'A man wanders into a seemingly deserted town with his young son in search of work. But after a bit of bad luck, he joins the town''s population of lost souls.', 'A man wanders into a seemingly deserted town with his young son in search of work. But after a bit of bad luck, he joins the town''s population of lost souls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KIRFXDuELVg86zDqDH0ESd9QoV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54146'),
