  ('870541829090859128', 'Place of Bones', 2024, 'Western, Thriller, Horror, Action', 'Andrzej Sekula, Audrey Cummings', 'Richard Taylor', 'Heather Graham, Tom Hopper, Corin Nemec, Brielle Robillard, Donald Cerrone, Gattlin Griffith, Zachary Keller, Ray Abruzzo', 'R', 'On a remote ranch, a mother and her daughter fight for survival when a wounded outlaw seeking refuge brings a notorious bank robber and his ruthless gang, all desperate to reclaim a stolen fortune, right to their doorstep.', 'On a remote ranch, a mother and her daughter fight for survival when a wounded outlaw seeking refuge brings a notorious bank robber and his ruthless gang, all desperate to reclaim a stolen fortune, right to their doorstep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZFkk6qkHkyK8ZLtSnoomVzbK2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1080249'),
  ('346727989590624848', 'Place publique', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Agnès Jaoui, Yves Angelo, Mathieu Vaillant', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Agnès Jaoui', 'Agnès Jaoui, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Héléna Noguerra, Léa Drucker, Grégoire Oestermann, Sam Karmann, Olivier Doran, Kévin Azaïs', null, 'Revolves around Castro, who was once a very famous TV host, but as he grows old, his popularity is dwindling.', 'Revolves around Castro, who was once a very famous TV host, but as he grows old, his popularity is dwindling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkenlpzAu0SbUKGYvbJklER4NkL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486521'),
  ('488253081501048438', 'Place Vendôme', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nicole Garcia, Laurent Dailland', 'Nicole Garcia, Jacques Fieschi', 'Catherine Deneuve, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Emmanuelle Seigner, Jacques Dutronc, Bernard Fresson, François Berléand, Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Otto Tausig', null, 'The story of a woman that remained distracted for a long time from her life, from the passions that made her feel alive. The importance of true love is compared with the material value of diamonds. Only one truly lasts forever. She''s got to find the thing that values most for her, the thing that gives psychical stability and real happiness again to her life.', 'The story of a woman that remained distracted for a long time from her life, from the passions that made her feel alive. The importance of true love is compared with the material value of diamonds. Only one truly lasts forever. She''s got to find the thing that values most for her, the thing that gives psychical stability and real happiness again to her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zSk1gOonLdJCESLMVzVww0aSlH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33799'),
  ('585796738770445796', 'Placés', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nessim Chikhaoui, Christophe Offenstein', 'Hélène Fillières, Nessim Chikhaoui', 'Shaïn Boumedine, Nailia Harzoune, Moussa Mansaly, Philippe Rebbot, Aloïse Sauvage, Julie Depardieu, Lucie Charles-Alfred, Elyes Aguis', null, 'Because he forgot his identity card, Elias cannot take the entrance exam to Sciences Po. In search of a job while waiting to be able to take the exam again, he becomes an educator in a children''s home. Confronted with an environment he doesn''t know how to work, Elias doesn''t yet know how much this experience will change his life.', 'Because he forgot his identity card, Elias cannot take the entrance exam to Sciences Po. In search of a job while waiting to be able to take the exam again, he becomes an educator in a children''s home. Confronted with an environment he doesn''t know how to work, Elias doesn''t yet know how much this experience will change his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epKakliobTsoCDMqGSKGpy3RGbx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:886953'),
  ('370398125972636533', 'Places in Cities', 1998, 'Drama', 'Angela Schanelec, Reinhold Vorschneider', 'Angela Schanelec', 'Sophie Aigner, Vincent Branchet, Katharina Eckerfeld, Martin Jackowski, Friederike Kammer, Jérôme Robart, Michael Sideris, Marie-Lou Sellem', null, 'Mimmi is a very lonely girl, not knowing what to do with her life. On the search for friends and boyfriends, she wanders around alone in different cities.', 'Mimmi is a very lonely girl, not knowing what to do with her life. On the search for friends and boyfriends, she wanders around alone in different cities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYVldqyXB74IzXMKXqiIlB3NhuI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110380'),
  ('323845712809558735', 'Places in the Heart', 1984, 'Drama', 'Robert Benton, Bran Ferren, Néstor Almendros', 'Robert Benton', 'Sally Field, Lindsay Crouse, John Malkovich, Danny Glover, Ed Harris, Ray Baker, Amy Madigan, Terry O''Quinn', 'PG', 'In 1935 rural Texas, recently widowed Edna Spaulding struggles to survive with two small children, a farm to run, and very little money in the bank - not to mention a deadly tornado and the unwelcome presence of the Ku Klux Klan. Edna is aided by her beautician sister, Margaret; a blind boarder, Mr. Will; and a would-be thief, Moze, who decides to teach Edna how to plant and harvest cotton.', 'In 1935 rural Texas, recently widowed Edna Spaulding struggles to survive with two small children, a farm to run, and very little money in the bank - not to mention a deadly tornado and the unwelcome presence of the Ku Klux Klan. Edna is aided by her beautician sister, Margaret; a blind boarder, Mr. Will; and a would-be thief, Moze, who decides to teach Edna how to plant and harvest cotton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmWg3uVn700inqOiadxeFTmiqmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13681'),
  ('209351713583765980', 'Placido', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Luis García Berlanga, Narciso Munné, Juan Estelrich March', 'José Luis Colina, Rafael Azcona, Luis García Berlanga', 'Cassen, José Luis López Vázquez, Elvira Quintillá, Manuel Alexandre, Mario Bustos, María Francés, Carmen Yepes, Jesús Puche', null, 'In a small Spanish town, during the Christmas holidays, a group of rich old ladies organize a peculiar event that consists of inviting a homeless person to sit down to dinner at their wealthy table. Plácido, a humble worker, is hired by the organizers to participate in a parade with his three-wheeled vehicle, a seemingly simple mission that will not be easy for him to accomplish.', 'In a small Spanish town, during the Christmas holidays, a group of rich old ladies organize a peculiar event that consists of inviting a homeless person to sit down to dinner at their wealthy table. Plácido, a humble worker, is hired by the organizers to participate in a parade with his three-wheeled vehicle, a seemingly simple mission that will not be easy for him to accomplish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xzbq4B8z9i53KGvIhBIKSDyoCa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51317'),
  ('986176366751065582', 'Plaga zombie', 1997, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Hernán Sáez, Pablo Parés', 'Pablo Parés, Hernán Sáez, Berta Muñiz', 'Pablo Parés, Berta Muñiz, Hernán Sáez, Walter Cornás, Diego Parés, Esteban Podetti, Pablo Fayó, Martín Lepera', null, 'A group of people must fight for their lives when a bizarre epidemic starts a zombie invasion.', 'A group of people must fight for their lives when a bizarre epidemic starts a zombie invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWuzzPMqreMASx45AEEbSc9nc1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73636'),
  ('379522493448933632', 'Plaga Zombie: Mutant Zone', 2001, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Pablo Parés, Hernán Sáez', 'Pablo Parés, Hernán Sáez', 'Berta Muñiz, Pablo Parés, Hernán Sáez, Paulo Soria, Alejandro D''Aloisio, Daniel de la Vega, Walter Cornás, Juan Bautista Dartiguelongue', null, 'A small town is the subject of some experiment with aliens where they were allowed to test some earth folks with some kind of disease, but of course it spread with disastrous results. And now, three oddballs have been dumped into the middle of this town as test subjects or something, and the race for survival is on. John West is a strongman, with a cowboy hat and leopard skin tights, Bill is a medical student, and Max is a mathematical genius, and it''s them against the zombies.', 'A small town is the subject of some experiment with aliens where they were allowed to test some earth folks with some kind of disease, but of course it spread with disastrous results. And now, three oddballs have been dumped into the middle of this town as test subjects or something, and the race for survival is on. John West is a strongman, with a cowboy hat and leopard skin tights, Bill is a medical student, and Max is a mathematical genius, and it''s them against the zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1mIx9fNBVICd2QBRbYAWKGt7hV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40151'),
  ('82718881213882206', 'Plaga zombie: zona mutante: revolución tóxica', 2012, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Julia Lenzberg, Pablo Parés, Diego Echave', 'Paulo Soria, Pablo Parés, Hernán Sáez', 'Hernán Sáez, Berta Muñiz, Pablo Parés, Paulo Soria, Walter Cornás, Diego Parés, Esteban Podetti, Pablo Payó', null, 'An invasion alien threatens the fate of humanity and begins in a village where there are Bill Johnson, John West and Max Giggs. The friends escape from there with the purpose of finding and destroying the invading ship before it completes its evil plan of conquest.', 'An invasion alien threatens the fate of humanity and begins in a village where there are Bill Johnson, John West and Max Giggs. The friends escape from there with the purpose of finding and destroying the invading ship before it completes its evil plan of conquest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKReb8xd1WR2EinjboW87zBmCyD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166214'),
  ('366149434413786647', 'Plague', 1979, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ed Hunt, Mark Irwin', 'Barry Pearson, Ed Hunt', 'Daniel Pilon, Kate Reid, Céline Lomez, Michael J. Reynolds, Brenda Donohue, Jonah Royston, Barbara Gordon, Jack Van Evera', 'PG', 'An outbreak of a bacteria called M-3 causes people to die in extreme pain via body spasms. A woman who is a carrier escapes from a hospital and goes on the run, spreading the plague to people she encounters, and onto food in fast food stops etc. She has no idea however that she is a carrier, and as such may carry a cure.', 'An outbreak of a bacteria called M-3 causes people to die in extreme pain via body spasms. A woman who is a carrier escapes from a hospital and goes on the run, spreading the plague to people she encounters, and onto food in fast food stops etc. She has no idea however that she is a carrier, and as such may carry a cure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0Pj2faI6GK5mMFTiMC3O3eLVld.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89397'),
  ('471667095334565533', 'Plague Town', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'David Gregory, Brian Rigney Hubbard, Nick Maczka', 'John Cregan, David Gregory', 'Josslyn DeCrosta, Erica Rhodes, David Lombard, Lindsay Goranson, James Warke, Catherine McMorrow, Elizabeth Bove, Michael Donaldson', 'NR', 'An American family visiting their Irish roots accidentally stumbles on a horde of bloodthirsty mutant children.', 'An American family visiting their Irish roots accidentally stumbles on a horde of bloodthirsty mutant children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLIdcCXTZ10iE3fazzQk6nIxp6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27612'),
  ('1052642930382855514', 'Plain Clothes', 1988, 'Comedy, Thriller, Mystery, Crime, Romance, Action', 'Martha Coolidge, Daniel Hainey, Frank Capra III', 'Scott Frank', 'Arliss Howard, Suzy Amis, George Wendt, Diane Ladd, Seymour Cassel, Larry Pine, Jackie Gayle, Abe Vigoda', 'PG', 'To prove his brother''s innocence, undercover officer Nick enrolls in high school again, dealing with crushes, bullies, humiliations, popularity swings, and quirky teachers and staff to find the real murderer.', 'To prove his brother''s innocence, undercover officer Nick enrolls in high school again, dealing with crushes, bullies, humiliations, popularity swings, and quirky teachers and staff to find the real murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coCA0gZObtGySSVLOPb784650ep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55728'),
  ('21227950725639898', 'Plainclothes', 2025, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Carmen Emmi, Ethan Palmer, Julia Zsolnay', 'Carmen Emmi', 'Tom Blyth, Russell Tovey, Amy Forsyth, Maria Dizzia, Christian Cooke, Gabe Fazio, John Bedford Lloyd, Sam Asa Brownstein', null, 'In 1990s New York, an undercover police officer receives an assignment to lure and arrest gay men. However, he''s surprised to discover a scintillating connection with one of his targets. As their secret connection deepens and internal pressure to deliver arrests intensifies, he finds himself torn between duty and desire.', 'In 1990s New York, an undercover police officer receives an assignment to lure and arrest gay men. However, he''s surprised to discover a scintillating connection with one of his targets. As their secret connection deepens and internal pressure to deliver arrests intensifies, he finds himself torn between duty and desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bT5QN5QARV5TblAt9jDVQQsnSec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1255718'),
  ('133773655498504485', 'Plainlands', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pekka Parikka, Kari Sohlberg', 'Pekka Parikka, Antti Tuuri', 'Taneli Mäkelä, Esko Salminen, Esko Nikkari, Vesa Mäkelä, Heikki Paavilainen, Kirsti Ortola, Eeva Eloranta, Rea Mauranen', null, 'Based on a novel of the same name by the Finnish author, Antti Tuuri, this delicious late-80''s comedy builds its dark humour on the stereotypical mentality of the northern part of Finland. While perhaps not as entertaining to a person unfamiliar with Finnish traditions, the brilliant acting, directing, plus the warm, beautiful Finnish summer more than make up for the cultural gap.The story begins with a group of brothers with their families coming up to honour the memory of their recently deceased father. Spending time together, opening old wounds and creating new ones... it all boils down to brotherhood. No matter what happens, brothers take care of their own.', 'Based on a novel of the same name by the Finnish author, Antti Tuuri, this delicious late-80''s comedy builds its dark humour on the stereotypical mentality of the northern part of Finland. While perhaps not as entertaining to a person unfamiliar with Finnish traditions, the brilliant acting, directing, plus the warm, beautiful Finnish summer more than make up for the cultural gap.The story begins with a group of brothers with their families coming up to honour the memory of their recently deceased father. Spending time together, opening old wounds and creating new ones... it all boils down to brotherhood. No matter what happens, brothers take care of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xM3vhyUAiO9Pq7HSP92wIoatLur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55520'),
  ('64208232335855008', 'Plajda', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Murat Şeker', 'Murat Dişli', 'Gürgen Öz, Sarp Apak, Tuba Ünsal, Turgay Tanülkü, Aydoğan Oflu, Güçlü Yalçıner, Fatih Koyunoğlu, Tuğçe Ersoy', null, 'Cem and Ali, two buddies, find themselves in the middle of a mafia showdown at a party where they are DJing. Not knowing what to do, the pair try to escape by putting on women''s clothes they find in the costume room. But a perverted member of the mafia takes them to a resort and holds them captive, and the pair suddenly find themselves working as entertainers at a hotel. During their first attempt to escape the hotel, they see 20 girls who have come to the hotel for a beauty pageant and are stunned. They don''t want to leave this paradise-like environment. But flirting with girls and living as women is difficult. Even when they try to escape from the hotel a second time, the duo, who have fallen in love with Cansu and Ebru from the TV crew, stay at the hotel. Meanwhile, the mafia also arrives at the hotel.', 'Cem and Ali, two buddies, find themselves in the middle of a mafia showdown at a party where they are DJing. Not knowing what to do, the pair try to escape by putting on women''s clothes they find in the costume room. But a perverted member of the mafia takes them to a resort and holds them captive, and the pair suddenly find themselves working as entertainers at a hotel. During their first attempt to escape the hotel, they see 20 girls who have come to the hotel for a beauty pageant and are stunned. They don''t want to leave this paradise-like environment. But flirting with girls and living as women is difficult. Even when they try to escape from the hotel a second time, the duo, who have fallen in love with Cansu and Ebru from the TV crew, stay at the hotel. Meanwhile, the mafia also arrives at the hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsKg9o8c9mbADRJeT06Gt2lvP6X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248760'),
  ('700623887683651683', 'Plan 75', 2022, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Chie Hayakawa, Hideho Urata, Yoshio Tsunetani', 'Jason Gray', 'Chieko Baisho, Hayato Isomura, Stefanie Arianne, Yuumi Kawai, Taka Takao, Hisako Ôkata, Kazuyoshi Kushida, Yoko Yano', null, 'In a Japan of the near future, the government program Plan 75 encourages senior citizens to be voluntarily euthanized to remedy a super-aged society. An elderly woman whose means of survival are vanishing, a pragmatic Plan 75 salesman, and a young Filipino laborer face choices of life and death.', 'In a Japan of the near future, the government program Plan 75 encourages senior citizens to be voluntarily euthanized to remedy a super-aged society. An elderly woman whose means of survival are vanishing, a pragmatic Plan 75 salesman, and a young Filipino laborer face choices of life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWmmZayMOLC8zCz59TcwsiAjYmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958487'),
  ('1141403775276224829', 'Plan 9 from Outer Space', 1957, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Edward D. Wood Jr., William C. Thompson', 'Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'Gregory Walcott, Mona McKinnon, Duke Moore, Tom Keene, Carl Anthony, Paul Marco, Tor Johnson, Dudley Manlove', 'NR', 'In California, an old man grieves the loss of his wife, and dies the day after she is buried. However, the space soldier Eros and his mate Tanna use an electric device to resurrect them both, alongside the strong Inspector Clay, who was murdered by the alien-controlled dead couple. When the populations of Hollywood and Washington DC see flying saucers on the sky, a colonel, a police lieutenant, a commercial pilot, his wife and a policeman try to stop the aliens.', 'In California, an old man grieves the loss of his wife, and dies the day after she is buried. However, the space soldier Eros and his mate Tanna use an electric device to resurrect them both, alongside the strong Inspector Clay, who was murdered by the alien-controlled dead couple. When the populations of Hollywood and Washington DC see flying saucers on the sky, a colonel, a police lieutenant, a commercial pilot, his wife and a policeman try to stop the aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmicZi7PvlnZ9rZqp6QXN2Db0pT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10513'),
  ('606783638742130055', 'Plan A', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Doron Paz, Yoav Paz, Moshe Mishali', 'Doron Paz, Yoav Paz', 'August Diehl, Sylvia Hoeks, Michael Aloni, Nikolai Kinski, Oz Zehavi, Barbara Bauer, Yoël Rozenkier, Ishai Golan', 'NR', 'Germany 1945, Max, a Jewish Holocaust survivor, meets a radical group of Jewish resistance fighters, who, like him, lost all hope for their future after they were robbed of their existence and their entire families were killed by the Nazis. They dream of retaliation on an epic scale for the Jewish people. An eye for an eye, a tooth for a tooth. Max starts identifying with the group''s monstrous plans...', 'Germany 1945, Max, a Jewish Holocaust survivor, meets a radical group of Jewish resistance fighters, who, like him, lost all hope for their future after they were robbed of their existence and their entire families were killed by the Nazis. They dream of retaliation on an epic scale for the Jewish people. An eye for an eye, a tooth for a tooth. Max starts identifying with the group''s monstrous plans...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHCcn6100h2HMWx83OdQtZXuhSR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714968'),
