  ('709247137889097793', 'Plane''s Flying to Russia', 1994, 'Comedy, Adventure, Action', 'Aleksei Kapilevich, Gennady Salnikov, Georgy Mayer', 'Aleksei Kapilevich, Konstantin Bryzgalov', 'Andrei Ankudinov, Sergei Parshin, Sergei Losev, Vladimir Khotinenko, Oleg Komarov, Aleksandr Pantykin, Nikolay Karpenko, Sofya Tiunova', null, 'Former prisoners captured plane. But on the way there was a failure, and to alleviate the weight of the aircraft, they throw overboard box with three hostages. The hostages managed to land safely. Now they have to stick together. And around a foreign land with a strange unknown language.', 'Former prisoners captured plane. But on the way there was a failure, and to alleviate the weight of the aircraft, they throw overboard box with three hostages. The hostages managed to land safely. Now they have to stick together. And around a foreign land with a strange unknown language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqHA3mY2dzUIagpht8QZCF7NeUB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227680'),
  ('423807817059551341', 'Planes', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Klay Hall, Sheryl Sardina Sackett', 'Jeffrey M. Howard', 'Dane Cook, Carlos Alazraqui, Val Kilmer, Julia Louis-Dreyfus, Brad Garrett, Teri Hatcher, John Cleese, Anthony Edwards', 'PG', 'Dusty is a cropdusting plane who dreams of competing in a famous aerial race. The problem? He is hopelessly afraid of heights. With the support of his mentor Skipper and a host of new friends, Dusty sets off to make his dreams come true.', 'Dusty is a cropdusting plane who dreams of competing in a famous aerial race. The problem? He is hopelessly afraid of heights. With the support of his mentor Skipper and a host of new friends, Dusty sets off to make his dreams come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2xgU0y0p77WTrB0oIkbpdaWq8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151960'),
  ('996507722776605469', 'Planes, Trains and Automobiles', 1987, 'Comedy', 'John Hughes, Donald Peterman, Mark Radcliffe', 'John Hughes', 'Steve Martin, John Candy, Laila Robins, Michael McKean, Dylan Baker, Kevin Bacon, Olivia Burnette, Carol Bruce', 'R', 'An irritable marketing executive, Neal Page, is heading home to Chicago for Thanksgiving when a number of delays force him to travel with a well meaning but overbearing shower curtain ring salesman, Del Griffith.', 'An irritable marketing executive, Neal Page, is heading home to Chicago for Thanksgiving when a number of delays force him to travel with a well meaning but overbearing shower curtain ring salesman, Del Griffith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwi2cET87xArJCb8MdbWq2BZO3n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2609'),
  ('80144329276423711', 'Planes, Trains, and Christmas Trees', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Marta Borowski', 'Cera Rose Pickering', 'Kathryn Davis, Olivier Renaud, Richard Waugh, Markeda McKay, Ewa Wolniczek, Maria Syrgiannis, Christopher Seivright, Ashton James', null, 'During a business trip, event planner Kayley and sports agent Brett find themselves unable to fly home for Christmas due to a snowstorm. Determined to get back to NYC by Christmas Eve, the two team up and try to make their own way home.', 'During a business trip, event planner Kayley and sports agent Brett find themselves unable to fly home for Christmas due to a snowstorm. Determined to get back to NYC by Christmas Eve, the two team up and try to make their own way home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcVbLZdXyavLsHmw9Lmnh4uHAan.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:988428'),
  ('479639051737186888', 'Planes: Fire & Rescue', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Bobs Gannaway', 'Jeffrey M. Howard', 'Ed Harris, Dane Cook, Julie Bowen, Curtis Armstrong, John Michael Higgins, Hal Holbrook, Teri Hatcher, Brad Garrett', 'PG', 'When world-famous air racer Dusty learns that his engine is damaged and he may never race again, he must shift gears and is launched into the world of aerial firefighting. Dusty joins forces with veteran fire and rescue helicopter Blade Ranger and his team, a bunch of all-terrain vehicles known as The Smokejumpers. Together, the fearless team battles a massive wildfire, and Dusty learns what it takes to become a true hero.', 'When world-famous air racer Dusty learns that his engine is damaged and he may never race again, he must shift gears and is launched into the world of aerial firefighting. Dusty joins forces with veteran fire and rescue helicopter Blade Ranger and his team, a bunch of all-terrain vehicles known as The Smokejumpers. Together, the fearless team battles a massive wildfire, and Dusty learns what it takes to become a true hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOmteFeBDI9FJOPTDvYJYFeAtdp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218836'),
  ('160286842906575178', 'Planet 51', 2009, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Jorge Blanco, Marcos Martínez, Javier Abad', 'Joe Stillman', 'Dwayne Johnson, Seann William Scott, Jessica Biel, Justin Long, Gary Oldman, John Cleese, Alan Marriott, Freddie Benedict', 'PG', 'When Earth astronaut Capt. Chuck Baker arrives on Planet 51 -- a world reminiscent of American suburbia circa 1950 -- he tries to avoid capture, recover his spaceship and make it home safely, all with the help of an empathetic little green being.', 'When Earth astronaut Capt. Chuck Baker arrives on Planet 51 -- a world reminiscent of American suburbia circa 1950 -- he tries to avoid capture, recover his spaceship and make it home safely, all with the help of an empathetic little green being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7Itcg3ZdExKwdKguy73WPEqosW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16866'),
  ('926472898743040407', 'Planet B', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Marie Crabit, Aude Léa Rapin, Judith Chalier', 'Aude Léa Rapin, Laurent Lunetta', 'Adèle Exarchopoulos, Souheila Yacoub, Eliane Umuhire, India Hair, Paul Beaurepaire, Jonathan Couzinié, Théo Cholbi, Amine Hamidou', null, 'France, 2039. One night, a group of activists who are being pursued by the State vanish without a trace. Julia Bombarth is one of them. When she awakens, she finds herself trapped in an entirely unfamiliar world: PLANET B.', 'France, 2039. One night, a group of activists who are being pursued by the State vanish without a trace. Julia Bombarth is one of them. When she awakens, she finds herself trapped in an entirely unfamiliar world: PLANET B.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCi5WZbYeFkM1KsOcbSv2qd37Bf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064758'),
  ('615888374097212897', 'Planet Dune', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Adventure', 'Marcus Friedlander, Glenn Campbell, Tammy Klein', 'Lauren Pritchard, Joe Roche', 'Sean Young, Emily Killian, Sienna Farall, Clark Moore, Sharon Desiree, Ramiro Leal, Tammy Klein, Anna Telfer', null, 'A crew on a mission to rescue a marooned base on a desert planet turns deadly when the crew finds themselves hunted and attacked by the planet’s apex predators: giant sand worms.', 'A crew on a mission to rescue a marooned base on a desert planet turns deadly when the crew finds themselves hunted and attacked by the planet’s apex predators: giant sand worms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPSPghn6tr6fGY6hTi78SrxBcqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881460'),
  ('537698236017170181', 'Planet Earth', 1974, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Marc Daniels, Archie R. Dalzell', null, 'John Saxon, Janet Margolin, Ted Cassidy, Christopher Cary, Diana Muldaur, Sally Kemp, Jo De Winter, Claire Brennen', null, 'The time: the 22nd century. The place: the Confederacy, a matriarchy where men are enslaved and impotent. The hero: Dylan Hunt, a handsome, vigorous 20th-century scientist awakened from suspended animation - just the "breeder" a Confederacy dominatrix has been waiting for! Can Hunt defy the Confederacy and free his downtrodden fellow males, or is he doomed to slavery on Planet Earth? A sequel to Gene Roddenberry''s Genesis II.', 'The time: the 22nd century. The place: the Confederacy, a matriarchy where men are enslaved and impotent. The hero: Dylan Hunt, a handsome, vigorous 20th-century scientist awakened from suspended animation - just the "breeder" a Confederacy dominatrix has been waiting for! Can Hunt defy the Confederacy and free his downtrodden fellow males, or is he doomed to slavery on Planet Earth? A sequel to Gene Roddenberry''s Genesis II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCiVCPHOWhT1MEXWfe3vZPnTOB8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54805'),
  ('148413765747665678', 'Planet Hulk', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action', 'Sam Liu, Kirk Tingblad', 'Greg Johnson', 'Rick D. Wasserman, Lisa Ann Beley, Mark Hildreth, Liam O''Brien, Kevin Michael Richardson, Sam Vincent, Advah Soudack, Michael Kopsa', 'PG-13', 'When the Hulk''s presence on Earth becomes too great a risk, the Illuminati trick him to board a shuttle destined for a planet where he will be able to live in peace, and launch it into space. The Hulk''s struggle to escape causes the shuttle to malfunction and crash land on the planet Sakaar, however, where he is sold into slavery and trained as a gladiator.', 'When the Hulk''s presence on Earth becomes too great a risk, the Illuminati trick him to board a shuttle destined for a planet where he will be able to live in peace, and launch it into space. The Hulk''s struggle to escape causes the shuttle to malfunction and crash land on the planet Sakaar, however, where he is sold into slavery and trained as a gladiator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wCzY3sAs6zHIzzHIcTKN2g0pu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30675'),
  ('276390104099934635', 'Planet Ocean', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Yann Arthus-Bertrand, Michael Pitiot', 'Michael Pitiot', 'Josh Duhamel, Luca Mercalli', null, 'Dive into our planet''s greatest mysteries with a team of international underwater cinematographers as they explore the breathtaking bond between humanity and the ocean.', 'Dive into our planet''s greatest mysteries with a team of international underwater cinematographers as they explore the breathtaking bond between humanity and the ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kukf6NNxQF1wLykdC2e0jlVELig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152113'),
  ('129200567375348365', 'Planet of Dinosaurs', 1977, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Action', 'James K. Shea, Henning Schellerup', 'Ralph Lucas', 'Mary Appleseth, Derna Wylde, Max Thayer, Pamela Bottaro, James Whitworth, Chuck Pennington, Charlotte Speer, Louie Lawless', null, 'A spaceship gets lost and is forced to make an emergency landing on an unknown planet. The planet looks much like Earth, only with no trace of civilization. Soon the crew discovers that there are bloodthirsty dinosaurs on the planet. The crew hopes to be found and rescued, but until then, they must fight to survive.', 'A spaceship gets lost and is forced to make an emergency landing on an unknown planet. The planet looks much like Earth, only with no trace of civilization. Soon the crew discovers that there are bloodthirsty dinosaurs on the planet. The crew hopes to be found and rescued, but until then, they must fight to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8wYyolN2DV7Orhrh5YfzLfOh3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38020'),
  ('26818328323669977', 'Planet of Snail', 2012, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Yi Seung-jun, Yi Seung-jun', null, null, null, 'Young-Chan comes from planet of snail where deaf blind people live slow and quiet lives. When Young-Chan came to Earth, nobody understood his language and he was desperate. Then an angel walked into his life. Soon-Ho knows how it is to be lonely and soon becomes an inseparable part of his life. Young-Chan also discovers an amazing world under his fingers as he learned to read books with braille. Hopes began to grow and he dreams of writing a book. However, Soon-Ho cannot always be there for him because of her own problem of spine disability. The couple now should learn to survive alone. While Soon-Ho uneasily spends her first day waiting for his return, Young-Chan goes out for the biggest adventure of his life.', 'Young-Chan comes from planet of snail where deaf blind people live slow and quiet lives. When Young-Chan came to Earth, nobody understood his language and he was desperate. Then an angel walked into his life. Soon-Ho knows how it is to be lonely and soon becomes an inseparable part of his life. Young-Chan also discovers an amazing world under his fingers as he learned to read books with braille. Hopes began to grow and he dreams of writing a book. However, Soon-Ho cannot always be there for him because of her own problem of spine disability. The couple now should learn to survive alone. While Soon-Ho uneasily spends her first day waiting for his return, Young-Chan goes out for the biggest adventure of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yp7bVwQVdY2lN8FflB7KJAwDPVE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114994'),
  ('127507705065355963', 'Planet of Storms', 1962, 'Science Fiction', 'Pavel Klushantsev, Arkadi Klimov, V. Yemelyanov', 'Aleksandr Kazantsev, Pavel Klushantsev', 'Georgi Zhzhyonov, Yuriy Sarantsev, Georgiy Teykh, Kyunna Ignatova, Gennadi Vernov', null, 'Soviet cosmonauts land on the planet Venus and find it teeming with life, some of it dangerous.', 'Soviet cosmonauts land on the planet Venus and find it teeming with life, some of it dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GjUVE9cx4sMWhue4LQXuWwAghf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49164'),
  ('763457110760843770', 'Planet of the Apes', 1968, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Franklin J. Schaffner, Leon Shamroy, William Kissell', 'Michael Wilson, Rod Serling', 'Charlton Heston, Roddy McDowall, Kim Hunter, Maurice Evans, James Whitmore, James Daly, Linda Harrison, Robert Gunner', 'G', 'Astronaut Taylor crash lands on a distant planet ruled by apes who use a primitive race of humans for experimentation and sport. Soon Taylor finds himself among the hunted, his life in the hands of a benevolent chimpanzee scientist.', 'Astronaut Taylor crash lands on a distant planet ruled by apes who use a primitive race of humans for experimentation and sport. Soon Taylor finds himself among the hunted, his life in the hands of a benevolent chimpanzee scientist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2r9iKnlSYEk4daQadsXfcjHfIjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:871'),
  ('93875843598278556', 'Planet of the Apes', 2001, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Tim Burton, Philippe Rousselot, Andy Armstrong', 'William Broyles Jr., Lawrence Konner, Mark Rosenthal', 'Mark Wahlberg, Tim Roth, Helena Bonham Carter, Michael Clarke Duncan, Paul Giamatti, Estella Warren, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, David Warner', 'PG-13', 'After a spectacular crash-landing on an uncharted planet, brash astronaut Leo Davidson finds himself trapped in a savage world where talking apes dominate the human race. Desperate to find a way home, Leo must evade the invincible gorilla army led by Ruthless General Thade.', 'After a spectacular crash-landing on an uncharted planet, brash astronaut Leo Davidson finds himself trapped in a savage world where talking apes dominate the human race. Desperate to find a way home, Leo must evade the invincible gorilla army led by Ruthless General Thade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZWsuP5rExMSji7erxnb1P5SK6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869'),
  ('873080639913105094', 'Planet of the Apes: A Milestone of Science Fiction', 2024, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Antoine Coursat', null, 'Alexandra Alévêque, Roddy McDowall, Kim Hunter, Charlton Heston', null, 'Since its release in 1968, Planet of the Apes, the masterful film directed by Franklin J. Schaffner and starring Charlton Heston, and its subsequent sequels have asked its viewers challenging questions about contemporary society under the guise of a bold science fiction saga: a fascinating look at a hugely successful pop culture phenomenon.', 'Since its release in 1968, Planet of the Apes, the masterful film directed by Franklin J. Schaffner and starring Charlton Heston, and its subsequent sequels have asked its viewers challenging questions about contemporary society under the guise of a bold science fiction saga: a fascinating look at a hugely successful pop culture phenomenon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j55l5cAP2Pc3O4UF70DQU0FIEUU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1286121'),
  ('767845424953607408', 'Planet of the Female Invaders', 1966, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Alfredo B. Crevenna, Alfredo Uribe', 'Emilio Gómez Muriel, Alfredo Ruanova', 'Elizabeth Campbell, Maura Monti, Guillermo Murray, Lorena Velázquez, Adriana Roel, Rogelio Guerra, José Ángel Espinosa ''Ferrusquilla'', Raúl Ramírez', null, 'A group of sexy space vixens flies down to Earth, sets up a shop at a carnival (disguising their ship as a ride), and kidnap some earthlings in their scheme to conquer our planet. The humans, including Marcos, a crooked boxer and our hero, Silvia, his love interest, and a gang of comical mobsters out to kill Marcos, are taken to the women’s home planet. There they are held prisoner by the evil queen Adastrea and aided by her selfless twin Alburnia. Meanwhile, a standard issue hunky scientist back on Earth, who happens to be Silvia’s boss, tries to rescue them.', 'A group of sexy space vixens flies down to Earth, sets up a shop at a carnival (disguising their ship as a ride), and kidnap some earthlings in their scheme to conquer our planet. The humans, including Marcos, a crooked boxer and our hero, Silvia, his love interest, and a gang of comical mobsters out to kill Marcos, are taken to the women’s home planet. There they are held prisoner by the evil queen Adastrea and aided by her selfless twin Alburnia. Meanwhile, a standard issue hunky scientist back on Earth, who happens to be Silvia’s boss, tries to rescue them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65jtlmZYsEP7FBQYEHZIMJrAgS1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109755'),
  ('705018431515661168', 'Planet of the Humans', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Jeff Gibbs', 'Jeff Gibbs', 'Jeff Gibbs, Chris Dodd', null, 'Forget all you have heard about how “Renewable Energy” is our salvation. It is all a myth that is very lucrative for some. Feel-good stuff like electric cars, etc. Such vehicles are actually powered by coal, natural gas… or dead salmon in the Northwest.', 'Forget all you have heard about how “Renewable Energy” is our salvation. It is all a myth that is very lucrative for some. Feel-good stuff like electric cars, etc. Such vehicles are actually powered by coal, natural gas… or dead salmon in the Northwest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91UfoJxsLVRt3A6M2GGbTTzMMD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622014'),
  ('756158898926811579', 'Planet of the Sharks', 2016, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Mark Atkins, Mark Atkins, Buzz Hughes', 'Mark Atkins, Marc Gottlieb', 'Brandon Auret, Stephanie Beran, Lindsay Sullivan, Lauren Joseph, Dan Barnett, Christia Visser, John B. Swart, Alex Anlos', null, 'In the near future, glacial melting has covered 98% of earth''s landmass. Sharks have flourished and now dominate the planet, operating as one massive school led by a mutated alpha shark.', 'In the near future, glacial melting has covered 98% of earth''s landmass. Sharks have flourished and now dominate the planet, operating as one massive school led by a mutated alpha shark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54hwLfOJONjqOFxGlEixpOHeEnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407620'),
  ('409603222034027013', 'Planet of the Vampires', 1965, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Adventure', 'Mario Bava, Serena Canevari, Manuel San Román', 'Ib Melchior, Alberto Bevilacqua, Callisto Cosulich', 'Barry Sullivan, Norma Bengell, Ángel Aranda, Evi Marandi, Stelio Candelli, Franco Andrei, Fernando Villena, Mario Morales', 'NR', 'After landing on a mysterious planet, a team of astronauts begin to turn on each other, swayed by the uncertain influence of the planet and its strange inhabitants.', 'After landing on a mysterious planet, a team of astronauts begin to turn on each other, swayed by the uncertain influence of the planet and its strange inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPpfT4r9HtHcri0eIknqpewoewM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17921'),
  ('847508231368338032', 'Planet Outlaws', 1953, 'Science Fiction', 'Ford Beebe, Saul A. Goodkind', 'Norman S. Hall, Helen Leighton, Ray Trampe', 'Buster Crabbe, Constance Moore, Jackie Moran, Anthony Warde, Jack Mulhall, Philson Ahn, C. Montague Shaw, Guy Usher', 'NR', 'A 20th Century pilot named Buck Rogers and his young friend Buddy Wade awake from 500 years in suspended animation to find that the world has been taken over by the outlaw army of Killer Kane. Feature version of the film serial Buck Rogers by Universal Pictures, 1940.', 'A 20th Century pilot named Buck Rogers and his young friend Buddy Wade awake from 500 years in suspended animation to find that the world has been taken over by the outlaw army of Killer Kane. Feature version of the film serial Buck Rogers by Universal Pictures, 1940.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IZ3UWFRZLwtcTA7KQfmtzwsGEf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23331'),
  ('347158780100273829', 'Planet Single', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mitja Okorn, Aleksander Pietrzak, Jan Belcl', 'Sam Akina, Jules Jones, Mitja Okorn', 'Maciej Stuhr, Agnieszka Więdłocha, Piotr Głowacki, Weronika Książkiewicz-Nathaniel, Tomasz Karolak, Joanna Jarmołowicz, Ewa Błaszczyk, Michał Czernecki', null, 'He is one of the top celebrities in the country: a fast-talking TV host, who can joke his way out of any situation. Women want to be with him, men want to be like him. He is looking for a new topic to discuss in his popular talk-show. She is a teacher at a musical school - a timid girl looking for Mr. Perfect on an internet dating site. He will help her realise her potential and teach her how to recognise various types of men for what they are, she will teach him what real life is about. The show will become a huge hit. It seems they are destined to fall in love and be together, but one day she actually does meet Mr. Perfect on the net.', 'He is one of the top celebrities in the country: a fast-talking TV host, who can joke his way out of any situation. Women want to be with him, men want to be like him. He is looking for a new topic to discuss in his popular talk-show. She is a teacher at a musical school - a timid girl looking for Mr. Perfect on an internet dating site. He will help her realise her potential and teach her how to recognise various types of men for what they are, she will teach him what real life is about. The show will become a huge hit. It seems they are destined to fall in love and be together, but one day she actually does meet Mr. Perfect on the net.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bePLXgvcpj2xlQfT9CUwVE7QLy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383682'),
  ('98368770415651216', 'Planet Single 2', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sam Akina, Mikołaj Łebkowski, Aleksander Pietrzak', 'Jules Jones, Sam Akina', 'Maciej Stuhr, Agnieszka Więdłocha, Piotr Głowacki, Weronika Książkiewicz-Nathaniel, Tomasz Karolak, Joanna Jarmołowicz, Danuta Stenka, Aleksandar Milićević', null, 'A teacher and a famous TV host must hide their not-so-merry romance from the public when they present a Christmas special live on-air.', 'A teacher and a famous TV host must hide their not-so-merry romance from the public when they present a Christmas special live on-air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOc7kzW8qItxqcuWJx9PS6QqLt0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552746'),
  ('540169089155464605', 'Planet Single: Greek Adventure', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sam Akina, Michał Chaciński', 'Sam Akina', 'Maciej Stuhr, Agnieszka Więdłocha, Weronika Książkiewicz-Nathaniel, Tomasz Karolak, Piotr Głowacki, Nikodem Rozbicki, Kamil Kula, Małgorzata Mikołajczak', null, 'A Greek getaway for five friends turns into a hilarious detective story when suspicions rise around one of their partners — who may be a famous con-man.', 'A Greek getaway for five friends turns into a hilarious detective story when suspicions rise around one of their partners — who may be a famous con-man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71ldr0VuST8uVqsmsIBTPVYgKV0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1468789'),
  ('881501839270768529', 'Planet Terror', 2007, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Robert Rodriguez, Robert Rodriguez, Brian Bettwy', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Rose McGowan, Freddy Rodríguez, Marley Shelton, Josh Brolin, Jeff Fahey, Michael Biehn, Bruce Willis, Rebel Rodriguez', 'R', 'Two doctors find their graveyard shift inundated with townspeople ravaged by sores. Among the wounded is Cherry Darling, a dancer whose leg was ripped from her body. As the invalids quickly become enraged aggressors, Cherry and her ex-boyfriend El Wray lead a team of accidental warriors into the night.', 'Two doctors find their graveyard shift inundated with townspeople ravaged by sores. Among the wounded is Cherry Darling, a dancer whose leg was ripped from her body. As the invalids quickly become enraged aggressors, Cherry and her ex-boyfriend El Wray lead a team of accidental warriors into the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3705GxG0RN9XDV5y9IiXKYHw1fK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1992'),
  ('455481682498793980', 'Planet Unknown', 2016, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Shawn ''Zixiao'' Wang, Shawn ''Zixiao'' Wang', 'Shawn ''Zixiao'' Wang', null, null, 'At the end of 21st century, mankind was facing global resource depletion. Space Rovers were sent out to find potentially habitable planets.', 'At the end of 21st century, mankind was facing global resource depletion. Space Rovers were sent out to find potentially habitable planets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7r0ZdIuhCSMDfelNdneLLZWU61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416403'),
  ('525178709219299580', 'Planetarian: Hoshi no Hito', 2016, 'Animation, Drama', 'Yui Kinoshita, Naotaka Watanabe, Haru Watanabe', 'Naokatsu Tsuda, Shogo Yasukawa', 'Tamio Ohki, Keiko Suzuki, Daisuke Ono, Sanae Fuku, Yoko Hikasa, Minami Tsuda, Akiko Takeguchi, Yuuki Kuwahara', null, 'The film adapts and expands the Planetarian visual novel by Key. The story is set in a dystopian future where biological and nuclear warfare has left a once prosperous civilization in complete ruin. The film tells the story of an old man travelling around with a mobile planetarium projector to show people the stars.', 'The film adapts and expands the Planetarian visual novel by Key. The story is set in a dystopian future where biological and nuclear warfare has left a once prosperous civilization in complete ruin. The film tells the story of an old man travelling around with a mobile planetarium projector to show people the stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hIbj9FohrwZC8eVrlVbbCqaaR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394326'),
  ('289566660783535575', 'Planetarium', 2016, 'Drama, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Rebecca Zlotowski, Clémentine Castel, Cristina Freitas', 'Rebecca Zlotowski, Robin Campillo', 'Natalie Portman, Lily-Rose Depp, Emmanuel Salinger, Amira Casar, Pierre Salvadori, Louis Garrel, David Bennent, Damien Chapelle', 'NR', 'In 1930s France, two sisters who are thought to be able to communicate with ghosts meet a visionary producer while performing in Paris.', 'In 1930s France, two sisters who are thought to be able to communicate with ghosts meet a visionary producer while performing in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znEuFcJJAiSEhBlt1gPeD28OdTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374464'),
  ('633141662319961569', 'Planetary Giants', 1966, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Alfredo B. Crevenna, Alfredo Uribe', 'Emilio Gómez Muriel', 'Guillermo Murray, Adriana Roel, Rogelio Guerra, José Ángel Espinosa ''Ferrusquilla'', José Gálvez, Jacqueline Fellay, Evita Muñoz ''Chachita'', Carlos Nieto', null, 'Daniel Wolf, scientist with a brand new rocket ship and a girlfriend/secretary is sent to ''the planet of the eternal night'' to fight the guy who has threatened earth. He is supposed to go alone, but his assistant sneaks in the ship somehow, along with two other guys.', 'Daniel Wolf, scientist with a brand new rocket ship and a girlfriend/secretary is sent to ''the planet of the eternal night'' to fight the guy who has threatened earth. He is supposed to go alone, but his assistant sneaks in the ship somehow, along with two other guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncUIF9IJPAnFUYUk89Eop67M1Nt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262635'),
  ('1062916185230997414', 'Plankton: The Movie', 2025, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Dave Needham', 'Mr. Lawrence, Kaz, Chris Viscardi', 'Mr. Lawrence, Jill Talley, Tom Kenny, Bill Fagerbakke, Rodger Bumpass, Carolyn Lawrence, Clancy Brown, Mary Jo Catlett', 'G', 'Plankton''s tangled love story with his sentient computer wife goes sideways when she takes a stand — and decides to destroy the world without him.', 'Plankton''s tangled love story with his sentient computer wife goes sideways when she takes a stand — and decides to destroy the world without him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGaUNLF5VZbg9ovPTyjm9Rv5xWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1104845'),
  ('258804603803557300', 'Plants', 2016, 'Drama', 'Roberto Doveris, Pelayo Lira, Patricio Alfaro', 'Roberto Doveris', 'Violeta Castillo, Ingrid Isensee, Mauro Vaca, Ernesto Meléndez, Juan Cano, Simone Mercado, Marcela de la Carrera, Gabriela Arancibia', null, 'For a whole summer, 17-year-old Florencia has to look after her brother, who is trapped in a persistent vegetative state. From time to time she reads to him from a comic about plant souls that take control of human bodies at full moon.', 'For a whole summer, 17-year-old Florencia has to look after her brother, who is trapped in a persistent vegetative state. From time to time she reads to him from a comic about plant souls that take control of human bodies at full moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dScXu87Tz8o2kIU9VVwcHAv56fs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379388'),
  ('988578861941686720', 'Plastic', 2014, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Julian Gilbey, Peter Wignall, Will Gilbey', 'Julian Gilbey, Will Gilbey, Chris Howard', 'Ed Speleers, Will Poulter, Alfie Allen, Sebastian de Souza, Emma Rigby, Thomas Kretschmann, Graham McTavish, Melise', 'R', 'Sam and Fordy run a credit card fraud scheme, but when they steal from the wrong man, they find themselves threatened by sadistic gangster. They need to raise £5m and pull off a daring diamond heist to clear their debt.', 'Sam and Fordy run a credit card fraud scheme, but when they steal from the wrong man, they find themselves threatened by sadistic gangster. They need to raise £5m and pull off a daring diamond heist to clear their debt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jva5sTJnlz9g11Xm0GTxl6WAIk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208869'),
  ('728575262857147036', 'Plastic Bag', 2009, 'Drama', 'Ramin Bahrani, Michael Simmonds', 'Ramin Bahrani', 'Werner Herzog, Barbara Weetman', null, 'A plastic bag, thrown out in the trash, attempts to find his way back to his owner and along the way discovers the world.', 'A plastic bag, thrown out in the trash, attempts to find his way back to his owner and along the way discovers the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZOKKv1p8iz3CtcIG7Vi7nhMO8o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66178'),
  ('938038575213308055', 'Plastic China', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Jiuliang Wang, Jiuliang Wang, Li Gangbing', null, null, null, 'This film tells a story about an unschooled 11-year-old girl Yi-Jie, she''s a truly global child who learns the world through the United Nations of Wastes while working with her YI minority parents in this recycle workshop thousand miles away from their mountain village home town', 'This film tells a story about an unschooled 11-year-old girl Yi-Jie, she''s a truly global child who learns the world through the United Nations of Wastes while working with her YI minority parents in this recycle workshop thousand miles away from their mountain village home town', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZoIeBXkNKmLerdJk4SeTIh3OBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428574'),
  ('482550797318865878', 'Plastic Guns', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Christophe Meurisse, Agnès Guilbault, Romane Isabella', 'Jean-Christophe Meurisse, Amélie Philippe', 'Delphine Baril, Charlotte Laemmel, Laurent Stocker, Gaëtan Peau, Juana Acosta, Anthony Paliotti, Philippe Rebbot, Jonathan Cohen', null, 'During a trip to Denmark, a man is arrested and accused of murdering his wife and three children. Though maintaining his innocence, he remains jailed as police investigate.', 'During a trip to Denmark, a man is arrested and accused of murdering his wife and three children. Though maintaining his innocence, he remains jailed as police investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tp6mfbXQ5zxM6oCx5CcINPfAeFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000888'),
  ('640125171925974990', 'Plastic Little: The Adventures of Captain Tita', 1994, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure, Comedy', 'Kinji Yoshimoto, Satoshi Urushihara', 'Masayori Sekimoto', 'Hekiru Shiina, Yuriko Fuchizaki, Norio Wakamoto, Keiko Yokozawa, Chikao Ohtsuka, Kappei Yamaguchi, Ryusei Nakao, Yosuke Akimoto', 'R', 'Tita, captain of a pet-hunting ship for the galaxy’s upper class, finds herself babysitting Elysse, a scientist’s daughter being pursued by the military commander Lord Guizel, who’ll stop at nothing to retrieve the key to the high-powered weapon her father created. Dodging the lord’s clutches is a planet-wide game of cat and mouse for Tita and her crew, with one crucial difference: Mice don’t shoot back!', 'Tita, captain of a pet-hunting ship for the galaxy’s upper class, finds herself babysitting Elysse, a scientist’s daughter being pursued by the military commander Lord Guizel, who’ll stop at nothing to retrieve the key to the high-powered weapon her father created. Dodging the lord’s clutches is a planet-wide game of cat and mouse for Tita and her crew, with one crucial difference: Mice don’t shoot back!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/de1dPo7MUK1NvBntnshzzVmi84e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16224'),
  ('517367773603764437', 'Plastic Planet', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Thomas Kirschner, Werner Boote', 'Werner Boote', 'Werner Boote, Peter Lieberzeit', null, 'Werner Boote presents an up-close and personal view of the controversial and fascinating material that has found its way into every facet of our daily lives: plastic. He takes us on a journey around the globe, showing that plastics have become a threat for both environment and human health.', 'Werner Boote presents an up-close and personal view of the controversial and fascinating material that has found its way into every facet of our daily lives: plastic. He takes us on a journey around the globe, showing that plastics have become a threat for both environment and human health.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhAt3mQTCjDwsXS0RkQbGgoKcH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53290'),
  ('349819179022230317', 'Plastic Tree', 2003, 'Romance, Drama, Horror', 'Eo Il-seon', 'Seong-sil Kim', 'Cho Eun-sook, Kim Jeong-hyeon, Kim In-kwon', null, 'A couple live a peaceful existence in a small seaside town. Their relationship is set to implode when the husband''s childhood friend stays at their home.', 'A couple live a peaceful existence in a small seaside town. Their relationship is set to implode when the husband''s childhood friend stays at their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1QMgvwCh5jLWkBplNnx90bMDpJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182307'),
  ('412559096750655666', 'Platform', 2001, 'Drama, History', 'Jia Zhangke, Nelson Yu Lik-wai', 'Jia Zhangke', 'Zhao Tao, Wang Hongwei, Liang Jingdong, Yang Lina, Han Sanming, Wang Bo', null, 'China’s rapid changes from the late 1970s to the early 1990s, as seen through the lives of four performers in a theater troupe.', 'China’s rapid changes from the late 1970s to the early 1990s, as seen through the lives of four performers in a theater troupe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFsp0NVmzHskDVoCjbpc9Asy8dV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80427'),
  ('108731247602992355', 'Platillos volantes', 2003, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Óscar Aibar, Xavier Bernabeu, Mario Montero', 'Óscar Aibar, Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Ángel de Andrés López, Jordi Vilches, José Luis Adserías, Àngels Poch, Macarena Gómez, Berta Ojea, Juan Margallo, Leo Bassi', null, 'Based on real events, in 1972 Juan and José are two textile workers from Tarrasa, Catalonia (northeast to Spain) who meet during an UFOs'' convention. Both share their passion about the paranormal, specially about UFOs. In these years where was very much UFOs'' sightings, they feel captivated by the mystery and start to investigate the diverse theories about the intentions or purposes of the sightings. Their friendship and the obsession they have will turn in dementia and paranoia, hurting their relations with their respective friends and familiars and exposing their lives to an extreme decision due to the conclusion of their own investigations. Written by Chockys', 'Based on real events, in 1972 Juan and José are two textile workers from Tarrasa, Catalonia (northeast to Spain) who meet during an UFOs'' convention. Both share their passion about the paranormal, specially about UFOs. In these years where was very much UFOs'' sightings, they feel captivated by the mystery and start to investigate the diverse theories about the intentions or purposes of the sightings. Their friendship and the obsession they have will turn in dementia and paranoia, hurting their relations with their respective friends and familiars and exposing their lives to an extreme decision due to the conclusion of their own investigations. Written by Chockys', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZOubpxPdlIZxx7udl6Pc2atQWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102508'),
  ('1116989919820662365', 'Platinum Blonde', 1931, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Capra, Joseph Walker, Charles C. Coleman', null, 'Jean Harlow, Robert Williams, Loretta Young, Halliwell Hobbes, Reginald Owen, Louise Closser Hale, Don Dillaway, Edmund Breese', 'NR', 'Ann Schuyler is an upper-crust socialite who bullies her reporter husband into conforming to her highfalutin ways. The husband chafes at the confinement of high society, though, and yearns for a creative outlet. He decides to write a play and collaborates with a fellow reporter.', 'Ann Schuyler is an upper-crust socialite who bullies her reporter husband into conforming to her highfalutin ways. The husband chafes at the confinement of high society, though, and yearns for a creative outlet. He decides to write a play and collaborates with a fellow reporter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlVEC1fvzW2bKKt6gXTON7LyNEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26884'),
  ('897512660643745585', 'Platinum Data', 2013, 'Mystery, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Keishi Otomo, Akira Sako, Yuji Shimomura', 'Hideya Hamada', 'Kazunari Ninomiya, Etsushi Toyokawa, Honami Suzuki, Katsuhisa Namase, Anne Watanabe, Kiko Mizuhara, Kaname Endo, Masato Hagiwara', null, 'Set in the year 2017, the Japanese government attempts to secretly control the DNA of its people. Ryuhei Kagura is a top scientist in the field of DNA analysis. He works at the DNA analysis institution run by the National Police Agency. When the inventor of the DNA analysis system is murdered, Ryuhei Kagura''s own DNA is found at the murder scene. Ryuhei Kagura becomes the prime suspect and then he becomes a fugitive. Veteran detective Reiji Asama goes in pursuit.', 'Set in the year 2017, the Japanese government attempts to secretly control the DNA of its people. Ryuhei Kagura is a top scientist in the field of DNA analysis. He works at the DNA analysis institution run by the National Police Agency. When the inventor of the DNA analysis system is murdered, Ryuhei Kagura''s own DNA is found at the murder scene. Ryuhei Kagura becomes the prime suspect and then he becomes a fugitive. Veteran detective Reiji Asama goes in pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ia5Aw5Wtzp1k7kbZYMC8TUPhFjD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208429'),
  ('995549834690992390', 'Plato''s Academy', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Filippos Tsitos, Polidefkis Kirlidis, Giorgos Zervas', 'Alexis Kardaras, Filippos Tsitos', 'Antonis Kafetzopoulos, Anastasias Kozdine, Titika Sarigouli, Giorgos Souxes, Kostas Koronaios, Panayotis Stamatakis, Maria Zorba', null, 'A Greek shopkeeper discovers something about his family''s past when his mother embraces an Albanian worker.', 'A Greek shopkeeper discovers something about his family''s past when his mother embraces an Albanian worker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A79zd0zY9N6Wqx5WkteBJTBGSW1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37590'),
  ('30142842223305854', 'Plato''s Run', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'James Becket', 'James Becket', 'Gary Busey, Roy Scheider, Steven Bauer, Jeff Speakman, Tiani Warden, Maggie Myatt, Horacio Le Don, Doug DeLuca', null, 'Hired to rescue escaped inmates, a Florida man is framed for a Cuban gangster''s assassination.', 'Hired to rescue escaped inmates, a Florida man is framed for a Cuban gangster''s assassination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxpJmAbAwvqWluMqL28a4RDoP4C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55670'),
  ('462408094381084624', 'Platonic Sex', 2001, 'Drama', 'Masako Matsuura, Takashi Inoue, Hiroshi Takase', 'Yoshiko Morishita', 'Saki Kagami, Joe Odagiri, Hiroshi Abe, Maho Nonami, Kenjirou Ishimaru, Toshie Negishi, Mantaro Koichi, Yoji Tanaka', null, 'When Aoi is gang-raped by her classmates and kicked out of her home by her own parents she sees no reason to continue living. Before she commits suicide, however, she receives an email on her cellphone from a man named Toshi addressed to a girl named Ai. The message simply thanks the girl for being alive, but this specific message has an effect on Aoi and she decides to keep on living. Without many options, Aoi resorts to everything from paid dating to porn to earn money and meets a lot of less than reputable characters. Throughout it all though she looks toward Toshi as her hope for happiness and the two form a relationship.', 'When Aoi is gang-raped by her classmates and kicked out of her home by her own parents she sees no reason to continue living. Before she commits suicide, however, she receives an email on her cellphone from a man named Toshi addressed to a girl named Ai. The message simply thanks the girl for being alive, but this specific message has an effect on Aoi and she decides to keep on living. Without many options, Aoi resorts to everything from paid dating to porn to earn money and meets a lot of less than reputable characters. Throughout it all though she looks toward Toshi as her hope for happiness and the two form a relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0btakophqUtfbea6psWNmdsjai.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39017'),
  ('223414435082165973', 'Platoon', 1986, 'Drama, War, Action', 'Robert Richardson, Oliver Stone, Gerry Toomey', 'Oliver Stone', 'Charlie Sheen, Willem Dafoe, Tom Berenger, Kevin Dillon, Forest Whitaker, Mark Moses, Keith David, Richard Edson', 'R', 'As a young and naive recruit in Vietnam, Chris Taylor faces a moral crisis when confronted with the horrors of war and the duality of man.', 'As a young and naive recruit in Vietnam, Chris Taylor faces a moral crisis when confronted with the horrors of war and the duality of man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3mmFkPQKvPZq5exmh0bDuXlD9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:792'),
  ('581625909379449232', 'Platoon Leader', 1988, 'Drama, War, Action', 'Aaron Norris, Arthur Wooster, Miguel Gil', 'David L. Walker, Rick Marx, Andrew Deutsch', 'Michael Dudikoff, Robert F. Lyons, Michael DeLorenzo, Jesse Dabson, Rick Fitts, Tony Pierce, Daniel Demorest, Brian Libby', 'R', 'West Point graduate lieutenant Jeff Knight meets cynicism when taking command of sergeant Michael McNamara''s tour veterans platoon in a Vietnamese trench camp. Unlike his predecessor, who hid till the end of his tour, Jeff takes charge, experiences the manual doesn''t allow coping with all realities and gets wounded. He returns, now fully respect by men and superiors. Besides the Vietcong, the platoon wrestles with the inscrutable villagers, which the G.I.''s officially protect, but also fear as some collaborate with them, other covertly with the Cong, either way subject to bloody reprisals.', 'West Point graduate lieutenant Jeff Knight meets cynicism when taking command of sergeant Michael McNamara''s tour veterans platoon in a Vietnamese trench camp. Unlike his predecessor, who hid till the end of his tour, Jeff takes charge, experiences the manual doesn''t allow coping with all realities and gets wounded. He returns, now fully respect by men and superiors. Besides the Vietcong, the platoon wrestles with the inscrutable villagers, which the G.I.''s officially protect, but also fear as some collaborate with them, other covertly with the Cong, either way subject to bloody reprisals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlvWj1I9W7wFD4s0D2QSWVvi1zE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48457'),
  ('543897457184371648', 'Play', 2005, 'Drama', 'Ricardo DeAngelis, Alicia Scherson, Rosario Onetto', 'Alicia Scherson', 'Viviana Herrera, Juan Pablo Quezada, Francisco Copello, Aline Küppenheim, Andrés Ulloa, Mateo Iribarren, Marcial Tagle, Alejandro Sieveking', null, 'A couple search for love but never quite seem to meet.', 'A couple search for love but never quite seem to meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyhSHBzmh1MbR1whkIYSokXhdFk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180526'),
  ('319814220367612931', 'Play', 2011, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ruben Östlund, Mattias Ek, Marius Dybwad Brandrud', 'Ruben Östlund, Erik Hemmendorff', 'Anas Abdirahman, Sebastian Blyckert, Yannick Diakité, Kevin Vaz, John Ortiz, Abdiaziz Hilowle, Sebastian Hegmar, Nana Manu', null, 'In central Gothenburg, Sweden, a group of boys, aged 12-14, robbed other children on about 40 occasions between 2006 and 2008. The thieves used an elaborate scheme called the ''little brother number'' or ''brother trick'', involving advanced role-play and gang rhetoric rather than physical violence.', 'In central Gothenburg, Sweden, a group of boys, aged 12-14, robbed other children on about 40 occasions between 2006 and 2008. The thieves used an elaborate scheme called the ''little brother number'' or ''brother trick'', involving advanced role-play and gang rhetoric rather than physical violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJWi0taJmU9WyPdIUVhShxISCFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85743'),
  ('43462745395126357', 'Play', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Marciano', 'Anthony Marciano', 'Max Boublil, Alice Isaaz, Malik Zidi, Arthur Périer, Noémie Lvovsky, Alain Chabat, Camille Lou, Alexandre Desrousseaux', null, 'In 1993, Max was 13 when he was offered his first camera. For 25 years he will not stop filming. The bunch of friends, the loves, the successes, the failures. From the 90s to the 2010s, it is the portrait of a whole generation that is emerging through its objective.', 'In 1993, Max was 13 when he was offered his first camera. For 25 years he will not stop filming. The bunch of friends, the loves, the successes, the failures. From the 90s to the 2010s, it is the portrait of a whole generation that is emerging through its objective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBJDYlzDnt0BcVzzusFvMI7RWDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547258'),
  ('404809523022934985', 'Play a Song for Me', 2009, 'Drama', 'Esmir Filho, Mauro Pinheiro Jr., Martín Grignaschi', 'Ismael Caneppele, Esmir Filho', 'Henrique Larré, Ismael Caneppele, Tuane Eggers, Samuel Reginatto, Áurea Baptista, Erna Lenhard, Ido Post, Adriana Seiffert', null, 'In a small town in the countryside in the south of Brazil, a teenager that uses the codename Mr. Tambourine Man spends his time in Internet, at school, smoking pot with his best friend Diego and with his dysfunctional mother. He dreams on leaving his hometown to watch a Bob Dylan''s show but seems to be hopeless stranded in the spot.', 'In a small town in the countryside in the south of Brazil, a teenager that uses the codename Mr. Tambourine Man spends his time in Internet, at school, smoking pot with his best friend Diego and with his dysfunctional mother. He dreams on leaving his hometown to watch a Bob Dylan''s show but seems to be hopeless stranded in the spot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKsJFFvXtogengrY9cWKYO0hmqp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73919'),
  ('546037913199619039', 'Play Dead', 1983, 'Horror', 'Peter Wittman', 'Lothrop W. Jordan', 'Yvonne De Carlo, Stephanie Dunnam, Ron Jackson, Glenn Kezer, David Ellzey, David Cullinane, Jo Livingston, Carolyn Greenwood', null, 'A woman uses her magic powers and a vicious Rotweiller dog to murder her relatives.', 'A woman uses her magic powers and a vicious Rotweiller dog to murder her relatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYzfmmJGCG1EIjgCBvc6KQuTNFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108563'),
  ('480317916041419226', 'Play Dead', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Patrick Lussier, Mac Fisken', 'Simon Boyes, Adam Mason', 'Bailee Madison, Jerry O''Connell, Anthony Turpel, Chris Butler, Chris Lee, Jorge-Luis Pallo, Sterling Beaumon, Josh Harp', 'R', 'Criminology student Chloe fakes her own death to break into a morgue, in order to retrieve a piece of evidence that ties her younger brother to a crime gone wrong. Once inside, she discovers that a sadistic coroner is using the corpses for his sick and twisted business, and when he realises that Chloe still has a pulse, a terrifying game of cat and mouse ensues.', 'Criminology student Chloe fakes her own death to break into a morgue, in order to retrieve a piece of evidence that ties her younger brother to a crime gone wrong. Once inside, she discovers that a sadistic coroner is using the corpses for his sick and twisted business, and when he realises that Chloe still has a pulse, a terrifying game of cat and mouse ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeiwFQzyMNp6JBwCfSspG5ZcoLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020696'),
  ('848738094868602466', 'Play Dead', 2025, 'Horror', 'Carlos Goitia', 'Gonzalo Mellid, Camilo Zaffora', 'Paula Brasca, Damián Del Castillo, Marta Quarleri, Milagros Ribet, Catalina Motto', null, 'A woman wakes up injured in a basement surrounded by corpses. To survive, she pretends to be dead while a grotesque ritual unfolds in the house above.', 'A woman wakes up injured in a basement surrounded by corpses. To survive, she pretends to be dead while a grotesque ritual unfolds in the house above.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixWeYfvXT9AbfM0QPb9kwbVLbLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1426297'),
  ('171217065488052780', 'Play Dirty', 1969, 'War, Adventure, Drama', 'André de Toth, Antonio Tarruella, Roger Good', 'André de Toth', 'Michael Caine, Nigel Davenport, Nigel Green, Harry Andrews, Patrick Jordan, Daniel Pilon, Bernard Archard, Aly Ben Ayed', 'R', 'During World War II in North Africa, a group of British commandos disguised as Italian soldiers must travel behind enemy lines and destroy a vital Nazi oil depot.', 'During World War II in North Africa, a group of British commandos disguised as Italian soldiers must travel behind enemy lines and destroy a vital Nazi oil depot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BkQ3aRlYQMqCLO943c0u1njscG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26652'),
  ('1105794878608163819', 'Play Dirty', 2025, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Shane Black, Ian Gracie, Philippe Rousselot', 'Shane Black, Anthony Bagarozzi, Charles Mondry', 'Mark Wahlberg, LaKeith Stanfield, Rosa Salazar, Keegan-Michael Key, Chukwudi Iwuji, Nat Wolff, Gretchen Mol, Thomas Jane', 'R', 'Expert thief Parker gets a shot at a major heist, but to pull it off he and his team must outsmart a South American dictator, the New York mob, and the world''s richest man.', 'Expert thief Parker gets a shot at a major heist, but to pull it off he and his team must outsmart a South American dictator, the New York mob, and the world''s richest man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovZ0zq0NwRghtWI1oLaM0lWuoEw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:941109'),
  ('453578035555946817', 'Play It Again, Charlie Brown', 1971, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Chris Inglis, Danny Hjeim, Pamelyn Ferdin, Stephen Shea, Lynda Mendelson, Hilary Momberger-Powers, Christopher DeFaria, Bill Melendez', null, 'Play It Again, Charlie Brown is the seventh prime-time animated TV special based upon the popular comic strip Peanuts, by Charles M. Schulz. This non-holiday Peanuts special centers on Lucy, her infatuation with Schroeder, and her willingness to do anything to win his affections.', 'Play It Again, Charlie Brown is the seventh prime-time animated TV special based upon the popular comic strip Peanuts, by Charles M. Schulz. This non-holiday Peanuts special centers on Lucy, her infatuation with Schroeder, and her willingness to do anything to win his affections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9U3eYAOb3BBuPCtN83rHzCAVcT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55443'),
  ('893648089843103736', 'Play It Again, Sam', 1972, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Owen Roizman, Herbert Ross, Charles Norton', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Diane Keaton, Tony Roberts, Jerry Lacy, Susan Anspach, Jennifer Salt, Joy Bang, Viva', 'PG', 'A neurotic film critic obsessed with the movie Casablanca attempts to get over his wife leaving him by dating again with the help of a married couple and his illusory idol, Humphrey Bogart.', 'A neurotic film critic obsessed with the movie Casablanca attempts to get over his wife leaving him by dating again with the help of a married couple and his illusory idol, Humphrey Bogart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZFz5rwrdVmEoHVkVU7EkZedDfz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11610'),
  ('951339461562532439', 'Play It as It Lays', 1972, 'Drama', 'Frank Perry, Jordan Cronenweth, Edward Teets', 'Joan Didion, John Gregory Dunne', 'Tuesday Weld, Anthony Perkins, Adam Roarke, Tammy Grimes, Ruth Ford, Eddie Firestone, Diana Ewing, Paul Lambert', 'R', 'Burned-out B-movie actress Maria, depressed and frustrated with her loveless marriage to an ambitious film director, Carter Lang, who would rather work on his career than on his relationship with her, numbs herself with drugs and sex with strangers. Only her friendship with a sensitive gay movie producer, B.Z., offers a semblance of solace. But even that relationship proves to be fleeting amidst the empty decadence of Hollywood.', 'Burned-out B-movie actress Maria, depressed and frustrated with her loveless marriage to an ambitious film director, Carter Lang, who would rather work on his career than on his relationship with her, numbs herself with drugs and sex with strangers. Only her friendship with a sensitive gay movie producer, B.Z., offers a semblance of solace. But even that relationship proves to be fleeting amidst the empty decadence of Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86XdjBK8FJJuTefGtGHzhTIYI0c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84796'),
  ('878373457266606701', 'Play It Like Godard', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Zaccaï, Bruno Degrave', 'Jonathan Zaccaï', 'Vincent Lacoste, Elsa Zylberstein, Aure Atika, Jonathan Zaccaï, Gilles Lellouche, Kad Merad, Élodie Hesme, Eric de Montalier', null, 'Jean-Christophe Kern, known as JC, is not a teenager like any other: he won the Palme d’Or at the age of 15, the Cesar at 16. This year, he is trying to graduate from high school.', 'Jean-Christophe Kern, known as JC, is not a teenager like any other: he won the Palme d’Or at the age of 15, the Cesar at 16. This year, he is trying to graduate from high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQGUE6bpG4XUBIljv48GbeeE1ba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116953'),
  ('749431502952409612', 'Play It to the Bone', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ron Shelton, Mark Vargo', 'Ron Shelton', 'Antonio Banderas, Woody Harrelson, Lolita Davidovich, Tom Sizemore, Lucy Liu, Robert Wagner, Richard Masur, Willie Garson', 'R', 'Two aging fighters in LA, friends, get a call from a Vegas promoter because his undercard fighters for a Mike Tyson bout that night are suddenly unavailable. He wants them to box each other. They agree as long as the winner gets a shot at the middleweight title. They enlist Grace, Cesar''s current and Vinnie''s ex girlfriend, to drive them to Vegas.', 'Two aging fighters in LA, friends, get a call from a Vegas promoter because his undercard fighters for a Mike Tyson bout that night are suddenly unavailable. He wants them to box each other. They agree as long as the winner gets a shot at the middleweight title. They enlist Grace, Cesar''s current and Vinnie''s ex girlfriend, to drive them to Vegas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSJl8pD17doJsAkou5mPvDogBQT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20761'),
  ('124058927510906381', 'Play Misty for Me', 1971, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bruce Surtees, Clint Eastwood, Bob Larson', 'Jo Heims, Dean Riesner', 'Clint Eastwood, Jessica Walter, Donna Mills, John Larch, Jack Ging, Irene Hervey, James McEachin, Clarice Taylor', 'R', 'A brief fling between a late-night radio disc jockey and an obsessed female fan takes a frightening turn when another woman enters the picture.', 'A brief fling between a late-night radio disc jockey and an obsessed female fan takes a frightening turn when another woman enters the picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1rdcRWJ9QAgS5lFkrZN9B6kaKf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15393'),
  ('928460089911291800', 'Play Motel', 1979, 'Crime, Thriller, Romance, Horror', 'Mario Gariazzo, Aldo Greci', 'Mario Gariazzo', 'Ray Lovelock, Anna Maria Rizzoli, Anthony Steffen, Antonella Antinori, Patrizia Webley, Enzo Fisichella, Mario Novelli, Marino Masé', null, 'The motel has a special room designed for sexual activities. It also has a habit of photographing sex act engines and extorting the parties concerned. One day a mysterious killer with black gloves up and the situation is changing.', 'The motel has a special room designed for sexual activities. It also has a habit of photographing sex act engines and extorting the parties concerned. One day a mysterious killer with black gloves up and the situation is changing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXfqkBXBl2tG3PrjRcAiw4N5iiq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104866'),
  ('202135490182358683', 'Play or Die', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jacques Kluger', 'Jacques Kluger, Amiel Bartana', 'Charley Palmer Rothwell, Roxane Mesquida, Laetitia Chambon, Helena Chambon, Marie Zabukovec, Thomas Mustin, Daphné Huynh, Hippolyte de Poucques', null, 'Welcome to Paranoia, the ultimate escape game. Rule #1: Nothing is real. Rule #2: One of you will die. Lucas and Chloe, two passionate gamers, decide to participate to Paranoia, a very exclusive escape game. After solving a first riddle, they make it to the location of the finale in an abandoned mental hospital, lost in a frightening forest. There, four other participants are waiting on them. They soon realize that only one of them will get out of there alive.', 'Welcome to Paranoia, the ultimate escape game. Rule #1: Nothing is real. Rule #2: One of you will die. Lucas and Chloe, two passionate gamers, decide to participate to Paranoia, a very exclusive escape game. After solving a first riddle, they make it to the location of the finale in an abandoned mental hospital, lost in a frightening forest. There, four other participants are waiting on them. They soon realize that only one of them will get out of there alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBT6UQX3qpNz9VAqk40CU5fOzJ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595216'),
  ('18467111322760507', 'Play the Game', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marc Fienberg, Gavin Kelly', 'Marc Fienberg', 'Paul Campbell, Andy Griffith, Doris Roberts, Liz Sheridan, Marla Sokoloff, Clint Howard, Rance Howard, Geoffrey Owens', 'PG-13', 'When ladies'' man David Mitchell (Paul Campbell) gives his lonely grandfather, Joe (Andy Griffith), some pointers on dating, Joe becomes a big hit with the women in his retirement community. But David strikes out with his own tricks when he tries to woo a girl named Julie (Marla Sokoloff). Now it''s up to Joe to teach his grandson how to win at love without playing games. Doris Roberts and Liz Sheridan co-star in this award-winning comedy.', 'When ladies'' man David Mitchell (Paul Campbell) gives his lonely grandfather, Joe (Andy Griffith), some pointers on dating, Joe becomes a big hit with the women in his retirement community. But David strikes out with his own tricks when he tries to woo a girl named Julie (Marla Sokoloff). Now it''s up to Joe to teach his grandson how to win at love without playing games. Doris Roberts and Liz Sheridan co-star in this award-winning comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48vqo9NZ6SyPohEepFiQNnYvnOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45708'),
  ('72661013304767255', 'Play While You Play', 1981, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Chen Kun-hou', 'Chiung Yao, Hou Hsiao-hsien', 'Fong Fei-fei, Kenny Bee, Anthony Chan Yau, Shih Ying, Chou Wan-Sheng, Ling Wu, Mei Fang, Yen Cheng-kuo', null, 'A photographer travels with her boyfriend to a seaside village in Penghu. There she strikes up a relationship with a blind man. When they reencounter one another back in Taipei, where he is preparing to undergo an operation to restore his sight, their connection intensifies.', 'A photographer travels with her boyfriend to a seaside village in Penghu. There she strikes up a relationship with a blind man. When they reencounter one another back in Taipei, where he is preparing to undergo an operation to restore his sight, their connection intensifies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqS643WQ7KxSLfGTQWWQfqBZqkP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87953'),
  ('578018297330186188', 'Playback', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'René Cardona Jr.', 'René Cardona Jr.', 'Sonia Infante, Humberto Zurita, Angela Alatriste, Christian Bach', null, 'A psychiatrist is brutally raped and takes her revenge in a bizarre game of cat and mouse.', 'A psychiatrist is brutally raped and takes her revenge in a bizarre game of cat and mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rM2wmlRvbkrTqOv5T6OmNr3V7VR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371780'),
  ('19657137762451649', 'Playback', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael A. Nickles', 'Michael A. Nickles', 'Johnny Pacar, Ambyr Childers, Christian Slater, Alessandra Torresani, Toby Hemingway, Lisa Jane Todd, Jennifer Missoni', 'R', 'While digging into their town''s infamous past, a group of high school students unwittingly unlock an even darker secret. Now, an evil spirit has been awakened and will stop at nothing to find his true heir.', 'While digging into their town''s infamous past, a group of high school students unwittingly unlock an even darker secret. Now, an evil spirit has been awakened and will stop at nothing to find his true heir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hkG8yiUasGSSayvqJ6MT4OWkn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84907'),
  ('80754017045245302', 'Playback', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Magalí Mérida, Luciano Giletta, Laura Perovich', 'Agustina Comedi', 'Marcos García, La Delpi, Martín Shanly, Marcos Caceres, Dana Colazo', null, 'In Córdoba, far from the Argentine capital, the end of a military regime promises a spring that is all too brief. “La Delpi” is the only survivor of a group of friends who are transgender women and drag-queens, who began to die of aids in the late 80s. In a Catholic and conservative city, the Grupo Kalas made their weapons and trenches out of improvised dresses and lip-syncing. Today the images of unique and unknown footage are not only a farewell letter, but a manifesto to friendship.', 'In Córdoba, far from the Argentine capital, the end of a military regime promises a spring that is all too brief. “La Delpi” is the only survivor of a group of friends who are transgender women and drag-queens, who began to die of aids in the late 80s. In a Catholic and conservative city, the Grupo Kalas made their weapons and trenches out of improvised dresses and lip-syncing. Today the images of unique and unknown footage are not only a farewell letter, but a manifesto to friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gflZpevVfSDnRdtLTFz8A7Hgbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647568'),
  ('970169025975896024', 'Playdate', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Fred Grivois', 'Fred Grivois, Nicolas Brigaud-Robert', 'Margot Bancilhon, Guillaume Gouix, Alysson Paradis, Hubert Delattre, Marceau Berber, Louka Peixoto-Verdou, Philippe Lebas, Kolia Abiteboul', null, 'Follows Sophie and Nicolas who move from the capital to start a new life, but when his son comes back from playing with their new neighbors'' son, they find he has some strange marks on his back and become suspicious of their neighbors.', 'Follows Sophie and Nicolas who move from the capital to start a new life, but when his son comes back from playing with their new neighbors'' son, they find he has some strange marks on his back and become suspicious of their neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UG6sSMfopwlc0L33uyDwVA6EHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920095'),
  ('713902757582594985', 'Playdate', 2025, 'Action, Comedy, Family', 'Luke Greenfield, Darran Tiernan, Brian Whittred', 'Neil Goldman', 'Alan Ritchson, Kevin James, Banks Pierce, Benjamin Pajak, Alan Tudyk, Sarah Chalke, Stephen Root, Isla Fisher', 'PG-13', 'When out-of-work accountant Brian joins stay-at-home dad Jeff for a playdate with their sons, he expects a laid-back afternoon. Instead, they''re chased by mercenaries, and Brian—totally unprepared—must survive one absurd obstacle after another.', 'When out-of-work accountant Brian joins stay-at-home dad Jeff for a playdate with their sons, he expects a laid-back afternoon. Instead, they''re chased by mercenaries, and Brian—totally unprepared—must survive one absurd obstacle after another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGodXWqJkkkbSebPIlxLSygV8GY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1248226'),
  ('1098970984292881746', 'Players', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Abbas Alibhai Burmawalla, Mustan Alibhai Burmawalla', 'Rohit Jugraj, Sudip Sharma', 'Abhishek Bachchan, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Bobby Deol, Neil Nitin Mukesh, Bipasha Basu, Omi Vaidya, Sikandar Kher, Vinod Khanna', null, 'Two professional robbers, an illusionist, an expert make-up artist, a gadget expert and a hacker come together to steal Romanian gold ingots while it is in transit.', 'Two professional robbers, an illusionist, an expert make-up artist, a gadget expert and a hacker come together to steal Romanian gold ingots while it is in transit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1EhvuG6PohOoW3qWbBD1rudYGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83382'),
  ('844027208878428795', 'Players', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Trish Sie, Matthew Clark', 'Whit Anderson', 'Gina Rodriguez, Damon Wayans Jr., Tom Ellis, Augustus Prew, Joel Courtney, Liza Koshy, Jerry Kernion, Ego Nwodim', 'R', 'New York sportswriter Mack has spent years devising successful hook-up "plays" with her friends, but when she unexpectedly falls for one of her targets, she must learn what it takes to go from simply scoring to playing for keeps.', 'New York sportswriter Mack has spent years devising successful hook-up "plays" with her friends, but when she unexpectedly falls for one of her targets, she must learn what it takes to go from simply scoring to playing for keeps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eA94hAGntLm7Lfol5FQJNxd53Hw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843617'),
  ('808073326550965808', 'Playful Pan', 1930, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, 'NR', 'The mythological satyr plays some tunes on his pipes and gets various flora and fauna dancing to them. Two clouds also dance; they bump into each other, causing lightning strikes that start a forest fire. The animals rush to escape the fire. Finally, an animal comes to tell Pan of the fire; he rushes to it, and gets it to dance to his tune, right into the lake.', 'The mythological satyr plays some tunes on his pipes and gets various flora and fauna dancing to them. Two clouds also dance; they bump into each other, causing lightning strikes that start a forest fire. The animals rush to escape the fire. Finally, an animal comes to tell Pan of the fire; he rushes to it, and gets it to dance to his tune, right into the lake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PzIkVgB7sMR2qL1Pl9MxMelSJS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56009'),
  ('618173522864035470', 'Playful Pluto', 1934, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig, Lee Millar', 'NR', 'Mickey''s trying to do some yardwork, but Pluto wants to play. They end up indoors; Mickey breaks a screen, spreads flypaper, and they both get stuck.', 'Mickey''s trying to do some yardwork, but Pluto wants to play. They end up indoors; Mickey breaks a screen, spreads flypaper, and they both get stuck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFrdQMex53zDFSneyZXJuJExiMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107524'),
  ('920270159367410678', 'Playful White Fingers', 1972, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tōru Murakawa, Toshitaka Takashima, Koji Okamoto', 'Tatsumi Kumashiro, Tōru Murakawa', 'Ichiro Araki, Hiroko Isayama, Hajime Tanimoto, Yoko Ishido, Hiroshi Gojo, Yoshio Adachi, Ichiro Kijima, Gō Awazu', null, 'A girl falls for a pickpocketer who gets arrested, so she hooks up with his ex-girlfriend and his ex-cellmate.', 'A girl falls for a pickpocketer who gets arrested, so she hooks up with his ex-girlfriend and his ex-cellmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNFKyqMLmrmFPEXS0mXRA55toya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233948'),
  ('1115581253679079080', 'Playgirl', 1954, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Joseph Pevney, Frank Shaw', 'Robert Blees', 'Shelley Winters, Barry Sullivan, Colleen Miller, Richard Long, Gregg Palmer, Kent Taylor, Jacqueline deWit, Dave Barry', 'NR', 'If you remember Shelley Winters from "The Poseidon Adventure" or "Bloody Mama," you might tend to forget what a knockout she was early in her career. This film will give you the chance to see her as a sexy nightclub singer teaching her just-in-from-the-sticks friend Colleen Miller the ropes in New York City. When Winters finds out that her married boyfriend Barry Sullivan has fallen for Miller, the recriminations...and bullets...start to fly!', 'If you remember Shelley Winters from "The Poseidon Adventure" or "Bloody Mama," you might tend to forget what a knockout she was early in her career. This film will give you the chance to see her as a sexy nightclub singer teaching her just-in-from-the-sticks friend Colleen Miller the ropes in New York City. When Winters finds out that her married boyfriend Barry Sullivan has fallen for Miller, the recriminations...and bullets...start to fly!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Loqqu3NUzpL1H1fA8ARrP6B1Hu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36520'),
  ('183972633734944088', 'Playground', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jean-François Ravagnan, Frédéric Noirhomme, Laura Wandel', 'Laura Wandel', 'Maya Vanderbeque, Günter Duret, Elsa Laforge, Lena Girard Voss, Simon Caudry, Thao Maerten, James Seguy, Naël Ammama', null, 'When Nora witnesses Abel being bullied by other kids, she rushes to protect him by warning their father. But Abel forces her to remain silent. Caught in a conflict of loyalty, Nora will ultimately try to find her place, torn between children''s and adult''s worlds.', 'When Nora witnesses Abel being bullied by other kids, she rushes to protect him by warning their father. But Abel forces her to remain silent. Caught in a conflict of loyalty, Nora will ultimately try to find her place, torn between children''s and adult''s worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTAfmBEaTYyPf3bre8hdIYiE3RB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785209'),
  ('299870178530187394', 'Playhouse', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Andy Toovey, Ian Smyth, Toby Watts', 'Toby Watts', 'William Holstead, Grace Courtney, Helen Mackay, James Rottger, Rebecca Calienda, Eilidh McLaughlin, Mathilde Darmady, Julie Higginson', null, 'Reckless Jack Travis is an irreverent horror writer notorious for scaring audiences. But as he obsesses over creating a new theatre show set in a haunted Scottish castle, demonic disturbances from deep within the walls begin to prey on his troubled daughter. When the alarming supernatural forces start to close in on him too, Jack is forced to reckon with the terrifying consequences of creating such a dark and macabre play. But will he realise the danger of unearthing a historic curse and stop writing before he damns himself, his personal sanity and those he loves forever?', 'Reckless Jack Travis is an irreverent horror writer notorious for scaring audiences. But as he obsesses over creating a new theatre show set in a haunted Scottish castle, demonic disturbances from deep within the walls begin to prey on his troubled daughter. When the alarming supernatural forces start to close in on him too, Jack is forced to reckon with the terrifying consequences of creating such a dark and macabre play. But will he realise the danger of unearthing a historic curse and stop writing before he damns himself, his personal sanity and those he loves forever?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1e6EJVJjRrhiU5BzK3LnzmbsMC0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728791'),
  ('426090657644834652', 'Playing', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Eduardo Coutinho, Jacques Cheuiche', 'Eduardo Coutinho', 'Eduardo Coutinho, Fernanda Torres, Marília Pêra, Andréa Beltrão, Aleta Gomes Vieira, Mary Sheila, Débora Almeida, Gisele Alves Moura', null, 'Following a newspaper ad, ordinary women tell part of their life stories to director Eduardo Coutinho, which are then re-enacted by actresses, blurring the barriers between truth, fiction and interpretation.', 'Following a newspaper ad, ordinary women tell part of their life stories to director Eduardo Coutinho, which are then re-enacted by actresses, blurring the barriers between truth, fiction and interpretation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abdJT8J5wRLwx7MBYj3OudLdU0Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86321'),
  ('764384797026761612', 'Playing Beatie Bow', 1986, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Donald Crombie, Geoffrey Simpson', 'Peter Gawler, Irwin Lane', 'Peter Phelps, Imogen Annesley, Mouche Phillips, Nikki Coghill, Moya O''Sullivan, Don Barker, Lyndel Rowe, Damian Janko', null, 'Abigail Kirk was an ordinary enough sixteen year old growing up in todays Sydney. An intriguing chain of events finds Abigail, through some eerie time shift, transported back one hundred years after watching some children playing a scary game called Beatie Bow.', 'Abigail Kirk was an ordinary enough sixteen year old growing up in todays Sydney. An intriguing chain of events finds Abigail, through some eerie time shift, transported back one hundred years after watching some children playing a scary game called Beatie Bow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olLyjIBJ95ti2rTi146AT5IpNps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16122'),
  ('192542213565687935', 'Playing by Heart', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Willard Carroll, Vilmos Zsigmond, Kelly Kiernan', 'Willard Carroll', 'Gillian Anderson, Ellen Burstyn, Sean Connery, Anthony Edwards, Angelina Jolie, Jay Mohr, Ryan Phillippe, Dennis Quaid', 'R', 'In a vibrant tapestry of love and longing, nine interconnected souls navigate romance and heartbreak in L.A., where passions collide and truths unfold, revealing that the heart''s desires often lead us where we least expect.', 'In a vibrant tapestry of love and longing, nine interconnected souls navigate romance and heartbreak in L.A., where passions collide and truths unfold, revealing that the heart''s desires often lead us where we least expect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3neHR1oPnC0OpcYhLn0TEdSHoEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:825'),
  ('669259795887176535', 'Playing Cards', 1896, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Gaston Méliès, Georges Méliès, Georgette Méliès, Octavie Huvier', null, 'Three friends are playing cards in a beer garden. One of them orders drinks. The waitress comes back with a bottle of wine and three glasses on a tray. The man serves his friends. They clink glasses and drink. Then the man asks for a newspaper. He reads a funny story in it and the three friends burst out laughing while the waitress merely smiles.', 'Three friends are playing cards in a beer garden. One of them orders drinks. The waitress comes back with a bottle of wine and three glasses on a tray. The man serves his friends. They clink glasses and drink. Then the man asks for a newspaper. He reads a funny story in it and the three friends burst out laughing while the waitress merely smiles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKoDwAu1aSzYE1I4NZVVembZDjP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104460'),
  ('1035002682982481859', 'Playing Cupid', 2021, 'Romance, TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'David Weaver, Mieke Verhelst', null, 'Laura Vandervoort, Nicholas Gonzalez, Mia Quaranta De La Rosa, Latonya Williams, Aria DeMaris, Shadan Saul, Georgie Daburas, Nolan Hupp', 'G', 'Set in the halls of Austen Middle School, a newly single middle-school teacher is covertly set up with a divorced dad after his daughter – one of her students – begins a matchmaking business for a school project she assigned her class.', 'Set in the halls of Austen Middle School, a newly single middle-school teacher is covertly set up with a divorced dad after his daughter – one of her students – begins a matchmaking business for a school project she assigned her class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6GBlAu8ifBGl69qyL8WpzVlo7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784379'),
  ('442055967985868922', 'Playing Dead', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Pascal Ridao, Jean-Paul Salomé', 'Jean-Paul Salomé', 'François Damiens, Géraldine Nakache, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Anne Le Ny, Nanou Garcia, Corentin Lobet, Judith Henry, Jean-Marie Winling', null, 'Jean, a forty-year-old struggling, out-of-work actor has hit rock bottom. Although open to any kind of work, he can''t get a break. At the unemployment office, his counselor has a rather odd proposal: he can get a job helping the police reconstruct crime scenes, by standing in for the dead victim. Jean''s obsession for detail impresses the detectives, allowing him to take a leading role in a sensitive investigation in Megève ski resort, during low season, after a series of murders', 'Jean, a forty-year-old struggling, out-of-work actor has hit rock bottom. Although open to any kind of work, he can''t get a break. At the unemployment office, his counselor has a rather odd proposal: he can get a job helping the police reconstruct crime scenes, by standing in for the dead victim. Jean''s obsession for detail impresses the detectives, allowing him to take a leading role in a sensitive investigation in Megève ski resort, during low season, after a series of murders', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXP7qAh51X339URqflp3qWmodnF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225719'),
  ('1148267154294620563', 'Playing Doctor', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Marco Petry, Jo Heim', 'Jan Ehlert, Marco Petry', 'Merlin Rose, Lisa Vicari, Max von der Groeben, Jannis Niewöhner, Christiane Paul, Oliver Korittke, Anna Böger, Ella-Maria Gollmer', null, 'Andi has had an inferiority complex since childhood and not only has to deal with it, but also with girls, feelings and genitalia in different sizes.', 'Andi has had an inferiority complex since childhood and not only has to deal with it, but also with girls, feelings and genitalia in different sizes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kB1roIe7E9RrrkN7lH2TGhMNyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323162'),
  ('165183101227800763', 'Playing for Keeps', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gabriele Muccino, Peter Menzies Jr.', 'Robbie Fox', 'Gerard Butler, Jessica Biel, Uma Thurman, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Iqbal Theba, Sean O''Bryan, Dennis Quaid, Judy Greer', 'PG-13', 'A former sports star who''s fallen on hard times starts coaching his son''s soccer team in an attempt to get his life together.', 'A former sports star who''s fallen on hard times starts coaching his son''s soccer team in an attempt to get his life together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYv6MqOoAIpxZd6ydJ4S5S2QHDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77875'),
  ('551423689673049611', 'Playing for Time', 1980, 'Drama, Music, History, TV Movie', 'Daniel Mann, Joseph Sargent, Arthur J. Ornitz', 'Arthur Miller', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Jane Alexander, Maud Adams, Christine Baranski, Robin Bartlett, Marisa Berenson, Verna Bloom, Donna Haley', null, 'When a Jewish songstress is plucked from the stage and sent to Auschwitz, she and other musicians find themselves assigned to a terrible task—using their talents to soothe fellow prisoners who are sentenced to die in the gas chambers.', 'When a Jewish songstress is plucked from the stage and sent to Auschwitz, she and other musicians find themselves assigned to a terrible task—using their talents to soothe fellow prisoners who are sentenced to die in the gas chambers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpUrgBytFwSempcJQvhBUgbRBnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51681'),
  ('717906142252722992', 'Playing God', 1997, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Anthony B. Richmond, Andy Wilson', 'Mark Haskell Smith', 'David Duchovny, Timothy Hutton, Angelina Jolie, Michael Massee, Stacey Travis, Bob Jennings, Peter Stormare, John Hawkes', 'R', 'Stripped of his medical license after performing an operation while high on amphetamines, famed LA surgeon Dr Eugene Sands abandons his former life only to find himself crossing paths with Raymond Blossom, an infamous counterfeiter. Employed as a "gun-shot doctor" when Raymond''s associates cannot risk visiting a hospital, Eugene is lured deep into the criminal world and becomes entangled with his boss''s girlfriend.', 'Stripped of his medical license after performing an operation while high on amphetamines, famed LA surgeon Dr Eugene Sands abandons his former life only to find himself crossing paths with Raymond Blossom, an infamous counterfeiter. Employed as a "gun-shot doctor" when Raymond''s associates cannot risk visiting a hospital, Eugene is lured deep into the criminal world and becomes entangled with his boss''s girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faYRZjtBMNygM7spt72yrs72hC8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12628'),
  ('1067876317442457766', 'Playing God', 2020, 'Drama', 'Lars Kraume', 'Ferdinand von Schirach, Lars Kraume', 'Barbara Auer, Lars Eidinger, Matthias Habich, Ulrich Matthes, Anna Maria Mühe, Christiane Paul, Götz Schubert, Ina Weisse', null, 'The 78-year-old former architect Richard Gärtner (Matthias Habich) wants to put an end to his life. However, this should not be done abroad, but quite legally with the help of his family doctor. For Dr. Brandt (Anna Maria Mühe), out of personal conviction, it is out of the question to get her elderly but healthy patient a fatal preparation.', 'The 78-year-old former architect Richard Gärtner (Matthias Habich) wants to put an end to his life. However, this should not be done abroad, but quite legally with the help of his family doctor. For Dr. Brandt (Anna Maria Mühe), out of personal conviction, it is out of the question to get her elderly but healthy patient a fatal preparation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PIE7HFOwoyj3SZ3UaCE6KdlucX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759930'),
  ('1090968345308951151', 'Playing God', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Scott Brignac', 'Scott Brignac', 'Luke Benward, Hannah Kasulka, Michael McKean, Alan Tudyk, Jude Demorest, Marc Menchaca, Leighton B. Allen, Raoul Canoli', null, 'A brother and sister con-artist duo find themselves scamming a grieving billionaire by convincing him they can introduce him to God, face-to-face.', 'A brother and sister con-artist duo find themselves scamming a grieving billionaire by convincing him they can introduce him to God, face-to-face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eXtK7BQMAYVktjVf78s0scMTdX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717693'),
  ('235542183608517906', 'Playing God', 2024, 'Animation, Horror, Drama', 'Matteo Burani, Guglielmo Trautvetter, Christine Seznec', 'Gianmarco Valentino, Matteo Burani', 'Edoardo Nanni, Pier Danio Forni', null, 'Fragile clay Sculptures come to life in a bare workshop, craving more than just existence. When their Sculptor abandons them, they must discover the power of belonging.', 'Fragile clay Sculptures come to life in a bare workshop, craving more than just existence. When their Sculptor abandons them, they must discover the power of belonging.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzhMGv1UfEbh7YgqBu8s2ryPBaw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1320467'),
  ('787142660237633995', 'Playing in the Park', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Josefina Barrera Fuentes, Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes', null, null, null, 'This 1929 home movie, shot by longtime Corpus Christi resident Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, may well represent some of the earliest produced by a Mexican-American filmmaker about the Mexican-American community in Texas. In the footage, Fuentes captures his wife Josefina and four of their children playing in a park in Corpus Christi. Josefina also takes a turn behind the camera to document her husband with the children.', 'This 1929 home movie, shot by longtime Corpus Christi resident Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, may well represent some of the earliest produced by a Mexican-American filmmaker about the Mexican-American community in Texas. In the footage, Fuentes captures his wife Josefina and four of their children playing in a park in Corpus Christi. Josefina also takes a turn behind the camera to document her husband with the children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Af4YVMThSKe4Bnk2N9Dhacs2FBA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496543'),
  ('1086049451480576516', 'Playing It Cool', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Justin Reardon, Rod Smith, Jeff Cutter', 'Chris Shafer, Paul Vicknair', 'Chris Evans, Michelle Monaghan, Topher Grace, Aubrey Plaza, Luke Wilson, Martin Starr, Anthony Mackie, Ioan Gruffudd', 'R', 'A young man meets and instantly falls in love with an engaged woman.', 'A young man meets and instantly falls in love with an engaged woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96htqghZlKctNJqDLo2DuC9PEap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277547'),
  ('483766380319769511', 'Playing the Field', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Sergio D''Offizi, Giorgio Gentili, Luigi Filippo D''Amico', 'Sandro Continenza, Luigi Filippo D''Amico, Giulio Scarnicci', 'Lando Buzzanca, Gabriella Pallotta, Massimo Mollica, Joan Collins, Marisa Solinas, Nello Pazzafini, Ignazio Leone, Dino Curcio', null, 'A small-time soccer referee gets the chance of a lifetime when he gets to referee a major-league game. He becomes a celebrity and suddenly finds himself having to choose between his future as a referee and the temptations that come his way, especially the women, now.', 'A small-time soccer referee gets the chance of a lifetime when he gets to referee a major-league game. He becomes a celebrity and suddenly finds himself having to choose between his future as a referee and the temptations that come his way, especially the women, now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zQWKhgb2g1nIMgPqP8fQpsl3pc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257816'),
  ('251305463008972937', 'Playing the Ponies', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Charles Lamont', 'Elwood Ullman, Charlie Melson, Al Giebler', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Billy Bletcher, William Irving, Charles Dorety, Sam Lufkin, Jack ''Tiny'' Lipson', 'NR', 'The stooges are gypped into trading their restaurant for "Thunderbolt", a washed up race horse. When Curly feeds Thunderbolt some chili pepperinos, he runs like crazy towards the nearest water. The boys enter Thunderbolt in a big race. With jockey Larry feeding Thunderbolt the pepperinos, and Moe and Curly on a motorcycle leading him with a bucket of water, they win the race.', 'The stooges are gypped into trading their restaurant for "Thunderbolt", a washed up race horse. When Curly feeds Thunderbolt some chili pepperinos, he runs like crazy towards the nearest water. The boys enter Thunderbolt in a big race. With jockey Larry feeding Thunderbolt the pepperinos, and Moe and Curly on a motorcycle leading him with a bucket of water, they win the race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6wPzpH3wSGVdvqjF0PSpkT5vqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115907'),
  ('1127564783875456374', 'Playing the Victim', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kirill Serebrennikov, Daler Khasanov, Tatyana Komarova', 'Oleg Presnyakov, Vladimir Presnyakov', 'Yuriy Chursin, Vitaliy Khaev, Aleksandr Ilyin Jr, Marat Basharov, Olga Demidova, Anna Mikhalkova, Fyodor Dobronravov, Marina Golub', null, 'A young man drops out of university and goes to the police. He''s done nothing wrong he just wants a job. A particular job. Playing the victim in murder reconstructions. Maybe by getting close to death he can manage to cheat on his own.', 'A young man drops out of university and goes to the police. He''s done nothing wrong he just wants a job. A particular job. Playing the victim in murder reconstructions. Maybe by getting close to death he can manage to cheat on his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmeKDPvieULQZecpRBeToxQB4qk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64484'),
  ('331574636797286381', 'Playing with Fire', 1975, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet, Yves Lafaye, Luc Béraud', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Philippe Noiret, Anicée Alvina, Sylvia Kristel, Agostina Belli, Serge Marquand, Charles Millot, Vernon Dobtcheff', null, 'A banker hires a seedy detective to find his daughter and keep her safe from kidnappers.', 'A banker hires a seedy detective to find his daughter and keep her safe from kidnappers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aJKdzZxwvcZqTUv7Bai6zKKmSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64557'),
  ('127724230467530840', 'Playing with Fire', 2019, 'Family, Comedy', 'Lisa Van Velden, Andy Fickman, Rich Delia', 'Matt Lieberman, Dan Ewen', 'John Cena, Keegan-Michael Key, John Leguizamo, Tyler Mane, Brianna Hildebrand, Christian Convery, Finley Rose Slater, Judy Greer', 'PG', 'A crew of rugged firefighters meet their match when attempting to rescue three rambunctious kids.', 'A crew of rugged firefighters meet their match when attempting to rescue three rambunctious kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBLPIpReSatt1zcgVzSVzq5e581.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554241'),
  ('1076483998088764662', 'Playing with Giants', 1991, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sayed Ameen, Saeed Hamed, Mohsen Nasr', 'Wahid Hamid', 'Adel Emam, Hussein Fahmy, Aaidah Riyadh, Mahmoud El Gendy, Gamal Ismail, Mohamed El Sawy, Mustafa Metwalli, Hanem Mohamed', null, 'When Hassan Bahlal, a young unemployed man, calls the National Security Agency to report a fire that is to break out in a factory the next day, a new chapter in Hassan''s life begins as he tells the officer he has foreseen the incident in a dream.', 'When Hassan Bahlal, a young unemployed man, calls the National Security Agency to report a fire that is to break out in a factory the next day, a new chapter in Hassan''s life begins as he tells the officer he has foreseen the incident in a dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFrI68Md1InTADwKmlVEtGF4gIW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372048'),
  ('953837363121381583', 'Playing with Love', 1977, 'Drama', 'Pier Giuseppe Murgia, Anita Rakosi', 'Peter Berling, Pier Giuseppe Murgia', 'Lara Wendel, Éva Ionesco, Martin Loeb', 'R', 'Laura and Fabrizio have been meeting every summer in the forest by her parent''s summer home. Fabrizio is a solitary boy with only his dog for company; Laura a sweet but unconfident child. This summer new aspects enter into their story as both are growing up. Laura is falling in love with Fabrizio, while he displays a new sexual awareness of her masked by his malice. Things develop further when they meet Sylvia who, unlike the innocent Laura, is confident and assertive. Fabrizio develops a fascination with her, eventually bribing Laura to fetch her to the forest to join them in play.', 'Laura and Fabrizio have been meeting every summer in the forest by her parent''s summer home. Fabrizio is a solitary boy with only his dog for company; Laura a sweet but unconfident child. This summer new aspects enter into their story as both are growing up. Laura is falling in love with Fabrizio, while he displays a new sexual awareness of her masked by his malice. Things develop further when they meet Sylvia who, unlike the innocent Laura, is confident and assertive. Fabrizio develops a fascination with her, eventually bribing Laura to fetch her to the forest to join them in play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nu5uj47KSF73VPEiIRYdPLJ96j7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46853'),
  ('1128166579044310180', 'Playlist', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Julie Conte, Nine Antico', 'Nine Antico, Marc Syrigas', 'Sara Forestier, Laetitia Dosch, Andranic Manet, Inas Chanti, Pierre Lottin, Grégoire Colin, Jackie Berroyer, Bertrand Belin', null, 'Sophie, 28, just found out she landed that job at a famous Parisian publisher. Her dream? Not exactly: she would rather see her own graphic work printed… When she tells her boyfriend Jean she is pregnant, everything explodes. They break up and she must return to waiting tables like her friend Julia, an aspiring actress. How can one survive in the city under such conditions?', 'Sophie, 28, just found out she landed that job at a famous Parisian publisher. Her dream? Not exactly: she would rather see her own graphic work printed… When she tells her boyfriend Jean she is pregnant, everything explodes. They break up and she must return to waiting tables like her friend Julia, an aspiring actress. How can one survive in the city under such conditions?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22hzlozbPeEYZb56BVSZIPrnitH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655369'),
  ('1126583482503681681', 'Playmaker', 1994, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Ross Berryman, Yuri Zeltser, Karen E. Frischmann', 'Yuri Zeltser', 'Jennifer Rubin, John Getz, Colin Firth, Jeff Perry, Arthur Taxier, Dean Norris, Belinda Waymouth, Diane Robin', null, 'A would-be actress uncovers horrifying files on other starlets.', 'A would-be actress uncovers horrifying files on other starlets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZB0RdhpuiGmtd4RnnV03p3oDyA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404557'),
