  ('755559438660046256', 'Playtime', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Lúcia Murat, Bacco Andrade', 'Lúcia Murat', 'Brenda Viveiros, Gustavo Veiga, Renan Dionata, Dandara Mello, Raquel Martins', null, 'Brazilian teens navigate complex social issues in their daily lives. The film blends real and fictional elements to explore violence, racism, and drug-related challenges faced by students aged 14-19 during their school experiences.', 'Brazilian teens navigate complex social issues in their daily lives. The film blends real and fictional elements to explore violence, racism, and drug-related challenges faced by students aged 14-19 during their school experiences.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F9XnyCcjh7KHF0GxpVghb7NHydHF.jpg', 'plex:movie:playtime-2026'),
  ('270059694975188238', 'Plaza Catedral', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Abner Benaim, Lorenzo Hagerman', 'Abner Benaim', 'Ilse Salas, Fernando Xavier De Casta, Manolo Cardona, Marcos Bernal Lopez, Luan Sampo Valdés, Elsa Fajardo, Abner Benaim, Nick Romano', null, 'Alicia is a 42-year-old-woman whose grief has caused her estrangement from society. Her world is turned upside down when 14-year-old Chief, a young boy who looks after people’s cars, stumbles into her house, bleeding.', 'Alicia is a 42-year-old-woman whose grief has caused her estrangement from society. Her world is turned upside down when 14-year-old Chief, a young boy who looks after people’s cars, stumbles into her house, bleeding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHiShU5amL19kwcRhyGbBBSWEKv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833427'),
  ('265277087737533421', 'Plaza Suite', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Arthur Hiller, Jack A. Marta', 'Neil Simon', 'Walter Matthau, Maureen Stapleton, Barbara Harris, Lee Grant, Louise Sorel, Dan Ferrone, Jose Ocasio, Thomas Carey', 'PG', 'Film version of the Neil Simon play has three separate acts set in the same hotel suite in New York''s Plaza Hotel with Walter Matthau in a triple role. In the first, Karen Nash tries to get her inattentive husband Sam''s attention and help save their failing marriage. In the second, brash film producer Jesse Kiplinger tries to seduce his former one-time flame Muriel. In the third, Roy Hubley and his wife Norma try and persuade their daughter, a bride to-be with cold feet, out of the bathroom before her approaching wedding ceremony.', 'Film version of the Neil Simon play has three separate acts set in the same hotel suite in New York''s Plaza Hotel with Walter Matthau in a triple role. In the first, Karen Nash tries to get her inattentive husband Sam''s attention and help save their failing marriage. In the second, brash film producer Jesse Kiplinger tries to seduce his former one-time flame Muriel. In the third, Roy Hubley and his wife Norma try and persuade their daughter, a bride to-be with cold feet, out of the bathroom before her approaching wedding ceremony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZ5eDobhO60wK4snbX6vtlz0Agh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42514'),
