  ('251106349278728727', 'Pledge This!', 2007, 'Comedy', 'William Heins, Fortunato Procopio, Strathford Hamilton', 'Cheryl Guerriero, Anna Obropta', 'Paris Hilton, Paula Garcés, Sarah Carter, Simon Rex, Geoffrey Arend, Alexis Thorpe, Bianca Lawson, Kerri Kenney', 'R', 'At popular South Beach University, filthy rich super-snob Victoria English is the absolute queen of leading Greek student club, Sigma Sigma. In order to achieve her crowning ambition, winning FHM Magazine''s annual best sorority, she must recruit atypical ''Sigmies'' to fulfill the diversity criteria. Ambitious sycophant pledge Kristen Haas helps her attract ''losers'' (too poor, ugly, unfashionable), who are cruelly put through excruciating hazing, without intent to actually enroll them. Gloria, the brightest and most assertive pledge, wins the heart of Derek ''baby Dick'', Victoria''s ideal, yet constantly abused boyfriend, whose bitch-addiction is cured by this alternative lover. Together they lead the revolt of the not-even-nerds.', 'At popular South Beach University, filthy rich super-snob Victoria English is the absolute queen of leading Greek student club, Sigma Sigma. In order to achieve her crowning ambition, winning FHM Magazine''s annual best sorority, she must recruit atypical ''Sigmies'' to fulfill the diversity criteria. Ambitious sycophant pledge Kristen Haas helps her attract ''losers'' (too poor, ugly, unfashionable), who are cruelly put through excruciating hazing, without intent to actually enroll them. Gloria, the brightest and most assertive pledge, wins the heart of Derek ''baby Dick'', Victoria''s ideal, yet constantly abused boyfriend, whose bitch-addiction is cured by this alternative lover. Together they lead the revolt of the not-even-nerds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3wkX38lNtjlz3R8XuKmJQIad8I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19213'),
  ('382348827498832268', 'Plenilune', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Imanol Uribe, Gonzalo F. Berridi', 'Elvira Lindo', 'Miguel Ángel Solá, Adriana Ozores, Juan Diego Botto, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Charo López, Chete Lera, María Galiana, Noelia Ortega', null, 'Romance and murder walk side by side in this psychological drama from Spain. A serial killer has been plying his grisly trade in a small town in Spain, murdering young girls and leaving their bodies in a nearby forest.', 'Romance and murder walk side by side in this psychological drama from Spain. A serial killer has been plying his grisly trade in a small town in Spain, murdering young girls and leaving their bodies in a nearby forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aicEbnD7EHFhM00411Al7oIOciO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71795'),
  ('971855086369388840', 'Plenty', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fred Schepisi, Ian Baker, Ken Shane', 'David Hare', 'Meryl Streep, Tracey Ullman, John Gielgud, Sting, Ian McKellen, Sam Neill, Burt Kwouk, Charles Dance', 'R', 'David Hare''s account of a one-time French freedom fighter who gradually realizes that her post-war life is not meeting her expectations.', 'David Hare''s account of a one-time French freedom fighter who gradually realizes that her post-war life is not meeting her expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x45XteYF8kw1GvwHWgJ2Kizyfnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41166'),
  ('840651350255482526', 'Ploey: You Never Fly Alone', 2018, 'Animation, Family', 'Árni Ólafur Ásgeirsson', 'Friðrik Erlingsson', 'Jamie Oram, Harriet Perring, Richard Cotton, Sean Astin, John Stamos, Debbie Chazen, Georgina Sutcliffe, Colin Mace', 'G', 'A plover chick has not learned to fly when his family migrates in the fall. He must survive the arctic winter, vicious enemies and himself in order to be reunited with his beloved one next spring.', 'A plover chick has not learned to fly when his family migrates in the fall. He must survive the arctic winter, vicious enemies and himself in order to be reunited with his beloved one next spring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQIKecVvsEEexALNuyPj9q4JmSN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506596'),
  ('787958142009544090', 'Plop Goes the Weasel!', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A lip-smacking weasel invades the barnyard of Foghorn Leghorn and his usual canine foe, and Foghorn is quite willing to put baby chicks in danger of being taken by the weasel so long as it makes the dog appear to be failing his job of guarding the chicks.', 'A lip-smacking weasel invades the barnyard of Foghorn Leghorn and his usual canine foe, and Foghorn is quite willing to put baby chicks in danger of being taken by the weasel so long as it makes the dog appear to be failing his job of guarding the chicks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7PhlgmaOB4orL5nBIL73Hq4LSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235817'),
  ('625087287921630861', 'Plot 35', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Éric Caravaca', 'Arnaud Cathrine, Éric Caravaca', null, null, 'Plot 35 is a place that was never mentioned in my family; it is where my elder sister, who died aged three, is buried. The sister about whom I was told nothing, or nearly nothing, and of whom my parents had oddly never kept a single photograph. It was to make up for the missing images that I decided to make this film. Thinking that I would simply chronicle a forgotten life, in fact I opened up the hidden door to a past that I was unaware of, to the subconscious memory that lies inside each of us and who makes us what we are.', 'Plot 35 is a place that was never mentioned in my family; it is where my elder sister, who died aged three, is buried. The sister about whom I was told nothing, or nearly nothing, and of whom my parents had oddly never kept a single photograph. It was to make up for the missing images that I decided to make this film. Thinking that I would simply chronicle a forgotten life, in fact I opened up the hidden door to a past that I was unaware of, to the subconscious memory that lies inside each of us and who makes us what we are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDbiMSLUkxKbGQJgQmkIJ8DEffJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455588'),
  ('525528375971424714', 'Plot of Fear', 1976, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Paolo Cavara, Roberto Palmerini, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Bernardino Zapponi', 'Corinne Cléry, Michele Placido, Quinto Parmeggiani, Edoardo Faieta, John Steiner, Jacques Herlin, Cecilia Polizzi, Greta Vayan', null, 'Plot of Fear tells the story of a decadent weekend party full of orgies and drugs on the outskirts of Milan. Inspector Lomenzo investigates a series of bizarre murders, each linked by the fact that pages from the German children’s book "Shock-Headed Peter" have been left at the scene of the crime. As the bodies pile up, Lomenzo is guided by a model and a surveillance expert to a decadent club frequented by the rich and powerful.', 'Plot of Fear tells the story of a decadent weekend party full of orgies and drugs on the outskirts of Milan. Inspector Lomenzo investigates a series of bizarre murders, each linked by the fact that pages from the German children’s book "Shock-Headed Peter" have been left at the scene of the crime. As the bodies pile up, Lomenzo is guided by a model and a surveillance expert to a decadent club frequented by the rich and powerful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7nnndNe8cIQRsHMrv4YHn1KxI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63112'),
  ('900429838693706966', 'Plötzlich fett', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Holger Haase', 'Sarah Schnier', 'Diana Amft, Sebastian Ströbel, Michou Friesz, Sigrid Spörk, Ludwig Kaschke, Wolfram Berger, Cornelius Obonya, Susanna Wiegand', null, 'Self-confessed body fetishist Nick hates fat people. He puts his heart and soul into his job as the manager of a fitness temple. The lavishly endowed Eva, on the other hand, is a pastry chef in a hotel on the roof of which Nick''s studio is located. A body-swap comedy for which Diana Amft and Sebastian Ströbel don fatsuits.', 'Self-confessed body fetishist Nick hates fat people. He puts his heart and soul into his job as the manager of a fitness temple. The lavishly endowed Eva, on the other hand, is a pastry chef in a hotel on the roof of which Nick''s studio is located. A body-swap comedy for which Diana Amft and Sebastian Ströbel don fatsuits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fPrwYyj1YeSWPRfNADX065U9OG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75008'),
