  ('455217220455446565', 'Plughead Rewired: Circuitry Man II', 1994, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Robert Lovy, Steven Lovy', 'Robert Lovy, Steven Lovy', 'Vernon Wells, Deborah Shelton, Jim Metzler, Dennis Christopher, Nicholas Worth, Traci Lords, Paul Willson, Andy Goldberg', null, 'In the backdrop of Earths polluted future a female FBI agent removes Danner, a pleasure android from an asylum in order to coerce him into helping her hunt down the criminal psychopath Plughead. But Plughead who has tangled with Danner before has his own plans as he is forcing a female scientist to help him manufacture life extending longevity chips which he intends to sell to rich and powerful clients.', 'In the backdrop of Earths polluted future a female FBI agent removes Danner, a pleasure android from an asylum in order to coerce him into helping her hunt down the criminal psychopath Plughead. But Plughead who has tangled with Danner before has his own plans as he is forcing a female scientist to help him manufacture life extending longevity chips which he intends to sell to rich and powerful clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rusQK7oM5QfuRl8dhaJBRq8BG0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30656'),
