  ('1089297468536872176', 'Plumbum, or The Dangerous Game', 1987, 'Drama', 'Vadim Abdrashitov, Lyudmila Gabelaya, Vladimir Kuchinsky', 'Aleksandr Mindadze', 'Anton Androsov, Yelena Dmitriyeva, Elena Yakovleva, Zoya Lirova, Aleksandr Feklistov, Vladimir Steklov, Aleksandr Pashutin, Aleksey Zaytsev', null, 'Fifteen year old gifted teenager Ruslan Chutko longs to do good and help the police to identify offenses under the pseudonym Plumbum. Plumbum decides in a single provincial town to eradicate the evil. However, in his interest of being a fighter against evil he goes far beyond what is permitted in a children''s play and ends up ruthlessly invading people''s lives.', 'Fifteen year old gifted teenager Ruslan Chutko longs to do good and help the police to identify offenses under the pseudonym Plumbum. Plumbum decides in a single provincial town to eradicate the evil. However, in his interest of being a fighter against evil he goes far beyond what is permitted in a children''s play and ends up ruthlessly invading people''s lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faGtP6bZa1xWlON2tVwgw59IoTW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204039'),
  ('361666669100624237', 'Plump Fiction', 1997, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Bob Koherr, Rex Nicholson, Greg Webb', 'Bob Koherr', 'Tommy Davidson, Julie Brown, Paul Dinello, Sandra Bernhard, Colleen Camp, Dan Castellaneta, Robert Costanzo, Matthew Glave', null, 'Four stories intersect in this violent film parody. Exterminators dress as hit men and try to protect the wife of their boss, Montello. Meanwhile, the strippers at Montello''s strip club, dressed as nuns, attempt to rob him. Tag-team wrestlers steal Montello''s briefcase, thinking its contents are valuable. Finally, Bumpkin, running to deliver a script, loses a lot of the pages.', 'Four stories intersect in this violent film parody. Exterminators dress as hit men and try to protect the wife of their boss, Montello. Meanwhile, the strippers at Montello''s strip club, dressed as nuns, attempt to rob him. Tag-team wrestlers steal Montello''s briefcase, thinking its contents are valuable. Finally, Bumpkin, running to deliver a script, loses a lot of the pages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVpAdZmLjgLI6onq2UDdLvg4lrs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39411'),
  ('212963780045476913', 'Plunder of the Sun', 1953, 'Adventure, Mystery, Drama', 'John Farrow', 'Jonathan Latimer', 'Glenn Ford, Diana Lynn, Patricia Medina, Francis L. Sullivan, Sean McClory, Eduardo Noriega, Julio Villarreal, Charles Rooner', 'NR', 'An American insurance adjuster, stranded in Havana, becomes involved with an archaeologist and a collector of antiquities in a hunt for treasure in the Mexican ruins of Zapoteca.', 'An American insurance adjuster, stranded in Havana, becomes involved with an archaeologist and a collector of antiquities in a hunt for treasure in the Mexican ruins of Zapoteca.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hT2k23ekVZYeYga404KDfLGZOR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76258'),
  ('378179990230856751', 'Plunder Road', 1957, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hubert Cornfield, Nat Merman, Louis Brandt', 'Steven Ritch', 'Gene Raymond, Jeanne Cooper, Wayne Morris, Elisha Cook Jr., Stafford Repp, Steven Ritch, Harry Tyler, Helene Heigh', 'NR', 'A spectacular heist starts to unravel as the crooks take it on the lam.', 'A spectacular heist starts to unravel as the crooks take it on the lam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zm4RBWwImlnUctZmwDKjPHDnz14.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36521'),
  ('132487288825988218', 'Plunkett & Macleane', 1999, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Jake Scott, John Mathieson, Euan Keddie', 'Robert Wade, Neal Purvis, Charles McKeown', 'Jonny Lee Miller, Robert Carlyle, Liv Tyler, Ken Stott, Michael Gambon, Alan Cumming, Alexander Armstrong, Ben Miller', 'R', 'Will Plunkett and Captain James Macleane, two men from different ends of the social spectrum in 18th-century England, enter a gentlemen''s agreement: They decide to rid the aristocrats of their belongings. With Plunkett''s criminal know-how and Macleane''s social connections, they team up to be soon known as "The Gentlemen Highwaymen". But when one day these gentlemen hold up Lord Chief Justice Gibson''s coach, Macleane instantly falls in love with his beautiful and cunning niece, Lady Rebecca Gibson. Unfortunately, Thief Taker General Chance, who also is quite fond of Rebecca, is getting closer and closer to getting both.', 'Will Plunkett and Captain James Macleane, two men from different ends of the social spectrum in 18th-century England, enter a gentlemen''s agreement: They decide to rid the aristocrats of their belongings. With Plunkett''s criminal know-how and Macleane''s social connections, they team up to be soon known as "The Gentlemen Highwaymen". But when one day these gentlemen hold up Lord Chief Justice Gibson''s coach, Macleane instantly falls in love with his beautiful and cunning niece, Lady Rebecca Gibson. Unfortunately, Thief Taker General Chance, who also is quite fond of Rebecca, is getting closer and closer to getting both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LASEwSyW2h7Zql0t1ksURC70MG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10381'),
  ('41291131203948637', 'Plus beau que moi tu meurs', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Clair, Didier Tarot, Mario Vulpiani', 'Bruno Tardon, Philippe Clair', 'Aldo Maccione, Philippe Clair, Raymond Pellegrin, Philippe Castelli, Florence Guérin, Ira von Fürstenberg, Philippe Nicaud, Maureen Kerwin', null, 'Aldo and Marco are twins. Marco, a priest by trade, has always been an object of pride for his mother, while Aldo has already spent six periods in prison. Always on the lookout for money and pretty girls, he lets himself be hijacked by crazy, often dishonest operations, which fail most of the time. One day, he is forced to flee to Tunisia, dressed as a priest and posing as Marco. There he meets up with Prosper, a childhood friend, whom he lures into his race for millions and beautiful summer girls. Marco, delegated by the Paris police, arrives in Tunisia to limit the damage, but only makes it worse. Once again, Aldo has to disappear into the wilderness for a while and make himself forgotten...', 'Aldo and Marco are twins. Marco, a priest by trade, has always been an object of pride for his mother, while Aldo has already spent six periods in prison. Always on the lookout for money and pretty girls, he lets himself be hijacked by crazy, often dishonest operations, which fail most of the time. One day, he is forced to flee to Tunisia, dressed as a priest and posing as Marco. There he meets up with Prosper, a childhood friend, whom he lures into his race for millions and beautiful summer girls. Marco, delegated by the Paris police, arrives in Tunisia to limit the damage, but only makes it worse. Once again, Aldo has to disappear into the wilderness for a while and make himself forgotten...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPFCO9KEj1JQ11ibdpqPkPWtKeZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45134'),
  ('1151904713932252190', 'Plus One', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'JP Quicquaro, Jeff Chan, Andrew Rhymer', 'Andrew Rhymer, Jeff Chan', 'Jack Quaid, Maya Erskine, Beck Bennett, Ed Begley Jr., Rosalind Chao, Tom Yi, Jessy Hodges, Brianne Howey', 'NR', 'Longtime single friends, Ben and Alice, agree to be each other''s respective plus one at every wedding they''re invited to, during a busy summer of wedding fever.', 'Longtime single friends, Ben and Alice, agree to be each other''s respective plus one at every wedding they''re invited to, during a busy summer of wedding fever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4w3bCp5UkLeemdq8MBNlyA3Zl2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508101'),
  ('1082915486752396084', 'Plus One at an Amish Wedding', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Ramsey, Kevin Bryan', 'D.F.W. Buckingham, Kimberly Rose Johnson', 'Galadriel Stineman, Kevin Joy, Mary McElree, Summer Mastain, Preston Kameka, Emily Joy Conly, Jordon Crusoe, Stacey Avey', 'G', 'April works at a prestigious hospital in New York and has recently met a handsome veterinarian named Jesse. Jesse receives an invitation to his brother''s wedding, so he and April travel to Amish Country to meet with those Jesse left behind years ago.', 'April works at a prestigious hospital in New York and has recently met a handsome veterinarian named Jesse. Jesse receives an invitation to his brother''s wedding, so he and April travel to Amish Country to meet with those Jesse left behind years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhm7XQabdl9HWapOYCjrgFcz236.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1008148'),
  ('1059955740812212700', 'Plush', 2013, 'Thriller', 'Daniel Moder, Catherine Hardwicke', 'Arty Nelson, Catherine Hardwicke', 'Emily Browning, Cam Gigandet, Dawn Olivieri, Xavier Samuel, Frances Fisher, Thomas Dekker, Marlene Forte, Elizabeth Peña', 'R', 'A young singer/songwriter, despite being married, becomes involved with her new guitarist, who she soon discovers has a dark past and may be a danger to her and those close to her.', 'A young singer/songwriter, despite being married, becomes involved with her new guitarist, who she soon discovers has a dark past and may be a danger to her and those close to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKtQbFwd72ZnXYbEIfEDVpHEJqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215881'),
  ('308025614121512355', 'Pluto', 2013, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Shin Su-won, Yun Ji-woon', 'Shin Su-won', 'Sung Joon, David Lee, Kim Kkob-bi, Kim Kwon, Seon Joo-ah, Nam Tae-boo, Park Hae-joon, Ryu Kyung-soo', null, 'Joon is arrested for the murder of the top student at his prestigious school. When he is released, Joon holds students accusing him of the crime in a room and forces them to reveal their dark secrets.', 'Joon is arrested for the murder of the top student at his prestigious school. When he is released, Joon holds students accusing him of the crime in a room and forces them to reveal their dark secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29j6OezM2TV7kBL2Hv4ZssF09ju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133964'),
  ('508086123827028074', 'Pluto and the Armadillo', 1943, 'Animation', 'Clyde Geronimi', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Fred Shields, Walt Disney', 'NR', 'Mickey and Pluto make a short stopover on a South American flight. Mickey throws Pluto''s ball into the jungle, and he chases it but it looks exactly the same as an armadillo that''s rolled up into a ball. This, of course, greatly confuses Pluto for a while. But he eventually makes friends with the armadillo. He chases the critter into a cave right behind his ball, and rips the ball apart thinking it''s the armadillo, which makes him very sad until the armadillo shows up again.', 'Mickey and Pluto make a short stopover on a South American flight. Mickey throws Pluto''s ball into the jungle, and he chases it but it looks exactly the same as an armadillo that''s rolled up into a ball. This, of course, greatly confuses Pluto for a while. But he eventually makes friends with the armadillo. He chases the critter into a cave right behind his ball, and rips the ball apart thinking it''s the armadillo, which makes him very sad until the armadillo shows up again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGqkKJjlNfkCh2m7fLVsMfIa5kG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68498'),
  ('340813018822350006', 'Pluto and the Gopher', 1950, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Ruth Clifford', 'NR', 'Pluto digs up Minnie''s garden and destroys her house in order to catch a pesky gopher-in spite of Minnie''s scoldings.', 'Pluto digs up Minnie''s garden and destroys her house in order to catch a pesky gopher-in spite of Minnie''s scoldings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mbxDISNpxjhBNeNyzEqmPLIFXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175999'),
  ('453765963964090079', 'Pluto at the Zoo', 1942, 'Animation', 'Clyde Geronimi', null, null, 'NR', 'Pluto walks past the zoo and sees the huge bone the sleeping lion has but getting it out is easier said than done. He gets it out of the lion''s cage, but then has to face the kangaroo and its playful joey. Next is the gorilla, then the crocodiles.', 'Pluto walks past the zoo and sees the huge bone the sleeping lion has but getting it out is easier said than done. He gets it out of the lion''s cage, but then has to face the kangaroo and its playful joey. Next is the gorilla, then the crocodiles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6StnBlBmE8ELyVNp1k9LFA6JrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68500'),
  ('42168926110994534', 'Pluto Junior', 1942, 'Animation', 'Clyde Geronimi', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Pluto and Pluto Junior are enjoying a lazy afternoon snooze when the playful pup tangles with a ball, a balloon, a worm, a bird, and a clothesline. Pluto rescues his son from a precarious situation, gets hung up in the process, but manages to land with a splash.', 'Pluto and Pluto Junior are enjoying a lazy afternoon snooze when the playful pup tangles with a ball, a balloon, a worm, a bird, and a clothesline. Pluto rescues his son from a precarious situation, gets hung up in the process, but manages to land with a splash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c92QU1RFSdgKQ0gY5BMYVSFy9yv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68501'),
  ('108038882178063003', 'Pluto''s Blue Note', 1947, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Billy Bletcher, John Woodbury', 'NR', 'Pluto wants to sing along with the birds, bee and cricket, but he is tone deaf.', 'Pluto wants to sing along with the birds, bee and cricket, but he is tone deaf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XXXPzHspYOPN5g8rpViaSxI5TH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164954'),
  ('765002550886418223', 'Pluto''s Christmas Tree', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'James MacDonald, Dessie Flynn, Clarence Nash, Ruth Clifford, Pinto Colvig', 'G', 'Pluto comes bounding outside to help Mickey get a Christmas tree. Chip ''n Dale see him and make fun of him, but the tree they take refuge in is the one Mickey chops down. They like the decorations, especially the candy canes and Mickey''s bowl of mixed nuts. But Pluto spots them and goes after them long before Mickey spots them. Minnie, Donald, and Goofy drop by to sing carols.', 'Pluto comes bounding outside to help Mickey get a Christmas tree. Chip ''n Dale see him and make fun of him, but the tree they take refuge in is the one Mickey chops down. They like the decorations, especially the candy canes and Mickey''s bowl of mixed nuts. But Pluto spots them and goes after them long before Mickey spots them. Minnie, Donald, and Goofy drop by to sing carols.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPyRZYQWLqfQIiOzgvtxg6IEunS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61080'),
  ('1060654359893576734', 'Pluto''s Dream House', 1940, 'Animation, Family', 'Clyde Geronimi', null, 'Walt Disney, Lee Millar, Billy Bletcher, Elvia Allman', 'NR', 'Mickey Mouse is about to build Pluto a doghouse when Pluto digs up a magic lamp that speaks in African-American vernacular. It offers to do Mickey''s bidding. Mickey''s first wish is for a doghouse, and the lamp starts to work. Suddenly, the saw, the planer, the paintbrush and other tools magically begin working on their own. Finally, Pluto has a magnificent doghouse. The second wish? Mickey asks the lamp to give Pluto a bath. But things go awry when Pluto accidentally breaks Mickey''s radio. Now, all sorts of conflicting messages are coming out of the speaker as Mickey tries to fix it. The lamp assumes all the voices are Mickey''s and obeys them. Pluto is rolled with a rolling pin, punched with boxing gloves, frozen in an aspic and is about to be cut into thin slices before all ends happily.', 'Mickey Mouse is about to build Pluto a doghouse when Pluto digs up a magic lamp that speaks in African-American vernacular. It offers to do Mickey''s bidding. Mickey''s first wish is for a doghouse, and the lamp starts to work. Suddenly, the saw, the planer, the paintbrush and other tools magically begin working on their own. Finally, Pluto has a magnificent doghouse. The second wish? Mickey asks the lamp to give Pluto a bath. But things go awry when Pluto accidentally breaks Mickey''s radio. Now, all sorts of conflicting messages are coming out of the speaker as Mickey tries to fix it. The lamp assumes all the voices are Mickey''s and obeys them. Pluto is rolled with a rolling pin, punched with boxing gloves, frozen in an aspic and is about to be cut into thin slices before all ends happily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6xNa8o3PIehG2rRLN0lIqtANoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67161'),
  ('402169514624372118', 'Pluto''s Fledgling', 1948, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'A little bird tries to fly too soon and lands in Pluto''s water dish. Pluto saves it and returns it to the nest but soon the bird tries again. This time, Pluto decides to give flying lessons, first pulling the bird like a kite, then launching him with an improvised slingshot.', 'A little bird tries to fly too soon and lands in Pluto''s water dish. Pluto saves it and returns it to the nest but soon the bird tries again. This time, Pluto decides to give flying lessons, first pulling the bird like a kite, then launching him with an improvised slingshot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WN5cS7kPHMA0glYg48OSvfzsRc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164945'),
  ('1060666189698439453', 'Pluto''s Heart Throb', 1950, 'Animation, Romance, Comedy', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Pluto falls for Dinah the dachshund; so does Butch. She strings both along, until Pluto very sweetly gives her a bone. But Butch won''t let her go, and keeps horning in, much to her annoyance.', 'Pluto falls for Dinah the dachshund; so does Butch. She strings both along, until Pluto very sweetly gives her a bone. But Butch won''t let her go, and keeps horning in, much to her annoyance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13MhaUHCbBsp4K3IIWFTUwttF4u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164979'),
  ('75498910716361596', 'Pluto''s Housewarming', 1947, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Pluto has just finished moving his bones into a spiffy new doghouse when a turtle comes along and starts moving them out. While Pluto is dealing with the turtle, Butch takes up residence. Butch chases Pluto back to his grungy old doghouse, and now it''s his turn to deal with the tenacious little turtle. The turtle wins, and he and Pluto become friends.', 'Pluto has just finished moving his bones into a spiffy new doghouse when a turtle comes along and starts moving them out. While Pluto is dealing with the turtle, Butch takes up residence. Butch chases Pluto back to his grungy old doghouse, and now it''s his turn to deal with the tenacious little turtle. The turtle wins, and he and Pluto become friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHW2HM1Bctth4nYVIbotY78MSFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68502'),
  ('641503108053032629', 'Pluto''s Judgement Day', 1935, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror', 'David Hand', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig, Billy Bletcher, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Pluto chases a kitten through a window and right into Mickey''s lap. Mickey scolds him, and goes off to wash the kitten. Pluto falls asleep in front of the fire, and dreams of a hell ruled by cats where he is put on trial for all his crimes against cats and, of course, found guilty.', 'Pluto chases a kitten through a window and right into Mickey''s lap. Mickey scolds him, and goes off to wash the kitten. Pluto falls asleep in front of the fire, and dreams of a hell ruled by cats where he is put on trial for all his crimes against cats and, of course, found guilty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTNmQBkkcN9CNUMwtPlcoJmldwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67162'),
  ('475661256317946535', 'Pluto''s Kid Brother', 1946, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Clarence Nash, Dorothy Lloyd, James MacDonald', 'NR', 'Pluto''s kid brother, K.B., keeps getting into trouble. When Butch the bulldog passes by, K.B. latches onto him. Butch gets K.B. to crawl into a meat market through a small slot. Pluto comes along, they tussle and set off the burglar alarm, which brings the dogcatcher, who grabs Butch.', 'Pluto''s kid brother, K.B., keeps getting into trouble. When Butch the bulldog passes by, K.B. latches onto him. Butch gets K.B. to crawl into a meat market through a small slot. Pluto comes along, they tussle and set off the burglar alarm, which brings the dogcatcher, who grabs Butch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0IvAvJzxe3z7jiPdHMfmXmTCZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68504'),
  ('1146832147325525835', 'Pluto''s Party', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Milt Schaffer', null, 'James MacDonald, Pinto Colvig', null, 'It''s Pluto''s birthday party, but Mickey''s dozen or so nephews seem to be having all the fun. Their present is a wagon so Pluto can pull them; the "Pin the Tail on Pluto" game doesn''t go quite right, and everything seems to prevent Pluto from having his birthday cake. But Mickey has planned ahead.', 'It''s Pluto''s birthday party, but Mickey''s dozen or so nephews seem to be having all the fun. Their present is a wagon so Pluto can pull them; the "Pin the Tail on Pluto" game doesn''t go quite right, and everything seems to prevent Pluto from having his birthday cake. But Mickey has planned ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGXJZ3PMUcvIGcWNgPMxm5tTrUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67163'),
  ('582346653870775984', 'Pluto''s Playmate', 1941, 'Animation', 'Norman Ferguson', null, null, 'NR', 'Pluto is playing with a ball on the beach. The ball goes into the water and starts moving in strange ways, because a sea lion is playing with it. Pluto does not want to share the ball, and eventually tries to bury it, but the sea lion is too clever. Pluto goes after the sea lion, but has to tangle with a persistent octopus. The sea lion saves Pluto, and resuscitates him, so Pluto agrees to play.', 'Pluto is playing with a ball on the beach. The ball goes into the water and starts moving in strange ways, because a sea lion is playing with it. Pluto does not want to share the ball, and eventually tries to bury it, but the sea lion is too clever. Pluto goes after the sea lion, but has to tangle with a persistent octopus. The sea lion saves Pluto, and resuscitates him, so Pluto agrees to play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/divtDzYBECKYLog60SyMaVvqzhk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68506'),
  ('233340692926170234', 'Pluto''s Purchase', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig, James MacDonald', 'NR', 'Mickey Mouse sends Pluto to buy sausage at the butcher shop, but Butch schemes to steal it.', 'Mickey Mouse sends Pluto to buy sausage at the butcher shop, but Butch schemes to steal it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LcdQ6fOkoEYZSSlnDRPRiZ3OdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164976'),
  ('795588706624187836', 'Pluto''s Quin-puplets', 1937, 'Animation', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, null, 'NR', 'Pluto wants to chase the sausage man, but Fifi convinces him to look after their five rambunctious puppies instead. The puppies end up in the basement, where they tangle with a compressed air tank, paint, a jug of hooch, and other hazards. Fifi returns and finds a drunk Pluto, paint on everyone, and gets very angry.', 'Pluto wants to chase the sausage man, but Fifi convinces him to look after their five rambunctious puppies instead. The puppies end up in the basement, where they tangle with a compressed air tank, paint, a jug of hooch, and other hazards. Fifi returns and finds a drunk Pluto, paint on everyone, and gets very angry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzVyQhO52VSx1Ix635Pdoa4OZyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68508'),
  ('95303330212165057', 'Pluto''s Surprise Package', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Pluto tries to bring in the mail, which gets more difficult when a package sprouts legs and tries to go swimming. Between the wandering turtle and the wind blowing the other mail around, Pluto''s got quite a task ahead. And it''s not made easier when both the letters and the turtle go off a large cliff.', 'Pluto tries to bring in the mail, which gets more difficult when a package sprouts legs and tries to go swimming. Between the wandering turtle and the wind blowing the other mail around, Pluto''s got quite a task ahead. And it''s not made easier when both the letters and the turtle go off a large cliff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msmou30FOCJL6lHYdfrmaODa6nG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164972'),
  ('752761413537957427', 'Pluto''s Sweater', 1949, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Ruth Clifford, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Minnie Mouse knits a sweater for Pluto. When she puts it on him, Pluto does whatever he can to try to get it off, eventually shrinking it to the perfect size for Figaro.', 'Minnie Mouse knits a sweater for Pluto. When she puts it on him, Pluto does whatever he can to try to get it off, eventually shrinking it to the perfect size for Figaro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ssSWld04uzIvb4TAKVj5b4rjj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175997'),
  ('603256835327730362', 'Plutopia', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'James MacDonald, Pinto Colvig, Jim Backus', null, 'Mickey''s on vacation at Camp Utopia. At first Pluto thinks it really is utopia: trees everywhere and a cat to chase. But the cabin rules are strict: no dogs indoors, and dogs must be muzzled and leashed. Mickey puts Pluto out to sleep, just out of reach of his food, and the cat comes down and taunts him. Pluto falls asleep and dreams of his "Plutopia" with a subservient cat begging Pluto to bite him and catering to his every need.', 'Mickey''s on vacation at Camp Utopia. At first Pluto thinks it really is utopia: trees everywhere and a cat to chase. But the cabin rules are strict: no dogs indoors, and dogs must be muzzled and leashed. Mickey puts Pluto out to sleep, just out of reach of his food, and the cat comes down and taunts him. Pluto falls asleep and dreams of his "Plutopia" with a subservient cat begging Pluto to bite him and catering to his every need.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6z7V27MYsaoXrzwYKcrf9zY2h0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67160'),
  ('776832241681966649', 'Plymouth Adventure', 1952, 'Drama, Adventure, History', 'Clarence Brown, Ridgeway Callow, Joel Freeman', 'Helen Deutsch', 'Spencer Tracy, Gene Tierney, Van Johnson, Leo Genn, Dawn Addams, Lloyd Bridges, Barry Jones, John Dehner', 'NR', 'During the Mayflower pilgrims'' long voyage across the Atlantic Ocean on their way to America, Captain Christopher Jones falls in love with William Bradford''s wife Dorothy.', 'During the Mayflower pilgrims'' long voyage across the Atlantic Ocean on their way to America, Captain Christopher Jones falls in love with William Bradford''s wife Dorothy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1bBvxJ4hD8MnLRlpH11wIOYyvA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90968'),
  ('518222321379552471', 'PM Narendra Modi', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Jayant H. Verma, Rahul Tanwar, Sunita Radia', 'Vivek Oberoi, Anirudh Chawla', 'Vivek Oberoi, Barkha Bisht, Zarina Wahab, Rajendra Gupta, Manoj Joshi, Akshat R. Saluja, Aanjjan Srivastav, Suresh Oberoi', null, 'Chronicles Narendra Modi’s life and events leading up to his swearing-in ceremony as the Prime Minister of India in 2014.', 'Chronicles Narendra Modi’s life and events leading up to his swearing-in ceremony as the Prime Minister of India in 2014.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4goB5vutZlPZaB0jovwJqOnUKGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589291'),
  ('838186093553559861', 'Pneuma', 2018, 'Drama', 'William Carne', 'William Carne', 'Allyson Grant, Jason Beaudoin, Jessie Crabbe, Lucas Rubkiewicz', null, 'Jonathan Hale has amnesia. Accused of a heinous act, he''s paired with a criminal psychologist to determine if he''s fit for trial. But having lost his memory, is he still the same person he was, or can he reinvent himself?', 'Jonathan Hale has amnesia. Accused of a heinous act, he''s paired with a criminal psychologist to determine if he''s fit for trial. But having lost his memory, is he still the same person he was, or can he reinvent himself?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jdHSryB4VPUWvG4KYrdNZKJ6CI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472026'),
  ('741180530702525279', 'PNL - Dans la légende tour', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', null, null, null, null, 'Live recording of French rap duo PNL playing songs from their album "Dans la légende" and more at the Bercy Arena in Paris.', 'Live recording of French rap duo PNL playing songs from their album "Dans la légende" and more at the Bercy Arena in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBLkn6lM1DDIwWmMkNAz386GCyn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:721916'),
  ('980625419460358223', 'Po', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Matteo Calore, Andrea Segre', 'Gianantonio Stella, Andrea Segre', null, null, 'November 14, 1951, the left bank of the Po river a few hundred meters from the Padua-Bologna railway bridge breaks. The tide invades the Polesine''s lands in a few minutes, one of the poorest regions in Italy at the time. Thousands people, men, women and children flee while the water remains stagnant for months between the houses and the countryside. Today, 70 years later, the children of that time remember those months immortalized by the films perfectly preserved in the Istituto Luce''s archives.', 'November 14, 1951, the left bank of the Po river a few hundred meters from the Padua-Bologna railway bridge breaks. The tide invades the Polesine''s lands in a few minutes, one of the poorest regions in Italy at the time. Thousands people, men, women and children flee while the water remains stagnant for months between the houses and the countryside. Today, 70 years later, the children of that time remember those months immortalized by the films perfectly preserved in the Istituto Luce''s archives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phTyECu1fQfDzwsMqNGL98rYxWU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956129'),
  ('1110732092456167903', 'Poachers', 1975, 'Drama', 'José Luis Borau, Francisco J. Querejeta, Roberto Parra', 'José Luis Borau, Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón', 'Lola Gaos, Ovidi Montllor, Alicia Sánchez, Ismael Merlo, José Luis Borau, Felipe Solano, José Luis Heredia, Erasmo Pascual', null, 'The relationship between a poacher and his domineering mother in rural Spain is upended when he falls for an escapee from a reform school.', 'The relationship between a poacher and his domineering mother in rural Spain is upended when he falls for an escapee from a reform school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqkjAu9FJKTGINYLnNnLiosyoI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142965'),
  ('773989832453797807', 'Pobre, pero honrada!', 1973, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Fernando Cortés, Xavier Cruz, Fernando Durán Rojas', 'Fernando Galiana', 'María Elena Velasco, Fernando Soler, Adalberto Rodríguez Machuchal, Norma Lazareno, Ángel Garasa, José Ángel Espinosa ''Ferrusquilla'', Raúl Meraz, Héctor Herrera', null, 'Beloved Mexican screen star La India Maria portrays a poor but honorable woman who causes a stir around town when she decides to become a witch doctor in this classic comedy from director Fernando Cortes. When the real medical practitioner in town discovers that there''s a new shaman around, the comic trouble that follows is sure to keep viewers in stitches.', 'Beloved Mexican screen star La India Maria portrays a poor but honorable woman who causes a stir around town when she decides to become a witch doctor in this classic comedy from director Fernando Cortes. When the real medical practitioner in town discovers that there''s a new shaman around, the comic trouble that follows is sure to keep viewers in stitches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPgCHLeYS5LzZ0gehrBYazKcUvO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245364'),
  ('1084592651364326657', 'Pocahontas', 1994, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Takashi Masunaga, Toshiyuki Hiruma', 'Jack Olesker', 'Kathleen Barr, Garry Chalk, Ian James Corlett, Philip Maurice Hayes, Andrea Libman, Jesse Moss', 'NR', 'History comes alive in this exciting animated tale of a great American heroine, an inspiring story packed with lots of action and surprises that make the pas a magical adventure for all your children. The daughter of the great chief, Powhattan, Pocahotas is a brave Indian Princess whose kindness brings about peace between her tribe and the English settlers led by handsome Captain John Smith.', 'History comes alive in this exciting animated tale of a great American heroine, an inspiring story packed with lots of action and surprises that make the pas a magical adventure for all your children. The daughter of the great chief, Powhattan, Pocahotas is a brave Indian Princess whose kindness brings about peace between her tribe and the English settlers led by handsome Captain John Smith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KnZAJw4bJoKT06CVlrzTuyqIK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246109'),
  ('309897180576147807', 'Pocahontas', 1995, 'Animation', 'Ryszard Słapczyński', 'Leonard Lee', 'Nickolas Grace, Lee Perry, Peter McAllum, Juliet Jordan', null, 'Set in Colonial America, Pocahontas has become a story of historical value known and loved internationally, among children of all ages. The film tells the story of the first English settlers in Virginia and the Native Americans who lived there. It highlights the very different values of the two civilisations and particularly their attitude and respect for the land. It''s a culture shock story and, on a personal level, a love story', 'Set in Colonial America, Pocahontas has become a story of historical value known and loved internationally, among children of all ages. The film tells the story of the first English settlers in Virginia and the Native Americans who lived there. It highlights the very different values of the two civilisations and particularly their attitude and respect for the land. It''s a culture shock story and, on a personal level, a love story', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpwFGXyvNAWrM6LCHUb2VUgkopw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333323'),
  ('451440082342018989', 'Pocahontas II: Journey to a New World', 1998, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Romance', 'Tom Ellery, Bradley Raymond, Kazuyoshi Takeuchi', 'Cindy Marcus, Allen Estrin, Flip Kobler', 'Billy Zane, Irene Bedard, Jim Cummings, David Ogden Stiers, Linda Hunt, Judy Kuhn, Jeff Bennett, Jean Stapleton', 'G', 'When news of John Smith''s death reaches America, Pocahontas is devastated. She sets off to London with John Rolfe, to meet with the King of England on a diplomatic mission: to create peace and respect between the two great lands. However, Governor Ratcliffe is still around; he wants to return to Jamestown and take over. He will stop at nothing to discredit the young princess.', 'When news of John Smith''s death reaches America, Pocahontas is devastated. She sets off to London with John Rolfe, to meet with the King of England on a diplomatic mission: to create peace and respect between the two great lands. However, Governor Ratcliffe is still around; he wants to return to Jamestown and take over. He will stop at nothing to discredit the young princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAnmNjw1TCTzS702mj1OwwmXBpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13761'),
  ('916513884875634301', 'Pocahontas: The Legend', 1995, 'Romance, Family, Adventure', 'Danièle J. Suissa, Richard Leiterman', 'Donald Martin', 'Sandrine Holt, Miles O''Keeffe, Tony Goldwyn, Gordon Tootoosis, Billy Merasty, Bucky Hill, David Hemblen, Billy Two Rivers', null, 'Englishmen come to explore and settle the new world. There they find natives who are curious about their "firesticks" and strange customs.', 'Englishmen come to explore and settle the new world. There they find natives who are curious about their "firesticks" and strange customs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dm6g9xku4PCyu5Cz8BZv4A3k9Ei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82711'),
  ('229783684093766125', 'Pocket Dial Murder', 2023, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Roxanne Boisvert, Bill St. John', 'Roxanne Boisvert, Audrey C. Marie', 'Kirsten Comerford, Steve Byers, Erica Anderson, Mathieu Bourassa, Dawn Lambing, Darius Rathe, Debra Hale, JaNae Armogan', null, 'Stacey receives a pocket dial from her husband, Jeff, where she hears the sudden death of a woman on the other end. When Jeff comes home, he says he lost his phone she doesn’t know what to think. Could Stacey be married to a murderer?', 'Stacey receives a pocket dial from her husband, Jeff, where she hears the sudden death of a woman on the other end. When Jeff comes home, he says he lost his phone she doesn’t know what to think. Could Stacey be married to a murderer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qn4AHNUtVjEsLDwURKBhPg90tkS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1121156'),
  ('136053478994018316', 'Pocket Hercules: Naim Suleymanoglu', 2019, 'Drama', 'Özer Feyzioğlu, Martin Szecsanov', 'Barış Pirhasan', 'Hayat Van Eck, Selen Öztürk, Yetkin Dikinciler, Gürkan Uygun, Renan Bilek, Levent Ülgen, Bülent Alkış, Kemal Başar', null, 'From defecting to the Olympics, an underdog weightlifter powers through adversity to raise up his community in this biopic of Naim Süleymanoğlu.', 'From defecting to the Olympics, an underdog weightlifter powers through adversity to raise up his community in this biopic of Naim Süleymanoğlu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNEATX1X3B7vmKY2Brm2wumuNG4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650360'),
  ('130069275502995673', 'Pocket Money', 1972, 'Comedy, Western, Adventure', 'M. James Arnett, Mickey McCardle, Gene Marum', 'Terrence Malick', 'Paul Newman, Lee Marvin, Strother Martin, Wayne Rogers, Héctor Elizondo, Christine Belford, Kelly Jean Peters, Gregory Sierra', 'PG', 'Broke and in debt, an otherwise honest cowboy and his buddy get mixed up in some shady dealings with a crooked cattle dealer.', 'Broke and in debt, an otherwise honest cowboy and his buddy get mixed up in some shady dealings with a crooked cattle dealer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfSFXd5vrJ1Zo29Vz6G3t3iK1Yv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45512'),
  ('480455212102158243', 'Pocket Ninjas', 1997, 'Action, Family, Comedy', 'Dave Eddy, Dwight F. Lay, Donald G. Jackson', 'David Huey', 'Robert Z''Dar, Sondi, Brad Bufanda, Joseph Valencia, Gary Daniels, Mel Novak, Rick Rabago, Lelagi Togisala', null, 'Somewhere in New Jersey, a group of masked rollerblading children "save the universe" by training to fight the evil Cobra Khan through a series of action-packed montages. Along the way they hypothesize some slapstick hijinks in a balloon factory, and save the day through a hypothetical Sonic Virtual Reality battle. A real treat!', 'Somewhere in New Jersey, a group of masked rollerblading children "save the universe" by training to fight the evil Cobra Khan through a series of action-packed montages. Along the way they hypothesize some slapstick hijinks in a balloon factory, and save the day through a hypothetical Sonic Virtual Reality battle. A real treat!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qj3S8lkzehYv3ZPxjZjbyUi5Ucg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16530'),
  ('948182557977358700', 'Pocketful of Miracles', 1961, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Frank Capra, Robert J. Bronner, Arthur S. Black Jr.', 'Robert Riskin', 'Glenn Ford, Bette Davis, Hope Lange, Arthur O''Connell, Peter Falk, Thomas Mitchell, Edward Everett Horton, Mickey Shaughnessy', 'NR', 'A New York gangster and his girlfriend attempt to turn street beggar Apple Annie into a society lady when the peddler learns her daughter is marrying royalty.', 'A New York gangster and his girlfriend attempt to turn street beggar Apple Annie into a society lady when the peddler learns her daughter is marrying royalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjXwcGJjT5tE22wazQUYH32HwU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248'),
  ('1023663551782948172', 'Pod', 2015, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mickey Keating, Mac Fisken', 'Mickey Keating', 'Larry Fessenden, Lauren Ashley Carter, Brian Morvant, John Weselcouch, Dean Cates', null, 'A family intervention goes horrifically awry within the snowy confines of an isolated lake house.', 'A family intervention goes horrifically awry within the snowy confines of an isolated lake house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bL3wnFJ9mbsEsYyFC5bHhuJCft9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323366'),
  ('719873211655700744', 'Podium', 2004, 'Comedy, Music', 'Yann Moix', 'Yann Moix, Arthur-Emmanuel Pierre, Olivier Dazat', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Jean-Paul Rouve, Julie Depardieu, Marie Guillard, Anne Marivin, Odile Vuillemin, Nadège Beausson-Diagne, Nicolas Jouxtel', null, 'Bernand Fréderic is a mediocre bank executive. He''s married and has a son. He used to have another profession: being French star Claude Francois. Now, with the Imitators Gala Night coming up, he must choose between his wife or the only thing that makes him happy: the applause.', 'Bernand Fréderic is a mediocre bank executive. He''s married and has a son. He used to have another profession: being French star Claude Francois. Now, with the Imitators Gala Night coming up, he must choose between his wife or the only thing that makes him happy: the applause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rq2KTyTJXd2p4kwCa1dajdrXimA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14648'),
  ('685476361642515974', 'Poem', 1972, 'Drama', 'Akio Jissoji, Kenji Shimomura, Kazumasa Otani', 'Toshirō Ishidō', 'Saburo Shinoda, Shin Kishida, Ryo Tamura, Eiko Yanami, Eishin Tono, Hiroko Sakurai, Kanjūrō Arashi, Haruhiko Okamura', null, 'A rigidly devoted young servant lives in a decaying aristocratic household as its members drift toward modernity, hedonism, and financial collapse. While the family quarrels over the fate of their estate, he clings to tradition and ritual, becoming a quiet witness to the social change and emotional unrest around him.', 'A rigidly devoted young servant lives in a decaying aristocratic household as its members drift toward modernity, hedonism, and financial collapse. While the family quarrels over the fate of their estate, he clings to tradition and ritual, becoming a quiet witness to the social change and emotional unrest around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRSPjLcMfdVheZ28sRLYZo6R0Tu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104551'),
