  ('1023312615046187479', 'Poem of the Sea', 1958, 'Drama', 'Yuliya Solntseva, Gavriil Egiazarov, Leonid Pchyolkin', 'Oleksandr Dovzhenko', 'Yevhen Bondarenko, Yevgeny Gurov, Zinaida Kirienko, Antonina Konchakova, Georgi Kovrov, Ivan Kozlovsky, Boris Livanov, Nataliia Naum', null, 'A Soviet dam project means that many old Ukrainian villages will end up under water. There are conflicts between the dam engineers and villagers who don''t want to move.', 'A Soviet dam project means that many old Ukrainian villages will end up under water. There are conflicts between the dam engineers and villagers who don''t want to move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Qa2RveCq3MgNGUuHqg9cVjITBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257637'),
  ('904654118166796362', 'Poetic Justice', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Singleton, Peter Lyons Collister', 'John Singleton', 'Janet Jackson, Tupac Shakur, Regina King, Joe Torry, Tyra Ferrell, Roger Guenveur Smith, Maya Angelou, Dina D.', 'R', 'Still grieving after the murder of her boyfriend, hairdresser Justice writes poetry to deal with the pain of her loss. Unable to get to Oakland to attend a convention because of her broken-down car, Justice gets a lift with her friend, Iesha, and Iesha''s postal worker boyfriend, Chicago. Along for the ride is Chicago''s co-worker, Lucky, to whom Justice grows close after some initial problems. But is she ready to open her heart again?', 'Still grieving after the murder of her boyfriend, hairdresser Justice writes poetry to deal with the pain of her loss. Unable to get to Oakland to attend a convention because of her broken-down car, Justice gets a lift with her friend, Iesha, and Iesha''s postal worker boyfriend, Chicago. Along for the ride is Chicago''s co-worker, Lucky, to whom Justice grows close after some initial problems. But is she ready to open her heart again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jE7Vzh3edBQtbbDcF4AC5gMX2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8291'),
  ('470270520103903704', 'Poetical Refugee', 2001, 'Drama', 'Abdellatif Kechiche, Dominique Brenguier', 'Abdellatif Kechiche', 'Sami Bouajila, Élodie Bouchez, Bruno Lochet, Aure Atika, Olivier Loustau, Virginie Darmon, Mustapha Adouani, Sami Zitouni', null, 'Like a Candide dreaming of Eldorado, Jallel lands in France, hoping to try his luck. From encounter to encounter, hostel to social welfare group, Jallel will make his way through a Paris of outcasts. Although failing to achieve his hopes, he discovers and shares in the solidarity felt by the destitute. –uniFrance', 'Like a Candide dreaming of Eldorado, Jallel lands in France, hoping to try his luck. From encounter to encounter, hostel to social welfare group, Jallel will make his way through a Paris of outcasts. Although failing to achieve his hopes, he discovers and shares in the solidarity felt by the destitute. –uniFrance', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8a1o31b6c5rMdX0aCjwmOqKINUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72480'),
  ('370810684105306851', 'Poetry', 2010, 'Drama', 'Lee Chang-dong, Kim Hyun-seok, Park Jung-bum', 'Lee Chang-dong', 'Yoon Jeong-hee, David Lee, Kim Hee-ra, Ahn Nae-sang, Kim Yong-taek, Park Myung-shin, Jang Hye-jin, Kim Nam-jin', null, 'A South Korean woman in her sixties enrolls in a poetry class as she grapples with her faltering memory and her grandson''s appalling wrongdoing.', 'A South Korean woman in her sixties enrolls in a poetry class as she grapples with her faltering memory and her grandson''s appalling wrongdoing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcefUQ0AIgRvkh9DS76tvetzxc2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47909'),
  ('468638114588592519', 'Poi', 2006, 'Drama', 'K. Balachander', 'K. Balachander', 'Uday Kiran, Vimala Raman, Geethu Mohandas, Prakash Raj, Avinash, K. Balachander, Adithya Menon', null, 'Valluvanar is an upright political leader in Tamil Nadu much respected for his honesty and uprightness. And he refuses to compromise on this trait even when his only son Kamban finds himself in jail for no fault of his. The opposition party takes advantage of the situation and bails out Kamban, who joins this party much to his father''s embarrassment. The media laps it up sensationalizing it further. Then Kamban decides to leave the country until things cool down. Only his mother Vasuki with whom he is close is aware of this plan. Kamban arrives at Sri Lanka where he be-friend''s Banerjee, a Bengali and stays with him. One day he finds a Tamil book on the beach which he traces to Shilpa the owner of the book, who is a college student preparing for the civil services examination. The film juggles between reality and fiction, where Theepori, the fictitious father image of Kamban advises him to fall in love. The rest of the story is about the emotional conflict between her career and love.', 'Valluvanar is an upright political leader in Tamil Nadu much respected for his honesty and uprightness. And he refuses to compromise on this trait even when his only son Kamban finds himself in jail for no fault of his. The opposition party takes advantage of the situation and bails out Kamban, who joins this party much to his father''s embarrassment. The media laps it up sensationalizing it further. Then Kamban decides to leave the country until things cool down. Only his mother Vasuki with whom he is close is aware of this plan. Kamban arrives at Sri Lanka where he be-friend''s Banerjee, a Bengali and stays with him. One day he finds a Tamil book on the beach which he traces to Shilpa the owner of the book, who is a college student preparing for the civil services examination. The film juggles between reality and fiction, where Theepori, the fictitious father image of Kamban advises him to fall in love. The rest of the story is about the emotional conflict between her career and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXzjNusdzdgA0GCSJezShJSM4UF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63677'),
  ('269304098946822281', 'Poinsettias for Christmas', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Christie Will Wolf, Mike Kam', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Bethany Joy Lenz, Sharon Lawrence, John Schneider, Lauren London, Marcus Rosner, Rhonda Dent, Oliver Rice, Nicole Hombrebueno', 'PG', 'It’s just weeks before Christmas when Ellie gets a call to return home to help her father on the family’s poinsettia farm. The family business is on the line to deliver tens of thousands of plants for the town’s annual parade. The problem is — the poinsettias have yet to turn red! As Ellie searches for the solution, she is reminded of where her heart truly lies as she falls in love with both her roots and a local botanist.', 'It’s just weeks before Christmas when Ellie gets a call to return home to help her father on the family’s poinsettia farm. The family business is on the line to deliver tens of thousands of plants for the town’s annual parade. The problem is — the poinsettias have yet to turn red! As Ellie searches for the solution, she is reminded of where her heart truly lies as she falls in love with both her roots and a local botanist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QBwknZ5N2XOHlLHUWVw2cg03ZX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542602'),
  ('1021974281625875835', 'Point Blank', 1967, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'John Boorman, Philip H. Lathrop, Al Jennings', 'Alexander Jacobs, Rafe Newhouse, David Newhouse', 'Lee Marvin, Angie Dickinson, Keenan Wynn, Carroll O''Connor, Lloyd Bochner, Michael Strong, John Vernon, Sharon Acker', 'NR', 'After being double-crossed and left for dead, a mysterious man named Walker single-mindedly tries to retrieve the rather inconsequential sum of money that was stolen from him.', 'After being double-crossed and left for dead, a mysterious man named Walker single-mindedly tries to retrieve the rather inconsequential sum of money that was stolen from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4y8yNXdcP9KQJXd0cIUmQ0t3ezB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26039'),
  ('1111020021290807122', 'Point Blank', 1998, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Matt Earl Beesley, Garrett Warren, Keith L. Smith', 'James Bannon, Chuck Konzelman, Daniel Raskov', 'Mickey Rourke, Danny Trejo, Kevin Gage, James Gammon, Frederic Forrest, Paul Ben-Victor, Werner Schreyer, Michael Wright', 'R', 'Convicted corporate criminal Howard engineers a prison break as he and a number of fellow inmates are being transferred to a new facility. The escapees storm a shopping mall and take a group of shoppers hostage (after killing many more of them) before making their demands. Only Rudy, a former mercenary and brother of one of the fugitives, can take out the criminals before more of the hostages die.', 'Convicted corporate criminal Howard engineers a prison break as he and a number of fellow inmates are being transferred to a new facility. The escapees storm a shopping mall and take a group of shoppers hostage (after killing many more of them) before making their demands. Only Rudy, a former mercenary and brother of one of the fugitives, can take out the criminals before more of the hostages die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ewYXrICSHI2PEZC972WPADIykL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56125'),
  ('958743871733672838', 'Point Blank', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Fred Cavayé, Alain Duplantier, Christian Vallat', 'Fred Cavayé, Guillaume Lemans', 'Gilles Lellouche, Roschdy Zem, Gérard Lanvin, Elena Anaya, Mireille Perrier, Claire Pérot, Moussa Maaskri, Pierre Benoist', 'R', 'Samuel Pierret is a nurse who saves the wrong guy – a thief whose henchmen take Samuel''s pregnant wife hostage to force him to spring their boss from the hospital. A race through the subways and streets of Paris ensues, and the body count rises. Can Samuel evade the cops and the criminal underground and deliver his beloved to safety?', 'Samuel Pierret is a nurse who saves the wrong guy – a thief whose henchmen take Samuel''s pregnant wife hostage to force him to spring their boss from the hospital. A race through the subways and streets of Paris ensues, and the body count rises. Can Samuel evade the cops and the criminal underground and deliver his beloved to safety?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tt2UlArx3joZWBYctJehCGmHGZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61404'),
  ('915686403298526301', 'Point Blank', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Philipp Kadelbach, Jakub Bejnarowicz', 'Oliver Kienle, Holger Karsten Schmidt', 'Tom Schilling, Edin Hasanović, Jens Albinus, Lazar Ristovski, Fortunato Cerlino, Britta Hammelstein, Emilia Schüle, Sascha Alexander Geršak', null, 'Berlin, Germany. Police officer Klaus Roth infiltrates the Serbian mafia, specializing in manipulating sports betting, and befriends the naive Luka, in order to capture Aco Gorić, the enigmatic head of the criminal ring.', 'Berlin, Germany. Police officer Klaus Roth infiltrates the Serbian mafia, specializing in manipulating sports betting, and befriends the naive Luka, in order to capture Aco Gorić, the enigmatic head of the criminal ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBQb1Qhy2afgKgQWbxYuqYlRk7X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385498'),
  ('818530467729637449', 'Point Break', 1991, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Kathryn Bigelow, Donald Peterman, Steve Yaconelli', 'W. Peter Iliff', 'Keanu Reeves, Patrick Swayze, Lori Petty, Gary Busey, John C. McGinley, James Le Gros, John Philbin, BoJesse Christopher', 'R', 'In Los Angeles, a gang of bank robbers who call themselves The Ex-Presidents commit their crimes while wearing masks of Reagan, Carter, Nixon and Johnson. Believing that the members of the gang could be surfers, the F.B.I. sends young agent Johnny Utah to the beach undercover to mix with the surfers and gather information.', 'In Los Angeles, a gang of bank robbers who call themselves The Ex-Presidents commit their crimes while wearing masks of Reagan, Carter, Nixon and Johnson. Believing that the members of the gang could be surfers, the F.B.I. sends young agent Johnny Utah to the beach undercover to mix with the surfers and gather information.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlbERIghrQ4oofqlbF7H0K0EYnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1089'),
  ('535125920554474747', 'Point Break', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Ericson Core, Ericson Core, Peter Lyons Collister', 'W. Peter Iliff', 'Edgar Ramírez, Luke Bracey, Teresa Palmer, Ray Winstone, Max Thieriot, Delroy Lindo, Tobias Santelmann, James Le Gros', 'PG-13', 'A young undercover FBI agent infiltrates a gang of thieves who share a common interest in extreme sports. A remake of the 1991 film, "Point Break".', 'A young undercover FBI agent infiltrates a gang of thieves who share a common interest in extreme sports. A remake of the 1991 film, "Point Break".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7JOvw5Lqs9ezoFTJxmz3nx3av2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257088'),
  ('21878597433297971', 'Point of Impact', 1993, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Bob Misiorowski', 'David Zito, Les Weldon, George Fernandez', 'Michael Paré, Barbara Carrera, Michael Ironside, Lehua Reid, Ian Yule', null, 'Jack Davis is a tough, outspoken cop who finds himself wrongly accused for the death of a fellow agent by the depraved and power hungry chief of Miami Customs, Martin Cullen. Disgraced and dismissed, Jack swears revenge and goes to work for Roberto Largo, a rich, evil Cuban crime boss, as bodyguard for his smoldering wife, Eva. Jack knows Largo is connected to his old boss Cullen and is determined to learn the secret that will bring him down. Trapped in a deadly game of cat and mouse, held captive by his passionate affair with Eva, Jack must figure out the significance of the mysterious Spanish Rose to survive.', 'Jack Davis is a tough, outspoken cop who finds himself wrongly accused for the death of a fellow agent by the depraved and power hungry chief of Miami Customs, Martin Cullen. Disgraced and dismissed, Jack swears revenge and goes to work for Roberto Largo, a rich, evil Cuban crime boss, as bodyguard for his smoldering wife, Eva. Jack knows Largo is connected to his old boss Cullen and is determined to learn the secret that will bring him down. Trapped in a deadly game of cat and mouse, held captive by his passionate affair with Eva, Jack must figure out the significance of the mysterious Spanish Rose to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhgNQoByYSkkXJY4Zea3Ils5qUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54067'),
  ('553043758559708162', 'Point of No Return', 1993, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Michael W. Watkins, John Badham, Carla McCloskey', 'Robert Getchell, Alexandra Seros', 'Bridget Fonda, Gabriel Byrne, Dermot Mulroney, Miguel Ferrer, Anne Bancroft, Olivia D''Abo, Richard Romanus, Harvey Keitel', 'R', 'Hardened criminal Maggie Hayward''s consistent violence, even in police custody, ends in the execution chamber. However, top-secret US government agent ''Bob'' arranges a staged death, so Maggie can be elaborately trained as a phantom killer and subdued into obedience.', 'Hardened criminal Maggie Hayward''s consistent violence, even in police custody, ends in the execution chamber. However, top-secret US government agent ''Bob'' arranges a staged death, so Maggie can be elaborately trained as a phantom killer and subdued into obedience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8hefEVK6WHiCbMUBeHU0yZbQLB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10498'),
  ('1108769491972554652', 'Point of Order!', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Emile de Antonio', null, 'Joseph McCarthy, Roy Cohn, Karl E. Mundt, Joseph N. Welch, Stuart Symington, Scoop Jackson, John L. McClellan, G. David Schine', null, 'Point of Order is compiled from TV footage of the 1954 Army-McCarthy hearings, in which the Army accused Senator McCarthy of improperly pressuring the Army for special privileges for Private David Schine, formerly of McCarthy''s investigative staff. McCarthy accused the Army of holding Schine hostage to keep him from searching for Communists in the Army. These hearings resulted in McCarthy''s eventual censure for conduct unbecoming a senator.', 'Point of Order is compiled from TV footage of the 1954 Army-McCarthy hearings, in which the Army accused Senator McCarthy of improperly pressuring the Army for special privileges for Private David Schine, formerly of McCarthy''s investigative staff. McCarthy accused the Army of holding Schine hostage to keep him from searching for Communists in the Army. These hearings resulted in McCarthy''s eventual censure for conduct unbecoming a senator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhkHJnJr8mYRC162623PWBCjXXS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97915'),
  ('71910980626694849', 'Point of Origin', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Newton Thomas Sigel, Anthony G. Nakonechnyj', 'Matthew Tabak', 'Ray Liotta, John Leguizamo, Colm Feore, Cliff Curtis, Illeana Douglas, Ronny Cox, Nora Zehetner, Bai Ling', 'R', 'An arson investigator searching for the perpetrator of a string of deadly fires in 1980s California.', 'An arson investigator searching for the perpetrator of a string of deadly fires in 1980s California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8c7fxx0nvrGGbuIDI3A7HQgzad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181132'),
  ('620514029120312968', 'Point of Terror', 1971, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Music', 'Alex Nicol', 'Ernest A. Charles, Tony Crechales', 'Peter Carpenter, Dyanne Thorne, Lory Hansen, Leslie Simms, Joel Marston, Paula Mitchell, Al Dunlap, Ernest A. Charles', 'R', 'A nightclub singer has nightmares about being involved in adultery and murder, only to wake up and find that they may not be nightmares.', 'A nightclub singer has nightmares about being involved in adultery and murder, only to wake up and find that they may not be nightmares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGGJU7bEOMCKh1I7NTfix6jD3pw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125751'),
  ('206933565693430829', 'Point Zero', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'José Pedro Goulart, Rodrigo Graciosa', 'José Pedro Goulart', 'Sandro Aliprandini, Eucir de Souza, Camila Vergara, Larissa Tavares, Nicolas Conceição, Thiago Ruffoni, Giulia Perillo, Lisandro Belloto', null, 'Young Ênio is having to deal with a lot at home. His family is falling apart, whilst his sister''s friends bully him at school. Over the course of one fateful night Ênio goes on an adventure, in a tour-de-force debut about growing up.', 'Young Ênio is having to deal with a lot at home. His family is falling apart, whilst his sister''s friends bully him at school. Over the course of one fateful night Ênio goes on an adventure, in a tour-de-force debut about growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKf2dut8ZzSAeZwgBFd4tlLLpLq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361146'),
  ('817585560381338439', 'Point-Blank', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Sacha Wiernik, Vincent Lannoo', 'Philippe Bernard, Olivier Berclaz', 'Olivia Ruiz, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Hubert Delattre, Ibrahim Koma, Vincent Aguesse, Thomas Chabrol, Gil Alma, Vassili Schneider', null, 'Justine, 40, is struggling to reconcile her family life and her job as a police officer in the serious-crimes squad. Then she''s accused of stealing money during a raid that goes wrong.', 'Justine, 40, is struggling to reconcile her family life and her job as a police officer in the serious-crimes squad. Then she''s accused of stealing money during a raid that goes wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdfvBo8IkAqoQeuSxxxEmvXJpy8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641561'),
  ('950267651423372330', 'Poison', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Sacha Guitry, François Gir, Jean Bachelet', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Michel Simon, Jean Debucourt, Jacques Varennes, Germaine Reuver, Marcelle Arnold, Georges Bever, Nicolas Amato, Jeanne Fusier-Gir', null, 'Paul Braconnier and his wife Blandine only have one thing in mind: to find a way to kill each other without risk. After listening to a radio show, Paul decides to go to Paris to meet a famous lawyer in the acquittal of the murderers. He tells the lawyer that he killed his wife. The lawyer asks Paul to reconstruct the circumstances of the drama. Without knowing it, he explains, in spite of himself, the way for Paul to murder his wife by putting the odds on his side to avoid death penalty or even be released...', 'Paul Braconnier and his wife Blandine only have one thing in mind: to find a way to kill each other without risk. After listening to a radio show, Paul decides to go to Paris to meet a famous lawyer in the acquittal of the murderers. He tells the lawyer that he killed his wife. The lawyer asks Paul to reconstruct the circumstances of the drama. Without knowing it, he explains, in spite of himself, the way for Paul to murder his wife by putting the odds on his side to avoid death penalty or even be released...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/supFTAz1bryBrTAHw7cOMDbD1TF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65534'),
  ('255546015595731409', 'Poison', 2017, 'Drama', 'Diego Olivares, Andrea Locatelli', 'Diego Olivares, Marcello Olivieri, Gaetano Di Vaio', 'Massimiliano Gallo, Luisa Ranieri, Salvatore Esposito, Miriam Candurro, Gennaro Di Colandrea, Nando Paone, Marianna Robustelli, Enzo Casertano', null, 'Two brothers who own a buffalo farm near Caserta attempt to resist the pressures of local mobsters who want to turn their land into an illegal landfill.', 'Two brothers who own a buffalo farm near Caserta attempt to resist the pressures of local mobsters who want to turn their land into an illegal landfill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyoUdW1bH6idRZwD6HEDd5KzRbc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474587'),
