  ('874408443597437293', 'Poison', 2026, 'Drama', 'Robertas Kuliūnas, Zivile Strazinskaite, Audinga Navickienė, Simonas Šaineris', 'Robertas Kuliūnas, Ilona Madelaine', 'Jurgita Jurkutė, Vytautas Rumšas Jaunesnysis, Kęstutis Cicėnas, Milda Gecaitė, Larisa Kalpokaitė', null, 'Elze, a young aspiring painter, moves to Lithuanian country side in hopes to find her freedom and leave her past behind. There she meets a local guy Nojus. Love story starts evolving between the two all while the past starts chasing her.', 'Elze, a young aspiring painter, moves to Lithuanian country side in hopes to find her freedom and leave her past behind. There she meets a local guy Nojus. Love story starts evolving between the two all while the past starts chasing her.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F7qpmvDnmJlJFPKVNYjJtRYzRrUk.jpg', 'plex:movie:poison-2026'),
  ('50904571853230318', 'Poison Berry in my Brain', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Toshiyuki Mihashi, Yuichi Satoh, Motonobu Kiyoku', 'Tomoko Aizawa', 'Yoko Maki, Yuki Furukawa, Songha, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Yoh Yoshida, Hiyori Sakurada, Kazuyuki Asano', null, 'Ichiko is a 30-year-old unemployed woman. She meets Ryoichi at a drinking establishment. Even though he is a lot younger than her, she can''t forget him. Meanwhile, Ichiko has 5 different characters in her brain that governs her actions. The 5 characters are Yoshida, Ishibashi, Ikeda, Hatoko and Kishi. These 5 character then have a fierce meeting. Yoshida presides over the meeting as the chairman. Ishibashi is the optimist. Ikeda is the pessimist. Hatoko is the character that lives in the moment and Kishi thinks about the past.', 'Ichiko is a 30-year-old unemployed woman. She meets Ryoichi at a drinking establishment. Even though he is a lot younger than her, she can''t forget him. Meanwhile, Ichiko has 5 different characters in her brain that governs her actions. The 5 characters are Yoshida, Ishibashi, Ikeda, Hatoko and Kishi. These 5 character then have a fierce meeting. Yoshida presides over the meeting as the chairman. Ishibashi is the optimist. Ikeda is the pessimist. Hatoko is the character that lives in the moment and Kishi thinks about the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6f51KQ4RicAT54LKzzDz8oELJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352694'),
  ('244030711933126603', 'Poison for the Fairies', 1986, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Carlos Enrique Taboada, Elvia Casillas, Jesús Marín', 'Carlos Enrique Taboada', 'Ana Patricia Rojo, Elsa Maria Gutierrez, Leonor Llausás, Carmela Stein, Maria Santander, Ernesto Schwartz, Lilia Aragón, Hilda Perez Carbajal', null, 'In 1965 Mexico City, Flavia, a wealthy yet lonely schoolgirl, befriends Veronica, a young orphan girl who has a fascination with witchcraft. Veronica convinces Flavia that she is a real witch and forces her to be her assistant. The children''s games gradually become more serious and Veronica demands more from Flavia.', 'In 1965 Mexico City, Flavia, a wealthy yet lonely schoolgirl, befriends Veronica, a young orphan girl who has a fascination with witchcraft. Veronica convinces Flavia that she is a real witch and forces her to be her assistant. The children''s games gradually become more serious and Veronica demands more from Flavia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kYZzOWDpnWtR6Z3h3MY5kf268o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28968'),
  ('440623236648979257', 'Poison Friends', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Emmanuel Bourdieu, Yorick Le Saux', 'Emmanuel Bourdieu, Marcia Romano', 'Malik Zidi, Thibault Vinçon, Alexandre Steiger, Thomas Blanchard, Dominique Blanc, Yves Arnaud, Natacha Régnier, Jacques Bonnaffé', null, 'A group of college students are duped by a charming pathological liar.', 'A group of college students are duped by a charming pathological liar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a59h79PjVcSeEfH36DKcyKMd1xh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104726'),
