  ('88837132271393873', 'Poison Ivy', 1992, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Katt Shea, Phedon Papamichael, Merritt Yohnka', 'Andy Ruben, Katt Shea', 'Drew Barrymore, Tom Skerritt, Sara Gilbert, Cheryl Ladd, Alan Stock, Jeanne Sakata, E.J. Moore, J.B. Quon', 'R', 'A seductive teen befriends an introverted high school student and schemes her way into the lives of her wealthy family.', 'A seductive teen befriends an introverted high school student and schemes her way into the lives of her wealthy family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pYkklZMMD00B00jDT5PHvN0Dhm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9264'),
