  ('1136990685751606284', 'Poison Ivy: The New Seduction', 1997, 'Thriller, Romance, Drama', 'Kurt Voss, Zoran Hochstätter, Cellin Gluck', 'Karen Kelly', 'Jaime Pressly, Megan Edwards, Michael Des Barres, Greg Vaughan, Merete Van Kamp, Athena Massey, Shanna Moakler, Susan Ward', 'R', 'A sinister seductress vows to destroy a suburban family.', 'A sinister seductress vows to destroy a suburban family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9Z43sz0qjTrmDjXRlChIVoH1JB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18222'),
