  ('346604782754580706', 'Poisoned: The Dirty Truth About Your Food', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Stephanie Soechtig', 'Jeff Benedict', 'Bill Marler, Darin Detwiler, Dr. John Kobayashi, Lance Price, Ph.D., Robert Nugent, Vicki Detwiler, Marion Nestle, Timothy Lytton', 'R', 'Through revealing interviews with experts and victims'' families, this gripping documentary examines the problem of deadly foodborne illness in the US.', 'Through revealing interviews with experts and victims'' families, this gripping documentary examines the problem of deadly foodborne illness in the US.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2s6Pe9l2NJMFDiscCIx7DwjDJMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115191'),
  ('694586062614631928', 'Poisonous Women', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nikos Zervos, Andreas Marianos, Neofytos Nikolaidis', 'Nikos Zervos', 'Spiros Papadopoulos, Ilias Logothetis, Nadia Mourouzi, Athina Tsilyra, Giannis Karatzogiannis, Valeria Christodoulidou, Alkis Panagiotidis, Yiolanta Balaoura', null, 'It is a story of a normal, everyday Greek family that each member turns out to be wacko or gets wacko by the other members. The father is the stoic figure that accepts everything. The mother has a middle age crisis and takes advantage of her husbands inability. The older brother is a doctor of psychology and has everything under control (or believe so) and the younger brother does nothing with his life acclaiming that he is a filmmaker.', 'It is a story of a normal, everyday Greek family that each member turns out to be wacko or gets wacko by the other members. The father is the stoic figure that accepts everything. The mother has a middle age crisis and takes advantage of her husbands inability. The older brother is a doctor of psychology and has everything under control (or believe so) and the younger brother does nothing with his life acclaiming that he is a filmmaker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8fuV6CZa21cCXqZt8iwAYlED6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47708'),
  ('1039244096897743747', 'Pokémon 3: The Movie', 2000, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Action, Family', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Hisashi Kagawa, Yoshiyuki Ito', 'Takeshi Shudo, Kunihiko Yuyama', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Yuji Ueda, Mayumi Izuka, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama, Naoto Takenaka', 'G', 'When the sadness of her father''s disappearance gets to Molly Hale, she unknowingly uses the Unown to create her own dream world along with Entei, who she believes to be her father. When Entei kidnaps Ash''s mother, Ash — alongside Misty and Brock — invade the mansion looking for his mom and trying to stop the mysteries of Molly''s Dream World and Entei!', 'When the sadness of her father''s disappearance gets to Molly Hale, she unknowingly uses the Unown to create her own dream world along with Entei, who she believes to be her father. When Entei kidnaps Ash''s mother, Ash — alongside Misty and Brock — invade the mansion looking for his mom and trying to stop the mysteries of Molly''s Dream World and Entei!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrBWiMWnD7mheMx846ycUWA3ohs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10991'),
  ('1000720646953446023', 'Pokémon 4Ever', 2001, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction, Family', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Hisao Shirai', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Unsho Ishizuka, Mayumi Izuka, Yuji Ueda, Tomokazu Seki, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki', 'G', 'In order to escape a greedy Pokémon hunter, Celebi must use the last of its energy to travel through time to the present day. Celebi brings along Sammy, a boy who had been trying to protect it. Along with Ash, Pikachu, and the rest of the gang, Sammy and Celebi must encounter an enemy far more advanced than the hunter, with the fate of the forest hanging in the balance.', 'In order to escape a greedy Pokémon hunter, Celebi must use the last of its energy to travel through time to the present day. Celebi brings along Sammy, a boy who had been trying to protect it. Along with Ash, Pikachu, and the rest of the gang, Sammy and Celebi must encounter an enemy far more advanced than the hunter, with the fate of the forest hanging in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thz83PS9twtVBEEAM59J1bh75nU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12600'),
  ('262946490898482163', 'Pokémon Chronicles: The Legend of Thunder!', 2001, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Norihiro Matsubara, Takaya Mizutani, Masamitsu Hidaka', 'Atsuhiro Tomioka', 'Kazusa Murai, Kenji Nojima, Yukiji, Ayako Shiraishi, Chinami Nishimura, Daiki Nakamura, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Hidetoshi Nakamura', null, 'Kenta, a Pokemon master in the making, meets up with his childhood friend, Marina, at a Pokemon Center, to see how their skills have developed. Their battle is interrupted by a thunderstorm and the arrival of Bashou and Buson, two Rocket-dan members using the Crystal System (which attracts Electric-type Pokemon). Their ultimate goal is to, under the guidance of professor Shiranui, bring Pokemon back to Sakaki. Kenta and Marina stumble upon this plan, and they try to stop it, but things get more difficult when the legendary Pokemon Raikou is captured.', 'Kenta, a Pokemon master in the making, meets up with his childhood friend, Marina, at a Pokemon Center, to see how their skills have developed. Their battle is interrupted by a thunderstorm and the arrival of Bashou and Buson, two Rocket-dan members using the Crystal System (which attracts Electric-type Pokemon). Their ultimate goal is to, under the guidance of professor Shiranui, bring Pokemon back to Sakaki. Kenta and Marina stumble upon this plan, and they try to stop it, but things get more difficult when the legendary Pokemon Raikou is captured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5V4RQvyYlz8HY9piw1ctsXiUKdc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295613'),
  ('962831139336026450', 'Pokémon Detective Pikachu', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Cliff Lanning, Dan John, Stephen Woolfenden', 'Dan Hernandez, Benji Samit, Derek Connolly', 'Ryan Reynolds, Justice Smith, Kathryn Newton, Bill Nighy, Ken Watanabe, Chris Geere, Suki Waterhouse, Josette Simon', 'PG', 'In a world where people collect pocket-size monsters (Pokémon) to do battle, a boy comes across an intelligent monster who seeks to be a detective.', 'In a world where people collect pocket-size monsters (Pokémon) to do battle, a boy comes across an intelligent monster who seeks to be a detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhWvnFgg3BNlcUz0Re1HfQqIcCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447404'),
  ('812556687141014987', 'Pokémon Heroes', 2002, 'Animation, Adventure, Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Hisao Shirai', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Mayumi Izuka, Yuji Ueda, Satomi Korogi, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'G', 'Ash, Pikachu and the gang try and stop a pair of thieves hiding out in the canals and alleyways of Altomare, the age-old water capital. Joining the adventure are two new legendary Pokémon, a pair of siblings named Latias and Latios, who serve as peacekeepers and protectors of the Soul Dew — a priceless treasure with a mysterious power.', 'Ash, Pikachu and the gang try and stop a pair of thieves hiding out in the canals and alleyways of Altomare, the age-old water capital. Joining the adventure are two new legendary Pokémon, a pair of siblings named Latias and Latios, who serve as peacekeepers and protectors of the Soul Dew — a priceless treasure with a mysterious power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eySv5rdYLW1k6LxepxCNl8ND26R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33875'),
  ('1004688664343803641', 'Pokémon Mystery Dungeon: Team Go-Getters out of the Gate!', 2006, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Yuji Asada, Akihiro Tamagawa, Yuji Asada', 'Aya Matsui', 'Sanae Kobayashi, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Yukana, Nobutoshi Canna, TARAKO, Michael Shitanda, Tomoe Hanba, Mika Kikuchi', null, 'Charmander''s voice calls out from the darkness if Squirtle is okay. The sleeping boy wakes up, and can''t believe himself when he sees a talking Charmander. Charmander then points out that he''s a Pokémon too. The boy takes a look at his reflection at a river besides him, and sees that it is true! He has turned into a Squirtle, and has no recollection at all how this had happened.', 'Charmander''s voice calls out from the darkness if Squirtle is okay. The sleeping boy wakes up, and can''t believe himself when he sees a talking Charmander. Charmander then points out that he''s a Pokémon too. The boy takes a look at his reflection at a river besides him, and sees that it is true! He has turned into a Squirtle, and has no recollection at all how this had happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mz7wjcHK8hO5NUaWMfVcAimy45A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613251'),
  ('52403041648287006', 'Pokémon Ranger and the Temple of the Sea', 2006, 'Family, Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Katsuyoshi Kanemura, Takuya Matsumoto', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Yuji Ueda, KAORI, Fushigi Yamada, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'G', 'On their way through the Battle Frontier, Ash and friends meet up with a Pokémon Ranger who''s mission is to deliever the egg of Manaphy to a temple on the ocean''s floor. However, a greedy pirate wants the power of Manaphy to himself.', 'On their way through the Battle Frontier, Ash and friends meet up with a Pokémon Ranger who''s mission is to deliever the egg of Manaphy to a temple on the ocean''s floor. However, a greedy pirate wants the power of Manaphy to himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZOi06xHjsG1VqbiIwS8GkyrAOn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16808'),
  ('92856682117230459', 'Pokémon the Movie 2000', 1999, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction, Family', 'Masafumi Mima, Kunihiko Yuyama, Keisuke Masunaga', 'Takeshi Shudo', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Mayumi Izuka, Satomi Korogi, Tomokazu Seki, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'G', 'When Lawrence III''s scheme to capture the Legendary Pokémon Lugia upsets the balance of nature, it is up to Ash Ketchum and his friends to save the world.', 'When Lawrence III''s scheme to capture the Legendary Pokémon Lugia upsets the balance of nature, it is up to Ash Ketchum and his friends to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6u65C8aG4krAVyHsTjAMF7ucTDH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12599'),
  ('32615130525840467', 'Pokémon the Movie: Black - Victini and Reshiram', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Akio Takami, Kunihiko Yuyama, Shinsuke Ikeda', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Aoi Yuuki, Minami Tsuda, Mamoru Miyano, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'G', 'The Kingdom of the People of the Earth once ruled over the land, but now all that remains is the Sword of the Earth. in the city of Eindoak. Satoshi, Iris, and Dent arrive in Eindoak during a harvest festival''s Pokémon Tournament and meet the legendary Pokémon Victini who wishes to share its powers of victory to someone. Elsewhere in the city, a descendant of the People of the Earth named Dred Grangil has arrived who seeks to revive the kingdom''s power with the Sword of the Earth, bringing them back into power over the land, and Satoshi and his friends must stop him before he destroys the land along with Victini.', 'The Kingdom of the People of the Earth once ruled over the land, but now all that remains is the Sword of the Earth. in the city of Eindoak. Satoshi, Iris, and Dent arrive in Eindoak during a harvest festival''s Pokémon Tournament and meet the legendary Pokémon Victini who wishes to share its powers of victory to someone. Elsewhere in the city, a descendant of the People of the Earth named Dred Grangil has arrived who seeks to revive the kingdom''s power with the Sword of the Earth, bringing them back into power over the land, and Satoshi and his friends must stop him before he destroys the land along with Victini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SuIAXmxlbImWHobCkCWCHAeg03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115223'),
  ('711266421462728151', 'Pokémon the Movie: Diancie and the Cocoon of Destruction', 2014, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Kazumi Sato, Kazuaki Mori', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Mayuki Makiguchi, Yuki Kaji, Mariya Ise, Megumi Satou, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki', 'PG', 'In the underground Diamond Domain, where many Carbink live, the Mythical Pokémon Diancie serves as ruler. The Heart Diamond that sustains the land is beginning to fall apart, and Diancie is not yet strong enough to create a new one. While seeking help from the Legendary Pokémon Xerneas, Diancie encounters a group of thieves who want to take control of its diamond-producing power–and who awaken the Legendary Pokémon Yveltal from its cocoon in the process! Can Ash and his friends help Diancie discover its true power, stop Yveltal’s rampage, and save the Diamond Domain?', 'In the underground Diamond Domain, where many Carbink live, the Mythical Pokémon Diancie serves as ruler. The Heart Diamond that sustains the land is beginning to fall apart, and Diancie is not yet strong enough to create a new one. While seeking help from the Legendary Pokémon Xerneas, Diancie encounters a group of thieves who want to take control of its diamond-producing power–and who awaken the Legendary Pokémon Yveltal from its cocoon in the process! Can Ash and his friends help Diancie discover its true power, stop Yveltal’s rampage, and save the Diamond Domain?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rA0KbJZbBt2fMmZs8bwPZnzFfDc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303903'),
  ('662099588025299540', 'Pokémon the Movie: Genesect and the Legend Awakened', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Masakatsu Iijima, Kojin Ochi', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Aoi Yuuki, Minami Tsuda, Mamoru Miyano, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'PG', 'A group of five Genesect have invaded the big city and pose a threat to the supply of electricity, which attracts the attention of the legendary Pokémon Mewtwo. Satoshi, Pikachu and his friends must come to the rescue when the powerful leader, a red Genesect, faces Mewtwo.', 'A group of five Genesect have invaded the big city and pose a threat to the supply of electricity, which attracts the attention of the legendary Pokémon Mewtwo. Satoshi, Pikachu and his friends must come to the rescue when the powerful leader, a red Genesect, faces Mewtwo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l921PT8ZDeAD4YWDaB5Uke89r9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227679'),
  ('330741476307777749', 'Pokémon the Movie: Hoopa and the Clash of Ages', 2015, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Tatsumi Yukiwaki, Kunihiko Yuyama, Masafumi Mima', 'Atsuhiro Tomioka', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Mayuki Makiguchi, Yuki Kaji, Mariya Ise, Megumi Satou, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki', 'G', 'Ash, Pikachu, and their friends come to a desert city by the sea. Here they meet the Mythical Pokémon Hoopa, which has the ability to summon things—including people and Pokémon—through its magic rings. After a scary incident, they learn of a story about a brave hero who stopped the rampage of a terrifying Pokémon long ago. Now, the threat that has been bottled up for years is in danger of breaking loose again.', 'Ash, Pikachu, and their friends come to a desert city by the sea. Here they meet the Mythical Pokémon Hoopa, which has the ability to summon things—including people and Pokémon—through its magic rings. After a scary incident, they learn of a story about a brave hero who stopped the rampage of a terrifying Pokémon long ago. Now, the threat that has been bottled up for years is in danger of breaking loose again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kXRevMC1XSywmxqqRHuBcZlROT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350499'),
  ('171136635915888961', 'Pokémon the Movie: I Choose You!', 2017, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Kaori Yoshikawa, Taka Satou, Shuichi Kitayama', 'Shouji Yonemura', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama, Unsho Ishizuka, Masami Toyoshima, Shoko Nakagawa', 'NR', 'Ash Ketchum wakes up late one morning after having broken his alarm clock in his sleep. He eventually makes it to Professor Oak''s lab, but is told that the three starter List of Pokémon (Bulbasaur, Squirtle, and Charmander) have already been taken by Trainers who were on time. However, Oak reveals that he has one more Pokémon, an Electric-type named Pikachu. Despite its volatile and feisty personality, as well as its refusal to get inside a Poké Ball, Ash happily takes Pikachu for his journey.', 'Ash Ketchum wakes up late one morning after having broken his alarm clock in his sleep. He eventually makes it to Professor Oak''s lab, but is told that the three starter List of Pokémon (Bulbasaur, Squirtle, and Charmander) have already been taken by Trainers who were on time. However, Oak reveals that he has one more Pokémon, an Electric-type named Pikachu. Despite its volatile and feisty personality, as well as its refusal to get inside a Poké Ball, Ash happily takes Pikachu for his journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vWiCtO1pa0oSG6QTyVKd8eyLLk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436931'),
  ('916129700727950775', 'Pokémon the Movie: Kyurem vs. the Sword of Justice', 2012, 'Family, Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Shinsuke Ikeda, Kyouko Takeuchi', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Aoi Yuuki, Minami Tsuda, Mamoru Miyano, Chika Fujimura, Kenta Miyake, Unsho Ishizuka', 'G', 'Ash and his two friends Iris and Cilan help a Keldeo battle against a powerful Dragon-type Pokémon named Kyurem its his test to become a Sacred Swordsman.', 'Ash and his two friends Iris and Cilan help a Keldeo battle against a powerful Dragon-type Pokémon named Kyurem its his test to become a Sacred Swordsman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gQEAR8aaCQRtJi7wq26ST5hukn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150213'),
  ('115746861465157606', 'Pokémon the Movie: Mewtwo Strikes Back - Evolution', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Family', 'Motonori Sakakibara, Masafumi Mima, Kunihiko Yuyama', 'Takeshi Shudo, Kunihiko Yuyama', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Mayumi Izuka, Satomi Korogi, Yuji Ueda, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'PG', 'After accepting an invitation from a mysterious trainer, Ash, Misty and Brock meet Mewtwo, an artificially created Pokémon who wants to do battle.', 'After accepting an invitation from a mysterious trainer, Ash, Misty and Brock meet Mewtwo, an artificially created Pokémon who wants to do battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtlyO2oIMcCx2DbOM52XO2rAcgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571891'),
  ('903481816867328426', 'Pokémon the Movie: Secrets of the Jungle', 2020, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Nazuna Okamura, Miwa Katayama, Takayuki Shimura', 'Atsuhiro Tomioka', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Moka Kamishiraishi, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama, Kantarô Nakamura, Shoko Nakagawa', 'G', 'In the Forest of Okoya, Koko is a feral child who has been raised as a Pokémon by the Mythical Pokémon Zarude. Koko has grown up never doubting that he is a Pokémon even though he can''t really use any sort of moves. Ash Ketchum and Pikachu meet Koko and help him protect the Great Tree from the crooked scientist Dr. Zed.', 'In the Forest of Okoya, Koko is a feral child who has been raised as a Pokémon by the Mythical Pokémon Zarude. Koko has grown up never doubting that he is a Pokémon even though he can''t really use any sort of moves. Ash Ketchum and Pikachu meet Koko and help him protect the Great Tree from the crooked scientist Dr. Zed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ow7PJcAHMMxgSIjCW6RnRqE9OA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662708'),
  ('639005312193512577', 'Pokémon the Movie: The Power of Us', 2018, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Miyako Ota, Yasushi Nishiya, Yasushi Nishiya', 'Aya Takaha, Eiji Umehara', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama, Unsho Ishizuka, Rina Kawaei, Koji Ohkura', 'G', 'A young athlete whose running days might be behind her, a compulsive liar, a shy researcher, a bitter old woman, and a little girl with a big secret—the only thing they have in common is the annual Wind Festival in Fula City. The festival celebrates the Legendary Pokémon Lugia, who brings the wind that powers this seaside city. When a series of threats endangers not just the festival, but all the people and Pokémon of Fula City, it’ll take more than just Satoshi and Pikachu to save the day! Can everyone put aside their differences and work together—or will it all end in destruction?', 'A young athlete whose running days might be behind her, a compulsive liar, a shy researcher, a bitter old woman, and a little girl with a big secret—the only thing they have in common is the annual Wind Festival in Fula City. The festival celebrates the Legendary Pokémon Lugia, who brings the wind that powers this seaside city. When a series of threats endangers not just the festival, but all the people and Pokémon of Fula City, it’ll take more than just Satoshi and Pikachu to save the day! Can everyone put aside their differences and work together—or will it all end in destruction?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oXKbOQOsPaLscHCqHjvi7hegOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494407'),
  ('1137111888656571719', 'Pokémon the Movie: Volcanion and the Mechanical Marvel', 2016, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Shinsuke Ikeda, Satoshi Nakano, Kazumi Sato', 'Atsuhiro Tomioka', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Mayuki Makiguchi, Yuki Kaji, Mariya Ise, Megumi Satou, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki', 'G', 'Ash meets the Mythical Pokémon Volcanion when it crashes down from the sky, creating a cloud of dust—and a mysterious force binds the two of them together! Volcanion despises humans and tries to get away, but it’s forced to drag Ash along as it continues its rescue mission. They arrive in a city of cogs and gears, where a corrupt official has stolen the ultimate invention: the Artificial Pokémon Magearna, created 500 years ago. He plans to use its mysterious power to take control of this mechanical kingdom! Can Ash and Volcanion work together to rescue Magearna? One of the greatest battles in Pokémon history is about to unfold!', 'Ash meets the Mythical Pokémon Volcanion when it crashes down from the sky, creating a cloud of dust—and a mysterious force binds the two of them together! Volcanion despises humans and tries to get away, but it’s forced to drag Ash along as it continues its rescue mission. They arrive in a city of cogs and gears, where a corrupt official has stolen the ultimate invention: the Artificial Pokémon Magearna, created 500 years ago. He plans to use its mysterious power to take control of this mechanical kingdom! Can Ash and Volcanion work together to rescue Magearna? One of the greatest battles in Pokémon history is about to unfold!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hdbuM6qBrHH0hX4sD8pNsXmalm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382190'),
  ('973690370802504866', 'Pokémon the Movie: White - Victini and Zekrom', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Yoko Kutsuzawa, Akio Takami, Kunihiko Yuyama', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Aoi Yuuki, Minami Tsuda, Mamoru Miyano, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'G', 'The Kingdom of the People of the Earth once ruled over the land, but now all that remains is the Sword of the Earth. in the city of Eindoak. Satoshi, Iris, and Dent arrive in Eindoak during a harvest festival''s Pokémon Tournament and meet the legendary Pokémon Victini who wishes to share its powers of victory to someone. Elsewhere in the city, a descendant of the People of the Earth named Dred Grangil has arrived who seeks to revive the kingdom''s power with the Sword of the Earth, bringing them back into power over the land, and Satoshi and his friends must stop him before he destroys the land along with Victini.', 'The Kingdom of the People of the Earth once ruled over the land, but now all that remains is the Sword of the Earth. in the city of Eindoak. Satoshi, Iris, and Dent arrive in Eindoak during a harvest festival''s Pokémon Tournament and meet the legendary Pokémon Victini who wishes to share its powers of victory to someone. Elsewhere in the city, a descendant of the People of the Earth named Dred Grangil has arrived who seeks to revive the kingdom''s power with the Sword of the Earth, bringing them back into power over the land, and Satoshi and his friends must stop him before he destroys the land along with Victini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/J5AsLGUAqMgq0MjoyWldqqMPs1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88557'),
  ('896733585680658777', 'Pokémon: Arceus and the Jewel of Life', 2009, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Kazumi Sato, Hiromi Niioka', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Yuji Ueda, Megumi Toyoguchi, Etsuko Kozakura, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'G', 'When the creator of the world, Arceus, comes to pass judgement on humanity for the theft of the legendary Jewel of Life, Ash and his friends are sent back in time to possibly reverse the events that led to Arceus'' vendetta.', 'When the creator of the world, Arceus, comes to pass judgement on humanity for the theft of the legendary Jewel of Life, Ash and his friends are sent back in time to possibly reverse the events that led to Arceus'' vendetta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpqguVMKyPbINe0GYmMwduoaUar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39057'),
  ('1148033342906299916', 'Pokémon: Destiny Deoxys', 2004, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Masahiko Watanabe, Rie Nakashima', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, KAORI, Yuji Ueda, Fushigi Yamada, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'PG', 'Deoxys, a Pokémon from outer space, terrorizes the high-tech city Ash Ketchum and his friends are visiting.', 'Deoxys, a Pokémon from outer space, terrorizes the high-tech city Ash Ketchum and his friends are visiting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UV4evNh70gvPZB9KJEoh3a9B6I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34065'),
  ('178502367803225020', 'Pokémon: Giratina and the Sky Warrior', 2008, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Kunihiko Yuyama', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Yuji Ueda, Megumi Toyoguchi, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama, Yuriko Yamaguchi', 'G', 'When Giratina is discovered to be able to create parallel dimensions, it''s up to Ash and his friends to stop a mysterious stranger from using its powers for evil.', 'When Giratina is discovered to be able to create parallel dimensions, it''s up to Ash and his friends to stop a mysterious stranger from using its powers for evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3T08IL68EVcrUPiJLVN9KSGlXs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47292'),
  ('258746337070467271', 'Pokémon: Gotta Dance!', 2003, 'Fantasy, Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Sayuri Ichiishi, Yuji Asada', 'Yukiyoshi Ôhashi', 'Ikue Otani, Chinami Nishimura, Yuji Ueda, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama, Miyako Ito, Chie Sato', null, 'Meowth is in charge of the Team Rocket secret base, a mysterious place full of odd gadgets and gizmos. Desperate to impress the boss, Meowth wants to use the Dancing PokéBaton—a device that lets users control Pokémon as they please—to create a show that’s sure to wow. Meanwhile, Pikachu and its friends finish up playing in the forest and stumble on the base. The gang hears Whismur, the Whisper Pokémon, crying for help—but when they try to make their rescue, the Dancing PokéBaton goes off and sends the whole group into a dancing frenzy! When a noise-loving Loudred and Ludicolo get caught up in the dancing, the madness gets even wilder! What’s going to happen to Meowth’s precious secret base?', 'Meowth is in charge of the Team Rocket secret base, a mysterious place full of odd gadgets and gizmos. Desperate to impress the boss, Meowth wants to use the Dancing PokéBaton—a device that lets users control Pokémon as they please—to create a show that’s sure to wow. Meanwhile, Pikachu and its friends finish up playing in the forest and stumble on the base. The gang hears Whismur, the Whisper Pokémon, crying for help—but when they try to make their rescue, the Dancing PokéBaton goes off and sends the whole group into a dancing frenzy! When a noise-loving Loudred and Ludicolo get caught up in the dancing, the madness gets even wilder! What’s going to happen to Meowth’s precious secret base?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dHhXEVT02zERFXKlHMgMGEGczR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351802'),
  ('186725065536913156', 'Pokémon: Jirachi - Wish Maker', 2003, 'Family, Action, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Koji Fukasawa, Noriyuki Suto, Yuji Asada', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Yuji Ueda, KAORI, Fushigi Yamada, Ikue Otani, Tomiko Suzuki, Shin-ichiro Miki, Megumi Hayashibara', 'PG', 'Ash, May, Brock, and Max come upon the festival of the Wishing Star of Seven Nights. During their enjoyment, the legendary Pokemon--Jirachi, descends from the heavens and befriends Max. Jirachi, with the power to grant any wish, is sought after by many people wanting to claim its power. One man seeks to use its legendary power to revive an ancient Pokemon known as Groudon, unaware of the dangers hidden within Jirachi''s powers', 'Ash, May, Brock, and Max come upon the festival of the Wishing Star of Seven Nights. During their enjoyment, the legendary Pokemon--Jirachi, descends from the heavens and befriends Max. Jirachi, with the power to grant any wish, is sought after by many people wanting to claim its power. One man seeks to use its legendary power to revive an ancient Pokemon known as Groudon, unaware of the dangers hidden within Jirachi''s powers', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbH0tIEymhyd6uk4xV4vrS6qybV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36218'),
  ('911847084835399790', 'Pokémon: Lucario and the Mystery of Mew', 2005, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Takuya Matsumoto, Masahiko Watanabe', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Yuji Ueda, KAORI, Fushigi Yamada, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'PG', 'In the legendary past, before Poké Balls were invented, an aura-guiding hero Pokémon named Lucario sensed two groups of armies about to clash, and a threat of a massive war in front of Oldoran Castle in Kanto that would leave no survivors. He transferred this message to his master, the legendary hero Arlon, while he was being attacked by a violent group of Hellgar. During the battle, his sense of sight was lost and he was rendered unable to see. He used the detection of his Aura, and so with the offensive Wave Bomb, he eliminated them. Though by the threat, the queen of Rota, Lady Rin was resolute to die with her civilians, and so Arlon made a choice.', 'In the legendary past, before Poké Balls were invented, an aura-guiding hero Pokémon named Lucario sensed two groups of armies about to clash, and a threat of a massive war in front of Oldoran Castle in Kanto that would leave no survivors. He transferred this message to his master, the legendary hero Arlon, while he was being attacked by a violent group of Hellgar. During the battle, his sense of sight was lost and he was rendered unable to see. He used the detection of his Aura, and so with the offensive Wave Bomb, he eliminated them. Though by the threat, the queen of Rota, Lady Rin was resolute to die with her civilians, and so Arlon made a choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3A3WiPXPmWVhXC7bGSiqtsYY9z6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34067'),
  ('260805699942424189', 'Pokémon: Mewtwo - Prologue to Awakening', 2013, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Kunihiko Yuyama', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Mamoru Miyano, Aoi Yuuki, Minami Tsuda, Unsho Ishizuka, Masaharu Sato, Chinami Nishimura', 'G', 'Mewtwo - Prologue to Awakening is a special episode of the Pokémon anime, serving as a prologue to Genesect and the Legend Awakened.', 'Mewtwo - Prologue to Awakening is a special episode of the Pokémon anime, serving as a prologue to Genesect and the Legend Awakened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26rgKiKAGXLCBt90cs5srV04IwE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249424'),
  ('694607059069640504', 'Pokémon: Mewtwo Returns', 2001, 'Animation, Family, Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Masamitsu Hidaka, Masafumi Mima, Yuji Asada', 'Takeshi Shudo', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Mayumi Izuka, Satomi Korogi, Yuji Ueda, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'G', 'The Team Rocket leader, Giovanni, has found Mewtwo in a remote area of the Johto region. As Giovanni tries to re-capture Mewtwo, Ash and his friends are kidnapped by Domino, a new Team Rocket member, while trying to rescue Pikachu from Jessie and James. The Clone Pokemon are also captured and are then used as bait for Mewtwo. The situation then becomes a battle between the wills of Mewtwo and Giovanni; and Mewtwo also tries to discover if it and the clones have a purpose in life, even though they are products of science.', 'The Team Rocket leader, Giovanni, has found Mewtwo in a remote area of the Johto region. As Giovanni tries to re-capture Mewtwo, Ash and his friends are kidnapped by Domino, a new Team Rocket member, while trying to rescue Pikachu from Jessie and James. The Clone Pokemon are also captured and are then used as bait for Mewtwo. The situation then becomes a battle between the wills of Mewtwo and Giovanni; and Mewtwo also tries to discover if it and the clones have a purpose in life, even though they are products of science.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIYljUBF2rXzB0yYZVEPY1l8zHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36897'),
  ('1077457069541338466', 'Pokémon: Pikachu''s Rescue Adventure', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Akihiro Tamagawa, Kunihiko Yuyama, Hisao Shirai', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Ikue Otani, Rikako Aikawa, Megumi Hayashibara, Inuko Inuyama, Mika Kanai, Katsuyuki Konishi, Etsuko Kozakura, Satomi Korogi', null, 'One day, Pikachu and its friends are walking along when they suddenly fall through a Diglett hole and into Pokémon Valley, a secret location that no one knows about. Pikachu and its buddies tell the Pokémon that they could use some help looking for Togepi, who fell through the hole first. The group sets off and eventually finds Togepi in the Exeggcute nest—but one of the Exeggcute is missing. That leads the group on another hunt; this time, though, Pikachu and its friends come back to the nest empty-handed. That’s when a storm begins to brew, filling Pokémon valley with roaring thunder and gusts of wind that almost blow the friends—and the Exeggcute nest—away! Are the friends going to be able to keep the nest safe and reunite the Exeggcute?', 'One day, Pikachu and its friends are walking along when they suddenly fall through a Diglett hole and into Pokémon Valley, a secret location that no one knows about. Pikachu and its buddies tell the Pokémon that they could use some help looking for Togepi, who fell through the hole first. The group sets off and eventually finds Togepi in the Exeggcute nest—but one of the Exeggcute is missing. That leads the group on another hunt; this time, though, Pikachu and its friends come back to the nest empty-handed. That’s when a storm begins to brew, filling Pokémon valley with roaring thunder and gusts of wind that almost blow the friends—and the Exeggcute nest—away! Are the friends going to be able to keep the nest safe and reunite the Exeggcute?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qsNVpLrCuls7RvXNguidWaObPB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36756'),
  ('271336153978393402', 'Pokémon: Pikachu''s Winter Vacation 2', 1999, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Kunihiko Yuyama', 'Yukiyoshi Ôhashi', 'Ikue Otani, Inuko Inuyama, Katsuyuki Konishi, Mami Koyama, Mayumi Izuka, Megumi Hayashibara, Mika Kanai, Rica Matsumoto', 'NR', 'When these Pokémon friends begin the holidays with Christmas quarreling, can Pikachu restore good cheer? Then, on a winter''s eve, when not even a trailer is stirring, the Pokémon are making a Yuletide discovery you won''t believe!', 'When these Pokémon friends begin the holidays with Christmas quarreling, can Pikachu restore good cheer? Then, on a winter''s eve, when not even a trailer is stirring, the Pokémon are making a Yuletide discovery you won''t believe!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKpaul4cXgQJH6wt5H3WrJp71UJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268998'),
  ('321961096752557287', 'Pokémon: The First Movie', 1998, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Izumi Shimura, Masaru Fukumoto', 'Takeshi Shudo', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Mayumi Izuka, Satomi Korogi, Yuji Ueda, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'G', 'Determined to prove its superiority, a bio-engineered Pokémon called Mewtwo lures Ash, Pikachu and others into a Pokemon match like none before.', 'Determined to prove its superiority, a bio-engineered Pokémon called Mewtwo lures Ash, Pikachu and others into a Pokemon match like none before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPW3AeK3iQi1Zd9dCbdNLijE48o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10228'),
  ('105098933135241909', 'Pokémon: The Mastermind of Mirage Pokémon', 2006, 'TV Movie, Animation, Action, Adventure', 'Kazumi Sato, Masafumi Mima, Yoshizo Tsuda', 'Shinzo Fujita', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Yuji Ueda, KAORI, Fushigi Yamada, Unsho Ishizuka, Mayumi Izuka, Megumi Hayashibara', 'NR', 'The story of "The Mastermind of Mirage Pokémon" centers on a Pokémon scientist who has developed a new Mirage System to resurrect extinct Pokémon. Satoshi, Haruka, Masato, and Takeshi show up at the Mirage Mansion for a demonstration of this new machine, only to witness the kidnapping of the scientist! Then a mysterious stranger appears and claims that the machine can actually create Pokémon without weaknesses. It’s up to Satoshi and company to preserve the natural balance of the Pokémon world.', 'The story of "The Mastermind of Mirage Pokémon" centers on a Pokémon scientist who has developed a new Mirage System to resurrect extinct Pokémon. Satoshi, Haruka, Masato, and Takeshi show up at the Mirage Mansion for a demonstration of this new machine, only to witness the kidnapping of the scientist! Then a mysterious stranger appears and claims that the machine can actually create Pokémon without weaknesses. It’s up to Satoshi and company to preserve the natural balance of the Pokémon world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJU76t41sf5BoKVHT3L3TtQP9xs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137773'),
  ('277665474547835174', 'Pokémon: The Rise of Darkrai', 2007, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Takuya Matsumoto, Hiroaki Yoshikawa', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Yuji Ueda, Megumi Toyoguchi, Megumi Hayashibara, Ryuji Akiyama, Kiyotaka Furushima, Inuko Inuyama', 'G', 'Ash and friends (this time accompanied by newcomer Dawn) arrive at an idyllic village on their way to their next Pokemon contest, where chaos will soon erupt with the prophecy of two Pokemon Gods (Dialga and Palkia) and the arrival of a mysterious, seemingly deadly Pokemon named Darkrai, which has the power to distort space and time.', 'Ash and friends (this time accompanied by newcomer Dawn) arrive at an idyllic village on their way to their next Pokemon contest, where chaos will soon erupt with the prophecy of two Pokemon Gods (Dialga and Palkia) and the arrival of a mysterious, seemingly deadly Pokemon named Darkrai, which has the power to distort space and time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yElGG6lxLtQXcgBVzF7Xxq7YRa2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25961'),
  ('706594934157032957', 'Pokémon: Zoroark - Master of Illusions', 2010, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Takuya Mizutani, Yuji Asada', 'Hideki Sonoda', 'Rica Matsumoto, Ikue Otani, Yuji Ueda, Megumi Toyoguchi, Etsuko Kozakura, Megumi Hayashibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Inuko Inuyama', 'G', 'Ash and his friends must stop a greedy media mogul from using the shape-shifting Zoroark to capture the time-travelling Celebi.', 'Ash and his friends must stop a greedy media mogul from using the shape-shifting Zoroark to capture the time-travelling Celebi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWgH64RZmm2rIHtO2DNnfN3DZa8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50087'),
  ('87284824077603957', 'Poker Face', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Russell Crowe, Aaron McLisky', 'Stephen M. Coates, Russell Crowe', 'Russell Crowe, Liam Hemsworth, RZA, Brooke Satchwell, Aden Young, Steve Bastoni, Daniel MacPherson, Elsa Pataky', 'PG-13', 'A yearly high-stakes poker game between childhood friends turns into chaos when the tech billionaire host unveils an elaborate scheme to seek revenge for the ways they''ve betrayed him over the years. But as his plans unfold, a group of thieves hatch plans of their own breaking into the mansion thinking it is empty. The old friends quickly band together and the years of playing the game help them win their way through a night of terror.', 'A yearly high-stakes poker game between childhood friends turns into chaos when the tech billionaire host unveils an elaborate scheme to seek revenge for the ways they''ve betrayed him over the years. But as his plans unfold, a group of thieves hatch plans of their own breaking into the mansion thinking it is empty. The old friends quickly band together and the years of playing the game help them win their way through a night of terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8a2MIBV9LuPYbF5rOEAohjjMz9P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842934'),
  ('615080960041557829', 'Poker in Bed', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Giuliano Carnimeo, Federico Zanni', 'Tito Carpi, Carlo Giuffrè', 'Carlo Giuffrè, Edwige Fenech, Carlo Delle Piane, Oreste Lionello, Enzo Cannavale, Enzo Andronico, Franca Valeri, Gigi Ballista', null, 'A poker player on a losing streak meets a beautiful young woman. He''s attracted to her, but she appears to be perfectly content with her boyfriend, a somewhat wussy writer. The gambler gets the idea that if he can get this woman into bed, it will change his luck at the gambling tables.', 'A poker player on a losing streak meets a beautiful young woman. He''s attracted to her, but she appears to be perfectly content with her boyfriend, a somewhat wussy writer. The gambler gets the idea that if he can get this woman into bed, it will change his luck at the gambling tables.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g50vrTqkWQwnSvCsrTgVUdtLDMh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179178'),
  ('350345296321665715', 'Poker King', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Chan Hing-Kai, Janet Chun Siu-Chun, Horace Wong Wing-Hang', 'Chan Hing-Kai, Janet Chun Siu-Chun, Debbie Lam Suk-Yin', 'Louis Koo, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Stephy Tang Lai-Yan, Josie Ho, Cherrie Ying Choi-Yi, Jo Kok Cho-Lam, Wong Yau-Nam, Kama Law', null, 'Although Randy''s family is involved in the casino business, he has never shared an interest in gaming until he played Texas Hold ''Em on the Internet. Rival Uno is the manager at Randy''s casion. These two bitter enemies will now face off in the Asian Poker King Championships.', 'Although Randy''s family is involved in the casino business, he has never shared an interest in gaming until he played Texas Hold ''Em on the Internet. Rival Uno is the manager at Randy''s casion. These two bitter enemies will now face off in the Asian Poker King Championships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjc7xGWvoErE4iEcTo3EIcgoYoR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29977'),
  ('886036733874960626', 'Poker Night', 2014, 'Thriller, Action, Crime, Horror', 'Greg Francis, Brandon Cox', 'Greg Francis, Doug Buchanan', 'Beau Mirchoff, Ron Perlman, Giancarlo Esposito, Corey Large, Titus Welliver, Halston Sage, Ron Eldard, Michael Eklund', null, 'When a new detective is caught by a vicious psychopath and locked in a basement, he must use the knowledge he learned from some of the best detectives at Poker Night, then match wits against his captor.', 'When a new detective is caught by a vicious psychopath and locked in a basement, he must use the knowledge he learned from some of the best detectives at Poker Night, then match wits against his captor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMwrmcAxJ2CpDnPXZVXTRiw7tsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298093'),
  ('729231543872138994', 'Pokiri', 2006, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Puri Jagannadh', 'Puri Jagannadh', 'Mahesh Babu, Ileana D''Cruz, Prakash Raj, Nassar, Brahmanandam, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Sayaji Shinde, Subbaraju', null, 'Pandu is a contract killer and will accept any contract provided the amount is right. The police want him for questioning, while the underworld needs him to silence their opponents. No one really knows this assassin''s background. It is only Pandu who knows his real identity, and he has no intention of sharing it with anyone.', 'Pandu is a contract killer and will accept any contract provided the amount is right. The police want him for questioning, while the underworld needs him to silence their opponents. No one really knows this assassin''s background. It is only Pandu who knows his real identity, and he has no intention of sharing it with anyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQ8NH5f3CxRrmqZWMZNYPwLmjDS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23381'),
  ('1002194560908193843', 'Pokkiri', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Romance, Comedy', 'Prabhu Deva, Nirav Shah', 'Prabhu Deva', 'Vijay, Asin Thottumkal, Prakash Raj, Napoleon, Nassar, Sriman, Mukesh Tiwari, Vadivelu', null, 'Amidst gang warfare and police crackdowns, mob hitman Tamizh falls for Shruthi, a nice girl unaware of his true identity. But she may not be the only one Tamizh is hiding secrets from...', 'Amidst gang warfare and police crackdowns, mob hitman Tamizh falls for Shruthi, a nice girl unaware of his true identity. But she may not be the only one Tamizh is hiding secrets from...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuLSscvrnDcxE9e0peMGRHbY2IW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59872'),
  ('742503247190852411', 'Pol', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Rodolfo Espinosa, Melanie Dent', 'Rodolfo Espinosa', 'Chloe Figueroa, Alejandro Ramos, José Mariano Díaz Duarte', null, 'Pol is a 14-year-old girl who lives with her father and grandfather, who wants to send them to Russia. Pol must make copies of some documents for his grandfather and on his way he meets Flaco, a boy who is fleeing from another older man who is looking for him.', 'Pol is a 14-year-old girl who lives with her father and grandfather, who wants to send them to Russia. Pol must make copies of some documents for his grandfather and on his way he meets Flaco, a boy who is fleeing from another older man who is looking for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exaJzSqMO8mGLgPZ2VkIOajQZwd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:770192'),
  ('956804594613820029', 'Pola X', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Leos Carax, Eric Pech, Éric Gautier', 'Leos Carax, Jean-Pol Fargeau, Lauren Sedofsky', 'Guillaume Depardieu, Yekaterina Golubeva, Catherine Deneuve, Delphine Chuillot, Laurent Lucas, Patachou, Petruta Catana, Mihaella Silaghi', null, 'A writer leaves his upper-class life and journeys with a woman claiming to be his sister, and her two friends.', 'A writer leaves his upper-class life and journeys with a woman claiming to be his sister, and her two friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTmZlEoH03sNtaNeYbboB7vgn5j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35717'),
  ('409754230136578296', 'Polar Bear', 2017, 'Drama', 'Marcelo Tobar', 'Marcelo Tobar', 'Humberto Busto, Harold Torres, Luis Alberti, Veronica Toussaint, Marcelo Tobar, Fernando Álvarez Rebeil, Cristian Magaloni, Lilia Mendoza', null, 'Heriberto gives a lift to a school reunion to two friends (Flor and Trujillo). In the way, we find out that they were his worst bullies.', 'Heriberto gives a lift to a school reunion to two friends (Flor and Trujillo). In the way, we find out that they were his worst bullies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlWUAjXTi8fkokXHHuEjRxttwA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483494'),
  ('917718299724709466', 'Polar Bear', 2022, 'Documentary, Family', 'Alastair Fothergill, Jeff Wilson', null, 'Catherine Keener', 'PG', 'A new mother’s memories of her own youth prepare her to navigate motherhood in the increasingly challenging world that polar bears face today.', 'A new mother’s memories of her own youth prepare her to navigate motherhood in the increasingly challenging world that polar bears face today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCRUQcbBs6Ix6YaBeCgC9OwE0mt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927070'),
  ('982640815446955029', 'Polar Rescue', 2022, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Lo Chi-Leung, Tony Cheung Tung-Leung', 'Lo Chi-Leung, Ying Chi-Wen, Zhang Xiaolu', 'Donnie Yen, Cecilia Han, Jia Bing, Tang Xu, Hou Tianlai, Xu Guangyu, Lin Chenhan, Hu Ming', null, 'A young boy, Lele, goes missing in the Changbai mountains after an argument with this father. Approaching the vital 48 hour mark and with no sign of Lele, his father takes it upon himself to brave an upcoming avalanche to save his son', 'A young boy, Lele, goes missing in the Changbai mountains after an argument with this father. Approaching the vital 48 hour mark and with no sign of Lele, his father takes it upon himself to brave an upcoming avalanche to save his son', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6rx0uxDDwY5OU3O5zyV8p1P5ll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973211'),
  ('149610614017021128', 'Polar Storm', 2009, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Paul Ziller, Mahlon Todd Williams', 'Paul Ziller', 'Jack Coleman, Holly Dignard, Tyler Johnston, Terry David Mulligan, Roger Cross, David James Lewis, Emma Lahana, Nicholas Carella', 'PG-13', 'When a piece of the massive comet "Copernicus" collides with the Earth, it knocks the planet off of its axis and unleashes a disaster never before witnessed. Dr. James Mayfield and his highly trained research team are the only ones who can re-align the axis. With his wife and teenage son in mortal danger, Dr. James Mayfield calls on his crack research team to help realign the planet''s axis before the effects of the catastrophe are irreversible.', 'When a piece of the massive comet "Copernicus" collides with the Earth, it knocks the planet off of its axis and unleashes a disaster never before witnessed. Dr. James Mayfield and his highly trained research team are the only ones who can re-align the axis. With his wife and teenage son in mortal danger, Dr. James Mayfield calls on his crack research team to help realign the planet''s axis before the effects of the catastrophe are irreversible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mD7nAZXnkIYJ6T4c1xOyK9qxRO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27391'),
  ('320540520327664885', 'Polar Trappers', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Donald and Goofy are trappers in the frozen south (Antarctica) with different approaches. Donald sees a penguin and dresses as one to lure her to the chopping block; Goofy baits a trap with fish (then acts like a walrus to capture one that steals his bait bucket).', 'Donald and Goofy are trappers in the frozen south (Antarctica) with different approaches. Donald sees a penguin and dresses as one to lure her to the chopping block; Goofy baits a trap with fish (then acts like a walrus to capture one that steals his bait bucket).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kycNe1voOPdkyB5ey1nJTzrJY6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69108'),
  ('690719036589230581', 'Polaris', 2022, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kirsten Carthew, Jesse Griffiths', 'Kirsten Carthew', 'Viva Lee, Khamisa Wilsher, Muriel Dutil, Kara Wooten, Dinah Gaston, Charlene Francique, Aimée Robinson, LeaAnne McNally', null, 'In 2144, a young girl raised by a polar bear chases her destiny after escaping capture by brutal warriors intent on killing her mother.', 'In 2144, a young girl raised by a polar bear chases her destiny after escaping capture by brutal warriors intent on killing her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nX3U0pF6v9Q9qGpgUu0yyohy8Qf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:988539'),
  ('694634680206597156', 'Polaroid', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Lars Klevberg, Pål Ulvik Rokseth', 'Blair Butler', 'Kathryn Prescott, Tyler Young, Keenan Tracey, Samantha Logan, Priscilla Quintana, Javier Botet, Mitch Pileggi, Davi Santos', 'PG-13', 'High school loner Bird Fitcher has no idea what dark secrets are tied to the mysterious Polaroid vintage camera she stumbles upon, but it doesn''t take long to discover that those who have their picture taken meet a tragic end. Bird and her friends must survive one more night as they race to solve the mystery of the haunted Polaroid before it kills them all.', 'High school loner Bird Fitcher has no idea what dark secrets are tied to the mysterious Polaroid vintage camera she stumbles upon, but it doesn''t take long to discover that those who have their picture taken meet a tragic end. Bird and her friends must survive one more night as they race to solve the mystery of the haunted Polaroid before it kills them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6a1iqhfM0Y31kNPOSNPIuPrsYQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431075'),
  ('640246668395584543', 'Pölhölä', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Pertti Reponen, Heikki Kinnunen, Taavi Kassila', 'Spede Pasanen', 'Heikki Kinnunen, Aake Kalliala, Helge Herala, Olavi Ahonen, Maija-Leena Soinne, Terhi Panula, Vesa Vierikko, Pirkka-Pekka Petelius', null, 'Masochists are in for a treat when Spede Productions'' most vulgar folk farce hits the screen. Created by no fewer than three first-time directors, the film tells the story of the village of Pölhölä, "where people are even more foolish than in Hölmölä."', 'Masochists are in for a treat when Spede Productions'' most vulgar folk farce hits the screen. Created by no fewer than three first-time directors, the film tells the story of the village of Pölhölä, "where people are even more foolish than in Hölmölä."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YGXDeLKLxAI3ejyDYETK9TyQJC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55528'),
  ('409459683858916390', 'Policarpo, ufficiale di scrittura', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Mario Soldati, Giuseppe Rotunno, Cesare Olivieri', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli', 'Renato Rascel, Peppino De Filippo, Renato Salvatori, Carla Gravina, Romolo Valli, Tony Soler, Luigi De Filippo, Checco Durante', null, 'Policarpo De Tappetti is a calligrapher who works under the orders of Don César Pancarano de Rondò. For many years, Policarpo has been seeking a promotion and a raise that never comes, and, it seems, will never come. One day, Jerónimo, the son of Don César, meets Celeste, the daughter of Policarpo, and falls in love with her. Policarpo sees in that relationship the solution to his aspirations at work, and does everything in his power to make this relationship fruitful. Don César, who presumes to be a count, sees with very bad eyes that his son meets a girl from such a different social position, and does just the opposite. But the efforts made by both parties will be of no use, since Celeste has fallen in love with Mario Marquetti, a "specialized mechanic" (typist) who is giving private lessons in the offices of the businessman Franquinet .', 'Policarpo De Tappetti is a calligrapher who works under the orders of Don César Pancarano de Rondò. For many years, Policarpo has been seeking a promotion and a raise that never comes, and, it seems, will never come. One day, Jerónimo, the son of Don César, meets Celeste, the daughter of Policarpo, and falls in love with her. Policarpo sees in that relationship the solution to his aspirations at work, and does everything in his power to make this relationship fruitful. Don César, who presumes to be a count, sees with very bad eyes that his son meets a girl from such a different social position, and does just the opposite. But the efforts made by both parties will be of no use, since Celeste has fallen in love with Mario Marquetti, a "specialized mechanic" (typist) who is giving private lessons in the offices of the businessman Franquinet .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAn0SIODT2rO3liy3gD3312itrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45024'),
  ('844862164437510893', 'Police', 1985, 'Drama, Crime', 'Maurice Pialat, Luciano Tovoli', 'Catherine Breillat, Sylvie Pialat, Jacques Fieschi', 'Gérard Depardieu, Sophie Marceau, Richard Anconina, Pascale Rocard, Sandrine Bonnaire, Jacques Mathou, Yann Dedet, Frank Karaoui', null, 'Mangin, a police inspector in Paris, leans hard on informants to get evidence on three Tunisian brothers who traffic in drugs. He arrests one, Simon, and his girl-friend Noria. Simon''s brothers go to their lawyer. He springs Noria, who promptly steals 2 million francs that belong to the Tunisians. They suspect her of the theft; her life as well as the lawyer''s is in danger. Meanwhile, Noria is playing with both the lawyer and Mangin''s affections. Mangin is mercurial anyway: intimidating and bloodying suspects, falling for a police commission trainee before flipping for Noria, wearing his emotions on his sleeve. Can he save the lawyer and Noria, and can he convince her to love?', 'Mangin, a police inspector in Paris, leans hard on informants to get evidence on three Tunisian brothers who traffic in drugs. He arrests one, Simon, and his girl-friend Noria. Simon''s brothers go to their lawyer. He springs Noria, who promptly steals 2 million francs that belong to the Tunisians. They suspect her of the theft; her life as well as the lawyer''s is in danger. Meanwhile, Noria is playing with both the lawyer and Mangin''s affections. Mangin is mercurial anyway: intimidating and bloodying suspects, falling for a police commission trainee before flipping for Noria, wearing his emotions on his sleeve. Can he save the lawyer and Noria, and can he convince her to love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMBanDuFv1M3LrJgVlwJqVFEujx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6320'),
  ('123911054958772135', 'Police', 2007, 'Drama', 'Aras Demiray, Onur Ünlü', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Haluk Bilginer, Özgü Namal, Ragıp Savaş, Sermiyan Midyat, Settar Tanrıöğen, Kaan Çakır, Emre Karayel, Zafer Diper', null, 'Musa Rami, who has become a legend with his struggle against the mafia, is a police officer at homicide division. One day prior to celebrating his 63rd birthday, with a surprise party arranged by his family, he finds out that he has cancer and two months left before his death. In these two months, will he be able to fight against the mafia that has intensified its threats against his family and simultaneously reveal his deep love to Funda, who is a university student 40 years younger than him?', 'Musa Rami, who has become a legend with his struggle against the mafia, is a police officer at homicide division. One day prior to celebrating his 63rd birthday, with a surprise party arranged by his family, he finds out that he has cancer and two months left before his death. In these two months, will he be able to fight against the mafia that has intensified its threats against his family and simultaneously reveal his deep love to Funda, who is a university student 40 years younger than him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUsPkVtkRyULFk7rt26sdeAFCP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49828'),
  ('231326151387566025', 'Police Academy', 1984, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Hugh Wilson, Michael D. Margulies, Richard Flower', 'Hugh Wilson, Neal Israel, Pat Proft', 'Steve Guttenberg, Kim Cattrall, G.W. Bailey, Bubba Smith, Donovan Scott, George Gaynes, Andrew Rubin, David Graf', 'R', 'New rules enforced by the Lady Mayoress mean that sex, weight, height and intelligence need no longer be a factor for joining the Police Force. This opens the floodgates for all and sundry to enter the Police Academy, much to the chagrin of the instructors. Not everyone is there through choice, though. Social misfit Mahoney has been forced to sign up as the only alternative to a jail sentence and it doesn''t take long before he falls foul of the boorish Lieutenant Harris. But before long, Mahoney realises that he is enjoying being a police cadet and decides he wants to stay... while Harris decides he wants Mahoney out!', 'New rules enforced by the Lady Mayoress mean that sex, weight, height and intelligence need no longer be a factor for joining the Police Force. This opens the floodgates for all and sundry to enter the Police Academy, much to the chagrin of the instructors. Not everyone is there through choice, though. Social misfit Mahoney has been forced to sign up as the only alternative to a jail sentence and it doesn''t take long before he falls foul of the boorish Lieutenant Harris. But before long, Mahoney realises that he is enjoying being a police cadet and decides he wants to stay... while Harris decides he wants Mahoney out!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxUkWoFI7rF1KUgTgbE3UJEQuvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9336'),
  ('515823826936307189', 'Police Academy 2: Their First Assignment', 1985, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jerry Paris, James Crabe, Donald Heitzer', 'Barry W. Blaustein, David Sheffield', 'Steve Guttenberg, Bubba Smith, David Graf, Michael Winslow, Bruce Mahler, Marion Ramsey, Colleen Camp, Howard Hesseman', 'PG-13', 'Officer Carey Mahoney and his cohorts have finally graduated from the Police Academy and are about to hit the streets on their first assignment. Question is, are they ready to do battle with a band of graffiti-tagging terrorists? Time will tell, but don''t sell short this cheerful band of doltish boys in blue.', 'Officer Carey Mahoney and his cohorts have finally graduated from the Police Academy and are about to hit the streets on their first assignment. Question is, are they ready to do battle with a band of graffiti-tagging terrorists? Time will tell, but don''t sell short this cheerful band of doltish boys in blue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIyvBInW2aGms0zyV9Pgwp9UPJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10157'),
  ('654820734428843066', 'Police Academy 3: Back in Training', 1986, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jerry Paris, Robert Saad, David Starke', 'Gene Quintano', 'Steve Guttenberg, Bubba Smith, David Graf, Michael Winslow, Marion Ramsey, Leslie Easterbrook, Art Metrano, Tim Kazurinsky', 'PG', 'When police funding is cut, the Governor announces he must close one of the academies. To make it fair, the two police academies must compete against each other to stay in operation. Mauser persuades two officers in Lassard''s academy to better his odds, but things don''t quite turn out as expected...', 'When police funding is cut, the Governor announces he must close one of the academies. To make it fair, the two police academies must compete against each other to stay in operation. Mauser persuades two officers in Lassard''s academy to better his odds, but things don''t quite turn out as expected...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBxGgWSR0CMaCVMA2kQS5MWU1z3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12118'),
  ('28947581479426593', 'Police Academy 4: Citizens on Patrol', 1987, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jim Drake, Robert Saad, Michael Zenon', 'Gene Quintano', 'Steve Guttenberg, Bubba Smith, Michael Winslow, David Graf, Tim Kazurinsky, Sharon Stone, Leslie Easterbrook, Marion Ramsey', 'PG', 'A new batch of recruits arrives at Police Academy, this time a group of civilian volunteers who have joined Commandant Lassard''s new Citizens on Patrol program. Although the community relations project has strong governmental support, a disgusted Captain Harris is determined to see it fail.', 'A new batch of recruits arrives at Police Academy, this time a group of civilian volunteers who have joined Commandant Lassard''s new Citizens on Patrol program. Although the community relations project has strong governmental support, a disgusted Captain Harris is determined to see it fail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvk5aWBJE3EqDX2ln6M4J4UiUXr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10587'),
  ('225611469655787038', 'Police Academy 5: Assignment Miami Beach', 1988, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alan Myerson, James Pergola, Carla Brand Breitner', 'Stephen Curwick', 'Bubba Smith, David Graf, Michael Winslow, Leslie Easterbrook, Marion Ramsey, Janet Jones, Lance Kinsey, Matt McCoy', 'PG', 'The Police Academy misfits travel to Miami Beach for Commandant Lassard to be honored with a prestigious lifetime award pending his retirement. Things take a turn when Lassard unknowingly ends up in possession of stolen diamonds from a jewel heist.', 'The Police Academy misfits travel to Miami Beach for Commandant Lassard to be honored with a prestigious lifetime award pending his retirement. Things take a turn when Lassard unknowingly ends up in possession of stolen diamonds from a jewel heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4m1qfTiVxdEDv0fgUf0FI7CA9Fe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11825'),
  ('573766769278567772', 'Police Academy 6: City Under Siege', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Peter Bonerz, Charles Rosher Jr., Marty P. Ewing', 'Stephen Curwick', 'Bubba Smith, David Graf, Michael Winslow, Leslie Easterbrook, Marion Ramsey, Lance Kinsey, Matt McCoy, Bruce Mahler', 'PG', 'Our favourite police men are called together to deal with a gang who rob banks and jewelers. Using their various talents as well as their extraordinary luck, the crooks stand no chance against our men and women in blue.', 'Our favourite police men are called together to deal with a gang who rob banks and jewelers. Using their various talents as well as their extraordinary luck, the crooks stand no chance against our men and women in blue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8CRCKNAsvUoQWqcXmctuIt1Nsw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11895'),
  ('135936294285035490', 'Police Academy: Mission to Moscow', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alan Metter, Ian Jones, Alex Hapsas', 'Randolph Davis, Michele S. Chodos', 'George Gaynes, Michael Winslow, David Graf, Leslie Easterbrook, G.W. Bailey, Christopher Lee, Ron Perlman, Claire Forlani', 'PG', 'The Russians seek help in dealing with the Mafia from the veterans of the Police Academy. They head off to Moscow, in order to find evidence against Konstantin Konali, who marketed a computer game that everyone in the world is playing.', 'The Russians seek help in dealing with the Mafia from the veterans of the Police Academy. They head off to Moscow, in order to find evidence against Konstantin Konali, who marketed a computer game that everyone in the world is playing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3517XQ9LpoEykyYq2TuDNS45MPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11546'),
  ('294509969974258561', 'Police Chief Pepe', 1969, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ettore Scola, Claudio Cirillo, Giorgio Scotton', 'Ruggero Maccari, Ettore Scola', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Giuseppe Maffioli, Silvia Dionisio, Tano Cimarosa, Marianne Comtell, Michele Capnist, Dana Ghia, Elsa Vazzoler', null, 'A police commissioner in a little town in the Italian Venetian province investigates a prostitution ring run by two pensioners; during his investigations he also learns that a former manicurist shacks up with ten students, the prefect''s daughter prostitutes to keep her pimp, a famous doctor has sex with his young patients, a headmaster has his eyes on the pupils, a noblewoman organizes orgies in her villa, the local convent is run by a lesbian and his actual girlfriend poses for a hardcore magazine. He wants everything to come out in the open but his superiors try to put obstacles in his way.', 'A police commissioner in a little town in the Italian Venetian province investigates a prostitution ring run by two pensioners; during his investigations he also learns that a former manicurist shacks up with ten students, the prefect''s daughter prostitutes to keep her pimp, a famous doctor has sex with his young patients, a headmaster has his eyes on the pupils, a noblewoman organizes orgies in her villa, the local convent is run by a lesbian and his actual girlfriend poses for a hardcore magazine. He wants everything to come out in the open but his superiors try to put obstacles in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdsHmOfef8xh51fjV7WzyhEeRCM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104227'),
  ('1126641988499012581', 'Police Family', 2026, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Balu, Jeyakumar Thangavel, Jaya K. Doss', 'Balu', 'Saravanan, Nisha Dubey, Rojan Leon, Raja Malaisamy', null, 'Vinoth, son of Chennai gangster Dhana, is beaten by SI Raja''s team and dumped outside Madurai. Found dead, the officers are blamed. Dhana seeks revenge on them and their families as Raja hunts the real killer before it''s too late.', 'Vinoth, son of Chennai gangster Dhana, is beaten by SI Raja''s team and dumped outside Madurai. Found dead, the officers are blamed. Dhana seeks revenge on them and their families as Raja hunts the real killer before it''s too late.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BZThhNjliMTAtMmNkNS00YjcyLWJjZjgtNTA1YWFlNWI2MmFiXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:police-family'),
  ('344581838454482711', 'Police Flash 80', 2026, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jean-Baptiste Saurel, Sébastien Deux, Julien Roux', 'Thomas Ngijol, Yohan Zaoui, Giulio Callegari', 'François Damiens, Audrey Lamy, Thomas Ngijol, Xavier Lacaille, Brahim Bouhlel, Yan Tual, Philippe Rebbot, Hamed Souna', null, 'Paris, 1980s. When his old cop partner is killed in action, Yvon Kastendeuch is propelled to the head of a new unit : Police Flash 80. There, he''ll have to team up with young recruits who will challenge his old "dominant male" habits.', 'Paris, 1980s. When his old cop partner is killed in action, Yvon Kastendeuch is propelled to the head of a new unit : Police Flash 80. There, he''ll have to team up with young recruits who will challenge his old "dominant male" habits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HD9MuSt5Fk6i7uAgI3m75VATjk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002109'),
  ('817311132402275709', 'Police Python 357', 1976, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Alain Corneau, Étienne Becker', 'Alain Corneau', 'Yves Montand, François Périer, Simone Signoret, Stefania Sandrelli, Vadim Glowna, Mathieu Carrière, Claude Bertrand, Gabrielle Doulcet', 'NR', 'A methodical police inspector becomes entangled in a web of deceit after a murder investigation reveals disturbing connections to his own department. As suspicion tightens around him, he must outwit both the killer and the system to survive.', 'A methodical police inspector becomes entangled in a web of deceit after a murder investigation reveals disturbing connections to his own department. As suspicion tightens around him, he must outwit both the killer and the system to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67ddTJ1msWwQtpRtksn0im0ysNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37455'),
  ('270069420060813051', 'Police Story', 1985, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Jackie Chan, Cheung Yiu-Cho, George Ma Joi-Man', 'Edward Tang, Jackie Chan', 'Jackie Chan, Brigitte Lin, Maggie Cheung, Bill Tung Biu, Chor Yuen, Charlie Cho Cha-Lee, Lam Kwok-Hung, Kam Hing-Yin', 'PG-13', 'Officer Chan Ka Kui manages to put a major Hong Kong drug dealer behind the bars practically alone, after a shooting and an impressive chase inside a slum. Now, he must protect the boss'' secretary, Selina, who will testify against the gangster in court.', 'Officer Chan Ka Kui manages to put a major Hong Kong drug dealer behind the bars practically alone, after a shooting and an impressive chase inside a slum. Now, he must protect the boss'' secretary, Selina, who will testify against the gangster in court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eFB0Iy1TMU4VO5hMcoCE064JAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9056'),
  ('533187000117356881', 'Police Story 2', 1988, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jackie Chan, Tang Pik-Yan, Danny Lee Yau-Tong', 'Jackie Chan, Edward Tang', 'Jackie Chan, Bill Tung Biu, Maggie Cheung, Lam Kwok-Hung, Mars, Benny Lai Keung-Kuen, Kenny Ho Ka-King, Johnny Cheung Wa', 'PG-13', 'The Hong Kong super-cop must stop a group of blackmailing bombers at the same time that the villains of the first Police Story are out for revenge.', 'The Hong Kong super-cop must stop a group of blackmailing bombers at the same time that the villains of the first Police Story are out for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjq1FXtHh9i2sIuM0JaoYf43FDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10753'),
  ('475428694550864740', 'Police Story 3: Super Cop', 1992, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah, Johnny Lee Man-Yiu', 'Edward Tang, Fibe Ma Mei-Ping, Lee Wai-Yee', 'Jackie Chan, Michelle Yeoh, Maggie Cheung, Kenneth Tsang, Yuen Wah, Bill Tung Biu, Josephine Koo Mei-Wah, Kelvin Wong Siu', 'R', 'A Hong Kong detective teams up with his female Red Chinese counterpart to stop a Chinese drug czar.', 'A Hong Kong detective teams up with his female Red Chinese counterpart to stop a Chinese drug czar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHeJWZDXegVEiBGBfnc7LGffuF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11134'),
  ('617495504988702296', 'Police Story 4: First Strike', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing, William Cheng Wai-Ming', 'Greg Mellott, Elliot Tong Ming-Kei, Nick Tramontane', 'Jackie Chan, Jackson Liu, Annie Wu, Bill Tung Biu, Yuri Petrov, Nonna Grishaeva, Ailen Sit Chun-Wai, Chan Man-Ching', 'PG-13', 'Hong Kong cop Chan Ka-Kui returns, working with Interpol to track down and arrest an illegal weapons dealer. Chan later realizes that things are not as simple as they appear and soon finds himself to be a pawn of an organization posing as Russian intelligence.', 'Hong Kong cop Chan Ka-Kui returns, working with Interpol to track down and arrest an illegal weapons dealer. Chan later realizes that things are not as simple as they appear and soon finds himself to be a pawn of an organization posing as Russian intelligence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRHbteT4IORJOXY0Qrnb4FPXRS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9404'),
  ('385674070070936986', 'Police Story: Lockdown', 2013, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Ding Sheng, Ding Yu', 'Ding Sheng', 'Jackie Chan, Liu Ye, Jing Tian, Yu Rongguang, Yin Tao, Na Wei, Liu Yiwei, Liu Hailong', 'R', 'A man looking for the release of a long-time prisoner takes a police officer, his daughter, and a group of strangers hostage.', 'A man looking for the release of a long-time prisoner takes a police officer, his daughter, and a group of strangers hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYukEgKMbbWr05s4nIvGqYGt84z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219572'),
  ('621166885586978781', 'Police, Adjective', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Corneliu Porumboiu, Alexandru Belc, Marius Panduru', 'Corneliu Porumboiu', 'Dragoș Bucur, Vlad Ivanov, Ion Stoica, Irina Săulescu, Cerasela Trandafir, Marian Ghenea, Cosmin Seleși, Șerban Georgevici', null, 'A cop named Cristi must go undercover to trail teen Victor who is suspected of selling pot in the north-eastern city of Vaslui.', 'A cop named Cristi must go undercover to trail teen Victor who is suspected of selling pot in the north-eastern city of Vaslui.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiimBQLll8l6SXyNjder7ToilDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32511'),
  ('1022864398818352103', 'Policegiri', 2013, 'Action, Comedy', 'N K Ekambaram, K. S. Ravikumar', 'Farhad Samji, Sajid Samji', 'Sanjay Dutt, Prachi Desai, Prakash Raj, Om Puri, Rajpal Yadav, Mukesh Tiwari, Manoj Joshi, Ramesh Khanna', null, 'A cop named DCP Rudra is transferred to a new police station. As the city is riddled with crime and corruption, he decides to bring law and order back for which he has to go against Nagori Subramaniyam, the local mafia. He does not believe in the system of going by the book and instead fights fire with fire.', 'A cop named DCP Rudra is transferred to a new police station. As the city is riddled with crime and corruption, he decides to bring law and order back for which he has to go against Nagori Subramaniyam, the local mafia. He does not believe in the system of going by the book and instead fights fire with fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5fev909Oy9wRbA7XQ29Qu6nswF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206301'),
  ('913571948393635032', 'Policeman and Me', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Atsuhiro Nabeshima, Ryuichi Hiroki, Yuki Kondo', 'Nami Kikkawa', 'Kazuya Kamenashi, Tao Tsuchiya, Mahiro Takasugi, Tina Tamashiro, Aya Omasa, Rie Tomosaka, Jun Murakami, Tomorowo Taguchi', null, 'Kako, a 16-year-old high school girl, goes to a mixer pretending to be 22. While there, she meets Kouta who at first has a very intimidating aura. But once he saves her from an awkward situation, she wants to know more about him as does he. That is until he finds out she isn''t 22. The next day Kako runs into him again, but this time he''s working as a police officer. Kako still wants to get closer to Kouta, but he isn''t interested or is he?', 'Kako, a 16-year-old high school girl, goes to a mixer pretending to be 22. While there, she meets Kouta who at first has a very intimidating aura. But once he saves her from an awkward situation, she wants to know more about him as does he. That is until he finds out she isn''t 22. The next day Kako runs into him again, but this time he''s working as a police officer. Kako still wants to get closer to Kouta, but he isn''t interested or is he?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RWccwpLwEjvjRANwVPD13ONs8Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438660'),
  ('1037770506294987004', 'Policewoman', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Spagnoli, Steno, Enrico Vanzina', 'Luciano Vincenzoni, Sergio Donati', 'Mariangela Melato, Renato Pozzetto, Orazio Orlando, Gianfranco Barra, Mario Carotenuto, Alberto Lionello, Alvaro Vitali, Umberto Smaila', null, 'A young policewoman discovers an ecological scandal and must face the corruption in the Milan Police department.', 'A young policewoman discovers an ecological scandal and must face the corruption in the Milan Police department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w16zcTx2dopOAn5UBNEvDmjaiUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139563'),
