  ('446590810900202225', 'Polka-Dot Puss', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Lillian Randolph, William Hanna', 'NR', 'Tom pretends to have a cold in order to trick Mammy into letting him stay inside for the night. Jerry tricks Tom by making him think he really is sick - with the measles.', 'Tom pretends to have a cold in order to trick Mammy into letting him stay inside for the night. Jerry tricks Tom by making him think he really is sick - with the measles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOSfqgyLPFRUjB6FrLSiv2wRHhY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75658'),
  ('125226192231498041', 'Polladhavan', 2007, 'Action, Drama', 'Vetrimaaran, R. Velraj', 'Vetrimaaran', 'Dhanush, Kishore, Divya Spandana, Daniel Balaji, Sentrayan, Karunas, Daniel Annie Pope, Chetan', null, 'Prabhu is dejected when he learns that his bike has been stolen. He decides to find the people who stole the bike, but lands in trouble when he realises that his bike has been used to transport drugs.', 'Prabhu is dejected when he learns that his bike has been stolen. He decides to find the people who stole the bike, but lands in trouble when he realises that his bike has been used to transport drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amHEVzgBKDnlNzxArcOpbvqVDrY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69516'),
  ('592071418970483399', 'Pollock', 2000, 'Drama, History', 'Lisa Rinzler, Ed Harris', 'Susan Emshwiller, Barbara Turner', 'Ed Harris, Marcia Gay Harden, Tom Bower, Jennifer Connelly, Bud Cort, John Heard, Val Kilmer, David Leary', 'R', 'In August of 1949, Life Magazine ran a banner headline that begged the question: "Jackson Pollock: Is he the greatest living painter in the United States?" The film is a look back into the life of an extraordinary man, a man who has fittingly been called "an artist dedicated to concealment, a celebrity who nobody knew." As he struggled with self-doubt, engaging in a lonely tug-of-war between needing to express himself and wanting to shut the world out, Pollock began a downward spiral.', 'In August of 1949, Life Magazine ran a banner headline that begged the question: "Jackson Pollock: Is he the greatest living painter in the United States?" The film is a look back into the life of an extraordinary man, a man who has fittingly been called "an artist dedicated to concealment, a celebrity who nobody knew." As he struggled with self-doubt, engaging in a lonely tug-of-war between needing to express himself and wanting to shut the world out, Pollock began a downward spiral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azsBSw2zw2uNHiCjTnbe9TJVEDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12509'),
  ('977528218647058422', 'Polly', 1989, 'Family, Music', 'Debbie Allen', null, 'Keshia Knight Pulliam, Phylicia Rashād, Dorian Harewood, T.K. Carter, Vanessa Bell Calloway, Larry Riley, Ken Page, Brock Peters', 'G', 'An musical adaptation of the book "Pollyanna" set in the 1950''s in which an orphan tries to use gladness to unite the people in a small southern town.', 'An musical adaptation of the book "Pollyanna" set in the 1950''s in which an orphan tries to use gladness to unite the people in a small southern town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZKo9mWNvn3YnQ6W2IUxChuW2gp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74972'),
  ('710675509051111721', 'Pollyanna', 1920, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Paul Powell, Alfred L. Werker, Charles Rosher', 'Frances Marion', 'Mary Pickford, Katherine Griffith, Howard Ralston, Helen Jerome Eddy, George Berrell, William Courtleigh, Herbert Prior, Wharton James', null, 'When Pollyanna is orphaned, she''s sent to live with her crotchety Aunt Polly. Pollyanna discovers that many of the people in her aunt''s New England hometown are as ill-tempered as her aunt. But Pollyanna''s incurable optimism - exemplified by her "glad game", in which she looks for the bright side of every situation - brings a change to the staid old community.', 'When Pollyanna is orphaned, she''s sent to live with her crotchety Aunt Polly. Pollyanna discovers that many of the people in her aunt''s New England hometown are as ill-tempered as her aunt. But Pollyanna''s incurable optimism - exemplified by her "glad game", in which she looks for the bright side of every situation - brings a change to the staid old community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sShuXyUMN1w3LNtl0HpRXingGxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108988'),
  ('814338118321094059', 'Pollyanna', 1960, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'David Swift, Russell Harlan', 'David Swift', 'Hayley Mills, Jane Wyman, Richard Egan, Karl Malden, Nancy Olson, Adolphe Menjou, Donald Crisp, Agnes Moorehead', 'G', 'A young girl comes to an embittered town and confronts its attitude with her determination to see the best in life.', 'A young girl comes to an embittered town and confronts its attitude with her determination to see the best in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lWkRXg35SjUZXLr10ez8DERvRv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31102'),
  ('339755209330192746', 'Poltergay', 2006, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Eric Lavaine, Vincent Mathias', 'Héctor Cabello Reyes, Eric Lavaine', 'Clovis Cornillac, Julie Depardieu, Lionel Abelanski, Gilles Gaston-Dreyfus, Jean-Michel Lahmi, Philippe Duquesne, Georges Gay, Michel Duchaussoy', null, 'Marc and Emma move into a new house but have no idea that their basement was a gay nightclub. To make matters worse, the club was destroyed by fire, and now the house is haunted by the ghosts of five gay clubbers.', 'Marc and Emma move into a new house but have no idea that their basement was a gay nightclub. To make matters worse, the club was destroyed by fire, and now the house is haunted by the ghosts of five gay clubbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4POmYYaHJSHUWGmDG3QPUv2crbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27614'),
  ('1092511282734475115', 'Poltergeist', 1982, 'Horror', 'Tobe Hooper, Matthew F. Leonetti, Bob Roe', 'Michael Grais, Steven Spielberg, Mark Victor', 'JoBeth Williams, Craig T. Nelson, Beatrice Straight, Dominique Dunne, Heather O''Rourke, Oliver Robins, Zelda Rubinstein, Richard Lawson', 'PG', 'The Freelings'' suburban home becomes the center of paranormal activity that opens a portal to the ''other side''. With help, they must cross over to get their daughter back.', 'The Freelings'' suburban home becomes the center of paranormal activity that opens a portal to the ''other side''. With help, they must cross over to get their daughter back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5AKo8iZAYulI87Uzxkn87vRY07.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609'),
