  ('776238789694491099', 'Polyamory for Dummies', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Fernando Colomo, Ángel Iguacel', 'Fernando Colomo, Marina Maesso, Casandra Macías Gago', 'Karra Elejalde, Quim Àvila Conde, María Pedraza, Toni Acosta, Lola Rodríguez, Eduardo Rosa, Cristina Gallego, Luis Bermejo', 'PG-13', 'Satur and Tina are married, and Berta enters their life as a ‘unicorn.’ In the end, however, Satur is pushed out and Tina and Berta have an affair. Manu is a loser who tries to embark on a relationship with Amanda, who at the same time is involved with Alex, Claudia and Marta and Esteban, with whom they are all co-raising two children. Everyone seem to be living many different lives but all of them will have a lot to learn from each other.', 'Satur and Tina are married, and Berta enters their life as a ‘unicorn.’ In the end, however, Satur is pushed out and Tina and Berta have an affair. Manu is a loser who tries to embark on a relationship with Amanda, who at the same time is involved with Alex, Claudia and Marta and Esteban, with whom they are all co-raising two children. Everyone seem to be living many different lives but all of them will have a lot to learn from each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5ixuR1rP3ewZODrCYbFaMc8xKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805052'),
  ('56085991826663265', 'Polygon', 1977, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Anatoliy Petrov, N. Saykova, T. Galkina', 'Sever Gansovsky', 'Aleksandr Belyavskiy, Anatoliy Kuznetsov, Vsevolod Yakut, Oleg Mokshantsev, Sergey Martynov', null, 'A Russian scientist creates a mind-reading weapon for his generals on a remote island. After the demonstration, the generals are pleased. Little do they realize, both the weapon, and the creator of the weapon have a mind of their own', 'A Russian scientist creates a mind-reading weapon for his generals on a remote island. After the demonstration, the generals are pleased. Little do they realize, both the weapon, and the creator of the weapon have a mind of their own', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDZrbwlbUWAuhNhfwmZGCntlkPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197210'),
  ('730371327448697153', 'Polytechnique', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Denis Villeneuve, Pierre Gill', 'Denis Villeneuve, Eric Leca, Jacques Davidts', 'Maxim Gaudette, Sébastien Huberdeau, Karine Vanasse, Evelyne Brochu, Martin Watier, Johanne-Marie Tremblay, Natalie Hamel-Roy, Pierre-Yves Cardinal', 'NR', 'A dramatization of the Montreal Massacre of 1989 where several female engineering students were murdered by an unstable misogynist.', 'A dramatization of the Montreal Massacre of 1989 where several female engineering students were murdered by an unstable misogynist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0xmtct9cSseksuFKMSXxM8hfni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22302'),
  ('319825257213001041', 'Pom Poko', 1994, 'Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Isao Takahata, Megumi Kagawa, Shinji Otsuka', 'Isao Takahata', 'Makoto Nonomura, Nijiko Kiyokawa, Shigeru Izumiya, Norihei Miki, Yuriko Ishida, Megumi Hayashibara, Yumi Ichihara, Akira Kamiya', 'G', 'The Raccoons of the Tama Hills are being forced from their homes by the rapid development of houses and shopping malls. As it becomes harder to find food and shelter, they decide to band together and fight back. The Raccoons practice and perfect the ancient art of transformation until they are even able to appear as humans in hilarious circumstances.', 'The Raccoons of the Tama Hills are being forced from their homes by the rapid development of houses and shopping malls. As it becomes harder to find food and shelter, they decide to band together and fight back. The Raccoons practice and perfect the ancient art of transformation until they are even able to appear as humans in hilarious circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zat2MMhejQyJJN6CucLI9Or9kdo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15283'),
  ('932078375188770840', 'Pom Pom', 1984, 'Action, Comedy', 'Ricky Lau, Joe Cheung Tung-Cho', null, 'Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, John Shum Kin-Fun, Deanie Ip, Paul Chung Fat, Ng Min-Kan, James Tien Chun, Philip Chan Yan-Kin, Wu Ma', null, 'Chau and Beethoven, two Hong Kong police detectives, go through misadventures to protect a young girl from a ruthless crime lord, as she possesses a ledger that contains all of the gangster''s activities. In the mix is a tough, no-nonsense policewoman, who falls for one of the detectives. Written by Oliver Chu', 'Chau and Beethoven, two Hong Kong police detectives, go through misadventures to protect a young girl from a ruthless crime lord, as she possesses a ledger that contains all of the gangster''s activities. In the mix is a tough, no-nonsense policewoman, who falls for one of the detectives. Written by Oliver Chu', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Qm8p0hhMzqTCprvkIPzUzKcmRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174108'),
