  ('619728865053848702', 'Pooh''s Grand Adventure: The Search for Christopher Robin', 1997, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Karl Geurs, Jamie Thomason', 'Karl Geurs, Carter Crocker', 'Jim Cummings, John Fiedler, Ken Sansom, Paul Winchell, Peter Cullen, Brady Bluhm, Andre Stojka, David Warner', 'G', 'Pooh gets confused when Christopher Robin leaves him a note to say that he has gone back to school after the holidays. So Pooh, Piglet, Tigger, Eeyore and Rabbit go in search of Christopher Robin which leads to a big adventure.', 'Pooh gets confused when Christopher Robin leaves him a note to say that he has gone back to school after the holidays. So Pooh, Piglet, Tigger, Eeyore and Rabbit go in search of Christopher Robin which leads to a big adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjk2Ig3I5bQvPUEH3A83aZebXEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14903'),
  ('846815422490854000', 'Pooh''s Heffalump Halloween Movie', 2005, 'Animation, Family', 'Saul Blinkoff, Elliot M. Bour', 'Brian Hohlfeld, Evan Spiliotopoulos', 'Jimmy Bennett, Peter Cullen, Jim Cummings, John Fiedler, Ken Sansom, Kath Soucie, Kyle Stanger, David Ogden Stiers', 'G', 'It''s Halloween in the 100 Acre Wood, and Roo''s best new friend, Lumpy, is looking forward to his first time trick-or-treating. That is, until Tigger warns them about the scary Gobloon, who''ll turn them into jack-o''-lanterns if he catches them. But if Roo and Lumpy turn the tables on the Gobloon, they get to make a wish! Lumpy and Roo decide to be "brave together, brave forever" and catch the Gobloon so they can make their wishes come true.', 'It''s Halloween in the 100 Acre Wood, and Roo''s best new friend, Lumpy, is looking forward to his first time trick-or-treating. That is, until Tigger warns them about the scary Gobloon, who''ll turn them into jack-o''-lanterns if he catches them. But if Roo and Lumpy turn the tables on the Gobloon, they get to make a wish! Lumpy and Roo decide to be "brave together, brave forever" and catch the Gobloon so they can make their wishes come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zVLrNuuEcNcyCz5SLgYimrkBT3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14885'),
  ('1090838145705953977', 'Pooh''s Heffalump Movie', 2005, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Frank Nissen, Jamie Thomason, Don MacKinnon', 'Evan Spiliotopoulos, Brian Hohlfeld', 'Jim Cummings, John Fiedler, Kath Soucie, Nikita Hopkins, Ken Sansom, Peter Cullen, Kyle Stanger, Brenda Blethyn', 'G', 'Who or what exactly is a Heffalump? The lovable residents of the Hundred Acre Wood -- Winnie the Pooh, Rabbit, Tigger, Eeyore, Kanga and the rest of the pack -- embark on a journey of discovery in search of the elusive Heffalump. But as is always the case, this unusual road trip opens their eyes to so much more than just the creature they''re seeking.', 'Who or what exactly is a Heffalump? The lovable residents of the Hundred Acre Wood -- Winnie the Pooh, Rabbit, Tigger, Eeyore, Kanga and the rest of the pack -- embark on a journey of discovery in search of the elusive Heffalump. But as is always the case, this unusual road trip opens their eyes to so much more than just the creature they''re seeking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kd5JqccroxOnC9sVMP5NtLrbkr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13682'),
  ('1103486777075610909', 'Pooja, Sir', 2025, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Deepak Rauniyar, Sheldon Chau', 'Deepak Rauniyar, David Barker, Asha Magrati', 'Asha Magrati, Nikita Chandak, Dayahang Rai, Aarti Mandal, Reecha Sharma, Bijay Baral, Gaumaya Gurung, Pashupati Rai', null, 'When two boys are kidnapped in a border town in Nepal, Detective Inspector Pooja is sent from Kathmandu to solve the case. But when she arrives, the brewing political unrest and violent protests throw her off course, and she is forced to seek help from Mamata, a local Madhesi policewoman. By putting aside systemic discrimination and pushing through everyday misogyny, the women solve the case - but at what personal cost?', 'When two boys are kidnapped in a border town in Nepal, Detective Inspector Pooja is sent from Kathmandu to solve the case. But when she arrives, the brewing political unrest and violent protests throw her off course, and she is forced to seek help from Mamata, a local Madhesi policewoman. By putting aside systemic discrimination and pushing through everyday misogyny, the women solve the case - but at what personal cost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmM6eEVJksrmzrvRg3jCrnLuxCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025011'),
  ('262480498352075078', 'Pooka Lives!', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Ana M. Amortegui, Alejandro Brugués', 'Ryan Copple', 'Malcolm Barrett, Lyndie Greenwood, Jonah Ray Rodrigues, Felicia Day, Gavin Stenhouse, Wil Wheaton, Rachel Bloom, Motoki Maxted', 'NR', 'A group of thirty-something friends from high school create their own Creepypasta about Pooka for laughs, but are shocked when it becomes so viral on the internet that it actually manifests more murdererous versions of the creature.', 'A group of thirty-something friends from high school create their own Creepypasta about Pooka for laughs, but are shocked when it becomes so viral on the internet that it actually manifests more murdererous versions of the creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8orAPNmomaXTVjikjMSYaanWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:686684'),
  ('898823020231071880', 'Pooka!', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Scott Winig, Nacho Vigalondo', 'Gerald Olson', 'Nyasha Hatendi, Latarsha Rose, Jon Daly, Dale Dickey, Jonny Berryman, Bryan Billy Boone, Caden Dragomer, Alex Jayne Go', 'NR', 'A struggling actor gets a holiday season job as a Christmas character in a plush suit to promote the hottest toy of the year, Pooka; he slowly develops two personalities—one when he''s in the suit and one that''s outside it.', 'A struggling actor gets a holiday season job as a Christmas character in a plush suit to promote the hottest toy of the year, Pooka; he slowly develops two personalities—one when he''s in the suit and one that''s outside it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6Rmmz5MYWHBqqdxhW6nsj0vgts.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566949'),
  ('726570801816887759', 'Pookie', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'M. C. Ganesh Chandra, Aswin Dhana', 'M. C. Ganesh Chandra', 'Adithya, Manoj Velmurugan, Dhani Aelay, Ajay Dhisan, RK Dhanusha', null, 'He struggles to tell her he wants to separate. When he finally does, she shares the same thoughts. Suddenly realizing he doesn''t want to lose her, they reconcile though both still privately consider breaking up.', 'He struggles to tell her he wants to separate. When he finally does, she shares the same thoughts. Suddenly realizing he doesn''t want to lose her, they reconcile though both still privately consider breaking up.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6b03JRKA8rSmSq8VTh3ssXSpBfr.jpg', 'plex:movie:pookie-2026'),
  ('1046250001464992595', 'Pool Boy Nightmare', 2020, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Cambria Hankin, Eric Rey, Michael Su', 'Rolfe Kanefsky', 'Jessica Morris, Tanner Zagarino, Ellie Darcey-Alden, Cynthia Aileen Strahan, Clark Moore, Valeria Gomez, Luis Fernandez-Gil, Angela Nicholas', null, 'The story follows Gale as she has a brief affair with pool cleaner Adam, but quickly turns down his continued advances. Insulted at being rejected, Adam starts dating Gale''s high school age daughter Becca, using her as an unsuspecting pawn in a twisted game of revenge.', 'The story follows Gale as she has a brief affair with pool cleaner Adam, but quickly turns down his continued advances. Insulted at being rejected, Adam starts dating Gale''s high school age daughter Becca, using her as an unsuspecting pawn in a twisted game of revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgF4cf3fb48fcY6ZMACfHGSurZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:740966'),
  ('39696261570656000', 'Pool Days', 1993, null, 'Brian Sloan', 'Brian Sloan', 'Josh Philip Weinstein, Nick Kokotakis, Kimberly Flynn, Richard Salamanca, Richard Foster, Steve Bilich, Will Gorgess, Adrian Davey', null, 'Justin, a 17-year old entering his final year of high school, gets a job as a life guard at a fitness center. Surrounded by hard bodies of both sexes and instructed by his boss to keep an eye on the steam room to report any men having sex, Justin begins to divine the direction his erotic feelings point. In separate incidents, Vicky and Russell, two older co-workers, hit on him. He tries out responses to both, and then must figure out what to do with his new self-knowledge.', 'Justin, a 17-year old entering his final year of high school, gets a job as a life guard at a fitness center. Surrounded by hard bodies of both sexes and instructed by his boss to keep an eye on the steam room to report any men having sex, Justin begins to divine the direction his erotic feelings point. In separate incidents, Vicky and Russell, two older co-workers, hit on him. He tries out responses to both, and then must figure out what to do with his new self-knowledge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1s7yMZMHhsrlbylNsuwrMkOVz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49179'),
