  ('202809283208045806', 'Poolhall Junkies', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Mars Callahan, John J. Hermansen, Robert Morris', 'Mars Callahan, Chris Corso', 'Mars Callahan, Chazz Palminteri, Christopher Walken, Rod Steiger, Rick Schroder, Michael Rosenbaum, Alison Eastwood, Phillip Glasser', 'R', 'A retired pool hustler is forced to pick up the stick again when his brother starts a game he can''t finish.', 'A retired pool hustler is forced to pick up the stick again when his brother starts a game he can''t finish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MAGLk0AtuPi24PBwy3o4ILO0CV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14293'),
  ('292064929015425090', 'Poolman', 2024, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Chris Pine, Matthew Jensen, Jesse Carmona', 'Chris Pine, Ian Gotler', 'Chris Pine, Annette Bening, Danny DeVito, DeWanda Wise, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Stephen Tobolowsky, Clancy Brown, John Ortiz', 'R', 'Darren Barrenman, an unwavering optimist and native Angeleno, spends his days looking after the pool of the Tahitian Tiki apartment block and fighting to make his hometown a better place to live.', 'Darren Barrenman, an unwavering optimist and native Angeleno, spends his days looking after the pool of the Tahitian Tiki apartment block and fighting to make his hometown a better place to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVz4Rh4j6FQTq9eva3xEvCMumAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834562'),
  ('776290493581628740', 'Poongsan', 2011, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Juhn Jai-hong', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Yoon Kye-sang, Kim Gyu-ri, Choi Moo-seong, Kim Jong-soo, Joe Odagiri, Han Gi-joong, Yoo Ha-bok, Jin Sun-kyu', null, 'Poongsan has the unenviable - and death-defying - job of delivering messages across the North and South Korean border to separated families. When South Korean government agents ask him to smuggle in In-ok, the lover of a high-ranking North Korean defector, into the South, the damsel and rescuer fall in love instead.', 'Poongsan has the unenviable - and death-defying - job of delivering messages across the North and South Korean border to separated families. When South Korean government agents ask him to smuggle in In-ok, the lover of a high-ranking North Korean defector, into the South, the damsel and rescuer fall in love instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ph8kuXsZzLmcyb0NpvtqYrSE0Zj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75004'),
  ('419087709002880690', 'Poor', 1986, 'Drama, Family, Romance, Comedy', 'Memduh Ün, Adem Ayral, Melahat Cengiz', 'Memduh Ün, Kemal Sunal, Bülent Oran', 'Kemal Sunal, Ece Alton, Nilgün Saraylı, Fatoş Sezer, Reha Yurdakul, Sevil Üstekin, Aslan Altın, Tuncer Sevi', null, 'Kemal is a young man who does all kinds of work to make ends meet and is passionate about football. The young man who makes his living from the hardest, one day finds a baby abandoned on the side of the road. Kemal, who adopted the orphaned baby, raises and takes care of the girl like the baby''s father.', 'Kemal is a young man who does all kinds of work to make ends meet and is passionate about football. The young man who makes his living from the hardest, one day finds a baby abandoned on the side of the road. Kemal, who adopted the orphaned baby, raises and takes care of the girl like the baby''s father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beRuuXKvZPXDQtV8GugVcHKQ2li.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299508'),
  ('1059589191530467307', 'Poor Boy''s Game', 2007, 'Drama', 'Clement Virgo, Luc Montpellier', 'Clement Virgo, Chaz Thorne', 'Rossif Sutherland, Danny Glover, Flex Alexander, Greg Bryk, Laura Regan, Tonya Williams, Stephen McHattie, K.C. Collins', null, 'Donnie Rose went to prison for beating a young man so brutally it left him handicapped for life. Nine years later, Donnie is out. He''s a different man with only one place to go: back home to the same violent and racist neighborhood that created him. At the other end of town, the black community still wants revenge. The instrument of justice will be Ossie Paris, a devastatingly talented boxer who challenges Donnie to a match; a match Donnie''s family and peers won''t let him refuse. George Carvery has waited nine years to avenge his son''s fate at the hands of Donnie. When finally they meet face to face, however, both realize they share a similar desire to overcome the past.', 'Donnie Rose went to prison for beating a young man so brutally it left him handicapped for life. Nine years later, Donnie is out. He''s a different man with only one place to go: back home to the same violent and racist neighborhood that created him. At the other end of town, the black community still wants revenge. The instrument of justice will be Ossie Paris, a devastatingly talented boxer who challenges Donnie to a match; a match Donnie''s family and peers won''t let him refuse. George Carvery has waited nine years to avenge his son''s fate at the hands of Donnie. When finally they meet face to face, however, both realize they share a similar desire to overcome the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mKbDppyNBwws5e8nH889E4Ejqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15020'),
  ('719942014408287413', 'Poor But Beautiful', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Vito Minore, Franco Montemurro', 'Dino Risi, Pasquale Festa Campanile, Massimo Franciosa', 'Maurizio Arena, Renato Salvatori, Marisa Allasio, Memmo Carotenuto, Lorella De Luca, Alessandra Panaro, Mario Carotenuto, Virgilio Riento', null, 'Salvatore and Romolo are two young and poor young men that are neighbours and friends. They live with their parents in Piazza Navona, Rome. They are poor but handsome, and both fall in love with Giovanna.', 'Salvatore and Romolo are two young and poor young men that are neighbours and friends. They live with their parents in Piazza Navona, Rome. They are poor but handsome, and both fall in love with Giovanna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39fi8hntFoq9gymdV2BKcuOJbVh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61829'),
  ('937032973487743847', 'Poor Cinderella', 1934, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Bonnie Poe, Jack Mercer', null, 'In the only Betty Boop color cartoon, Cinderella (Betty) goes to the ball thanks to her fairy godmother. Later, only her foot fits the glass slipper.', 'In the only Betty Boop color cartoon, Cinderella (Betty) goes to the ball thanks to her fairy godmother. Later, only her foot fits the glass slipper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwG3vSzRSDsoAttrFZmEnvoZAgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147848'),
  ('580904706433955608', 'Poor Cow', 1967, 'Drama', 'Ken Loach, Brian Probyn, Andrew Grieve', 'Nell Dunn', 'Carol White, Terence Stamp, John Bindon, Queenie Watts, Kate Williams, Ken Campbell, Gladys Dawson, Paddy Joyce', 'NR', 'A young woman lives a life filled with bad choices. At a young age she marries and has a child--with an abusive thief who quickly ends up in prison. Left alone, she takes up with the guy''s mate, another thief, who seems to give her some happiness but who also ends up locked up. She then takes up with a series of seedy types who offer nothing but momentary pleasure--if that.', 'A young woman lives a life filled with bad choices. At a young age she marries and has a child--with an abusive thief who quickly ends up in prison. Left alone, she takes up with the guy''s mate, another thief, who seems to give her some happiness but who also ends up locked up. She then takes up with a series of seedy types who offer nothing but momentary pleasure--if that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7ANsKsrbphsx21hGVRGZl1tydj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76072'),
  ('436994288422123412', 'Poor Georges', 2019, 'Drama', 'Claire Devers, Stefano Paradiso', 'Claire Devers, Jean-Louis Benoît', 'Grégory Gadebois, Monia Chokri, Noah Parker, Pascale Arbillot, Stéphane De Groodt, Mylène Mackay, Sébastien Ricard, Élise Guilbault', null, 'Georges (Grégory Gadebois), teaches school in Montreal – he and wife Emma, (Monia Chokri) have just moved to the countryside. One day, he surprises a young intruder Zack, (Noah Parker), rummaging through his things.', 'Georges (Grégory Gadebois), teaches school in Montreal – he and wife Emma, (Monia Chokri) have just moved to the countryside. One day, he surprises a young intruder Zack, (Noah Parker), rummaging through his things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7ovr0Mmm3stHQR6wIDsAHk2XBw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560095'),
