  ('462795827033073544', 'Poor Little Rich Girl', 1936, 'Adventure, Family, Music', 'Irving Cummings, Booth McCracken, John F. Seitz', 'Harry Tugend, Sam Hellman, Gladys Lehman', 'Shirley Temple, Alice Faye, Gloria Stuart, Jack Haley, Michael Whalen, Sara Haden, Jane Darwell, Claude Gillingwater', 'NR', 'Cossetted and bored, Barbara Barry is finally sent off to school by her busy if doting widowed soap manufacturer father. When her nurse is injured en route, Barbara finds herself alone in town, ending up as part of radio song-and-dance act Dolan and Dolan sponsored by a rival soap company.', 'Cossetted and bored, Barbara Barry is finally sent off to school by her busy if doting widowed soap manufacturer father. When her nurse is injured en route, Barbara finds herself alone in town, ending up as part of radio song-and-dance act Dolan and Dolan sponsored by a rival soap company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1yAlXypI8T7gr4BJloTYoNRalE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43268'),
  ('158629315635894687', 'Poor Little Rich Girl', 1965, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Andy Warhol, Andy Warhol', 'Ronald Tavel', 'Edie Sedgwick, Chuck Wein', null, 'A young, jobless woman stays in bed, reads, talks on the phone, smokes cigarettes, makes fresh coffee, and tries on some clothes from a large wardrobe.', 'A young, jobless woman stays in bed, reads, talks on the phone, smokes cigarettes, makes fresh coffee, and tries on some clothes from a large wardrobe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v92faaxm1TTH4rIFSMFjqalnDSt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208054'),
  ('627404489308488799', 'Poor Millionaires', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Franco Montemurro, Dino Risi, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Dino Risi, Pasquale Festa Campanile, Massimo Franciosa', 'Maurizio Arena, Renato Salvatori, Alessandra Panaro, Lorella De Luca, Memmo Carotenuto, Sylva Koscina, Fred Buscaglione, Roberto Rey', null, 'After a series of misunderstandings and other unfortunate incidents, the honeymoon of two young couples ends sooner than planned. Back at their starting point, the ensuing conflict leads to one of the couples separating. Salvatore, who moves away, is hit in the street by a car and loses his memory: he has lost his memories of his friends and family - until he meets his wife Marisa, in which he falls in love again ...', 'After a series of misunderstandings and other unfortunate incidents, the honeymoon of two young couples ends sooner than planned. Back at their starting point, the ensuing conflict leads to one of the couples separating. Salvatore, who moves away, is hit in the street by a car and loses his memory: he has lost his memories of his friends and family - until he meets his wife Marisa, in which he falls in love again ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWBWM49hWh4ZdwxOiiNePHqoE6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288921'),
