  ('691913099201342324', 'Pootie Tang', 2001, 'Action, Comedy', 'Louis C.K., Willy Kurant', 'Louis C.K.', 'Lance Crouther, JB Smoove, Jennifer Coolidge, Reg E. Cathey, Robert Vaughn, Wanda Sykes, Chris Rock, Mario Joyner', 'PG-13', 'Pootie Tang, the musician/actor/folk hero of the ghetto, is chronicled from his early childhood to his battles against the evil Corporate America, who try to steal his magic belt and make him sell out by endorsing addictive products to his people. Pootie must learn to find himself and defeat the evil corporation for all the young black children of America, supatime.', 'Pootie Tang, the musician/actor/folk hero of the ghetto, is chronicled from his early childhood to his battles against the evil Corporate America, who try to steal his magic belt and make him sell out by endorsing addictive products to his people. Pootie must learn to find himself and defeat the evil corporation for all the young black children of America, supatime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNvx45x4JWHYucpnV2vuKn9TZnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10615'),
  ('164077707424276638', 'Pop', 1999, null, 'Brian Johnson', null, 'Peter Paige, Elisa Donovan, Michael Fetters, Kurt McKinney', 'NR', 'Two with-it young physicists are being chased by a sinister exec and her pair of goons, as well as a matched set of small-eyed G-men in black, all in pursuit of a math-nerd who''s made off with a mysterious high-tech secret and vanished with his new girlfriend from space. The word "caper," you''ll agree, was invented for just this situation.', 'Two with-it young physicists are being chased by a sinister exec and her pair of goons, as well as a matched set of small-eyed G-men in black, all in pursuit of a math-nerd who''s made off with a mysterious high-tech secret and vanished with his new girlfriend from space. The word "caper," you''ll agree, was invented for just this situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9MKafI2jp1JLekbfD5OjdqXBLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471025'),
  ('741633690293009061', 'Pop ''im Pop!', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Robert McKimson, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A circus comes to town featuring Gracie the Fighting Kangaroo and her youngster, Hippety Hopper.', 'A circus comes to town featuring Gracie the Fighting Kangaroo and her youngster, Hippety Hopper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mU4rI7XIWtTjLbANcmxFPrnVzWt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236106'),
  ('798615756471468716', 'Pop Aye', 2017, 'Drama', 'Pipat Jomkoh, Monkum Khukhuntin, Tippawan Narintorn', 'Kirsten Tan', 'Thaneth Warakulnukroh, Penpak Sirikul, Bong, Sasapin Siriwanij, Nattavut Trivisivavet, Supanthu Julma, Chainarong Phokaew, Tossapol Leongsupporn', null, 'On a chance encounter, a disenchanted architect bumps into his long-lost elephant on the streets of Bangkok. Excited, he takes his elephant on a journey across Thailand in search of the farm where they grew up together.', 'On a chance encounter, a disenchanted architect bumps into his long-lost elephant on the streets of Bangkok. Excited, he takes his elephant on a journey across Thailand in search of the farm where they grew up together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTwE3Ff2LpCGBI4q7hsLzt2wnHP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428497'),
  ('677998653336466326', 'Pop Goes the Easel', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Felix Adler', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Bobby Burns, Neal Burns, Bob Callahan, Phyllis Crane, Lew Davis', 'NR', 'The stooges are down and out. With a cop chasing them, they flee into an artists studio where they are mistaken for students. The cop continues to hunt for them and they use a variety of disguises and tactics to elude him. A wild clay throwing fight ends the film.', 'The stooges are down and out. With a cop chasing them, they flee into an artists studio where they are mistaken for students. The cop continues to hunt for them and they use a variety of disguises and tactics to elude him. A wild clay throwing fight ends the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyOsWHQaRdmKfEdN7UcKvOC6OCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115047'),
  ('451301608262449152', 'Pop in Q', 2016, 'Animation, Fantasy, Music, Drama, Adventure', 'Takayuki Uragami, Daiki Nakazawa, Ikuko Ito', 'Shuuko Arai', 'Asami Seto, Shiori Izawa, Ari Ozawa, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Atsumi Tanezaki, Azusa Tadokoro, Erii Yamazaki, Kaede Hondo', null, 'The story begins the day before the graduation ceremony. Five middle school girls each are preoccupied with their real everyday lives. These girls meet each other in a fantasy world after being sent there through a sudden occurrence. There, they learn about the impending crisis that this world is facing. The way to avert this crisis is for the five to collaborate and bring their five hearts together as one through dance. However, the five cannot come to love the world, and cannot tell their true feelings to one another, so their hearts are unable to unite. The time limit is fast approaching. Can the dance of the five girls save the world? And will they be able to graduate?', 'The story begins the day before the graduation ceremony. Five middle school girls each are preoccupied with their real everyday lives. These girls meet each other in a fantasy world after being sent there through a sudden occurrence. There, they learn about the impending crisis that this world is facing. The way to avert this crisis is for the five to collaborate and bring their five hearts together as one through dance. However, the five cannot come to love the world, and cannot tell their true feelings to one another, so their hearts are unable to unite. The time limit is fast approaching. Can the dance of the five girls save the world? And will they be able to graduate?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pk3Q0U7dh3wf3c3J3cagqz0zUE9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415283'),
  ('1073848332455833733', 'Pop Redemption', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Martin Le Gall, Frédéric Nony', 'Mark Eacersall, Martin Le Gall, Alexandre Astier', 'Julien Doré, Yacine Belhousse, Audrey Fleurot, Jonathan Cohen, Grégory Gadebois, Alexandre Astier', null, 'A black metal band it is about to split up. In their way to one last gig at Hellfest festival an accidental death triggers numerous misadventures to four metalheads.', 'A black metal band it is about to split up. In their way to one last gig at Hellfest festival an accidental death triggers numerous misadventures to four metalheads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2S0Su5mieHGXXLQ4EQYWr28uXBF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198130'),
  ('962677272220355383', 'Popcorn', 1991, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Mark Herrier, Phil Dupont, John Wildermuth', 'Alan Ormsby', 'Jill Schoelen, Tom Villard, Dee Wallace, Derek Rydall, Kelly Jo Minter, Malcolm Danare, Elliott Hurst, Ivette Soler', 'R', 'While holding a horror film festival, a group of film students find themselves stalked by a madman who may have a sinister connection to a cult leader.', 'While holding a horror film festival, a group of film students find themselves stalked by a madman who may have a sinister connection to a cult leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6peTotMLdRLQ5Hq2oJI5EYurIR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39875'),
  ('437240161115554348', 'Popcorn and Ice Cream', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Franz Josef Gottlieb', 'Erich Tomek', 'Olivia Pascal, Benny Schnier, Zachi Noy, Gesa Thoma, Bea Fiedler, Karl Heinz Maslo, Ursula Buchfellner, Herbert Fux', null, 'Gesa loses her vacation money in a warehouse bed while having sex with her boyfriend. When she realizes the money is gone, they return to the warehouse, but the beds have all been picked up for delivery. They immediately set off by train to follow the money.', 'Gesa loses her vacation money in a warehouse bed while having sex with her boyfriend. When she realizes the money is gone, they return to the warehouse, but the beds have all been picked up for delivery. They immediately set off by train to follow the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3Rv1elXqAdfpa6ROJVZhScE29k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222837'),
  ('58184754739779788', 'Popcorn e patatine', 1985, 'Music, Comedy', 'Mariano Laurenti, Silvio Fraschetti, Filiberto Fiaschi', 'Mariano Laurenti, Franco Calabrese, Piero Regnoli', 'Nino D''Angelo, Roberta Olivieri, Lucio Montanaro, Pippo Cairelli, Gena Gas, Alan Gerbi, Anna Malvica, Enzo Berri', null, 'In love with the beautiful Anna, Nino follows her on vacation to Taormina and, to impress her, pretends to stay in a luxurious hotel. The misunderstandings follow each other. Neapolitan scenary, revised in a comic-seaside key, to the extent of the symbolic face of the genus Nino D''Ange.', 'In love with the beautiful Anna, Nino follows her on vacation to Taormina and, to impress her, pretends to stay in a luxurious hotel. The misunderstandings follow each other. Neapolitan scenary, revised in a comic-seaside key, to the extent of the symbolic face of the genus Nino D''Ange.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mpkgoabT48TvIMObNJzjUdfj1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210357'),
  ('24374344291993578', 'Pope Francis: A Man of His Word', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Wim Wenders, Lisa Rinzler', 'Wim Wenders, David Rosier', 'Pope Francis, Ignazio Oliva, Sister María Eufemia Goycoechea, Joe Biden, Daniele De Angelis, Carlo Falconetti, Evo Morales, Paul Ryan', null, 'Pope Francis responds to questions from around the world, discussing topics including ecology, immigration, consumerism and social justice.', 'Pope Francis responds to questions from around the world, discussing topics including ecology, immigration, consumerism and social justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pGMnjyebbDY33AkWqaJbvC5eEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505205'),
