  ('919798348779067769', 'Pope Leo XIII Being Seated Bestowing Blessing', 1898, 'Documentary', 'William K.L. Dickson', null, 'Pope Leo XIII', null, 'Probably the first video of a Pope: Leo XIII sits in his chair with guards and attendants, then blesses the viewers.', 'Probably the first video of a Pope: Leo XIII sits in his chair with guards and attendants, then blesses the viewers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lru6dm0DVpqac4IWlJhXb8Qd1Qs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325498'),
  ('959843916280727246', 'Popemobile', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Sylvain Estibal, Magaly González, Cuco Grajeda', 'Sylvain Estibal, Myriam Tekaïa', 'Kad Merad, Myriam Tekaïa, Julia Vignali, Carlo Basabe, Boris Shoemann, Agustín Ocegueda, Guillermo Navarro, Guillermo León', null, 'To mark his recent appointment, the new Pope prepares for a tour of Latin America, only to find that the Vatican is bankrupt. A rich Mexican woman offers to help out. In return for financing his trip, she demands he attends an event in his honour in the city of Ciudad Juarez – Mexico’s capital of crime. The “guardian angel” turns out to be a drug trafficker, and when she discovers that a lookalike Pope has been sent in his place, confusion, laughter and unexpected chaos ensue.', 'To mark his recent appointment, the new Pope prepares for a tour of Latin America, only to find that the Vatican is bankrupt. A rich Mexican woman offers to help out. In return for financing his trip, she demands he attends an event in his honour in the city of Ciudad Juarez – Mexico’s capital of crime. The “guardian angel” turns out to be a drug trafficker, and when she discovers that a lookalike Pope has been sent in his place, confusion, laughter and unexpected chaos ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtGpaRQmxUVI88Jzun3Z2HNHbXA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1186640'),
  ('89119299527985815', 'Popeye', 1980, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Giuseppe Rotunno, Robert Altman, Victor Tourjansky', 'Jules Feiffer', 'Robin Williams, Shelley Duvall, Ray Walston, Paul Dooley, Paul L. Smith, Richard Libertini, Donald Moffat, MacIntyre Dixon', 'PG', 'Popeye is a super-strong, spinach-scarfing sailor man who''s searching for his father. During a storm that wrecks his ship, Popeye washes ashore and winds up rooming at the Oyl household, where he meets Olive. Before he can win her heart, he must first contend with Olive''s fiancé, Bluto.', 'Popeye is a super-strong, spinach-scarfing sailor man who''s searching for his father. During a storm that wrecks his ship, Popeye washes ashore and winds up rooming at the Oyl household, where he meets Olive. Before he can win her heart, he must first contend with Olive''s fiancé, Bluto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCCp4pESgYY6uTFARYf4UYV1BdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11335'),
  ('916904104728000653', 'Popeye Doyle', 1986, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Crime', 'Peter Levin, Reginald H. Morris', 'Richard Di Lello', 'Ed O''Neill, Matthew Laurance, Candy Clark, George De La Pena, Audrey Landers, James Handy, J.K. Simmons, Nicholas Kadi', 'NR', 'While Popeye Doyle is investigating what appears to be a very simple drug overdose, he becomes involved in international intrigue. The Mosad and various other foreign diplomatic figures turn up everywhere he goes. The drug overdose becomes a very involved murder case.', 'While Popeye Doyle is investigating what appears to be a very simple drug overdose, he becomes involved in international intrigue. The Mosad and various other foreign diplomatic figures turn up everywhere he goes. The drug overdose becomes a very involved murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30ZbqYZbED70vzuFaBmbGzs5mmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116214'),
  ('170022690852203986', 'Popeye for President', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Seymour Kneitel', null, 'Jack Mercer, Jackson Beck, Mae Questel', null, 'Popeye and Bluto are running for President. It''s election day, the vote is tied, and Olive Oyl is the only remaining voter. However, she won''t vote, and the election outcome be decided, until her chores are done. Popeye and Bluto compete to complete them.', 'Popeye and Bluto are running for President. It''s election day, the vote is tied, and Olive Oyl is the only remaining voter. However, she won''t vote, and the election outcome be decided, until her chores are done. Popeye and Bluto compete to complete them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wa3VDXYbhv6MAf2AFGDOYuExVwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235113'),
