  ('910956127476165136', 'Popeye''s Voyage: The Quest for Pappy', 2004, 'Family, Animation', 'Ezekiel Norton', 'Paul Reiser, Jim Hardison', 'Billy West, Tabitha St. Germain, Kathy Bates, Garry Chalk, Sanders Whiting', null, 'After a wild dream, Popeye, along with Bluto, Olive, Wimpy, and Swee''pea, takes to the seas to rescue his long-lost absent father for the holidays, while the dastardly Sea Hag tries to stop the rag-tag crew from breaking a mysterious and fateful prophecy.', 'After a wild dream, Popeye, along with Bluto, Olive, Wimpy, and Swee''pea, takes to the seas to rescue his long-lost absent father for the holidays, while the dastardly Sea Hag tries to stop the rag-tag crew from breaking a mysterious and fateful prophecy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bU0F48vDuOf832V53NkzU6M74UU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59777'),
  ('834590057616940940', 'Popi', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Arthur Hiller, Andrew Laszlo', 'Tina Pine, Lester Pine', 'Alan Arkin, Rita Moreno, Reuben Figueroa, Miguel Alejandro, Arny Freeman, Joan Tompkins, Anthony Holland, Louis Zorich', 'G', 'Abraham is a Puerto Rican single parent with two boys. He is becoming very worried about them living in their run down neighborhood when one day he notices that Cubans who escape are lionized and given exceptional benefits. He thinks up a plot to have his sons washed ashore as cuban immigrants who will be adopted by rich anglos.', 'Abraham is a Puerto Rican single parent with two boys. He is becoming very worried about them living in their run down neighborhood when one day he notices that Cubans who escape are lionized and given exceptional benefits. He thinks up a plot to have his sons washed ashore as cuban immigrants who will be adopted by rich anglos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmJuPJ5d3ZpaeLnx7UdLd7zve71.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92289'),
  ('1061050918074134370', 'Popp Dich schlank', 2005, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Christoph Schrewe, Fritz Seemann', 'Don Bohlinger', 'Theresa Scholze, Jochen Schropp, Dirk Bach, Dominic Boeer, Cheyenne Rushing, Martin Glade, Walfriede Schmitt, Martin Klempnow', null, 'Paul and Paula are partners in their profession as comic artists and best friends in their private lives. They also have the same problem: being overweight! When Paul''s school sweetheart Mariah suddenly turns up and is about to move to the city, Paul decides to lose weight. But he breaks his leg during his first attempt at fitness. And how do you burn a lot of calories despite breaking your leg? By popping! The results are impressive and gradually everyone around him falls for the sex diet. Eventually even Paula, who persuades her good old friend Paul to have sex with her. After all, they know each other inside out and don''t want anything else from each other, or do they?', 'Paul and Paula are partners in their profession as comic artists and best friends in their private lives. They also have the same problem: being overweight! When Paul''s school sweetheart Mariah suddenly turns up and is about to move to the city, Paul decides to lose weight. But he breaks his leg during his first attempt at fitness. And how do you burn a lot of calories despite breaking your leg? By popping! The results are impressive and gradually everyone around him falls for the sex diet. Eventually even Paula, who persuades her good old friend Paul to have sex with her. After all, they know each other inside out and don''t want anything else from each other, or do they?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jupWJaIRX3CZ1PRkKEZNUITBvJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135751'),
  ('1126998663391086195', 'Poppitz', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Harald Sicheritz', 'Harald Sicheritz, Roland Düringer', 'Roland Düringer, Marie Bäumer, Nora Heschl, Kai Wiesinger, Reinhard Nowak, Oliver Korittke, Maria Hofstätter, Alfred Dorfer', null, 'Car salesman Gerry Schartl is on his way to dream holidays in an all-inclusive club at Cosamera. He´s a smart guy, great in his job, and his life is perfect - well, nearly perfect...', 'Car salesman Gerry Schartl is on his way to dream holidays in an all-inclusive club at Cosamera. He´s a smart guy, great in his job, and his life is perfect - well, nearly perfect...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssLTXNfqOQKMmJCFsFuCd7PsydA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56398'),
  ('79456255175299352', 'Popstar', 2005, 'Romance, Family, Comedy', 'Richard Gabai, Andrea V. Rossotto', 'Timothy Barton', 'Aaron Carter, Alana Austin, David Cassidy, Kimberly Kevon Williams, Adrianne Palicki, Mary Elise Hayden, Deena Dill, Andrew Stevens', 'PG', 'A teenage girls life gets turned upside down when a new school friend turns out to be a popstar.', 'A teenage girls life gets turned upside down when a new school friend turns out to be a popstar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5QIkzyQR5ekNaZDWmLLAbeZy30.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31277'),
  ('1142021069994546583', 'Popstar: Never Stop Never Stopping', 2016, 'Comedy, Music', 'Akiva Schaffer, Jorma Taccone, Brandon Trost', 'Akiva Schaffer, Andy Samberg, Jorma Taccone', 'Andy Samberg, Jorma Taccone, Akiva Schaffer, Sarah Silverman, Tim Meadows, Maya Rudolph, Joan Cusack, Imogen Poots', 'R', 'When his new album fails to sell records, pop/rap superstar Conner4real goes into a major tailspin and watches his celebrity high life begin to collapse. He''ll try anything to bounce back, anything except reuniting with his old rap group The Style Boyz.', 'When his new album fails to sell records, pop/rap superstar Conner4real goes into a major tailspin and watches his celebrity high life begin to collapse. He''ll try anything to bounce back, anything except reuniting with his old rap group The Style Boyz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBZeZZNjYBUU21zFvBnin5n62bv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341012'),
  ('677179024896118691', 'Populaire', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Régis Roinsard, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Régis Roinsard, Daniel Presley, Romain Compingt', 'Romain Duris, Déborah François, Bérénice Bejo, Shaun Benson, Mélanie Bernier, Nicolas Bedos, Miou-Miou, Eddy Mitchell', 'R', 'An insurance agent and his new secretary become locked in the grip of romance and competition as they train together for a speed-typing contest.', 'An insurance agent and his new secretary become locked in the grip of romance and competition as they train together for a speed-typing contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4d4a0uDl8tI4EoIjYEyU54Xpkzu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136403'),
