  ('1099267600374426730', 'Population 436', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michelle MacLaren, Thomas Burstyn', 'Michael Kingston', 'Jeremy Sisto, Charlotte Sullivan, Fred Durst, Peter Outerbridge, R.H. Thomson, David Fox, Monica Parker, Frank Adamson', 'R', 'A census-taker is sent to investigate why a certain small town has had the same population -- 436 residents -- for the last 100 years.', 'A census-taker is sent to investigate why a certain small town has had the same population -- 436 residents -- for the last 100 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trEcuqgfXtIt06b7Tg1fkCnOHBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1596'),
  ('562532485797345197', 'Por ellas aunque mal paguen', 1952, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Jesús Marín, Juan Bustillo Oro', 'Augusto Martinez Olmedilla, Juan Bustillo Oro', 'Pedro Infante, Silvia Pinal, Ángel Infante, Fernando Soler, Irma Dorantes, Alfonso Bedoya, Tito Gómez, Fanny Schiller', null, 'Don Anastacio, an aristocrat passing through a rough patch,He will make marry his daughter Isabel with wealthy rancher. Isabel and her family refuse to work, Jose Manuel takes them to the ranch, where they are forced to work for food.', 'Don Anastacio, an aristocrat passing through a rough patch,He will make marry his daughter Isabel with wealthy rancher. Isabel and her family refuse to work, Jose Manuel takes them to the ranch, where they are forced to work for food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAhbk2ecf5Eu6qWyeuj2DY9oSo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246222'),
  ('397152119962795336', 'Por los pelos', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Nacho G. Velilla', 'Nacho G. Velilla, Oriol Capel, David S. Olivas', 'Antonio Pagudo, Carlos Librado "Nene", Tomy Aguilera, Eva Ugarte, Amaia Salamanca, Leo Harlem, María Hervás, Alba Planas', null, 'Juanjo (Antonio Pagudo) is a forty-year-old man who, despite not having low self-esteem due to his baldness, his wife, Inma (Eva Ugarte), obsessed with image and aesthetics, is in charge of making him complex about it. On the other hand, his friend Sebas (Carlos Librado "Nene") is affected by his lack of hair and is willing to do whatever it takes to regain his younger version, something that affects his ex-wife, Sofía (Amaia Salamanca) , and their daughters. Ready for anything, both get into a little trouble to get the money to allow them to travel to Turkey and have a hair transplant. In Istanbul they meet Rayco (Tomy Aguilera), a young reggaeton singer who is having great success, but after discovering his alopecia at a concert, he needs an urgent hair transplant. In this way, the three of them will try to seek happiness through aesthetics, but perhaps they will discover that there is something far beyond the physical.', 'Juanjo (Antonio Pagudo) is a forty-year-old man who, despite not having low self-esteem due to his baldness, his wife, Inma (Eva Ugarte), obsessed with image and aesthetics, is in charge of making him complex about it. On the other hand, his friend Sebas (Carlos Librado "Nene") is affected by his lack of hair and is willing to do whatever it takes to regain his younger version, something that affects his ex-wife, Sofía (Amaia Salamanca) , and their daughters. Ready for anything, both get into a little trouble to get the money to allow them to travel to Turkey and have a hair transplant. In Istanbul they meet Rayco (Tomy Aguilera), a young reggaeton singer who is having great success, but after discovering his alopecia at a concert, he needs an urgent hair transplant. In this way, the three of them will try to seek happiness through aesthetics, but perhaps they will discover that there is something far beyond the physical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQdD2FmlLW4GF879nynoZZWBukM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826218'),
  ('834574165860390953', 'Por mis pistolas', 1968, 'Adventure, Comedy, Western', 'Miguel M. Delgado, José Ortiz Ramos, Moises M. Delgado', 'Marco Antonio Almazan, Cantinflas', 'Cantinflas, Isela Vega, Gloria Coral, Quintín Bulnes, Rhea Frichina, Carlos Cardán, Ivan J. Rado, Alfonso Mejía', null, 'Fidencio Borer, an apothecary in a village on the northern border of Mexico, discovers some old title of a mine in Arizona and decides to claim them. Trying to cross the border is a border guard intercepted by exaggerating in the line of duty. On the way is captured by a tribe of Apaches and is about to be burned alive, but thanks to the Great Head Horse Lying having toothache and learns that the prisoner it can heal, ordered his release on the condition that the cure. Fidencio would take the wheel and gets the eternal friendship of the Chief apache.', 'Fidencio Borer, an apothecary in a village on the northern border of Mexico, discovers some old title of a mine in Arizona and decides to claim them. Trying to cross the border is a border guard intercepted by exaggerating in the line of duty. On the way is captured by a tribe of Apaches and is about to be burned alive, but thanks to the Great Head Horse Lying having toothache and learns that the prisoner it can heal, ordered his release on the condition that the cure. Fidencio would take the wheel and gets the eternal friendship of the Chief apache.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssKgWBjx2CmoFvqE8EwbialwRFo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41294'),
  ('990058055447054228', 'Por primera vez', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Octavio Cortázar', 'Octavio Cortázar', 'Octavio Cortázar', null, 'In 1967, Cuban documentary filmmaker Octavio Cortazar followed a travelling projectionist troupe whose mission was to show moving pictures to rural communities for the first time. Cortazar’s short film documents one audience’s response to its first film: Charlie Chaplin’s Modern Times.', 'In 1967, Cuban documentary filmmaker Octavio Cortazar followed a travelling projectionist troupe whose mission was to show moving pictures to rural communities for the first time. Cortazar’s short film documents one audience’s response to its first film: Charlie Chaplin’s Modern Times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rmKz3vDpARQMORt9JOv9OiiAcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169252'),
  ('907661923102505224', 'Por Que Você Não Chora?', 2020, 'Drama', 'Cibele Amaral', null, 'Carolina Monte Rosa, Bárbara Paz, Cristiana Oliveira, Elisa Lucinda, Priscila Camargo, Maria Paula, Rodrigo Brassoloto, Luciana Martuchelli', null, 'Strong and feminine, "Why don''t you cry?" addresses the delicate topic of suicide. Jessica is very closed, Barbara is a time bomb. The two meet when, at the stage of the faculty of psychology, Jessica meets Barbara. The coexistence leads Jessica to question her empty and meaningless life.', 'Strong and feminine, "Why don''t you cry?" addresses the delicate topic of suicide. Jessica is very closed, Barbara is a time bomb. The two meet when, at the stage of the faculty of psychology, Jessica meets Barbara. The coexistence leads Jessica to question her empty and meaningless life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNSHszBLb0fI1RcNPZw9YulKpzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739465'),
  ('1080736377766751701', 'Por Siempre RBD', 2023, 'Music, Documentary', 'Miguel Ángel Fox', null, 'Dulce María, Anahí, Maite Perroni, Christian Chávez, Christopher Von Uckermann', null, 'The most successful Mexican pop group in decades returns after a successful tour of the United States, Colombia and Brazil to share not only their greatest hits, but an intimate, behind-the-scenes look at what the RBD reunion means to them.', 'The most successful Mexican pop group in decades returns after a successful tour of the United States, Colombia and Brazil to share not only their greatest hits, but an intimate, behind-the-scenes look at what the RBD reunion means to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJ9tLOj7KNmSQWYjV7nTmgIldIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219559'),
  ('372740000748452847', 'Por Thozhil', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Vignesh Raja, Kalaiselvan Sivaji', 'Vignesh Raja, Alfred Prakash', 'Ashok Selvan, R. Sarathkumar, Sarath Babu, Nikhila Vimal, P.L. Thenappan, O. A. K. Sundar, Nizhalgal Ravi, Harish Kumar', null, 'Loganathan, a senior cop is asked to mentor Prakash, an academically bright but faint-hearted rookie and this unlikely duo team up to investigate a series of murder cases, and realize all of them are interlinked and that a psychopath serial killer is on the run.', 'Loganathan, a senior cop is asked to mentor Prakash, an academically bright but faint-hearted rookie and this unlikely duo team up to investigate a series of murder cases, and realize all of them are interlinked and that a psychopath serial killer is on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZ2BbjGBDRW5Q5Q9jgEknuiEQ0f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115239'),
  ('527420348015396865', 'Por Tu Maldito Amor', 1990, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Rafael Villaseñor Kuri', 'Ramón Obón', 'Vicente Fernández, Sonia Infante, Claudia Fernández, Leonardo Daniel, Josefina Echánove, José Natera, César Castro, Raúl Meraz', null, 'One man must decide two women: one is mature, confident, and an owner of land while the other is young, beautiful, and impetuous. But there’s a problem, they’re both sisters.', 'One man must decide two women: one is mature, confident, and an owner of land while the other is young, beautiful, and impetuous. But there’s a problem, they’re both sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZybndGB7qynnOLDQ2RHcMAdQTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348609'),
  ('115857492829403679', 'Por tus muertos', 2024, 'Comedy, Music', 'Sayago Ayuso', 'Sayago Ayuso, Juanjo Ramírez Mascaró, Paco Mateo', 'José Mota, Jorge Sanz, Marta Belenguer, Carles Francino, Emilio Linder, Carlota García', null, 'METRALLA was a rock group from the late 1980s that achieved great success with its first and only LP titled “Por Tus Muertos”, but which mysteriously dissolved just before giving its first concert. Thirty years later, Miguel, one of the members of the band, still dreams of being a rock star, even though no one goes to his concerts and his music store is about to be seized by the bank. Ordúñez, a famous rock radio communicator, offers him to give a concert at the Palace of Madrid on the condition that he reunites the original members of the band.', 'METRALLA was a rock group from the late 1980s that achieved great success with its first and only LP titled “Por Tus Muertos”, but which mysteriously dissolved just before giving its first concert. Thirty years later, Miguel, one of the members of the band, still dreams of being a rock star, even though no one goes to his concerts and his music store is about to be seized by the bank. Ordúñez, a famous rock radio communicator, offers him to give a concert at the Palace of Madrid on the condition that he reunites the original members of the band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j61AYdBcEk6WZZzxmhfoNZccn4j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1209304'),
  ('1113696105986889340', 'Porcelain Horse', 2012, 'Drama', 'Chris Teague, Javier Andrade', 'Javier Andrade', 'Leovanna Orlandini, Andrés Crespo, Francisco Savinovich, Alejandro Fajardo, Victor Arauz', null, 'Paco Chavez''s life is careless and charming. It''s a life of illicit drugs and a forbidden love affair he carries with Lucia, his former high school sweetheart, now married to another man. One night, Paco and his younger brother Luis, enter their parent''s home to steal a porcelain horse to pawn in order to score more drugs. Their father catches them and a fight ensues. The consequences of that fight will haunt both brothers forever.', 'Paco Chavez''s life is careless and charming. It''s a life of illicit drugs and a forbidden love affair he carries with Lucia, his former high school sweetheart, now married to another man. One night, Paco and his younger brother Luis, enter their parent''s home to steal a porcelain horse to pawn in order to score more drugs. Their father catches them and a fight ensues. The consequences of that fight will haunt both brothers forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNe88HZI2BXIHBrxlq0bl37tO7K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225335'),
  ('296729097305399085', 'Porco Rosso', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Atsushi Okui, Megumi Kagawa', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Shūichirō Moriyama, Tokiko Kato, Bunshi Katsura VI, Tsunehiko Kamijô, Akemi Okamura, Akio Otsuka, Hiroko Seki, Reizō Nomoto', 'PG', 'In Italy in the 1930s, sky pirates in biplanes terrorize wealthy cruise ships as they sail the Adriatic Sea. The only pilot brave enough to stop the scourge is the mysterious Porco Rosso, a former World War I flying ace who was somehow turned into a pig during the war. As he prepares to battle the pirate crew''s American ace, Porco Rosso enlists the help of spunky girl mechanic Fio Piccolo and his longtime friend Madame Gina.', 'In Italy in the 1930s, sky pirates in biplanes terrorize wealthy cruise ships as they sail the Adriatic Sea. The only pilot brave enough to stop the scourge is the mysterious Porco Rosso, a former World War I flying ace who was somehow turned into a pig during the war. As he prepares to battle the pirate crew''s American ace, Porco Rosso enlists the help of spunky girl mechanic Fio Piccolo and his longtime friend Madame Gina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mIvSvnVBApfORL9N6S38Q7wD6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11621'),
  ('388680026043533915', 'Porgy and Bess', 1959, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Leon Shamroy, Otto Preminger, Paul Helmick', 'N. Richard Nash', 'Sidney Poitier, Dorothy Dandridge, Sammy Davis Jr., Pearl Bailey, Brock Peters, Diahann Carroll, Leslie Scott, Ruth Attaway', 'NR', 'In the early 1900s, the fictional Catfish Row section of Charleston, South Carolina serves as home to a black fishing community. Crippled beggar Porgy, who travels about in a goat-drawn cart, loves the drug-addicted Bess, who lives with stevedore Crown, the local bully.', 'In the early 1900s, the fictional Catfish Row section of Charleston, South Carolina serves as home to a black fishing community. Crippled beggar Porgy, who travels about in a goat-drawn cart, loves the drug-addicted Bess, who lives with stevedore Crown, the local bully.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4zwlj8bgRYsUoF0VEwPEgldCvn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1940'),
  ('431927385897966114', 'Pork Chop Hill', 1959, 'Drama, History, War', 'Lewis Milestone, Sam Leavitt, Ray Gosnell Jr.', 'James R. Webb', 'Gregory Peck, Harry Guardino, Rip Torn, George Peppard, Carl Benton Reid, James Edwards, Bob Steele, Woody Strode', null, 'Korean War, April 1953. Lieutenant Clemons, leader of the King company of the United States Infantry, is ordered to recapture Pork Chop Hill, occupied by a powerful Chinese Army force, while, just seventy miles away, at nearby the village of Panmunjom, a tense cease-fire conference is celebrated.', 'Korean War, April 1953. Lieutenant Clemons, leader of the King company of the United States Infantry, is ordered to recapture Pork Chop Hill, occupied by a powerful Chinese Army force, while, just seventy miles away, at nearby the village of Panmunjom, a tense cease-fire conference is celebrated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88LF3thfIx1BDqa5aErseoFXz58.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37305'),
  ('647593011695903667', 'Pork Pie', 2017, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Matt Murphy', 'Matt Murphy', 'Dean O''Gorman, James Rolleston, Ashleigh Cummings, Antonia Prebble, Matt Whelan, Siobhan Marshall, Ben Mitchell, Tom Sainsbury', null, 'A trio of accidental outlaws travel the length of New Zealand, protesting conformity and chasing lost love, with a posse of cops and a media frenzy in pursuit.', 'A trio of accidental outlaws travel the length of New Zealand, protesting conformity and chasing lost love, with a posse of cops and a media frenzy in pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVq78wlHLWTf1QQ0BzdcBeg8vM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429698'),
  ('265022867373047789', 'Porklips Now', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Ernie Fosselius', 'Ernie Fosselius', 'Billy Gray, Ernie Fosselius, John Brent, Leon Martel, Mark Lee, Jim Turner, Larry Walker, Tom Bullock', 'NR', 'This spoof of ''Apocalypse Now'' has health inspector Will Dullard travelling by car "uptown" with two friends to have a meeting with a certain Mertz, the owner of a meat processing shop, to "investigate with extreme prejudice."', 'This spoof of ''Apocalypse Now'' has health inspector Will Dullard travelling by car "uptown" with two friends to have a meeting with a certain Mertz, the owner of a meat processing shop, to "investigate with extreme prejudice."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iinbsN5Gox6Lou0f8kiRqQeyM7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282393'),
  ('66295880188415709', 'Porky & Daffy', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky Pig is Daffy Duck''s fight manager who gets Daffy a fight with "The Champion", but things get looney.', 'Porky Pig is Daffy Duck''s fight manager who gets Daffy a fight with "The Champion", but things get looney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMMrC9ZEzFgR9ZaHRNR8Zk1dqtn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150483'),
  ('470055917983326055', 'Porky and Gabby', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ub Iwerks', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky Pig and ill-tempered Gabby Goat go on a camping outing. Chaos ensues.', 'Porky Pig and ill-tempered Gabby Goat go on a camping outing. Chaos ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CQW3guwnFZJv4rexNqUJS2tsJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151863'),
  ('610662912632672167', 'Porky at the Crocadero', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'The Crocadero nightclub. Porky has his diploma from the Sucker Correspondence School of music, and has dreams of being a bandleader, but he''s broke. He gets a job at the club washing dishes. His boss mistakes Porky going after a fly for loafing and fires him. His bandleaders don''t show, and he brings Porky back to impersonate several famous bandleaders.', 'The Crocadero nightclub. Porky has his diploma from the Sucker Correspondence School of music, and has dreams of being a bandleader, but he''s broke. He gets a job at the club washing dishes. His boss mistakes Porky going after a fly for loafing and fires him. His bandleaders don''t show, and he brings Porky back to impersonate several famous bandleaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9jwWSQDr27kuSF5IGmN9oN1toG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236179'),
  ('643304490867166252', 'Porky Chops', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Arthur Davis', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Lumber jack Porky Pig intrudes upon the peace of a hipster squirrel vacationing in the Northwoods by trying to chop down the squirrel''s tree. The squirrel retaliates by enclosing the base of his tree with steel so that Porky''s axes cannot penetrate. The ensuing conflict between Porky and the squirrel awakens an angry bear.', 'Lumber jack Porky Pig intrudes upon the peace of a hipster squirrel vacationing in the Northwoods by trying to chop down the squirrel''s tree. The squirrel retaliates by enclosing the base of his tree with steel so that Porky''s axes cannot penetrate. The ensuing conflict between Porky and the squirrel awakens an angry bear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFuErcrPb6rmKfQFAC6bCg9NxT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88761'),
  ('198705347714162168', 'Porky in Egypt', 1938, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc, Danny Webb', null, 'Porky is a tourist. He''s missed the main camel, so he rents one of his own. Both of them are soon overcome by the hot desert sun; the camel starts hallucinating, and marches off, playing the bagpipes. Porky sees the camel swimming in a pool, but it turns out to be a mirage. The camel eventually recovers enough to bring both of them back to town, where Porky goes mad.', 'Porky is a tourist. He''s missed the main camel, so he rents one of his own. Both of them are soon overcome by the hot desert sun; the camel starts hallucinating, and marches off, playing the bagpipes. Porky sees the camel swimming in a pool, but it turns out to be a mirage. The camel eventually recovers enough to bring both of them back to town, where Porky goes mad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uFhCAmRSTMU6G4uajB6ODONZFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100333'),
  ('488666709445572850', 'Porky in the North Woods', 1936, 'Animation, Family', 'Frank Tashlin, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Joe Dougherty, Bernice Hansen', null, 'Porky Pig runs a game refuge. Despite the abundant signs to the contrary, Jean-Baptiste the trapper sets numerous traps, ensnaring many animals.', 'Porky Pig runs a game refuge. Despite the abundant signs to the contrary, Jean-Baptiste the trapper sets numerous traps, ensnaring many animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ajb1njNLK6KpjztCVHETM2ZJRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201993'),
  ('964961825507219179', 'Porky in Wackyland', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Porky Pig travels to a surreal land in order to hunt and catch the elusive Do-Do bird, reportedly the last of its kind.', 'Porky Pig travels to a surreal land in order to hunt and catch the elusive Do-Do bird, reportedly the last of its kind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uq1BO4DmBMTM1PPULLoy4yIpsD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128756'),
  ('984469705934843341', 'Porky Pig''s Feat', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky Pig and Daffy Duck owe an outrageous sum to the Broken Arms Hotel. The manager thwarts their efforts to escape without paying their bill.', 'Porky Pig and Daffy Duck owe an outrageous sum to the Broken Arms Hotel. The manager thwarts their efforts to escape without paying their bill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNcwmRR97ryxZZhg1lPhJ11E5Ec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100334'),
  ('456398703362563000', 'Porky the Rain-Maker', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Joe Dougherty, Tedd Pierce', null, 'The farm is suffering through a terrible drought. Porky''s father sends him to the store to buy some feed with their last dollar...', 'The farm is suffering through a terrible drought. Porky''s father sends him to the store to buy some feed with their last dollar...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvxBMLnm8jXHuewYuyS4hB4uwos.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201974'),
  ('1094799022446354017', 'Porky''s', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Bob Clark, Reginald H. Morris', 'Bob Clark', 'Dan Monahan, Mark Herrier, Wyatt Knight, Roger Wilson, Cyril O''Reilly, Tony Ganios, Kaki Hunter, Kim Cattrall', 'R', 'In 1954 Florida, a group of high school boys head to a strip club in the Everglades in an attempt to lose their collective virginity. When the club''s owner and his sheriff brother swindle them out of their money and embarrass them, the boys plan revenge.', 'In 1954 Florida, a group of high school boys head to a strip club in the Everglades in an attempt to lose their collective virginity. When the club''s owner and his sheriff brother swindle them out of their money and embarrass them, the boys plan revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqCOt1cWfKqCepxK7LIdT812idH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10246'),
  ('1058624852221121891', 'Porky''s Badtime Story', 1937, 'Animation, Family', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'After Porky and Gabby oversleep yet again, their boss warns them that they''ll be fired if they''re late again...', 'After Porky and Gabby oversleep yet again, their boss warns them that they''ll be fired if they''re late again...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pR9ktdkeCbh0rhQuRPcXEHelRp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219529'),
  ('54925722597116101', 'Porky''s Cafe', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Chuck Jones, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky uses his cafe''s kitchen''s mechanical gadgets to fix a meal for a diner, while cook Conrad Cat deals with an ant in the pancake mix.', 'Porky uses his cafe''s kitchen''s mechanical gadgets to fix a meal for a diner, while cook Conrad Cat deals with an ant in the pancake mix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCT7vhUa5PZnohdHBEtrOXpc2ku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188390'),
  ('842621733652179823', 'Porky''s Double Trouble', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Sara Berner, Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky Pig has some problems when his mobster lookalike decides to frame him for a bank job.', 'Porky Pig has some problems when his mobster lookalike decides to frame him for a bank job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaOTMMkRrj2EJXCgGUhf7kooSbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196813'),
  ('1045335612909222290', 'Porky''s Duck Hunt', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery, Carl W. Stalling', 'Tex Avery', 'Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher', null, 'Inexperienced duck hunter Porky Pig is taunted by a mischievous duck (Daffy, making his screen debut).', 'Inexperienced duck hunter Porky Pig is taunted by a mischievous duck (Daffy, making his screen debut).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8REnyGCIYg8BHXMWHNYH7dEcaGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190072'),
  ('929595843369386853', 'Porky''s Garden', 1937, 'Comedy, Family, Animation', 'Tex Avery, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Earle Hodgins, Charles Judels', null, 'Porky decides to start a garden. Mayhem ensues.', 'Porky decides to start a garden. Mayhem ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsc7P64L3LhHXgQo8iwi3961Fx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190101'),
  ('678250035294400078', 'Porky''s Hare Hunt', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Ben Hardaway, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Porky Pig goes after a rogue rabbit who manages to frustrate him at every turn.', 'Porky Pig goes after a rogue rabbit who manages to frustrate him at every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lB5e1uSwtErZRSPklxjya19WcIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188763'),
  ('932266931722878659', 'Porky''s II: The Next Day', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Bob Clark, Reginald H. Morris', 'Roger Swaybill, Alan Ormsby, Bob Clark', 'Dan Monahan, Wyatt Knight, Mark Herrier, Roger Wilson, Cyril O''Reilly, Tony Ganios, Kaki Hunter, Scott Colomby', 'R', 'When the students of Angel Beach High decide to stage "An Evening With Shakespeare," their efforts are threatened by Miss Balbricker, who views the works of Shakespeare as obscene. She enlists the help of Reverend Bubba Flavel, a religious fanatic who brings along his flock of followers to pressure the school into shutting down the production.', 'When the students of Angel Beach High decide to stage "An Evening With Shakespeare," their efforts are threatened by Miss Balbricker, who views the works of Shakespeare as obscene. She enlists the help of Reverend Bubba Flavel, a religious fanatic who brings along his flock of followers to pressure the school into shutting down the production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZjSlaXM8Ez91ZV39frILApGuKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19698'),
  ('825271669183375408', 'Porky''s Midnight Matinee', 1941, 'Animation', 'Chuck Jones, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Working backstage at a theater, Porky frees a little ant he finds in a cage, only to learn that it''s a rare and valuable trained pygmy ant.', 'Working backstage at a theater, Porky frees a little ant he finds in a cage, only to learn that it''s a rare and valuable trained pygmy ant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umjBP8162wp2Z3DFy7i8e4B9UBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236532'),
  ('961689262142858539', 'Porky''s Party', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky''s birthday. His uncle sends him a silkworm that churns out articles of clothing when it hears the word "sew." After a sock and a bra, Porky stuffs it in a pocket to prepare for his party. He uses some hair tonic, then his dog Black Fury has some for himself it''s 99% alcohol. The guests arrive: a penguin and a goose. The penguin, shoveling in the food, accidentally swallows the worm, which starts churning out top hats, which pop open inside the penguin''s head. The goose tries increasingly violent ways of remedying this. Meanwhile, Porky''s dog, lathered with shaving cream, runs in and is branded a mad dog.', 'Porky''s birthday. His uncle sends him a silkworm that churns out articles of clothing when it hears the word "sew." After a sock and a bra, Porky stuffs it in a pocket to prepare for his party. He uses some hair tonic, then his dog Black Fury has some for himself it''s 99% alcohol. The guests arrive: a penguin and a goose. The penguin, shoveling in the food, accidentally swallows the worm, which starts churning out top hats, which pop open inside the penguin''s head. The goose tries increasingly violent ways of remedying this. Meanwhile, Porky''s dog, lathered with shaving cream, runs in and is branded a mad dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfgPNRGQxhClOwLC8SHLy6FLns9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100335'),
  ('121537363194889110', 'Porky''s Pastry Pirates', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Kent Rogers', null, 'Porky Pig owns a bakery. Enter a bee and a fly.', 'Porky Pig owns a bakery. Enter a bee and a fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhDRdNXaDnL63jlKwxkrHL7MQwJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152243'),
  ('1012419862946170431', 'Porky''s Pooch', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A dog named Rover explains to a Scottish Terrier named Sandy how he got his master. He went into a hotel room and bothered someone taking a bath--Porky Pig. Porky doesn''t want Rover as a pet, no matter how many times Rover tries to make Porky adopt him.', 'A dog named Rover explains to a Scottish Terrier named Sandy how he got his master. He went into a hotel room and bothered someone taking a bath--Porky Pig. Porky doesn''t want Rover as a pet, no matter how many times Rover tries to make Porky adopt him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tumsLxfzec5EbEfrE8yRFnpcIAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236511'),
  ('530082941429129426', 'Porky''s Poppa', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett, Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Robert Clampett', null, 'We take a tour of Porky''s Poppa''s farm, to the tune of Old MacDonald. After meeting several animals, "on this farm, he has a mortgage" which he frets over, particularly since Bessie has stopped producing milk. Poppa orders an Acme milk producing robot, and the beast vs. machine battle is on.', 'We take a tour of Porky''s Poppa''s farm, to the tune of Old MacDonald. After meeting several animals, "on this farm, he has a mortgage" which he frets over, particularly since Bessie has stopped producing milk. Poppa orders an Acme milk producing robot, and the beast vs. machine battle is on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqVhJVlmzpIsgUnZxAA9AnaL2Eh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236191'),
  ('184131365754876952', 'Porky''s Poultry Plant', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Joe Dougherty', null, 'Porky Pig is raising chickens, ducks, and geese. Many birds have fallen victim to the hawk. Porky''s going to do everything he can to fight back.', 'Porky Pig is raising chickens, ducks, and geese. Many birds have fallen victim to the hawk. Porky''s going to do everything he can to fight back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A69Fp5gezIM3O11q91nOUMKlsVi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201997'),
  ('137552496507690428', 'Porky''s Preview', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Mel Blanc, Sara Berner, Cliff Nazarro', null, 'The audience enters Porky''s movie theater, with a collection of quick gags: A firefly acting as usher, a kangaroo taking tickets and putting the stubs in her pouch, a chicken buying child tickets for her eggs. A skunk tries to buy a ticket, costing a nickel, but he only has one scent. He looks for a way to sneak in. Meanwhile, Porky introduces the show: a collection of cartoons, drawn as stick figures. At the end, the audience is all gone because the skunk managed to sneak in. Porky''s cartoons include: Circus Parade, Choo-Choo Train, Soldiers (Marchin), Horse Race, and Dances (hula, Mexican hat, and ballet). All accompanied by a self-parody musical score.', 'The audience enters Porky''s movie theater, with a collection of quick gags: A firefly acting as usher, a kangaroo taking tickets and putting the stubs in her pouch, a chicken buying child tickets for her eggs. A skunk tries to buy a ticket, costing a nickel, but he only has one scent. He looks for a way to sneak in. Meanwhile, Porky introduces the show: a collection of cartoons, drawn as stick figures. At the end, the audience is all gone because the skunk managed to sneak in. Porky''s cartoons include: Circus Parade, Choo-Choo Train, Soldiers (Marchin), Horse Race, and Dances (hula, Mexican hat, and ballet). All accompanied by a self-parody musical score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4TcggtIcA5o0V8D9nTlRDOoX2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186425'),
  ('955995089956038116', 'Porky''s Railroad', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher', null, 'Porky is the engineer on the most pathetic train in the fleet. After some routine episodes (using pepper to get the engine to sneeze itself up a hill, chasing a cow off the tracks, only to discover too late that it''s been replaced by a very angry bull), Porky gets word that he''s going to be replaced by the new streamlined Silver Fish. He insults it under his breath, but the Silver Fish engineer hears and challenges him to a race. The angry bull catapults Porky to victory.', 'Porky is the engineer on the most pathetic train in the fleet. After some routine episodes (using pepper to get the engine to sneeze itself up a hill, chasing a cow off the tracks, only to discover too late that it''s been replaced by a very angry bull), Porky gets word that he''s going to be replaced by the new streamlined Silver Fish. He insults it under his breath, but the Silver Fish engineer hears and challenges him to a race. The angry bull catapults Porky to victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5l9gvtWVFW201L72DCrzBkdiqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219554'),
  ('968639249738238620', 'Porky''s Revenge', 1985, 'Comedy', 'James Komack', 'Ziggy Steinberg, Bob Clark', 'Dan Monahan, Wyatt Knight, Tony Ganios, Mark Herrier, Kaki Hunter, Scott Colomby, Nancy Parsons, Fred Buch', 'R', 'As graduation nears for the class of 1955 at Angel Beach High, the gang once again faces off against their old enemy, Porky, who wants them to throw the school''s championship basketball game since he has bet on the opposing team.', 'As graduation nears for the class of 1955 at Angel Beach High, the gang once again faces off against their old enemy, Porky, who wants them to throw the school''s championship basketball game since he has bet on the opposing team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ad3F9Fm7zdZmBqBSvJIAJRfac9m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23919'),
  ('113034404853181414', 'Porky''s Road Race', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher, Joe Dougherty, Tedd Pierce, Elvia Allman, Dave Barry', null, 'It''s race day, and first prize is $2 million (less $1,999,998.37 in taxes). Porky''s little car is matched against cars driven by stars of yesteryear, including Laurel and Hardy and Charlie Chaplin. When the black #13 driven by "Borax Karoff" makes a bid for the finish line, can Porky fend him off?', 'It''s race day, and first prize is $2 million (less $1,999,998.37 in taxes). Porky''s little car is matched against cars driven by stars of yesteryear, including Laurel and Hardy and Charlie Chaplin. When the black #13 driven by "Borax Karoff" makes a bid for the finish line, can Porky fend him off?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqFNEw1S6x2H4Lhs8HLczruFk5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100330'),
