  ('144034954171240302', 'Port of Flowers', 1943, 'War, Drama, Comedy', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Hiroshi Kusuda', 'Yoshiro Tsuji', 'Eitarō Ozawa, Ken Uehara, Mitsuko Mito, Chishū Ryū, Eijirō Tōno, Takeshi Sakamoto, Yôsuke Hanzawa, Fusako Maki', null, 'The sweet but naive denizens of a charming port town are hoodwinked by a couple of con men at the outset of World War II. But the hustlers’ plan backfires when they come down with severe cases of conscience. Keisuke Kinoshita’s directorial debut is a breezy, warmhearted, and often very funny crowd-pleaser that’s a testament to the filmmaker’s faith in people.', 'The sweet but naive denizens of a charming port town are hoodwinked by a couple of con men at the outset of World War II. But the hustlers’ plan backfires when they come down with severe cases of conscience. Keisuke Kinoshita’s directorial debut is a breezy, warmhearted, and often very funny crowd-pleaser that’s a testament to the filmmaker’s faith in people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAoxWaB6dmAIxYYE276HYa1Bf8s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299104'),
  ('448451984525801234', 'Port of Freedom', 1944, 'Drama, Romance', 'Helmut Käutner, Werner Krien', 'Richard Nicolas, Helmut Käutner', 'Hans Albers, Ilse Werner, Hans Söhnker, Hilde Hildebrand, Gustav Knuth, Günther Lüders, Ilse Fürstenberg, Helmut Käutner', null, 'Singing sailor Hannes, who now entertains the crowd at St. Pauli''s Hippodrome after years at sea, promises his dying brother that he will take care of his ex-girlfriend Gisa. Taking Gisa to Hamburg to live with him, Hannes quickly falls in love with her, but soon has to face Gisa''s affection for another man, Willem.', 'Singing sailor Hannes, who now entertains the crowd at St. Pauli''s Hippodrome after years at sea, promises his dying brother that he will take care of his ex-girlfriend Gisa. Taking Gisa to Hamburg to live with him, Hannes quickly falls in love with her, but soon has to face Gisa''s affection for another man, Willem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kL2LPROwMQLQArdib3HJktDYi1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10574'),
  ('324170530764205457', 'Port of New York', 1949, 'Crime, Drama', 'László Benedek, George E. Diskant, Irving Friedman', 'Eugene Ling', 'Scott Brady, Richard Rober, K.T. Stevens, Yul Brynner, Arthur Blake, Lynne Carter, John Kellogg, William Challee', 'NR', 'Two narcotics agents go after a gang of murderous drug dealers who use ships docking at the New York harbor to smuggle in their contraband.', 'Two narcotics agents go after a gang of murderous drug dealers who use ships docking at the New York harbor to smuggle in their contraband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2daeeaQdjkRSr2cGyPX8iVIsUl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23334'),
  ('33819248210538948', 'Port of Shadows', 1938, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Marcel Carné, Eugen Schüfftan', 'Jacques Prévert', 'Jean Gabin, Michel Simon, Michèle Morgan, Pierre Brasseur, Édouard Delmont, Raymond Aimos, Robert Le Vigan, René Génin', null, 'Down a foggy, desolate road to the port city of Le Havre travels Jean, an army deserter looking for another chance to make good on life. Fate, however, has a different plan for him, as acts of both revenge and kindness render him front-page news.', 'Down a foggy, desolate road to the port city of Le Havre travels Jean, an army deserter looking for another chance to make good on life. Fate, however, has a different plan for him, as acts of both revenge and kindness render him front-page news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2S8O2V50TZlXV8uabOvGUJ1i5CZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46326'),
  ('252287750494040081', 'Porta dos Fundos: Contrato Vitalício', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Ian SBF, Tereza Gonzalez, Gui Machado', 'Fábio Porchat, Gabriel Esteves', 'Fábio Porchat, Gregório Duvivier, Thati Lopes, Luís Lobianco, João Vicente de Castro, Antonio Tabet, Rafael Portugal, Marcos Veras', 'PG', 'Two friends, filmmaker Miguel and actor Rodrigo, win the grand prize of the jury at the Cannes Film Festival. After drinking too much, Rodrigo signs a lifetime contract to star in Miguel''s next film. Miguel mysteriously disappears and comes back ten years later proposing to make a delirious film retelling his adventure in the years he''d been gone. Rodrigo is already famous and fears risking his career, but he has no alternative but to comply.', 'Two friends, filmmaker Miguel and actor Rodrigo, win the grand prize of the jury at the Cannes Film Festival. After drinking too much, Rodrigo signs a lifetime contract to star in Miguel''s next film. Miguel mysteriously disappears and comes back ten years later proposing to make a delirious film retelling his adventure in the years he''d been gone. Rodrigo is already famous and fears risking his career, but he has no alternative but to comply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtMhA3TGD0yJ65lDjywe1cxkQ6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394499'),
  ('106805703560617066', 'Portishead: Roseland New York', 1998, 'Music, Documentary', 'Dick Carruthers', null, 'Beth Gibbons, Geoff Barrow, Adrian Utley, Dave MacDonald', null, 'Portishead concert in the Roseland Ballroom, New York City, on 24th July 1997 with tracks from the albums "Dummy" and "Portishead" played by the band and a 30 piece orchestra.', 'Portishead concert in the Roseland Ballroom, New York City, on 24th July 1997 with tracks from the albums "Dummy" and "Portishead" played by the band and a 30 piece orchestra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jN7D1C1pGskfnYWD57BbPwmdM9m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15520'),
  ('550684325793890944', 'Portland', 1996, 'Crime, Drama', 'Niels Arden Oplev, Henrik Jongdahl', null, 'Anders W. Berthelsen, Ulrich Thomsen, Iben Hjejle, Helle Dolleris, Jens Albinus, Birthe Neumann', null, 'The basic story of a young criminal not quite living up to his won ideals of "not to give a damn" sidesteps out of his criminal career while dragging his younger brother into it, could have been interesting. Unfortunately the implementation is simply not good enough. As so often with Danish movies, there is little appreciation for detail thus leaving us with hoodlums talking like they''ve done time at a business academy rather than a prison. Dialects completely out of here and idiosyncratic bikers without bikes or even character for that matter. An ever accelerating surrealism towards the end doesn''t help to clear the slow pace of this film but it does give a glimpse of what the story could have unfolded to become.', 'The basic story of a young criminal not quite living up to his won ideals of "not to give a damn" sidesteps out of his criminal career while dragging his younger brother into it, could have been interesting. Unfortunately the implementation is simply not good enough. As so often with Danish movies, there is little appreciation for detail thus leaving us with hoodlums talking like they''ve done time at a business academy rather than a prison. Dialects completely out of here and idiosyncratic bikers without bikes or even character for that matter. An ever accelerating surrealism towards the end doesn''t help to clear the slow pace of this film but it does give a glimpse of what the story could have unfolded to become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PTzrF8CSHxf5pmfcGJHUupbYVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77077'),
  ('787883373410800193', 'Portland Street Blues', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'Raymond Yip Wai-Man, Lai Yiu-Fai', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Patrick Kong Pak-Leung', 'Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Kristy Yang Rongru, Shu Qi, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Vincent Wan Yeung-Ming, Richard Ng Man-Tat, John Ching Tung, Chik King-Man', null, 'In a triad underworld dominated by men, the film tells the story of how Sister 13 (Sandra Ng) faces the trials and tribulations of rising to become the Hung Hing branch leader of Portland Street, in this first official spin-off movie from the Young & Dangerous Series.', 'In a triad underworld dominated by men, the film tells the story of how Sister 13 (Sandra Ng) faces the trials and tribulations of rising to become the Hung Hing branch leader of Portland Street, in this first official spin-off movie from the Young & Dangerous Series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0paNBnLz9W2RDqWGsmAgNANCZm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49215'),
  ('906850980185610195', 'Portnoy''s Complaint', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ernest Lehman, Philip H. Lathrop, Michael D. Moore', 'Ernest Lehman', 'Richard Benjamin, Karen Black, Lee Grant, Jack Somack, Renée Lippin, Jeannie Berlin, Kevin Conway, Lewis J. Stadlen', null, 'During a session with his psychoanalyst, Alexander Portnoy rants about everything that is bothering him. His complaints include his childhood and his family with an emphasis on his mother, his sexual fantasies and the problems that he has with women, and his obsessive feelings about his Judaism.', 'During a session with his psychoanalyst, Alexander Portnoy rants about everything that is bothering him. His complaints include his childhood and his family with an emphasis on his mother, his sexual fantasies and the problems that he has with women, and his obsessive feelings about his Judaism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cohjszyNI4MaewCuaF2IUSSS22B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145364'),
  ('1041755809324542854', 'Porto das Caixas', 1963, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Paulo César Saraceni, Mário Carneiro, Luis Carlos Miele', 'Paulo César Saraceni', 'Irma Álvarez, Reginaldo Faria, Paulo Padilha, Joseph Guerreiro, Margarida Rey, Sergio Sanz', null, 'In the city of Porto das Caixas, a woman seeks help from multiple lovers to murder her dirty husband. Desperate to free herself, she decides to put her plan into practice alone.', 'In the city of Porto das Caixas, a woman seeks help from multiple lovers to murder her dirty husband. Desperate to free herself, she decides to put her plan into practice alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngtSjws9ubQCBrdnKFKsOvDscDx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194978'),
  ('8561687782149712', 'Porto of My Childhood', 2001, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Emmanuel Machuel', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Jorge Trêpa, Ricardo Trêpa, Maria de Medeiros, Manoel de Oliveira, José Wallenstein, Rogério Samora, Leonor Baldaque, Leonor Silveira', null, 'Manoel de Oliveira''s autobiographical documentary about returning to his hometown.', 'Manoel de Oliveira''s autobiographical documentary about returning to his hometown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNUnlO8ktyhebPrha0Uiq1s9HlH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117406'),
  ('717737004678763019', 'Portrait in Black', 1960, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Gordon, Russell Metty', 'Ben Roberts, Ivan Goff', 'Lana Turner, Anthony Quinn, Richard Basehart, Sandra Dee, John Saxon, Ray Walston, Virginia Grey, Anna May Wong', 'NR', 'A pair of lovers plot to kill the woman''s rich husband.', 'A pair of lovers plot to kill the woman''s rich husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aev5PXbTpOlNrat44ljgibZH8br.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39779'),
  ('543481918112675273', 'Portrait in Crystal', 1983, 'Action, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Hua Shan, Tang Tak-Cheung, Nico Wong Man-Wan', 'Chen Wengui, Tsai Nai-Pin, Huang Ying', 'Jason Pai Piao, Chun Wong, Lau Yuk-Pok, Lam Sau-Kwan, Teng Wei-Hao, Wang Yong, Chen Szu-Chia, Hsiao Yu', null, 'When a naive sculptor spills blood on his newest statue, he awakens a mass-murdering crystalline spirit in the underworld. Along with his trusted companion Fatty, he backflips his way through mystical realms to uncover who is trapping souls in his statues..', 'When a naive sculptor spills blood on his newest statue, he awakens a mass-murdering crystalline spirit in the underworld. Along with his trusted companion Fatty, he backflips his way through mystical realms to uncover who is trapping souls in his statues..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qw9fWACKGoRhcCD9aqNuhEL1JJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104595'),
  ('350979921863900864', 'Portrait in Terror', 1965, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Rados Novakovic', 'Vic Webber', 'William Campbell, Anna Pavane, Patrick Magee, Kerry Anderson, Dante Gerino, Mike Astin', null, 'A plan to steal a valuable work of art leads to murder.', 'A plan to steal a valuable work of art leads to murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fx35nzmgUpedBcbHMzLdNseJlFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252422'),
  ('729539788142116494', 'Portrait of a ''60% Perfect Man'': Billy Wilder', 1982, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Annie Tresgot, Gary Graver, Michel Ciment', null, 'Michel Ciment, Billy Wilder, Walter Matthau, Jack Lemmon, I. A. L. Diamond', null, 'French film critic Michel Ciment interviews Billy Wilder about his life and filmmaking.', 'French film critic Michel Ciment interviews Billy Wilder about his life and filmmaking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iULHepTQDh2gLWKo6TvEmWwRoym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153100'),
  ('1139829834882641228', 'Portrait of a Beauty', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jeon Yun-su, Hong Chang-pyo, Kim Seung-gyu', 'Suryeon Han, Jeon Yun-su', 'Kim Gyu-ri, Kim Young-ho, Kim Nam-gil, Choo Ja-hyun, Bo Ri, Lee Eun-mi, Shin Yu-ju, Joo Young-ho', null, 'Born to a family of established court painters, seven-year-old Yoon-jeong is a young girl gifted at painting. However, the pressure is on her brother to carry on the proud family tradition, as women aren’t allowed to become professional painters. While her brother trains to take his place in the court, Yoon-jeong helps him out by secretly painting for him. The little girl’s life is turned upside down when her brother kills himself. In order to preserve the family honor, she is forced to take her brother’s name and lives as a man. Yun-bok’s genius and talent captures the heart of another great master of the time, Kim Hong-do. But her daring depictions of women are condemned by the royal institute as obscene. Yun-bok meets Kang-mu and falls deeply in love. For the first time, she feels the strong desire to abandon everything she has built and simply be a woman in front of the man she loves. Kang-moo sacrifices all for his love as well.', 'Born to a family of established court painters, seven-year-old Yoon-jeong is a young girl gifted at painting. However, the pressure is on her brother to carry on the proud family tradition, as women aren’t allowed to become professional painters. While her brother trains to take his place in the court, Yoon-jeong helps him out by secretly painting for him. The little girl’s life is turned upside down when her brother kills himself. In order to preserve the family honor, she is forced to take her brother’s name and lives as a man. Yun-bok’s genius and talent captures the heart of another great master of the time, Kim Hong-do. But her daring depictions of women are condemned by the royal institute as obscene. Yun-bok meets Kang-mu and falls deeply in love. For the first time, she feels the strong desire to abandon everything she has built and simply be a woman in front of the man she loves. Kang-moo sacrifices all for his love as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJJLJQRTvc7AWQaCgejhPawL412.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60192'),
  ('888769805466405925', 'Portrait of a Beauty', 2019, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Umur Turagay', 'Pınar Bulut, Onur Koralp', 'Burçin Terzioğlu, Birkan Sokullu, Serkan Keskin, Melisa Şenolsun, Feridun Düzağaç, Şencan Güleryüz, Lara Tonka, Gizem Soysaldı', null, 'Receiving important news about her father, whom she has not met for years, Nisan returns to her father''s house with her husband and daughter. There are strange things happening in this mansion where she escaped away years ago. What is happening in the mansion.What is the mystery of the woman in the picture. Encountering her nightmares, Nisan has to illuminate this mystery as soon as possible in order to protect herself and her family.', 'Receiving important news about her father, whom she has not met for years, Nisan returns to her father''s house with her husband and daughter. There are strange things happening in this mansion where she escaped away years ago. What is happening in the mansion.What is the mystery of the woman in the picture. Encountering her nightmares, Nisan has to illuminate this mystery as soon as possible in order to protect herself and her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ad0DAihwDsvlDfTGVCdgw2MAoK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654795'),
  ('54678190403438277', 'Portrait of a Lady on Fire', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Céline Sciamma, Claire Mathon, Anaïs Couette', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Noémie Merlant, Adèle Haenel, Luàna Bajrami, Valeria Golino, Christel Baras, Armande Boulanger, Guy Delamarche, Clément Bouyssou', 'R', 'On an isolated island in Brittany at the end of the eighteenth century, a female painter is obliged to paint a wedding portrait of a young woman.', 'On an isolated island in Brittany at the end of the eighteenth century, a female painter is obliged to paint a wedding portrait of a young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LquGwEhbg3soxSCs9VNyh5VJd9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531428'),
  ('267190919424617379', 'Portrait of a Lazy Woman', 1986, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Chantal Akerman, Sonia Wieder-Atherton', null, 'Belgian director Chantal Akerman struggles to overcome her laziness in the name of making a film about the subject.', 'Belgian director Chantal Akerman struggles to overcome her laziness in the name of making a film about the subject.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WbPIMURQjR1vBmFuwzo5O59buM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646171'),
  ('1150620941459649140', 'Portrait of a Nude Woman', 1981, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Nino Manfredi, Alberto Lattuada', 'Silvana Buzzo, Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli', 'Nino Manfredi, Eleonora Giorgi, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Georges Wilson, Carlo Bagno, Beatrice Ring, Donato Castellaneta, Toni Barpi', null, 'Sandro is a Roman adrift in Venice during the Carnival. After sixteen years of marriage, Sandro can no longer reconcile his spontaneous and lively character with that of his wife Laura, a cultured and composed Venetian woman. Yet another argument prompts him to leave her and seek refuge at the home of a painter friend. Among his many paintings, he notices one depicting a naked woman who bears an incredible resemblance to his wife. Are they two women or one, and in the masquerade of the Carnival, what is real?', 'Sandro is a Roman adrift in Venice during the Carnival. After sixteen years of marriage, Sandro can no longer reconcile his spontaneous and lively character with that of his wife Laura, a cultured and composed Venetian woman. Yet another argument prompts him to leave her and seek refuge at the home of a painter friend. Among his many paintings, he notices one depicting a naked woman who bears an incredible resemblance to his wife. Are they two women or one, and in the masquerade of the Carnival, what is real?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVILhwu2KZdWe2Et3gKCuUXvzLq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58201'),
  ('934337469927228805', 'Portrait of a Young Girl at the End of the 60s in Brussels', 1994, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Chantal Akerman, Raymond Fromont', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Circé Lethem, Julien Rassam, Joëlle Marlier, Cynthia Rodberg', null, 'The main character, Michèle, spends the hour discussing her views of life with some old and new friends, and tries to understand her own feelings about her place in the world and her sexuality, while a camera follows along at close range.', 'The main character, Michèle, spends the hour discussing her views of life with some old and new friends, and tries to understand her own feelings about her place in the world and her sexuality, while a camera follows along at close range.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89s5DtuzCqrGFrojXHwW52wkQXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124485'),
  ('749574910023213451', 'Portrait of a Young Man in Three Movements', 1931, 'Documentary', 'Henwar Rodakiewicz', null, null, null, 'This is a non-narrative film, comprised of shots that "portray a certain young man in the terms of the things that he likes", such as the flow of the tide on a seashore, the motion of finely-tuned machinery, and sunlight shining through the fronds of a palm.', 'This is a non-narrative film, comprised of shots that "portray a certain young man in the terms of the things that he likes", such as the flow of the tide on a seashore, the motion of finely-tuned machinery, and sunlight shining through the fronds of a palm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yddfCJXkKDcAoxd6bxZtwZmcEo3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162611'),
  ('191407865055755121', 'Portrait of Alison', 1955, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Guy Green, Wilkie Cooper', 'Guy Green, Ken Hughes', 'Terry Moore, Robert Beatty, William Sylvester, Josephine Griffin, Geoffrey Keen, Allan Cuthbertson, Henry Oscar, William Lucas', 'NR', 'An actress and an artist are linked by his brother to deadly smugglers sought by Scotland Yard.', 'An actress and an artist are linked by his brother to deadly smugglers sought by Scotland Yard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOBHr7VZFsAappF3Eca4Ba4CD3D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171906'),
  ('855375807680889586', 'Portrait of Hell', 1969, 'Drama, Horror', 'Shirō Toyoda, Kazuo Yamada', 'Toshio Yasumi', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Kinnosuke Nakamura, Yōko Naitō, Shun Ōide, Hideyo Amamoto, Yoshirō Uchida, Tappei Shimokawa, Haruo Suzuki', null, 'The story, set in the Heian era, depicts the conflict between Korean painter Yoshihide (Nakadai) and his Japanese patron, the cruel and egotistical daimyo Horikawa (Nakamura). It is based on the 1918 short story Hell Screen by Ryūnosuke Akutagawa.', 'The story, set in the Heian era, depicts the conflict between Korean painter Yoshihide (Nakadai) and his Japanese patron, the cruel and egotistical daimyo Horikawa (Nakamura). It is based on the 1918 short story Hell Screen by Ryūnosuke Akutagawa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7649BNhPvj0lH5DY43K2ymwjJzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82547'),
  ('473736236769930508', 'Portrait of Jason', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Shirley Clarke, Jeri Sopanen', null, 'Jason Holliday, Shirley Clarke, Carl Lee', null, 'Interview with Jason Holliday aka Aaron Payne. House-boy, would-be cabaret performer, and self-proclaimed hustler giving one man''s gin-soaked, pill-popped view of what it was like to be black and gay in 1960s United States. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Milestone Films in 2013.', 'Interview with Jason Holliday aka Aaron Payne. House-boy, would-be cabaret performer, and self-proclaimed hustler giving one man''s gin-soaked, pill-popped view of what it was like to be black and gay in 1960s United States. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Milestone Films in 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yin3GGSG8FxiZmizfSwlcphQoYK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83232'),
  ('731483034408589599', 'Portrait of Jennie', 1948, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy, Mystery', 'William Dieterle, Joseph H. August', 'Ben Hecht', 'Jennifer Jones, Joseph Cotten, Ethel Barrymore, Lillian Gish, Cecil Kellaway, David Wayne, Florence Bates, Albert Sharpe', 'NR', 'A mysterious girl inspires a struggling artist.', 'A mysterious girl inspires a struggling artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuZVFoCOxKKwC6eKWol4NkAFpWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32558'),
  ('132343301992587828', 'Portrait of Madame Yuki', 1950, 'Drama', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Kiyoshi Komori, Jōji Ohara', 'Yoshikata Yoda', 'Michiyo Kogure, Ken Uehara, Eijirō Yanagi, Yoshiko Kuga, Haruya Katō, Yuriko Hamada, Kumeko Urabe, Shizue Natsukawa', null, 'A young woman takes up her new job as the servant of a noblewoman and soon discovers that underneath her facade of luxury lies great unhappiness.', 'A young woman takes up her new job as the servant of a noblewoman and soon discovers that underneath her facade of luxury lies great unhappiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEUwjDJlNrmBqiillV8zTo9JxPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46045'),
  ('513536790022820747', 'Portrait of the Artist as a Young Bunny', 1980, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Phil Monroe', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Bugs Bunny gushes with excitement over the end of school, but while stopping to wonder why he''s excited about this at his age, he runs into a tree and has a flashback to his youth, when he was just as excited about the end of school. But his nemesis, a young Elmer Fudd, is also out, and he''s out to get the budding wascally wabbit.', 'Bugs Bunny gushes with excitement over the end of school, but while stopping to wonder why he''s excited about this at his age, he runs into a tree and has a flashback to his youth, when he was just as excited about the end of school. But his nemesis, a young Elmer Fudd, is also out, and he''s out to get the budding wascally wabbit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sC3kT4FFTPXvXaccJSRFOv65rBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197765'),
  ('680968394608799165', 'Portrait: Werner Herzog', 1986, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Reinhold Messner, Lotte Eisner, Mick Jagger, Jason Robards, Klaus Kinski, Paul Hittscher, Thomas Mauch', null, 'An autobiographical short film by Werner Herzog made in 1986. Herzog tells stories about his life and career. The film contains excerpts and commentary on several Herzog films, including Signs of Life, Heart of Glass, Fata Morgana, Aguirre, the Wrath of God, The Great Ecstasy of Woodcarver Steiner, Fitzcarraldo, and the Les Blank documentary Burden of Dreams. Notable is footage of a conversation between Herzog and his mentor Lotte Eisner, a photographer. In another section, he talks with mountaineer Reinhold Messner, in which they discuss a potential film project in the Himalayas to star Klaus Kinski.', 'An autobiographical short film by Werner Herzog made in 1986. Herzog tells stories about his life and career. The film contains excerpts and commentary on several Herzog films, including Signs of Life, Heart of Glass, Fata Morgana, Aguirre, the Wrath of God, The Great Ecstasy of Woodcarver Steiner, Fitzcarraldo, and the Les Blank documentary Burden of Dreams. Notable is footage of a conversation between Herzog and his mentor Lotte Eisner, a photographer. In another section, he talks with mountaineer Reinhold Messner, in which they discuss a potential film project in the Himalayas to star Klaus Kinski.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FlBcT50GARAxBDZrNO8XfLMC4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162451'),
  ('980455096708790656', 'Portraits in a Sea of Lies', 2010, 'Drama', 'Carlos Gaviria', 'Carlos Gaviria', 'Paola Baldion, Julián Román, Edgardo Román, Ana María Arango, Carolina Lizarazo, Ramsés Ramos, Héctor Durango', null, 'A young woman experiences the worst life has to over in this depressing but worthwhile Colombian drama tinged with a hint of magical realism. Paola Baldion plays Marina, a withdrawn teenager whose abusive grand-dad houses her in a dilapidated shed. When the old fart pops his clogs, Marina passes into the care of cousin Jairo (Julian Roman), a cheesecake photographer who "hires" her to help him with his gear, and the two end up taking an episodic road trip as they travel to reclaim grandpa''s legacy. Unpleasant flashbacks to Marina''s tragic childhood ensue. Yep, the good times never end in this one! Known in English as Portraits in a Sea of Lies, this meditation on the 50-year long Colombian civil war - as seen through the grueling experiences of our heroine - won the Jury Award for Best Narrative Feature at the 14th Cine Las Americas International Film Festival.', 'A young woman experiences the worst life has to over in this depressing but worthwhile Colombian drama tinged with a hint of magical realism. Paola Baldion plays Marina, a withdrawn teenager whose abusive grand-dad houses her in a dilapidated shed. When the old fart pops his clogs, Marina passes into the care of cousin Jairo (Julian Roman), a cheesecake photographer who "hires" her to help him with his gear, and the two end up taking an episodic road trip as they travel to reclaim grandpa''s legacy. Unpleasant flashbacks to Marina''s tragic childhood ensue. Yep, the good times never end in this one! Known in English as Portraits in a Sea of Lies, this meditation on the 50-year long Colombian civil war - as seen through the grueling experiences of our heroine - won the Jury Award for Best Narrative Feature at the 14th Cine Las Americas International Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zg5shzmYW1KipImvEXrw3MY0faK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108309'),
  ('963458850526943890', 'Portraits of Women', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jörn Donner, Heikki Katajisto, Jaakko Talaskivi', 'Jörn Donner', 'Jörn Donner, Ritva Vepsä, Kirsti Wallasvaara, Aarre Elo, Marianne Holmström, Henrik Granö, Jaakko Talaskivi, Lennart Lauramaa', null, 'Finnish porn movie producer Pertsa returns from America to his home country to continue his profession with hopelessly small budgets and incompetent casts and crews. A self-ironic satire about director Donner''s scandalous fame in late 1960s Finland, notorious for a graphic long shot of his penis pointing northeast.', 'Finnish porn movie producer Pertsa returns from America to his home country to continue his profession with hopelessly small budgets and incompetent casts and crews. A self-ironic satire about director Donner''s scandalous fame in late 1960s Finland, notorious for a graphic long shot of his penis pointing northeast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msQ5aChYHZO5YZuLx3ckOpPUaEb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23269'),
  ('722267253182704699', 'Portuguese Vacation', 1963, 'Drama', 'Pierre Kast, Raoul Coutard', 'Pierre Kast, Robert Scipion, Alain Aptekman', 'Françoise Arnoul, Catherine Deneuve, Michel Auclair, Françoise Brion, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Jean-Marc Bory, Françoise Prévost, Jacques Doniol-Valcroze', null, 'Françoise and her husband Jean-Pierre invite some friend couples to spend a weekend in their large villa on the Portuguese coast. What follows is a romantic intrigue, with each character discovering a little more about themselves.', 'Françoise and her husband Jean-Pierre invite some friend couples to spend a weekend in their large villa on the Portuguese coast. What follows is a romantic intrigue, with each character discovering a little more about themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJpYNe2a2jco83h3pNj6XP38Lox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406406'),
  ('915728153290579046', 'Pose', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Jamie Adams, Lucy Turner, Jan Vrhovnik', 'Jamie Adams', 'James McAvoy, Lucas Bravo, Leila Farzad, Almudena Amor, Aisling Franciosi, Elektra Jansson-Kilbey, Maria Therese Bassetti, Kristin Zakala', null, 'Isolated in a grand country manor, a reclusive artist spends a passionate and paranoid weekend with his ex-lover, an obsessive fan, and a potential muse. Hoping to spark a new wave of artistic brilliance over the course of a few tumultuous days, filled with chaos and revelation not all of them will make it out alive.', 'Isolated in a grand country manor, a reclusive artist spends a passionate and paranoid weekend with his ex-lover, an obsessive fan, and a potential muse. Hoping to spark a new wave of artistic brilliance over the course of a few tumultuous days, filled with chaos and revelation not all of them will make it out alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhyyyWrHUbl6QG4udAJj17CBa5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1199193'),
  ('642621918836370169', 'Poseidon', 2006, 'Adventure, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Wolfgang Petersen, John Seale, Mark W. Mansbridge', 'Mark Protosevich', 'Josh Lucas, Kurt Russell, Jacinda Barrett, Richard Dreyfuss, Emmy Rossum, Mía Maestro, Mike Vogel, Kevin Dillon', 'PG-13', 'A packed cruise ship traveling the Atlantic is hit and overturned by a massive wave, compelling the passengers to begin a dramatic fight for their lives.', 'A packed cruise ship traveling the Atlantic is hit and overturned by a massive wave, compelling the passengers to begin a dramatic fight for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDPdjGc8SUEDWfTwMaZlCE6NSi3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503'),
  ('939677433991053192', 'Poseidon Rex', 2014, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Mark L. Lester, Alexander Yellen', 'Rafael Jordan', 'Brian Krause, Anne McDaniels, Steven Helmkamp, Candice Nunes, Berne Velasquez, Gildon Roland, Pulu Lightburn, Garrett Brawith', null, 'Jackson Slate, famous treasure hunter, is out to find the legendary Lost Gold Of Cortez in the open waters off a secluded island in the Caribbean Sea. Using dynamite to blast his way through centuries of silt, new chasms are created reaching miles below the ancient ocean floor. From here, an ancient evil is released, that quickly, savagely, and without warning, destroys Jackson s boat and kills his crew. The sole survivor of the carnage, Jackson teams up with marine biologist, Sarah, to venture back to the site and investigate the horrific events. They extract an egg from the darkest depths of the ocean and take it back to the lab to investigate. But when it hatches, they realise they have awaken a deadly prehistoric monster, the P-Rex, which will stop at nothing until the entire island is destroyed...', 'Jackson Slate, famous treasure hunter, is out to find the legendary Lost Gold Of Cortez in the open waters off a secluded island in the Caribbean Sea. Using dynamite to blast his way through centuries of silt, new chasms are created reaching miles below the ancient ocean floor. From here, an ancient evil is released, that quickly, savagely, and without warning, destroys Jackson s boat and kills his crew. The sole survivor of the carnage, Jackson teams up with marine biologist, Sarah, to venture back to the site and investigate the horrific events. They extract an egg from the darkest depths of the ocean and take it back to the lab to investigate. But when it hatches, they realise they have awaken a deadly prehistoric monster, the P-Rex, which will stop at nothing until the entire island is destroyed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ng6QwrflpHNPcZLxlrnwj0R3b7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244852'),
  ('974117538547182246', 'Positive I.D.', 1986, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Andy Anderson, Paul Barton, Lisa Lancaster', 'Andy Anderson', 'Stephanie Rascoe Myers, John S. Davies, Steven Fromholz, Lauren Lane, Gail Cronauer, John Williamson', 'R', 'A year after she is brutally raped, Dallas housewife Julie Kenner still can''t shake the horror of the attack. She decides to forge a series of separate identities for herself, borrowing the names and birth dates of various strangers.', 'A year after she is brutally raped, Dallas housewife Julie Kenner still can''t shake the horror of the attack. She decides to forge a series of separate identities for herself, borrowing the names and birth dates of various strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqk8SE7uTI7PdXtcvoDrCLDIMkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89183'),
  ('223685336994687273', 'Posse', 1975, 'Western', 'Kirk Douglas, Fred J. Koenekamp, Jack Roe', 'Christopher Knopf, William Roberts', 'Kirk Douglas, Bruce Dern, Bo Hopkins, James Stacy, Luke Askew, David Canary, Alfonso Arau, Katherine Woodville', 'PG', 'A tough marshal with political ambitions leads an elite posse to capture a notorious train robber and his gang.', 'A tough marshal with political ambitions leads an elite posse to capture a notorious train robber and his gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmgcz6KtHeRwAz60S3hPGNweItS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45874'),
