  ('1130686121528241655', 'Possessed', 1999, 'Horror', 'Anders Rønnow Klarlund', 'Anders Rønnow Klarlund, Ola Saltin', 'Ole Lemmeke, Udo Kier, Kirsti Eline Torhaug, Ole Ernst, Iben Hjejle, Niels Anders Thorn, Nikolaj Lie Kaas', null, 'A stranger arrives in Copenhagen from a plane from Romania. Shortly after the power is lost in the whole city.', 'A stranger arrives in Copenhagen from a plane from Romania. Shortly after the power is lost in the whole city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwEFNW4suBdJ141vUs3uoo7iA7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22194'),
  ('362692662759240132', 'Possessed', 2000, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Steven E. de Souza, Edward J. Pei', 'Michael Lazarou, Steven E. de Souza', 'Timothy Dalton, Henry Czerny, Jonathan Malen, Michael Rhoades, Shannon Lawson, Christopher Plummer, Michael McLachlan, Richard Waugh', 'NR', 'An 11 year old boy starts throwing temper tantrums, vomiting on and attacking people, and swearing uncontrollably. Furniture begins to move on its own when he is around, and he doesn''t remember any of it. After giving up on the protestants, the boy''s parents turn to the catholic church for help. Father Bowden is a WWII veteran who is experiencing nightmares, flashbacks and other personal problems, including alcoholism. He is recruited by the archbishop to perform a series of exorcisms. This is the apparent true account of the last exorcism known to have been done by the catholic church.', 'An 11 year old boy starts throwing temper tantrums, vomiting on and attacking people, and swearing uncontrollably. Furniture begins to move on its own when he is around, and he doesn''t remember any of it. After giving up on the protestants, the boy''s parents turn to the catholic church for help. Father Bowden is a WWII veteran who is experiencing nightmares, flashbacks and other personal problems, including alcoholism. He is recruited by the archbishop to perform a series of exorcisms. This is the apparent true account of the last exorcism known to have been done by the catholic church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y69KzSWrryMLJJZ7aVOy1qjnFg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68572'),
  ('272435600254501830', 'Possessed', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Kang Dae-hui, Lee Yong-ju, Cho Sang-yun', 'Lee Yong-ju', 'Nam Sang-mi, Ryu Seung-ryong, Kim Bo-yeon, Shim Eun-kyung, Moon Hee-kyung, Lee Chang-jik, Jang Young-nam, Oh Ji-eun', null, 'After Hee-jin''s younger sister So-jin, who is possessed by a spirit,disappears,the neighbors die one by one and a secret underlying their deaths is revealed.', 'After Hee-jin''s younger sister So-jin, who is possessed by a spirit,disappears,the neighbors die one by one and a secret underlying their deaths is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ku2FT9R3SpCBGUShvFXLlUsdRnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56781'),
  ('764828045606526895', 'Possessed', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror', 'Samuel Ortí Martí, Néstor de Les', 'Rubén Ontiveros, Samuel Ortí Martí', 'Anabel Alonso, Josema Yuste, Santiago Segura, Álex Angulo, Conchita Goyanes, Mariví Bilbao, José María Íñigo, Mónica Chaparro', null, 'Trini, a world-renowned flamenco dancer, abandons the stage after suffering a personal tragedy.', 'Trini, a world-renowned flamenco dancer, abandons the stage after suffering a personal tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxbvbVK8RT7DRvSlaIJi67crw1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337719'),
  ('562120899423114402', 'Possessed by the Night', 1994, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Fred Olen Ray, Gary Graver, Grant Austin Waldman', 'Mark Thomas McGee', 'Shannon Tweed, Ted Prior, Sandahl Bergman, Chad McQueen, Frank Sivero, Turhan Bey, Henry Silva, Melissa Brasselle', 'R', 'A horror writer buys an odd looking mutant embryo creature, pickled in a jar, from a shop in Chinatown, hoping it will be a creative inspiration for his work. Instead, the odd mutation provokes a rage of violence and lust to envelop the suburban villa where the writer lives with his wife and sexy secretary.', 'A horror writer buys an odd looking mutant embryo creature, pickled in a jar, from a shop in Chinatown, hoping it will be a creative inspiration for his work. Instead, the odd mutation provokes a rage of violence and lust to envelop the suburban villa where the writer lives with his wife and sexy secretary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEDxG300kF8uSVp7bc0WdXGdGKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5755'),
  ('645182060758126878', 'Possession', 1981, 'Horror', 'Barbara Kloth, Eva-Maria Schönecker, Bruno Nuytten', 'Andrzej Żuławski', 'Isabelle Adjani, Sam Neill, Margit Carstensen, Heinz Bennent, Johanna Hofer, Carl Duering, Shaun Lawton, Michael Hogben', 'R', 'A young woman left her family for an unspecified reason. The husband determines to find out the truth and starts following his wife. At first, he suspects that a man is involved. But gradually, he finds out more and more strange behaviors and bizarre incidents that indicate something more than a possessed love affair.', 'A young woman left her family for an unspecified reason. The husband determines to find out the truth and starts following his wife. At first, he suspects that a man is involved. But gradually, he finds out more and more strange behaviors and bizarre incidents that indicate something more than a possessed love affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSxz8VWHVleJXdIce9D0ujkmJNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21484'),
  ('672798549153195845', 'Possession', 2002, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Neil LaBute, Jean-Yves Escoffier', 'Laura Jones, Neil LaBute', 'Gwyneth Paltrow, Aaron Eckhart, Jeremy Northam, Jennifer Ehle, Lena Headey, Holly Aird, Toby Stephens, Trevor Eve', 'PG-13', 'Maud Bailey, a brilliant English academic, is researching the life and work of poet Christabel La Motte. Roland Michell is an American scholar in London to study Randolph Henry Ash, now best-known for a collection of poems dedicated to his wife. When Maud and Roland discover a cache of love letters that appear to be from Ash to La Motte, they follow a trail of clues across England, echoing the journey of the couple over a century earlier.', 'Maud Bailey, a brilliant English academic, is researching the life and work of poet Christabel La Motte. Roland Michell is an American scholar in London to study Randolph Henry Ash, now best-known for a collection of poems dedicated to his wife. When Maud and Roland discover a cache of love letters that appear to be from Ash to La Motte, they follow a trail of clues across England, echoing the journey of the couple over a century earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12z5oCy4s3GBOUrNCWvcKYBK4eI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30072'),
  ('943942743376390281', 'Possession', 2009, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Joel Bergvall, Simon Sandquist, Gregory Middleton', 'Michael Petroni', 'Sarah Michelle Gellar, Lee Pace, Michael Landes, William B. Davis, Tuva Novotny, Chelah Horsdal, Michael Jonsson, Paul Jarrett', 'PG-13', 'A woman''s life is thrown into chaos after a freak car accident sends her husband and brother-in-law into comas. Thrills arrive after the brother-in-law wakes up, thinking he''s his brother.', 'A woman''s life is thrown into chaos after a freak car accident sends her husband and brother-in-law into comas. Thrills arrive after the brother-in-law wakes up, thinking he''s his brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8L0ZVI4OAm6nagDx5QM0ufUsqG8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33788'),
  ('185713808511757387', 'Possession', 2022, 'Drama, Horror', 'Henrik Martin Dahlsbakken, Oskar Dahlsbakken, Katinka Lotherington', 'Henrik Martin Dahlsbakken', 'Jan Sælid, Eva Nergård, Tarjei Sandvik Moe, Anna Filippa Hjarne, Dennis Storhøi, Nina Ellen Ødegård, Benjamin Helstad, Ellen Dorrit Petersen', null, 'A priest has been tasked with deciding the location of a new church for the local mining company, which reveals itself to be on top of an old Sami burial ground. After removing the remains, the dead come alive and haunt the settlers.', 'A priest has been tasked with deciding the location of a new church for the local mining company, which reveals itself to be on top of an old Sami burial ground. After removing the remains, the dead come alive and haunt the settlers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yf5mWsMEZGt8MrodiiIeC0R9pEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843314'),
  ('426001379206010858', 'Possessions', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Éric Guirado, Thierry Godefroy', 'Éric Guirado, Isabelle Claris', 'Jérémie Renier, Julie Depardieu, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Alexandra Lamy, Benoît Giros, Ludmila Ruoso, Ludovic Berthillot, Alain Blazquez', null, 'Bruno and Maryline move into a small town of the French Apls, chasing their dream for a better life. But their primary enthusiasm becomes disappointment, anger and jealousy.', 'Bruno and Maryline move into a small town of the French Apls, chasing their dream for a better life. But their primary enthusiasm becomes disappointment, anger and jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unK10KonCGJTwMHhOg7UVojvbVS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93851'),
  ('727254095706771844', 'Possessions', 2014, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Shuhei Morita', 'Shuhei Morita', 'Koichi Yamadera, Aoi Yuuki, Takeshi Kusao', null, 'A man sheltering from a storm is trapped in a house where the objects have developed souls. In order to leave, he must first fix the objects.', 'A man sheltering from a storm is trapped in a house where the objects have developed souls. In order to leave, he must first fix the objects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w80BMPGz5qKLN07BQx7SRrcOhAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211358'),
  ('34296768818425755', 'Possessions', 2024, 'Horror', 'Brent Cote', 'Brent Cote', 'Clive Standen, Yeardley Smith, Mason Wells, K.C. Clyde, Reynada Robinson, Dustin Wilson, Nancy Harding, Hannah Reese', null, 'Follows a father who seeks a fresh start with his son after the loss of his wife, and purchased a storage unit facility sight unseen, but secrets buried behind the metal doors become a parent''s worst nightmare.', 'Follows a father who seeks a fresh start with his son after the loss of his wife, and purchased a storage unit facility sight unseen, but secrets buried behind the metal doors become a parent''s worst nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39a7zYZvkGfs7EOVVK3dQlWyYJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1152619'),
  ('275127720025126335', 'Possessor', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Larissa Malarek, Carolyn Li, Brandon Cronenberg', 'Brandon Cronenberg', 'Andrea Riseborough, Christopher Abbott, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Sean Bean, Tuppence Middleton, Rossif Sutherland, Kaniehtiio Horn, Raoul Bhaneja', 'R', 'Tasya Vos, an elite corporate assassin, uses brain-implant technology to take control of other people’s bodies to terminate high profile targets. As she sinks deeper into her latest assignment, Vos becomes trapped inside a mind that threatens to obliterate her.', 'Tasya Vos, an elite corporate assassin, uses brain-implant technology to take control of other people’s bodies to terminate high profile targets. As she sinks deeper into her latest assignment, Vos becomes trapped inside a mind that threatens to obliterate her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xC9GZeJZ3NagdkGg9nLQx0aPG6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435615'),
  ('352089857346005327', 'Possibility of an Island', 2008, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Michel Houellebecq, Jeanne Lapoirie, Éric Guichard', 'Michel Houellebecq', 'Benoît Magimel, Ramata Koite, Patrick Bauchau, Andrzej Seweryn, Michel Houellebecq, Elisa Mouliaá, Gavin Bowd, Clara Ponsot', null, 'La Possibilité d''une île is a 2008 film directed by Michel Houellebecq, loosely based on his 2005 novel The Possibility of an Island.', 'La Possibilité d''une île is a 2008 film directed by Michel Houellebecq, loosely based on his 2005 novel The Possibility of an Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6A7FIjv3tM0UhUzwNe4L8645qGR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58133'),
  ('124047263354098551', 'Possible Loves', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sandra Werneck, Walter Carvalho, João Nabuco', 'Maya Da-Rin, Paulo Halm', 'Murilo Benício, Carolina Ferraz, Emílio de Mello, Irene Ravache, Beth Goulart, Christine Fernandes, Alberto Szafran, Drica Moraes', null, 'Fifteen year ago, Carlos went to the cinema to meet Júlia, his university colleague with whom he was in love. She never showed up. Carlos was left waiting in the lobby alone. While he waits, something happens which will change his life. A scene, an encounter, an unfinished sentence... Something insignificant, but which will determine the character''s life. Fifteen years later, we follow three completely different versions of Carlos''s life. In one, he is a man divided between the stability of a secure life in a lukewarm marriage, and the growing desire to live a great love affair. In the second, he is homosexual and places passion above all else. In the third possible life, Carlos is a man who hasn''t yet discovered love, and lives through successive disastrous relationships in search of the perfect woman. One of them is his real life. Another is not his life. And a third is the life he''d like to lead. Which is his true life ?', 'Fifteen year ago, Carlos went to the cinema to meet Júlia, his university colleague with whom he was in love. She never showed up. Carlos was left waiting in the lobby alone. While he waits, something happens which will change his life. A scene, an encounter, an unfinished sentence... Something insignificant, but which will determine the character''s life. Fifteen years later, we follow three completely different versions of Carlos''s life. In one, he is a man divided between the stability of a secure life in a lukewarm marriage, and the growing desire to live a great love affair. In the second, he is homosexual and places passion above all else. In the third possible life, Carlos is a man who hasn''t yet discovered love, and lives through successive disastrous relationships in search of the perfect woman. One of them is his real life. Another is not his life. And a third is the life he''d like to lead. Which is his true life ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJAvxOliOwRCZu7unXMTDeOU0H5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123833'),
  ('133059507070705768', 'Possible Worlds', 2000, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Robert Lepage, Jonathan Freeman', 'Robert Lepage, John Mighton', 'Tilda Swinton, Tom McCamus, Sean McCann, Gabriel Gascon, Rick Miller, Griffith Brewer, Daniel Brooks, Steve Adams', null, 'The same man lives out several parallel lives in different "worlds" and in different relationships at the same time.', 'The same man lives out several parallel lives in different "worlds" and in different relationships at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfjNjtKZq5jwkiutnb7JzpqcLmk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38987'),
