  ('154458378773320493', 'Post Tenebras Lux', 2012, 'Drama', 'Carlos Reygadas, Alexis Zabé', 'Carlos Reygadas', 'Adolfo Jimenez Castro, Nathalia Acevedo, Willebaldo Torres, Rut Reygadas, Eleazar Reygadas, Suemi Valderrama', 'NR', 'Juan and his urban family live in the Mexican countryside, where they enjoy and suffer a world apart. And nobody knows if these two worlds are complimentary or if they strive to eliminate one another.', 'Juan and his urban family live in the Mexican countryside, where they enjoy and suffer a world apart. And nobody knows if these two worlds are complimentary or if they strive to eliminate one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIKrYjBvMlqZ2yYuZZt3R2iLHJq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103689'),
  ('642843953089139060', 'Post Truth', 2023, 'Comedy, Action', 'Dong Chengpeng, Qian Tiantian', 'Dong Chengpeng, Su Biao', 'Dong Chengpeng, Li Xueqin, Yin Zheng, Wang Xun, Wang Shengdi, Ma Li, Victoria Song, Bai Yu', null, 'Former boss Wei Pingan makes his living by selling cemeteries. For the sake of a promise, Wei Pingan tries to find out the truth, but finds that the people who spread the rumors do not care about the truth, but only about what they believe to be the truth, and Wei Pingan himself is caught in a new rumor.', 'Former boss Wei Pingan makes his living by selling cemeteries. For the sake of a promise, Wei Pingan tries to find out the truth, but finds that the people who spread the rumors do not care about the truth, but only about what they believe to be the truth, and Wei Pingan himself is caught in a new rumor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7iacGicFSZDuFpk39vV9nTQhEA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945703'),
